p>To pay Rs.&nbsp; 50,000/- as the cost of litigation to the complainant.&nbsp;</p><p>any other relief to which the complaint is found entitled to under the peculiar facts and circumstances, may also be granted to the complaint.&nbsp;</p>',1094500.00,1162146.95,'2013-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>To direct the respondent to pay an amount of Rs. 11,49,506(as per receipts) + Rs. 12,640.95/-(in Cash) +Rs. 14,400/-(Extra amount for AC installation as per receipt) totaling Rs. 11,76,546.95 along with interest @18% to the complainant.&nbsp;</p><p>To pay Rs.&nbsp; 5.00 lacs on account of physical harassment and mental agony suffered by the Complainant.&nbsp;</p><p>To pay Rs.&nbsp; 50,000/- as the cost of litigation to the complainant.&nbsp;</p><p>any other relief to which the complaint is found entitled to under the peculiar facts and circumstances, may also be granted to the complaint.&nbsp;</p>','1','','2013-10-12 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Shop NO. 463, Peer Muchalla, Zirakpur, TL 1, SAS Nagar(Mohali) Punjab.160104','','',1,1,0,0,'kamlarajput556','2018-07-31 16:00:45.000','kamlarajput556','2018-07-31 16:00:45.000'),(12,1003,'1003',1003,'2e48d207-9453-4c35-b23a-b91dfb241ff9','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','my name demo','anumusic5@gmail.com',1212121212,0,0,'wawdq','',28,507,'121121','1','wawdq','',28,507,'121121','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASD01-PM0001','test','asdasd','',0,0,'asdasd','',27,301,'160001','1','asdasd','',27,301,'160001','1','<p>asdasd</p>','<p>asd\"</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>asdasda</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'demo3','2018-07-31 20:02:22.000','demo3','2018-07-31 20:02:22.000'),(13,1003,'1003',1003,'2e48d207-9453-4c35-b23a-b91dfb241ff9','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','my name demo','anumusic5@gmail.com',1212121212,0,0,'wawdq','',28,507,'121121','1','wawdq','',28,507,'121121','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASD01-P