018 I visited the site and while inspection I found out that electricity works on the site were not complete. Lastly I went to visit the site again on 01/08/2018 and found out that a JCB machine and tipper truck were extracting the soil from a plot and dumping waste construction material to level the plot back. Immediately I went to my plot and found out that the same had been done.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>','<p>sasa</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>as</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'nikhil_sp1','2018-08-02 16:15:49.000','nikhil_sp1','2018-08-02 16:15:49.000'),(37,1009,'1009',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority','',0,0,'PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','0','<p>I purchased plot 65C at Old Jail Site, Jalandhar on 22/04/2016 via PUDA auction. On 17/04/2016 I received the allotment letter in which it was mentioned that the possession shall be handed over within 1 year. I have made lump sum payment for the plot on 19/04/2018 and applied for No Due Certificate on 02/05/2018. But still haven\'t received it. On 26/06/2018 I received the possession letter in which it was mentioned that electricity works have been completed. On 09/07/2018 I visited the site and while inspection I found out that electricity works on the site were not complete. Lastly I went to visit the site again on 01/08/2018 and found out that a JCB machine and tipper truck were extracting the soil from a plot and dumping waste construction material(Malba) to level the plot back. Immediately I went to my plot and found out that the same had been done.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>','<p>I would like PUDA to pay me penalty for delay in giving possession @ 18% PA. And PUDA should complete all the pending work at the site and issue possession letter again after completion of works. The existing possession should be declared as void as the work mentioned in the letter are not complete. Lastly PUDA should extract all the construction waste (Malba) from the plot and put proper soil&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>',11402358.00,11406647.61,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','2018-06-26 00:00:00.000','<p>PUDA should complete all the pending works urgently. Also PUDA should make sure that the contractors do not extract soil from the plots in the future and also extract Malba from the plot and put good and clean soil.</p>','1','','2016-08-17 00:00:00','2016-04-22 00:00:00','65C Old Jail Site, Jalandhar.','','',2,0,0,0,'nikhil_sp1','2018-08-02 16:30:46.000','nikhil_sp1','2018-08-02 16:30:46.000'),(38,1009,'1009',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority','',0,0,'PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','0','<p>I purchased plot 65C at Old Jail Site, Jalandhar on 22/04/2016 via PUDA auction. On 17/04/2016 I received the allotment letter in which it was mentioned that the possession shall be handed over within 1 year. I have made lump sum payment for the plot on 19/04/2018 and applied for No Due Certificate on 02/05/2018. But still haven\'t received it. On 26/06/2018 I received the possession letter in which it was mentioned that electricity works have been completed. Even the MLA of area had expressed his concern regarding the development at he site. On 09/07/2018 I visited the site and while inspection I found out that electricity works on the site were not complete. Lastly I went to visit the site again on 01/08/2018 and found out that a JCB machine and tipper truck were extracting the soil from a plot and dumping waste construction material(Malba) to level the plot back. Immediately I went to my plot and found out that the same had been done.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>','<p>I would like PUDA to pay me penalty for delay in giving possession @ 18% PA. And PUDA should complete all the pending work at the site and issue possession letter again after completion of works. The existing possession should be declared as void as the work mentioned in the letter are not complete. Lastly PUDA should extract all the construction waste (Malba) from the plot and put proper soil&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>',11402358.00,11406647.61,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','2018-06-26 00:00:00.000','<p>PUDA should complete all the pending works urgently. Also PUDA should make sure that the contractors do not extract soil from the plots in the future and also extract Malba from the plot and put good and clean soil.</p>','1','','2016-08-17 00:00:00','2016-04-22 00:00:00','65C Old Jail Site, Jalandhar.','','',2,0,0,0,'nikhil_sp1','2018-08-02 17:01:59.000','nikhil_sp1','2018-08-02 17:01:59.000'),(39,1008,'1008',1017,'c5979978-7e2d-4b44-85f9-d7153801dae4','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-02 19:46:55.000','Saloney Ganeriwala','Devki@ganeriwala.co.in',9814004850,1724654850,356339913002,'H NO 323, ADVOCATES ENCLAVE','SECTOR 49A',6,128,'160047','1','H NO 323, ADVOCATES ENCLAVE','SECTOR 49A',6,128,'160047','KANISTH GANERIWALA','kanisth@ganeriwala.co.in',9814048883,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PC0007','India Trade Tower','Ms Bhanu Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd','acapda13@gmail.com',0,0,'Corporate Office 7, Local Shopping Centre','Kalkaji',10,120,'110019','1','Corporate Office 7, Local Shopping Centre','Kalkaji',10,120,'110019','1','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" align=\"center\" style=\"mar