ffering Offer of Possession for Fit Out.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:72.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;mso-pagination:none;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;mso-hyphenate:\r\nnone\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial\">a)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">To direct </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">the Builder to execute the Conveyance Deed /\r\nSale Deed so that actual and physical possession of the Unit can be delivered as per\r\nClause 30(a) and Clause 26(c) of the Agreement-cum-Allotment Letter and enable\r\nthe Complainant to legally take-over, occupy, and use the Unit<a name=\"_GoBack\"></a>;&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;\r\nmargin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:72.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;\r\ntext-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-pagination:none;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nmso-hyphenate:none\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial\">b)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">To direct the Builder for payment of due and\r\naccrued ‘Assured Return’ of sum of Rs. 54,015.79/- per month w.e.f. 01.01.2018\r\ntill handing over of actual physical possession of the Unit by execution of\r\nConveyance Deed.</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;\r\nmargin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:72.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;\r\ntext-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-pagination:none;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nmso-hyphenate:none\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial\">c)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">To direct the Builder for paying 24% interest on\r\ndelayed payment of the </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">‘Assured Return’ of sum of Rs. 54,015.79/-from\r\nthe date of accrual till the date of payment.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"Heading\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:72.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">d)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">To\r\ndirect the Builder to pay for costs of litigation amounting to Rs.&nbsp; 70,000/-<o:p></o:p></span></p>',4882220.00,4882220.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">Since the physical possession has not been delivered and the Assured Return was liable to be paid till the offer of possession, therefore the Builder be directed for payment of due and accrued ‘Assured Return’ of sum of Rs. 54,015.79/- per month w.e.</span><a name=\"_GoBack\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\"></a><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">f. 01.01.2018 for delayed possession till handing over of actual physical possession of the Unitas per Clause 30(a) and Clause 26(c) of the Agreement-cum-Allotment Letter.</span>','1','','2010-09-24 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','603-B, SIXTH FLOOR, INDIA TRADE TOWER, NEW CHANDIGARH','','',1,1,0,0,'Saloney','2018-08-02 18:36:30.000','Saloney','2018-08-02 18:36:30.000'),(40,1010,'1010',1023,'90160124-8fb8-4627-8a13-def2b65b9f74','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','kavish singla','kavish_singla@yahoo.co.in',9888650840,0,278405856938,'house no. 3273','sector-23-D',6,128,'160023','1','house no. 3273','sector-23-D',6,128,'160023','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH42-PM0059','The Punjab Urban\r\nPlanning &\r\nDevelopment\r\nAuthority','ESTATE OFFICER, PUDA/GLADA LUDHIANA','gladaldh@yahoo.com',0,1612460804,'PUDA, GLADA complex','ferozepur road, near westend mall, Ludhiana',28,366,'141001','1','PUDA, GLADA complex','ferozepur road, near westend mall, Ludhiana',28,366,'141001','1','<p>A scheme was floated by PUDA for allotment of 601 free hold residential plots at PUDA enclave (sugar mill site), Jagraon, Distt Ludhiana. The scheme closed on 30.11.2012. I applied in the scheme for a 400 sqyd plot via application no. 2681 dated 27.11.2012 through application financing by SBI, PBB branch/sector-17/Chandigarh. On 14.03.2013 I settled the loan of earnest money i.e.Rs.3,40,000/- from Sbi pending against the application, as I was selected in draw. On 21.03.2013 I deposited the remaining 15% amount with PUDA/ GLADA via receipt no. GLADA/2013/82 for Rs.5,10,000/-. On 22.03.2013 I received the leeter of intent from PUDA for depositing the already deposited 15% amount i.e.5,10,000/-. A total of Rs. 8,50,000/- was paid to PUDA, Ludhiana upto 22.03.2013.</p><p>Further I received allotment letter on 29.08.2015 for plot no. 101 of 400 Sqyd at PUDA enclave (sugar mill site), jagraon. My first installment fell due on 01.09.2016 as per their communication, but we did not deposit the money because no development work took place at site. it has been 3 years since, despite my regular visits to the site and communication with the officials, there has been no ammenities provided nor any efforts by the authority to develop the site to make it living worthy. No efforts have been made by the authority to setup daily need shops, medical hall, clinics, dispensary, school, community centres etc. despite being advertised as a modern township full of ammenities.</p><p>Fed up with the attitude of the authority and its officials I applied for refund of my money alongwith 15% interest on 26.03.2018. Reminders were sent on 18.04.2018 and15.05.2018. To hide thier irregularities they sent me a letter dated 16.05.2018, dispached it on 19.05.2018, agreeing to my request and asking for deposit of all original documents and receipts. All the documents were sent on 25.05.2018 by speed post. But, the communication has stopped altogether and no reply to my reminders on 19.06.2018 and 17.07.2018 for refund of all my money alongwith 15% interest have been received. I need the money immediately for my mother\'s immediate medical treatment expenses, but the authority has been not paying any heed to my requests for the payment for the past 6 months. A cancelled cheque was attached for immediate payment through rtgs.</p><p>From the day one of floating of the scheme, the developer was least interested in developing the site and making it living worthy as a hefty loan is pending against the project as per news published from time to time and was a mere mechanism for collecting money from innocent people.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>','<p>1. Refund of 8,50,000/-paid to PUDA, Ludhiana by me.</p><p>2. Interest @ 15% from the date of deposit till receiving of the payment.</p><p>3. Rs. 1,00,000/- as compensation for mental agony for the past 5 years.</p><div><br></div>',3400000.00,850000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>1. Refund of 8,50,000/-paid to PUDA, Ludhiana by me.</p><div><br></div>','1','','2015-08-29 00:00:00','2013-03-22 00:00:00','plot no. 101, sugar mill site, Jagraon, Distt. Ludhiana','','',1,0,0,0,'kavish','2018-08-02 18:59:25.000','kavish','2018-08-02 18:59:25.000'),(41,1011,'1011',1011,'cba99bdd-355d-4a94-82b4-7b53f5bfb3a3','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','KAPIL TANDON','kapiltandon100@rediffmail.com',9888189000,0,0,'129/11','CENTRAL TOWN',28,261,'144001','1','129/11','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR114_','HERO HOMES REALTY PVT LTD','HERO REALTY PVT LTD','',0,0,'plot no 1 sector88, sas nagar mohali','',28,507,'160055','1','plot no 1 sector88, sas nagar mohali','',28,507,'160055','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222A35\">There are many\r\npoint which are pending to be resolved as my money to the extent of 3 lacs is\r\nstuck with them and&nbsp;HERO Homes is&nbsp;not agreeing to pay any of it and\r\nare making excuses on or the other and not&nbsp;giving&nbsp;any solid&nbsp;reason\r\nfor these deductions.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#222A35\">So requesting you to intervene as per the applicable guidelines\r\nin RERA act.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1. Amount\r\ndeducted on account of brokerage paid by Hero homes- 68397/-<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">2.&nbsp;\r\nInterest charges , as its an cancelled case, still they charged interest till\r\nthe date of money paid to me: - 34665/-<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3. GST refund\r\nwas given to me- same has been deducted at the time of payment, further GST has\r\nbeen deducted on the deductions&nbsp;</span><span class=\"MsoHyperlink\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;roboto&quot;,serif;color:#337AB7\"><a href=\"made:-(\">made:-(</a></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;Rs.215894\r\n&amp; 165172)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">4. Final money\r\nwhich was to be paid to me has been delayed beyond 90 days. (Final payment of\r\n819000 delayed by atleast 15 days, totaling a loss of Rs 4000/-)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">So total\r\nunlawful deductions&nbsp;</span><span class=\"MsoHyperlink\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;roboto&quot;,serif;color:#337AB7\"><a href=\"are:-\">are:-</a></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;(68397+34665+215894+165172+4000\r\n= 488128/-<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Final, 10% of BSP of\r\n52,14,580, i.e 5,21,458/- has also been deducted apart from above, ideally it\r\nshould be on amount paid basis and not on total BSP.</span><br></p>',7200000.00,1901888.00,'2019-09-04 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">So total\r\nunlawful deductions&nbsp;</span><span class=\"MsoHyperlink\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;roboto&quot;,serif;color:#337AB7\"><a href=\"are:-\">are:-</a></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;(68397+34665+215894+165172+4000\r\n= 488128/-</span><br></p><p><br></p>','1','','2016-02-04 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','202, TOWER6, PLOT NO1, SECTOR88, MOHALI','','',2,0,0,0,'kapiltandon','2018-08-02 19:59:55.000','kapiltandon','2018-08-02 19:59:55.000'),(42,1011,'1011',1011,'cba99bdd-355d-4a94-82b4-7b53f5bfb3a3','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-16 16:39:16.000','KAPIL TANDON','kapiltandon100@rediffmail.com',9888189000,0,0,'129/11','CENTRAL TOWN',28,261,'144001','1','129/11','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR114_','HERO HOMES REALTY PVT LTD','HERO REALTY PVT LTD','',0,0,'plot no 1 sector88, sas nagar mohali','',28,507,'160055','1','plot no 1 sector88, sas nagar mohali','',28,507,'160055','1','<p class=