 ESTATE,\r\nJAGRAON\r\n(OLD SUGAR MILL\r\nSITE)','ESTATE OFFICER, PUDA/GLADA, LUDHIANA','gladaldh@yahoo.com',0,1612460804,'The Punjab Urban Planning & Development Authority, GLADA Complex, ','Ferozepur Road, Near Westend Mall, Ludhiana',28,366,'141001','1','The Punjab Urban Planning & Development Authority, GLADA Complex, ','Ferozepur Road, Near Westend Mall, Ludhiana',28,366,'141001','1','<p>A scheme was floated by PUDA for allotment of 601 free hold residential plots at PUDA enclave (sugar mill site), Jagraon, Distt. Ludhiana . The scheme closed on 30.11.2012. I applied in the scheme for a 400 sq yd plot via application no. 2681 dated 27.11.2012 through SBI/PBB/sector-17/Chandigarh. On 21.03.2013 I deposited the remaining 15% amount with PUDA i.e.5,10,000/- via receipt no. GLADA/2013/82. On 22.03.2013 I received the letter of intent from PUDA for depositing the already deposited 15% amount i.e.5,10,000/-. A total of Rs. 8,50,000/- was paid upto 22.03.2013.</p><p>Further I received allotment letter on 29.08.2015 for plot no. 101 of 400Sqyd at PUDA enclave (sugar mill site), Jagraon. my first installment fell due on 01.09.2016 as per their communication, but we did not deposit the money because no development work took place at site. It has been 5 years since the scheme was floated. On my regular visits to the site and telephonic communication with the officials, I have seen that there has been no development/amenities provided nor any efforts by the authority have been made to develop the site to make it living worthy. No efforts have been made by the authority to setup daily need shops, medical hall, clinics, dispensary, school, community centres etc. despite being advertised as a modern township full of amenities.</p><p>Fed up with the attitude of the authority and its officials I applied for refund of my money alongwith 15% interest from the date of money deposited, on 26.03.2018. Reminders were sent on 18.04.2018 and 15.05.2018. To hide there callousness, they sent me a letter dated 16.05.2018, dispatched it on 19.05.2018 agreeing to my request and asking for deposit of all original documents and receipts.All the documents were sent on 25.05.2018 by speed post. But thereafter the communication has stopped and no reply to my reminders on 19.06.2018 and 17.07.2018 for refund of all my money alongwith 15% interest has been received. I need the money immediately for my mother\'s immediate medical treatment but the authority has been not paying any heed to my requests for the payment. Also a&nbsp; cancelled cheque was attached with the documents for immediate payment through rtgs.</p><p>The developer had and never has any plans to develop the township and was a mere game to collect money from innocent people as a large amount of loan is pending against the project which has been reported by newspaper dailies from time to time.</p><div><br></div>','<p>1. Refund of 8,50,000/- deposited by me with PUDA.</p><p>2. Interest @ 15% from the date of deposit till receiving of the payment.</p><p>3.&nbsp;Rs. 1,00,000/- as compensation for mental agony for the past 5 years.</p><div><br></div>',3400000.00,850000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>1. Refund of 8,50,000/- deposited by me with PUDA.</p><div><br></div>','1','','2015-08-29 00:00:00','2013-03-22 00:00:00','plot no.101, PUDA enclave (sugar mill site), Jagraon, Distt. Ludhiana ','','',1,1,0,0,'kavish','2018-08-02 20:05:21.000','kavish','2018-08-02 20:05:21.000'),(44,1009,'1009',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority','',0,0,'PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','0','<p>sa&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>','<p>sa</p>',11402358.00,11406647.61,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','2018-06-26 00:00:00.000','<p>sa</p>','1','','2016-08-17 00:00:00','2016-04-22 00:00:00','65C Old Jail Site, Jalandhar.','','',2,0,0,0,'nikhil_sp1','2018-08-03 13:48:06.000','nikhil_sp1','2018-08-03 13:48:06.000'),(45,1009,'1009',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority','',0,0,'PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','0','<p>I purchased plot number 65C at Old Jail Jalandhar on 22/04/2016 via PUDA auction. On 17/08/2016 I received the allotment letter in which it was mentioned that the possession shall be handed over within 1 year of the Auction. The possession was delayed by 2 years. I was offered possession on 26/06/2018.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>','<p>sa</p>',11402358.00,11406647.61,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','2018-06-26 00:00:00.000','<p>sa</p>','1','','2016-08-17 00:00:00','2016-04-22 00:00:00','65C Old Jail Site, Jalandhar.','','',2,0,0,0,'nikhil_sp1','2018-08-03 15:45:54.000','nikhil_sp1','2018-08-03 15:45:54.000'),(46,1009,'1009',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority','',0,0,'PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','0','<p>I purchased plot number 65C at Old Jail Jalandhar on 22/04/2016 via PUDA auction. On 17/08/2016 I received the allotment letter in which it was mentioned that the possession shall be handed over within 1 year of the Auction. The possession was delayed by 2 years. I was offered possession on 26/06/2018, and the possession letter stated that the electricity works is completed. On 09/07/2018 I visited the site and while inspection I found out that electricity works on the site were not complete. PUDA has offered possession with completing necessary works. Even the MLA of the area had expressed his concern regarding the development of the site. I have made lump sum payment for the plot on 19/04/2018 and applied for No Due Certificate on 02/05/2018. But still PUDA hasn\'t issued the NO Due Certificate. Lastly I went to site again on 01/08/2018 and found that the contractor for the site were using JCB machine and tipper trucks to steal soil from the plots and were dumping waste construction material (Malba) to level the plots. I immediately went to see my plot and found out that same had been done with my plot. I have a video of this incident and can share the video with the authorities.&nbsp;</p>','<p>sa</p>',11402358.00,11406647.61,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','2018-06-26 00:00:00.000','<p>sa</p>','1','','2016-08-17 00:00:00','2016-04-22 00:00:00','65C Old Jail Site, Jalandhar.','','',2,0,0,0,'nikhil_sp1','2018-08-03 15:56:45.000','nikhil_sp1','2018-08-03 15:56:45.000'),(47,1013,'1013',1001,'abcbc615-56f0-487c-bd5a-d97762a711d4','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Iqbal Singh testdata','iqbalme@gmail.com',1212121212,0,0,'test data 76','test data 89',2,23,'111111','1','test data 76','test data 89',2,23,'111111','','',0,0,'Promoter','GGGGGG-GGG66-GG7777','fgf','gffg','',0,0,'fgfg','',1,434,'565656','1','fgfg','',1,434,'565656','1','<p>ttt</p>','<p>yyy</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>yuyu</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'testdata34','2018-08-03 16:03:14.000','testdata34','2018-08-03 16:03:14.000'),(48,1009,'1009',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority','',0,0,'PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','0','<p>I purchased plot number 65C at Old Jail Jalandhar on 22/04/2016 via PUDA auction. On 17/08/2016 I received the allotment letter in which it was mentioned that the possession shall be handed over within 1 year of the Auction. The possession was delayed by 2 years. I was offered possession on 26/06/2018, and the possession letter stated that the electricity works is completed. On 09/07/2018 I visited the site and while inspection I found out that electricity works on the site were not complete. PUDA has offered possession with completing necessary works. Even the MLA of the area had expressed his concern regarding the development of the site. I have made lump sum payment for the plot on 19/04/2018 by arranging a loan from Punjab National Bank and applied for No Due Certificate on 02/05/2018. But still PUDA hasn\'t issued the NO Due Certificate. Lastly I went to site again on 01/08/2018 and found that the contractor for the site were using JCB machine and tipper trucks to steal soil from the plots and were dumping waste construction material (Malba) to level the plots. I immediately went to see my plot and found out that same had been done with my plot. I have a video of this incident and can share the video with the authorities.&nbsp;</p>','PUDA should complete all the pending works at the site and issue possession letter again completion of works. The existing possession letter should be declared void as the work mentioned in the letter is not complete. PUDA should pay me penalty for delaying the possession @18% PA on the monthly compounding basis this interest should be applicable from the date os payment made by me and till the issue of new possession letter&nbsp;',11402358.00,11406647.61,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','2018-06-26 00:00:00.000','<p>sa</p>','1','','2016-08-17 00:00:00','2016-04-22 00:00:00','65C Old Jail Site, Jalandhar.','','',2,0,0,0,'nikhil_sp1','2018-08-03 16:03:14.000','nikhil_sp1','2018-08-03 16:03:14.000'),(49,1014,'1014',1001,'abcbc615-56f0-487c-bd5a-d97762a711d4','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Iqbal Singh testdata','iqbalme@gmail.com',1212121212,0,0,'test data 76','test data 89',2,23,'111111','1','test data 76','test data 89',2,23,'111111','','',0,0,'Promoter','TTTTTT-UUU77-TT6666','test','test','',0,0,'tes','',3,192,'333333','1','tes','',3,192,'333333','1','<p>hhh</p>','<p>hhh</p>',66.00,77.00,'2018-08-28 00:00:00.000','2018-08-29 00:00:00.000','<p>gg</p>','1','','2018-08-29 00:00:00','2018-08-24 00:00:00','yhug','','',1,0,0,0,'testdata34','2018-08-03 16:04:46.000','testdata34','2018-08-03 16:04:46.000'),(50,1009,'1009',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority','',0,0,'PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','<p>I purchased plot number 65C at Old Jail Jalandhar on 22/04/2016 via PUDA auction. On 17/08/2016 I received the allotment letter in which it was mentioned that the possession shall be handed over within 1 year of the Auction. The possession was delayed by 2 years. I was offered possession on 26/06/2018, and the possession letter stated that the electricity works is completed. On 09/07/2018 I visited the site and while inspection I found out that electricity works on the site were not complete. PUDA has offered possession with completing necessary works. Even the MLA of the area had expressed his concern regarding the development of the site. I have made lump sum payment for the plot on 19/04/2018 by arranging a loan from Punjab National Bank and applied for No Due Certificate on 02/05/2018. But still PUDA hasn\'t issued the NO Due Certificate. Lastly I went to site again on 01/08/2018 and found that the contractor for the site were using JCB machine and tipper trucks to steal soil from the plots and were dumping waste construction material (Malba) to level the plots. I immediately went to see my plot and found out that same had been done with my plot. I have a video of this incident and can share the video with the authorities.&nbsp;</p>','PUDA should complete all the pending works at the site and issue possession letter again completion of works. The existing possession letter should be declared void as the work mentioned in the letter is not complete. PUDA should pay me penalty for delaying the possession @18% PA on the monthly compounding basis this interest should be applicable from the date os payment made by me and till the issue of new possession letter post completion of all necessary work&nbsp; like electricity work, as PUDA would charges @18% PA interest from me in case there is a payment default at my end. Now they should be penalised for the delay in similar order. PUDA should extract all the construction waste (Malba) from the plot and put proper soil and take necessary security measures to prevent the theft from the plot. Because of the delay in giving in the possession I am being forced to pay interest even with out getting possession. This has put me in significant financial constraints and mental stress. Now they should be penalised with mental harassment fee of 15 Lakhs.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;',11402358.00,11406647.61,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','2018-06-26 00:00:00.000','<p>PUDA should complete all the pending works urgently. Also PUDA should make sure that the contractors do not steal soil from the plots in the future and also extract Malba from my plot and put good and clean soil. PUDA also should compact the clean soil so that I do not have to deep excavation for the foundation works.</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>','1','','2016-08-17 00:00:00','2016-04-22 00:00:00','65C Old Jail Site, Jalandhar.','','',2,0,0,0,'nikhil_sp1','2018-08-03 16:22:17.000','nikhil_sp1','2018-08-03 16:22:17.000'),(51,1009,'1009',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-03 17:36:58.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority','',0,0,'PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','<p>I purchased plot number 65C at Old Jail site, Jalandhar on 22/04/2016 via PUDA auction. On 17/08/2016 I received the allotment letter in which it was mentioned that the possession shall be handed over within 1 year of the Auction. The possession has been delayed by over 2 years. I was offered possession on 26/06/2018, and the possession letter stated that the electricity works is completed. On 09/07/2018 I visited the site and while inspection I found out that electricity works on the site were not complete. PUDA has offered possession without completing necessary works. Even the MLA of the area had expressed his concern regarding the development of the site. I have made lump sum payment for the plot on 19/04/2018 by arranging a loan from Punjab National Bank and applied for No Due Certificate on 02/05/2018. But still PUDA hasn\'t issued the NO Due Certificate. Lastly I went to visit site again on 01/08/2018 and found that the contractor for the site were using JCB machine and tipper trucks to steal soil from the plots and were dumping waste construction material (Malba) to level the plots. I immediately went to see my plot and found out that same had been done with my plot. I have a video of this incident and can share the video with the authorities.&nbsp;</p>','PUDA should complete all the pending works at the site and issue possession letter again after completion of works. The existing possession letter should be declared void as the work mentioned in the letter is not complete. PUDA should pay me penalty for delaying the possession @18% PA on the monthly compounding basis this interest should be applicable from the date os payment made by me and till the issue of new possession letter post completion of all necessary work like electricity work, as PUDA would charges @18% PA interest from me in case there is a payment default at my end. Now they should be penalised for the delay in similar order. PUDA should extract all the construction waste (Malba) from the plot and put proper soil and take necessary security measures to prevent the theft from the plot. Because of the delay in giving in the possession I am being forced to pay interest even with out getting possession. This has put me in significant financial constraints and mental stress. Now they should be penalised with mental harassment fee of 15 Lakhs.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;',11402358.00,11406647.61,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','2018-06-26 00:00:00.000','<p>PUDA should complete all the pending works urgently. Also PUDA should make sure that the contractors do not steal soil from the plots in the future and also extract Malba from my plot and put good and clean soil. PUDA also should compact the clean soil so that I do not have to deep excavation for the foundation works.</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>','1','','2016-08-17 00:00:00','2016-04-22 00:00:00','65C Old Jail Site, Jalandhar.','','',1,1,0,0,'nikhil_sp1','2018-08-03 16:29:59.000','nikhil_sp1','2018-08-03 16:29:59.000'),(52,1015,'1015',1001,'abcbc615-56f0-487c-bd5a-d97762a711d4','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Iqbal Singh testdata','iqbalme@gmail.com',1212121212,0,0,'test data 76','test data 89',2,23,'111111','1','test data 76','test data 89',2,23,'123213','sdfdsfs','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL30-PM0001','dsf','dsgsdfgd','test@se.t',1231231235,0,'dsgsg','sdgdsg',7,82,'123222','1','dsgsg','sdgdsg',7,82,'123222','1','<p>dsfsdfsd</p>','<p>fsfsdf</p>',45.45,45.67,'2018-08-21 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2018-08-21 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','dfdsf','','',1,0,0,0,'testdata34','2018-08-03 17:36:09.000','testdata34','2018-08-03 17:36:09.000'),(53,1016,'1016',1010,'a182232b-88d6-4711-8baa-f8a026fb675f','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-29 12:50:30.000','Gurudhian Singh Kharoud','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988100005,1724190909,486914706829,'#102, Sector 10 A','',6,128,'160011','1','#102, Sector 10 A','',6,128,'160011','Himanshu Raj','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988200001,1724181010,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0034','OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTN V','OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTENTION PVT LIMITED','info@omaxe.com',9711800256,1141896680,'HOUSE NO 668B, FIRST FLOOR','PHASE 2, DAKSHIN MARG EXTENSION ROAD, NEW CHANDIGARH (MULLANPUR)',28,507,'140901','1','HOUSE NO 668B, FIRST FLOOR','PHASE 2, DAKSHIN MARG EXTENSION ROAD, NEW CHANDIGARH (MULLANPUR)',28,507,'140901','1','<p class=\"normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.5in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: Thorndale, serif;\">(i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: Thorndale, serif;\">That the complainant is a citizen\r\nof India and is residing at the </span><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: Thorndale, serif;\">VILLAGE SEONA,\r\nDISTRICT PATIALA, PUNJAB-147001</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: Thorndale, serif;\">.</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: Thorndale, serif;\"> The Aadhar\r\ncard of the complainant is annexed as <b><u>ANNEXURE\r\nC- 1.</u></b> He has given his hard earned money in the OP No.1’s new Project “<b>OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTN V</b>” situated in\r\nMullanpur, New Chandigarh, Mohali (PB) for residential plot.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"normal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:10.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;border:none;mso-padding-alt:\r\n31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">(ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: Thorndale, serif;\">That the opposite party NO.1 is a\r\nCompany and has, at all material points of time, been and is still engaged in\r\nthe commercial business of developing and selling housing projects/flats and\r\nother construction layouts to various individuals and/or others in lieu of\r\nvaluable considerations for profit being their primary objective</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">.&nbsp;<u><o:p></o:p></u></span></p>','<p class=\"normalCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n0in;margin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;\r\ntext-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: Thorndale, serif;\">(i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: Thorndale, serif;\">To direct the OP No.1 and OP No.2\r\n(being jointly and severely liable) to compensate the complainant in the shape\r\nof refund the complete amount which has been deposited against the residential\r\nproperty so booked by the complainant along with an Interest on the amount from\r\nthe date of deposit at the rate of 20%&nbsp;\r\ntill the actual realization of the complete amount within 90 days\r\naccording to section 18(1) Real Estate (Regulation And Development) Act, 2016, 18(2)\r\nReal Estate (Regulation And Development) Act, 2016, Section 19(4) of The Real\r\nEstate (Regulation And Development) Act, 2016, r/w Rule 16 and Rule 17 of\r\nPunjab State Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Rules, 2017<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"normal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.5in;line-height:200%;border:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;\r\nmso-border-shadow:yes\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: Thorndale, serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p