span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Thorndale;mso-bidi-font-family:Thorndale\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Thorndale&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That the Complainant is an aggrieved person as\r\nOP has not registered its project i.e.&nbsp; <b>“OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTN V” </b>and hence,\r\nhave filed the present application which should be read as part and parcel of\r\nthe main complaint for interim relief.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Thorndale;mso-bidi-font-family:Thorndale\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Thorndale&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That it is humbly submitted before the Hon’ble\r\nAuthority that the complainant IS entitled to <u>sanctioned plans</u>, <u>layout\r\nplans along with the specifications,</u> approved by the competent authority\r\nand such other information of the OP’S project <b>“OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTN V”</b> under <b>section 19 (1) of the Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Act,\r\n2016</b>. For the convenience of the Hon’ble Authority, the relevant section is\r\nreproduced hereunder;</span></p>','1','','2012-08-17 00:00:00','2012-08-17 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2018-08-05 19:44:54.000','lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2018-08-05 19:44:54.000'),(54,1003,'1003',1003,'2e48d207-9453-4c35-b23a-b91dfb241ff9','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','my name demo','anumusic5@gmail.com',1212121212,0,0,'wawdq','',28,507,'121121','1','wawdq','',28,507,'121121','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASD01-PM0001','test','asdasd','',0,0,'asdasd','',27,301,'160001','1','asdasd','',27,301,'160001','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><a name=\"_GoBack\"></a><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">This is to bring to your kind notice the\r\nviolations in Opera Garden group housing Peer Muchalla Vill. Kishan Pura\r\nZirakpur. This site is near to the under construction building that recently\r\nfell. The objections raised by the office of chief town planner were also\r\ndisregarded before passing of the site plan by the Zirakpur Municipal council<b>.\r\nThe same are attached as Annex 4. These objections have not been removed till\r\ndate.</b>&nbsp;In addition, following violations also exist in this project.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Invalid</b> <b>Site Plan:&nbsp;</b>The site\r\nplan was sanctioned in 2006, with a validity of 1 year <b>(Annex 5).</b> The same is\r\nto be renewed every year from the office of CTP which has not been done in this\r\ncase. This invalid site plan has been used for RERA registration. The\r\nconstruction and sale is being done without renewal of the same.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#500050\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">2.&nbsp;<b>No\r\nCompletion Certificate:&nbsp;</b>The builder has given possession and transferred\r\nthe flat to the purchasers but no completion certificate has been taken from\r\nthe concerned authorities.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Conversion\r\nof 3 BHK to 4 BHK:&nbsp;</b>No\r\n4BHK Flats are sanctioned in the site Plan by the Zirakpur MC as is evident\r\nfrom the copy of the Site Plan in&nbsp;<b>Annex 1</b>&nbsp;but the site plan\r\nmentioned in the Catalogue shows two Blocks of 4 BHK flats. The Approval by the\r\nOffice of CTP&nbsp;<b>Annex 4 Point 17</b>&nbsp;has raised objections that the\r\nplan is such that 3 bedroom flats can be converted into 4 bedroom flats and the\r\nsame is being done &amp; 2 bedroom flats can be converted into 3 bedroom flats\r\nwhich again is being done. The 2 Blocks (56 Flats) of the 3 BHK flats are being\r\nsold as 4 BHK Flats as seen from the Catalogue.</span>\r\n\r\n<br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:14.25pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">5.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Conversion of 2\r\nBHK into 3 BHK:</b>&nbsp; 56 nos of 3BHK flats and 224 nos of 2 BHK flats are sanctioned\r\nin the site plan. The Developer has malafide intentions which are evident from\r\nthe catalogue&nbsp;<b>Annex 2 Pg.3&nbsp;</b>of the developer showing 6 Nos of 3\r\nBHK Blocks, 2 Nos of 4 BHK Blocks and 1 Block of EWS flats. There is no mention\r\nof 2 BHK blocks</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;adasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdadasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdassdasdasd. This is a new wow fasdadasdasdasdasdaddasdasasdasd</o:p></span></p>','<p>asd\" \' - ( )+&amp;</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>asdasda</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'demo3','2018-08-07 13:04:32.000','demo3','2018-08-07 13:04:32.000'),(55,1017,'1017',1028,'45267570-c6aa-4a72-bb88-95c35fbc31ff','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','HARISH  KUMAR','harishkumar.76@rediffmail.com',9816455587,0,0,'H.NO.494','PO DAGSHAI',14,551,'173210','1','H.NO.494','PO DAGSHAI',14,551,'173210','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0046','IMPERIAL COUNTY','ROHIT WALIA','rohit.walia@wwicsestates.com',8054779108,1726663600,'A12','PHASE 6',28,501,'160055','1','A12','PHASE 6',28,501,'160055','1','<table width=\"654\" style=\"width: 491pt; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n </font><colgroup><col width=\"654\" style=\"width: 491pt; mso-width-source: userset; mso-width-alt: 23917;\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n </font><tbody><tr height=\"20\" style=\"height: 15pt;\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n  </font><td width=\"654\" height=\"20\" align=\"right\" style=\"border: 0px black; width: 491pt; height: 15pt; background-color: transparent;\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">1726663600</font></td><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n </font></tr><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n</font></tbody></table><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\"><font face=\"Cambria\" size=\"3\">Dear Sir,</font></span></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\"><font face=\"Cambria\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\"><font face=\"Cambria\" size=\"3\">I am going to file the case against the company\r\nwwwicsestates Mohali due to refuse my token money for Rs</font></span><span style=\'color: black; font-family: \"Helvetica\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'>166668</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\"><font face=\"Cambria\" size=\"3\">. I have continuously followed up through phone and mail but no response\r\ngiven me.&nbsp; Because the company person also said me there is no provision\r\nto return the money in company laws. But company person ensured that if plot\r\nwill be resale, the payment returned to you through our broker, named VIKRANT\r\nSOOD (RUDRA BROTHERS SHIMLA).The plot was resale to other customer on dated nov\r\n2017 and customer paid 90% payment to company. On the base of this, the company\r\nprovided me the Self posted cheque from Rudra brother on date 25-03-2018 for\r\nRs150000 after deduction the commission for Rs16668. On that date I was gone to\r\nthe bank and bank confirmed me there was not transaction done for last one or\r\ntwo year in this account. It is fraud cheque.&nbsp;&nbsp; Again I have\r\nrequested to company, pls look into this matter. Company person said me to\r\nfollow up with our broker (Rudra Brothers Shimla). Broker also ensured to given\r\nthe payment through NEFT Last two month, broker not pick my phone and no reply\r\nany mail and what’s up message. Even company not given me the any response in\r\nmy phone and written mail.</font></span></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\"><font face=\"Cambria\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><br></p>','<p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\"><font face=\"Cambria\" size=\"3\">Dear Sir,</font></span></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\"><font face=\"Cambria\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\"><font face=\"Cambria\" size=\"3\">I am going to file the case against the company\r\nwwwicsest