lats as seen from the Catalogue.</span>\r\n\r\n<br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:14.25pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">5.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Conversion of 2\r\nBHK into 3 BHK:</b>&nbsp; 56 nos of 3BHK flats and 224 nos of 2 BHK flats are sanctioned\r\nin the site plan. The Developer has malafide intentions which are evident from\r\nthe catalogue&nbsp;<b>Annex 2 Pg.3&nbsp;</b>of the developer showing 6 Nos of 3\r\nBHK Blocks, 2 Nos of 4 BHK Blocks and 1 Block of EWS flats. There is no mention\r\nof 2 BHK blocks</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;adasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdadasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdassdasdasd. This is a new wow fasdadasdasdasdasdaddasdasasdasd</o:p></span></p>','<p>asd\" \' - ( )+&amp;</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>asdasda</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'demo3','2018-08-10 12:11:55.000','demo3','2018-08-10 12:11:55.000'),(59,1019,'1019',1040,'a147b67e-0e01-42fd-9e99-390d21e31f08','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Mehak Aggarwal','mehakmukul@gmail.com',9878189241,0,443790646394,'H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','1','H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASR02-PR0169','Guru ram das urban estate Amritsar','Chief Administrator Puda Mohali','ca@puda.gov.in',0,1722215501,'Puda Bhawan ','Sector 62 Mohali',28,507,'160055','1','Puda Bhawan ','Sector 62 Mohali',28,507,'160055','1','<p>False promise of possession. Not delivered in promised time. Terms and conditions of offer document and letter of allotment not complied. Instalments not scheduled as per offer document. Possession not delivered on 25 per cent payment as promised in offer document. Interest charged on balance 75 percent payment. Possession not given within 90 days of allotment letter. Possession not given even after 22 months of allotment letter. No hope of completion of development works up to next 24 months. Inconsistent terms and conditions of allotment letter. Plot relocated subsequently after revising lay out plan in July 2018.</p>','Rescheduling of balance 75 percent amount which should be recovered in 8 Half yearly instalments instead of 6 Half yearly instalments. Waiver of interest and panelty on balance 75 percent amount. Revised and new fresh allotment letter of new plot number so as the terms and conditions of which clearly mention the period in which the possession will be given and make the terms and conditions of allotment letter in consistence with the offer of possession. The date of allotment letter should be within 90 days of the offer of possession as mentioned in the allotment letter.&nbsp;',9000000.00,2250000.00,'2017-01-27 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Waiver of till date interest and panelty on the balance 75 percent amount.</p>','1','','2016-10-27 00:00:00','2016-04-27 00:00:00','New plot Number 454. Old plot Number 407 in Guru ram Dass urban estate Amritsar\r\n\r\n\r\n','','',2,0,0,0,'Mehak','2018-08-10 23:06:02.000','Mehak','2018-08-10 23:06:02.000'),(60,1020,'1020',1037,'661ca13d-c609-494a-8154-30b925087da6','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-11 17:11:03.000','ChananSingh','Sidhurallying@yahoo.co.in',9779215717,0,0,'Sidhu Farm, Village Chaharmajra,','Mohali',28,507,'140901','1','Sidhu Farm, Village Chaharmajra,','Mohali',28,507,'140901','BalwinderSingh','advbalwinder@gmail.com',9814016752,1722646731,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0032','Phase-2 Development of Mega Residential Project','CMD Omaxe Chandigarh Extension Developers Private Limited','customerrelations_chandigarh@omaxe.com',9711800256,1141896680,'India Trader Tower, 1st Floor, Madhya Marg Extn. Road, New Chandigarh,  (Near Mullanpur) ','District-SAS Nagar, Punjab',28,507,'140901','1','India Trader Tower, 1st Floor, Madhya Marg Extn. Road, New Chandigarh,  (Near Mullanpur) ','District-SAS Nagar, Punjab',28,507,'140901','1','<p>Non-delivery of possession of the provisionally allotted 9 residential plots under the Land Pooling Agreements dated 03.03.2011, illegal demand of money for the plots as well as on account of PLC without confirming the location of the plots as to whether the same are corner and/or park facing plots. (The documents are attached)&nbsp;</p>','<p>Restraining the respondent from demanding money illegally for the provisionally allotted plots under the Land Pooling Agreements, restraining the respondent from demanding money on account of PLC till it is confirmed that the plots are corner and/or park facing plots, issuance of directions to the respondent to issue the actual detailed allotment letter and handover physical possession, to pay the interest and compensation for delay in handing over the possession, to pay compensation for the crop loss and on account of end less litigation etc. (the documents are attached).</p>',0.00,0.00,'2013-03-03 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Stay of the operation of notice dated 08.05.2018, reminders dated 29.06.2018 and 27.07.2018. Directions to the respondent not to demand any money during the pendency of the present complaint.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>','1','','2017-12-28 00:00:00','2011-03-03 00:00:00','OCE/312, OCE/313, OCE/316, OCE/327, OCE/328, OCE/329, OCE/659, OCE/668A, OCE/670','','',1,1,0,0,'BalwinderSingh','2018-08-11 10:52:47.000','BalwinderSingh','2018-08-11 10:52:47.000'),(61,1021,'1021',1040,'a147b67e-0e01-42fd-9e99-390d21e31f08','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-13 16:44:01.000','Mehak Aggarwal','mehakmukul@gmail.com',9878189241,0,443790646394,'H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','1','H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASR02-PR0169','Sri Guru Ram Dass Urban Estate Amritsar','Chief Administrator Puda Mohali','ca@puda.gov.in',0,1722215501,'Chief Administrator PUDA','Puda Bhawan Sector 62 Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','Chief Administrator PUDA','Puda Bhawan Sector 62 Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','Promise of possession in 90 days in Allotment letter. Possession not delivered neither in 90 days nor in 18 months and not even after 22 months&nbsp; from issue of allotment letter. Promise of Easy payment plan spread over eight instalments and possession on 25 percent payment not fulfilled. Presently instalments are charged in six half yearly instalments instead of eight. Plot relocated to new site and new plot allotted after one year after obtaining consent. No development work at site up to 11.06.2018. Possession likely to take two more years.','<p>(1) Reschedulling of instalments to eight instead of six. (2) Waiver of interest and panelty on balance 75 percent amount till the offer of possession.(3) Withdrawl of previous allotment letter and issue of new allotment letter with new allotted plot Number granting one year moratorium and Reschedulling balance 75 percent amount in eight instalments instead of six and the date of allotment letter should be such wherein the promise of time made for delivering possession is actually fulfilled. (4) Not charging interest on balance 75 percent amount till the offer of possession is made by PUDA</p>',9000000.00,2250000.00,'2017-01-27 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>(1) Waiver of till date interest and panelty on the outstanding 75 percent&nbsp; principal amount and issue of new allotment letter in current date with Reschedulling the balance insttalments in eight instalments with one year moratorium with new plot Number and wherein the promise made regarding possession is clearly mentioned as regards the period and in that period puda should be actually capable of delieveing the possession. ( 2) Withdraw the previous allotment letter dated 27.10.2016. immediately as the promise regarding possession in 90 days and the other conditions of scheme have not been fulfilled as mentioned on the front page of scheme brochure front page attached herewith as document no 1001.</p>','1','','2016-10-27 00:00:00','2016-04-27 00:00:00','New relocated plot Number 454. Old plot Number 407 in Guru ram Dass urban estate Amritsar','','',2,0,0,0,'Mehak','2018-08-11 17:17:15.000','Mehak','2018-08-11 17:17:15.000'),(62,1022,'1022',1040,'a147b67e-0e01-42fd-9e99-390d21e31f08','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Mehak Aggarwal','mehakmukul@gmail.com',9878189241,0,443790646394,'H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','1','H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASR02-PR0169','Sri Guru Ram Dass urban estate Amritsar','Chief Administrator Puda Mohali','ca@puda.gov.in',0,1722215501,'Chief Administrator Puda sector 62','Puda Bhawan Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','Chief Administrator Puda sector 62','Puda Bhawan Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p>Possession not delivered in 18 months as promised in the brochure neither in 90 days as promised in Allotment letter dated 27.10.2016. Balance 75 percent scheduled in 6 half yearly instalments instead of 8 Half yearly instalments as mentioned on the front page of scheme brochure front page. Lay out plan revised and plot relocated to other place. This process of relocation took one year but puda keep on charging the interest and panelty on balance 75 percent amount. No development at site till date. No hope of completion of development works at site for next 15 months or more as tender for development of sector has been allotted only on 11.06.2018. Possession not offered on 25 percent payment as promised on front page of scheme brochure.</p>','<p>(1)Complete waiver of outstanding and accrued interest and panelty on balance&nbsp; 75 percent payment of 6 insttalments. (2) Withdrawal of previous allotment letter dated 27.10.2016 and issue of fresh allotment letter in current date with Reschedulling the balance insttalments in eight instalments instead of six insttalments and alongwith moratorium of one year. The date of revised allotment letter should be such wherein your promise of handing over possession in 90 days is fulfilled.</p>',9000000.00,2430000.00,'2017-01-27 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Complete waiver of outstanding and accrued interest till date on balance payment of 75 percent.</p>','1','','2016-10-27 00:00:00','2016-04-27 00:00:00','New relocated plot Number 454. Old plot Number 407 ','','',2,0,0,0,'Mehak','2018-08-12 05:45:00.000','Mehak','2018-08-12 05:45:00.000'),(63,1023,'1023',1040,'a147b67e-0e01-42fd-9e99-390d21e31f08','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Mehak Aggarwal','mehakmukul@gmail.com',9878189241,0,443790646394,'H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','1','H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASR02-PR0169','Sri Guru Ram Dass urban estate Amritsar','Chief Administrator Puda Mohali','ca@puda.gov.in',0,1722215501,'Chief Administrator Puda sector 62','Puda Bhawan Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','Chief Administrator Puda sector 62','Puda Bhawan Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p>Possession not delivered in 18 months as promised in the brochure neither in 90 days as promised in Allotment letter dated 27.10.2016. Balance 75 percent scheduled in 6 half yearly instalments instead of 8 Half yearly instalments as mentioned on the front page of scheme brochure front page. Lay out plan revised and plot relocated to other place. This process of relocation took one year but puda keep on charging the interest and panelty on balance 75 percent amount. No development at site till date. No hope of completion of development works at site for next 15 months or more as tender for development of sector has been allotted only on 11.06.2018. Possession not offered on 25 percent payment as promised on front page of scheme brochure.</p>','<p>(1)Complete waiver of outstanding and accrued interest and panelty on balance&nbsp; 75 percent payment of 6 insttalments. (2) Withdrawal of previous allotment letter dated 27.10.2016 and issue of fresh allotment letter in current date with Reschedulling the balance insttalments in eight instalments instead of six insttalments and alongwith moratorium of one year. The date of revised allotment letter should be such wherein your promise of handing over possession in 90 days is fulfilled.</p>',9000000.00,2430000.00,'2017-01-27 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Complete waiver of outstanding and accrued interest till date on balance payment of 75 percent.</p>','1','','2016-10-27 00:00:00','2016-04-27 00:00:00','New relocated plot Number 454. Old plot Number 407 ','','',2,0,0,0,'Mehak','2018-08-12 05:45:00.000','Mehak','2018-08-12 05:45:00.000'),(64,1024,'1024',1011,'cba99bdd-355d-4a94-82b4-7b53f5bfb3a3','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','KAPIL TANDON','kapiltandon100@rediffmail.com',9888189000,0,0,'129/11','CENTRAL TOWN',28,261,'144001','1','129/11','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0114','HERO REALTY PVT LTD','HERO REALTY PVT LTD','customercare@HeroRealty.in',0,0,'plot no 1 sector88, sas nagar mohali','',28,507,'160055','1','plot no 1 sector88, sas nagar mohali','',28,507,'160055','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222A35\">There are many point which are pending to be\r\nresolved as my money to the extent of 3 lacs is stuck with them and&nbsp;HERO\r\nHomes is&nbsp;not agreeing to pay any of it and are making excuses on or the\r\nother and not&nbsp;giving&nbsp;any solid&nbsp;reason for these deductions.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222A35\">So requesting you to intervene as per the\r\napplicable guidelines in RERA act.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1. Amount\r\ndeducted on account of brokerage paid by Hero homes- 68397/-<u1:p></u1:p></span><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">2.&nbsp; Interest charges , as its an\r\ncancelled case, still they charged interest till the date of money paid to me:\r\n- 34665/-<u1:p></u1:p></span><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3. GST refund was given to me- same has\r\nbeen deducted at the time of payment, further GST has been deducted on the\r\ndeductions&nbsp;</span><span class=\"MsoHyperlink\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif; color: rgb(51, 122, 183);\"><a href=\"made:-(\">made:-(</a></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;Rs.215894 &amp; 165172)<u1:p></u1:p></span><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 