d allotment letter should be such wherein your promise of handing over possession in 90 days is fulfilled.</p>',9000000.00,2430000.00,'2017-01-27 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Complete waiver of outstanding and accrued interest till date on balance payment of 75 percent.</p>','1','','2016-10-27 00:00:00','2016-04-27 00:00:00','New relocated plot Number 454. Old plot Number 407 ','','',2,0,0,0,'Mehak','2018-08-15 11:43:39.000','Mehak','2018-08-15 11:43:39.000'),(75,1029,'1029',1018,'edb8dbf5-df88-4dbc-959c-42408b674a42','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-06 16:53:17.000','RAMAN MITTAL','poram0613@gmail.com',8556003033,0,647678521783,'246-I BLOCK','BRS NAGAR',28,366,'141012','1','246-I BLOCK','BRS NAGAR',28,366,'141012','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0041','IREO WATER FRONT SIDHWAN CANAL ROAD LUDHIANA','IREO WATER FRONT PVT LTD ','rajiv.gupta@ireo.in',9501004421,0,'sidhwan canal  road','sidhwan canal road ',28,366,'141102','1','sidhwan canal  road','sidhwan canal road ',28,366,'141102','1','<p>I PURCHASED A PLOT , UNIT NO. X081, PLOT TYPE T , PHASE II in IREO WATERFRONT&nbsp; ON DATED 07/11/2013&nbsp; AGREEMENT WAS DONE ON 19/09/2014 .&nbsp;</p><p>IT WAS AN INSTALLMENT BASED PROGRAMME . THE PROJECT TIME WAS OF 24 MONTHS WHICH WAS COMPLETED ON 19/09/2016 AS PER AGREEMENT DATE. TILL DATE I HAVE NOT GOT POSSESSION OF MY PLOT.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>','<p>AS ALL THE TIME OF COMPLETION, GRACE PERIOD AND EXTENDED DELAY PERIOD WITH DELAY COMPENSATION HAS BEEN COMPLETED ACCORDING TO CLAUSE NO. 11.1, 11.2 AND 11.3.&nbsp;</p><p>NOW I WANT TO TERMINATE THE AGREEMENT AND WANT MY REFUND WITH INTEREST.</p><p><br></p>',2808125.00,2639075.00,'2016-09-19 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>TO TERMINATE THE AGREEMENT AND REFUND ALL THE MONEY WITH INTEREST.</p>','1','','2014-09-19 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','UNIT NO. X081, PLOT TYPE T, PHASE II','','',2,0,0,0,'raman12345','2018-08-15 12:20:35.000','raman12345','2018-08-15 12:20:35.000'),(76,1030,'1030',1050,'5a33139b-7ff8-45d1-a03b-b1247ba461b4','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-15 15:10:23.000','sushma  singla','sushmasingla1011@gmail.com',9815898442,0,0,'house no. 593','sector-7, panchkula',13,15,'134109','1','house no. 593','sector-7, panchkula',13,15,'134109','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH42-PM0059','DEVELOPMENT\r\nURBAN ESTATE,\r\nJAGRAON\r\n(OLD SUGAR MILL\r\nSITE','ESTATE OFFICER, PUDA/GLADA, LUDHIANA','gladaldh@yahoo.com',0,0,'The Punjab Urban Planning & Development Authority, GLADA Complex, ','Ferozepur Road, Near Westend Mall, ',28,366,'141001','1','The Punjab Urban Planning & Development Authority, GLADA Complex, ','Ferozepur Road, Near Westend Mall, ',28,366,'141001','1','<p>A scheme was floated by PUDA for allotment of 601 free hold residential plots at PUDA enclave (sugar mill site), Jagraon Distt. Ludhiana. The scheme closed on 30.11.2012. I applied in the scheme for a 200 sqyd plot via application no. 9092 dated 27.11.2012 through application financing by SBI/17/chd. On 21.03.2013. I deposited the remaining 15% amount with PUDA as I was successful in the draw for the plots i.e.2,55,000/-. On 12.03.2013, I received the letter of intent from PUDA for depositing the 15% amount i.e.2,55,000/-. a total of Rs. 4,25,000/- was paid upto 21.03.2013.</p><p>Further I received allotment letter on 20.10.2015 for plot no. 209 of 200Sqyd at PUDA enclave (sugar mill site), jagraon Distt. Ludhiana. My first installment fell due on 15.09.2016 as per their communication, but we did not deposit the money because no development work took place at site as promised by PUDA in there offer documents. It has been 3 years since, despite my regular visits to the site and communication with the officials, there has been no amenities provided nor any efforts by the authority to develop the site to make it living worthy. No efforts have taken place by the authority to setup daily need shops, medical hall, clinics, dispensary, school, community centers despite being advertised as a modern township full of amenities. I am a senior citizen and suffering from a chronic illness and the locality is not living worthy due to paucity of any amenities of daily needs or emergency.</p><p>Fed up with the attitude of the authority and its officials I applied for refund of my money along with 15% interest on 16.03.2018. reminders were sent on 17.04.2018, 18.05.2018. They sent me a letter dated 14.05.2018, dispatched on 17.05.2018 agreeing to my request and asking for deposit of all original documents and receipts, which were sent on 25.05.2018. the communication has stopped altogether and no reply to my reminders on 19.06.2018, 17.07.2018 for refund of all my money along with 15% interest has been received. I need the money immediately but the authority has been not paying any heed to my requests for the payment for the past 6 months. Cancelled cheque was attached for immediate payment through rtgs.</p><p>This offer was floated as a mere scheme to collect money from innocent people and the authorities has no plans to develop the place.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>','<p>refund of 4,25,000/-</p><p>interest @ 15% from the date of deposit till receiving of the payment</p><p>Rs. 1,00,000/- as compensation for mental agony for the past 5 years.</p><p><br></p>',1700000.00,425000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>refund of 4,25,000/-<br></p>','1','','2015-09-19 00:00:00','2013-03-12 00:00:00','plot no. 209, Puda enclave, sugar mill site, Jagraon, Distt Ludhiana','','',1,1,0,0,'sushma1011singla','2018-08-15 13:01:44.000','sushma1011singla','2018-08-15 13:01:44.000'),(77,1023,'1023',1040,'a147b67e-0e01-42fd-9e99-390d21e31f08','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Mehak Aggarwal','mehakmukul@gmail.com',9878189241,0,443790646394,'H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','1','H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASR02-PR0169','Sri Guru Ram Dass urba