next 15 months or more as tender for development of sector has been allotted only on 11.06.2018. Possession not offered on 25 percent payment as promised on front page of scheme brochure.</p>','<p>(1)Complete waiver of outstanding and accrued interest and panelty on balance&nbsp; 75 percent payment of 6 insttalments. (2) Withdrawal of previous allotment letter dated 27.10.2016 and issue of fresh allotment letter in current date with Reschedulling the balance insttalments in eight instalments instead of six insttalments and alongwith moratorium of one year. The date of revised allotment letter should be such wherein your promise of handing over possession in 90 days is fulfilled. In revised allotment letter balance 75 percent should be recovered in eight instalments instead of six insttalments without interest till possession alongwith one year moratorium. Interest should be paid to me on my 25 percent deposit @ 12 percent from the date of deposit. Possession should be delivered on 25 percent payment as promised otherwise puda should pay me the damages.</p>',9000000.00,2430000.00,'2017-01-27 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Complete waiver of outstanding and accrued interest till date on balance payment of 75 percent and interest on my 25 percent deposit @ 12 percent from the date of deposit till date.</p>','1','','2016-10-27 00:00:00','2016-04-27 00:00:00','New relocated plot Number 454. Old plot Number 407 ','','',1,1,0,0,'Mehak','2018-08-15 14:47:18.000','Mehak','2018-08-15 14:47:18.000'),(80,1005,'1005',1015,'9beadb82-78b9-4168-bec7-a36c3762c2dd','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-16 14:53:23.000','Savita Sharma','sharmasavita473@gmail.com',7009167551,0,965548039699,'Vill Ghiot Post office sathana','Teh. Fatehpur',14,293,'176025','1','Vill Ghiot Post office sathana','Teh. Fatehpur',14,293,'176025','Mayur Karkra','mayurkarkra1@gmail.com',9988335340,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0282','Opera Garden by Opera Infratech','Ajayvir Sehgal','operahomes@gmail.com',0,0,'SCO 36 ','Sector 3 ',13,15,'134109','1','SCO 36 ','Sector 3 ',13,15,'134109','1','<p>Details of the facts are attached in the attachments as the character limit was too small for the facts of the case. please refer to the attachment for facts.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>','<p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-align: justify; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 19.9333px; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">It is therefore requested to get an inspection done and then an enquiry be conducted and the registration be cancelled and other suitable action be taken against the Respondents so that the customers who have bought the flats and the intending buyers are saved from any kind of fraud.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</span><br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-align: justify; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Pending final decision on the complaint the complainants seeks issue of the following interim order:</span><span style=\"color: rgb(80, 0, 80);\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-align: justify; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">(i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Respondents be restrained from selling/booking any flat constructed on the land of the complainants mentioned in para no. 1 of the complaint, to any person.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(80, 0, 80);\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-align: justify; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">(ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;To initiate an inquiry into the matter that how the respondents were able to get the license/approval to construct the flats.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(80, 0, 80);\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-align: justify; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">(iii) To stop further construction of flats till this complaint is disposed off.</span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'sharmasavita473','2018-08-16 14:53:18.000','sharmasavita473','2018-08-16 14:53:18.000'),(81,1031,'1031',1035,'75b0db22-f941-461e-bc1d-907fba7fff7d','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Preeti Sudan','psudan@gmail.com',9910882388,0,0,'26, New moti bagh','',10,436,'110021','0','Flat no. 204, tower no 3, royal estate, ambala Road, near best price, Zirakpur, Mohali',' Sanskriti Golden Oak Real Estate Pvt. Ltd., DLF Pocket R2, New Chandigarh (Mullanpur)',28,507,'140603','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0351',' Sanskriti Golden Oak\r\nReal Estate Pvt. Ltd.,\r\nDLF Pocket R2, New\r\nChandigarh (Mullanpur),\r\nDistrict S.A.S. Nagar','Ravi Garg','',9501254111,0,'Flat no. 204, tower no 3, royal estate, ambala Road, near best price, Zirakpur, Mohali','M/s. Sanskriti Golden Oak Real Estate Pvt. Ltd., DLF Pocket R2, New Chandigarh (Mullanpur),',28,507,'140603','1','Flat no. 204, tower no 3, royal estate, ambala Road, near best price, Zirakpur, Mohali','M/s. Sanskriti Golden Oak Real Estate Pvt. Ltd., DLF Pocket R2, New Chandigarh (Mullanpur),',28,507,'140603','1','<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">I\r\nhad booked a Flat (SF2/R3/205/2) in the project “Sanskriti Homes in DLF”\r\nsituated in Sector 3B, New Chandigarh (Mullanpur) which was launched by the company Sanskriti Golden Oak Real Estate Pvt. Ltdin\r\n2014. The director and the main person of the company is Sh Ravi Garg R/o H no 639 Sector 11-B, Chandigarh and&nbsp;Flat no. 204, tower no 3, royal estate, ambala Road, near best price, Zirakpur, Mohali .&nbsp; For details complaint please find attachment.</span><br></p>','<p>1. Refund of all the installments/booking amount (Rs.15,38,700/-) from the respondent.</p><p>2. Award interest 24% with effect from the date of signing of the allotment letter.</p><p>3. Award Rs 5,00,000/-&nbsp; as compensation for harassment, pain and agony suffered by the complainant.</p>',6484200.00,1538700.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>To restraining the builder from selling the land and to maintain the Status Quo. Otherwise the complainant will not be able to get refund of her hard earn money.</p>','1','','2015-06-11 00:00: