atter.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\">Details of full matter is enclosed in attached letter</p>','1','','2016-02-04 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','202, TOWER6, PLOT NO1, SECTOR88, MOHALI','','',2,0,0,0,'kapiltandon','2018-08-16 21:23:46.000','kapiltandon','2018-08-16 21:23:46.000'),(83,1011,'1011',1011,'cba99bdd-355d-4a94-82b4-7b53f5bfb3a3','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-16 21:25:14.000','KAPIL TANDON','kapiltandon100@rediffmail.com',9888189000,0,0,'129/11','CENTRAL TOWN',28,261,'144001','1','129/11','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0114','HERO HOMES REALTY PVT LTD','HERO REALTY PVT LTD','',0,0,'plot no 1 sector88, sas nagar mohali','',28,507,'160055','1','plot no 1 sector88, sas nagar mohali','',28,507,'160055','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222A35\">There are many\r\npoint which are pending to be resolved as my money to the extent of 3 lacs is\r\nstuck with them and&nbsp;HERO Homes is&nbsp;not agreeing to pay any of it and\r\nare making excuses on or the other and not&nbsp;giving&nbsp;any solid&nbsp;reason\r\nfor these deductions.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#222A35\">So requesting you to intervene as per the applicable guidelines\r\nin RERA act.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#222A35\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#222A35\"><o:p>Full detail attached in attached letter</o:p></span></p>','<p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1. Amount\r\ndeducted on account of brokerage paid by Hero homes- 68397/-<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-ri