 Chandigarh (Mullanpur),',28,507,'140603','0','26 new moti bagh','',10,436,'110021','1','<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">I\r\nhad booked a Flat (SF2/R3/205/2) in the project “Sanskriti Homes in DLF”\r\nsituated in Sector 3B, New Chandigarh (Mullanpur) which was launched by the company Sanskriti Golden Oak Real Estate Pvt. Ltdin\r\n2014. The director and the main person of the company is Sh Ravi Garg R/o H no 639 Sector 11-B, Chandigarh and&nbsp;Flat no. 204, tower no 3, royal estate, ambala Road, near best price, Zirakpur, Mohali .&nbsp; For details complaint please find attachment.</span><br></p>','<p>1. Refund of all the installments/booking amount (Rs.15,38,700/-) from the respondent.</p><p>2. Award interest 24% with effect from the date of signing of the allotment letter.</p><p>3. Award Rs 5,00,000/-&nbsp; as compensation for harassment, pain and agony suffered by the complainant.</p>',6484200.00,1538700.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>To restraining the builder from selling the land and to maintain the Status Quo. Otherwise the complainant will not be able to get refund of her hard earn money.</p>','1','','2015-06-11 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','SF2/R3/205/2','','',1,1,0,0,'Preetisudan','2018-08-20 15:47:18.000','Preetisudan','2018-08-20 15:47:18.000'),(86,1033,'1033',1039,'663ee4dc-5289-4ce6-862d-9ae59e401df2','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-29 15:03:36.000','Ranjit Puri','rkpuri@live.com',9815007269,0,264640630386,'H.No. 361','First Floor, Sector 15A',6,128,'160015','1','H.No. 361','First Floor, Sector 15A',6,128,'160015','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0067','M/s. Credo Assets Private Limited, SCO 146-148, 1st Floor,Sector 43-B, Chandigarh','Mr. Raman, Ms Amandeep Kaur, Ms Parveen Saini','',0,1724972200,'SCO 146-147-148','Sector 43B',6,128,'160043','0','361, FF','Sector 15A',6,128,'160015','1','<p>I have booked one room flat 2143, in City Of Dreams, Tower 05, Village SantaMajra, Sector 116, SAS Nagar. Credo Assets the promotors of the project have promised to deliver the project in the month of Feb., 2018. They have been sending me Demand letters much before schedules. They even issued legal notices unnecessarily to harass me even though I was always in time and even before time. On 13th of June they sent me another demand notice demanding 1.76 lacs to which I sent them picture of their project which was far away from work they were claiming and I requested them to pay me the interest for delay in project.</p><p>To this they sent me offer of possession on 10th July 2018 with final demand of Rs 4.08 Lac which included sudden charge of interest of Rs. 49000.. On 10th August I have gone to their project and found that there are no roads to reach flat. Flat is far away from completion and can not be delivered before Oct-Nov 2018. Thus causing delay of 8 months or more. All pictures taken on 10th Aug sent to Credo proved falseness of their letter of possession.</p>','<p>I am a retired person and also heart patient. I Pray to RERA to ask the promotors to stop harassing me. They should send me the letter of offer only after receiving completion certificate as I have taken loan from housing finance company. They should pay me interest for 8-9 months delay.&nbsp;</p>',0.00,0.00,'2018-02-28 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>I am a retired person and also heart patient. I Pray to RERA to ask the promotors to stop harassing me. They should send me the letter of offer only after receiving completion certificate as I have taken loan from housing finance company and from relations. They should pay me interest for 8-9 months delay.&nbsp;<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'RANJITKUMARPURI','2018-08-22 08:50:25.000','RANJITKUMARPURI','2018-08-22 08:50:25.000'),(87,1034,'1034',1065,'5d77a8a1-fcfb-43dd-b68b-edd8cac39426','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-23 12:05:37.000','Tajammul Hoda','hoda_taj@yahoo.com',7696000507,0,0,'Flat No. 402 , 4th Floor, Block-L, Maya Garden Phase-II, VIP Road , Zirakpur','',28,507,'140603','1','Flat No. 402 , 4th Floor, Block-L, Maya Garden Phase-II, VIP Road , Zirakpur','',28,507,'140603','Amitabh Tewari','amitabh.tewari@outlook.com',9814016469,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0080','Maya Garden Phase II','M/S Barnala Builders and Property Consultants','barnalabuilders@ymail.com',0,0,'Maya Garden Magnesia, Near Decathelon, Chandigarh-Ambala Road, Zirakpur','',28,507,'140603','1','Maya Garden Magnesia, Near Decathelon, Chandigarh-Ambala Road, Zirakpur','',28,507,'140603','1','<p><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">That\r\nthe present complaint is being filed before this Hon’ble Tribunal Under\r\nSections 12,14 and 19 of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016\r\n[“<b>Act</b>”] read with Rule 36 of the\r\nPunjab State Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Rules, 2017 [“<b>Rules</b>”], against the Respondent for\r\ninter<i> alia</i> deliberately not adhering\r\nto the sanctioned layout plan and fraudulently encroaching upon the common\r\nareas within the project called </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;MS Mincho&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">“Maya Garden Phase II” project, [“<b>The Project</b>”] which is situated at VIP\r\nRoad, Village Bishanpura, Zirakpur</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">. </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;MS Mincho&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Furthermore for denying to provide a sanctioned\r\nlayout plan to the complainant besides repeated requests. Additionally for\r\nmaking false statements in the prospectus / brochure of the above-mentioned\r\nproject in order to allure the complainant in investing into the project</span><br></p>','<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">The Respondent should be\r\npenalized for violating Section 12, 14, 19 of the Real Estate Regulation Act on\r\nthe grounds mentioned in the uploaded document containing the detailed facts</span><br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Pending final decision on\r\nthe complaint, the complainant seeks issue of the following interim Orders as mentioned in the detailed document.</span><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'Tewari','2018-08-23 11:22:51.000','Tewari','2018-08-23 11:22:51.000'),(88,1021,'1021',1040,'a147b67e-0e01-42fd-9e99-390d21e31f08','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-13 16:44:01.000','Mehak Aggarwal','mehakmukul@gmail.com',9878189241,0,443790646394,'H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','1','H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASR02-PR0169','Sri Guru Ram Dass Urban Estate Amritsar','Chief Administrator Puda Mohali','ca@puda.gov.in',0,1722215501,'Chief Administrator PUDA','Puda Bhawan Sector 62 Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','Chief Administrator PUDA','Puda Bhawan Sector 62 Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','Promise of possession in 90 days in Allotment letter. Possession not delivered neither in 90 days nor in 18 months and not even after 22 months&nbsp; from issue of allotment letter. Promise of Easy payment plan spread over eight instalments and possession on 25 percent payment not fulfilled. Presently instalments are charged in six half yearly instalments instead of eight. Plot relocated to new site and new plot allotted after one year after obtaining consent. No development work at site up to 11.06.2018. Possession likely to take two more years.','<p>(1) Reschedulling of instalments to eight instead of six. (2) Waiver of interest and panelty on balance 75 percent amount till the offer of possession.(3) Withdrawl of previous allotment letter and issue of new allotment letter with new allotted plot Number granting one year moratorium and Reschedulling balance 75 percent amount in eight instalments instead of six and the date of allotment letter should be such wherein the promise of time made for delivering possession is actually fulfilled. (4) Not charging interest on balance 75 percent amount till the offer of possession is made by PUDA</p>',9000000.00,2250000.00,'2017-01-27 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>(1) Waiver of till date interest and panelty on the outstanding 75 percent&nbsp; principal amount and issue of new allotment letter in current date with Reschedulling the balance insttalments in eight instalments with one year moratorium with new plot Number and wherein the promise made regarding possession is clearly mentioned as regards the period and in that period puda should be actually capable of delieveing the possession. ( 2) Withdraw the previous allotment letter dated 27.10.2016. immediately as the promise regarding possession in 90 days and the other conditions of scheme have not been fulfilled as mentioned on the front page of scheme brochure front page attached herewith as document no 1001.</p>','1','','2016-10-27 00:00:00','2016-04-27 00:00:00','New relocated plot Number 454. Old plot Number 407 in Guru ram Dass urban estate Amritsar','','',2,0,0,0,'Mehak','2018-08-23 16:10:30.000','Mehak','2018-08-23 16:10:30.000'),(89,1021,'1021',1040,'a147b67e-0e01-42fd-9e99-390d21e31f08','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-13 16:44:01.000','Mehak Aggarwal','mehakmukul@gmail.com',9878189241,0,443790646394,'H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','1','H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASR02-PR0169','Sri Guru Ram Dass Urban Estate Amritsar','Chief Administrator Puda Mohali','ca@puda.gov.in',0,1722215501,'Chief Administrator PUDA','Puda Bhawan Sector 62 Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','Chief Administrator PUDA','Puda Bhawan Sector 62 Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','Promise of possession in 90 days in Allotment letter. Possession not delivered neither in 90 days nor in 18 months and not even after 22 months&nbsp; from issue of allotment letter. Promise of Easy payment plan spread over eight instalments and possession on 25 percent payment not fulfilled. Presently instalments are charged in six half yearly instalments instead of eight. Plot relocated to new site and new plot allotted after one year after obtaining consent. No development work at site up to 11.06.2018. Possession likely to take two more years.','<p>(1) Reschedulling of instalments to eight instead of six. (2) Waiver of interest and panelty on balance 75 percent amount till the offer of possession.(3) Withdrawl of previous allotment letter and issue of new allotment letter with new allotted plot Number granting one year moratorium and Reschedulling balance 75 percent amount in eight instalments instead of six and the date of allotment letter should be such wherein the promise of time made for delivering possession is actually fulfilled. (4) Not charging interest on balance 75 percent amount till the offer of possession is made by PUDA</p>',9000000.00,2250000.00,'2017-01-27 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>(1) Waiver of till date interest and panelty on the outstanding 75 percent&nbsp; principal amount and issue of new allotment letter in current date with Reschedulling the balance insttalments in eight instalments with one year moratorium with new plot Number and wherein the promise made regarding possession is clearly mentioned as regards the period and in that period puda should be actually capable of delieveing the possession. ( 2) Withdraw the previous allotment letter dated 27.10.2016. immediately as the promise regarding possession in 90 days and the other conditions of scheme have not been fulfilled as mentioned on the front page of scheme brochure front page attached herewith as document no 1001.</p>','1','','2016-10-27 00:00:00','2016-04-27 00:00:00','New relocated plot Number 454. Old plot Number 407 in Guru ram Dass urban estate Amritsar','','',1,1,0,0,'Mehak','2018-08-23 16:11:37.000','Mehak','2018-08-23 16:11:37.000'),(90,1035,'1035',1070,'1351aa76-924b-4fc4-bf35-77789f6742b5','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-25 09:03:38.000','Grinder Singh Grover','gsgrover134@gmail.com',9814748295,0,0,'A5#303 Ashberry homes Crescent parc','G.T.Bypass Road Vallah',28,39,'143501','1','A5#303 Ashberry homes Crescent parc','G.T.Bypass Road Vallah',28,39,'143501','','',0,0,'Promoter','P','Impact Date Magnum Township Pvt Ltd','Impact sare township Pvt ltd','amritsar@saregroup.com',8146977700,0,'G-317 1st&2nd floor','Bhai Randhir Singh Nagar',28,366,'141012','0','Impact Garden V.P.O Vallah','G.T.Road.Bypass ',28,39,'143501','1','<p>Registered project under mention no is only for plots but selling stock inventory of flats.which is illegal.charged amount is more than area provided.Company still not provided copies of approvals, occupancy certificate which is mandatory under act.Illegaly running Hostel without any provision under act.Steying here in hostel difficult for end users.Company misled allotees through clever manner I.e super area or built up area or carpet area..Company fail to provide detail of Escrow Account detail.Illegaly charging maintenance.</p>','<p>Hon\'ble forum has got jurisdiction to try and entertain the present complaint.opposite party may kindly directed to refund amount charged along with @interest of 18% with final Demand Invoice charged under Ref#CPAH-0144 DT 28th Feb 2013</p>',2599250.00,2916583.00,'2012-09-10 00:00:00.000','2013-08-05 00:00:00.000','<p>Amount extra charged 402333 along with interest @18%</p>','0','','2010-09-10 00:00:00','2010-11-08 00:00:00','A5#303 Ashberry homes','','',2,0,0,0,'gsgrover13','2018-08-25 08:49:01.000','gsgrover13','2018-08-25 08:49:01.000'),(91,1036,'1036',1072,'0e5435a8-9ebc-461c-8140-1608480fb86e','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-27 10:21:39.000','Ms SARLA Bhan','tej_bhan49@yahoo.in',9356058033,0,202361931835,'# 335','Sector-8',13,15,'134109','1','# 335','Sector-8',13,15,'134109','S S Pathania','sawrooppathania@gmail.com',7087095116,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PC0014','M/s Shushma Buildtech Limited','Sh Binder Pal Mittal','bhupinder@sushmabuildtech.com',9872889933,0,'M/s Sushma Buildtech Limited','Unit No B-107, Business Complex at Elante Mall, First Floor, Indrustrail Area Phase -I ',6,128,'160002','1','M/s Sushma Buildtech Limited','Unit No B-107, Business Complex at Elante Mall, First Floor, Indrustrail Area Phase -I ',6,128,'160002','1','<p>(i)  Having seen brochure Annexure C-1, the complainant applied vide C-2 dated 25-08-2014 for a commercial unit in Sushma Infinium under construction &amp; situated at Village Bishangrah-Bishanpura on Chandigarh – Ambala Highway, Zirakpur.\r\n</p><p>(ii)  Allotment of Unit No 40 on 5th Floor in Sushma Infinium, measuring 446.73 Sq Ft (Super Area) having Basic Sale Price of Rs 31, 90,000/=  was made vide C-3 and was asked to deposit an amount of Rs 3, 30, 828/- ) which was deposited  on 30-10-2014 against a  Receipt No 1580 (Annexure C-4). \r\n</p><p>&nbsp;(iii)  Possession was promised to be delivered in the month of June 2016. In the month of February 2016, the complainant received a show cause notice 18-02-2016 (C-5) in which an amount of Rs 25, 41,550/- was demanded failing which allotment was threatened to be cancelled.  Thereafter, a letter of cancellation dated 10-03-2016 (C-6) was received. \r\n</p><p>(iv)  In turn, the complainant requested vides C-7 dated 20-03-2016 to supply her certified copies of certain documents. Complainant visited their office and informed that she was no more interested in regularization of the allotment of the Unit and reiterated her demand of supply of documents vide Annexure C-7 &amp; C-9 vide C-11 dated 14-08-2016. Even deposit of whole amount was offered subject to handing over the possession vide C-13 dated 12-12-2016. Legal notice dated 04-04-2017 (C-15) was served. Since the allotment stands cancelled, the money deposited is liable to be returned with interest. No written agreement of sale or Buyer’s Agreement, as required under the law/ promised  when blank papers were got signed is executed even after receiving more than 10% of the amount of consideration which  is against the provisions of Section 13 of the Act.\r\n</p><p>(v)	Possession was to be delivered by June 2016 and upon demanding the possession even in January 2017 &amp; failure of the respondents thereto, the respondents are required to refund the amount of Rs 5, 30, 828/- deposited with interest @12% PA.</p>','<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left:0in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 31.5pt .75in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">(i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">The Respondents be ordered to\r\nrefund the money deposited by the complainant with 12% interest from the date\r\nof deposit till the date of actual refund.&nbsp;\r\n<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;\r\ntext-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0in;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\ntab-stops:list 31.5pt 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial\">(ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Respondents be ordered to be\r\nburdened with costs for an amount of Rs 1, 00,000/- towards mental and physical\r\nharassment and the litigation expenses.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\nmso-add-space:auto;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent2\" style=\"margin-left:0in;text-align:justify;\r\ntext-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;tab-stops:list 31.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">(iii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other order as deemed fit and proper in\r\nthe light of facts and circumstances of the case may please be passed.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',31.90,5.31,'2016-06-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NIL</p>','1','','2014-10-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Unit No 40, 5th Floor, Sushma Infinium,  Chandigarh-Ambala Highway, Zirakpur','','',1,1,0,0,'tejbhan','2018-08-25 21:41:20.000','tejbhan','2018-08-25 21:41:20.000'),(92,1037,'1037',1073,'ea24ae1b-fb57-450e-b7fb-929306b83ac3','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Harman preet Singh','Harmanpreetsingh77@gmail.com',9810189137,0,0,'215 Narmada Apartment','Alaknanda',10,557,'110019','1','215 Narmada Apartment','Alaknanda',10,557,'110019','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0147','WAVEW ESTATE BLOCK - B','COUNTRY COLONISERS PVT LTD','rera@waveestate.in',0,7290015352,'M/S Country Colonisers Pvt Ltd ','Sec 85 , SAS Nagar',28,507,'140308','1','M/S Country Colonisers Pvt Ltd ','Sec 85 , SAS Nagar',28,507,'140308','1','<p>I purchased an Apartment from Country Colonisers Pvt Limited in their Wave Estate Project in NOvember 2012 . The details of my apartment are enclosed below :-</p><p>Project Name - wave Estate</p><p>unit no - 701 , 7th floor , sec 85 , mohali , B bougainvillea&nbsp;</p><p>unit type - 1885 square feet , 3 bhk</p><p>The above unit was purchased under the constrution linked plan . The project was supposed to be handed to us in Dec 2014 as per the original commitment from the Builder however we are sitting in Aug 2018 the project has still not been handed over to us . When I spoke to the representatives of Country Colonisers , they informed me that the project would be handed over by Dec 2018 which is another 4 months from now . Based on my own research &amp; analysis , this project would not be handed over for atleast 2 more years. Till date I have paid approx INR 57Lacs to the Builder &amp; I have neither got the property handed over for 6 years plus I am losing interest on my hard earned money on a daily basis &amp; my money is blocked for an infinite amount of time .</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>','<p>I write to you to request your intervention &amp; help recover my money back from the builder as I no longer have any faith left in them based on false promises made by them &amp; i am in dire need of my funds urgently . As mentioned in my complaint above , I have already paid INR 57 lacs to the builder &amp; I have lost on valuable interest on this money for 6 years &amp; niether is the money accesable to me .</p><p><br></p><p>I request full recovery of my money along with interest at the prevailing rates .</p><div><br></div>',7741437.50,5756773.00,'2012-11-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>I just need my hard earned money back . I am a salaried employee &amp; a large portion of my savings is blocked for last 6 years hence i am seeking your help in securing my money back</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','701 , block B , sec 85 mohali ','','',2,0,0,0,'Harman77','2018-08-26 09:06:04.000','Harman77','2018-08-26 09:06:04.000'),(93,1038,'1038',1053,'4b6cce0d-cb7b-46c0-9cff-6656bf5776c2','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-28 11:12:42.000','Gagandeep Singh Walia','gaurav88g@gmail.com',9888139269,0,0,'H.No.1023, Sector-71 Mohali','',28,507,'160071','1','H.No.1023, Sector-71 Mohali','',28,507,'160071','GAURAV GUPTA','gaurav69g@gmail.com',9888139269,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0002','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS LIMITED','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS LIMITED','',0,0,'SCO; 39-42,SECTOR-82,SAS NAGAR, MOHALI','',28,39,'160071','1','SCO; 39-42,SECTOR-82,SAS NAGAR, MOHALI','',28,39,'160071','1','<p>1.	That the Complainant is represented through his GPA holder through his wife Arpana walia as complainant remains out of India most of times due to his Job in Merchant Navy. Copy of GPA is attached as Annexure C-1. Arpana Walia is conversant with the facts of the present complaint. Complainant on 19.12.2012 applied for a Residential 4BHK flat/Apartment, in Respondent upcoming Project described as “ FALCON VIEW ”   of the size 3730 Sq. ft  along with an Earnest Deposit of Rs. 11,64,410/-. Copy of booking application dated 20.10.2012 is attached as Annexure C-2. Respondent vide letter dated 23.08.2013 allotted a 4 BHK Apartment No. F-901, facing Greeen of 3012 Sq. Ft. (Approximately) in wing –F at 9th floor in (SUPER MEGA) FALCON VIEW, PHASE-1, Sector-66-A, Mohali. Allotment Letter dated 23.08.2013 is attached as Annexure C-3. It is pertinent to mention that the respondent has never executed buyers agreement with the complainant.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>2.	That the total sale price of the flat was Rs.1,12,95,000/- (One Crore Twelve Lackh Ninety Five Thousand Only) plus charges in relation to PLC, Parking, IFMS charges, Club Membership Charges, Power Backup. The Complainant were required to make the payments as per the Construction linked payment plan.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>3.	That as per the Clause No.2.24 of the allotment letter dated 23.08.2013 it was told by the Respondent/ builder that they would deliver the fully developed possession of the said flat to the Complainant within 30 months from the date of issue of allotment letter however vide letter dated 15.01.2014 respondent did substitution in Clause No.2.24 of Allotment letter and assured to deliver the possession of the flat with in 24 month from date of issue of allotment letter i.e till 23.08.2015. Copy of Letter dated 15.01.2014 is attached as Annexure C- 4 and the respondent builder is failed to deliver the possession to the Complainant with in stipulated time except receiving the more than 95% cost of the apartment.  The Complainant has alrea</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:72.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">a.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Allow\r\nthe present complaint and direct the Respondents to immediately complete the\r\ndevelopment of project and construction of the apartment and deliver the\r\npossession of the apartment along with all amenities.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:72.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">b.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To&nbsp; pay interest to the Complainant from the respective\r\ndate of payment to till the date of delivery of the possession of the apartment\r\nin accordance with section 18 of the Real Estate (Regulation and development)\r\nAct 2016;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:72.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">c.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Allow\r\nthe present complainant and direct the Respondent to make the payment of the\r\nsum of <b>Rs. 10,00,000/-</b> as lump sum\r\ncompensation for causing Mental &amp; Physical Harassment and Agony to the Complainant\r\nand Punitive Damages for Unfair Trade Practice.;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:72.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">d.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Allow\r\nthe present complaint and direct the Respondent to make the payment of the sum\r\nof <b>Rs. 1,50,000/-</b> as Costs of\r\nLitigation to the Complainant;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;ma