nt-family:&quot;Thorndale&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><b><u><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">RESPECTFULLY SHOWETH</span></u></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Thorndale;mso-bidi-font-family:Thorndale\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Thorndale&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That the Complainant is an aggrieved person as\r\nOP has not registered its project i.e.&nbsp; <b>“OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTN V” </b>and hence,\r\nhave filed the present application which should be read as part and parcel of\r\nthe main complaint for interim relief.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Thorndale;mso-bidi-font-family:Thorndale\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Thorndale&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That it is humbly submitted before the Hon’ble\r\nAuthority that the complainant IS entitled to <u>sanctioned plans</u>, <u>layout\r\nplans along with the specifications,</u> approved by the competent authority\r\nand such other information of the OP’S project <b>“OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTN V”</b> under <b>section 19 (1) of the Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Act,\r\n2016</b>. For the convenience of the Hon’ble Authority, the relevant section is\r\nreproduced hereunder;</span></p>','1','','2012-08-17 00:00:00','2012-08-17 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2018-08-30 16:59:13.000','lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2018-08-30 16:59:13.000'),(99,1039,'1039',1089,'f089a27c-f769-417d-ad07-bc3896fb8d9c','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-05 17:14:21.000','Rattan  Chand','sourav1003@gmail.com',9417427188,0,0,'H. No 1007  Sector 35 B Chandigarh','',6,128,'160022','1','H. No 1007  Sector 35 B Chandigarh','',6,128,'160022','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0253','Bajwa Developers Ltd/Sunny Enclave- Global City','Bajwa Developers Ltd','',0,0,'SCO 17-18, Ludhiana - Chandigarh State Highway, Sector 125, Sunny Enclave, Kharar, Punjab ','',28,507,'140301','0','SCO 17-18, Ludhiana - Chandigarh State Highway, Sector 125, Sunny Enclave, Kharar, Punjab ','',28,507,'140301','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">My wife Rakesh Lata had purchased\r\nPlot No. 1008 (measuring 0-5 Marla (150 sq yds) from Khewat Nos. 5/5,6,7 &amp; 55/1,\r\nkhasra no 25/16/1/2 etc. out of 68 kanal, 17 marlas of village Harlalpur, no.\r\n181 tehsil Kharar and Distt SAS Nagar, Mohali which is situated in Sunny\r\nEnclave) from M/s Balwa Developers Limited. A sale deed No. 3608 dated\r\n16.09.2013 was registered in the office of the Sub Registrar, Kharar in the\r\npresence of Sub-Registrar, Kharar. An</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">amended Sale Deed of Plot No. 929 area 0-5 Marlas (152.72 sq\r\nyds) in lieu of earlier transavtions dated 10.06.2016 bearing Serial No 2260\r\nwas made by Sh. Ankit Sidana s/o Sh Dinesh Sidana authorised authority of Bajwa\r\nDevelopers. This amended deed was registered in lieu of old Plot No 1008 in\r\nwhich the full and final payment was made to the M/s Bajwa Developers. So, the\r\nPlot no. 929 was given against the old Plot via showing that seller have\r\nreceived all of the consideration amount (Rs 24,75,000/-) of the present plot.The authorised signatory of M/s\r\nBajwa Developers had offered possession to Plot no 929 size 152.72 sq yds in\r\nSec 124, Global City Distt. SAS Nagar, Mohali on 09.03.2017 through his letter\r\nand stated that they are giving possession of this Plot after six months.</span><span style=\"font-size: 7pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Smt. Rakesh Lata have several times approached M/s Bajwa\r\nDevelopers and concerned persons for handing over the possession of Plot No.\r\n929, Sector 124 in their office Desu Majra, SCO 17-18, Sunny Enclave, Kharar\r\nand they have failed to hand over the possession of the said plot.On\r\n21.12.2017, my wife Rakesh Lata was expired after shock of not getting the\r\npossession of her plot after 5 years.T</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">he total amount of Rs\r\n27,50,000 from my hard earned money is received by the developers and plot was\r\nnot given in lieu of said consideration.We have also got transferred the ownership of this plot in\r\nrevenue record and the same is stand in my name Rattan Chand and my two sons\r\nGaurav Sharma and Sourav.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-theme-font:\r\nmajor-latin\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><o:p></o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;text-align:justify\">It is\r\ntherefore requested that necessary directions for giving possession of Plot no.\r\n929 measuring 152.72 sq yds, Global City, Sector 124, Tehsil Kharar, Distt.\r\nMohali shall be given to M/s Bajwa Developers Limited, Sunny Enclave, SCO\r\n17-18, Desu Majra and a complaint against this developer may be accepted for\r\nnot giving possession of the Plot in question and causing death of my wife Smt\r\nRakesh Lata.<o:p></o:p></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;text-align:justify\">It is\r\ntherefore requested that necessary directions for giving possession of Plot no.\r\n929 measuring 152.72 sq yds, Global City, Sector 124, Tehsil Kharar, Distt.\r\nMohali shall be given to M/s Bajwa Developers Limited, Sunny Enclave, SCO\r\n17-18, Desu Majra and a complaint against this developer may be accepted for\r\nnot giving possession of the Plot in question and causing death of my wife Smt\r\nRakesh Lata.<o:p></o:p></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'sourav1003','2018-09-05 14:09:49.000','sourav1003','2018-09-05 14:09:49.000'),(100,1038,'1038',1053,'4b6cce0d-cb7b-46c0-9cff-6656bf5776c2','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-06 12:38:47.000','Gagandeep Singh Walia','gaurav88g@gmail.com',9888139269,0,0,'H.No.1023, Sector-71 Mohali','',28,507,'160071','1','H.No.1023, Sector-71 Mohali','',28,507,'160071','GAURAV GUPTA','gaurav69g@gmail.com',9888139269,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','Falcon View\r\nApartmentsPhase-2,\r\nTower\r\nC to H,','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS LIMITED','',0,0,'SCO; 39-42,SECTOR-82,SAS NAGAR, MOHALI','',28,39,'160071','1','SCO; 39-42,SECTOR-82,SAS NAGAR, MOHALI','',28,39,'160071','1','<p>1.	That the Complainant is represented through his GPA holder through his wife Arpana walia as complainant remains out of India most of times due to his Job in Merchant Navy. Copy of GPA is attached as Annexure C-1. Arpana Walia is conversant with the facts of the present complaint. Complainant on 19.12.2012 applied for a Residential 4BHK flat/Apartment, in Respondent upcoming Project described as “ FALCON VIEW ”   of the size 3730 Sq. ft  along with an Earnest Deposit of Rs. 11,64,410/-. Copy of booking application dated 20.10.2012 is attached as Annexure C-2. Respondent vide letter dated 23.08.2013 allotted a 4 BHK Apartment No. F-901, facing Greeen of 3012 Sq. Ft. (Approximately) in wing –F at 9th floor in (SUPER MEGA) FALCON VIEW, PHASE-1, Sector-66-A, Mohali. Allotment Letter dated 23.08.2013 is attached as Annexure C-3. It is pertinent to mention that the respondent has never executed buyers agreement with the complainant.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>2.	That the total sale price of the flat was Rs.1,12,95,000/- (One Crore Twelve Lackh Ninety Five Thousand Only) plus charges in relation to PLC, Parking, IFMS charges, Club Membership Charges, Power Backup. The Complainant were required to make the payments as per the Construction linked payment plan.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>3.	That as per the Clause No.2.24 of the allotment letter dated 23.08.2013 it was told by the Respondent/ builder that they would deliver the fully developed possession of the said flat to the Complainant within 30 months from the date of issue of allotment letter however vide letter dated 15.01.2014 respondent did substitution in Clause No.2.24 of Allotment letter and assured to deliver the possession of the flat with in 24 month from date of issue of allotment letter i.e till 23.08.2015. Copy of Letter dated 15.01.2014 is attached as Annexure C- 4 and the respondent builder is failed to deliver the possession to the Complainant with in stipulated time except receiving the more than 95% cost of the apartment.  The Complainant has alrea</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:72.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">a.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Allow\r\nthe present complaint and direct the Respondents to immediately complete the\r\ndevelopment of project and construction of the apartment and deliver the\r\npossession of the apartment along with all amenities.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:72.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">b.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To&nbsp; pay interest to the Complainant from the respective\r\ndate of payment to till the date of delivery of the possession of the apartment\r\nin accordance with section 18 of the Real Estate (Regulation and development)\r\nAct 2016;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:72.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">c.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Allow\r\nthe present complainant and direct the Respondent to make the payment of the\r\nsum of <b>Rs. 10,00,000/-</b> as lump sum\r\ncompensation for causing Mental &amp; Physical Harassment and Agony to the Complainant\r\nand Punitive Damages for Unfair Trade Practice.;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:72.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">d.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Allow\r\nthe present complaint and direct the Respondent to make the payment of the sum\r\nof <b>Rs. 1,50,000/-</b> as Costs of\r\nLitigation to the Complainant;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:72.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideo