on 19.08.2016.I applied for a 500 sq yards plot by depositing Rs 1000000 as earnest money. I was allotted a 500 Sq yards plot in draw of lots held on 21.09.2016 in General Category in IT CITY MOHALI vide GMADA Letter of intent number GMADA-EO/2016/52908 DATED 21-Nov-2016/23.11.2016. As per clause 5 (1) of letter of intent I was required to deposit Rs 2000000 towards plus Rs 200000 towards 2 percent cancer cess amount totalling&nbsp; to&nbsp; Rd 22 Lakhs&nbsp; which I deposited&nbsp; through Demand draft number&nbsp; 001722&nbsp; vide Gmada&nbsp; receipt number&nbsp; 51362 dated 16.01.2017. As per clause&nbsp; 5 (2) of the LOI balance&nbsp; amount of 70 percent&nbsp; was to&nbsp; be deposited in&nbsp; 6 equal half&nbsp; yearly instalments&nbsp; along with&nbsp; 12 percent interest.&nbsp; First&nbsp; instalment was&nbsp; due on&nbsp; 21.05.2017. As per clause&nbsp; 10 of the&nbsp; above&nbsp; LOI the delay&nbsp; in payment&nbsp; of instalments&nbsp; up to 24 months can be&nbsp; condoned on&nbsp; genuine reasons&nbsp; on written request&nbsp; by charging&nbsp; 18 percent interest&nbsp; for the period&nbsp; of delay. I have not&nbsp; paid the above&nbsp; instalments because&nbsp; of financial constraints.&nbsp; I have&nbsp; written&nbsp; to GMADA vide my&nbsp; registered letter&nbsp; number&nbsp; EP4591352811N dated 02.06.2018 for giving&nbsp; me&nbsp; extension&nbsp; of&nbsp; time up to&nbsp; 20.05.2019 for depositing the balance outstanding&nbsp; instalments. I was allotted&nbsp; a plot number 1041 in the numbering&nbsp; draw held on 13.04.2018 at S.No 54. As per clause 15 of the above LOI&nbsp; dated 21.11.2016 the&nbsp; physical possession of&nbsp; the above plot&nbsp; was to be&nbsp; handed&nbsp; over to&nbsp; me within&nbsp; one year&nbsp; of Letter&nbsp; of intent&nbsp; I.e before&nbsp; 20.11.2017. But the development&nbsp; works at&nbsp; site have not&nbsp; been&nbsp; completed&nbsp; by GMADA till date and I have not been offered possession of&nbsp; plot even after&nbsp; expiry of&nbsp; 21 months of the date of Letter&nbsp; of intent&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>','Complete waiver of interest on Balance 70 percent payment up to the date of offer of possession.&nbsp;',9000000.00,2250000.00,'2017-01-27 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Waiver of till date interest and panelty on the balance 75 percent amount.</p>','1','','2016-10-27 00:00:00','2016-04-27 00:00:00','New plot Number 454. Old plot Number 407 in Guru ram Dass urban estate Amritsar\r\n\r\n\r\n','','',2,0,0,0,'Mehak','2018-09-08 06:02:26.000','Mehak','2018-09-08 06:02:26.000'),(106,1019,'1019',1040,'a147b67e-0e01-42fd-9e99-390d21e31f08','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Mehak Aggarwal','mehakmukul@gmail.com',9878189241,0,443790646394,'H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','1','H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0116','It city mohali','Chief Administrator Gmada Mohali','ca@puda.gov.in',0,1722215501,'Chief Administrator  Gmada  puda bhawan','Sector 62 Mohali',28,507,'160055','1','Chief Administrator  Gmada  puda bhawan','Sector 62 Mohali',28,507,'160055','1','<p>Gmada floated a scheme for allotment of 750 residential plots @ Rs 20000/-per sq yards in It city mohali for different sizes of plots .Scheme closed on 19.08.2016.I applied for a 500 sq yards plot by depositing Rs 1000000 as earnest money. I was allotted a 500 Sq yards plot in draw of lots held on 21.09.2016 in General Category in IT CITY MOHALI vide GMADA Letter of intent number GMADA-EO/2016/52908 DATED 21-Nov-2016/23.11.2016. As per clause 5 (1) of letter of intent I was required to deposit Rs 2000000 towards plus Rs 200000 towards 2 percent cancer cess amount totalling&nbsp; to&nbsp; Rd 22 Lakhs&nbsp; which I deposited&nbsp; through Demand draft number&nbsp; 001722&nbsp; vide Gmada&nbsp; receipt number&nbsp; 51362 dated 16.01.2017. As per clause&nbsp; 5 (2) of the LOI balance&nbsp; amount of 70 percent&nbsp; was to&