 be delivered before Oct-Nov 2018. Thus causing delay of 8 months or more. All pictures taken on 10th Aug sent to Credo proved falseness of their letter of possession.</p>','<p>I am a retired person and also heart patient. I Pray to RERA to ask the promotors to stop harassing me. They should send me the letter of offer only after receiving completion certificate as I have taken loan from housing finance company. They should pay me interest for 8-9 months delay.&nbsp;</p>',0.00,0.00,'2018-02-28 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>I am a retired person and also heart patient. I Pray to RERA to ask the promotors to stop harassing me. They should send me the letter of offer only after receiving completion certificate as I have taken loan from housing finance company and from relations. They should pay me interest for 8-9 months delay.&nbsp;<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'RANJITKUMARPURI','2018-09-08 08:13:35.000','RANJITKUMARPURI','2018-09-08 08:13:35.000'),(112,1019,'1019',1040,'a147b67e-0e01-42fd-9e99-390d21e31f08','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Mehak Aggarwal','mehakmukul@gmail.com',9878189241,0,443790646394,'H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','1','H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0116','It city mohali','Chief Administrator Gmada Mohali','ca@puda.gov.in',0,1722215501,'Chief Administrator  Gmada  puda bhawan','Sector 62 Mohali',28,507,'160055','1','Chief Administrator  Gmada  puda bhawan','Sector 62 Mohali',28,507,'160055','1','<p>Gmada floated a scheme for allotment of 750 residential plots @ Rs 20000/-per sq yards in It city mohali for different sizes of plots .Scheme closed on 19.08.2016.I applied for a 500 sq yards plot by depositing Rs 1000000 as earnest money. I was allotted a 500 Sq yards plot in draw of lots held on 21.09.2016 in General Category in IT CITY MOHALI vide GMADA Letter of intent number GMADA-EO/201