bsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(2) Demand for Interest @ 12 percent&nbsp; on my 30 percent deposit of Rs 30 Lakhs from the date of deposit up to the date of offer of possession.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) Start the recovery of balance 70 percent amount of Rs 70 Lakhs in six half yearly instalments commencing&nbsp; from the date of offer of possession and after issue of allotment letter of plot Number 1041.',10000000.00,3200000.00,'2017-11-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>(1) Waiver of due,outstanding,accrued interest,panelty&nbsp; and surcharge on Balance 70 percent&nbsp; amount of Rs 70 LAKHS from the date of Letter of intent&nbsp; up to date of issue of offer of possession or up to date of issue of allotment letter of plot Number 1041.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) Stop charging further and future interest and panelty on the Balance payment of Rs 70 Lakhs pending till the final decision of the present case.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) Stop charging further and future interest, panelty and surcharge on outstanding interest, accrued interest and panelty as on date till the final decision of present case.</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2016-11-21 00:00:00','Plot number 1041 IT CITY MOHALI\r\n\r\n\r\n','','',1,1,0,0,'Mehak','2018-09-08 11:37:29.000','Mehak','2018-09-08 11:37:29.000'),(119,1040,'1040',1070,'1351aa76-924b-4fc4-bf35-77789f6742b5','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Grinder Singh Grover','gsgrover134@gmail.com',9814748295,0,0,'A5#303 Ashberry homes Crescent parc','G.T.Bypass Road Vallah',28,39,'143501','1','A5#303 Ashberry homes Crescent parc','G.T.Bypass Road Vallah',28,39,'143501','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASR02-PR0071','Impact Sar Magnum Township Ltd','ISMTPL','care@saregroup.com',8146977700,1836574820,'IMPACT SARE MAGNUM TOWNSHIP LTD','3407,Gurdev Nagar Behind Ansal Plaza Ludhiana',28,39,'141001','1','IMPACT SARE MAGNUM TOWNSHIP LTD','3407,Gurdev Nagar Behind Ansal Plaza Ludhiana',28,39,'141001','1','GCNo 10182018 is checked that PBRERAASR02PR0071&nbsp; is sought by authority.Company misleading about area of flat charged @1405 sq ft. but area given is much less than showed .Company could not show approvals &amp; Escrow account to alottees.Remain complaint is same &nbsp;<br>','<p>50 lacs .Company cheated us heavily.Illegaly against any provision started hostel in stock inventory of flats.Now company failed sell flats on ground that Area charged is more than provided<br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'gsgrover13','2018-09-08 21:03:19.000','gsgrover13','2018-09-08 21:03:19.000'),(120,1029,'1029',1018,'edb8dbf5-df88-4dbc-959c-42408b674a42','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-06 16:53:17.000','RAMAN MITTAL','poram0613@gmail.com',8556003033,0,647678521783,'246-I BLOCK','BRS NAGAR',28,366,'141012','1','246-I BLOCK','BRS NAGAR',28,366,'141012','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0041','IREO WATER FRONT SIDHWAN CANAL ROAD LUDHIANA','IREO WATER FRONT PVT LTD ','rajiv.gupta@ireo.in',9501004421,0,'sidhwan canal  road','sidhwan canal road ',28,366,'141102','1','sidhwan canal  road','sidhwan canal road ',28,366,'141102','1','<p>I PURCHASED A PLOT , UNIT NO. X081, PLOT TYPE T , PHASE II in IREO WATERFRONT&nbsp; ON DATED 07/11/2013&nbsp; AGREEMENT WAS DONE ON 19/09/2014 .&nbsp;</p><p>IT WAS AN INSTALLMENT BASED PROGRAMME . THE PROJECT TIME WAS OF 24 MONTHS WHICH WAS COMPLETED ON 19/09/2016 AS PER AGREEMENT DATE. TILL DATE I HAVE NOT GOT POSSESSION OF MY PLOT.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>','<p>AS ALL THE TIME OF COMPLETION, GRACE PERIOD AND EXTENDED DELAY PERIOD WITH DELAY COMPENSATION HAS BEEN COMPLETED ACCORDING TO CLAUSE NO. 11.1, 11.2 AND 11.3.&nbsp;</p><p>NOW I WANT TO TERMINATE THE AGREEMENT AND WANT MY REFUND WITH INTEREST.</p><p><br></p>',2808125.00,2639075.00,'2016-09-19 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>TO TERMINATE T