42034,0,'M/s Impact Sare Magnum Township (p) LTD.','1st And 2nd Floor, G-317, Bhai Randhir Singh Nagar Ludhiana',28,366,'141012','1','M/s Impact Sare Magnum Township (p) LTD.','1st And 2nd Floor, G-317, Bhai Randhir Singh Nagar Ludhiana',28,366,'141012','1','<p>Registered project under mention no is only for plots but selling stock inventory of flats.which is illegal.charged amount is more than area provided.Company still not provided copies of approvals, occupancy certificate which is mandatory under act.Illegaly running Hostel without any provision under act.Steying here in hostel difficult for end users.Company misled allotees through clever manner I.e super area or built up area or carpet area..Company fail to provide detail of Escrow Account detail.Illegaly charging maintenance.</p>','<p>Hon\'ble forum has got jurisdiction to try and entertain the present complaint.opposite party may kindly directed to refund amount charged along with @interest of 18% with final Demand Invoice charged under Ref#CPAH-0144 DT 28th Feb 2013.company still selling flats by mis leading customers by getting registration no PBRERA-ASR02-PR0071 fraudulently.</p>',2599250.00,2916583.00,'2012-09-10 00:00:00.000','2013-08-05 00:00:00.000','<p>Amount extra charged 402333 along with interest @18%</p>','1','','2010-09-10 00:00:00','2010-11-08 00:00:00','A5#303 Ashberry homes','','',1,1,0,0,'gsgrover13','2018-09-14 13:54:57.000','gsgrover13','2018-09-14 13:54:57.000'),(124,1041,'1041',1101,'02670259-a5ee-4dab-92ad-b1ad005c5b73','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-15 13:51:16.000','SURENDRA SINGH RAWAT','sureendra1968@gmail.com',9216550173,0,0,'HOUSE NO. 2238/79','SHANTI NAGAR GALI NO. 8-A, MANI MAJRA',6,128,'160101','1','HOUSE NO 171','SECTOR 8A',6,128,'160009','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0143','PARKWOOG GLADE ','PARKWOOD DEVELOPERS PVT LTD ','',9915858662,0,'KHARAR','KHARAR LANDRAN ROAD , SECTOR 116 GREATER  MOHALI',28,507,'140301','1','KHARAR','KHARAR LANDRAN ROAD , SECTOR 116 GREATER  MOH