n&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:66.0pt;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:90.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n97%\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:97%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">In view\r\nof the facts mentioned in paragraph 4 above, the complainant prays for the\r\nfollowing relief Possession of the flat be handed over without further delay or\r\nrefund of money invested by complainant&nbsp;\r\nalong with interest up to date at the @ 15% per annum.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:9.15pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p><br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:90.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-24.0pt;mso-line-height-alt:0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:90.0pt\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size: 21.3333px;\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 7pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">Interim\r\norder, if prayed for: Possession of the Flat or investment return with up to\r\ndate interest.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:9.2pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:66.0pt;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:90.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n97%\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:97%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">Pending\r\nfinal decision on the complaint the complainant seeks issue of the following\r\ninterim order: N.A.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'sureendra1968@gmail.com','2018-09-15 12:58:59.000','sureendra1968@gmail.com','2018-09-15 12:58:59.000'),(125,1042,'1042',1103,'42f2dd92-e315-4c19-b096-57f9c7804e08','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-15 14:30:38.000','JASJEET  SINGH','Jsssingh.51@gmail.com',9216550171,0,0,'HOUSE NO. 171','SECTOR 8A',6,128,'160009','1','HOUSE NO. 171','SECTOR 8A',6,128,'160009','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0143','PARKWOOD GLADE','PARKWOOD DEVELOPERS PVT LTD','',9915858662,0,'KHARAR','KHARAR LANDRAN ROAD , SECTOR 116 GREATER  MOHALI',28,507,'140301','1','KHARAR','KHARAR LANDRAN ROAD , SECTOR 116 GREATER  MOHALI',28,507,'140301','1','<p><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Facts\r\nof the case: &nbsp;Late&nbsp; S, Dalip Singh Father of the Complaint Ms\r\nHarveen Kaur Bala, invested a sum of Rs. 42,70,496/- Rupees Forty Two Lacs Seventy\r\nThousands and Four hundred Ninety Six only) &nbsp;in the Year 2012</span><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:66.0pt;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:90.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n97%\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:97%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">In view\r\nof the facts mentioned in paragraph 4 above, the complainant prays for the\r\nfollowing relief Possession of the flat be handed over without further delay or\r\nrefund of money invested by complainant&nbsp;\r\nalong with interest up to date at the @ 15% per annum.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',4398300.00,4270496.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:90.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-24.0pt;mso-line-height-alt:0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:90.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">Interim\r\norder, if prayed for: Possession of the Flat or investment return with up to\r\ndate interest.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:9.2pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:66.0pt;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:90.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n97%\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:97%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">Pending\r\nfinal decision on the complaint the complainant seeks issue of the following\r\ninterim order: N.A.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','BLOCK C UNIT NO C202 SECOND FLOOR','','',1,1,0,0,'jasjeetsingh','2018-09-15 14:26:06.000','jasjeetsingh','2018-09-15 14:26:06.000'),(126,1043,'1043',1091,'e2da2916-c5af-4a15-acce-51dcf84d70a2','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-15 23:14:52.000','Prem Datt','dattprem@gmail.com',9417323627,0,0,'House No. 2378, Sector 35-C,','',6,128,'160035','1','House No. 3175B, Sector 24D,','',6,128,'160024','Rajeev Anand','anandlawoffice2378@gmail.com',9417870805,1722622364,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','M/s Country Colonizers Private Limited','Through its MD','',0,0,'PO Rayon and Silk Mills','Adjoining Coca Cola Depot GT Road, Chheharta',28,39,'143105','0','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd. Wave Estate Project','SAS Nagar Mohali',28,39,'140308','1','<p>4.1.	The Complainantupon the advertisements of apartments in project at Mohali by the Promoter Respondent showed his interest in buying the apartment with his other colleagues. The Complainant was made to enter an Agreement to Sellby the Company with one Komal Kumar towards purchase of Unit No. 61First Floor in Sector 99, SAS Nagar (Mohali).  The initial booking payment of Rs. 3 lakhs approx. was made by the Complainantin the name of Komal Kumar and on the receipt of said payment, the said Independent Floor was transferred in the name of the Complainant by the Respondent Promoter vide Receipt dated 05.02.2013 and subsequent payment making 15% of BSF in total was made on 22.03.2013 (true copy is annexed as ANNEXURE C-1 (Colly). Thereafter, the Complainant was made to apply for Housing Loan which was approved from HDFC Bank on 03 June 2013 and kept at the disposal of the Respondent / Colonizer.\r\n</p><p>The Complainantentered into an “Independent Residential Floor Allottee Arrangement” at Mohali on 23.07.2013 with M/s Country Colonizers Pvt. Ltd. claiming to be “Developer” of a Mega Integrated Township on approx 255 acres of land regarding which it was represented that necessary approvals and sanctions have been granted by the Empowerment Committee under the Industrial Policy 2003, Government of Punjab with further representation that the Lay Out Plans of the land admeasuring 230.262 acres has already been approved vide letter dated 21.12.2011.</p><p>\r\n</p><p>4.2.	That the Complainantprovisionally allotted “Independent Residential Floors” Bearing No. 61on 1st Floor in Sector ‘G’ having a saleable area of 1060 sq ft comprised in scheme of Ground + 2 Floors constructed on a plot having an area of 200 sq yards situated in the lay out plan of Wave Estate, SAS Nagar, Section 85 and 99, Mohali as per Clause 2.1 of Arrangement.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>4.3.	That the consideration of the said Independent Residential Floor towards the Basic Sale Price was fixed at Rs. 3773.5849 per sq ft amounting to approximately&nbsp;</p>','<p>5.1	That Apartment 43/FF First Floor Wave Floor Sector 99, Mohali (Relocated Apartment) in lieu of Apartment No. 61 FF, First Floor Sector G, Wave Floor, Sector 85 &amp; 99 Mohali, the Project WAVE ESTATE Sector 85 and 99 Mohali was allotted to the applicant on the settled terms and conditions in the AGREEMENT dated 23 JULY 2013to be completed within 24 months Plus 6 months and with the condition in Clause 5.5 of the Agreement as under :\r\n</p><p>&nbsp;“5.5	Subject to clause 5.1 and 5.2 above and further the Allottee(s) having complied with its obligations under the Application Form as well as this “Independent Residential Floor” Allottee(s) Arrangement, including but not limited to timely payment of the entire Consideration and other charges as per the payment plan opted by the Allottee(s), in the event of willful delay in construction of the “Independent Residential Floor” for reason attributable solely to the Developer, delay charges would be payable to the Allottee(s) at the rate of Rs. 5/- per square feet per month on Saleable Area.  It is hereby clarified that the aforesaid delay charges shall be payable, subject to demand being raised by the Allottee(s) for the same (and will be calculated from the date of the said demand), till the date when possession of the said “Independent Residential Floor” is offered to the Allottee(s).  Further, all payments towards the delay charges, as due from the Developer, would be adjusted from the payment due to the Developer from the Allottee(s) at the time of the final settlement of Sale Consideration of the said “Independent Residential Floor”.  Provided specifically that the Developer shall be entitled, without the payment of any delay charges, not to offer the possession of the said “Independent Residential Floor”, to the Allottee(s), till all payments/amount due and payable by the Allottee(s), as of such date, including all default, payment of interest etc., have been paid by the Allottee(s).”\r\n</p><p>&nbsp;The Respondent Promoter has failed to fulf</p>',4000000.00,3600000.00,'2016-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">The respondents be directed to complete the\r\ndevelopment works of the project and the construction of the independent\r\nresidential floor in question without any further delay and also offer the\r\npossession after the grant of occupation certificate of the Building and the\r\nCompletion Certificate of the Wave Estate Project.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2013-07-23 00:00:00','Independent Residential Floor Bearing No. 43/FF in Sector 99','','',1,1,0,0,'RajeevAnand','2018-09-15 17:01:21.000','RajeevAnand','2018-09-15 17:01:21.000'),(127,1022,'1022',1040,'a147b67e-0e01-42fd-9e99-390d21e31f08','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Mehak Aggarwal','mehakmukul@gmail.com',9878189241,0,443790646394,'H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','1','H No 21 Phase 2','Urban estate Patiala',28,454,'147002','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASR02-PR0169','Sri Guru Ram Dass urban estate Amritsar','Chief Administrator Puda Mohali','ca@puda.gov.in',0,1722215501,'Chief Administrator Puda sector 62','Puda Bhawan Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','Chief Administrator Puda sector 62','Puda Bhawan Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p>Possession not delivered in 18 months as promised in the brochure neither in 90 days as promised in Allotment letter dated 27.10.2016. Balance 75 percent scheduled in 6 half yearly instalments instead of 8 Half yearly instalments as mentioned on the front page of scheme brochure front page. Lay out plan revised and plot relocated to other place. This process of relocation took one year but puda keep on charging the interest and panelty on balance 75 percent amount. No development at site till date. No hope of completion of development works at site for next 15 months or more as tender for development of sector has been allotted only on 11.06.2018. Possession not offered on 25 percent payment as promised on front page of scheme brochure.</p>','<p>(1)Complete waiver of outstanding and accrued interest and panelty on balance&nbsp; 75 percent payment of 6 insttalments. (2) Withdrawal of previous allotment letter dated 27.10.2016 and issue of fresh allotment letter in current date with Reschedulling the balance insttalments in eight instalments instead of six insttalments and alongwith moratorium of one year. The date of revised allotment letter should be such wherein your promise of handing over possession in 90 days is fulfilled.</p>',9000000.00,2430000.00,'2017-01-27 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Complete waiver of outstanding and accrued interest till date on balance payment of 75 percent.</p>','1','','2016-10-27 00:00:00','2016-04-27 00:00:00','New relocated plot Number 454. Old plot Number 407 ','','',1,0,0,0,'Mehak','2018-09-16 14:34:58.000','Mehak','2018-09-16 14:34:58.000'),(128,1044,'1044',1108,'bf5a9f59-eaa5-435c-93e6-da29c1986f5d','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','AMAN DEEP  JASWAL','amanjaswal@rediffmail.com',9811227230,0,0,'G-149 ','PREET VIHAR',10,189,'110092','1','G-149 ','PREET VIHAR',10,189,'110092','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0046','Imperial Heights /\r\nWWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd\r\n','Col BS Sandhu (Retd.)','info@wwicsestates.com',9357993579,1726663600,'WWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','A12, Industrial Area, PhaseVI, Mohali,',28,507,'160055','1','WWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','A12, Industrial Area, PhaseVI, Mohali,',28,507,'160055','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">I had received letter of\r\noffer of possession dated : 31/10/2017 against which all due&nbsp;payment to\r\nbuilder was made on 14/01/2018 (after receipt of payment calculation by\r\nbuilder) but&nbsp;&nbsp;inspite of assurance of handing over the possession and\r\nregistry of the said unit within 30&nbsp;days of full and final payment, registry\r\nof flat is not done till date.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Since builder was\r\ndelaying the registry of flat I had personally visited builder\'s office\r\non&nbsp;26/03/2018 to get the registry done at my own but i was&nbsp;denied to\r\ndo so and i was told that registry will be done by builder only. Inspite of my\r\nregular followups builder has not confirmed me registry amount and finally in\r\nMay \'2018 i was told to pay registry amount after adjusting delayed penalty\r\ntill May \'2018 ( as&nbsp;builder knew that flat is not ready or&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;approvals\r\nwere not taken hence paid delayed&nbsp;penalty&nbsp;till May\'2018)&nbsp;and\r\ncheque No.002306 dated 27/05/2018 was paid to builder on 24/05/2018.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Regret to inform you\r\nthat inspite of my regular followups with builder since Jan \'2018,&nbsp; i am\r\nalways been given next month\'s date for registry which makes me feel that\r\nbuilder is either&nbsp;unnecessarily&nbsp;harassing me or he does not\r\nhave&nbsp; relevant&nbsp;approvals due to which registry of property is not\r\nbeing done till today. Needless to say that&nbsp;government&nbsp;is also\r\nloosing revenue due to non registry of flats inspite of taking full and final\r\npayments by builder from customers around 9 months back.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Further It is\r\nmore&nbsp;painful&nbsp;that builder has already charged one year advance\r\nmaintenance&nbsp;charges from me without getting the registry done till\r\ndate&nbsp;due to which i am getting&nbsp;mentally harassed and&nbsp;incurring\r\nfinancial loss as i am not able to rent out my property.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span></p>','<p>Builder should clarify how and on what basis letter for offer of possession was issued to me in Oct \'2017 when relevant approvals were not taken by builder.</p><p>Since builder has already charged me full payment of flat i.e. Rs. 3121004 in Jan \'2018 and i have already paid registry amount to&nbsp; builder in May \'2018 for registry moreover builder has charged me one year advance maintenance charges i.e Rs. 29520/- in JULY \'2018 but builder has failed to get the registry done till date due to which i am getting mentally harassed &amp; incurring financial loss as i am not able to rent out my property hence builder should pay penalty equivalent to monthly rent i.e.12000/- per month from June \'2018 till the time registry of my flat is not done and interest @ 24% on Rs.2,66,873/- amount charged from me which was actually payable at the time of actual possession of flat.<br></p><div><br></div>',3121004.00,3121004.00,'2015-03-29 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Builder should pay penalty equivalent to monthly rent i.e.12000/- per month from June \'2018 till the time registry of my flat is not done and interest @ 24% on Rs.2,66,873/- amount charged from me which was actually payable at the time of actual possession of flat.<br></p>','1','','2012-03-29 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','UNIT NO.704, TOWER - H, SEVENTH FLOOR, IMPERIAL HEIGHTS, SECTOR-115, MOHALI, PUNJAB','','',2,0,0,0,'AMANDEEPJASWAL','2018-09-18 14:38:51.000','AMANDEEPJASWAL','2018-09-18 14:38:51.000'),(129,1044,'1044',1108,'bf5a9f59-eaa5-435c-93e6-da29c1986f5d','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-20 15:51:43.000','AMAN DEEP  JASWAL','amanjaswal@rediffmail.com',9811227230,0,0,'G-149 ','PREET VIHAR',10,189,'110092','1','G-149 ','PREET VIHAR',10,189,'110092','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0046','Imperial Heights /\r\nWWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd\r\n','Col BS Sandhu (Retd.)','info@wwicsestates.com',9357993579,1726663600,'WWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','A12, Industrial Area, PhaseVI, Mohali,',28,507,'160055','1','WWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','A12, Industrial Area, PhaseVI, Mohali,',28,507,'160055','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">I had received letter of\r\noffer of possession dated : 31/10/2017 against which all due&nbsp;payment to\r\nbuilder was made on 14/01/2018 (after receipt of payment calculation by\r\nbuilder) but&nbsp;&nbsp;inspite of assurance of handing over the possession and\r\nregistry of the said unit within 30&nbsp;days of full and final payment, registry\r\nof flat is not done till date.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Since builder was\r\ndelaying the registry of flat I had personally visited builder\'s office\r\non&nbsp;26/03/2018 to get the registry done at my own but i was&nbsp;denied to\r\ndo so and i was told that registry will be done by builder only. Inspite of my\r\nregular followups builder has not confirmed me registry amount and finally in\r\nMay \'2018 i was told to pay registry amount after adjusting delayed penalty\r\ntill May \'2018 ( as&nbsp;builder knew that flat is not ready or&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;approvals\r\nwere not taken hence paid delayed&nbsp;penalty&nbsp;till May\'2018)&nbsp;and\r\ncheque No.002306 dated 27/05/2018 was paid to builder on 24/05/2018.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Regret to inform you\r\nthat inspite of my regular followups with builder since Jan \'2018,&nbsp; i am\r\nalways been given next month\'s date for registry which makes me feel that\r\nbuilder is either&nbsp;unnecessarily&nbsp;harassing me or he does not\r\nhave&nbsp; relevant&nbsp;approvals due to which registry of property is not\r\nbeing done till today. Needless to say that&nbsp;government&nbsp;is also\r\nloosing revenue due to non registry of flats inspite of taking full and final\r\npayments by builder from customers around 9 months back.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Further It is\r\nmore&nbsp;painful&nbsp;that builder has already charged one year advance\r\nmaintenance&nbsp;charges from me without getting the registry done till\r\ndate&nbsp;due to which i am getting&nbsp;mentally harassed and&nbsp;incurring\r\nfinancial loss as i am not able to rent out my property.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span></p>','<p>Builder should clarify how and on what basis letter for offer of possession was issued to me in Oct \'2017 when relevant approvals were not taken by builder.</p><p>Since builder has already charged me full payment of flat i.e. Rs. 3121004 in Jan \'2018 and i have already paid registry amount to&nbsp; builder in May \'2018 for registry moreover builder has charged me one year advance maintenance charges i.e Rs. 29520/- in JULY \'2018 but builder has failed to get the registry done till date due to which i am getting mentally harassed &amp; incurring financial loss as i am not able to rent out my property hence builder should pay penalty equivalent to monthly rent i.e.12000/- per month from June \'2018 till the time registry of my flat is not done and interest @ 24% on Rs.2,66,873/- amount charged from me which was actually payable at the time of actual possession of flat.<br></p><div><br></div>',3121004.00,3121004.00,'2015-03-29 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Builder should pay penalty equivalent to monthly rent i.e.12000/- per month from June \'2018 till the time registry of my flat is not done and interest @ 24% on Rs.2,66,873/- amount charged from me which was actually payable at the time of actual possession of flat.<br></p>','1','','2012-03-29 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','UNIT NO.704, TOWER - H, SEVENTH FLOOR, IMPERIAL HEIGHTS, SECTOR-115, MOHALI, PUNJAB','','',1,1,0,0,'AMANDEEPJASWAL','2018-09-18 15:01:19.000','AMANDEEPJASWAL','2018-09-18 15:01:19.000'),(130,1045,'1045',1108,'bf5a9f59-eaa5-435c-93e6-da29c1986f5d','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','AMAN DEEP  JASWAL','amanjaswal@rediffmail.com',9811227230,0,0,'G-149 ','PREET VIHAR',10,189,'110092','1','G-149 ','PREET VIHAR',10,189,'110092','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0046','Imperial Heights /\r\nWWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd\r\n','Col BS Sandhu (Retd.)','info@wwicsestates.com',9357993579,1726663600,'WWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','A12, Industrial Area, PhaseVI, Mohali,',28,507,'160055','1','WWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','A12, Industrial Area, PhaseVI, Mohali,',28,507,'160055','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">I had received letter of\r\noffer of possession dated : 31/10/2017 against which all due&nbsp;payment to\r\nbuilder was made on 14/01/2018 (after receipt of payment calculation by\r\nbuilder) but&nbsp;&nbsp;inspite of assurance of handing over the possession and\r\nregistry of the said unit within 30&nbsp;days of full and final payment, registry\r\nof flat is not done till date.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Since builder was\r\ndelaying the registry of flat I had personally visited builder\'s office\r\non&nbsp;26/03/2018 to get the registry done at my own but i was&nbsp;denied to\r\ndo so and i was told that registry will be done by builder only. Inspite of my\r\nregular followups builder has not confirmed me registry amount and finally in\r\nMay \'2018 i was told to pay registry amount after adjusting delayed penalty\r\ntill May \'2018 ( as&nbsp;builder knew that flat is not ready or&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;approvals\r\nwere not taken hence paid delayed&nbsp;penalty&nbsp;till May\'2018)&nbsp;and\r\ncheque No.002306 dated 27/05/2018 was paid to builder on 24/05/2018.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Regret to inform you\r\nthat inspite of my regular followups with builder since Jan \'2018,&nbsp; i am\r\nalways been given next month\'s date for registry which makes me feel that\r\nbuilder is either&nbsp;unnecessarily&nbsp;harassing me or he does not\r\nhave&nbsp; relevant&nbsp;approvals due to which registry of property is not\r\nbeing done till today. Needless to say that&nbsp;government&nbsp;is also\r\nloosing revenue due to non registry of flats inspite of taking full and final\r\npayments by builder from customers around 9 months back.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Further It is\r\nmore&nbsp;painful&nbsp;that builder has already charged one year advance\r\nmaintenance&nbsp;charges from me without getting the registry done till\r\ndate&nbsp;due to which i am getting&nbsp;mentally harassed and&nbsp;incurring\r\nfinancial loss as i am not able to rent out my property.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Builder\r\nshould clarify how and on what basis letter for offer of possession was issued\r\nto me in Oct \'2017 when relevant approvals were not taken by builder.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Since\r\nbuilder has already charged me full payment of flat i.e. Rs. 3121004 in Jan\r\n\'2018 and i have already paid registry amount to&nbsp; builder in May \'2018 for\r\nregistry moreover builder has charged me one year advance\r\nmaintenance&nbsp;charges i.e Rs. 29520/- in JULY \'2018 but builder has failed\r\nto get the registry done till date due to which i am getting mentally harassed\r\n&amp; incurring financial loss as i am not able to rent out my property hence\r\nbuilder should&nbsp;pay penalty equivalent to monthly rent i.e.12000/- per\r\nmonth from June \'2018 till the time registry of my flat is not done and\r\ninterest @ 24% on Rs.2,66,873/- amount charged from me which was actually\r\npayable at the time of actual possession of flat.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p>',3121004.00,3121004.00,'2015-03-29 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px; text-align: justify;\">Builder should&nbsp;pay penalty equivalent to monthly rent i.e.12000/- per month from June \'2018 till the time registry of my flat is not done and interest @ 24% on Rs.2,66,873/- amount charged from me which was actually payable at the time of actual possession of flat.</span><br></p>','1','','2012-03-29 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','UNIT NO.704, TOWER - H, SEVENTH FLOOR, IMPERIAL HEIGHTS, SECTOR-115, MOHALI, PUNJAB','','',1,0,0,0,'AMANDEEPJASWAL','2018-09-18 17:33:10.000','AMANDEEPJASWAL','2018-09-18 17:33:10.000'),(131,1046,'1046',1102,'d197bd4a-7512-45ef-94ec-91ef468f6e55','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bee Gee Builtech','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,0,'SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','sector -9',13,15,'134109','1','SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','sector -9',13,15,'134109','Savinder Singh Gill','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103','Palm Village','Monika Gupta','rahul.m.gupta@gmail.com',0,0,'House no. 24, Raja Park, Mahesh nagar','Ambala Cantt',13,1,'133001','1','House no. 24, Raja Park, Mahesh nagar','Ambala Cantt',13,1,'133001','1','<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">That the complainant no. 1 is the promoter\r\nhaving RERA registration no. </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103,</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">has developed project under\r\nthe name and style of “PALM VILLAGE”, located in Sector-126, NH-21, S.A.S.\r\nNagar, Mohali. The complainant no. 1 is a partnership firm and the present\r\ncomplaint is being filed on behalf of the complainant no. 1 through its\r\npartner, Sh. Surinder Kumar Bansal. The copy of the partnership deed dated\r\n03.01.2012 is annexed herewith as <b>Annexure\r\nC-1</b>. The complainant no. 2 is a maintenance agency which has been entrusted\r\nupon with the maintenance of the project of the complainant no. 1. It is\r\npertinent to mention here that both the complainants have entered into an\r\nagreement for the said reason. The copy of the Agreement with Maintenance\r\nAgency dated 24<sup>th</sup> December, 2014 is annexed herewith as <b>Annexure C-2</b>. The complainant no. 2\r\nused to be a partnership firm but the same now is a proprietorship firm after\r\nthe partnership was dissolved through Dissolution Deed dated 31.03.2016 and\r\ncopy of the Dissolution deed dated 31.03.2016 is annexed herewith as <b>Annexure C-3.</b></span><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%;\r\ntab-stops:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">In view of the facts mentioned in paragraph 4\r\nabove, the complainants prays for the following relief(s):<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-36.0pt;\r\nmso-text-indent-alt:-9.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level3 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span>1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Directing\r\nthe respondent to pay the amount of Rs. 31,702/- due towards the maintenance\r\ncharges.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-36.0pt;\r\nmso-text-indent-alt:-9.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level3 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span>2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">﻿</span><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">﻿<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">D</span></span><span style