861126,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103','PALM VILLAGE','Monika Gupta','rahul.m.gupta@GMAIL.COM',0,0,'House No. 24, Raja Park','Mahesh Nagar',13,1,'133001','1','House No. 24, Raja Park','Mahesh Nagar',13,1,'133001','1','<p>That the complainant no. 1 is the promoter having RERA registration no. PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103, has developed project under the name and style of “PALM VILLAGE”, located in Sector-126, NH-21, S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali. The complainant no. 2 is a maintenance agency which has been entrusted upon with the maintenance of the project of the complainant no. 1. It is pertinent to mention here that both the complainants have entered into an agreement for the said reason.That the respondents are allottees of the complainant no. 1 and applied for an apartment measuring 4280 sq. ft. (Approximate Super Area) on 07.04.2014 in the abovementioned project and in pursuance of the said booking, they were allotted flat no. B-901 on 9th Floor in Tower-B vide allotment letter dated 28.04.2014. That a buyer’s agreement was signed between the complainant no. 1 and the Respondents on 28.04.2014.&nbsp; The respondents were thereafter offered possession of the said apartment on 04.02.2015 and the possession of the said apartment was taken over by the respondent on 22.04.2015.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Further it is pertinent to mention here that in\r\nthe possession handing over letter, the respondents had undertaken to pay the\r\nmaintenance charges after taking over possession of the said apartment and had\r\nalso undertaken to enter into a maintenance agreement. The Respondents were\r\nentered into a maintenance agreement dated 22.04.2015 with the complainant no.\r\n2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">That the respondents despite been in possession\r\nof the said apartment, has not been paying the maintenance charges fixed as per\r\nthe maintenance 