uot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">The respondent was thereafter offered possession\r\nof the said apartment on 30.12.2014 and the possession of the said apartment\r\nwas taken over by the respondent on 12.02.2015.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Further it is pertinent to mention here that in\r\nthe possession handing over letter, the respondent had undertaken to pay the\r\nmaintenance charges after taking over possession of the said apartment and had\r\nalso undertaken to enter into a maintenance agreement. The respondent had\r\nthereafter, entered into a maintenance agreement dated 12.02.2015 with the\r\ncomplainant no. 2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">That the respondent despite been in possession\r\nof the said apartment, has not been paying the maintenance charges fixed as per\r\nthe maintenance agreement and is enjoying all the services free of cost. It is\r\nfurther pertinent to mention here that a number of public notices has been got\r\nattached in the society whereby the respondent was called upon various times\r\nfor payment of the maintenance charges but no heed was paid to the said notices\r\nby the respondent. Further, it is pertinent to mention here that the complainants also got a legal notice issued to the respondent.</span><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nmso-text-indent-alt:-9.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level3 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n.5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;