T Road, Chheharta',28,39,'143105','0','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd. Wave Estate Project site office sector 85','SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','4.1.	The Complainant upon the advertisements of apartments in project at Mohali by the Promoter Respondent showed his interest in buying the apartment with his other colleagues. The Complainant  was made to enter an Agreement to Sellby the Company with one Harish Chandra towards purchase of Unit No. 66 First Floor in Sector 99, SAS Nagar (Mohali).  The initial booking payment of Rs. 3 lakhs approx was made by the Complainant in the name of Harish Chander and on the receipt of said payment, the said Independent Floor was transferred in the name of the Complainant by the Respondent Promoter vide Receipt dated 05.02.2013 and subsequent payment making 15% of BSF in total was made on 21.03.2013 (true copy is annexed as ANNEXURE C-1 (Colly). Thereafter, the Complainant in May 2013 was made to apply Housing Loan for Rs. 30,00,000/-, which was approved from HDFC Bank on 17.05.2013 and kept at the disposal of the Respondent/Colonizer. \r\n<p></p><div>The Complainant entered into an “Independent Residential Floor Allottee Arrangement” at Mohali on 19.07.2013 with M/s Country Colonizers Pvt. Ltd. claiming to be “Developer” of a Mega Integrated Township on approx 255 acres of land regarding which it was represented that necessary approvals and sanctions have been granted by the Empowerment Committee under the Industrial Policy 2003, Government of Punjab with further representation that the Lay Out Plans of the land admeasuring 230.262 acres has already been approved vide letter dated 21.12.2011.  \r\n</div><div>\r\n</div><div>4.2.	That the Complainant provisionally allotted “Independent Residential Floors” Bearing No. 66 on 1st Floor in Sector ‘G’ having a saleable area of 1060 sq ft comprised in scheme of Ground + 2 Floors constructed on a plot having an area of 200 sq yards situated in the lay out plan of Wave Estate, SAS Nagar, Sector 85 and 99, Mohali as per Clause 2.1</div><div><br></div><div>(Document/Complaint Uploaded)</div>','<p>In view of the facts mentioned in Paragraph 4 above, the complainant prays for the following relief(s)&nbsp;\r\n</p><p>5.1	That Apartment 42/FF, Wave Floor Sector 99, Mohali (Relocated Apartment) in lieu of Apartment No. 66 FF, First Floor Sector G, Wave Floor, Sector 85 &amp; 99 Mohali, the Project WAVE ESTATE Sector 85 and 99 Mohali was allotted to the applicant on the settled terms and conditions in the AGREEMENT dated 19 JULY 2013 to be completed within 24 months Plus 6 months and with the condition in Clause 5.5 of the Agreement as under :\r\n</p><p>&nbsp;“5.5	Subject to clause 5.1 and 5.2 above and further the Allottee(s) having complied with its obligations under the Application Form as well as this “Independent Residential Floor” Allottee(s) Arrangement, including but not limited to timely payment of the entire Consideration and other charges as per the payment plan opted by the Allottee(s), in the event of willful delay in construction of the “Independent Residential Floor” for reason attributable solely to the Developer, delay charges would be payable to the Allottee(s) at the rate of Rs. 5/- per square feet per month on Saleable Area.  It is hereby clarified that the aforesaid delay charges shall be payable, subject to demand being raised by the Allottee(s) for the same (and will be calculated from the date of the said demand), till the date when possession of the said “Independent Residential Floor” is offered to the Allottee(s).  Further, all payments towards the delay charges, as due from the Developer, would be adjusted from the payment due to the Developer from the Allottee(s) at the time of the final settlement of Sale Consideration of the said “Independent Residential Floor”.  Provided specifically that the Developer shall be entitled, without the payment of any delay charges, not to offer the possession of the said “Independent Residential Floor”, to the Allottee(s), till all payments/amount due and payable by the Allottee(s), as of such date,&nbsp;</p><p>(Document uploaded)&nbsp;<br></p>',4000000.00,3600000.00,'2016-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">The respondents be directed to complete\r\nthe development works of the project and the construction of the independent\r\nresidential floor in question without any further delay and also offer the\r\npossession after the grant of occupation certificate of the Building and the\r\nCompletion Certificate of the Wave Estate Project.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2013-07-19 00:00:00','Independent Residential Floor Bearing No. 42/FF in Sector 99','','',2,0,0,0,'RajeevAnand','2018-09-21 19:27:54.000','RajeevAnand','2018-09-21 19:27:54.000'),(144,1059,'1059',1091,'e2da2916-c5af-4a15-acce-51dcf84d70a2','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-23 12:31:42.000','Narinder Kumar Thakur','nktkangra@yahoo.co.in',9417493259,1722622364,0,'House no. 155-A','Sector 42-A',6,128,'160042','1','House No. 2378, Sector 35-C,','',6,128,'160035','Rajeev Anand','anandlawoffice2378@gmail.com',9417870805,1722622364,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','M/s Country colonizers Pvt Ltd','Through its MD','customercare@waveestate.in',0,0,'PO Rayon and Silk Mills','Adjoining Coca Cola Depot GT Road, Chheharta',28,39,'143105','0','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd. Wave Estate Project site office sector 85','SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','<p>4.1.	The Complainant No. 1 upon the advertisements of apartments in project at Mohali by the Promoter Respondent showed his interest in buying the apartment with his other colleagues. The Complainant No.1 was made to enter an Agreement to Sellby the Company with one Harish Chander towards purchase of Unit No. 67 First Floor in Sector 99, SAS Nagar (Mohali).  The initial booking payment of Rs. 3 lakhs approx was made by the Complainant No. 1 in the name of Harish Chander and on the receipt of said payment, the said Independent Floor was transferred in the name of the Complainant No. 1 by the Respondent Promoter vide Receipt dated 05.02.2013 and subsequent payment making 15% of BSF in total was made on 21.03.2013 (true copy is annexed as ANNEXURE C-1 (Colly). Thereafter,the Complainant No. 1 in May 2013 was made to apply Housing Loan for Rs. 30,00,000/-, which was approved from HDFC Bank on 15.05.2013 and kept at the disposal of the Respondent/Colonizer. \r\n</p><p>The Complainant No. 1 entered into an “Independent Residential Floor Allottee Arrangement” at Mohali on 11.07.2013 with M/s Country Colonizers Pvt. Ltd. claiming to be “Developer” of a Mega Integrated Township on approx 255 acres of land regarding which it was represented that necessary approvals and sanctions have been granted by the Empowerment Committee under the Industrial Policy 2003, Government of Punjab with further representation that the Lay Out Plans of the land admeasuring 230.262 acres has already been approved vide letter dated 21.12.2011.  \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>4.2.	That the Complainant No. 1 provisionally allotted “Independent Residential Floors” Bearing No. 67 on 1st Floor in Sector ‘G’ having a saleable area of 1060 sq ft comprised in scheme of Ground + 2 Floors constructed on a plot having an area of 200 sq yards situated in the lay out plan of Wave Estate, SAS Nagar, Section 85 and 99, Mohali as per Clause 2.1 of Arrangement.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>(Document/Complaint Upload)</p>','<p>In view of the facts mentioned in Paragraph 4 above, the complainant prays for the following relief(s) \r\n</p><p>5.1	That Apartment 44/FF First Floor Wave Floor Sector 99, Mohali (Relocated Apartment) in lieu of Apartment No. 67 FF, First Floor Sector G, Wave Floor, Sector 85 &amp; 99 Mohali, the Project WAVE ESTATE Sector 85 and 99 Mohali was allotted to the applicant on the settled terms and conditions in the AGREEMENT dated 11 JULY 2013 to be completed within 24 months Plus 6 months and with the condition in Clause 5.5 of the Agreement as under :\r\n</p><p>&nbsp;“5.5	Subject to clause 5.1 and 5.2 above and further the Allottee(s) having complied with its obligations under the Application Form as well as this “Independent Residential Floor” Allottee(s) Arrangement, including but not limited to timely payment of the entire Consideration and other charges as per the payment plan opted by the Allottee(s), in the event of willful delay in construction of the “Independent Residential Floor” for reason attributable solely to the Developer, delay charges would be payable to the Allottee(s) at the rate of Rs. 5/- per square feet per month on Saleable Area.  It is hereby clarified that the aforesaid delay charges shall be payable, subject to demand being raised by the Allottee(s) for the same (and will be calculated from the date of the said demand), till the date when possession of the said “Independent Residential Floor” is offered to the Allottee(s).  Further, all payments towards the delay charges, as due from the Developer, would be adjusted from the payment due to the Developer from the Allottee(s) at the time of the final settlement of Sale Consideration of the said “Independent Residential Floor”.  Provided specifically that the Developer shall be entitled, without the payment of any delay charges, not to offer the possession of the said “Independent Residential floor</p><p><br></p><p>(Document / Complaint Uploaded)</p>',4000000.00,3600000.00,'2016-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">The respondents be directed to complete the\r\ndevelopment works of the project and the construction of the independent residential\r\nfloor in question without any further delay and also offer the possession after\r\nthe grant of occupation certificate of the Building and the Completion\r\nCertificate of the Wave Estate Project</span><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2013-07-11 00:00:00','Independent Residential Floor Bearing No. 44/FF in Sector 99','','',2,0,0,0,'RajeevAnand','2018-09-21 19:53:13.000','RajeevAnand','2018-09-21 19:53:13.000'),(145,1060,'1060',1091,'e2da2916-c5af-4a15-acce-51dcf84d70a2','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-21 21:10:01.000','Manjeet Singh and Anita Negi','metaphysics1127@gmail.com',7018869262,1722622364,0,'Village machkehar, PO Ahju, Tehsil joginder nagar','District Mandi Himachal Pradesh',14,382,'175032','1','Village machkehar, PO Ahju, Tehsil joginder nagar','District Mandi Himachal Pradesh',14,382,'175032','Rajeev Anand','anandlawoffice2378@gmail.com',9417870805,1722622364,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd','Through its MD','customercare@waveestate.in',0,0,'PO Rayon and Silk Mills','Adjoining Coca Cola Depot GT Road, Chheharta',28,39,'143105','0','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd. Wave Estate Project site office sector 85','SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','<p>4.1.	The Complainant No. 1 upon the advertisements of apartments in project at Mohali by the Promoter Respondent showed his interest in buying the apartment with his other colleagues. The Complainant No.1 was made to enter an Agreement to Sell dt 03.08.2013 by the Company with one Renu Singla towards purchase of Unit No. 28Second Floor in Sector 99, SAS Nagar (Mohali).A total ofRs.6,18,540 (Six lakhs Eighteen Thousand Five hundred forty)towards15% of BSPincluding Booking Amountplus service tax was made by the Complainant No. 1 in the name of Mrs Renu Singlaand on the receipt of said payment, the said Independent Floor was transferred in the name of the Complainant No. 1 by the Respondent Promoter on payment of 15% of BSP (including booking amount dt 05.02.13) vide Receipt dt 17.08.13 plus service tax receipt dt 31.08.14(true copy is annexed as ANNEXURE C-1). Thereafter, the Complainant No. 1 in SEP 2013 was made to enter a Tripartite Agreement between HDFC Bank, Promoter Respondent and Complainant No. 1 towards the approval of Home Loan for Rs. 32,00,000/- under offer date 03.09.2013(true copy of Tripartite Agreement is annexed as ANNEXURE C-2).\r\n</p><p>The Complainant No. 1 entered into an “Independent Residential Floor Allottee Arrangement” at Mohali on 03.09.2013 with M/s Country Colonizers Pvt. Ltd. claiming to be “Developer” of a Mega Integrated Township on approx 255 acres of land regarding which it was represented that necessary approvals and sanctions have been granted by the Empowerment Committee under the Industrial Policy 2003, Government of Punjab with further representation that the Lay Out Plans of the land admeasuring 230.262 acres has already been approved vide letter dated 21.12.2011.  (True copy of Independent Residential Floor” allotee(s) Arrangement is annexed as ANNEXURE C-3 (Colly).\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>(further Document/Complaint Uploaded)</p>','<p>In view of the facts mentioned in Paragraph 4 above, the complainant prays for the following relief(s) \r\n</p><p>5.1	That Apartment Unit No. 28 Second Floor in Sector 99, SAS Nagar, Mohali, the Project WAVE ESTATE Sector 85 and 99 Mohali was allotted to the applicant on the settled terms and conditions in the AGREEMENT dated 03SEPTEMBER 2013 to be completed within 24 months Plus 6 months and with the condition in Clause 5.5 of the Agreement as under :\r\n</p><p>&nbsp;“5.5	Subject to clause 5.1 and 5.2 above and further the Allottee(s) having complied with its obligations under the Application Form as well as this “Independent Residential Floor” Allottee(s) Arrangement, including but not limited to timely payment of the entire Consideration and other charges as per the payment plan opted by the Allottee(s), in the event of willful delay in construction of the “Independent Residential Floor” for reason attributable solely to the Developer, delay charges would be payable to the Allottee(s) at the rate of Rs. 5/- per square feet per month on Saleable Area.  It is hereby clarified that the aforesaid delay charges shall be payable, subject to demand being raised by the Allottee(s) for the same (and will be calculated from the date of the said demand), till the date when possession of the said “Independent Residential Floor” is offered to the Allottee(s).  Further, all payments towards the delay charges, as due from the Developer, would be adjusted from the payment due to the Developer from the Allottee(s) at the time of the final settlement of Sale Consideration of the said “Independent Residential Floor”.  Provided specifically that the Developer shall be entitled, without the payment of any delay charges, not to offer the possession of the said “Independent Residential Floor”, to the Allottee(s), till all payments/amount due and payable by the Allottee(s), as of such date, including all default, payment of interest etc., have been paid by the Allottee(s).”\r\n</p><p>&nbsp;(further Document Uploaded)</p>',4000000.00,3600000.00,'2016-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The\r\nrespondents be directed to complete the development works of the project and\r\nthe construction of the independent residential floor in question without any\r\nfurther delay and also offer the possession after the grant of occupation\r\ncertificate of the Building and the Completion Certificate of the Wave Estate\r\nProject.</span><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2013-09-03 00:00:00','“Independent Residential Floors” Bearing No. 28 on 2nd Floor in Sector ‘G’','','',2,0,0,0,'RajeevAnand','2018-09-21 20:16:30.000','RajeevAnand','2018-09-21 20:16:30.000'),(146,1061,'1061',1106,'0fa4919e-f07b-4736-b6c4-5b115fc41a37','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Hardeep Singh','hardeep.licdo@gmail.com',8146320007,1765250553,606394546303,'VPO.Sohana, Sector.77','Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','Asst. Branch Manager','LIC of India, Mandi Gobindgarh, Distt- FatehGarh Sahib',28,204,'147301','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0091','Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','Sukhchain Brar and Hoshiar Singh','bbsbikpmohali@gmail.com',9888033671,0,'M/S Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','Vill.Chapparchiri Kalan( H.B.No.195), Sector.92, Distt.SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','M/S Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','Vill.Chapparchiri Kalan( H.B.No.195), Sector.92, Distt.SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','<p>With due respect I want to explain each fact as given below;</p><p><br></p><p>1. That I have been harrassed by them very much since I booked two plots at POSH city of the above promoter on date 3.7.2017 as per the advertisement given by them on facebook and also at location before allotment of RERA No. Which falls under PB RERA Act 2016( as no promoter can advertise before RERA Approval)</p><p><br></p><p>2. That the two plots having No.158 on my wife name and No.124 on myself Name were alloted to me by them through the payment of Rs 100000 via cheque No. 971350 dt 3.7.17 and Rs 375000 via cheque No. 023730 dated 3.7.17 on the name of Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises which got cleared.</p><p><br></p><p>3. That both of them explain me that the project is RERA approved and got No very soon and you will got possession within 1 year upto 30.6.2018 but they got totally failed in doing so.</p><p><br></p><p>4. That they again demanded from me Rs 844360 via cheque No. 023731 dt 13.9.17 which also got cleared as to complete25% of Amount without doing any progress of the project and till this date also were unable to get RERA No.</p><p><br></p><p>5.That I have paid Total Amount of Rs. 13,19,360 &nbsp;till 13.9.2017 to them through all my cheques.</p><p><br></p><p>6. That they totally misleaded , misguided and also harrassed and tortured me mentally, when I visited there many times for getting LOI and Agreement documents since 1 year and 3 months.</p><p><br></p><p>7. That they have changed the maps of project many times and now they have started constructing Independent Floors (S+4) on the location of my booked plot No.124 and givent the contract to ACHME Ltd. &nbsp;without any intimation to me.</p><p><br></p><p>8. That the time of 1 year got passed and they totally failed even in refunding my Amount of Rs 1319360 with interest@18% plus harrassement Amount of Rs 200000 also, as I have requested to refund the amount through my mail send to them on 15.8.18.</p><p><br></p><p>9. I request yourself to help me in refunding my Amount with interest @18%plus harrassement Charge equal to 18 lakh.</p><p><br></p><p>Thanks</p><p><br></p><p>Regards</p><p><br></p><p>Hardeep Singh</p>','<p>I want to explain that;</p><p><br></p><p>1.In view of my above explaination the Promoter totally failed in providing Service to Customers and also unable to refund the amount after the notice of 15days which very well falls under National Consumer Act 1986.</p><p><br></p><p>2.And also they have given advertisements for promotion of the project before 1 year without RERA Approval. Which very well falls under PB RERA Act 2016.</p><p><br></p><p>3. That they have been harrassed me very much by giving false statements and also tortured me mentally by saying that you can do anything and God will teach me lesson. I dont know what I have done wrong by paying them Rs 1319360. And I got problem of high BP and hypertension due to their mentally torture to me. I am now taking medicines due to them. So kindly fine them Rs 200000 for &nbsp;harrassement and mentally torture to me.</p><p><br></p><p>4. That the Amount with interest @18% rounded to Rs 16 lakh plus Rs 2lakh as harrassement and mentally torture Charges is equal to Rs 18 lakh.</p><p><br></p><p>5. Please help me in refunding my this Amount ov Rs 18 lakh from them.</p><p><br></p><p>I shall be thankful to you.</p><p><br></p><p>Hardeep Singh</p>',4750000.00,1319360.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Please help me in refunding my whole amount of Rs 1319360 with interest @18% Plus harrassement and mentally torture charge of Rs 2 lakh.</p><p><br></p><p>Total Amount Rs 18 lakh.</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you</p><p><br></p><p>Regards</p><p><br></p><p>Hardeep Singh</p>','1','','2017-07-03 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','124 and 158','','',1,0,0,0,'HSToor','2018-09-22 10:27:01.000','HSToor','2018-09-22 10:27:01.000'),(147,1062,'1062',1106,'0fa4919e-f07b-4736-b6c4-5b115fc41a37','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Hardeep Singh','hardeep.licdo@gmail.com',8146320007,1765250553,606394546303,'VPO.Sohana, Sector.77','Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','Asst. Branch Manager','LIC of India, Mandi Gobindgarh, Distt- FatehGarh Sahib',28,204,'147301','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0091','Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','Sukhchain Brar and Hoshiar Singh','bbsbikpmohali@gmail.com',9888033671,0,'M/S Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','Vill.Chapparchiri Kalan( H.B.No.195), Sector.92, Distt.SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','M/S Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','Vill.Chapparchiri Kalan( H.B.No.195), Sector.92, Distt.SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','<p>With due respect I want to explain each fact as given below;</p><p><br></p><p>1. That I have been harrassed by them very much since I booked two plots at POSH city of the above promoter on date 3.7.2017 as per the advertisement given by them on facebook and also at location before allotment of RERA No. Which falls under PB RERA Act 2016( as no promoter can advertise before RERA Approval)</p><p><br></p><p>2. That the two plots