rt of\r\nbuilder to comply with rules and regulations has lead to erosion of credibility\r\nof the builder in view of cheating with me. I have been requesting the builder\r\nand the real estate agents since 01/05/2018&nbsp;\r\nto repay my whole amount which they have not done so far. You are\r\nrequested to direct the builder and the real estate agent to refund my money in\r\nfull along with interest upto date.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">c.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The\r\nbuilder and the real estate agents are reluctant to issue proper receipt/invoice\r\nin token of having received token money and instalment from the undersigned\r\nhence have cheated me, an innocent young man.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">d.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The\r\nreluctant and whimsical attitude of the builder along with unfair dealings have\r\nlead me to undue mental stress and humiliation.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">a.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The\r\nbuilder be directed to refund my money i.e. Rs. 6,62,434.00, which he has taken\r\nfrom me by unfair means and further he be directed to pay me the interest\r\nthereon as agreed immediately.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">b.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The\r\nbuilder and agents be directed to compensate me for the harassment, mental\r\ntorture and business loss due to their false promises.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Payment of the principal amount and interest theron<span>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;as agreed agreed i.e. 1% per month.<o:p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'Nitin15','2018-09-26 10:33:12.000','Nitin15','2018-09-26 10:33:12.000'),(157,1070,'1070',1115,'0c0ffa23-22c5-436e-a595-1aab1e70ec7b','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Vikas  Bhatia','bhatiavikas2009@gmail.com',7087404458,0,0,'1044 a 41 b','',6,128,'160041','1','1044 a 41 b','',6,128,'160041','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0038','GILLCO VALLEY','GILLCO DEVELOPERS AND BUILDERS PRIVATE LIMITED','info@gillcogroup.com',0,0,'GILLCO VALLEY CHANDIGARH KHARAR HIGHWAY  NH21','',28,507,'140301','1','GILLCO VALLEY CHANDIGARH KHARAR HIGHWAY  NH21','',28,507,'140301','1','<p>1. That  in January 2014, the complainant had booked a unit no. 1429 , First Floor, In Gillco Budget Homes, Gillco Valley, Chandigarh-Kharar Highway, NH-21, Kharar, Greater Mohali, for a total sale consideration of Rs. 2740000/-.</p><p>2. That the complainant had made a payment of Rs. 403500/- at the time of booking and Buyers Agreement was executed on 17.1.2014 and allotment letter was also provided to the complainant on 17.1.2014.</p><p>3. That&nbsp; the complainant availed home loan facility from HDFC Bank and made further payments of Rs. 14 Lacs to the respondent through Bank loan, on couple of occasions i.e. on 21.3.2014 –Rs. 1100000/- and 12.2.2015-Rs. 300000/-</p><p>4. That as per terms and conditions of the Buyers Agreement, the possession of the unit was to be delivered by the respondent within 12 months from the date of execution of the Buyers Agreement i.e. the possession was to be delivered on or before 17.1.2015.</p><p>5. That there being defect in title and also due to non-compliance of several laws and in absence of requisite approvals including Occupation Certificate etc., the respondent has not been able to deliver the possession of the said unit to the complainant till date i.e. even expiry of 4 years from the date of booking despite receiving Rs. 1803500/- from the complainant. Even the financial institutions have refused to release the funds/further loan amounts to respondent in absence of requisite approvals.</p><p>6. That the complainant has been visiting the office of the respondent but of no avail.</p><p>7. That the respondent has not discharged the obligations cast upon it in the terms and conditions of the Buyers Agreement and is in total breach and violation of the provisions of Punjab RERA Rules and is also guilty of cheating the allottees.</p><p>8. That due to malafide intents of the respondent, the complainant has been forced to make payment of rent to landowners as well as Pre-EMIs to the Bank.</p><p>9. That the complainant has suffered huge financial losses, mental trauma and</p>','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<style type=\"text/css\">\r\np.p1 {margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 36.0px; text-indent: -36.0px; font: 14.3px Times; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000}\r\np.p2 {margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 36.0px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -36.0px; font: 14.3px Times; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000}\r\nspan.s1 {font-kerning: none}\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">The complainant requests that the amounts worth Rs. 1803500/- paid by the complainant to the respondent towards &nbsp;the said unit be refunded alongwith interest as prescribed under law from the date of respective payment and penalty be imposed upon the respondent for the violation of the provisions of applicable statutes and rules.</span></p>',2740000.00,1803500.00,'2015-01-17 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NIL</p>','1','','2014-01-17 00:00:00','2014-01-17 00:00:00','1429 FIRST FLOOR GILLCO BUDGET HOMES GILLCO VALLEY','','',2,0,0,0,'bhatiavikas2009@gmail.com','2018-09-26 11:50:12.000','bhatiavikas2009@gmail.com','2018-09-26 11:50:12.000'),(158,1070,'1070',1115,'0c0ffa23-22c5-436e-a595-1aab1e70ec7b','FormTypeM',1,0,1,1,'2018-09-27 11:30:21.000','Vikas  Bhatia','bhatiavikas2009@gmail.com',7087404458,0,0,'1044 a 41 b','',6,128,'160041','1','1044 a 41 b','',6,128,'160041','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0038','GILLCO VALLEY','GILLCO DEVELOPERS AND BUILDERS PRIVATE LIMITED','info@gillcogroup.com',0,0,'GILLCO VALLEY CHANDIGARH KHARAR HIGHWAY  NH21','',28,507,'140301','1','GILLCO VALLEY CHANDIGARH KHARAR HIGHWAY  NH21','',28,507,'140301','1','<p>1. That  in January 2014, the complainant had booked a unit no. 1429 , First Floor, In Gillco Budget Homes, Gillco Valley, Chandigarh-Kharar Highway, NH-21, Kharar, Greater Mohali, for a total sale consideration of Rs. 2740000/-.</p><p>2. That the complainant had made a payment of Rs. 403500/- at the time of booking and Buyers Agreement was executed on 17.1.2014 and allotment letter was also provided to the complainant on 17.1.2014.</p><p>3. That&nbsp; the complainant availed home loan facility from HDFC Bank and made further payments of Rs. 14 Lacs to the respondent through Bank loan, on couple of occasions i.e. on 21.3.2014 –Rs. 1100000/- and 12.2.2015-Rs. 300000/-</p><p>4. That as per terms and conditions of the Buyers Agreement, the possession of the unit was to be delivered by the respondent within 12 months from the date of execution of the Buyers Agreement i.e. the possession was to be delivered on or before 17.1.2015.</p><p>5. That there being defect in title and also due to non-compliance of several laws and in absence of requisite approvals including Occupation Certificate etc., the respondent has not been able to deliver the possession of the said unit to the complainant till date i.e. even expiry of 4 years from the date of booking despite receiving Rs. 1803500/- from the complainant. Even the financial institutions have refused to release the funds/further loan amounts to respondent in absence of requisite approvals.</p><p>6. That the complainant has been visiting the office of the respondent but of no avail.</p><p>7. That the respondent has not discharged the obligations cast upon it in the terms and conditions of the Buyers Agreement and is in total breach and violation of the provisions of Punjab RERA Rules and is also guilty of cheating the allottees.</p><p>8. That due to malafide intents of the respondent, the complainant has been forced to make payment of rent to landowners as well as Pre-EMIs to the Bank.</p><p>9. That the complainant has suffered huge financial losses, mental trauma and</p>','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<style type=\"text/css\">\r\np.p1 {margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 36.0px; text-indent: -36.0px; font: 14.3px Times; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000}\r\np.p2 {margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 36.0px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -36.0px; font: 14.3px Times; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000}\r\nspan.s1 {font-kerning: none}\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">The complainant requests that the amounts worth Rs. 1803500/- paid by the complainant to the respondent towards &nbsp;the said unit be refunded alongwith interest as prescribed under law from the date of respective payment and penalty be imposed upon the respondent for the violation of the provisions of applicable statutes and rules.</span></p>',2740000.00,1803500.00,'2015-01-17 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NIL</p>','1','','2014-01-17 00:00:00','2014-01-17 00:00:00','1429 FIRST FLOOR GILLCO BUDGET HOMES GILLCO VALLEY','','',1,1,0,0,'bhatiavikas2009@gmail.com','2018-09-26 12:20:11.000','bhatiavikas2009@gmail.com','2018-09-26 12:20:11.000'),(159,1071,'1071',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bee Gee Builtech','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,0,'SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','1','SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','Savinder singh Gill','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0128','Astha City','Rachna Katyal ','skplanning@yahoo.com',8146819222,0,'House No. 5847, Modern Housing Complex','Manimajra',6,128,'160101','0','Flat No. 22-C, First Floor, Astha City','Peer Muchhalla, Sub-Tehsil Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif;\">That the complainant no. 1 is the promoter\r\nhaving RERA registration no. </span><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">PBRERA-SAS79-PR0128</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif;\">\r\nhas developed project under the name and style of “Aastha City”, located in Astha\r\nCity, Peer Muchhalla, Sub-Tehsil Zirakpur, Tehsil- Dera Bassi, Dist. Mohali, Punjab.</span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The complainant no. 2 is a maintenance agency\r\nwhich has been entrusted upon with the maintenance of the project of the\r\ncomplainant no. 1. It is pertinent to mention here that both the complainants\r\nhave entered into an agreement.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">That the respondent is an allottee of the\r\ncomplainant no. 1 who had applied for an apartment measuring 650 sq. ft.\r\n(Approximate Super Area) on 07.09.2015 in the abovementioned project.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">That a buyer’s agreement was signed between the\r\ncomplainant no. 1 and the respondent.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The possession of the said apartment was taken\r\nover by the respondent on 07.12.2015.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">it is pertinent to mention here that in the\r\npossession handing over letter, the respondent had undertaken to pay the\r\nmaintenance charges after taking over possession of the said apartment and had\r\nalso undertaken to enter into a maintenance agreement. The respondent had\r\nthereafter, entered into a maintenance agreement dated 07.12.2015 with the\r\ncomplainant no. 2.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">That the respondent despite been in possession\r\nof the said apartment, has not been paying the maintenance charges fixed as per\r\nthe maintenance agreement and is enjoying all the services free of cost.</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nmso-text-indent-alt:-9.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level3 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n.5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -0.5in;\">Directing\r\nthe respondent to pay the amount of Rs. 25,734/- due towards the maintenance\r\ncharges.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nmso-text-indent-alt:-9.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level3 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n.5in\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Cent