 26.06.2014 in the abovementioned project and in pursuance of the\r\nsaid booking, he was allotted flat no. 22-A on Ground Floor vide allotment\r\nletter dated 30.06.2014.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">That a buyer’s agreement was signed between the\r\ncomplainant no. 1 and the respondent on 30.06.2014. </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The respondent was thereafter offered possession\r\nof the said apartment on 25.11.2014 and the possession of the said apartment\r\nwas taken over by the respondent on 03.03.2015. </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Further it is pertinent to mention here that in\r\nthe possession handing over letter, the respondent had undertaken to pay the\r\nmaintenance charges after taking over possession of the said apartment and had\r\nalso undertaken to enter into a maintenance agreement. The respondent had thereafter,\r\nentered into a maintenance agreement dated 03.03.2015 with the complainant no.\r\n2. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">That the respondent despite been in possession\r\nof the said apartment, has not been paying the maintenance charges fixed as per\r\nthe maintenance agreement and is enjoying all the services free of cost.</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nmso-text-indent-alt:-9.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level3 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n.5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nmso-text-indent-alt:-9.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level3 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n.5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span>2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></b><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Directing\r\nthe respondent to pay the amount of Rs. 24,587/- due towards the maintenance\r\ncharges.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 37.3333px; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 37.3333px; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;Directing the respondent to pay compensation of Rs. 15,000/- to the complainants.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nmso-text-indent-alt:-9.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level3 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nmso-text-indent-alt:-9.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level3 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n.5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></b><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Directing\r\nthe respondent to pay interest on the due amount as mentioned in the\r\nmaintenance agreement till the pendency of the present complaint till actual\r\npayment.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'BeeG','2018-09-26 17:09:50.000','BeeG','2018-09-26 17:09:50.000'),(163,1074,'1074',1017,'c5979978-7e2d-4b44-85f9-d7153801dae4','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-27 17:38:54.000','Kanisth Ganeriwala','Kanisth@ganeriwala.co.in',9814048883,1724654850,0,'H NO 323, ADVOCATES ENCLAVE','SECTOR 49A',6,128,'160047','1','H NO 323, ADVOCATES ENCLAVE','SECTOR 49A',6,128,'160047','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0090','Sandwoods Opulencia','Sandwoods Infratech Projects Pvt. Ltd.','info@sandwoods.com',0,0,'Regd. Office: 1108, Arunanchal Building','19 Barakhamba Road',10,120,'110001','0','SCO 222-223, 3rd Floor','Sector 34 A',6,128,'160034','1','<p>a)    The Builder marketed their new project – ‘SANDWOODS OPULENCIA’ located at Sector 110, S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali under a subvention-scheme.\r\n</p><p>b)    Accordingly the complainant applied for a unit measuring 1325 Sq. Ft under the subvention scheme and was allotted Unit No. 169, 7th Floor in Tower D4 against the Basic Sales Price of the unit for Rs. 41,80,000.&nbsp;<br></p><p>c)    After paying the booking amount it was specifically assured that the possession of the Unit will be handed within a maximum timeframe of 36 months and that all the EMI’s till possession would be paid by the Builder and the complainant would not be required to make any payment in this regard till the possession is obtained.&nbsp;<br></p><p>d)    However, the Builder unilaterally changed the terms of this assurance and said that he will pay only the interest part of the EMI’s and not the complete EMI’s till possession.&nbsp;<br></p><p>e)    Clause 6(a) of the Agreement specifically states that:&nbsp;<br></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;“The Developer, subject to force majeure, shall offer the possession of the said Unit to the Buyer within Thirty Six (36) months&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;from the date of this agreement with a grace period of Six (6) months.”&nbsp;<br></p><p>\r\n</p><p> \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>f)     Even as per the Agreement the period of 36 Months had already expired long ago on 26.10.2017. There is delay of nearly 1 year and till date there is no possession from the Builder.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p> \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>g)    The builder has even stopped discharging its liability of paying the EMI’s since October 1, 2017 and the now the entire burden of EMI’s have fallen upon the Complainant contrary to the initial promise. \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p> \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>h)    The Builder sent letter dated 05.09.2017 stating that they are offering possession of the Unit soon and on this pretext stopped discharging their liabilities. Even since 05.09.2017 more than 1 year has lapsed and there is no possession of the Unit. The Complainant is compelled to pay entire EMI’s at present despite the initial undertaking despite making a payment of Rs. 42,90,666 till date and the</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in;\r\nline-height:115%;mso-pagination:none;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;mso-hyphenate:\r\nnone\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial\">a)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">To </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">refund the entire payment made and received by\r\nthe Builder against the said Unit till date i.e. Rs. </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">42,90,666</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">; and<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;\r\nmso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in;\r\nline-height:115%;mso-pagination:none;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;mso-hyphenate:\r\nnone\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial\">b)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">To pay interest on the entire payment made and\r\nreceived by the Builder against the said Unit till date i.e. Rs. </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">42,90,666\r\n</span><i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">minus </span></i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">any interest already paid by the Builder under\r\nthe subvention scheme as applicable; and<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\nmargin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:1.0in;mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"Heading\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">c)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">To\r\ndirect the Builder to pay for compensation for harassment and mental agony amounting\r\nto Rs.&nbsp; 50,000/-<o:p></o:p></span></p>',4180000.00,4290666.00,'2017-10-26 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n12.0pt;margin-left:1.0in;mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n115%;mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">As this Hon’ble forum deems fit under the\r\ncircumstances of the case.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','2014-10-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Unit 169, 7th Floor in Tower D4, Sandwoods Opulencia, Sector 110, SAS Nagar','','',2,0,0,0,'Saloney','2018-09-26 18:03:06.000','Saloney','2018-09-26 18:03:06.000'),(164,1075,'1075',1017,'c5979978-7e2d-4b44-85f9-d7153801dae4','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-03 17:09:09.000','Parika Ganeriwal','Kanisth@ganeriwala.co.in',9814048883,1724654850,0,'H NO 323, ADVOCATES ENCLAVE','SECTOR 49A',6,128,'160047','1','H NO 323, ADVOCATES ENCLAVE','SECTOR 49A',6,128,'160047','KANISTH GANERIWALA','kanisth@ganeriwala.co.in',9814048883,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0090','Sandwoods Opulencia','Sandwoods Infratech Projects Pvt. Ltd.','info@sandwoods.com',0,0,'Regd. Office: 1108, Arunanchal Building','19 Barakhamba Road',10,120,'110001','0',' SCO: 222-223, 3rd Floor','Sector 34 A',6,128,'160034','1','<p>a)	The Builder marketed their new project – ‘SANDWOODS OPULENCIA’ located at Sector 110, S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali under a subvention-scheme.\r\n</p><p>b)	Accordingly the complainant applied for one unit measuring 1325 Sq. Ft under the subvention scheme and was allotted Unit No. 172, 7th Floor in Tower D4 against the Basic Sales Price of the unit for Rs. 41,80,000. \r\n</p><p>c)	After paying the booking amount it was specifically assured and represented that the possession of the Unit will be handed over to the Complainant within a maximum timeframe of 36 months and that all the EMI’s till possession would be paid by the Builder and the complainant would not be required to make any payment in this regard till the possession is obtained. \r\n</p><p>d)	However, the Builder unilaterally changed the terms of this assurance and said that he will pay only the interest part of the EMI’s and not the complete EMI’s till possession. \r\n</p><p>e)	Clause 6(a) of the Agreement specifically states that:\r\n</p><p>“The Developer, subject to force majeure, shall offer the possession of the said Unit to the Buyer within Thirty Six (36) months from the date of this agreement with a grace period of Six (6) months.”\r\n</p><p>f)	Even as per the Agreement the period of 36 Months had already expired long ago on 27.05.2017. There is delay of 1 year and 4 month till date. \r\n</p><p>\r\ng)	The builder has even stopped discharging its liability of paying the EMI’s since October 1, 2017 contrary to the initial promise.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>\r\nh)	The Builder sent letter dated 05.09.2017 stating that they are offering possession of the Unit soon and on this pretext stopped discharging their liabilities. Even since 05.09.2017 more than 1 year has lapsed and there is no possession of the Unit. The Complainant was compelled to foreclose the loan due to non-performance of Builder’s initial undertaking.&nbsp;</p><p>i)	The complainant has made a payment of Rs. 43,98,288 till date which is much more than the B.S.P. of Rs. 41,80,000 and despite this there is no possession.&nbsp;<br></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in;\r\nline-height:115%;mso-pagination:none;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;mso-hyphenate:\r\nnone\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial\">a)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">To </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">refund the entire payment made and received by\r\nthe Builder against the said Unit till date i.e. Rs. 43,98,288; and<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;\r\nmso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in;\r\nline-height:115%;mso-pagination:none;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;mso-hyphenate:\r\nnone\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial\">b)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">To pay interest on the entire payment made and\r\nreceived by the Builder against the said Unit till date i.e. Rs. 43,98,288 <i>minus </i>any interest already paid by the\r\nBuilder under the subvention scheme as applicable; and<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"Heading\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">c)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">To\r\ndirect the Builder to pay for compensation for harassment and mental agony amounting\r\nto Rs.&nbsp; 50,000/-<o:p></o:p></span></p>',4180000.00,4398288.00,'2017-05-27 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n12.0pt;margin-left:1.0in;mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n115%;mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">As this Hon’ble forum deems fit under the\r\ncircumstances of the case.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','2014-05-28 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Unit No. 172, Tower D4, Sandwoods Opulencia, Sector 110, Landran Road, SAS Nagar','','',1,1,0,0,'Saloney','2018-09-26 19:10:35.000','Saloney','2018-09-26 19:10:35.000'),(165,1076,'1076',1120,'84277fb5-7a10-4661-b624-f0f8791464ea','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NareshKumar Saini & Nidhi Saini','jagan2702@gmail.com',9463990426,0,0,'R/o #115 A, Jarnail Enclave Phase- 1, ','Zirakpur, ',28,507,'140603','1','R/o #115 A, Jarnail Enclave Phase- 1, ','Zirakpur, ',28,507,'140603','Jagan Nath Bhandari','advbhandarichd@gmail.com',9855677966,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PC0022','Maya Garden Magnesia','Barnala Builders through its Director and others','info@mayagardenmagnesia.com',0,0,' SCO 1 & 2, Maya Garden City, Opposite McDonalds , NH 22, Chd-Ambala Highway.','Nangla Road, Zirakpur, ',28,507,'140603','1',' SCO 1 & 2, Maya Garden City, Opposite McDonalds , NH 22, Chd-Ambala Highway.','Nangla Road, Zirakpur, ',28,507,'140603','1','<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">﻿Note: That in present complaint the Parforma respondents has been arrayed as party and those are necessary party this complaint but in e-filing there is no option to add respondents and in e-filing the character limit has been prescribed