212,0,0,'wawdq','',28,507,'121121','1','wawdq','',28,507,'121121','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASD01-PM0001','test','asdasd','asd@asd.com',0,0,'asdasd','',27,301,'160001','1','asdasd','',27,301,'160001','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><a name=\"_GoBack\"></a><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">This is to bring to your kind notice the\r\nviolations in Opera Garden group housing Peer Muchalla Vill. Kishan Pura\r\nZirakpur. This site is near to the under construction building that recently\r\nfell. The objections raised by the office of chief town planner were also\r\ndisregarded before passing of the site plan by the Zirakpur Municipal council<b>.\r\nThe same are attached as Annex 4. These objections have not been removed till\r\ndate.</b>&nbsp;In addition, following violations also exist in this project.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Invalid</b> <b>Site Plan:&nbsp;</b>The site\r\nplan was sanctioned in 2006, with a validity of 1 year <b>(Annex 5).</b> The same is\r\nto be renewed every year from the office of CTP which has not been done in this\r\ncase. This invalid site plan has been used for RERA registration. The\r\nconstruction and sale is being done without renewal of the same.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#500050\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">2.&nbsp;<b>No\r\nCompletion Certificate:&nbsp;</b>The builder has given possession and transferred\r\nthe flat to the purchasers but no completion certificate has been taken from\r\nthe concerned authorities.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Conversion\r\nof 3 BHK to 4 BHK:&nbsp;</b>No\r\n4BHK Flats are sanctioned in the site Plan by the Zirakpur MC as is evident\r\nfrom the copy of the Site Plan in&nbsp;<b>Annex 1</b>&nbsp;but the site plan\r\nmentioned in the Catalogue shows two Blocks of 4 BHK flats. The Approval by the\r\nOffice of CTP&nbsp;<b>Annex 4 Point 17</b>&nbsp;has raised objections that the\r\nplan is such that 3 bedroom flats can be converted into 4 bedroom flats and the\r\nsame is being done &amp; 2 bedroom flats can be converted into 3 bedroom flats\r\nwhich again is being done. The 2 Blocks (56 Flats) of the 3 BHK flats are being\r\nsold as 4 BHK Flats as seen from the Catalogue.</span>\r\n\r\n<br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:14.25pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">5.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Conversion of 2\r\nBHK into 3 BHK:</b>&nbsp; 56 nos of 3BHK flats and 224 nos of 2 BHK flats are sanctioned\r\nin the site plan. The Developer has malafide intentions which are evident from\r\nthe catalogue&nbsp;<b>Annex 2 Pg.3&nbsp;</b>of the developer showing 6 Nos of 3\r\nBHK Blocks, 2 Nos of 4 BHK Blocks and 1 Block of EWS flats. There is no mention\r\nof 2 BHK blocks</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;adasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdadasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdasdassdasdasd. This is a new wow fasdadasdasdasdasdaddasdasasdasd</o:p></span></p>','<p>asd\" \' - ( )+&amp;</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>asdasda</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'demo3','2018-09-27 10:44:12.000','demo3','2018-09-27 10:44:12.000'),(168,1077,'1077',1126,'c5d5539f-f896-4a4a-9808-f6498fce3578','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-28 15:29:17.000','narender sharma','narendersharmachd45@gmail.com',9056296154,0,0,'h.no 1632','vill. burail',6,128,'160047','1','h.no 1632','vill. burail',6,128,'160047','','',0,0,'Agent','PBRERA-SAS79-PRO329_','dara buildtech and developers ltd','dara buildtech','daraestates@hotmail.com',8302000555,0,'sco 3 & 4 khuni majra','kharar landran road ',28,507,'140301','1','sco 3 & 4 khuni majra','kharar landran road ',28,507,'140301','1','<p>i have paid a part of booking amount of rs 11000 vide receipt no.0631 dated 14/01/2018</p><p>i have also paid remaining 12.5% of booking amount of rs.59000 was paid on 04/03/2018</p><p>it was mutually agreed that a bank loan of rs 500000 will be started to pay the balance amount in june 2018for which company started paper work but no response received till august&nbsp;</p><p>then i contacted the company and company said it is not so easy to get a flat at this rate rather it would take 2 or 3 years</p><p>then i requested the company to return my money for which they decline my request and offer my another flat of rs 12 lack to which am not able to buy.</p><p>moreover they also offer me to deposit&nbsp; your money in for 5 years and we would give you money back at 12% interest rate&nbsp;</p><p>another day i visited their now they said we will not refund your money you will not do anything if you want to go to higher authority you can but result would be the same we know all authority persons you will not get your money back even through hook or cook.</p>','<p>i want full compensation with interest of my deposited amount&nbsp; of rs 70000</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>i want full compensation with interest of my deposited amount&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'NARENDER.1981','2018-09-27 13:15:45.000','NARENDER.1981','2018-09-27 13:15:45.000'),(169,1071,'1071',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-15 10:04:56.000','Bee Gee Builtech','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,0,'SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','1','SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','Savinder singh Gill','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0128','Astha City','Rachna Katyal ','skplanning@yahoo.com',8146819222,0,'House No. 5847, Modern Housing Complex','Manimajra',6,128,'160101','0','Flat No. 22-C, First Floor, Astha City','Peer Muchhalla, Sub-Tehsil Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif;\">That the complainant no. 1 is the promoter\r\nhaving RERA registration no. </span><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">PBRERA-SAS79-PR0128</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif;\">\r\nhas developed project under the name and style of “Aastha City”, located in Astha\r\nCity, Peer Muchhalla, Sub-Tehsil Zirakpur, Tehsil- Dera Bassi, Dist. Mohali, Punjab.</span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The complainant no. 2 is a maintenance agency\r\nwhich has been entrusted upon with the maintenance of the project of the\r\ncomplainant no. 1. It is pertinent to mention here that both the complainants\r\nhave entered into an agreement.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">That the respondent is an allottee of the\r\ncomplainant no. 1 who had applied for an apartment measuring 650 sq. ft.\r\n(Approximate Super Area) on 07.09.2015 in the abovementioned project.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">That a buyer’s agreement was signed between the\r\ncomplainant no. 1 and the respondent.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The possession of the said apartment was taken\r\nover by the respondent on 07.12.2015.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">it is pertinent to mention here that in the\r\npossession handing over letter, the respondent had undertaken to pay the\r\nmaintenance charges after taking over possession of the said apartment and had\r\nalso undertaken to enter into a maintenance agreement. The respondent had\r\nthereafter, entered into a maintenance agreement dated 07.12.2015 with the\r\ncomplainant no. 2.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">That the respondent despite been in possession\r\nof the said apartment, has not been paying the maintenance charges fixed as per\r\nthe maintenance agreement and is enjoying all the services free of cost.</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nmso-text-indent-alt:-9.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level3 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n.5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -0.5in;\">Directing\r\nthe respondent to pay the amount of Rs. 25,734/- due towards the maintenance\r\ncharges.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nmso-text-indent-alt:-9.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level3 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n.5in\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -0.5in;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.5in; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Direct</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.5in; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">ing the respondent to pay compensation of Rs. 15,000/- to the complainants.</span></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nmso-text-indent-alt:-9.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level3 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n.5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot