d 14/01/2018 for 1 bhk top floor</p><p>i have also paid remaining 12.5% of booking amount of rs.59000 was paid on 04/03/2018</p><p>it was mutually agreed that a bank loan of rs 500000 will be started to pay the balance amount in june 2018for which company started paper work but no response received till august&nbsp;</p><p>then i contacted the company and company said it is not so easy to get a flat at this rate rather it would take 2 or 3 years</p><p>then i requested the company to return my money for which they decline my request and offer my another flat of rs 12 lack to which am not able to buy.</p><p>moreover they also offer me to deposit&nbsp; your money in for 5 years and we would give you money back at 12% interest rate&nbsp;</p><p>another day i visited their now they said we will not refund your money you will not do anything if you want to go to higher authority you can but result would be the same we know all authority persons you will not get your money back even through hook or cook.</p>','<p>i want full compensation with interest of my deposited amount&nbsp; of rs 70000 or i want possession at the decided rate of 5 lac at the time of booking&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>',570000.00,70000.00,'2019-02-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>i want full compensation with interest of my deposited amount&nbsp; of rs 70000 or i want possession at the decided rate of 5 lac at the time of booking&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'NARENDER.1981','2018-10-03 13:00:39.000','NARENDER.1981','2018-10-03 13:00:39.000'),(180,1074,'1074',1017,'c5979978-7e2d-4b44-85f9-d7153801dae4','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-03 17:15:06.000','Kanisth Ganeriwala','Kanisth@ganeriwala.co.in',9814048883,1724654850,0,'H NO 323, ADVOCATES ENCLAVE','SECTOR 49A',6,128,'160047','1','H NO 323, ADVOCATES ENCLAVE','SECTOR 49A',6,128,'160047','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0090','Sandwoods Opulencia','Sandwoods Infratech Projects Pvt. Ltd.','info@sandwoods.com',0,0,'Regd. Office: 1108, Arunanchal Building','19 Barakhamba Road',10,120,'110001','0','SCO 222-223, 3rd Floor','Sector 34 A',6,128,'160034','1','<p>a)    The Builder marketed their new project – ‘SANDWOODS OPULENCIA’ located at Sector 110, S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali under a subvention-scheme.\r\n</p><p>b)    Accordingly the complainant applied for a unit measuring 1325 Sq. Ft under the subvention scheme and was allotted Unit No. 169, 7th Floor in Tower D4 against the Basic Sales Price of the unit for Rs. 41,80,000.&nbsp;<br></p><p>c)    After paying the booking amount it was specifically assured that the possession of the Unit will be handed within a maximum timeframe of 36 months and that all the EMI’s till possession would be paid by the Builder and the complainant would not be required to make any payment in this regard till the possession is obtained.&nbsp;<br></p><p>d)    However, the Builder unilaterally changed the terms of this assurance and said that he will pay only the interest part of the EMI’s and not the complete EMI’s till possession.&nbsp;<br></p><p>e)    Clause 6(a) of the Agreement specifically states that:&nbsp;<br></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;“The Developer, subject to force majeure, shall offer the possession of the said Unit to the Buyer within Thirty Six (36) months&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;from the date of this agreement with a grace period of Six (6) months.”&nbsp;<br></p><p>\r\n</p><p> \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>f)     Even as per the Agreement the period of 36 Months had already expired long ago on 26.10.2017. There is delay of nearly 1 year and till date there is no possession from the Builder.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p> \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>g)    The builder has even stopped discharging its liability of paying the EMI’s since October 1, 2017 and the now the entire burden of EMI’s have fallen upon the Complainant contrary to the initial promise. \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p> \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>h)    The Builder sent letter dated 05.09.2017 stating that they are offering possession of the Unit soon and on this pretext stopped discharging their liabilities. Even since 05.09.2017 more than 1 year has lapsed and there is no possession of the Unit. The Complainant is compelled to pay entire EMI’s at present despite the initial undertaking despite making a payment of Rs. 42,90,666 till date and there being no possession.</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in;\r\nline-height:115%;mso-pagination:none;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;mso-hyphenate:\r\nnone\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial\">a)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">To </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">refund the entire payment made and received by\r\nthe Builder against the said Unit till date i.e. Rs. </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">42,90,666</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">; and<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;\r\nmso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in;\r\nline-height:115%;mso-pagination:none;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;mso-hyphenate:\r\nnone\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial\">b)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">To pay interest on the entire payment made and\r\nreceived by the Builder against the said Unit till date i.e. Rs. </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">42,90,666\r\n</span><i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">minus </span></i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">any interest already paid by the Builder under\r\nthe subvention scheme as applicable; and<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\nmargin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:1.0in;mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"Heading\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">c)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">To\r\ndirect the Builder to pay for compensation for harassment and mental agony amounting\r\nto Rs.&nbsp; 50,000/-<o:p></o:p></span></p>',4180000.00,4290666.00,'2017-10-26 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n12.0pt;margin-left:1.0in;mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n115%;mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\">As this Hon’ble forum deems fit under the\r\ncircumstances of the case.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','2014-10-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Unit 169, 7th Floor in Tower D4, Sandwoods Opulencia, Sector 110, SAS Nagar','','',1,1,0,0,'Saloney','2018-10-03 17:12:27.000','Saloney','2018-10-03 17:12:27.000'),(181,1083,'1083',1135,'7ce4ff29-c893-46aa-aac9-b9c5d5926814','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','naresh  kumar','akhilesh@vyaslawassociates.com',7087973992,0,0,'29-C, Kashmir avenue, Amritsar','',28,39,'143001','1','29-C, Kashmir avenue, Amritsar','',28,39,'143001','akhilesh vyas','akhilesh@vyaslawassociates.com',9855004557,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASR02-PR0169','Sh. Guru Ram \r\nDass, Urban \r\nEstate','Punjab Urban Planning Development Authority','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA Bhawan','green avenue',28,39,'143001','1','PUDA Bhawan','green avenue',28,39,'143001','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That\r\nthe applicant was allotted residential plot by Punjab Urban Planning and\r\nDevelopment Authority (hereinafter called as “PUDA”) bearing residential plot\r\nNo. 344 measuring 300 Sq. Yards at Guru Ram Dass Urban Estate Airport Road,\r\nAmritsar. The total price of the residential plot of Rs. 54.00 lacs only @ Rs.\r\n18000/- per Sq. Yard. As per the payment schedule given in the allotment letter\r\n25% of the allotment amount was to be paid initially and rest of the payment\r\nwas to be paid after the possession. The brochure of the scheme clearly\r\nreflects that possession on 25% payment as per the allotment letter it admitted\r\nby the respondent that payment of Rs. 13,50,000/- lacs was made by the\r\napplicant and it has already been adjusted towards initial 25% of the sale\r\nprice of residential plot as mentioned in clause No. 3.1. For the balance\r\npayment of 75% the schedule as follows was settled between the parties.&nbsp; The terms and conditions of the balance\r\npayment of 75% were also settled between the parties as per annexure A1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -0.5in;\">That\r\none necessary fact which cannot be ignored is that the applicant was allured\r\ntowards this scheme once he was shown that possession will be handed over on\r\n25% of payment. After making the payment of 25% the applicant kept on\r\napproaching the respondents for the possession and other amenities thereafter,\r\nbut nothing was informed to them. The most important clause as per the\r\nallotment letter is clause no. 6 i.e. possession and ownership as per&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -0.5in;\">Annexure A1. The\r\nclause of possession and ownership very clearly stated that possession will be\r\ngiven within 90% days from the date of issuance of allotment letter. The abovenoted\r\nclause proved to be fatal as per the agreement with the parties.</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -0.5in;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -0.5in;\">No possession has been handed over up till now but the parties are still being charged interest and penal interest. There is no denial to the fact in\r\nthe present case that the amount of 25% was duly paid and the amount was duly\r\ncredited with the respondent.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p>good</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>okk</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'akhilesh','2018-10-04 15:48:00.000','akhilesh','2018-10-04 15:48:00.000'),(182,1083,'1083',1135,'7ce4ff29-c893-46aa-aac9-b9c5d5926814','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','naresh  kumar','akhilesh@vyaslawassociates.com',7087973992,0,0,'29-C, Kashmir avenue, Amritsar','',28,39,'143001','1','29-C, Kashmir avenue, Amritsar','',28,39,'143