RAKKPUR',28,507,'140603','1','BALTANA','MC ZRAKKPUR',28,507,'140603','1','<p>I HAD PURCHASED TWO PLOT NUMBERED 41 - 115 SQ YDS AND 37 - 110 SQ. YARDS IN BALAJI ENCLAVE&nbsp; KOLI MAJRA, LALRU, TEHSIL DERA BASSI, DISTT S A S NAGAR, PUNJAB AGAINST THE DEED NO. 667 AND 668 OF 16/05/2017, THE AREA WAS UNDER DEVELOPING</p><p><br></p><p>TILL DATE NO POSSESSION HAS BEEN GIVEN BY THEM.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>','<p>CASE HAS BEEN REGSITERED AGASNT TIHME AND MY MONEY WITH INTEREST WILL BE RETURN BACK TO ME.</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>CASE HAS BEEN REGSITERED AGASNT TIHME AND MY MONEY WITH INTEREST WILL BE RETURN BACK TO ME.<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'nisha.6242','2018-10-11 15:57:49.000','nisha.6242','2018-10-11 15:57:49.000'),(190,1089,'1089',1154,'76087e52-5827-4626-bcf1-6ca35660c9a0','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-27 14:48:37.000','Bikram Singh Rana','lawvikas99@gmail.com',7988059993,0,592293198565,'H.No.989','Sector-15',13,20,'131001','1','H.No.989','sector-15',13,20,'131001','Vikas Deep','lawvikas99@gmail.com',7988059993,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0367','Downtown Retail in Uniworld City','Unitech Ltd.','sanctions_hry@unitechgroup.com',0,0,'Unitech House','L block, South City-1',13,5,'122007','1','Unitech House','L block, South City-1',13,5,'122007','0','<p>Facts of the case:\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>i)	That the respondent is a public limited company, duly incorporated under the Companies Act, 1956, engaged in the business of real estate development. \r\n</p><p>ii)	That the respondent represented that it is in the process of setting up “Uniworld City” at land situated in Sector 97, 106 &amp; 107, Mohalli, Punjab, comprise of Plots, Villas, Multi-storey Group Housing, Commercial Complexes etc. It further represented that it intends to construct and develop, in accordance with Building Plans as approved by Director, Town &amp; Country Planning, Govt. Of Punjab, Chandigarh, a commercial complex under name and style of ‘Downtown Retail’ in Uniworld City, Sector-97, Mohalli, Punjab.\r\n</p><p>iii)	That the project in question is registered with this Authority vide RERA Registration No. PBRERA-SAS80PR0367, as per details obtained from the official web-site of the RERA Punjab.\r\n</p><p>iv)	That vide Agreement to Sell dated 22-08-2014, the complainant purchased a commercial unit No.029A, Ground Floor, admeasuring 650sq.feet in ‘Downtown Retail’ in Uniworld City, Sector-97, Mohalli, Punjab. The same was purchased for total sale consideration of Rs.22,75,000/-. The copy of Agreement dated 22-08-2014 is annexed herewith as ANNEXURE-P1 (17 pages).\r\n</p><p>v)	That it was agreed that in case 90% amount of total sale consideration is deposited by complainant against the unit, the respondent shall pay to the complainant a monthly periodical payment i.e. “Assured Return” @ Rs.72.08/- per square feet per month of the super area till the unit is leased out by respondent after completion. Hence accordingly, amount of Rs.46,852/- per month was payable quarterly by the respondent. Out of this total sale consideration, the complainant at the time of booking / registration had paid Rs.20,47,500/-. Rest amount of Rs.2,27,500/- was payable at possession. A Memorandum of Understanding dated 22-08-2014 was executed in this respect. The copy of Memorandum of Understanding dated 22-08-2014 is annexed herew</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:26.05pt;\r\nmargin-bottom:10.0pt;margin-left:60.55pt;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span></b><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Relief(s) sought:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:4.75pt;margin-bottom:\r\n8.0pt;margin-left:60.55pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">In\r\nview of the facts mentioned in paragraph 4 above, the complainant prays for the\r\nfollowing relief(s) <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:10.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:90.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nmso-list:l1 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.5pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial\">a)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The respondent be directed to hand over the\r\nactual physical possession of the unit in question, got booked plot i.e. the\r\ncommercial unit No.029A, Ground Floor, admeasuring 650sq.feet in ‘Downtown\r\nRetail’ in Uniworld City, Sector-97, Mohalli, Punjab, to the complainant, after\r\nfully developing the said colony and obtaining the Occupation Certificate.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">The respondent be\r\nfurther directed to pay the statutory compensation, on amount deposited from\r\ntheir respective deposits till possession of plot, in the interest of justice</span><br></p>',2275000.00,2247500.00,'2017-02-21 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:10.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:90.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The respondent be\r\ndirected to pay the statutory interim compensation, per month, till possession\r\nof plot is handed over as the respondent is enjoying the benefit and fruit of\r\nhuge amount, deposited by the complainant, against the booking of unit in question.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','2014-08-22 00:00:00','2014-08-22 00:00:00','Downtown Retail in Uniworld City, Sector-97, Mohali, Punjab','','',1,1,0,0,'lawvikas99','2018-10-13 15:37:47.000','lawvikas99','2018-10-13 15:37:47.000'),(191,1090,'1090',1143,'750cff8c-f4c0-4b3b-853b-c94fcf3d7864','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Sandeep Kaur','sandeepbajwa27@gmail.com',9888087374,0,0,'House No.577, First Floor','pocket-4, Omaxe, New Chandigarh, Mullanpur',28,507,'140901','1','253','Sector-4,Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0007','ATS Golf Meadows Lifestyle 1','ATS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','pradeep.rathee@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS Estates Private Limited','711/92, Deepali, Nehru Place',10,429,'110019','1','ATS Estates Private Limited','711/92, Deepali, Nehru Place',10,429,'110019','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>abc</p>',6147500.00,5550000.00,'2015-08-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','2015-01-28 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat No - 04032, 3rd Floor, Tower No. 4','','',2,0,0,0,'Sandeepkaurats','2018-10-15 11:56:46.000','Sandeepkaurats','2018-10-15 11:56:46.000'),(192,1091,'1091',1132,'1cc1b298-c384-4c23-8f77-3e560c57343c','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-29 12:16:21.000','Col Shiv Kumar Anand & Vinod Arora','sk.anand1581@gmail.com',9815001098,0,318710313792,'1581, Sector 34-D','',6,128,'160022','1','1581, Sector 34-D','Chandigarh',6,128,'160022','Col Shiv Kumar Anand','sk.anand1581@gmail.com',9815001098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0089','AEROPOLIS INFRASTRUCTURE PVT LTD','TEJINDER SINGH BHATIA','tejindersinghbhatia@gmail.com',9592969696,0,'Aeropolis City,','Sector 66A, SAS Nagar(Mohali)-',28,507,'160062','1','Aeropolis City,','Sector 66A, SAS nagar. (Mohali)',28,507,'160062','0','<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Mangal;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Applied for a IT plot\r\nof 400 sq yds in 2011. The same has not been handed over, till date &amp; there\r\nis no development of the area. The company has changed its name and has kept its\r\ncustomers ignorant. This could only be found out on visit to your office. Since\r\nlast eight years payments have been made, as per the development plan, as\r\nindicated by Yellowstone. Actually, on the ground there is zero development.\r\nThe Yellowstone has been cheating the customers &amp; utilizing the funds in\r\nother projects. Since the company has laid down the conditions for timely\r\npayments, imposing interest of 18% for late payments, I had no choice. I am 75\r\nyear old &amp; have requested the company many a times, but to no avail. I have\r\npaid Rs. 22.11 Lakh, over the period. It is more than seven years since,\r\nstarted paying for the plot. Considering the normal time of three years of\r\ncompletion of the project, the company has already taken more than four years, over &amp; above the basic necessary period</span><br></p>','<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Mangal;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">RERA is requested, to\r\norder the company to hand over the plots at the earliest. RERA is further\r\nrequested to order the AEROPOLIS to pay interest @ 18% pa, for retaining the\r\nmoney for so long. In case they can’t hand over the plot, then they should\r\nhandover 400 sq yds of free hold land in Sector 66-A, SAS Nagar and pay\r\ninterest at 18% from 2011 to the date of settlement. In case the company is\r\nhanding over the plot, that case they should give 18% rate of interest of the\r\nperiod over &amp; above the basic period of 3 years required of the completion\r\nof the project, for keeping the money for so long. In case the company is not\r\nable to hand over the plots, then it should give, 400 sq yds of land with free\r\ntitle in Sector 66A, SAS Nagar, along with interest of 18% from Aug 2011 to\r\ndate, for keeping the money, for the period from the date of allotment to the\r\ndate of settlement.</span><br></p>',26400000.00,2211000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-21.15pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Before completion of your order &amp;\r\nhanding over the plot, you are requested to order the company to hand over the\r\ninterest at 18% pa, the rate the company was charging from its customers, for\r\nthe period that they have retained the money &amp; used it for other purposes\r\nfor their benefit. Your kind attention is drawn to Sr. 19 (4) of regulations\r\n&amp; development of RERA, in this case. Company should also be penalized for\r\ncheating &amp; harassing their customers &amp; retaining &amp; using the money\r\nfor their projects. Legal costs also are imposed on AEROPOLIS Infrastructure\r\nPvt. Ltd.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','2011-06-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','-','','',2,0,0,0,'sk.anand1581@gmail.com','2018-10-15 12:08:58.000','sk.anand1581@gmail.com','2018-10-15 12:08:58.000'),(193,1090,'1090',1143,'750cff8c-f4c0-4b3b-853b-c94fcf3d7864','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Sandeep Kaur','sandeepbajwa27@gmail.com',9888087374,0,0,'House No.577, First Floor','pocket-4, Omaxe, New Chandigarh, Mullanpur',28,507,'140901','1','253','Sector-4,Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0007','ATS Golf Meadows Lifestyle 1','ATS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','pradeep.rathee@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS Estates Private Limited','711/92, Deepali, Nehru Place',10,429,'110019','1','ATS Estates Private Limited','711/92, Deepali, Nehru Place',10,429,'110019','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">That applicant along with\r\nher mother Gurdarshan kaur had purchased a three bedroom flat bearing\r\nRegistration No 355 and apartment No 6032 sixth&nbsp;floor, Tower 1, in ATS\r\nGolf Meadows Lifestyle, in 2013. A sum of Rs. 5550000 was paid by them towards\r\nthe sale consideration.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">That applicant and Gurdarshan\r\nKaur in December, 2014 decided to have bigger accommodation and thus requested\r\nthe respondent to allot them four bedroom flat instead. Accordingly, the\r\nrespondent vide allotment letter dated 28-Jan-2015, allotted flat No 04032,\r\n3rd&nbsp;floor, Tower 4, Registration No 432, measuring 2950 sq ft in ATS Gold\r\nMeadows Lifestyle for total sale consideration of Rs 6147500. The respondent\r\nassured to deliver the possession in August, 2015. All the previous payments\r\nmade by the applicant and Gurdarshan Kaur amounting to Rs.5550000 were\r\ntransferred to this apartment<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">A buyer agreement in\r\nrespect of said apartment was executed on 28-Jan-2015 and as per clause 14 of\r\nthe said agreement, the possession of the flat was to be delivered within 36\r\nmonths from the date start of construction of particular tower in which flat is\r\nallotted. The construction of Tower No 4 was started in August, 2012 as\r\nintimated by the respondent vide letter dated 18.09.2014 which was sent to the\r\napplicant on 27.04.2018. The period of 36 months expired in August, 2015. Thus,\r\nthe respondent was bound to deliver the possession by August, 2015. But till\r\ndate the respondent has failed to deliver the possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">The applicant along with\r\nGurdarshan Kaur is living in a rented accommodation and thus the respondent is\r\nalso liable to pay the amount towards the rent paid by the applicant for\r\nstaying in the rented accommodation with effect from September, 2015 till the\r\ndate of possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">That the applicant has\r\nbecome the absolute owner of said apartment after the transfer of share by\r\nGurdarshan Kaur, in her favor and the respondent has duly acknowledged the same\r\nby executing a supplementary agreement dated 04.09.2018.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p>abc</p>',6147500.00,5550000.00,'2015-08-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','2015-01-28 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat No - 04032, 3rd Floor, Tower No. 4','','',2,0,0,0,'Sandeepkaurats','2018-10-15 15:59:05.000','Sandeepkaurats','2018-10-15 15:59:05.000'),(194,1090,'1090',1143,'750cff8c-f4c0-4b3b-853b-c94fcf3d7864','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Sandeep Kaur','sandeepbajwa27@gmail.com',9888087374,0,0,'House No.577, First Floor','pocket-4, Omaxe, New Chandigarh, Mullanpur',28,507,'140901','1','253','Sector-4,Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0007','ATS Golf Meadows Lifestyle 1','ATS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','pradeep.rathee@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS Estates Private Limited','711/92, Deepali, Nehru Place',10,429,'110019','1','ATS Estates Private Limited','711/92, Deepali, Nehru Place',10,429,'110019','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">That applicant along with\r\nher mother Gurdarshan kaur had purchased a three bedroom flat bearing\r\nRegistration No 355 and apartment No 6032 sixth&nbsp;floor, Tower 1, in ATS\r\nGolf Meadows Lifestyle, in 2013. A sum of Rs. 5550000 was paid by them towards\r\nthe sale consideration.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">That applicant and Gurdarshan\r\nKaur in December, 2014 decided to have bigger accommodation and thus requested\r\nthe respondent to allot them four bedroom flat instead. Accordingly, the\r\nrespondent vide allotment letter dated 28-Jan-2015, allotted flat No 04032,\r\n3rd&nbsp;floor, Tower 4, Registration No 432, measuring 2950 sq ft in ATS Gold\r\nMeadows Lifestyle for total sale consideration of Rs 6147500. The respondent\r\nassured to deliver the possession in August, 2015. All the previous payments\r\nmade by the applicant and Gurdarshan Kaur amounting to Rs.5550000 were\r\ntransferred to this apartment<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">A buyer agreement in\r\nrespect of said apartment was executed on 28-Jan-2015 and as per clause 14 of\r\nthe said agreement, the possession of the flat was to be delivered within 36\r\nmonths from the date start of construction of particular tower in which flat is\r\nallotted. The construction of Tower No 4 was started in August, 2012 as\r\nintimated by the respondent vide letter dated 18.09.2014 which was sent to the\r\napplicant on 27.04.2018. The period of 36 months expired in August, 2015. Thus,\r\nthe respondent was bound to deliver the possession by August, 2015. But till\r\ndate the respondent has failed to deliver the possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">The applicant along with\r\nGurdarshan Kaur is living in a rented accommodation and thus the respondent is\r\nalso liable to pay the amount towards the rent paid by the applicant for\r\nstaying in the rented accommodation with effect from September, 2015 till the\r\ndate of possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">That the applicant has\r\nbecome the absolute owner of said apartment after the transfer of share by\r\nGurdarshan Kaur, in her favor and the respondent has duly acknowledged the same\r\nby executing a supplementary agreement dated 04.09.2018.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\">To offer possession of apartment No\r\n04032, on 3rd Floor in Tower No 4 complete in all aspects (with all the basic\r\nfacilities made available at the site) along with interest, as contemplated\r\nunder rule 16 of The Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development)\r\nRules, 2017, on the already deposited amount i.e. </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast\">Rs. 5550000, </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\">for the period of delay in possession with\r\neffect from September, 2015 till offer of the possession of the said apartment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\">To pay Rs. 500000 as compensation\r\nfor deficiency in service, unfair trade practice and mental harassment suffered\r\nby the complainant and </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">damages\r\nfor the physical and mental torture, agony, discomfort and undue hardships\r\ncaused to the complainant. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\">To pay the amount calculated at the\r\nrate Rs. 12700 per month w.e.f &nbsp;September,2015\r\nto April, 2016 towards the rent paid by the applicant along with maintenance\r\ncharges at the rate of Rs. 1500 per month for said period, and to pay amount\r\ncalculated at the rate of Rs. 13970 per month w.e.f May, 2016 to March,2017\r\ntowards the rent paid by the applicant along with maintenance charges at the\r\nrate of Rs. 2200 per month, for the period of delay in possession w.e.f.\r\nSeptember, 2015 till offer of the possession of the said apartment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\">To pay Rs. 100000 as litigation\r\nexpenses to the complainant in the interest of justice.</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',6147500.00,5550000.00,'2015-08-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','2015-01-28 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat No - 04032, 3rd Floor, Tower No. 4','','',2,0,0,0,'Sandeepkaurats','2018-10-15 15:59:38.000','Sandeepkaurats','2018-10-15 15:59:38.000'),(195,1090,'1090',1143,'750cff8c-f4c0-4b3b-853b-c94fcf3d7864','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Sandeep Kaur','sandeepbajwa27@gmail.com',9888087374,0,0,'House No.577, First Floor','pocket-4, Omaxe, New Chandigarh, Mullanpur',28,507,'140901','1','253','Sector-4,Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0007','ATS Golf Meadows Lifestyle 1','ATS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','pradeep.rathee@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS Estates Private Limited','711/92, Deepali, Nehru Place',10,429,'110019','1','ATS Estates Private Limited','711/92, Deepali, Nehru Place',10,429,'110019','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">That applicant along with\r\nher mother Gurdarshan kaur had purchased a three bedroom flat bearing\r\nRegistration No 355 and apartment No 6032 sixth&nbsp;floor, Tower 1, in ATS\r\nGolf Meadows Lifestyle, in 2013. A sum of Rs. 5550000 was paid by them towards\r\nthe sale consideration.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150