n of Rs 6147500. The respondent\r\nassured to deliver the possession in August, 2015. All the previous payments\r\nmade by the applicant and Gurdarshan Kaur amounting to Rs.5550000 were\r\ntransferred to this apartment<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">A buyer agreement in\r\nrespect of said apartment was executed on 28-Jan-2015 and as per clause 14 of\r\nthe said agreement, the possession of the flat was to be delivered within 36\r\nmonths from the date start of construction of particular tower in which flat is\r\nallotted. The construction of Tower No 4 was started in August, 2012 as\r\nintimated by the respondent vide letter dated 18.09.2014 which was sent to the\r\napplicant on 27.04.2018. The period of 36 months expired in August, 2015. Thus,\r\nthe respondent was bound to deliver the possession by August, 2015. But till\r\ndate the respondent has failed to deliver the possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">The applicant along with\r\nGurdarshan Kaur is living in a rented accommodation and thus the respondent is\r\nalso liable to pay the amount towards the rent paid by the applicant for\r\nstaying in the rented accommodation with effect from September, 2015 till the\r\ndate of possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">That the applicant has\r\nbecome the absolute owner of said apartment after the transfer of share by\r\nGurdarshan Kaur, in her favor and the respondent has duly acknowledged the same\r\nby executing a supplementary agreement dated 04.09.2018.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-a