onths from the date start of construction of particular tower in which flat is allotted. The construction of Tower No 4 was started in August, 2012 as intimated by the respondent vide letter dated 18.09.2014 (C-5) which was sent to the applicant on 27.04.2018. The period of 36 months expired in August, 2015. Thus, the respondent was bound to deliver the possession by August, 2015. But till date the respondent has failed to deliver the possession.\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">The applicant along with Gurdarshan Kaur is living in a rented accommodation and thus the respondent is also liable to pay the amount towards the rent paid by the applicant for staying in rented accommodation with effect from September, 2015 till the date of possession.\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">That the applicant has become the absolute owner of said apartment after the transfer of share by Gurdarshan Kaur, in her favor and the respondent&nbsp; duly acknowledged the same by executing a supplementary agreement dated 4.9.2018(C-6)</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\">To offer possession of apartment No\r\n04032, on 3rd Floor in Tower No 4 complete in all aspects&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 18px;\">(with all the basic\r\nfacilities made available at the site)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">along with interest, as contemplated\r\nunder rule 16 of The Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development)\r\nRules, 2017, on the already deposited amount i.e. </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; lin