mmodation with effect from September, 2015 till the date of possession.\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">That the applicant has become the absolute owner of said apartment after the transfer of share by Gurdarshan Kaur, in her favor and the respondent&nbsp; duly acknowledged the same by executing a supplementary agreement dated 4.9.2018(C-6). Statement of Account(C-7)</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\">To offer possession of apartment No\r\n04032, on 3rd Floor in Tower No 4 complete in all aspects&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 18px;\">(with all the basic\r\nfacilities made available at the site)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">along with interest, as contemplated\r\nunder rule 16 of The Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development)\r\nRules, 2017, on the already deposited amount i.e. </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">Rs. 5550000, </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">for the period of delay in possession with\r\neffect from September, 2015 till offer of the possession of the said apartment.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\">To pay Rs. 500000 as compensation\r\nfor deficiency in service, unfair trade practice and mental harassment suffered\r\nby the complainant and </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">damages\r\nfor the physical and mental torture, agony, discomfort and undue hardships\r\ncaused to the complainant. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\">To pay the amount calculated at the\r\nrate Rs. 12700 per month w.e.f &nbsp;September,2015\r\nto April, 2016 towards the rent paid by the applicant along with maintenance\r\ncharges at the rate of Rs. 1500 per month for said period, and to pay amount\r\ncalculated at the rate of Rs. 13970 per month w.e.f May, 2016 to March,2017\r\ntowards the rent paid by the applicant along with maintenance charges at the\r\nrate of Rs. 2200 per month, for the period of delay in possession w.e.f.\r\nSeptember, 2015 till offer of the possession of the said apartment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\">To pay Rs. 100000 as litigation\r\nexpenses to the complainant in the interest of justice.</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',6147500.00,5550000.00,'2015-08-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<div class=\"WordSection1\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">It is further prayed that during the\r\npendency of instant application, the respondent be directed not to create any\r\nthird party rights over the said apartment and not to create any charge over\r\nit.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n21.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n</div><p>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><br clear=\"all\" style=\"page-break-before:always;mso-break-type:section-break\"></span></p>','1','','2015-01-28 00:00:00','2015-01-28 00:00:00','Flat No - 04032, 3rd Floor, Tower No. 4','','',2,0,0,0,'Sandeepkaurats','2018-10-15 16:28:00.000','Sandeepkaurats','2018-10-15 16:28:00.000'),(202,1090,'1090',1143,'750cff8c-f4c0-4b3b-853b-c94fcf3d7864','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-15 17:02:49.000','Sandeep Kaur','sandeepbajwa27@gmail.com',9888087374,0,0,'House No.577, First Floor','pocket-4, Omaxe, New Chandigarh, Mullanpur',28,507,'140901','0','HOUSE NO 253','Sector 4 Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0007','ATS Golf Meadows Lifestyle 1','ATS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','pradeep.rathee@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'Village Madhopur','Tehsil Derabassi',28,507,'140507','0','711/92, DEEPALI','NEHRU PLACE',10,429,'110019','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">That applicant along with her mother Gurdarshan kaur had purchased a 3 BHK flat bearing Registration No 355, apartment No 6032, 6th floor, Tower 1, in ATS Golf Meadows Lifestyle, in 2013(C-1). A sum of Rs. 5550000 was paid by them towards the sale consideration(C-2).\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">That applicant and Gurdarshan Kaur in December, 2014 decided to have bigger accommodation and thus requested the respondent to allot them 4 BHK flat instead. Accordingly, the respondent vide allotment letter dated 28-Jan-2015 (C-3) allotted flat No 04032, 3rd floor, Tower 4, Registration No 432, measuring 2950 sq ft in ATS Gold Meadows Lifestyle for total sale consideration of Rs 6147500. The respondent assured to deliver the possession in August, 2015. All the previous payments made by the applicant and Gurdarshan Kaur amounting to Rs.5550000 were transferred to this apartment\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">Buyer agreement(C-4) in respect of said apartment was executed on 28-Jan-2015 and as per clause 14, the possession of the flat was to be delivered within 36 months from the date start of construction of particular tower in which flat is allotted. The construction of Tower No 4 was started in August, 2012 as intimated by the respondent vide letter dated 18.09.2014 (C-5) which was sent to the applicant on 27.04.2018. The period of 36 months expired in August, 2015. Thus, the respondent was bound to deliver the possession by August, 2015. But till date the respondent has failed to deliver the possession.\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">The applicant along with Gurdarshan Kaur is living in a rented accommodation and thus the respondent is also liable to pay the amount towards the rent paid by the applicant for staying in rented accommodation with effect from September, 2015 till the date of possession.\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">That the applicant has become the absolute owner of said apartment after the transfer of share by Gurdarshan Kaur, in her favor and the respondent&nbsp; duly acknowledged the same by executing a supplementary agreement dated 4.9.2018(C-6). Statement of Account(C-7)</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\">To offer possession of apartment No\r\n04032, on 3rd Floor in Tower No 4 complete in all aspects&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 18px;\">(with all the basic\r\nfacilities made available at the site)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">along with interest, as contemplated\r\nunder rule 16 of The Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development)\r\nRules, 2017, on the already deposited amount i.e. </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">Rs. 5550000, </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">for the period of delay in possession with\r\neffect from September, 2015 till offer of the possession of the said apartment.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\">To pay Rs. 500000 as compensation\r\nfor deficiency in service, unfair trade practice and mental harassment suffered\r\nby the complainant and </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">damages\r\nfor the physical and mental torture, agony, discomfort and undue hardships\r\ncaused to the complainant. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\">To pay the amount calculated at the\r\nrate Rs. 12700 per month w.e.f &nbsp;September,2015\r\nto April, 2016 towards the rent paid by the applicant along with maintenance\r\ncharges at the rate of Rs. 1500 per month for said period, and to pay amount\r\ncalculated at the rate of Rs. 13970 per month w.e.f May, 2016 to March,2017\r\ntowards the rent paid by the applicant along with maintenance charges at the\r\nrate of Rs. 2200 per month, for the period of delay in possession w.e.f.\r\nSeptember, 2015 till offer of the possession of the said apartment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\">To pay Rs. 100000 as litigation\r\nexpenses to the complainant in the interest of justice.</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',6147500.00,5550000.00,'2015-08-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<div class=\"WordSection1\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">It is further prayed that during the\r\npendency of instant application, the respondent be directed not to create any\r\nthird party rights over the said apartment and not to create any charge over\r\nit.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n21.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n</div><p>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><br clear=\"all\" style=\"page-break-before:always;mso-break-type:section-break\"></span></p>','1','','2015-01-28 00:00:00','2015-01-28 00:00:00','Flat No - 04032, 3rd Floor, Tower No. 4','','',2,0,0,0,'Sandeepkaurats','2018-10-15 16:28:32.000','Sandeepkaurats','2018-10-15 16:28:32.000'),(203,1058,'1058',1091,'e2da2916-c5af-4a15-acce-51dcf84d70a2','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-21 21:05:41.000','Harendra Singh Negi','negi_hs@yahoo.com',9417474113,0,0,'House No. 3178 B, ','Sector 24 D',6,128,'160024','1','House No. 3178 B, ','Sector 24 D',6,128,'160024','Rajeev Anand','anandlawoffice2378@gmail.com',9417870805,1722622364,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','M/s country colonizers Pvt Ltd.','Through its MD','customercare@waveestate.in',0,0,'PO Rayon and Silk Mills','Adjoining Coca Cola Depot GT Road, Chheharta',28,39,'143105','0','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd. Wave Estate Project site office sector 85','SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','The Complainant booked an Apartment 66 FF, First Floor Sector G, Wave Floor, Sector 99 Mohali on 21.03.2013 making initial payment (Annexure C-1 Colly). Agreement dated 19.07.2013 (Annexure C-2) was executed with Respondent for saleable area 1060sqFt @ 3773.58/sqFt. As per cLause 5.2, the Project was to be developed and the Apartment was to be handed over in 24 months and by Cl. 5.5 the delay entailed Rs. 5/sqFt/month for delay. On 20.01.2014, the Complainant was made to fill another Agreement (Annexure C-3) and the Apartment of the Complainant was unilaterally changed by issuing a letter (Annexure C-4) with new number 42/FF, Wave Floor Sector 99, Mohali (Relocated Apartment). \r\n<div>The Complainant took a Loan (Annexure C-5) for the Apartment. The Complainant found that site plan has been changed of the Apartment by changing bathroom door opening in bedroom etc.. Having found the Project and the Apartment delayed, the Complainant gave a representation 11.01.2017 (Annexure C-6) that construction started with 2 years delay and not completed. The complainant gave another representation dated 05.08.2017 (Annexure C-7) that even after 4 1/2 years possession not offered. On 03.09.2017 (Annexure C-8) the Complainant wanted to meet the senior executive but no time was given for meeting for delivery of possession. The Complainant upon interest liability and EMI burden spent his life savings and repaid loan on 01.03.2017 (Annexure C-9).    \r\n</div><div>Till date on offer of possession made. The apartment was to be completed by 19.01.2016 but not done against which Complainant gave representation dated 23.09.2017 (Annexure C-10). The Respondent made a unilateral Deed of Settlement on 16.12.2017 (Annexure C-11) to give interest &amp; also give possession by March 2018 but since not honoured by Respondent, the Deed of Settlement became redundant. \r\n</div><div>Now on 14.08.2018 (Annexure C-12) a Statement of Account has been given wherein area increased and money charged without any increase in Apartment area.</div>','<p>The Apartment was to be handed over after completing the Project in 24 months + 6 Months i.e. from 23.07.2013 by 23.01.2016. Even the monthly compensation of Rs5/SqFt/month was to be paid from January 2016 onwards till date NOT PAID.\r\n</p><p>&nbsp;The Respondent has taken the total sale price in advance at the time of signing of Agreement to the tune of Rs. 3 Lakhs (+Service Tax) on 05.02.2013 and 3 lakhs(+Service Tax)  on 21.03.2013+ Rs 968658 (+Service Tax) on 05.02.2015 + Rs 231342 (+ Service Tax) on 31.03.2015+ 1055264/- (+ service Tax) on 16.11.2015 +Rs. 144736/- (+ service Tax) on 16.11.2015+ 559382/- lakhs (+ service Tax) on 18.06.2016 + 40618 (+ service Tax) on 14.06.2016, totaling 36 Lakhs (+ service Tax) as also EMIs with interest.\r\n</p><p>The possession of the Apartment was to be given to the Applicant / Allottee within 24 + 6 = 30 months. Inspite of elapsing of over 5 years of Agreement, no development and construction works have been completed in the Complex and the Respondent Promoter has failed in its obligation towards the Complex and Independent Residential Floor allotted to the Complainant. The Respondent Promoter is liable to pay the interest on the payment so received for the period of delay in offering possession after the completion of the development works of the project and the completion of the construction of the Independent Residential Floor. \r\n</p><p>In view of the above : \r\n</p><p>(i) The Applicant / Allottee is seeking compensation as applicable in Para 5.5 of Agreement dated 19.07.2013 from January 2016 onwards till date; \r\n</p><p>(ii) directions for completion of the development works of the project and the construction of the independent residential floor in question without any further delay and also offer the possession after the grant of Occupation Certificate of the Building and the Completion Certificate of the Wave Estate Project alongwith interest and compensation prescribed under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act 2016 as the action of the Respondents.</p>',4000000.00,3600000.00,'2016-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">The respondents be directed to complete\r\nthe development works of the project and the construction of the independent\r\nresidential floor in question without any further delay and also offer the\r\npossession after the grant of occupation certificate of the Building and the\r\nCompletion Certificate of the Wave Estate Project.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2013-07-19 00:00:00','Independent Residential Floor Bearing No. 42/FF in Sector 99','','',2,0,0,0,'RajeevAnand','2018-10-16 00:44:35.000','RajeevAnand','2018-10-16 00:44:35.000'),(204,1058,'1058',1091,'e2da2916-c5af-4a15-acce-51dcf84d70a2','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-21 21:05:41.000','Harendra Singh Negi','negi_hs@yahoo.com',9417474113,0,0,'House No. 3178 B, ','Sector 24 D',6,128,'160024','1','House No. 3178 B, ','Sector 24 D',6,128,'160024','Rajeev Anand','anandlawoffice2378@gmail.com',9417870805,1722622364,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','M/s country colonizers Pvt Ltd.','Through its MD','customercare@waveestate.in',0,0,'PO Rayon and Silk Mills','Adjoining Coca Cola Depot GT Road, Chheharta',28,39,'143105','0','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd. Wave Estate Project site office sector 85','SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','The Complainant booked an Apartment 66 FF, First Floor Sector G, Wave Floor, Sector 99 Mohali on 21.03.2013 making initial payment (Annexure C-1 Colly). Agreement dated 19.07.2013 (Annexure C-2) was executed with Respondent for saleable area 1060sqFt @ 3773.58/sqFt. As per cLause 5.2, the Project was to be developed and the Apartment was to be handed over in 24 months and by Cl. 5.5 the delay entailed Rs. 5/sqFt/month for delay. On 20.01.2014, the Complainant was made to fill another Agreement (Annexure C-3) and the Apartment of the Complainant was unilaterally changed by issuing a letter (Annexure C-4) with new number 42/FF, Wave Floor Sector 99, Mohali (Relocated Apartment). \r\n<div>The Complainant took a Loan (Annexure C-5) for the Apartment. The Complainant found that site plan has been changed of the Apartment by changing bathroom door opening in bedroom etc.. Having found the Project and the Apartment delayed, the Complainant gave a representation 11.01.2017 (Annexure C-6) that construction started with 2 years delay and not completed. The complainant gave another representation dated 05.08.2017 (Annexure C-7) that even after 4 1/2 years possession not offered. On 03.09.2017 (Annexure C-8) the Complainant wanted to meet the senior executive but no time was given for meeting for delivery of possession. The Complainant upon interest liability and EMI burden spent his life savings and repaid loan on 01.03.2017 (Annexure C-9).    \r\n</div><div>Till date on offer of possession made. The apartment was to be completed by 19.01.2016 but not done against which Complainant gave representation dated 23.09.2017 (Annexure C-10). The Respondent made a unilateral Deed of Settlement on 16.12.2017 (Annexure C-11) to give interest &amp; also give possession by March 2018 but since not honoured by Respondent, the Deed of Settlement became redundant. \r\n</div><div>Now on 14.08.2018 (Annexure C-12) a Statement of Account has been given wherein area increased and money charged without any increase in Apartment area.</div>','<p>The Apartment was to be handed over after completing the Project in 24 months + 6 Months i.e. from 23.07.2013 by 23.01.2016. Even the monthly compensation of Rs5/SqFt/month was to be paid from January 2016 onwards till date NOT PAID.\r\n</p><p>&nbsp;The Respondent has taken the total sale price in advance at the time of signing of Agreement to the tune of Rs. 3 Lakhs (+Service Tax) on 05.02.2013 and 3 lakhs(+Service Tax)  on 21.03.2013+ Rs 968658 (+Service Tax) on 05.02.2015 + Rs 231342 (+ Service Tax) on 31.03.2015+ 1055264/- (+ service Tax) on 16.11.2015 +Rs. 144736/- (+ service Tax) on 16.11.2015+ 559382/- lakhs (+ service Tax) on 18.06.2016 + 40618 (+ service Tax) on 14.06.2016, totaling 36 Lakhs (+ service Tax) as also EMIs with interest.\r\n</p><p>The possession of the Apartment was to be given to the Applicant / Allottee within 24 + 6 = 30 months. Inspite of elapsing of over 5 years of Agreement, no development and construction works have been completed in the Complex and the Respondent Promoter has failed in its obligation towards the Complex and Independent Residential Floor allotted to the Complainant. The Respondent Promoter is liable to pay the interest on the payment so received for the period of delay in offering possession after the completion of the development works of the project and the completion of the construction of the Independent Residential Floor. \r\n</p><p>In view of the above : \r\n</p><p>(i) The Applicant / Allottee is seeking compensation as applicable in Para 5.5 of Agreement dated 19.07.2013 from January 2016 onwards till date; \r\n</p><p>(ii) directions for completion of the development works of the project and the construction of the independent residential floor in question without any further delay and also offer the possession after the grant of Occupation Certificate of the Building and the Completion Certificate of the Wave Estate Project alongwith interest and compensation prescribed under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act 2016 as the action of the Respondents.</p>',4000000.00,3600000.00,'2016-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">The respondents be directed to complete\r\nthe development works of the project and the construction of the independent\r\nresidential floor in question without any further delay and also offer the\r\npossession after the grant of occupation certificate of the Building and the\r\nCompletion Certificate of the Wave Estate Project.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2013-07-19 00:00:00','Independent Residential Floor Bearing No. 42/FF in Sector 99','','',2,0,0,0,'RajeevAnand','2018-10-16 00:45:42.000','RajeevAnand','2018-10-16 00:45:42.000'),(205,1092,'1092',1156,'fe9d0b35-d692-47a7-ad8a-e66a989164d1','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Jai Bhushan Chandan','jb.chandan@yahoo.com',8360074813,0,0,'23-B','Moti nagar',28,366,'141010','1','23-B','Moti nagar',28,366,'141010','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','Casa Espana','ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd','email@atsgreens.com',0,0,' ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.',' 711/92, Deepali, Nehru Place',10,429,'110019','1',' ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.',' 711/92, Deepali, Nehru Place',10,429,'110019','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>abc</p>',9600000.00,9200000.00,'2018-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','2018-02-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat No. 10171, Tower 10','','',2,0,0,0,'JBchandan','2018-10-16 15:30:08.000','JBchandan','2018-10-16 15:30:08.000'),(206,1092,'1092',1156,'fe9d0b35-d692-47a7-ad8a-e66a989164d1','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'