reement, no development and construction works\r\nhave been completed in the Complex and the Respondent Promoter has failed in\r\nits obligation towards the Complex and Independent Residential Floor allotted\r\nto the Complainant. The Respondent Promoter is liable to pay the interest on\r\nthe payment so received for the period of delay in offering possession after\r\nthe completion of the development works of the project and the completion of\r\nthe construction of the Independent Residential Floor.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">In view of the above : <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">(i) The Applicant / Allottee is seeking\r\ncompensation as applicable in Para 5.5 of Agreement dated 19.07.2013 from\r\nJanuary 2016 onwards till date; <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">(ii) directions for completion of the\r\ndevelopment works of the project and the construction of the independent\r\nresidential floor in question without any further delay and also offer the\r\npossession after the grant of Occupation Certificate of the Building and the\r\nCompletion Certificate of the Wave Estate Project alongwith interest and\r\ncompensation prescribed under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act 2016\r\nas the action of the Respondents.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',4000000.00,3600000.00,'2016-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">The respondents be directed to complete\r\nthe development works of the project and the construction of the independent\r\nresidential floor in question without any further delay and also offer the\r\npossession after the grant of occupation certificate of the Building and the\r\nCompletion Certificate of the Wave Estate Project.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2013-07-19 00:00:00','Independent Residential Floor Bearing No. 42/FF in Sector 99','','',2,0,0,0,'RajeevAnand','2018-10-18 13:49:48.000','RajeevAnand','2018-10-18 13:49:48.000'),(209,1059,'1059',1091,'e2da2916-c5af-4a15-acce-51dcf84d70a2','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-18 15:14:26.000','Narinder Kumar Thakur','nktkangra@yahoo.co.in',9417493259,1722622364,0,'House no. 155-A','Sector 42-A',6,128,'160042','1','House No. 2378, Sector 35-C,','',6,128,'160035','Rajeev Anand','anandlawoffice2378@gmail.com',9417870805,1722622364,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','M/s Country colonizers Pvt Ltd','Through its MD','customercare@waveestate.in',0,0,'PO Rayon and Silk Mills','Adjoining Coca Cola Depot GT Road, Chheharta',28,39,'143105','0','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd. Wave Estate Project site office sector 85','SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The Complainant booked an Unit No 67 FF, First\r\nFloor Sector G, Wave Floor, Sector 99 Mohali on 21.03.2013. (Annexure C-1).\r\nAgreement dated 11.07.2013 (Annexure C-2) was executed with Respondent for\r\nsaleable area 1060sqFt @ 3773.5849/sqFt. As per Clause 5.2, the Project was to\r\nbe developed and the Apartment was to be handed over in 24 months and by Cl.\r\n5.5 the delay entailed Rs. 5/sqFt/month for delay. On 20.01.2015, the\r\nComplainant was made to fill another Agreement (Annexure C-3) and the Apartment\r\nof the Complainant was unilaterally changed by issuing a letter with new number\r\n44/FF, Wave Floor Sector 99, Mohali (Relocated Apartment). </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The Complainant took a Loan of 32 lakhs (Annexure C-4) for said\r\nApartment. It was found that site plan of the Apartment is changed by changing\r\nbathroom door opening in bedroom etc. Having found the Project and the\r\nApartment delayed, the Complainant gave a representation 11.01.2017 (Annexure\r\nC-5) that construction started with 2 years delay and not completed. The\r\ncomplainant gave two representations dated May 2017 (Annexure C-6) &amp;\r\n05.08.2017 <span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">(Annexure C-7)</span> that even after\r\n4 1/2 years possession not offered. On 03.09.2017 (Annexure C-8) the\r\nComplainant wanted to meet the senior but no time was given for meeting for\r\ndelivery of possession. The Complainant upon interest liability and EMI burden\r\nspent his life savings and repaid loan on 27.03.2017 (Annexure C-9).&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The Apartment is totally incomplete &amp; no possession is given.\r\nThe apartment was to be completed by 11.01.2016 but not done against which\r\nComplainant gave representation dated 23.09.2017 (Annexure C-10). The\r\nRespondent made a unilateral Deed of Settlement on 05.11.2017 (Annexure C-11)\r\nto give interest &amp; also give possession by March 2018 but since not\r\nhonoured by Respondent, the Deed of Settlement became redundant. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Now on 18.08.2018 (Annexure\r\nC-12) a Statement of Account has been given wherein area increased and money\r\ncharged without any increase in Apartment area.</span>','<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The\r\nApartment was to be handed over after completing the Project in 24 months + 6\r\nMonths i.e. from 11.07.2013 by 11.01.2016. Even the monthly compensation of\r\nRs5/SqFt/month was to be paid from January 2016 onwards till date NOT PAID.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The\r\nRespondent&nbsp;has taken the total sale price in advance at the time of signing\r\nof Agreement to the tune of Rs. 3 Lakhs (+Service Tax) on 05.02.2013 and 3\r\nlakhs (+Service Tax) &nbsp;on 21.03.2013+ Rs 968658\r\n(+Service Tax) on 13.02.2015 + Rs 231342 (+ Service Tax) on 31.03.2015+ 1057177\r\n(+ service Tax) on 16.11.2015 +Rs. 142823 (+ service Tax)on 16.11.2015+ 6 lakhs\r\n(+ service Tax)on 22.04.2017 totaling 36 Lakhs (+ service Tax), totaling 36\r\nLakhs (+ service Tax) as also EMIs with interest.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The possession of the Apartment was to be given to the\r\nApplicant / Allottee within 24 + 6 = 30 months. Inspite of elapsing of over 5\r\nyears of Agreement, no development and construction works have been completed\r\nin the Complex and the Respondent Promoter has failed in its obligation towards\r\nthe Complex and Independent Residential Floor allotted to the Applicant. The\r\nPromoter is liable to pay the interest on the payment so received for the\r\nperiod of delay in offering possession after the completion of the development\r\nworks of the project and the completion of the construction of the Independent\r\nResidential Floor. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">In\r\nview of the above : <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">(i)\r\nThe Applicant / Allottee is seeking compensation as applicable in Para 5.5 of\r\nAgreement dated 11.07.2013 from January 2016 onwards till date; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">(ii) directions for completion of the development works of the project\r\nand the construction of the independent residential floor in question without\r\nany further delay and also offer the possession after the grant of Occupation\r\nCertificate of the Building and the Completion Certificate of the Wave Estate\r\nProject alongwith interest and compensation prescribed under Real Estate\r\n(Regulation and Development) Act 2016 as the action of the Respondents.</span><br></p>',4000000.00,3600000.00,'2016-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">The respondents be directed to complete the\r\ndevelopment works of the project and the construction of the independent residential\r\nfloor in question without any further delay and also offer the possession after\r\nthe grant of occupation certificate of the Building and the Completion\r\nCertificate of the Wave Estate Project</span><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2013-07-11 00:00:00','Independent Residential Floor Bearing No. 44/FF in Sector 99','','',2,0,0,0,'RajeevAnand','2018-10-18 15:06:05.000','RajeevAnand','2018-10-18 15:06:05.000'),(210,1060,'1060',1091,'e2da2916-c5af-4a15-acce-51dcf84d70a2','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-18 18:42:05.000','Manjeet Singh and Anita Negi','metaphysics1127@gmail.com',7018869262,1722622364,0,'Village machkehar, PO Ahju, Tehsil joginder nagar','District Mandi Himachal Pradesh',14,382,'175032','1','Village machkehar, PO Ahju, Tehsil joginder nagar','District Mandi Himachal Pradesh',14,382,'175032','Rajeev Anand','anandlawoffice2378@gmail.com',9417870805,1722622364,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd','Through its MD','customercare@waveestate.in',0,0,'PO Rayon and Silk Mills','Adjoining Coca Cola Depot GT Road, Chheharta',28,39,'143105','0','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd. Wave Estate Project site office sector 85','SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The Complainant booked Unit No 28 SF, Second\r\nFloor Sector G, Wave Floor, Sector 99 Mohali having saleable area 1060spft on 17.08.2013\r\nmaking initial payment (Annexure C-1). Tripartite Agreement dated 03.09.2013\r\n(Annexure C-2) was executed with Respondent for approval of Home Loan for Rs.\r\n32,00,000. On 03.09.2013 (Annexure C-3) Agreement was executed where Clause 5.2\r\nstated that the Apartment was to be handed over in 24 months and by Cl. 5.5 the\r\ndelay entailed Rs. 5/sqFt/month for delay. On 08.12.2014, the Complainant was\r\nmade to fill another Agreement (Annexure C-4). </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The Complainant took a Loan (Annexure C-5) for the Apartment. The\r\nComplainant found that site plan has been changed of the Apartment by changing\r\nbathroom door opening in bedroom etc. Having found the Project and the\r\nApartment delayed, the Complainant gave a Email-representation 28.06.2017\r\n(Annexure C-6) that construction started with 2 years delay and not completed.\r\nThe complainant gave reminder E-mail dated 11.12.2017 (Annexure C-7) that even\r\nafter 4 1/2 years possession not offered. On 08.01.2018 (Annexure C-8) the\r\nComplainant and respondent to agreed to bear pre-EMI interest obligation till\r\nthe offer of possession and to deliver the possession by March 2018. The possession\r\nletter dated 27.06.2018 (Annexure C-9) was issued but after delay of two years\r\nthree months approx from 02.03.2016. The respondents also increased the area\r\nand sent notice 27.06.2018 (Annexure C-10) to complainant asking to pay\r\nadditional amount Rs. 98113.05+5886.78 as CGST against the increased area. On\r\n24.07.2018 (Annexure C-11) request through mail is made for settlement for last\r\nfull payment but no correspondence is received till date <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The Apartment is incomplete.\r\nThe apartment was to be completed by 03.03.2016 but not done against which\r\nComplainant gave representation dated 23.09.2017 (Annexure C-11).&nbsp;</span><br></p>','<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The\r\nApartment was to be handed over after completing the Project in 24 months + 6\r\nMonths i.e. from 03.09.2013 by 03.03.2016. Even the monthly compensation of\r\nRs5/SqFt/month was to be paid from March 2016 onwards till date NOT PAID.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The\r\nRespondent&nbsp;has taken the total sale price in advance at the time of signing\r\nof Agreement to the tune of Rs. 6 Lakhs on 17.08.2013 + Rs 18,540 (Service Tax)\r\non 31.08.2014, Rs 12,00000 on 24.01.2015 + &nbsp;Rs 37,080 (Service Tax)on 28.01. 2015, Rs\r\n99,4923 + Rs 2,05077 on 10.04.2014 + 42,000 (service tax for both the amount)\r\ndt29.06.2016 and 6 lakhs on 08.02.2017 + 27,000 (service tax) dt 11.01.2017,\r\ntotaling 36 Lakhs + 1,24,620service taxas also EMIs with interest.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The possession of the Apartment was to be given to the\r\nApplicant / Allottee within 24 + 6 = 30 months. Inspite of elapsing of over 5\r\nyears of Agreement, no development and construction works have been completed\r\nin the Complex and the Respondent Promoter has failed in its obligation towards\r\nthe Complex and Independent Residential Floor allotted to the Applicant. The\r\nPromoter is liable to pay the interest on the payment so received for the\r\nperiod of delay in offering possession after the completion of the development\r\nworks of the project and the completion of the construction of the Independent\r\nResidential Floor. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">In\r\nview of the above : <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">(i)\r\nThe Applicant / Allottee is seeking compensation as applicable in Para 5.5 of\r\nAgreement dated 03.09.2013 from March 2016 onwards till date; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">(ii)\r\ndirections for completion of the development works of the project and the\r\nconstruction of the independent residential floor in question without any\r\nfurther delay and also offer the possession after the grant of Occupation\r\nCertificate of the Building and the Completion Certificate of the Wave Estate\r\nProject alongwith interest and compensation prescribed under Real Estate\r\n(Regulation and Development) Act 2016 as the action of the Respondents.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',4000000.00,3600000.00,'2016-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The\r\nrespondents be directed to complete the development works of the project and\r\nthe construction of the independent residential floor in question without any\r\nfurther delay and also offer the possession after the grant of occupation\r\ncertificate of the Building and the Completion Certificate of the Wave Estate\r\nProject.</span><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2013-09-03 00:00:00','“Independent Residential Floors” Bearing No. 28 on 2nd Floor in Sector ‘G’','','',2,0,0,0,'RajeevAnand','2018-10-18 18:32:04.000','RajeevAnand','2018-10-18 18:32:04.000'),(211,1093,'1093',1135,'7ce4ff29-c893-46aa-aac9-b9c5d5926814','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Gursharan Singh','akhilesh@vyaslawassociates.com',9855004557,0,0,'house No. 4475, Ranjitpura PO Khalsa College, Amritsar ','',28,39,'143001','1','house No. 4475, Ranjitpura PO Khalsa College, Amritsar ','',28,39,'143001','akhilesh vyas','akhilesh@vyaslawassociates.com',9855004557,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASR02-PR0169','Guru Ram Dass Urban Estate','Punjab Urban Planning Development Authority','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA Bhawan','green avenue',28,39,'143001','1','PUDA Bhawan','green avenue',28,39,'143001','1','<p><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">That the complainant was\r\nallotted residential plot by Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority\r\n(hereinafter called as “PUDA”) bearing residential plot No. 345 measuring 300\r\nSq. Yards at Guru Ram Dass Urban Estate Airport Road, Amritsar. The total price\r\nof the residential plot of Rs. 54.00 lacs only @ Rs. 18000/- per Sq. Yard. As\r\nper the payment schedule given in the allotment letter 25% of the allotment\r\namount was to be paid initially and rest of the payment was to be paid after\r\nthe possession. The brochure of the scheme clearly reflects that possession on\r\n25% payment as per the allotment letter it admitted by the respondent that\r\npayment of Rs. 1350000/-was made by the complainant and it has already been\r\nadjusted towards initial 25% of the sale price of residential plot as mentioned\r\nin clause No. 3.1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 16.75pt;\">For the balance payment of 75%, the complainant is always ready\r\nand willing to pay the amount as per schedule.&nbsp;</span><br></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.35pt;margin-left:\r\n0in;line-height:16.75pt\">\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8.35pt; line-height: 16.75pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\">That no possession has been handed over up till now. there is no\r\ndevelopment at the site at all. Various letters has been forwarded to the\r\nEstate Officer PUDA Amritsar and RTI applications have been filed to their\r\nofficers but nothing has resulted fruitful. The possession was scheduled to be\r\ngiven within 90 days after making payment of 25% but nothing has been done in\r\nthis regard. The complainant has approached earlier Hon\'ble Punjab and Haryana\r\nHigh court vide which their representation was decided and she withdrew the\r\nearlier petition for seeking relief under this act.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n7.5pt;margin-left:.75in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.5in;line-height:21.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">i)</span><span style=\"font-size: 7pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"apple-converted-space\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">That as the department has not adhered to their discipline of\r\ndelivering the actual possession of the property as per the contract,\r\ntherefore, the applicant shall not be liable to pay any interest and penal\r\ninterest on the future payments to be made to the respondents and further\r\npayment of Principal amount shall be deferred till the respondents hands over\r\nthe actual physical possession.</span><u1:p></u1:p></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: 21pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">ii)</span><span style=\"font-size: 7pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"apple-converted-space\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">That the applicant is not liable to pay any amount by way of penal\r\ninterest if any charged by the respondent department. They are liable to get\r\nthe refund of any penal interest charged up till now as the delay any occurred\r\nis because of the conduct and acts of the respondent department. &nbsp;The\r\ninterest already paid shall be refunded&nbsp; or interest amount which is\r\nalready&nbsp; been charged by the respondents shall stands adjusted in the\r\nfuture payments as the delay has occurred due to lapse on the part of the\r\nrespondents.</span><u1:p></u1:p></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: 21pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">iii)</span><span style=\"font-size: 7pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"apple-converted-space\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">That the applicant is liable to be sufficient compensation as per\r\nthe statue as they have been denied their physical possession up till now\r\nwithout any explanatory reason by the department. They have not been handed\r\nover the possession of their allotted plots rather the applicant has made the\r\npayment as per the schedule to the respondent department.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><u1:p></u1:p></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt 0.75in; text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: 21pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">iv)</span><span style=\"font-size: 7pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"apple-converted-space\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\">That as stated above the extension was sought by the&nbsp;\r\ncomplainant for 180 days and during that period interest was charged by the\r\nrespondents. The respondents shall be directed to refund that interest &nbsp;of Rs. 96201/-or adjust that amount in the principal amount in future payments. &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',5400000.00,1350000.00,'2017-03-02 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt 22px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: 21pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">i)</span><span style=\"font-size: 7pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"apple-converted-space\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">That as the department has not adhered to their discipline of delivering the actual possession of the property as per the contract, therefore, the applicant shall not be liable to pay any interest and penal interest on the future payments to be made to the respondents and further payment of Principal amount shall be deferred till the respondents hands over the actual physical possession.</span><u1:p></u1:p></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt 22px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: 21pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">ii)</span><span style=\"font-size: 7pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"apple-converted-space\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">That the applicant is not liable to pay any amount by way of penal interest if any charged by the respondent department. They are liable to get the refund of any penal interest charged up till now as the delay any occurred is because of the conduct and acts of the respondent department. &nbsp;The interest already paid shall be refunded&nbsp; or interest amount which is already&nbsp; been charged by the respondents shall stands adjusted in the future payments as the delay has occurred due to lapse on the part of the respondents.</span><u1:p></u1:p></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt 22px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: 21pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">iii)</span><span style=\"font-size: 7pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"apple-converted-space\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">That the applicant is liable to be sufficient compensation as per the statue as they have been denied their physical possession up till now without any explanatory reason by the department. They have not been handed over the possession of their allotted plots rather the applicant has made the payment as per the schedule to the respondent department.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><u1:p></u1:p></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt 22px; text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: 21pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">iv)</span><span style=\"font-size: 7pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"apple-converted-space\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\">That as stated above the extension was sought by the&nbsp; complainant for 180 days and during that period interest was charged by the respondents. The respondents shall be directed to refund that interest &nbsp;of Rs. 96201/-or adjust that amount in the principal amount in future payments. &nbsp;</span></p>','1','','2016-12-02 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','345','','',2,0,0,0,'akhilesh','2018-10-21 16:18:35.000','akhilesh','2018-10-21 16:18:35.000'),(212,1094,'1094',1135,'7ce4ff29-c893-46aa-aac9-b9c5d5926814','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-18 15:51:19.000','Tejinder Pal Kaur','akhilesh@vyaslawassociates.com',9855004557,0,0,'81,Taylor Road, Amritsar','',28,39,'143001','1','81,Taylor Road, Amritsar','',28,39,'143001','akhilesh vyas','akhilesh@vyaslawassociates.com',9855004557,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASR02-PR0169','Guru Ram Dass Urban Estate','Punjab Urban Planning Development Authority','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA Bhawan','green avenue',28,39,'143001','1','PUDA Bhawan','green avenue',28,39,'143001','1','<p><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">i. The complainant was allotted\r\nresidential plot by Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority\r\n(hereinafter called as “PUDA”) bearing residential plot No. 497 measuring 400\r\nSq. Yards at Guru Ram Dass Urban Estate Airport Road, Amritsar. The total price\r\nof the residential plot of Rs. 72.00 lacs only @ Rs. 18000/- per Sq. Yard. As\r\nper the payment schedule given in the allotment letter 25% of the allotment\r\namount was to be paid initially and rest of the payment was to be paid after\r\nthe possession. The brochure of the scheme clearly reflects that possession on\r\n25% payment as per the allotment letter it admitted by&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">the respondent that payment of Rs. 18.00 lacs\r\nwas made by the applicant and it has already been adjusted towards initial 25%\r\nof the sale price of residential plot as mentioned in clause No. 3.1.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 16.75pt;\">For the balance payment of 75%, the complainant is always ready\r\nand willing to pay the amount as per schedule.&nbsp;</span><br></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.35pt;margin-left:\r\n0in;line-height:16.75pt\">\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8.35pt; line-height: 16.75pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\">That no possession has been handed over up till now. there is no\r\ndevelopment at the site at all. Various letters has been forwarded to the\r\nEstate Officer PUDA Amritsar and RTI applications have been filed to their\r\nofficers but nothing has resulted fruitful. The possession was scheduled to be\r\ngiven within 90 days after making payment of 25% but nothing has been done in\r\nthis regard. The complainant has approached earlier Hon\'ble Punjab and Haryana\r\nHigh court vide which their representation was decided and she withdrew the\r\nearlier petition for seeking relief under this act.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n7.5pt;margin-left:.75in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.5in;line-height:21.0pt\"><span style=\"line-hei