nant and </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">damages\r\nfor the physical and mental torture, agony, discomfort and undue hardships\r\ncaused to the complainant. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\">To pay the amount calculated at the\r\nrate Rs. 12700 per month w.e.f &nbsp;September,2015\r\nto April, 2016 towards the rent paid by the applicant along with maintenance\r\ncharges at the rate of Rs. 1500 per month for said period, and to pay amount\r\ncalculated at the rate of Rs. 13970 per month w.e.f May, 2016 to March,2017\r\ntowards the rent paid by the applicant along with maintenance charges at the\r\nrate of Rs. 2200 per month, for the period of delay in possession w.e.f.\r\nSeptember, 2015 till offer of the possession of the said apartment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\">To pay Rs. 100000 as litigation\r\nexpenses to the complainant in the interest of justice.</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',6147500.00,5550000.00,'2015-08-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<div class=\"WordSection1\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%\">It is further prayed that during the\r\npendency of instant application, the respondent be directed not to create any\r\nthird party rights over the said apartment and not to create any charge over\r\nit.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n21.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n</div><p>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><br clear=\"all\" style=\"page-break-before:always;mso-break-type:section-break\"></span></p>','1','','2015-01-28 00:00:00','2015-01-28 00:00:00','Flat No - 04032, 3rd Floor, Tower No. 4','','',1,1,0,0,'Sandeepkaurats','2018-10-31 16:50:56.000','Sandeepkaurats','2018-10-31 16:50:56.000'),(248,1085,'1085',1135,'7ce4ff29-c893-46aa-aac9-b9c5d5926814','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Gurmukh singh ','akhilesh@vyaslawassociates.com',8427828900,0,0,'Nikki Mandi, Patti, ','',28,574,'143001','1','Nikki Mandi, Patti, ','',28,574,'143001','akhilesh vyas','akhilesh@vyaslawassociates.com',9855004557,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASR02-PR0169','Guru Ram Dass Urban Estate','Punjab Urban Planning Development Authority','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA Bhawan','green avenue',28,39,'143001','1','PUDA Bhawan','green avenue',28,39,'143001','1','<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">That the complainant was allotted residential plot by respondent bearing plot No. 482 measuring 500 Sq. yards at Guru Ram Dass Urban Estate Airport Road, Amritsar. The total price of the plot is Rs. 945000/- @ 18000/- per square yard.</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 115%;\">As per the payment schedule given in the\r\nallotment letter 25% of the allotment amount was to be paid initially and rest\r\nof the payment was to be paid after the possession. The brochure of the scheme\r\nclearly reflects that possession will be handed over on 25% payment as per the allotment letter. It\r\nis admitted by the respondent that payment of Rs. 23,62,500/- was made by the complainant and thereafter entire payment has been made by complainant as per the settle sale\r\nprice of residential plot as mentioned in clause No. 3.1.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 115%;\">The complainant has paid full sale consideration amount.</span><font face=\"Bookman Old Style, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 19px;\"> As per Para 6(i) under the Possession and Ownership Heading of allotment letter possession was be to handed over within 90 days of issuance of allotment letter. So time limit for possession date is 22.1.2017. &nbsp;There is no chance of handing over the possession as no development work was even initiated, applicant made a request through application (diary no 4869 dated 6.917) to waive off interest. But this letter was never responded from respondent. To be on safer side of law applicant paid first installment (Principal and interest both) and then made the full payment. <br></span></font></p><p><font face=\"Bookman Old Style, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 19px;\"><br></span></font></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">1. The complainant is entitled for possession with all the development possible as per agreed terms and conditions.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">2. That the PUDA should refund interest which has been charged by them. </span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">3. PUDA should pay interest on amount which has been paid to it under section 18 of RERA act,2016.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">4. The complainant is entitled for compensation of Rs. 10,00,000/- on account of mental agony and litigation charges.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">5. PUDA should not change plan of site and should restore my original plot. <br><o:p></o:p></span></p>',9450000.00,9450000.00,'2017-01-22 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">1. The complainant is entitled for possession with all the development possible as per agreed terms and conditions.</span><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 