 and litigation charges.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">5. PUDA should not change plan of site and should restore my original plot. <br><o:p></o:p></span></p>',9450000.00,9450000.00,'2017-01-22 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">1. The complainant is entitled for possession with all the development possible as per agreed terms and conditions.</span><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">2. That the PUDA should refund interest which has been charged by them. </span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">3. PUDA should pay interest on amount which has been paid to it under section 18 of RERA act,2016.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">4. The complainant is entitled for compensation of Rs. 10,00,000/- on account of mental agony and litigation charges.</span></p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">5. PUDA should not change plan of site and should restore my original plot.</span>','1','','2016-10-22 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','482','','',2,0,0,0,'akhilesh','2018-10-31 17:18:32.000','akhilesh','2018-10-31 17:18:32.000'),(250,1086,'1086',1135,'7ce4ff29-c893-46aa-aac9-b9c5d5926814','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-28 18:37:21.000','Rita Kaundal','akhilesh@vyaslawassociates.com',9950693693,0,0,'House No. 89-C, Gali No. 9 Guru amardass Avenue, Ajnala Road, amritsar','',28,39,'143001','1','House No. 89-C, Gali No. 9 Guru amardass Avenue, Ajnala Road, amritsar','',28,39,'143001','akhilesh vyas','akhilesh@vyaslawassociates.com',9855004557,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASR02-PR0169','Guru Ram Dass Urban Estate','Punjab Urban Planning Development Authority','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA Bhawan','green avenue',28,39,'143001','1','PUDA Bhawan','green avenue',28,39,'143001','1','<p><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">That the complainant was\r\nallotted residential plot by Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority\r\n(hereinafter called as “PUDA”) bearing residential plot No. 152 measuring 200\r\nSq. Yards at Guru Ram Dass Urban Estate Airport Road, Amritsar. The total price\r\nof the residential plot of Rs. 36.00 lacs only @ Rs. 18000/- per Sq. Yard. As\r\nper the payment schedule given in the allotment letter 25% of the allotment\r\namount was to be paid initially and rest of the payment was to be paid after\r\nthe possession. The brochure of the scheme clearly reflects that possession on\r\n25% payment as per the allotment letter it admitted by the respondent that\r\npayment of Rs. 9.00 lacs was made by the complainant and it has already been\r\nadjusted towards initial 25% of the sale price of residential plot as mentioned\r\nin clause No. 3.1.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">That no possession has been handed over up till now. there is no development at the site at all. Various letters has been forwarded to the Estate Officer PUDA Amritsar and RTI applications have been filed to their officers but nothing has resulted fruitful. The possession was scheduled to be given within 90 days after making payment of 25% but nothing has been done in this regard. The complainant has approached earlier Hon\'ble Punjab and Haryana High court vide which their representation was decided and she withdrew the earlier petition for seeking relief under this act.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><br></span><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;\">1. That the complainant is entitled to get delivery of possession of the above said plot and the respondent is also liable to develop the entire project as per agreed terms and conditions and provide all basic amenities in the project.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That as the\r\ndepartment has not adhered to their discipline of delivering the actual\r\npossession of the property as per the contract, therefore, the applicant shall\r\nnot be liable to pay any interest and penal interest on the future payments to\r\nbe made to the respondents and further payment of Principal amount shall be\r\ndeferred till the respondents hands over the actual physical possession. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;\">3)<span style=\"font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That the\r\napplicant is not liable to pay any amount by way of penal interest if any\r\ncharged by the respondent department. They are liable to get the refund of any\r\npenal interest charged up till now as the delay any occurred is because of the\r\nconduct and acts of the respondent department. &nbsp;The interest already paid shall be\r\nrefunded&nbsp; or interest amount which is\r\nalready&nbsp; been charged by the respondents\r\nshall stands adjusted in the future payments as the delay has occurred due to\r\nlapse on the part of the respondents. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;\">4)<span style=\"font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That the\r\napplicant is liable to be sufficient compensation as per the statue as they\r\nhave been denied their physical possession up till now without any explanatory\r\nreason by the department. They have not been handed over the possession of\r\ntheir allotted plots rather the applicant has made the payment as per the\r\nschedule to the respondent department.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -0.5in; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 34px;\"><font face=\"Bookman Old Style, serif\">5) &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"line-height: 115%; text-indent: -0.5in; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif; font-size: 13pt;\">That as stated above the extension was sought by\r\nthe</span><span style=\"line-height: 115%; text-indent: -0.5in; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%; text-indent: -0.5in; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif; font-size: 13pt;\">complainant for 180 days and during\r\nthat period interest was charged by the respondents. The respondents shall be\r\ndirected to refund that interest amount or adjust that amount in the principal\r\namount in future payments</span></p>',3600000.00,900000.00,'2017-03-13 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>That the complainant is entitled for all reliefs mentioned above along with interim relief as mentioned:</p><p>That till the project is finally developed and delivered to the complainant their should be no moratorium on further payment. <br></p>','1','','2016-12-13 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','152','','',1,1,0,0,'akhilesh','2018-10-31 22:21:37.000','akhilesh','2018-10-31 22:21:37.000'),(251,1101,'1101',1180,'61e07eb0-c813-4129-a767-52572ef143fe','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Narendra  Bahadur kharya','amitshri1983@gmail.com',9910532073,0,0,'B-501, Kartik Kunj Apartments','Plot No. D-13, Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201303','1','B-501, Kartik Kunj Apartments','Plot No. D-13, Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201303','Amit Kumar Srivastav and Umesh Chauhan','amitshri1983@gmail.com',9910532073,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-XXX00-PM0000','Ludhiana City Centre','M/s Today Homes & Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd','contact@todayhomes.co.in',0,0,'Upper Ground Floor 8 to 9, Pragati Tower, Rajendra Place, New Delhi – 110008','Shop No. 24,25,26, Main Market Shaheed Bhagat Singh Nagar Pakhowal Road, Ludhiana, Punjab-141002',10,429,'110008','1','Upper Ground Floor 8 to 9, Pragati Tower, Rajendra Place, New Delhi – 110008','Shop No. 24,25,26, Main Market Shaheed Bhagat Singh Nagar Pakhowal Road, Ludhiana, Punjab-141002',10,429,'110008','1','<p>a)That the complainant is a law-abiding citizen of India and residing at the above said address and presently working in USA and residing in USA.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>b)That the complaint is being preferred by the GPA (General Power of Attorney) Mr. Surendra Kumar Kharya who is the real brother of the complainant and the complainant executed GPA in favour of his brother Mr. Surendra Bahadur Kharya on 8.04.2011 for taking any action or filing case on his behalf in the interest of his property in all over India. Copy of GPA dated 08/04/2011 is annexed herewith as Annexure-1.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>c)That the complainant approached to the Respondent in 2006 for booking of an office space in newly introduced project of the respondent as “Ludhiana City Centre” Situated at Plot No. 476, Citizen Road, Shaheed Bhagat Singh Nagar, Ludhiana, Punjab-141001,  and the respondent allotted  Unit no. 538, Super built area 1239.24 sq.ft in consideration the complainant paid booking amount of Rs. 4,00,000/- (Rupees Four Lakh Only) on 05.05.2006 vide cheque no.434680 to the respondent and submit booking form for the said booking. Copy of booking form and copy of cheque dated 05.05.2006 is annexed herewith as Annexure- 1. \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>d)That the complainant further paid Rs. 53,784/- on 02.07.2006 and Rs. 5,50,000/- on 05.07.2006 vide Cheque no.353627, dated 02.07.2006 and vide cheque No. 353781 dated 05.07.2006. Copy of cheque dated 02.07.2006 and 05.07.2006 is annexed herewith as Annexure-3 (colly).\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>e)That this booking was done at the pre launch stage and the complainant advised that the unit will be allot after getting all approval and sanction plan from the concern Authority. That it was informed by the respondent that this project is a premium project and all the approvals will come soon. \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>f)That on the good faith on the respondent and Govt. complainant kept waiting for the further update from the respondent but it was very depressing for the complainant that after making payment of a huge amount he has  not received any</p>','<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left:54.0000pt;text-indent:-36.0000pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">I.&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:\'Times New Roman\';line-height:200%;font-size:14.0000pt;\">direct the respondent to refund the entire paid amount to the complainant and consequently pay to the complainant an amount of Rs. 10,03,784/- (Rupees &nbsp;Ten Lakhs Three Thousand Seven Hundred Eighty Four Only) with interest @ 18% per annum calculated from the date of respective deposit till the date of actual realization;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:\'Times New Roman\';line-height:200%;font-size:14.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left:54.0000pt;text-indent:-36.0000pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">II.&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:\'Times New Roman\';line-height:200%;font-size:14.0000pt;\">award cost of &nbsp;litigation of Rs.1 lac in favour of the complainant and against the respondent; and </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:\'Times New Roman\';line-height:200%;font-size:14.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left:54.0000pt;text-indent:-36.0000pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">III.&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:\'Times New Roman\';line-height:200%;font-size:14.0000pt;\">pass such other and further order(s) as this Hon’ble Regulatory Authority may deem fit and proper in the facts and circumstances of the present case;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:\'Times New Roman\';line-height:200%;font-size:14.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left:54.0000pt;text-indent:-36.0000pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">I.&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:\'Times New Roman\';line-height:200%;font-size:14.0000pt;\">direct the respondent to refund the entire paid amount to the complainant and consequently pay to the complainant an amount of Rs. 10,03,784/- (Rupees &nbsp;Ten Lakhs Three Thousand Seven Hundred Eighty Four Only) with interest @ 18% per annum calculated from the date of respective deposit till the date of actual realization;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:\'Times New Roman\';line-height:200%;font-size:14.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left:54.0000pt;text-indent:-36.0000pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">II.&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:\'Times New Roman\';line-height:200%;font-size:14.0000pt;\">award cost of &nbsp;litigation of Rs.1 lac in favour of the complainant and against the respondent; and </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:\'Times New Roman\';line-height:200%;font-size:14.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left:54.0000pt;text-indent:-36.0000pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\"><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'Umesh','2018-11-03 13:32:03.000','Umesh','2018-11-03 13:32:03.000'),(252,1053,'1053',1118,'262f4ef6-f22b-4923-95e9-fda9419bf233','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-26 20:04:53.000','KAMAL KUMAR GUPTA','kamalgupta1965@hotmail.com',9811573415,0,588071755561,'1/6981','SHIVAJI PARK, SHAHDARA,',10,189,'110032','1','1/6981','SHIVAJI PARK, SHAHDARA,',10,189,'110032','KAMAL KUMAR GUPTA','kamalgupta1965@hotmail.com',9811573415,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0232','Chandigarh Colonizers Pvt.Ltd\r\n','Chandigarh Colonizers Pvt.Ltd','operahouse@gmail.com',0,0,'Chandigarh Colonizers Pvt. Ltd','SCO-36, SECTOR -3, PANCHKULA',13,15,'134109','1','Chandigarh Colonizers Pvt. Ltd','SCO-36, SECTOR -3, PANCHKULA',13,15,'134109','1','<p>SIR/MADAM, BOOK A FLAT IN OPERA GARDEN ,&nbsp;Chandigarh Colonizers Pvt. Ltd, AT NAC ZIRAKPUR DISTT MOHALI, PUNJAB. PAYMENT RECEIPT NO- 1384 DT 13.06.2006 RS.275000/- AND 0319 DT 24.09.2007 RS.325000/- DUE TO NON CONSTRUCTION THAT TIME I SUBMIT ALL ORIGINAL PAPERS AT PROMOTERS OFFICE AT&nbsp; Chandigarh Colonizers Pvt. Ltd,&nbsp;SCO-36, SECTOR -3, PANCHKULA, HARYANA ON DATED 29.08.2008</p><p>TILL TODAY THEY CAN NOT RETURN MY MONEY ALONG WITH INTEREST, AND THEY REFUSE ME AT HIS OFFICE . SEVERAL TIME I VISIT HIS OFFICE FOR RETURN MY MONEY ALONG WITH INTEREST ,&nbsp;</p><p>THIS FLAT BOOK BY MY MOTHER AND SHE GO TO HEAVEN ON DATED 09.09.2012 , I ALREADY SUBMIT HER DEATH CERTIFICATE TO HIS OFFICE AT Chandigarh Colonizers Pvt. Ltd, SCO-36, SECTOR -3, PANCHKULA, HARYANA</p><p><br></p>','<p>SIR/MADAM, I PRAY TO YOU PLEASE REFUND MY AMOUNT ALONG WITH INTEREST FROM Chandigarh Colonizers Pvt. Ltd,