h Colonizers Pvt. Ltd, SCO-36, SECTOR -3, PANCHKULA, HARYANA</p><p><br></p>','<p>SIR/MADAM, I PRAY TO YOU PLEASE REFUND MY AMOUNT ALONG WITH INTEREST FROM Chandigarh Colonizers Pvt. Ltd, , SCO-36, SECTOR -3, PANCHKULA, HARYANA</p><p>SITE ADDRESS - OPERA GARDEN ,&nbsp;Chandigarh Colonizers Pvt. Ltd, AT NAC ZIRAKPUR DISTT MOHALI, PUNJAB<br></p>',0.00,600000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>SIR/MADAM, I PRAY TO YOU PLEASE REFUND MY AMOUNT ALONG WITH INTEREST FROM Chandigarh Colonizers Pvt. Ltd, , SCO-36, SECTOR -3, PANCHKULA, HARYANA</p><p>SITE ADDRESS - OPERA GARDEN ,&nbsp;Chandigarh Colonizers Pvt. Ltd, AT NAC ZIRAKPUR DISTT MOHALI, PUNJAB</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'kamal98110','2018-11-06 13:30:02.000','kamal98110','2018-11-06 13:30:02.000'),(254,1102,'1102',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Vinay Vohra','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9814010363,0,0,'House No.413, Dalima Vihar','Rajpura',28,454,'140401','1','253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM SPRING','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-141','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-141','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p>ABC</p>','<p>ABC</p>',4500000.00,2250000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>ABC</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','NO ALLOTMENT 7 AGREEMENT YET','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2018-11-07 16:40:27.000','rerafilingformm','2018-11-07 16:40:27.000'),(255,1102,'1102',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Vinay Vohra','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9814010363,0,0,'House No.413, Dalima Vihar','Rajpura',28,454,'140401','1','253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM SPRING','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-141','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-141','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p>ABC</p>','<p>ABC</p>',4500000.00,2250000.00,'2013-04-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Complainant,on 21.4.11 booked a(C1)250 sq yards\r\nplot @RS.18000 per sq yd (excluding EDC &amp; PLC)from the respondent in Palm\r\nspring.Before booking of said plot,the respondent had assured the complainant\r\nthat development would be started very soon &amp; possession will be delivered\r\nin 2 years.Complainant paid Rs. 1350000 i.e Rs 850000 in cash on 18.4.2011\r\n&amp; Rs. 500000 on 21.4.11 by cheque. An acknowledgment (C2) was issued by\r\nrespondent in which it arbitrarily incorporated the condition of paying the\r\nIDC.When complainant resisted about the same, the respondent threatened to\r\nforfeit the money paid by complainant if such charges are not paid by\r\nhim.Insipte of repeated requests, respondent did not issue any allotment letter\r\n&amp; execute the agreement.Respondent assured to issue allotment letter &amp;\r\nexecute agreement on further payment of Rs.9 lacs i.e 20 % sale\r\nconsideration.In the hope of getting the same, the complainant paid the said\r\namount of Rs. 9 lacs on 19.7.13 i.e.Rs. 4 lacs in cash &amp; Rs. 5 lac by\r\ncheque(C3).But inspite of receiving the said amount,respondent did not issue\r\nany allotment letter &amp; execute the agreement. Complainant many times\r\nrequested the respondent to issue the allotment letter &amp; execute the\r\nagreement, but respondent did not pay any heed to his request. Instead it\r\nstarted demanding more money for issuing allotment letter &amp; executing the\r\nagreement.Respondent only issued registration no.(C4) after receiving 50% of sale consideration.Complainant visited the office of respondent many times during the\r\nyear 2015, 2016, 2017 &amp; 2018 for redressal of his grievances but to no avail.\r\nInspite of paying Rs.2250000/- i.e. 50% sale consideration, the complainant is\r\nstill empty handed.Respondent always kept the complainant in dark about the\r\napprovals &amp; development.It has failed to develop the project.It had not\r\neven applied the necessary permissions when the plot was sold to complainant.A\r\nlist of dates of approvals (C5) and some important approval as (C6&amp;C7).</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','NO ALLOTMENT & AGREEMENT YET','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2018-11-07 16:50:45.000','rerafilingformm','2018-11-07 16:50:45.000'),(256,1102,'1102',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Vinay Vohra','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9814010363,0,0,'House No.413, Dalima Vihar','Rajpura',28,454,'140401','1','253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM SPRING','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-141','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-141','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Complainant,on\r\n21.4.11 booked a(C-1)250 sq yards plot @RS.18000 per sq yd (excluding EDC &amp;\r\nPLC)from the respondent in Palm spring.Before booking of said plot,the\r\nrespondent had assured the complainant that development would be started very\r\nsoon &amp; possession will be delivered in 2 years.Complainant paid Rs. 1350000\r\ni.e Rs 850000 in cash on 18.4.2011 &amp; Rs. 500000 on 21.4.11 by cheque. An\r\nacknowledgment (C-2) was issued by respondent in which it arbitrarily\r\nincorporated the condition of paying the IDC.When complainant resisted about\r\nthe same, the respondent threatened to forfeit the money paid by complainant if\r\nsuch charges are not paid by him.Insipte of repeated requests, respondent did\r\nnot issue any allotment letter &amp; execute the agreement.Respondent assured\r\nto issue allotment letter &amp; execute agreement on further payment of Rs.9\r\nlacs i.e 20 % sale consideration.In the hope of getting the same, the\r\ncomplainant paid the said amount of Rs. 9 lacs on 19.7.13 i.e.Rs. 4 lacs in\r\ncash &amp; Rs. 5 lac by cheque(C-3).But inspite of receiving the said\r\namount,respondent did not issue any allotment letter &amp; execute the\r\nagreement. Complainant many times requested the respondent to issue the\r\nallotment letter &amp; execute the agreement, but respondent did not pay any\r\nheed to his request. Instead it started demanding more money for issuing\r\nallotment letter &amp; executing the agreement.Respondent only issued registration\r\nnumber (C-4) after receiving 50% of sale consideration.Complainant visited the\r\noffice of respondent many times during the year 2015, 2016, 2017 &amp; 2018 for\r\nredressal of his grievances but to no avail. Inspite of paying Rs.2250000/-\r\ni.e. 50% sale consideration, the complainant is still empty handed.Respondent\r\nalways kept the complainant in dark about the approvals &amp; development.It\r\nhas failed to develop the project.It had not even applied the necessary\r\npermissions when the plot was sold to complainant.A list of dates of approvals\r\n(C-5) and some important approval as (C-6&amp;C-7)</span><o:p></o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Directing\r\nthe respondent to refund the principle amount i.e.Rs. 2250000/- along with\r\ninterest as contemplated under rule 16 of The Punjab RERA Rules, 2017,as the\r\ncomplainant does not wish to have a plot in the project being developed by the\r\nrespondent, as the complainant has lost faith in the respondent due to\r\nmisrepresentation by it about the approvals &amp; stages of development during\r\nall these years ,did not issue any allotment letter &amp; execute the agreement\r\ntill date, failed to develop the project.Also the respondent has committed\r\nviolation of various provisions of PAPRA &amp; conditions of various approvals\r\ngranted to it,as it could not collect any amount till the exemption is received\r\nunder Section 44 of PAPRA which was granted on 25.1.17.The respondent collected\r\nthe money from the complainant in 2011.The approvals were granted to the\r\nrespondent on the ground that it will not sell any plot &amp; collect money\r\nfrom the general public till exemption under Section 44 of PAPRA is\r\nreceived.Also, inspite of receiving 50% of sale consideration the respondent\r\ndid not execute any agreement &amp; issue a plot number till date &amp; asking\r\nthe complainant to pay more money for getting the allotment letter &amp;\r\nexecution of agreement in violation of Section 13 of RERA<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">&nbsp;(ii)Directing the respondent to pay the\r\ncompensation of Rs.10 lacs for deficiency in services, unfair trade practices\r\n&amp; harassment caused to the complainant &amp; for using their hard earned\r\nmoney for such a long period.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">(iii)Directing\r\nthe respondent to pay litigation expenses to the tune of Rs.50000<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">(iv)To\r\ntake action against respondent under Section 61 of RERA for constant violation\r\nof provision of Section 13 of RERA as the respondent failed to issue any\r\nallotment letter &amp; execute the buyer’s agreement till date, inspite of\r\nreceiving 50% of sale consideration <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">(v)\r\nFor cancelling the extension granted to the respondent for constantly violating\r\nvarious provisions of RERA and for indulging into unfair trade practices.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',4500000.00,2250000.00,'2013-04-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ol><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The respondent be directed to provide the list\r\nof allottees to whom it has allotted/sold the 862 residential plots as per the\r\nlayout plan approved by GMADA on 6.10.2015. The respondent has been duly registered under RERA for the said approved layout plan. As pe the said approved layout plan, the respondent can sell 862 residential plots and 73 commercial plots/spaces.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The respondent be directed to provide the list\r\nof hypothecated plots ,which are hypothecated to GMADA, out of the said approved 862\r\nresidential and 73 commercial plots</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The respondent be directed to provide the list\r\nof hypothected plots already </span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">allotted</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">/sold to general public.</span></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The respondent be directed to provide the\r\ndetails of funds collected from the general public since 2010 in lieu of the said approved 862\r\nresidential plots which are part of approved layout plan and for which the respondent is duly registered under\r\nSection 3 of RERA and also, the detail where such amount has been utilized by\r\nthe respondent</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The respondent be directed to provide all the\r\nbank details where such amount has been deposited along with the statement of\r\naccounts since the year 2010</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the details in respect of number of bookings made by the respondent since the year 2010 for the said 862 residential plots</span><o:p></o:p></span></p></li></ol>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','NO ALLOTMENT & AGREEMENT YET','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2018-11-07 17:07:57.000','rerafilingformm','2018-11-07 17:07:57.000'),(257,1102,'1102',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Vinay Vohra','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9814010363,0,0,'House No.413, Dalima Vihar','Rajpura',28,454,'140401','1','253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM SPRING','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-141','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-141','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Complainant,on\r\n21.4.11 booked a(C-1)250 sq yards plot @RS.18000 per sq yd (excluding EDC &amp;\r\nPLC)from the respondent in Palm spring.Before booking of said plot,the\r\nrespondent had assured the complainant that development would be started very\r\nso