k about the approvals &amp; development.It\r\nhas failed to develop the project.It had not even applied the necessary\r\npermissions when the plot was sold to complainant.A list of dates of approvals\r\n(C-5) and some important approval as (C-6&amp;C-7)</span><o:p></o:p></p>','<ol><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Directing\r\nthe respondent to refund the principle amount i.e.Rs. 2250000/- along with\r\ninterest as contemplated under rule 16 of The Punjab RERA Rules, 2017,as the\r\ncomplainant does not wish to have a plot in the project being developed by the\r\nrespondent, as the complainant has lost faith in the respondent due to\r\nmisrepresentation by it about the approvals &amp; stages of development during\r\nall these years ,did not issue any allotment letter &amp; execute the agreement\r\ntill date, failed to develop the project.Also the respondent has committed\r\nviolation of various provisions of PAPRA &amp; conditions of various approvals\r\ngranted to it,as it could not collect any amount till the exemption is received\r\nunder Section 44 of PAPRA which was granted on 25.1.17.The respondent collected\r\nthe money from the complainant in 2011.The approvals were granted to the\r\nrespondent on the ground that it will not sell any plot &amp; collect money\r\nfrom the general public till exemption under Section 44 of PAPRA is\r\nreceived.Also, inspite of receiving 50% of sale consideration the respondent\r\ndid not execute any agreement &amp; issue a plot number till date &amp; asking\r\nthe complainant to pay more money for getting the allotment letter &amp;\r\nexecution of agreement in violation of Section 13 of RERA.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Directing the respondent to pay the\r\ncompensation of Rs.10 lacs for deficiency in services, unfair trade practices\r\n&amp; harassment caused to the complainant &amp; for using their hard earned\r\nmoney for such a long period.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Directing\r\nthe respondent to pay litigation expenses to the tune of Rs.50000.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">To\r\ntake action against respondent under Section 61 of RERA for constant violation\r\nof provision of Section 13 of RERA as the respondent failed to issue any\r\nallotment letter &amp; execute the buyer’s agreement till date, inspite of\r\nreceiving 50% of sale consideration.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">For cancelling the extension granted to the respondent for constantly violating\r\nvarious provisions of RERA and for indulging into unfair trade practices.</span></li></ol>',4500000.00,2250000.00,'2013-04-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ol><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The respondent be directed to provide the list\r\nof allottees to whom it has allotted/sold the 862 residential plots as per the\r\nlayout plan approved by GMADA on 6.10.2015. The respondent has been duly registered under RERA for the said approved layout plan. As per the said approved layout plan, the respondent can sell 862 residential plots and 73 commercial plots/spaces.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The respondent be directed to provide the list\r\nof hypothecated plots ,which are hypothecated to GMADA, out of the said approved 862\r\nresidential and 73 commercial plots</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The respondent be directed to provide the list\r\nof hypothected plots already </span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">allotted</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">/sold to general public.</span></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The respondent be directed to provide the\r\ndetails of funds collected from the general public since 2010 in lieu of the said approved 862\r\nresidential plots which are part of approved layout plan and for which the respondent is duly registered under\r\nSection 3 of RERA and also, the detail where such amount has been utilized by\r\nthe respondent</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The respondent be directed to provide all the\r\nbank details where such amount has been deposited along with the statement of\r\naccounts since the year 2010</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the details in respect of number of bookings made by the respondent since the year 2010 for the said 862 residential plots</span><o:p></o:p></span></p></li></ol>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','NO ALLOTMENT & AGREEMENT YET','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2018-11-08 18:40:11.000','rerafilingformm','2018-11-08 18:40:11.000'),(260,1059,'1059',1091,'e2da2916-c5af-4a15-acce-51dcf84d70a2','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-18 15:14:26.000','Narinder Kumar Thakur','nktkangra@yahoo.co.in',9417493259,1722622364,0,'House no. 155-A','Sector 42-A',6,128,'160042','1','House No. 2378, Sector 35-C,','',6,128,'160035','Rajeev Anand','anandlawoffice2378@gmail.com',9417870805,1722622364,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','Wave Estate Project','M/s Country colonizers Pvt Ltd Through its MD','customercare@waveestate.in',0,0,'PO Rayon and Silk Mills','Adjoining Coca Cola Depot GT Road, Chheharta',28,39,'143105','0','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd. Wave Estate Project site office sector 85','SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The Complainant booked an Unit No 67 FF, First\r\nFloor Sector G, Wave Floor, Sector 99 Mohali on 21.03.2013. (Annexure C-1).\r\nAgreement dated 11.07.2013 (Annexure C-2) was executed with Respondent for\r\nsaleable area 1060sqFt @ 3773.5849/sqFt. As per Clause 5.2, the Project was to\r\nbe developed and the Apartment was to be handed over in 24 months and by Cl.\r\n5.5 the delay entailed Rs. 5/sqFt/month for delay. On 20.01.2015, the\r\nComplainant was made to fill another Agreement (Annexure C-3) and the Apartment\r\nof the Complainant was unilaterally changed by issuing a letter with new number\r\n44/FF, Wave Floor Sector 99, Mohali (Relocated Apartment). </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The Complainant took a Loan of 32 lakhs (Annexure C-4) for said\r\nApartment. It was found that site plan of the Apartment is changed by changing\r\nbathroom door opening in bedroom etc. Having found the Project and the\r\nApartment delayed, the Complainant gave a representation 11.01.2017 (Annexure\r\nC-5) that construction started with 2 years delay and not completed. The\r\ncomplainant gave two representations dated May 2017 (Annexure C-6) &amp;\r\n05.08.2017 <span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">(Annexure C-7)</span> that even after\r\n4 1/2 years possession not offered. On 03.09.2017 (Annexure C-8) the\r\nComplainant wanted to meet the senior but no time was given for meeting for\r\ndelivery of possession. The Complainant upon interest liability and EMI burden\r\nspent his life savings and repaid loan on 27.03.2017 (Annexure C-9).&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The Apartment is totally incomplete &amp; no possession is given.\r\nThe apartment was to be completed by 11.01.2016 but not done against which\r\nComplainant gave representation dated 23.09.2017 (Annexure C-10). The\r\nRespondent made a unilateral Deed of Settlement on 05.11.2017 (Annexure C-11)\r\nto give interest &amp; also give possession by March 2018 but since not\r\nhonoured by Respondent, the Deed of Settlement became redundant. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Now on 18.08.2018 (Annexure\r\nC-12) a Statement of Account has been given wherein area increased and money\r\ncharged without any increase in Apartment area.</span>','<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The\r\nApartment was to be handed over after completing the Project in 24 months + 6\r\nMonths i.e. from 11.07.2013 by 11.01.2016. Even the monthly compensation of\r\nRs5/SqFt/month was to be paid from January 2016 onwards till date NOT PAID.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The\r\nRespondent&nbsp;has taken the total sale price in advance at the time of signing\r\nof Agreement to the tune of Rs. 3 Lakhs (+Service Tax) on 05.02.2013 and 3\r\nlakhs (+Service Tax) &nbsp;on 21.03.2013+ Rs 968658\r\n(+Service Tax) on 13.02.2015 + Rs 231342 (+ Service Tax) on 31.03.2015+ 1057177\r\n(+ service Tax) on 16.11.2015 +Rs. 142823 (+ service Tax)on 16.11.2015+ 6 lakhs\r\n(+ service Tax)on 22.04.2017 totaling 36 Lakhs (+ service Tax), totaling 36\r\nLakhs (+ service Tax) as also EMIs with interest.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The possession of the Apartment was to be given to the\r\nApplicant / Allottee within 24 + 6 = 30 months. Inspite of elapsing of over 5\r\nyears of Agreement, no development and construction works have been completed\r\nin the Complex and the Respondent Promoter has failed in its obligation towards\r\nthe Complex and Independent Residential Floor allotted to the Applicant. The\r\nPromoter is liable to pay the interest on the payment so received for the\r\nperiod of delay in offering possession after the completion of the development\r\nworks of the project and the completion of the construction of the Independent\r\nResidential Floor. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">In\r\nview of the above : <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">(i)\r\nThe Applicant / Allottee is seeking compensation as applicable in Para 5.5 of\r\nAgreement dated 11.07.2013 from January 2016 onwards till date; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">(ii) directions for completion of the development works of the project\r\nand the construction of the independent residential floor in question without\r\nany further delay and also offer the possession after the grant of Occupation\r\nCertificate of the Building and the Completion Certificate of the Wave Estate\r\nProject alongwith interest and compensation prescribed under Real Estate\r\n(Regulation and Development) Act 2016 as the action of the Respondents.</span><br></p>',4000000.00,3600000.00,'2016-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">The respondents be directed to complete the\r\ndevelopment works of the project and the construction of the independent residential\r\nfloor in question without any further delay and also offer the possession after\r\nthe grant of occupation certificate of the Building and the Completion\r\nCertificate of the Wave Estate Project</span><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2013-07-11 00:00:00','Independent Residential Floor Bearing No. 44/FF in Sector 99','','',2,0,0,0,'RajeevAnand','2018-11-09 15:31:16.000','RajeevAnand','2018-11-09 15:31:16.000'),(261,1059,'1059',1091,'e2da2916-c5af-4a15-acce-51dcf84d70a2','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-18 15:14:26.000','Narinder Kumar Thakur','nktkangra@yahoo.co.in',9417493259,1722622364,0,'House no. 155-A','Sector 42-A',6,128,'160042','1','House No. 2378, Sector 35-C,','',6,128,'160035','Rajeev Anand','anandlawoffice2378@gmail.com',9417870805,1722622364,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','Wave Estate Project','M/s Country colonizers Pvt Ltd Through its MD','customercare@waveestate.in',0,0,'PO Rayon and Silk Mills','Adjoining Coca Cola Depot GT Road, Chheharta',28,39,'143105','0','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd. Wave Estate Project site office sector 85','SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The Complainant booked an Unit No 67 FF, First\r\nFloor Sector G, Wave Floor, Sector 99 Mohali on 21.03.2013. (Annexure C-1).\r\nAgreement dated 11.07.2013 (Annexure C-2) was executed with Respondent for\r\nsaleable area 1060sqFt @ 3773.5849/sqFt. As per Clause 5.2, the Project was to\r\nbe developed and the Apartment was to be handed over in 24 months and by Cl.\r\n5.5 the delay entailed Rs. 5/sqFt/month for delay. On 20.01.2015, the\r\nComplainant was made to fill another Agreement (Annexure C-3) and the Apartment\r\nof the Complainant was unilaterally changed by issuing a letter with new number\r\n44/FF, Wave Floor Sector 99, Mohali (Relocated Apartment). </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The Complainant took a Loan of 32 lakhs (Annexure C-4) for said\r\nApartment. It was found that site plan of the Apartment is changed by changing\r\nbathroom door opening in bedroom etc. Having found the Project and the\r\nApartment delayed, the Complainant gave a representation 11.01.2017 (Annexure\r\nC-5) that construction started with 2 years delay and not completed. The\r\ncomplainant gave two representations dated May 2017 (Annexure C-6) &amp;\r\n05.08.2017 <span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">(Annexure C-7)</span> that even after\r\n4 1/2 years possession not offered. On 03.09.2017 (Annexure C-8) the\r\nComplainant wanted to meet the senior but no time was given for meeting for\r\ndelivery of possession. The Complainant upon interest liability and EMI burden\r\nspent his life savings and repaid loan on 27.03.2017 (Annexure C-9).&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The Apartment is totally incomplete &amp; no possession is given.\r\nThe apartment was to be completed by 11.01.2016 but not done against which\r\nComplainant gave representation dated 23.09.2017 (Annexure C-10). The\r\nRespondent made a unilateral Deed of Settlement on 05.11.2017 (Annexure C-11)\r\nto give interest &amp; also give possession by March 2018 but since not\r\nhonoured by Respondent, the Deed of Settlement became redundant. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Now on 18.08.2018 (Annexure\r\nC-12) a Statement of Account has been given wherein area increased and money\r\ncharged without any increase in Apartment area.</span>','<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The\r\nApartment was to be handed over after completing the Project in 24 months + 6\r\nMonths i.e. from 11.07.2013 by 11.01.2016. Even the monthly compensation of\r\nRs5/SqFt/month was to be paid from January 2016 onwards till date NOT PAID.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The\r\nRespondent&nbsp;has taken the total sale price in advance at the time of signing\r\nof Agreement to the tune of Rs. 3 Lakhs (+Service Tax) on 05.02.2013 and 3\r\nlakhs (+Service Tax) &nbsp;on 21.03.2013+ Rs 968658\r\n(+Service Tax) on 13.02.2015 + Rs 231342 (+ Service Tax) on 31.03.2015+ 1057177\r\n(+ service Tax) on 16.11.2015 +Rs. 142823 (+ service Tax)on 16.11.2015+ 6 lakhs\r\n(+ service Tax)on 22.04.2017 totaling 36 Lakhs (+ service Tax), totaling 36\r\nLakhs (+ service Tax) as also EMIs with interest.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The possession of the Apartment was to be given to the\r\nApplicant / Allottee within 24 + 6 = 30 months. Inspite of elapsing of over 5\r\nyears of Agreement, no development and construction works have been completed\r\nin the Complex and the Respondent Promoter has failed in its obligation towards\r\nthe Complex and Independent Residential Floor allotted to the Applicant. The\r\nPromoter is liable to pay the interest on the payment so received for the\r\nperiod of delay in offering possession after the completion of the development\r\nworks of the project and the completion of the construction of the Independent\r\nResidential Floor. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">In\r\nview of the above : <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">(i)\r\nThe Applicant / Allottee is seeking compensation as applicable in Para 5.5 of\r\nAgreement dated 11.07.2013 from January 2016 onwards till date; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">(ii) directions for completion of the development works of the project\r\nand the construction of the independent residential floor in question without\r\nany further delay and also offer the possession after the grant of Occupation\r\nCertificate of the Building and the Completion Certificate of the Wave Estate\r\nProject alongwith interest and compensation prescribed under Real Estate\r\n(Regulation and Development) Act 2016 as the action of the Respondents.</span><br></p>',4000000.00,3600000.00,'2016-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">The respondents be directed to complete the\r\ndevelopment works of the project and the construction of the independent residential\r\nfloor in question without any further delay and also offer the possession after\r\nthe grant of occupation certificate of the Building and the Completion\r\nCertificate of the Wave Estate Project</span><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2013-07-11 00:00:00','Independent Residential Floor Bearing No. 44/FF in Sector 99','','',2,0,0,0,'RajeevAnand','2018-11-09 15:31:33.000','RajeevAnand','2018-11-09 15:31:33.000'),(262,1103,'1103',1197,'48449df7-379b-405e-98c2-f285f525d12f','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Jasbir Singh','csvedparkash@gmail.com',9814700360,0,0,'Churchview, 1St. Peters Close','Burnham SLI 7HS, United Kingdom',28,507,'160059','1','H. NO. 360','Phase-4, SAS Nagar',28,507,'160059','Manjit Singh','',9814700360,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','The Views at Mohali Hills','EMAAR MGF Land Limited','enquiries@emaarmgf.com',1723314801,0,'EMAAR MGF Land Private Limited','1st Floor, SCO No. 120-122, Sector-17C, Chandigarh',6,128,'160017','1','EMAAR MGF Land Private Limited','1st Floor, SCO No. 120-122, Sector-17C, Chandigarh',6,128,'160017','1','<p>aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa</p>','<p>vvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvv</p>',5701543.00,0.00,'2010-10-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb</p>','1','','2007-10-05 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Unit No.TVM-L3-F11-1103 Tower No.F,The Views at Mohali Hills, Sector-105, SAS Nagar Mohali (Pb)','','',2,0,0,0,'jasbirsinghc','2018-11-09 15:45:34.000','jasbirsinghc','2018-11-09 15:45:34.000'),(263,1103,'1103',1197,'48449df7-379b-405e-98c2-f285f525d12f','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Jasbir Singh','csvedparkash@gmail.com',9814700360,0,0,'Churchview, 1St. Peters Close','Burnham SLI 7HS, United Kingdom',28,507,'160059','1','H. NO. 360','Phase-4, SAS Nagar',28,507,'160059','Manjit Singh','',9814700360,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','The Views at Mohali Hills','EMAAR MGF Land Limited','enquiries@emaarmgf.com',1723314801,0,'EMAAR MGF Land Private Limited','1st Floor, SCO No. 120-122, Sector-17C, Chandigarh',6,128,'160017','1','EMAAR MGF Land Private Limited','1st Floor, SCO No. 120-122, Sector-17C, Chandigarh',6,128,'160017','1','<ul><li><li>That the Applicants are the residents of U.K. and are British subjects and desirous and looking forward to buy a residential house for themselves.&nbsp; The Applicants came across a brochure issued by the Respondent that they have been granted the approvals and exemptions to construct a Group Housing Complex and has planned for constructing the same the Colony, known as the ‘Mohali Hills’, to be constructed on the land consisting of high-end Apartments and Pent Houses, Car parking spaces, recreational facilities etc.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>That the Applicants being allured with the information about the approvals and legal rights of the Respondent, known as Company, moved an Application on 13.07.2007 for registration/ provisional allotment of a residential apartment in the Group Housing Complex and the Applicants deposited Rs.1,62,080/- for booking deposit of the area of 1,750 sq. feet under Order No. 601685 with the Customer Code No. TVM/454 and issued a provisional Allotment of Unit No./ Apartment No. L-3/1103 with total consideration of Rs.57,01,543/-.&nbsp; A copy of the letter dated 23.07.2007 is annexed herewith as ANNEXURE A-1.&nbsp;</li><li>That thereafter, the Claimant deposited a sum of Rs.5,37,920/- and Rs.3,46,208/- on 30.09.2007 and further a sum of Rs.40,49,131/- on 31.10.2007 (Total paid amount : Rs.50,95,339/-.&nbsp;</li><li>That the Claimant was allotted Unit No. L-3/1103 in Tower No. ‘L’ with a total cost of Rs.57,01,543/- in the Project known as ‘The Views’ vide letter dated 23.07.2007 and an Agreement was signed/executed on 11.02.2008 through the Authorized Signatory of the Respondent.&nbsp; The details of the Apartments have also been mentioned in para No. 1.1 of the Agreement with three Bed Rooms and three toilets and super area of 1,750 sq. feet @ Rs.2,950/- per sq. feet.&nbsp; &nbsp;A copy of the Agreement is annexed herewith as ANNEXURE A-2.</li></li></ul>','<p>In view of the facts mentioned in Paragraph 4 above, the Applicant prays for the following compensation(s):-</p><p>Refund of an amount of Rs.50,95,339/- paid by the Applicants along with interest (highest marginal cost of lending rate of the State Bank of India+2%) from the respective dates of deposit till actual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.</p><p>Payment of compensation of Rs.10.00 lacs due to the inordinate delay on the part of the Respondent in failing to handover possession of the Allotted Unit; mental agony, harassment and escalation in the prices of the Real Estate as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.</p><p>Any other relief which the Applicants are entitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>',5701543.00,0.00,'2010-10-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ul><li><li>In view of the facts mentioned in Paragraph 4 above, the Applicant prays for the following compensation(s):-</li><li>Refund of an amount of Rs.50,95,339/- paid by the Applicants along with interest (highest marginal cost of lending rate of the State Bank of India+2%) from the respective dates of deposit till actual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.</li><li>Payment of compensation of Rs.10.00 lacs due to the inordinate delay on the part of the Respondent in failing to handover possession of the Allotted Unit; mental agony, harassment and escalation in the prices of the Real Estate as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.</li><li>Any other relief which the Applicants are entitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;</li></li></ul>','1','','2007-10-05 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Unit No.TVM-L3-F11-1103 Tower No.F,The Views at Mohali Hills, Sector-105, SAS Nagar Mohali (Pb)','','',2,0,0,0,'jasbirsinghc','2018-11-09 15:51:50.000','jasbirsinghc','2018-11-09 15:51:50.000'),(264,1103,'1103',1197,'48449df7-379b-405e-98c2-f285f525d12f','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-09 16:48:57.000','Jasbir Singh','csvedparkash@gmail.com',9814700360,0,0,'Churchview, 1St. Peters Close','Burnham SLI 7HS, United Kingdom',28,507,'160059','1','H. NO. 360','Phase-4, SAS Nagar',28,507,'160059','Manjit Singh','',9814700360,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','The Views at Mohali Hills','EMAAR MGF Land Limited','enquiries@emaarmgf.com',1723314801,0,'EMAAR MGF Land Private Limited','1st Floor, SCO No. 120-122, Sector-17C, Chandigarh',6,128,'160017','1','EMAAR MGF Land Private Limited','1st Floor, SCO No. 120-122, Sector-17C, Chandigarh',6,128,'160017','1','<ul><li><li>That the Applicants are the residents of U.K. and are British subjects and desirous and looking forward to buy a residential house for themselves.&nbsp; The Applicants came across a brochure issued by the Respondent that they have been granted the approvals and exemptions to construct a Group Housing Complex and has planned for constructing the same the Colony, known as the ‘Mohali Hills’, to be constructed on the land consisting of high-end Apartments and Pent Houses, Car parking spaces, recreational facilities etc.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>That the Applicants being allured with the information about the approvals and legal rights of the Respondent, known as Company, moved an Application on 13.07.2007 for registration/ provisional allotment of a residential apartment in the Group Housing Complex and the Applicants deposited Rs.1,62,080/- for booking deposit of the area of 1,750 sq. feet under Order No. 601685 with the Customer Code No. TVM/454 and issued a provisional Allotment of Unit No./ Apartment No. L-3/1103 with total consideration of Rs.57,01,543/-.&nbsp; A copy of the letter dated 23.07.2007 is annexed herewith as ANNEXURE A-1.&nbsp;</li><li>That thereafter, the Claimant deposited a sum of Rs.5,37,920/- and Rs.3,46,208/- on 30.09.2007 and further a sum of Rs.40,49,131/- on 31.10.2007 (Total paid amount : Rs.50,95,339/-.&nbsp;</li><li>That the Claimant was allotted Unit No. L-3/1103 in Tower No. ‘L’ with a total cost of Rs.57,01,543/- in the Project known as ‘The Views’ vide letter dated 23.07.2007 and an Agreement was signed/executed on 11.02.2008 through the Authorized Signatory of the Respondent.&nbsp; The details of the Apartments have also been mentioned in para No. 1.1 of the Agreement with three Bed Rooms and three toilets and super area of 1,750 sq. feet @ Rs.2,950/- per sq. feet.&nbsp; &nbsp;A copy of the Agreement is annexed herewith as ANNEXURE A-2.</li></li></ul>','<p>In view of the facts mentioned in Paragraph 4 above, the Applicant prays for the following compensation(s):-</p><p>Refund of an amount of Rs.50,95,339/- paid by the Applicants along with interest (highest marginal cost of lending rate of the State Bank of India+2%) from the respective dates of deposit till actual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.</p><p>Payment of compensation of Rs.10.00 lacs due to the inordinate delay on the part of the Respondent in failing to handover possession of the Allotted Unit; mental agony, harassment and escalation in the prices of the Real Estate as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.</p><p>Any other relief which the Applicants are entitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>',5701543.00,0.00,'2010-10-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ul><li><li>In view of the facts mentioned in Paragraph 4 above, the Applicant prays for the following compensation(s):-</li><li>Refund of an amount of Rs.50,95,339/- paid by the Applicants along with interest (highest marginal cost of lending rate of the State Bank of India+2%) from the respective dates of deposit till actual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.</li><li>Payment of compensation of Rs.10.00 lacs due to the inordinate delay on the part of the Respondent in failing to handover possession of the Allotted Unit; mental agony, harassment and escalation in the prices of the Real Estate as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.</li><li>Any other relief which the Applicants are entitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;</li></li></ul>','1','','2007-10-05 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Unit No.TVM-L3-F11-1103 Tower No.F,The Views at Mohali Hills, Sector-105, SAS Nagar Mohali (Pb)','','',2,0,0,0,'jasbirsinghc','2018-11-09 15:51:59.000','jasbirsinghc','2018-11-09 15:51:59.000'),(265,1059,'1059',1091,'e2da2916-c5af-4a15-acce-51dcf84d70a2','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-18 15:14:26.000','Narinder Kumar Thakur','nktkangra@yahoo.co.in',9417493259,1722622364,0,'House No. 155-A','Sector 42-A',6,128,'160042','1','House No. 2378, Sector 35-C,','',6,128,'160035','Rajeev Anand','anandlawoffice2378@gmail.com',9417870805,1722622364,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','Wave Estate Project','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd Through its MD','customercare@waveestate.in',0,0,'PO Rayon and Silk Mills','Adjoining Coca Cola Depot GT Road, Chheharta',28,39,'143105','0','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd. Wave Estate Project site office sector 85','SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The Complainant booked an Unit No 67 FF, First\r\nFloor Sector G, Wave Floor, Sector 99 Mohali on 21.03.2013. (Annexure C-1).\r\nAgreement dated 11.07.2013 (Annexure C-2) was executed with Respondent for\r\nsaleable area 1060sqFt @ 3773.5849/sqFt. As per Clause 5.2, the Project was to\r\nbe developed and the Apartment was to be handed over in 24 months and by Cl.\r\n5.5 the delay entailed Rs. 5/sqFt/month for delay. On 20.01.2015, the\r\nComplainant was made to fill another Agreement (Annexure C-3) and the Apartment\r\nof the Complainant was unilaterally changed by issuing a letter with new number\r\n44/FF, Wave Floor Sector 99, Mohali (Relocated Apartment). </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The Complainant took a Loan of 32 lakhs (Annexure C-4) for said\r\nApartment. It was found that site plan of the Apartment is changed by changing\r\nbathroom door opening in bedroom etc. Having found the Project and the\r\nApartment delayed, the Complainant gave a representation 11.01.2017 (Annexure\r\nC-5) that construction started with 2 years delay and not completed. The\r\ncomplainant gave two representations dated May 2017 (Annexure C-6) &amp;\r\n05.08.2017 <span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">(Annexure C-7)</span> that even after\r\n4 1/2 years possession not offered. On 03.09.2017 (Annexure C-8) the\r\nComplainant wanted to meet the senior but no time was given for meeting for\r\ndelivery of possession. The Complainant upon interest liability and EMI burden\r\nspent his life savings and repaid loan on 27.03.2017 (Annexure C-9).&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The Apartment is totally incomplete &amp; no possession is given.\r\nThe apartment was to be completed by 11.01.2016 but not done against which\r\nComplainant gave representation dated 23.09.2017 (Annexure C-10). The\r\nRespondent made a unilateral Deed of Settlement on 05.11.2017 (Annexure C-11)\r\nto give interest &amp; also give possession by March 2018 but since not\r\nhonoured by Respondent, the Deed of Settlement became redundant. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Now on 18.08.2018 (Annexure\r\nC-12) a Statement of Account has been given wherein area increased and money\r\ncharged without any increase in Apartment area.</span>','<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The\r\nApartment was to be handed over after completing the Project in 24 months + 6\r\nMonths i.e. from 11.07.2013 by 11.01.2016. Even the monthly compensation of\r\nRs5/SqFt/month was to be paid from January 2016 onwards till date NOT PAID.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The\r\nRespondent&nbsp;has taken the total sale price in advance at the time of signing\r\nof Agreement to the tune of Rs. 3 Lakhs (+Service Tax) on 05.02.2013 and 3\r\nlakhs (+Service Tax) &nbsp;on 21.03.2013+ Rs 968658\r\n(+Service Tax) on 13.02.2015 + Rs 231342 (+ Service Tax) on 31.03.2015+ 1057177\r\n(+ service Tax) on 16.11.2015 +Rs. 142823 (+ service Tax)on 16.11.2015+ 6 lakhs\r\n(+ service Tax)on 22.04.2017 totaling 36 Lakhs (+ service Tax), totaling 36\r\nLakhs (+ service Tax) as also EMIs with interest.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The possession of the Apartment was to be given to the\r\nApplicant / Allottee within 24 + 6 = 30 months. Inspite of elapsing of over 5\r\nyears of Agreement, no development and construction works have been completed\r\nin the Complex and the Respondent Promoter has failed in its obligation towards\r\nthe Complex and Independent Residential Floor allotted to the Applicant. The\r\nPromoter is liable to pay the interest on the payment so received for the\r\nperiod of delay in offering possession after the completion of the development\r\nworks of the project and the completion of the construction of the Independent\r\nResidential Floor. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">In\r\nview of the above : <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.7pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">(i)\r\nThe Applicant / Allottee is seeking compensation as applicable in Para 5.5 of\r\nAgreement dated 11.07.2013 from January 2016 onwards till date; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">(ii) directions for completion of the development works of the project\r\nand the construction of the independent residential floor in question without\r\nany further delay and also offer the possession after the grant of Occupation\r\nCertificate of the Building and the Completion Certificate of the Wave Estate\r\nProject alongwith interest and compensation prescribed under Real Estate\r\n(Regulation and Development) Act 2016 as the action of the Respondents.</span><br></p>',4000000.00,3600000.00,'2016-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">The respondents be directed to complete the\r\ndevelopment works of the project and the construction of the independent residential\r\nfloor in question without any further delay and also offer the possession after\r\nthe grant of occupation certificate of the Building and the Completion\r\nCertificate of the Wave Estate Project.</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">The Promoter be also directed to pay the interim monthly interest and compensation till the completion of the project and the Complex in question in the pendency of the Complaint.&nbsp;<br></span><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2013-07-11 00:00:00','Independent Residential Floor Bearing No. 44/FF in Sector 99','','',2,0,0,0,'RajeevAnand','2018-11-09 15:57:46.000','RajeevAnand','2018-11-09 15:57:46.000'),(266,1059,'1059',1091,'e2da2916-c5af-4a15-acce-51dcf84d70a2','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-09 16:00:09.000','Narinder Kumar Thakur','nktkangra@yahoo.co.in',9417493259,1722622364,0,'House No. 155-A','Sector 42-A',6,128,'160042','1','House No. 2378, Sector 35-C,','',6,128,'160035','Rajeev Anand','anandlawoffice2378@gmail.com',9417870805,1722622364,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','Wave Estate Project','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd Through its MD','customercare@waveestate.in',0,0,'PO Rayon and Silk Mills','Adjoining Coca Cola Depot GT Road, Chheharta',28,39,'143105','0