-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Pass any other order/orders which PBRERA may deem fit in the facts and circumstances of the case.</span></p></li></ol></ol>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ol style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Direct PSPCL for permanent electricity connections for the 65 families (Complainant).</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Direct MC kharar for permanent water and sewerage connections to the society.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asia