6,128,'160022','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'jarnailthakur','2018-11-13 15:15:48.000','jarnailthakur','2018-11-13 15:15:48.000'),(283,1111,'1111',1119,'dae2bb68-2fa2-473d-a49d-c15de93bd3da','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','RAJEEV SALWAN','advravinder@gmail.com',9815700280,0,0,'H. NO. 1462, PHASE 3B2','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160059','1','H. NO. 1462, PHASE 3B2','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160059','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0155','GOLF LINKS - I (RESIDENTIAL)','ANSAL PROPERTIES & INFRASTRUCTURE LTD.','info@ansalapi.com',0,0,'SCO NO. 183-184, SECTOR 9-C, CHANDIGARH','',6,128,'160009','1','SCO NO. 183-184, SECTOR 9-C, CHANDIGARH','',6,128,'160009','1','<p>Respondents offered a scheme of LAND POOLING under which&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;they are going to acquire/\r\npurchase land on Kharar - Landran road, Greater Mohali for which they have\r\ninvited finance from the general public and under the scheme it was offered\r\nthat for every 0.50 Acre of land, Respondent shall allot a developed residential plot measuring 500 Sq. Yards in\r\nthe township/ project which was to be developed on kharar landran road at Mohali within a period of Two Years from development agreement which was executed on 08.09.2011. Price consideration was agreed at Rs.60,00,000/-. On 11.02.2014, allotment of Plot No.401, Sector 114 Ansal Golf Liks - 1, Mohali issued to complainants without informing its location and surroundings. Offered possession of said plot on 14.08.2014 and delivered the possession of the plot on the same day to which there was no approach road, plot level was much down to the road level, running dirty drain just behind the drain which was never disclosed to the complainants. On 25.09.2014 Plot Buyer\'s Agreement was executed and surprisingly price of the plot was increased by another Rs.15,00,000/- besides cost of EDC and IDC. This increase was done under the garb of PLC for Corner Plot without informing that there is a Dirty Drain running just behind the plot of the complainants.&nbsp; Till date Complainants have already paid an amount of Rs.84,05,365/-. Complainant wrote regd. letter dated 10.10.2014 to respondents seeking refund of overcharged amount. Paper possession of un-developed&nbsp; and inhabitable plot with running dirty drain just at its back was given on 20.07.2015 to the complainants. No approved layout was shown to the complainants till date. The said dirty drain is stinking so badly due to urinal and sewage waste of nearby villages and swaraj tractor factory which is very near to the complex. The drain is a breeding ground for mosquitoes, insects and flies. Plot level is down by 10-12 ft from the road level. Complaint made to GMADA. GMADA Sought reply.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">a).&nbsp;&nbsp; Relocation of the plot no. 401 measuring 500\r\nsq. yards be done to a suitable place, as per the choice of the complainants,\r\nat a preferable location (Corner Plot) with all amenities, facilities like\r\nroad, sewerage and water connection, metalled roads, street lights, levelling of\r\nplot at road level etc.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">b)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of the excess amount of\r\nRs.15,00,000/- charged from the complainants on account of PLC;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">c)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Respondents be directed to provide the proof\r\nof the EDC/ IDC deposited by the respondents with the GMADA/ any other\r\ncompetent authority out of the amount charged from the complainants.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">d)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Respondents may be restrained to demand the\r\nmaintenance charges till the time relocation to a habitable plot is not done.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">e).&nbsp;&nbsp; Pay interest @18% per annum from the dates of\r\nrespective payments till the date of actual realization of the amount;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">f).&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pay compensation to the tune of\r\nRs.10,00,000/- for the delayed possession mental harassment and agony caused to\r\nit by the respondents; and<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">g).&nbsp;&nbsp; Pay Rs.1,10,000/- as the litigation charges\r\nand expenses incurred by it.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">h).&nbsp;&nbsp; Order any other relief that this Hon’ble\r\nCourt, SAS Nagar, Mohali, Pujab may deem fit and proper in the circumstances of\r\nthe present complaint.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:56.7pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">IN\r\nCASE RESPONDENTS FAILS TO RELOCATE THE PLOT AS PRAYED ABOVE, ALTERNATIVELY &nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:84.3pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-27.6pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund entire deposited amount of Rs.84,05,365/-.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">j).&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pay interest @18% per annum from the dates\r\nof respective payments till the date of actual realization of the amount;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">k).&nbsp;&nbsp; Pay compensation to the tune of\r\nRs.10,00,000/- for the delayed possession mental harassment and agony caused to\r\nit by the respondents; and<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">l).&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pay Rs.1,10,000/- as the litigation charges\r\nand expenses incurred by it.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">m).&nbsp; Order any other relief that this Hon’ble\r\nCourt, SAS Nagar, Mohali, Punjab may deem fit and proper in the circumstances\r\nof the present complaint.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',6000000.00,8405365.00,'2013-09-08 00:00:00.000','2015-07-20 00:00:00.000','<p>Respondents may be directed to deposit principle amount of Rs.84,05,365/- paid by the complainants to the Respondents before this Hon\'ble Court till decision of the present case.</p>','1','','2014-02-11 00:00:00','2011-09-08 00:00:00','plot no. 401 sector 114 golf Links - 1 Mohali.','','',2,0,0,0,'advravinder','2018-11-14 00:46:06.000','advravinder','2018-11-14 00:46:06.000'),(284,1112,'1112',1209,'f480cc0c-0691-4f54-b963-7b2179191666','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Sushil Kumar','chauhan.vinay725@gmail.com',9872749303,0,570726735321,'#1114/A, A.G. Audit Pool colony','Sector 41-B',6,128,'160036','1','#1114/A, A.G. Audit Pool colony','Sector 41-B',6,128,'160036','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0277','Land Twister Homes','Pankaj Sood','info@landtwisters.com',9803002030,0,'Opposite Ansal Golf links 2','Sector 115, Landry Kharar, SAS Nagar, Mohali 160055',28,507,'160055','1','Opposite Ansal Golf links 2','Sector 115, Landry Kharar, SAS Nagar, Mohali 160055',28,507,'160055','1','