ne-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">2. Delayed construction:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">The construction rate has been too slow and poor. All throughout the year, there was no progress at all. They pressurized us to have a home loan approved but we didn\'t want to as there was no progress at all at ground zero.</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">info</span><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">&nbsp;concealed:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">The builder had conveyed that all the approvals have been received and nothing is pending which wasn\'t correct at all. They had many internal pending approvals.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">4. Biased and vague sell agreement:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">The sale agreement/ allotment letter was biased and pretty vague. It had unacceptable clauses.</span></p>','<p>Abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'Vinay','2018-11-14 10:52:04.000','Vinay','2018-11-14 10:52:04.000'),(286,1112,'1112',1209,'f480cc0c-0691-4f54-b963-7b2179191666','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Sushil Kumar','chauhan.vinay725@gmail.com',9872749303,0,570726735321,'#1114/A, A.G. Audit Pool colony','Sector 41-B',6,128,'160036','1','#1114/A, A.G. Audit Pool colony','Sector 41-B',6,128,'160036','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBR