26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">4. Biased and vague sell agreement:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">The sale agreement/ allotment letter was biased and pretty vague. It had unacceptable clauses.</span></p>','<p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">We want to cancel the flat no. 357/1, booked with Land Twisters Homes and want full refund of our money paid in 2016. We have intimated the cancellation of the same to the promoter via their e-mail address shared on their website on 20th-Oct-2018.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 21.600000381469727px; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">We have paid&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">Rs</span><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">. 5</span><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">,64,300</span><span style=\"line-height: 21.600000381469727px;\">/- till date