ure or in advertisement is not\r\nhabitable.I have been cheated as PUDA is forcing me to accept possesion of plot on which a normal human being cannot even stand due to stink/unhygiene.</span></u></i></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">i) Sub\r\nsection18 (1) of Section 1 of Real Estate (Regulation and Development Act) 2016\r\nand&nbsp;Section 18(1) 19(4)19(7) and 84(2) (i) (j) (k) of Punjab State Real\r\nEstate (Regulation and Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;<b>to withdraw my\r\nallotment under this project and seek full refund of the money already paid as\r\nfull cost of the plot i.e. Rs.5578560/- along with interest at 12 % p.a. (The\r\nsame interest which PUDA charges from allottees) from respective dates of payments</b>&nbsp;as\r\nDeveloper PUDA has cheated me by not disclosing presence of such jhuggis\r\nanywhere in the brochure or advertisement adjacent to my plot making the site\r\nnot fit and safe for habitation.</span></i><i style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: yellow;\">PUDA is forcing me to accept possesion of plot on which a normal human being cannot even stand due to stink/unhygiene.Even after paying them my entire life savings I am being asked to live adjacent to Jhuggis .</span></u></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></i></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.