tyle=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></i></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">(ii)<b>I would also request the authority to pass\r\na restraining order addressed to my financing Bank (Bank of India, Shree Ganesh\r\nComplex, GT Road, Khanna District Ludhiana State Punjab) to not impose\r\ncommercial rate of interest on the loan as I have not been able to complete\r\nconstruction on the said said plot due to lapses and delays by PUDA in non-completion\r\nof development activities on time and forcing possession of plot adjacent to\r\njhuggis (not mentioned in Brochure or anywhere) and different from layout plan approved\r\nby the competent authority.Sir i am not able to bear such penalty of higher commercial rate of interest in the range of 12 % p.a. for no fault of mine.&nbsp;</b></span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b><br></b></span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b><o:p></o:p></b></span></i></p>',5578560.00,5578560.00,'2018-06-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">i) Sub\r\nsection18 (1) of Section 1 of Real Estate (Regulation and Development Act) 2016\r\nand&nbsp;Section 18(1) 19(4)19(7) and 84(2) (i) (j) (k) of Punjab State Real\r\nEstate (Regulation and Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;<b>to withdraw my\r\nallotment under this project and seek full refund of the money already paid as\r\nfull cost of the plot i.e. Rs.5578560/- along with interest at 12 % p.a. (The\r\nsame interest which PUDA charges from allottees) from respective dates of payments</b>&nbsp;as\r\nDeveloper PUDA has cheated me by not disclosing presence of such jhuggis\r\nanywhere in the brochure or advertisement adjacent to my plot making the site\r\nnot fit and safe for habitation</span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">(ii)<b>I would also request the authority to pass\r\na restraining order addressed to my financing Bank (Bank of India, Shree Ganesh\r\nComplex, GT Road, Khanna District Ludhiana State Punjab) to not impose\r\ncommercial rate of interest on the loan as I have not been able to complete\r\nconstruction on the said said plot due to lapses and delays by PUDA in non-completion\r\nof development activities on time and forcing possession of plot adjacent to\r\njhuggis (not mentioned in Brochure or anywhere) and different from layout plan approved\r\nby the competent authority<o:p></o:p></b></span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','1','','2018-12-06 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Plot No 113 ,PUDA Enclave 2 Rajpura Colony Patiala (Punjab)\r\n147001','','',2,0,0,0,'Sbala60','2018-11-14 13:38:58.000','Sbala60','2018-11-14 13:38:58.000'),(295,1115,'1115',1214,'236d33c7-52c2-47c2-9d91-8289ee07ebac','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Mukesh Gupta','mukeshgupta.31@gmail.com',9417217902,0,0,'B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PC0019','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','rera@waveestate.in',0,0,' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali)',28,507,'140308','1',' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali)',28,507,'140308','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">I had booked independent first floor in Wave\r\nEstate, Sector-99 under subvention scheme in by initial payment of Rs.\r\n3,00,000/- vide cheque no. 60113 dated 08.02.2013. Next payment was made vide\r\ncheque no. 60117 dated 19.04.2013 amounting Rs. 3,18,540/-. It was committed to\r\nmake delivery within 2 years.&nbsp;</span>However, M/s Country Colonisers Pvt.\r\nLtd. executed the agreement on 07.02.2015 as per which possession was to be\r\noffered within 24 months along with an extended grace period of 6 months.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Accordingly, I arranged for accommodation on\r\nrent in Apr’2017 and have been paying both rent and EMIs as the subvention\r\nperiod had lapsed. Due to inordinate delay I lost faith in the project and requested\r\nthe developers through e-mails to refund my deposits. However there was no\r\nresponse from their end as they continued to defer possession and progress on\r\nsite was very slow. They agreed to settle only pre-EMI interest from Aug’17 (24+6\r\nmonths from date of agreement) onwards and offered to deliver possession in Mar’18.\r\nDeveloper even failed to meet that deadline and possession has not been offered\r\ntill date.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">After so much of agony, I do not want to remain\r\nassociated with the developer and request for return of all deposits including\r\nEMIs with interest.</span><b><u><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></u></b></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">In\r\nlight of the case facts association with the project has not only loss of time,\r\nmoney and effort but has caused a lot of mental harassment. &nbsp;It is therefore requested to refunding entire\r\ndeposits including EMIs paid to bank with interest. It is also requested to\r\ncompensate with mental harassment charges.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',4000000.00,3000000.00,'2017-08-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','It is prayed to stop the EMIs till final decision as I am not able to pay both rent and EMI.&nbsp;','1','','2015-02-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','40, First Floor, Sector-99, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'mukesh013128','2018-11-14 15:13:20.000','mukesh013128','2018-11-14 15:13:20.000'),(296,1115,'1115',1214,'236d33c7-52c2-47c2-9d91-8289ee07ebac','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Mukesh Gupta','mukeshgupta.31@gmail.com',9417217902,0,0,'B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PC0019','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','rera@waveestate.in',0,0,' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali)',28,507,'140308','1',' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali)',28,507,'140308','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">I had booked independent first floor in Wave\r\nEstate, Sector-99 under subvention scheme by initial payment of Rs.\r\n3,00,000/- vide cheque no. 60113 dated 08.02.2013. Next payment was made vide\r\ncheque no. 60117 dated 19.04.2013 amounting Rs. 3,18,540/-. It was committed to\r\nmake delivery within 2 years.&nbsp;</span>However, M/s Country Colonisers Pvt.\r\nLtd. executed the agreement on 07.02.2015 as per which possession was to be\r\noffered within 24 months along with an extended grace period of 6 months.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Accordingly, I arranged for accommodation on\r\nrent in Apr’2017 and have been paying both rent and EMIs as the subvention\r\nperiod had lapsed. Due to inordinate delay I lost faith in the project and requested\r\nthe developers through e-mails to refund my deposits. However there was no\r\nresponse from their end as they continued to defer possession and progress on\r\nsite was very slow. They agreed to settle only pre-EMI interest from Aug’17 (24+6\r\nmonths from date of agreement) onwards and offered to deliver possession in Mar’18.\r\nDeveloper even failed to meet that deadline and possession has not been offered\r\ntill date.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">After so much of agony of 5 years 9 months, I do not want to remain\r\nassociated with the developer and request for return of all deposits including\r\nEMIs with interest.</span><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">In\r\nlight of the case facts brought out hereinabove, association with the project has not only been loss of time,\r\nmoney and effort but has caused a lot of mental harassment. It is therefore requested to refund entire\r\ndeposits including EMIs paid to bank with interest. It is also requested to\r\ncompensate by ordering for mental harassment charges.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',4000000.00,3000000.00,'2017-08-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','It is prayed to stop the EMIs till final decision as I am not able to pay both rent and EMI.&nbsp;','1','','2015-02-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','40, First Floor, Sector-99, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'mukesh013128','2018-11-14 15:31:41.000','mukesh013128','2018-11-14 15:31:41.000'),(297,1091,'1091',1132,'1cc1b298-c384-4c23-8f77-3e560c57343c','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-29 12:16:21.000','Col Shiv Kumar Anand & Vinod Arora','sk.anand1581@gmail.com',9815001098,0,318710313792,'1581, Sector 34-D','',6,128,'160022','1','1581, Sector 34-D','Chandigarh',6,128,'160022','Col Shiv Kumar Anand','sk.anand1581@gmail.com',9815001098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0089','Aeropolis City\r\n(formerly known as Yellowstone Landmark Infocity)','AEROPOLIS INFRASTRUCTURE PVT LTD c/o TEJINDER SINGH BHATIA','tejindersinghbhatia@gmail.com',9592969696,0,'Aeropolis City,','Sector 66A, SAS Nagar(Mohali)-',28,507,'160062','1','Aeropolis City,','Sector 66A, SAS nagar. (Mohali)',28,507,'160062','1','<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Mangal;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Applied for a IT plot\r\nof 400 sq yds in 2011. The same has not been handed over, till date &amp; there\r\nis no development of the area. The company has changed its name and has kept its\r\ncustomers ignorant. This could only be found out on visit to your office. Since\r\nlast eight years payments have been made, as per the development plan, as\r\nindicated by Yellowstone. Actually, on the ground there is zero development.\r\nThe Yellowstone has been cheating the customers &amp; utilizing the funds in\r\nother projects. Since the company has laid down the conditions for timely\r\npayments, imposing interest of 18% for late payments, I had no choice. I am 75\r\nyear old &amp; have requested the company many a times, but to no avail. I have\r\npaid Rs. 22.11 Lakh, over the period. It is more than seven years since,\r\nstarted paying for the plot. Considering the normal time of three years of\r\ncompletion of the project, the company has already taken more than four years, over &amp; above the basic necessary period</span><br></p>','<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Mangal;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">RERA is requested, to\r\norder the company to hand over the plots at the earliest. RERA is further\r\nrequested to order the AEROPOLIS to pay interest @ 18% pa, for retaining the\r\nmoney for so long. In case they can’t hand over the plot, then they should\r\nhandover 400 sq yds of free hold land in Sector 66-A, SAS Nagar and pay\r\ninterest at 18% from 2011 to the date of settlement. In case the company is\r\nhanding over the plot, that case they should give 18% rate of interest of the\r\nperiod over &amp; above the basic period of 3 years required of the completion\r\nof the project, for keeping the money for so long. In case the company is not\r\nable to hand over the plots, then it should give, 400 sq yds of land with free\r\ntitle in Sector 66A, SAS Nagar, along with interest of 18% from Aug 2011 to\r\ndate, for keeping the money, for the period from the date of allotment to the\r\ndate of settlement.</span><br></p>',26400000.00,2211000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-21.15pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Before completion of your order &amp;\r\nhanding over the plot, you are requested to order the company to hand over the\r\ninterest at 18% pa, the rate the company was charging from its customers, for\r\nthe period that they have retained the money &amp; used it for other purposes\r\nfor their benefit. Your kind attention is drawn to Sr. 19 (4) of regulations\r\n&amp; development of RERA, in this case. Company should also be penalized for\r\ncheating &amp; harassing their customers &amp; retaining &amp; using the money\r\nfor their projects. Legal costs also are imposed on AEROPOLIS Infrastructure\r\nPvt. Ltd.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','2011-06-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','-','','',2,0,0,0,'sk.anand1581@gmail.com','2018-11-15 11:50:58.000','sk.anand1581@gmail.com','2018-11-15 11:50:58.000'),(298,1091,'1091',1132,'1cc1b298-c384-4c23-8f77-3e560c57343c','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-29 12:16:21.000','Col Shiv Kumar Anand & Vinod Arora','sk.anand1581@gmail.com',9815001098,0,0,'1581, Sector 34-D','',6,128,'160022','1','1581, Sector 34-D','Chandigarh',6,128,'160022','Col Shiv Kumar Anand','sk.anand1581@gmail.com',9815001098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0089','Aeropolis City\r\n(formerly known as Yellowstone Landmark Infocity)','AEROPOLIS INFRASTRUCTURE PVT LTD c/o TEJINDER SINGH BHATIA','tejindersinghbhatia@gmail.com',9592969696,0,'Aeropolis City,','Sector 66A, SAS Nagar(Mohali)-',28,507,'160062','1','Aeropolis City,','Sector 66A, SAS nagar. (Mohali)',28,507,'160062','1','<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Mangal;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Applied for a IT plot\r\nof 400 sq yds in 2011. The same has not been handed over, till date &amp; there\r\nis no development of the area. The company has changed its name and has kept its\r\ncustomers ignorant. This could only be found out on visit to your office. Since\r\nlast eight years payments have been made, as per the development plan, as\r\nindicated by Yellowstone. Actually, on the ground there is zero development.\r\nThe Yellowstone has been cheating the customers &amp; utilizing the funds in\r\nother projects. Since the company has laid down the conditions for timely\r\npayments, imposing interest of 18% for late payments, I had no choice. I am 75\r\nyear old &amp; have requested the company many a times, but to no avail. I have\r\npaid Rs. 22.11 Lakh, over the period. It is more than seven years since,\r\nstarted paying for the plot. Considering the normal time of three years of\r\ncompletion of the project, the company has already taken more than four years, over &amp; above the basic necessary period</span><br></p>','<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Mangal;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">RERA is requested, to\r\norder the company to hand over the plots at the earliest. RERA is further\r\nrequested to order the AEROPOLIS to pay interest @ 18% pa, for retaining the\r\nmoney for so long. In case they can’t hand over the plot, then they should\r\nhandover 400 sq yds of free hold land in Sector 66-A, SAS Nagar and pay\r\ninterest at 18% from 2011 to the date of settlement. In case the company is\r\nhanding over the plot, that case they should give 18% rate of interest of the\r\nperiod over &amp; above the basic period of 3 years required of the completion\r\nof the project, for keeping the money for so long. In case the company is not\r\nable to hand over the plots, then it should give, 400 sq yds of land with free\r\ntitle in Sector 66A, SAS Nagar, along with interest of 18% from Aug 2011 to\r\ndate, for keeping the money, for the period from the date of allotment to the\r\ndate of settlement.</span><br></p>',26400000.00,2211000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-21.15pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Before completion of your order &amp;\r\nhanding over the plot, you are requested to order the company to hand over the\r\ninterest at 18% pa, the rate the company was charging from its customers, for\r\nthe period that they have retained the money &amp; used it for other purposes\r\nfor their benefit. Your kind attention is drawn to Sr. 19 (4) of regulations\r\n&amp; development of RERA, in this case. Company should also be penalized for\r\ncheating &amp; harassing their customers &amp; retaining &amp; using the money\r\nfor their projects. Legal costs also are imposed on AEROPOLIS Infrastructure\r\nPvt. Ltd.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','2011-06-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','-','','',2,0,0,0,'sk.anand1581@gmail.com','2018-11-15 11:58:15.000','sk.anand1581@gmail.com','2018-11-15 11:58:15.000'),(299,1091,'1091',1132,'1cc1b298-c384-4c23-8f77-3e560c57343c','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-15 12:30:18.000','Col Shiv Kumar Anand & Vinod Arora','sk.anand1581@gmail.com',9815001098,0,0,'1581, Sector 34-D','',6,128,'160022','1','1581, Sector 34-D','Chandigarh',6,128,'160022','Col Shiv Kumar Anand','sk.anand1581@gmail.com',9815001098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0089','Aeropolis City\r\n(formerly known as Yellowstone Landmark Infocity)','AEROPOLIS INFRASTRUCTURE PVT LTD c/o TEJINDER SINGH BHATIA','tejindersinghbhatia@gmail.com',9592969696,0,'Aeropolis City,','Sector 66A, SAS Nagar(Mohali)-',28,507,'160062','1','Aeropolis City,','Sector 66A, SAS nagar. (Mohali)',28,507,'160062','1','<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Mangal;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Applied for a IT plot\r\nof 400 sq yds in 2011. The same has not been handed over, till date &amp; there\r\nis no development of the area. The company has changed its name and has kept its\r\ncustomers ignorant. This could only be found out on visit to your office. Since\r\nlast eight years payments have been made, as per the development plan, as\r\nindicated by Yellowstone. Actually, on the ground there is zero development.\r\nThe Yellowstone has been cheating the customers &amp; utilizing the funds in\r\nother projects. Since the company has laid down the conditions for timely\r\npayments, imposing interest of 18% for late payments, I had no choice. I am 75\r\nyear old &amp; have requested the company many a times, but to no avail. I have\r\npaid Rs. 22.11 Lakh, over the period. It is more than seven years since,\r\nstarted paying for the plot. Considering the normal time of three years of\r\ncompletion of the project, the company has already taken more than four years, over &amp; above the basic necessary period</span><br></p>','<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Mangal;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">RERA is requested, to\r\norder the company to hand over the plots at the earliest. RERA is further\r\nrequested to order the AEROPOLIS to pay interest @ 18% pa, for retaining the\r\nmoney for so long. In case they can’t hand over the plot, then they should\r\nhandover 400 sq yds of free hold land in Sector 66-A, SAS Nagar and pay\r\ninterest at 18% from 2011 to the date of settlement. In case the company is\r\nhanding over the plot, that case they should give 18% rate of interest of the\r\nperiod over &amp; above the basic period of 3 years required of the completion\r\nof the project, for keeping the money for so long. In case the company is not\r\nable to hand over the plots, then it should give, 400 sq yds of land with free\r\ntitle in Sector 66A, SAS Nagar, along with interest of 18% from Aug 2011 to\r\ndate, for keeping the money, for the period from the date of allotment to the\r\ndate of settlement.</span><br></p>',26400000.00,2211000.00,'2011-06-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-21.15pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Before completion of your order &amp;\r\nhanding over the plot, you are requested to order the company to hand over the\r\ninterest at 18% pa, the rate the company was charging from its customers, for\r\nthe period that they have retained the money &amp; used it for other purposes\r\nfor their benefit. Your kind attention is drawn to Sr. 19 (4) of regulations\r\n&amp; development of RERA, in this case. Company should also be penalized for\r\ncheating &amp; harassing their customers &amp; retaining &amp; using the money\r\nfor their projects. Legal costs also are imposed on AEROPOLIS Infrastructure\r\nPvt. Ltd.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','2011-06-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Not Issued','','',1,1,0,0,'sk.anand1581@gmail.com','2018-11-15 12:30:15.000','sk.anand1581@gmail.com','2018-11-15 12:30:15.000'),(300,1114,'1114',1038,'22fcbe23-e0a4-4755-9ab6-4ad928d16843','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Tarun Arora','imemyself.arora@gmail.com',8557011367,0,0,'H n 17 Street No 1','OLD BISHAN NAGAR',28,454,'147001','0','H n 102 St no 7','Guru Nanak Enclave',28,454,'147001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-PTL63-PM0068','PUDA ENCLAVE 2 RAJPURA COLONY PATIALA \r\nPROMOTER :PUDA PATIALA','Estate Officer ,PUDA Patiala','pdapatiala@hotmail.com',0,1755020529,'Patiala urban Planning And Development Authority','Urban Estate, Phase II, Patiala',28,454,'147001','1','Patiala urban Planning And Development Authority','Urban Estate, Phase II, Patiala',28,454,'147001','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">I am allottee of Plot no.113 at PUDA Enclave -2\r\nRajpura colony ,Patiala (Punjab) registered&nbsp;<b>under RERA&nbsp; Regn No:\r\nPBRERA-PTL63-PM0068&nbsp;</b>.PUDA,Patiala had issued allotment letter of plot\r\nno.113 bearing Memo No.:P.U.D.A.- E.O./2016/14582 dated 06.12.2016 vide their\r\nMemo No. /PDA/2017/1520 dated 01.03.2017 (Attached)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b style=\"font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px;\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Total price of plot&nbsp;Rs.5578560/- was paid by me on 06.06.2017.</span></i></b><b style=\"font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px;\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">No dues certificate issued by PUDA attached. It is important to mention here that I have raised loan of Rs.50.00\r\nLakhs from Bank to make payment of plot purchase to PUDA</span></i></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: yellow;\">The possesion of the plot\r\nwas delayed and not given by cutoff date either by 06.03.2018.(As per Brochure)\r\nor by 06.06.2018(As per Allotment Letter)</span></u></i></b><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Meanwhile,PUDA sent me Offer letter &nbsp;to take possession of the plot within 30 days latest by\r\n30.08.2018 </span></i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">.<b><i><u><span style=\"background:\r\nyellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">On physically verifying the site I found that the\r\nproject is loaded with encumbrances i.e. Illegal establishments /Jhuggis of\r\nSlum Dwellers adjacent to my plot .Presence of such Illegal structures\r\n/Establishments was never published in the advertisements or brochure published\r\nby PUDA. (Photographs of Slum Dwellers and their establishments attached)</span></u></i></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: yellow;\">Under current\r\ncircumstances, it is not feasible for me to take possession of the plot and\r\nstart construction work at site since there is no safety /security owing to\r\nthreat posed by the slum dwellers with such an unhygienic environment that can\r\ncause serious health ailments due to presence of unbearable stink of faecal\r\nmatters/garbage</span></u></i></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: yellow;\">The said plot no. 113 allotted being offered with delayed possession\r\nwithout completion of development works as per sanctioned Layout plan loaded\r\nwith encumbrances/Illegal establishments /Jhuggis of Slum Dwellers\r\nadjacent to my plot&nbsp;and not revealed (probably deliberately) by PUDA at\r\nany stage ether in layout plan of the brochure or in advertisement is not\r\nhabitable.I have been cheated as PUDA is forcing me to accept possesion of plot on which a normal human being cannot even stand due to stink/unhygiene.</span></u></i></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">i) Sub\r\nsection18 (1) of Section 1 of Real Estate (Regulation and Development Act) 2016\r\nand&nbsp;Section 18(1) 19(4)19(7) and 84(2) (i) (j) (k) of Punjab State Real\r\nEstate (Regulation and Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;<b>to withdraw my\r\nallotment under this project and seek full refund of the money already paid as\r\nfull cost of the plot i.e. Rs.5578560/- along with interest at 12 % p.a. (The\r\nsame interest which PUDA charges from allottees) from respective dates of payments</b>&nbsp;as\r\nDeveloper PUDA has cheated me by not disclosing presence of such jhuggis\r\nanywhere in the brochure or advertisement adjacent to my plot making the site\r\nnot fit and safe for habitation.</span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></i><i style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: yellow;\">PUDA is forcing me to accept possesion of plot on which a normal human being cannot even stand due to stink/unhygiene.Even after paying them my entire life savings I am being asked to live adjacent to Jhuggis .</span></u></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></i></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b><o:p></o:p></b></span></i></p>',5578560.00,5578560.00,'2018-06-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b>I would also request the authority to pass\r\na restraining order addressed to my financing Bank (Bank of India, Shree Ganesh\r\nComplex, GT Road, Khanna District Ludhiana State Punjab) to not impose\r\ncommercial rate of interest on the loan as I have not been able to complete\r\nconstruction on the said said plot due to lapses and delays by PUDA in non-completion\r\nof development activities on time and forcing possession of plot adjacent to\r\njhuggis (not mentioned in Brochure or anywhere) and different from layout plan approved\r\nby the competent authority</b></span></i><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>I am not at fault for any delays and seek interim relief from Honurable Authority.</o:p></p>','1','','2018-12-06 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Plot No 113 ,PUDA Enclave 2 Rajpura Colony Patiala (Punjab)\r\n147001','','',2,0,0,0,'Sbala60','2018-11-15 12:44:39.000','Sbala60','2018-11-15 12:44:39.000'),(301,1116,'1116',1214,'236d33c7-52c2-47c2-9d91-8289ee07ebac','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Mukesh Gupta','mukeshgupta.31@gmail.com',9417217902,0,0,'B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PC0019','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','rera@waveestate.in',0,0,' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali).',28,507,'140308','1',' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali).',28,507,'140308','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">I had booked independent first floor in Wave\r\nEstate, Sector-99 under subvention scheme in Feb’2013 by making initial payment\r\nof Rs. 3,00,000/- vide cheque no. 60113 dated 08.02.2013. Next payment was made\r\nvide cheque no. 60117 dated 19.04.2013 amounting Rs. 3,18,540/-. It was\r\ncommitted to make delivery within 2 years.&nbsp;However, M/s Country Colonisers\r\nPvt. Ltd. executed the agreement on 07.02.2015 as per which possession was to\r\nbe offered within 24 months along with an extended grace period of 6 months.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Accordingly, I arranged for accommodation on\r\nrent in Apr’2017 and have been paying both rent and EMIs as the subvention\r\nperiod had lapsed. Due to inordinate delay I lost faith in the project and\r\nrequested the developers through e-mails to refund my deposits. However there\r\nwas no response from their end as they continued to defer possession and\r\nprogress on site was very slow. After a lot of follow-up developer agreed to settle\r\nonly pre-EMI interest from Aug’17 (24+6 months from date of agreement) onwards against\r\nbalance sale consideration and offered to deliver possession in Mar’18.\r\nDeveloper even failed to meet that deadline and possession has not been offered\r\ntill date.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">After so much of agony, I do not want to remain\r\nassociated with the developer and request for return of all deposits (including\r\nEMIs) with interest.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">In\r\nlight of the case facts association with the project has not only been loss of\r\ntime, money and effort but has caused a lot of mental harassment.&nbsp; It is therefore requested to refund entire\r\ndeposits including EMIs paid to bank with interest. It is also requested to\r\ncompensate on account of mental harassment. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Time\r\nis of essence in such contracts and complainants cannot be expected to wait indefinitely\r\nfor the respondent to</span> complete the project and hand over its possession\r\nat its free will. As such I waited for 6 years and there is enough ground for\r\nclaiming compensation.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p><br></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p><br></o:p></p>',4000000.00,3000000.00,'2017-08-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>It is prayed for stopping EMIs till final decision is ordered as I am burdened to pay both EMIs and rental.</p>','1','','2015-02-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','40, First Floor, Wave Estate, Sector-99, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'mukesh013128','2018-11-15 13:07:50.000','mukesh013128','2018-11-15 13:07:50.000'),(302,1116,'1116',1214,'236d33c7-52c2-47c2-9d91-8289ee07ebac','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Mukesh Gupta','mukeshgupta.31@gmail.com',9417217902,0,0,'B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PC0019','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','rera@waveestate.in',0,0,' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali).',28,507,'140308','1',' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali).',28,507,'140308','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">I had booked independent first floor in Wave\r\nEstate, Sector-99 under subvention scheme in Feb’2013 by making initial payment\r\nof Rs. 3,00,000/- vide cheque no. 60113 dated 08.02.2013. Next payment was made\r\nvide cheque no. 60117 dated 19.04.2013 amounting Rs. 3,18,540/-. It was\r\ncommitted to make delivery within 2 years.&nbsp;However, M/s Country Colonisers\r\nPvt. Ltd. executed the agreement on 07.02.2015 as per which possession was to\r\nbe offered within 24 months along with an extended grace period of 6 months.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Accordingly, I arranged for accommodation on\r\nrent in Apr’2017 and have been paying both rent and EMIs as the subvention\r\nperiod had lapsed. Due to inordinate delay I lost faith in the project and\r\nrequested the developers through e-mails to refund my deposits. However there\r\nwas no response from their end as they continued to defer possession and\r\nprogress on site was very slow. After a lot of follow-up developer agreed to settle\r\nonly pre-EMI interest from Aug’17 (24+6 months from date of agreement) onwards against\r\nbalance sale consideration and offered to deliver possession in Mar’18.\r\nDeveloper even failed to meet that deadline and possession has not been offered\r\ntill date.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">After so much of agony, I do not want to remain\r\nassociated with the developer and request for return of all deposits (including\r\nEMIs) with interest.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">In\r\nlight of the case facts association with the project has not only been loss of\r\ntime, money and effort but has caused a lot of mental harassment.&nbsp; It is therefore requested to refund entire\r\ndeposits including EMIs paid to bank with interest. It is also requested to\r\ncompensate on account of mental harassment. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Time\r\nis of essence in such contracts and complainants cannot be expected to wait indefinitely\r\nfor the respondent to</span> complete the project and hand over its possession\r\nat its free will. As such I waited for 6 years and there is enough ground for\r\nclaiming compensation.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p><br></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p><br></o:p></p>',4000000.00,3000000.00,'2017-08-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>It is prayed for stopping EMIs till final decision is ordered as I am burdened to pay both EMIs and rental.</p>','1','','2015-02-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','40, First Floor, Wave Estate, Sector-99, Mohali','','',1,0,0,0,'mukesh013128','2018-11-15 13:20:56.000','mukesh013128','2018-11-15 13:20:56.000'),(303,1117,'1117',1212,'0eb896ad-0693-424e-8920-7bac072f4176','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Amardeep Singh Bains','bains_11@hotmail.com',9501118451,0,0,'house no 103, VPO;BAINSTANIWAL,','201, URBAN ESTATE Patiala',28,248,'144105','1','house no 201,urban estate , PHASE 1','201 ,URBAN ESTATE ,PHASE -1 ,PATIALA',28,454,'147002','','',0,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-LUD45-PR0386','IREO WATER FRONT PVT LTD.C-14 FIRST FLOOR .MALVIYA NAGAR,SOUTH DELHI .DELHI -110017','Amardeep Singh Bains','bains_11@hotmail.com',9501118451,0,'house no 201.Urban Estate ,Phase -1,Patiala','house no 103,VPO -Bainstaniwal,Dist Hoshiarpur',28,248,'147001','1','house no 201.Urban Estate ,Phase -1,Patiala','house no 103,VPO -Bainstaniwal,Dist Hoshiarpur',28,248,'147001','1','<p>I was allocated a&nbsp; plot name 099 at ireo waterfront at Ludhiana on 19 NOV 15 ,</p><p>And the possession of the same was due within 24 month .</p><p>possession is still not been done &amp; the work is a complete halt.i have sent emails for the same but no one has responded about the same.</p><p><br></p><p>REquest you to please give a&nbsp; refund of the same .</p>','<p>complete amount refund with interest in delay of possession&nbsp;&amp; the interest paid by me to the bank till date for the loan taken against the plot.</p>',2836399.00,2639427.00,'2017-11-19 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>complete amount refund with interest in delay of possession&nbsp;&amp; the interest paid by me to the bank till date for the loan taken against the plot.<br></p>','1','','2015-11-19 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','099,','','',2,0,0,0,'Amardeep81','2018-11-15 19:01:57.000','Amardeep81','2018-11-15 19:01:57.000'),(304,1114,'1114',1038,'22fcbe23-e0a4-4755-9ab6-4ad928d16843','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-15 20:32:49.000','Tarun Arora','imemyself.arora@gmail.com',8557011367,0,0,'H n 17 Street No 1','OLD BISHAN NAGAR',28,454,'147001','0','H n 102 St no 7','Guru Nanak Enclave',28,454,'147001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-PTL63-PM0068','PUDA ENCLAVE 2 RAJPURA COLONY PATIALA \r\nPROMOTER :PUDA PATIALA','Estate Officer ,PUDA Patiala','pdapatiala@hotmail.com',0,1755020529,'Patiala urban Planning And Development Authority','Urban Estate, Phase II, Patiala',28,454,'147001','1','Patiala urban Planning And Development Authority','Urban Estate, Phase II, Patiala',28,454,'147001','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">I am allottee of Plot no.113 at PUDA Enclave -2\r\nRajpura colony ,Patiala (Punjab) registered&nbsp;<b>under RERA&nbsp; Regn No:\r\nPBRERA-PTL63-PM0068&nbsp;</b>.PUDA,Patiala had issued allotment letter of plot\r\nno.113 bearing Memo No.:P.U.D.A.- E.O./2016/14582 dated 06.12.2016 vide their\r\nMemo No. /PDA/2017/1520 dated 01.03.2017 (Attached)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b style=\"font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px;\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Total price of plot&nbsp;Rs.5578560/- was paid by me on 06.06.2017.</span></i></b><b style=\"font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px;\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">No dues certificate issued by PUDA attached. It is important to mention here that I have raised loan of Rs.50.00\r\nLakhs from Bank to make payment of plot purchase to PUDA</span></i></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: yellow;\">The possesion of the plot\r\nwas delayed and not given by cutoff date either by 06.03.2018.(As per Brochure)\r\nor by 06.06.2018(As per Allotment Letter)</span></u></i></b><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Meanwhile,PUDA sent me Offer letter &nbsp;to take possession of the plot within 30 days latest by\r\n30.08.2018 </span></i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">.<b><i><u><span style=\"background:\r\nyellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">On physically verifying the site I found that the\r\nproject is loaded with encumbrances i.e. Illegal establishments /Jhuggis of\r\nSlum Dwellers adjacent to my plot .Presence of such Illegal structures\r\n/Establishments was never published in the advertisements or brochure published\r\nby PUDA. (Photographs of Slum Dwellers and their establishments attached)</span></u></i></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: yellow;\">Under current\r\ncircumstances, it is not feasible for me to take possession of the plot and\r\nstart construction work at site since there is no safety /security owing to\r\nthreat posed by the slum dwellers with such an unhygienic environment that can\r\ncause serious health ailments due to presence of unbearable stink of faecal\r\nmatters/garbage</span></u></i></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: yellow;\">The said plot no. 113 allotted being offered with delayed possession\r\nwithout completion of development works as per sanctioned Layout plan loaded\r\nwith encumbrances/Illegal establishments /Jhuggis of Slum Dwellers\r\nadjacent to my plot&nbsp;and not revealed (probably deliberately) by PUDA at\r\nany stage ether in layout plan of the brochure or in advertisement is not\r\nhabitable.I have been cheated as PUDA is forcing me to accept possesion of plot on which a normal human being cannot even stand due to stink/unhygiene.</span></u></i></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">i) Sub\r\nsection18 (1) of Section 1 of Real Estate (Regulation and Development Act) 2016\r\nand&nbsp;Section 18(1) 19(4)19(7) and 84(2) (i) (j) (k) of Punjab State Real\r\nEstate (Regulation and Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;<b>to withdraw my\r\nallotment under this project and seek full refund of the money already paid as\r\nfull cost of the plot i.e. Rs.5578560/- along with interest at 12 % p.a. (The\r\nsame interest which PUDA charges from allottees) from respective dates of payments</b>&nbsp;as\r\nDeveloper PUDA has cheated me by not disclosing presence of such jhuggis\r\nanywhere in the brochure or advertisement adjacent to my plot making the site\r\nnot fit and safe for habitation.</span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></i><i style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: yellow;\">PUDA is forcing me to accept possesion of plot on which a normal human being cannot even stand due to stink/unhygiene.Even after paying them my entire life savings I am being asked to live adjacent to Jhuggis .</span></u></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></i></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b><o:p></o:p></b></span></i></p>',5578560.00,5578560.00,'2018-06-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b>I would also request the authority to pass\r\na restraining order addressed to my financing Bank (Bank of India, Shree Ganesh\r\nComplex, GT Road, Khanna District Ludhiana State Punjab) to not impose\r\ncommercial rate of interest on the loan as I have not been able to complete\r\nconstruction on the said plot due to lapses and delays by PUDA in non-completion\r\nof development activities on time and forcing possession of plot adjacent to\r\njhuggis (not mentioned in Brochure or anywhere) and different from layout plan approved\r\nby the competent authority</b></span></i><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>I am not at fault for any delays and seek interim relief from Honorable Authority.</o:p></p>','1','','2018-12-06 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Plot No 113 ,PUDA Enclave 2 Rajpura Colony Patiala (Punjab)\r\n147001','','',1,1,0,0,'Sbala60','2018-11-15 20:32:43.000','Sbala60','2018-11-15 20:32:43.000'),(305,1118,'1118',1085,'416c72a3-a2db-42db-9e91-50fe152da8ff','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Mohinder Jit Kaur','mishrasatty7@gmail.com',7888356908,7888356908,0,'#781-A, HIG Flats,','Phase-9',28,507,'160062','1','#781-A, HIG Flats,','Phase-9',28,128,'160062','Satish Mishra','advocatesatish7@gmail.com',9988817966,9988817966,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0022','Gateway City','Punjab Urban Planning & Development Authority (PUDA) through ESTATE OFFICER','helpdesk@puda.gov.in',1722215202,1722215202,'PUDA Bhawan','Sector 62',28,507,'160055','1','PUDA Bhawan','Sector 62',28,507,'160055','1','<p>1 That the respondent issued Letter of Intent (LOI) to applicant for residential Plot no. 165/Park Facing measuring 400 Sq. Yard, Sector 118-119, Gateway City, S.A.S Nagar, Mohali- 160055 dated 24.8.2015 in reference to application Form No. 10457. The Letter of Intent (LOI) is hereby appended as Annexure A-1.&nbsp;</p><p>2 That in furtherance of Letter of Intent (LOI), Allotment Letter appended as Annexure A-2 dated 26.8.2016 was issued to applicant. The tentative price of the plot is Rs. 88,20,000/- at the rate of Rs. 21,000/- Rs/Sq. Yard.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>3 That in pursuance to Allotment Letter, Applicant made following payments as per the payment schedule and financial conditions stated in letter:</p><p>S.no<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Date<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Mode<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Type<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Amount</p><p>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>15.1.2015<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Bank Transfer<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Earnest Money<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>8,40,000/-</p><p>2<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>18.3.2016<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>DD<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Allotment Money<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>12,60,000/-</p><p>3<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>21.3.2016<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>DD<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Installment<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>1,52,000/-</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Cancer Cess 2%<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>1,68,000/-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Total Amt.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>24,20,000/-</p><p>Thus, till date Rs. 24,20,000/- has been paid by Applicant to the respondent as per statement of account appended as Annexure A-3</p><p>&nbsp;4 That as per the Allotment Letter dated 26.8.2016, the possession of the said plot in question was to be given within 18 months from the date of issuance of allotment which is already over i.e. 26.2.2018 Thus, the respondent has failed to handover possession within the stipulated time as written in the allotment letter agreed between the parties.&nbsp;</p><p>5 The respondent has yet to give reply to Applicant whether they have got the Occupancy Certificate/Completion Certificate for the said plot or not? Respondent has been avoiding this question for too long since the Allotment letter was issued.&nbsp;</p><p>6 That the said project promoted by respondent lacks basic infrastructure like roads, poor connectivity, drains, electricity, water supply, green cover, street lights missing, roads without berm, no security or police post. Owing to these factors only applicant has stopped further payments and thus defaulted according to respondent.&nbsp;</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">1 Refund of the\r\nAmount i.e. Rs. 24,20,000/- with same interest as stated by respondent for the buyer\r\nin the agreement plus Compensation for delay in possession under </span></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Section\r\n18</span></b></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"> in contravention to\r\nAllotment Letter and in consonance with provisions of RERA Act which is SBI\r\nMCLR plus 2%. </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">2 Compensation for\r\ninability/failure to discharge obligations as per Allotment Letter and RERA Act\r\nunder </span></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Section 18 (3)</span></i></b></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"> lacking in basic services which was initially\r\npromised and no disclosure about status of Completion Certificate/Occupancy\r\nCertificate before handing over the possession.</span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">3\r\nCompensation on account of mental agony, pain and litigation expenses upto Rs.\r\n2 lakh as illustrated in the Section 72 of the RERA Act. </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">4 Any other appropriate remedy or\r\nrelief which this court may deem fit in the present circumstances may also be\r\nawarded in the favour of Appli</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">cant.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>',8820000.00,2420000.00,'2018-02-26 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>1 That the respondent be restrained from imposing any penalty in whatsoever form it may be against the complainant till the pendency and final outcome of the case as the complainant has stopped making any further payments in lieu of failure to handover the possession within the stipulated timeframe as written in allotment letter i.e. 26.2.2018.</p><p>2 That the respondent be further stopped from initiating any legal proceeding, criminal or civil case or administrative order or any action whatsoever it may be against the complainant arising out of the same transaction i.e. related to Plot no. 165/Park Facing, Sector 118-119, Gateway City, S.A.S Nagar, Mohali- 160055</p><p>3 That the respondent be curtailed from siphoning of the funds which is already paid by complainant i.e. Rs. 24,20,000/- in whatsoever manner it may be. No deductions or fine or forfeiture of money be allowed till the pendency of present complaint.&nbsp;</p><p>4 That No action may kindly be taken on administrative side against complainant for not making the future payments and the right of complainant to seek refund of Rs. 24,20,000/- may kindly be protected till the final disposal of complaint. This may kindly be seen in the light of order dated 02.11.2018 by Adjudicating Officer of this very hon\'ble forum where Complaint no. ADC/1011/2018 instituted on 31.08.2018 has been ordered to be returned to the complainant in view of circular bearing no. RERA/Pb/.ENF/14 dated 29.10.2018 , relevant is item no. 7.4 i.e. Role of the Adjudicating officer in the context of complaint in form \'M\' and \'N\'.&nbsp;</p><p>5 That the complaint may be revived from the same stage where the above Complaint no. ADC/1011/2018 instituted on 31.08.2018 is returned vide order dated 02.11.2018 in the interest of justice and complainant\'s interest since no prejudice will be caused to either of the parties.</p><p>6 Any other relief temporary or be it permanent which this authority may deem fit may also be granted in the favour of complainant.&nbsp;</p>','1','','2016-08-26 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Plot no. 165/Park Facing, Sector 118-119, Gateway City, S.A.S Nagar, Mohali- 160055','','',2,0,0,0,'Satish','2018-11-15 22:46:29.000','Satish','2018-11-15 22:46:29.000'),(306,1118,'1118',1085,'416c72a3-a2db-42db-9e91-50fe152da8ff','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-16 11:44:06.000','Mohinder Jit Kaur','mishrasatty7@gmail.com',7888356908,7888356908,0,'#781-A, HIG Flats,','Phase-9',28,507,'160062','1','#781-A, HIG Flats,','Phase-9',28,128,'160062','Satish Mishra','advocatesatish7@gmail.com',9988817966,9988817966,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0022','Gateway City','Punjab Urban Planning & Development Authority (PUDA) through ESTATE OFFICER','helpdesk@puda.gov.in',1722215202,1722215202,'PUDA Bhawan','Sector 62',28,507,'160055','1','PUDA Bhawan','Sector 62',28,507,'160055','1','<p>1 That the respondent issued Letter of Intent (LOI) to applicant for residential Plot no. 165/Park Facing measuring 400 Sq. Yard, Sector 118-119, Gateway City, S.A.S Nagar, Mohali- 160055 dated 24.8.2015 in reference to application Form No. 10457. The Letter of Intent (LOI) is hereby appended as Annexure A-1.&nbsp;</p><p>2 That in furtherance of Letter of Intent (LOI), Allotment Letter appended as Annexure A-2 dated 26.8.2016 was issued to applicant. The tentative price of the plot is Rs. 88,20,000/- at the rate of Rs. 21,000/- Rs/Sq. Yard.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>3 That in pursuance to Allotment Letter, Applicant made following payments as per the payment schedule and financial conditions stated in letter:</p><p>S.no<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Date<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Mode<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Type<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Amount</p><p>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>15.1.2015<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Bank Transfer<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Earnest Money<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>8,40,000/-</p><p>2<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>18.3.2016<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>DD<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Allotment Money<span style=\"white-space:pre\"