MEADOWS 1','ATS ESTATES PRIVATE LIMITED','pradeep.rathee@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS TOWER, PLOT NO.16','SECTOR 35, NOIDA',33,216,'201305','1','ATS TOWER, PLOT NO.16','SECTOR 35, NOIDA',33,216,'201305','1','<p>Facts in Brief</p><p>i<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the complainant is a citizen of India and is residing at the above mentioned address. The Aadhar card of the complainant is annexed as ANNEXURE C 1. The complainant has given his hard earned money in the OPs Project ATS GOLF MEADOWS I situated in Dera Bassi SAS Nagar Mohali Punjab for purchasing the residential plot based on assurance and promises of the OP which later on proved to be the false assurances and promises.</p><p><br></p><p>ii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the opposite party is a Company and has at all material points of time been and is still engaged in the commercial business of developing and selling housing projects flats plots and other construction layouts to various individuals and or others in lieu of valuable considerations for profit being their primary objective.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>iii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the OP is a Builder Company and as part of their business venture decided to develop a residential space in the name of ATS GOLF MEADOWS I situated in Dera bassi SAS Nagar Punjab. The OP Builder had published various web and news advertisements as well as visual advertisements to attract the public at large to purchase residential space in the said project The OP had promised the complainant state of the art residential spaces that are affordable yet modern and well equipped residential project within a stipulated time period.</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Rest of the Facts of the case is enclosed as a complaint</p>','<p>Relief Sought</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to compensate the complainant in the shape of refund of the complete amount which has been deposited against the residential property so booked by the complainant along with an Interest on the amount from the date of deposit at the rate of 20 per sent&nbsp; till the actual realization of the complete amount within 90 days according to section 18 1 Real Estate Regulation And Development Act 2016 18 2 Real Estate Regulation And Development Act 2016 Section 19 4 of The Real Estate Regulation And Development Act 2016 r w Rule 16 and Rule 17 of Punjab State Real Estate Regulation and Development Rules 2017</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Rest of the relief Sought of the case is enclosed as a complaint</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Not Prayed</p>','1','','2009-04-25 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2018-11-19 16:26:19.000','lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2018-11-19 16:26:19.000'),(328,1127,'1127',1066,'3568b05d-bd51-44d0-b387-09a3505b7441','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','GVStar Estates LLP LLP','ramsingh.dil@gmail.com',8699904514,0,0,'House no 726, Sector 2 Panchkula','',13,15,'134102','1','House no 2322 sector 66 mohali','',28,507,'160062','Neeraj Sobti','Advocatesobti@yahoo.co.in',9872279500,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','FALCON VIEW,PHASE-II,SECTOR 66-A, MOHALI','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS LTD','janta@jantahousing.com',8284045724,1722294000,'SCO 39-42, sector 82','industrial area , mohali',28,507,'160062','1','SCO 39-42, sector 82','industrial area , mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nmso-hyphenate:none\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">That, in the year 2013, the\r\nRespondents made a number of assurances through various newspapers, marketing\r\nemails and telemarketing with regard to launching of their integrated\r\nresidential project under the name and style of “FALCON VIEW”, in Phase-II,\r\n(wrongly mentioned as Phase-I, in allotment letter dated 02.08.2013, Annexure\r\nC-1) Sector 66-A, Mohali, having salient features&nbsp;as such, the applicant\r\nmet the representative of the Respondents for the purchase of a residential\r\napartment in their said project. The Respondents assured that since the\r\ndevelopment activity, at the site, had started in full swing, as such, on\r\nbooking the apartment, in the said project, possession thereof, complete in all\r\nrespects, would be handed over to the purchasers, within a maximum period of 30\r\nmonths, from the date of execution of the Allotment Letter.</span><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; font-weight: 700;\">upto 01.02.2016</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">That applicant vide\r\ntheir application dated 02.04.2013 applied for an apartment and accordingly 4\r\nBHK Apartment i.e. No. E-401, 4<sup>th</sup> Floor, wing E, Facing Green,\r\nFalcon View, Phase-II, (wrongly mentioned as Phase-I, in allotment letter dated\r\n02.08.2013, Annexure C-1) Sector 66-A, Mohali, Punjab, measuring 3007 sq. ft.,\r\n@Rs.3,600/- per sq. ft., was allotted in favor of the applicant vide Allotment\r\nLetter dated 02.08.2013, along with details of plot and the total sale\r\nconsideration amount was fixed as Rs.1,08,25,200/-.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><b style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;That in-spite of the receipt of substantial amount against the said apartment the respondents have failed to complete the said apartment and further failed to offer the possession of the said apartment upto 01.02.2016.&nbsp;</span></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><b style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">That recently the applicant have come to know that the entire project of the respondents is illegal as the respondent have started the construction of the project without obtaining clearance from the environment and forest department as required under notification dated 14.09.2006 and the State Level Environment Impact Assessment Authority (SEIAA) had already initiated action against.<br></span><br></b></span><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:97%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:97%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:Times\">In view of the facts\r\nmentioned in paragraph 4 above, the complainant prays for the following\r\nrelief(s)</span><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">That as\r\nthe respondents have failed to comply with the terms and conditions of the\r\nallotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (Annexure C-1) and have failed to deliver the\r\npossession of the apartment/flat within the stipulated time. Therefore, the\r\napplicant as per section 18 of the RERA Act. 2016, is entitled for</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Refund principal amount of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">10,580,830/- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">of the\r\napplicant </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">along</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> with interest @ 18% P.a. from the date of actual payment till\r\nrealization. <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Pay compensation of Rs.5,00,000/- to the applicant for mental\r\nharassment, mental agony <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">iii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><font face=\"Tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Any other relief which this Hon’ble authority deems fit may also\r\nbe passed in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">favour</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;of the applicant.</span></font><b style=\"font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><o:p></o:p></b></p>',10825200.00,0.00,'2016-02-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Interim Order date - 30.10.2018</p><p>The adjudicating officer now can not deal with the case of the refund and interest and for that purpose the complaint has to be filled in the Form-M before the authority . For compensation only ,the party may file complaint in form-N.Thus , in view of these circumstances, the Adjudicating officer lacks the jurisdiction to grant relief of refund or interest thereon. Therefore, in the larger interest of justice, the complaint is ordered to be returned to the complainant , who is at liberty to file a fresh complaint before the authority as per the decision of learned authority. Copy of this order&nbsp; be supplied to&nbsp; both&nbsp; the parties under rules.</p>','1','','2013-08-02 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat no- E401,4th floor, Wing E, \r\nPhase II, Sector 66-A mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'GVstarLLP','2018-11-19 17:27:03.000','GVstarLLP','2018-11-19 17:27:03.000'),(329,1111,'1111',1119,'dae2bb68-2fa2-473d-a49d-c15de93bd3da','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','RAJEEV SALWAN','advravinder@gmail.com',9815700280,0,0,'H. NO. 1462, PHASE 3B2','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160059','1','H. NO. 1462, PHASE 3B2','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160059','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0155','GOLF LINKS - I (RESIDENTIAL)','ANSAL PROPERTIES & INFRASTRUCTURE LTD.','info@ansalapi.com',0,0,'SCO NO. 183-184, SECTOR 9-C, CHANDIGARH','',6,128,'160009','1','SCO NO. 183-184, SECTOR 9-C, CHANDIGARH','',6,128,'160009','1','<p>Respondents offered a scheme of LAND POOLING under which&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;they are going to acquire/\r\npurchase land on Kharar - Landran road,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> Greater Mohali for which they have\r\ninvited finance from the general public and under the scheme it was offered\r\nthat for every 0.50 Acre of land, Respondent shall allot a developed residential plot measuring 500 Sq. Yards in\r\nthe township/ project which was to be developed on kharar landran road at Mohali within a period of Two Years from development agreement which was executed on 08.09.2011. Price consideration was agreed at Rs.60,00,000/-. On 11.02.2014, allotment of Plot No.401, Sector 114 Ansal Golf Liks - 1, Mohali issued to complainants without informing its location and surroundings. Offered possession of said plot on 14.08.2014 and delivered the possession of the plot on the same day to which there was no approach road, plot level was much down to the road level, running dirty drain just behind the drain which was never disclosed to the complainants. On 25.09.2014 Plot Buyer\'s Agreement was executed and surprisingly price of the plot was increased by another Rs.15,00,000/- besides cost of EDC and IDC. This increase was done under the garb of PLC for Corner Plot without informing that there is a Dirty Drain running just behind the plot of the complainants.&nbsp; Till date Complainants have already paid an amount of Rs.84,05,365/-. Complainant wrote regd. letter dated 10.10.2014 to respondents seeking refund of overcharged amount. Paper possession of un-developed&nbsp; and inhabitable plot with running dirty drain just at its back was given on 20.07.2015 to the complainants. No approved layout was shown to the complainants till date. The said dirty drain is stinking so badly due to urinal and sewage waste of nearby villages and swaraj tractor factory which is very near to the complex. The drain is a breeding ground for mosquitoes, insects and flies. Plot level is down by 10-12 ft from the road level. Complaint made to GMADA. GMADA Sought reply.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">a).&nbsp;&nbsp; Relocation of the plot no. 401 measuring 500\r\nsq. yards be done to a suitable place, as per the choice of the complainants,\r\nat a preferable location (Corner Plot) with all amenities, facilities like\r\nroad, sewerage and water connection, metalled roads, street lights, levelling of\r\nplot at road level etc.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">b)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of the excess amount of\r\nRs.15,00,000/- charged from the complainants on account of PLC;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">c)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Respondents be directed to provide the proof\r\nof the EDC/ IDC deposited by the respondents with the GMADA/ any other\r\ncompetent authority out of the amount charged from the complainants.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">d)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Respondents may be restrained to demand the\r\nmaintenance charges till the time relocation to a habitable plot is not done.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">e).&nbsp;&nbsp; Pay interest @18% per annum from the dates of\r\nrespective payments till the date of actual realization of the amount;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">f).&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pay compensation to the tune of\r\nRs.10,00,000/- for the delayed possession mental harassment and agony caused to\r\nit by the respondents; and<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">g).&nbsp;&nbsp; Pay Rs.1,10,000/- as the litigation charges\r\nand expenses incurred by it.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">h).&nbsp;&nbsp; Order any other relief that this Hon’ble\r\nCourt, SAS Nagar, Mohali, Pujab may deem fit and proper in the circumstances of\r\nthe present complaint.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:56.7pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">IN\r\nCASE RESPONDENTS FAILS TO RELOCATE THE PLOT AS PRAYED ABOVE, ALTERNATIVELY &nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:84.3pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-27.6pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund entire deposited amount of Rs.84,05,365/-.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">j).&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pay interest @18% per annum from the dates\r\nof respective payments till the date of actual realization of the amount;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">k).&nbsp;&nbsp; Pay compensation to the tune of\r\nRs.10,00,000/- for the delayed possession mental harassment and agony caused to\r\nit by the respondents; and<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">l).&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pay Rs.1,10,000/- as the litigation charges\r\nand expenses incurred by it.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">m).&nbsp; Order any other relief that this Hon’ble\r\nCourt, SAS Nagar, Mohali, Punjab may deem fit and proper in the circumstances\r\nof the present complaint.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',6000000.00,8405365.00,'2013-09-08 00:00:00.000','2015-07-20 00:00:00.000','<p>Respondents may be directed to deposit principle amount of Rs.84,05,365/- paid by the complainants to the Respondents before this Hon\'ble Court till decision of the present case.</p>','1','','2014-02-11 00:00:00','2011-09-08 00:00:00','plot no. 401 sector 114 golf Links - 1 Mohali.','','',2,0,0,0,'advravinder','2018-11-19 18:45:03.000','advravinder','2018-11-19 18:45:03.000'),(330,1113,'1113',1213,'884b4d58-4c66-46bb-bc48-a198d34830a7','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Prashant Kathuria','prashantkathuria@gmail.com',9855658178,0,0,'H. No. 2, Near Police Lines','Opposite DAV Public School, Amritsar',28,39,'143001','1','H. No. 2, Near Police Lines','Opposite DAV Public School, Amritsar',28,39,'143001','Ved Parkash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0124','Acme Eden Court','Acme Builders Pvt. Ltd.','contact@acmebuilders.in',8592122888,0,'GH-10, Sector-90-91','JLPL, Mohali',28,507,'160022','1','GH-10, Sector-90-91','JLPL, Mohali',28,507,'160022','1','<div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CONCISE STATEMENT OF FACTS AND GROUNDS OF COMPLAINT</div><div><br></div><ul><li>That the respondent has purchased land for the purpose of developing group Housing Colony from the Master Developer (Janta Land Promoters Limited) who is the owner of land in Sector 91,SAS Nagar, District Mohali in the State of Punjab and developing township project under the name and style of “JLPL Township in Sector 90-91 in accordance with the approval granted by the Town and Country Planning Department Punjab.</li></ul><div><br></div><ul><li>That the respondent is developing Group Housing on land so purchased from the Master Developer under all approvals from the Master Developer that are under the provisions of laws of State of Punjab.</li></ul><div><br></div><ul><li>That respondent is developing Group Housing under the name and style of “Acme Eden Court” in the “JLPL Township” Sector 90-91, SAS Nagar, District Mohali. The respondent has been vested with rights to execute all agreements, issue allotments and re-allotments, collect monies, construct the areas purchased by it and market the products and act on behalf of the Master Developer for all reasons for the benefit of this agreement.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>The Other Details are continued in the Annexure to the complaint.</p></div><div><br></div>','<ul><li><li>That the respondent has also revised the layout plans of the residential project twice which has shattered the confidence of the applicant. The applicant wishes to withdraw from the project on account of abnormal delay in completing development works, changes in original layout plan without the consent of the applicant and other allottees.</li><li>As per clause 15 of the Builder Buyer Agreement, the possession of the allotted unit was to be offered within 36 months from the date of signing of the said agreement i.e. on 17.01.2016 which has already expired.</li><li>The provisions of RERA for ongoing projects provide equal rights to the existing allottees, who have signed contracts before the commencement of the Act. Therefore the applicant is seeking relief under the provisions of RERA.&nbsp;</li><li>In view of the points above, it is clearly established that the respondent has violated the provisions of Section 12, 14, 18 &amp; 19 of Real Estate (Development &amp; Regulations) Act, 2016.</li><li>It, is therefore, humbly prayed that the Hon’ble Authority may consider the applicant’s submissions and order the respondent to refund our total amount of Rs. 92,87,213/- along with interest as per RERA provisions from the respective dates of payments made to the respondent and a compensation of Rs. 10,00,000/- for the economic and mental sufferings to the applicant.</li><li></li></li></ul><div><br></div>',9287213.00,0.00,'2016-01-17 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NIL','1','','2012-12-16 00:00:00','2013-01-17 00:00:00','Unit No. 802, Tow-T1, Eight Floor, GH-10, Sector-90-91, JLPL, Mohali (Pb)','','',2,0,0,0,'kathuria.prashant','2018-11-19 18:46:36.000','kathuria.prashant','2018-11-19 18:46:36.000'),(331,1113,'1113',1213,'884b4d58-4c66-46bb-bc48-a198d34830a7','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Prashant Kathuria','prashantkathuria@gmail.com',9855658178,0,0,'H. No. 2, Near Police Lines','Opposite DAV Public School, Amritsar',28,39,'143001','1','H. No. 2, Near Police Lines','Opposite DAV Public School, Amritsar',28,39,'143001','Ved Parkash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0124','Acme Eden Court','Acme Builders Pvt. Ltd.','contact@acmebuilders.in',8592122888,0,'GH-10, Sector-90-91','JLPL, Mohali',28,507,'160022','1','GH-10, Sector-90-91','JLPL, Mohali',28,507,'160022','1','<div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CONCISE STATEMENT OF FACTS AND GROUNDS OF COMPLAINT</div><div><br></div><ul><li>That the respondent has purchased land fo