e applicant.</li><li></li></ul><div><br></div>',9287213.00,0.00,'2016-01-17 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NIL','1','','2012-12-16 00:00:00','2013-01-17 00:00:00','Unit No. 802, Tow-T1, Eight Floor, GH-10, Sector-90-91, JLPL, Mohali (Pb)','','',2,0,0,0,'kathuria.prashant','2018-11-20 14:53:35.000','kathuria.prashant','2018-11-20 14:53:35.000'),(335,1113,'1113',1213,'884b4d58-4c66-46bb-bc48-a198d34830a7','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Prashant Kathuria','prashantkathuria@gmail.com',7009180831,0,0,'H. No. 2, Near Police Lines','Opposite DAV Public School, Amritsar',28,39,'143001','1','H. No. 2, Near Police Lines','Opposite DAV Public School, Amritsar',28,39,'143001','Ved Parkash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0124','Acme Eden Court','Acme Builders Pvt. Ltd.','contact@acmebuilders.in',8592122888,0,'GH-10, Sector-90-91','JLPL, Mohali',28,507,'160022','1','GH-10, Sector-90-91','JLPL, Mohali',28,507,'160022','1','<div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CONCISE STATEMENT OF FACTS AND GROUNDS OF COMPLAINT</div><div><br></div><ul><li>That the respondent has purchased land for the purpose of developing group Housing Colony from the Master Developer (Janta Land Promoters Limited) who is the owner of land in Sector 91,SAS Nagar, District Mohali in the State of Punjab and developing township project under the name and style of “JLPL Township in Sector 90-91 in accordance with the approval granted by the Town and Country Planning Department Punjab.</li></ul><div><br></div><ul><li>That the respondent is developing Group Housing on land so purchased f