opment as per agreed terms and conditions to be done by the respondents.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">2. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;The respondent should refund interest which has been charged by them. </span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">3. &nbsp; &nbsp; The respondent should pay interest on amount which has been paid to it under section 18 of RERA act,2016.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">4. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;The respondent shall be directed to pay the compensation of Rs. 10,00,000/- on account of mental agony and litigation charges.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">5. &nbsp; &nbsp;The respondent should not change plan of site and should restore my original plot. <br><o:p></o:p></span></p>',9450000.00,9450000.00,'2017-01-22 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 32px; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\">1. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;The respondents shall be directed to hand over the possession alongwith entire development as per agreed terms and conditions to be done by the respondents.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 32px; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\">2. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;The respondent should refund interest which has been charged by them.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 32px; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\">3. &nbsp; &nbsp; The respondent should pay interest on amount which has been paid to it under section 18 of RERA act,2016.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 32px; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\">4. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;The respondent shall be directed to pay the compensation of Rs. 10,00,000/- on account of mental agony and litigation charges.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 32px; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\">5. &nbsp; &nbsp;The respondent should not change plan of site and should restore my original plot.&nbsp;</span></p>','1','','2016-10-22 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','482','','',1,1,0,0,'akhilesh','2018-11-21 16:54:11.000','akhilesh','2018-11-21 16:54:11.000'),(341,1087,'1087',1135,'7ce4ff29-c893-46aa-aac9-b9c5d5926814','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Prem Nath Sharma','akhilesh@vyaslawassociates.com',9815065180,0,0,'3549, Bank Wali Gali, Vijay Nagar, Batala road, Amritsar','',28,39,'143001','1','3549, Bank Wali Gali, Vijay Nagar, Batala road, Amritsar','',28,39,'143001','akhilesh vyas','akhilesh@vyaslawassociates.com',9855004557,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASR02-PR0169','Guru Ram Dass Urban Estate','Punjab Urban Planning Development Authority','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA Bhawan','green avenue',28,39,'143001','1','PUDA Bhawan','green avenue',28,39,'143001','1','<p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.35pt;margin-left:\r\n0in;line-height:16.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">That the complainant was\r\nallotted residential plot by Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority\r\n(hereinafter called as “PUDA”) bearing residential plot No. 334 measuring 300\r\nSq. Yards at Guru Ram Dass Urban Estate Airport Road, Amritsar. The total price\r\nof the residential plot of Rs. 54.00 lacs only @ Rs. 18000/- per Sq. Yard. As\r\nper the payment schedule given in the allotment letter 25% of the allotment\r\namount was to be paid initially and rest of the payment was to be paid after\r\nthe possession. The brochure of the scheme clearly reflects that possession on\r\n25% payment as per the allotment letter it admitted by the respondent that\r\npayment of Rs. 1350000/- was made by the applicant and it has already been\r\nadjusted towards initial 25% of the sale price of residential plot as mentioned\r\nin clause No. 3.1. For the balance payment of 75%, the complainant is always ready and willing to pay the amount as per schedule.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.35pt;margin-left:\r\n0in;line-height:16.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\">That no possession has been handed over up till now and there is no\r\ndevelopment at the site at all. Various letters, representations has been forwarded to the\r\nEstate Officer PUDA Amritsar and RTI applications have been filed to their\r\nofficers but nothing has resulted fruitful. The possession was scheduled to be\r\ngiven within 90 days after making payment of 25% but nothing has been done in\r\nthis regard. The complainant has approached earlier Hon\'ble Punjab and Haryana\r\nHigh court vide which their representation was decided and she withdrew the\r\nearlier petition for seeking relief under this act.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.35pt;margin-left:\r\n0in;line-height:16.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\">That the copy of the photographs of the site, RTI Application, letters to Estate Officers and order of High Court are attached for the kind perusal of the court.&nbsp;</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;\">i)<span style=\"font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Th</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif; line-height: 17.55pt; text-indent: -0.5in; font-size: 14px;\">e respondents shall be directed to hand over the possession\r\nalongwith entire development as per agreed terms and conditions to be done by\r\nthe respondents.&nbsp;</span></p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">ii)</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">That the respondent shall directed that applicant/ complainant is not liable to pay any amount by way of penal interest if any\r\ncharged by the respondent department. The respondent shall further be directed to refund any\r\npenal interest charged up till now as the delay any occurred is because of the\r\nconduct and acts of the respondent department. &nbsp;Further respondent shall be directed that the interest already paid shall be\r\nrefunded or interest amount which is\r\nalready&nbsp; been charged by the respondents\r\nshall stands adjusted in the future payments as the delay has occurred due to\r\nlapse on the part of the respondents.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">iii)</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">That the respondent shall be directed to pay sufficient compensation as per the statue &nbsp;to the complainant as they\r\nhave been denied their physical possession up till now without any explanatory\r\nreason by the department. &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">iv)</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">That as stated\r\nabove the extension was sought by the&nbsp;\r\ncomplainant for 180 days and during that period interest was charged by\r\nthe respondents. The respondents shall be directed to refund that interest\r\namount or adjust that amount in the principal amount in future payments.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>',5400000.00,1350000.00,'2017-03-02 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 34px; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Th</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif; line-height: 17.55pt; text-indent: -0.5in;\">e respondents shall be directed to hand over the possession alongwith entire development as per agreed terms and conditions to be done by the respondents.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 34px; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">ii)</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 34px; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">That the respondent shall directed that applicant/ complainant is not liable to pay any amount by way of penal interest if any charged by the respondent department. The respondent shall further be directed to refund any penal interest charged up till now as the delay any occurred is because of the conduct and acts of the respondent department. &nbsp;Further respondent shall be directed that the interest already paid shall be refunded or interest amount which is already&nbsp; been charged by the respondents shall stands adjusted in the future payments as the delay has occurred due to lapse on the part of the respondents.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 34px; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">iii)</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 34px; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">That the respondent shall be directed to pay sufficient compensation as per the statue &nbsp;to the complainant as they have been denied their physical possession up till now without any explanatory reason by the department. &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"line-height: 20px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 34px; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">iv)</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 34px; font-family: \'Bookman Old Style\', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">That as stated above the extension was sought by the&nbsp; complainant for 180 days and during that period interest was charged by the respondents. The respondents shall be directed to refund that interest amount or adjust that amount in the principal amount in future payments. &nbsp;</span></span></p>','1','','2016-12-02 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','334','','',2,0,0,0,'akhilesh','2018-11-21 17:06:05.000','akhilesh','2018-11-21 17:06:05.000'),(342,1129,'1129',1226,'5bc88368-bef1-4451-a36b-5d7ae9738025','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-22 11:08:31.000','Preeti Sudan','advmadhursharma@gmail.com',9780175460,0,0,'H.no 26, new moti bagh officers colony','',10,562,'110023','1','H.no 26, new moti bagh officers colony','',10,562,'110023','Madhur Sharma','advmadhursharma@gmail.com',9780175460,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0351','M/s. Sanskriti Golden Oak\r\nReal Estate Pvt. Ltd.,\r\nDLF Pocket R2, New\r\nChandigarh (Mullanpur),\r\nDistrict S.A.S. Nagar, \r\n','Ravi Garg','info@sanskritihomes.com',9501254111,0,'Ravi Garg S/o Ishwar Chamder, Flat no 204, Tower no.3 Royal Estate, Ambala Road,  zirakpur','M/s. Sanskriti Golden Oak Real Estate Pvt. Ltd., DLF Pocket R2, New Chandigarh (Mullanpur), ',28,507,'140603','0',' Ravi Garg S/o Ishwar Chamder, Flat no 204, Tower no.3 Royal Estate, Ambala Road,  zirakpur.',' Ravi Garg, Flat no 405, Tower no.18 Royal Estate, Ambala Road, near best price, zirakpur.',28,507,'140603','1','<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-align: justify;\">Th<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">at\r\nMs. Preeti Sudan, complainant had booked a Flat (SF2/R3/205/2) in the project “Sanskriti\r\nHomes in DLF” situated in Sector 3B, New Chandigarh (Mullanpur) [RERA\r\nRegistration no. PBRERA-SAS80PR0351] which was launched by the company\r\nSanskriti Golden Oak Real Estate Pvt. Ltdin 2014. The director and the one of\r\nthe main person of the company is Sh Ravi Garg S/o Ishwar Chander Garg R/o H no\r\n639 Sector 11-B, Chandigarh and Flat no 204, Tower no.3 Royal Estate, Ambala Road,\r\nnear best price, zirakpur, Mohali, Punjab and Flat no 405, Tower no.18 Royal\r\nEstate, Ambala Road, near best price, zirakpur, Mohali, Punjab. The company\r\n[M/s. Sanskriti Golden Oak Real Estate Pvt. Ltd., DLF Pocket R2, New Chandigarh\r\n(Mullanpur), District S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali] at the time of booking had promised\r\ncompletion of the project in 2 years. However, when it failed to even start the\r\nproject, I stopped making the payment and sought refund. The company kept on\r\nsending emails for making payments but there was no work on the ground. That Rs.15,38,700/-as\r\npayments was made to the company in 5 Installments. That when confronted Mr\r\nRavi Garg, Director, assured me the refund of booking amount and accordingly on\r\n8.9.2016 the original document of the flat were handed over to the company\r\nrepresentative Mr Bhushan Garg. However, for the last more then two years Mr\r\nRavi Garg has been not given back a single penny and is delaying the refund by\r\nmaking excuses. Everytime, when you ask him about the status of the refund, he\r\nseeks some time on one pretext or the other and then does not make the payment.\r\nAt one time he said that he will transfer the fund to my account through NEFT\r\nbut failed to do so. The same can be checked from his bank records. The\r\nallotment letter dated 11.06.2015 attached for your reference and also letter\r\ndated 08.09.2016 to refund the amount paid to them and giving back the original\r\ndocuments to them.</span></span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntab-stops:225.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:.5in;tab-stops:225.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Keeping in view this background, it requested that a\r\ncomplaint be lodged against Mr Ravi Garg and Sanskriti Golden Oak Real Estate\r\nPvt. Ltd for cheating, misrepresentation of facts and not refunding the money\r\nwith interest paid by me in spite of returning the original documents.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-indent: 0.5in;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:.5in;tab-stops:225.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">It is therefore, most respectfully and humbly prayed that\r\nthis Hon’ble forum may be please to:</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:225.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Award\r\nthe refund of the money (Rs.15,38,700/-) paid by the complainant to the\r\nRespondent.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:225.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Award\r\ninterest @24% with the effect from the date of signing of the allotment letter.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:225.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Award\r\nRs.5,00,000/- as compensation for harassment, pain and agony suffered by the\r\ncomplainant for having been cheated by the respondent.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:225.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:225.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">To pass any other order or relief that this\r\nHon’ble forum may deem fit in the interest of justice.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>',6484200.00,1538700.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Respondent may be order to refund the money given to him.','1','','2015-06-11 00:00:00','2015-07-25 00:00:00','SF2/R3/205/II','','',2,0,0,0,'advmadhursharma','2018-11-21 20:42:54.000','advmadhursharma','2018-11-21 20:42:54.000'),(343,1130,'1130',1085,'416c72a3-a2db-42db-9e91-50fe152da8ff','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Arvind Sharma ','arvindsharma_2005@hotmail.com',9811851750,9811851750,0,'A-44, A-Block, Pkt- OO','Sector-2, Rohini, ',10,440,'110085','1','A-44, A-Block, Pkt- OO','Sector-2, Rohini, ',10,440,'110085','Satish Mishra','advocatesatish7@gmail.com',9988817966,7888356908,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','Wave Floor Sector-99,  Block G ','M/s Country Colonizers Private Limited','postsales@waveestate.in',8194959697,8194959697,'Sector-85','',28,507,'140301','1','Sector-85','',28,507,'140301','1','<p>1 That Applicants entered into agreement with respondents for Property no. 6/Ground Floor in Wave Floor Sector 99, Block G, Mohali through ‘INDEPENDENT RESIDENTIAL FLOOR’ ALLOTEE(S) ARRANGEMENT vide Agreement Dt. 04.06.2015 duly signed by both parties appended as Annexure A-1. \r\n</p><p>2 That as per agreement, possession of unit was to be given on or before 03.12.2017 as per agreement including grace period of 6 months but intimation for possession was only offered on 27.3.2018, appended as Annexure A-2, 114 days late from prescribed deadline. It was agreed that on offering possession respondents would compensate for delay as per RERA. Also Payment Demand Notice appended as Annexure A-3 amounting to Rs. 7,19,600/- (Total) was sent by respondents on same date i.e. 27.3.2018. The account statement till 18.11.2017 is appended for reference as Annexure A-4. \r\n</p><p>3 That in pursuance to Payment Demand Notice, the applicants paid amounts Rs. 70,800/- for Electricity &amp; Water Connection Charges plus Power Back up , Rs. 2,35,200/-, &amp; Rs. 2,10,000/- for BSP-Intimation of Possession (Total Rs. 5,16,000/-) all through Cheque on 24.4.2018 in CCPL Wave Estate Block G RERA A/c. The payment receipt of all three payments is yet to be given by the respondents &amp; cheques appended as Annexure A-5. The applicants have not made the following payments owing to dispute: \r\n</p><p>1	Demand Against INC./DEC. AREA (26* 3962.26 sq. ft)	Rs. 1,03,018.98/-\r\n</p><p>2	Community Building Charges plus Annual Charges (Optional)	Rs. 75,000 + 5,000\r\n</p><p>3	IFMS (Interest Free Maintenance Security)	Rs. 89,756/-\r\n</p><p>4	Conveyance Deed Registration Expenses Sheet	Rs. 3,36,211/-\r\n</p><p>4 That the Email communication between the applicants &amp; respondents on the aforesaid issues has been  appended as Annexure A-6 (Colly). On 30.5.2018 after no satisfactory reply to concerns of applicants, a legal notice was sent  appended as Annexure A-7. \r\n</p><p>5 The respondents have not intimated whether they have Occupancy Certificate/Completion Certificate for&nbsp;</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">1 Relief as Compensation\r\nfor delay in possession under </span></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Section 18</span></b></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> in contravention to sale agreement and consonance\r\nwith provisions of RERA Act which is SBI MCLR plus 2%. </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">2 Increase in\r\nSaleable area unilaterally without intimation to the Applicants. Thus, for relief\r\nas compensation for misleading the Applicants and violating the provisions of\r\nsale agreement as well as </span></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Section\r\n14 (1) &amp; 14 (2)</span></i></b></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\nof RERA Act. </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">3 Relief as Compensation\r\nfor inviting to handover of possession with defects of seepage in the block violating\r\n</span></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Section 14(3)</span></i></b></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> of the RERA Act. </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">4 Relief as Compensation\r\nfor inability/failure to discharge obligations as per sale agreement and RERA\r\nAct under </span></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Section 18 (3)</span></i></b></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> lacking in basic services which was initially\r\npromised such as gated community with full-proof security, no disclosure about\r\nstatus of Occupancy Certificate before handing over the possession, no receipts\r\nof recent payments being made, no prompt and timely communication to the\r\nqueries as essence of time was clearly flouted, no clarification on upcoming\r\nmaintenance charges to Applicants.</span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>',4200000.00,0.00,'2017-12-03 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">1 That the respondent\r\nbe restrained from imposing any penalty in whatsoever form it may be against\r\nthe complainant till the pendency and final outcome of the case as the\r\ncomplainant has stopped making any further payments in lieu of failure to\r\nhandover the possession within the stipulated timeframe as written in agreement\r\ni.e. 04.06.2015.</span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:\r\n36.0pt;line-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">2 That the respondent\r\nbe further stopped from initiating any legal proceeding, criminal or civil case\r\nor administrative order or any action whatsoever it may be against the\r\ncomplainant arising out of the same transaction i.e. related to </span></span><i><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Property No. 6/Ground Floor in\r\nWave Floor Sector-99,</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Block G , Country\r\nColonisers Pvt Ltd – Mohali</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></i><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:windowtext\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">3 That the respondent\r\nbe curtailed from siphoning of the funds which is already paid by complainant\r\nin whatsoever manner it may be. No deductions or fine or forfeiture of money be\r\nallowed till the pendency of present complaint. </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">4 That No action may\r\nkindly be taken on administrative side against complainant for not making the\r\nfuture payments and the right of complainant to seek delayed compensation may\r\nkindly be protected till the final disposal of complaint. This may kindly be\r\nseen in the light of order dated 30.10.2018 by Adjudicating Officer of this\r\nvery hon\'ble forum where Complaint no. AC/53/2018 instituted on 17.07.2018 has\r\nbeen ordered to be returned to the complainant in view of circular bearing no.\r\nRERA/Pb/.ENF/14 dated 29.10.2018 , relevant is item no. 7.4 i.e. Role of the\r\nAdjudicating officer in the context of complaint in form \'M\' and \'N\'. </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">5 That the complaint\r\nmay be revived from the same stage where the above Complaint no. AC/53/2018\r\ninstituted on 17.07.2018 is returned vide order dated 30.10.2018 in the\r\ninterest of justice and complainant\'s interest since no prejudice will be\r\ncaused to either of the parties.</span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">6\r\nAny other relief temporary or be it permanent which this authority may deem fit\r\nmay also be granted in the favour of complainants.</span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2015-06-04 00:00:00','Property No. 6/Ground Floor in Wave Floor Sector-99,  Block G ,','','',2,0,0,0,'Satish','2018-11-22 09:20:40.000','Satish','2018-11-22 09:20:40.000'),(344,1130,'1130',1085,'416c72a3-a2db-42db-9e91-50fe152da8ff','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-22 19:18:03.000','Arvind Sharma ','arvindsharma_2005@hotmail.com',9811851750,9811851750,0,'A-44, A-Block, Pkt- OO','Sector-2, Rohini, ',10,440,'110085','1','A-44, A-Block, Pkt- OO','Sector-2, Rohini, ',10,440,'110085','Satish Mishra','advocatesatish7@gmail.com',9988817966,7888356908,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','Wave Floor Sector-99,  Block G ','M/s Country Colonizers Private Limited','postsales@waveestate.in',8194959697,8194959697,'Sector-85','',28,507,'140301','1','Sector-85','',28,507,'140301','1','<p>1 That Applicants entered into agreement with respondents for Property no. 6/Ground Floor in Wave Floor Sector 99, Block G, Mohali through ‘INDEPENDENT RESIDENTIAL FLOOR’ ALLOTEE(S) ARRANGEMENT vide Agreement Dt. 04.06.2015 duly signed by both parties appended as Annexure A-1. \r\n</p><p>2 That as per agreement, possession of unit was to be given on or before 03.12.2017 as per agreement including grace period of 6 months but intimation for possession was only offered on 27.3.2018, appended as Annexure A-2, 114 days late from prescribed deadline. It was agreed that on offering possession respondents would compensate for delay as per RERA. Also Payment Demand Notice appended as Annexure A-3 amounting to Rs. 7,19,600/- (Total) was sent by respondents on same date i.e. 27.3.2018. The account statement till 18.11.2017 is appended for reference as Annexure A-4. \r\n</p><p>3 That in pursuance to Payment Demand Notice, the applicants paid amounts Rs. 70,800/- for Electricity &amp; Water Connection Charges plus Power Back up , Rs. 2,35,200/-, &amp; Rs. 2,10,000/- for BSP-Intimation of Possession (Total Rs. 5,16,000/-) all through Cheque on 24.4.2018 in CCPL Wave Estate Block G RERA A/c. The payment receipt of all three payments is yet to be given by the respondents &amp; cheques appended as Annexure A-5. The applicants have not made the following payments owing to dispute: \r\n</p><p>1	Demand Against INC./DEC. AREA (26* 3962.26 sq. ft)	Rs. 1,03,018.98/-\r\n</p><p>2	Community Building Charges plus Annual Charges (Optional)	Rs. 75,000 + 5,000\r\n</p><p>3	IFMS (Interest Free Maintenance Security)	Rs. 89,756/-\r\n</p><p>4	Conveyance Deed Registration Expenses Sheet	Rs. 3,36,211/-\r\n</p><p>4 That the Email communication between the applicants &amp; respondents on the aforesaid issues has been  appended as Annexure A-6 (Colly). On 30.5.2018 after no satisfactory reply to concerns of applicants, a legal notice was sent  appended as Annexure A-7. \r\n</p><p>5 The respondents have not intimated whether they have Occupancy Certificate/Completion Certificate for&nbsp;</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">1 Relief as Compensation\r\nfor delay in possession under </span></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Section 18</span></b></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> in contravention to sale agreement and consonance\r\nwith provisions of RERA Act which is SBI MCLR plus 2%. </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">2 Increase in\r\nSaleable area unilaterally without intimation to the Applicants. Thus, for relief\r\nas compensation for misleading the Applicants and violating the provisions of\r\nsale agreement as well as </span></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Section\r\n14 (1) &amp; 14 (2)</span></i></b></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\nof RERA Act. </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">3 Relief as Compensation\r\nfor inviting to handover of possession with defects of seepage in the block violating\r\n</span></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Section 14(3)</span></i></b></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> of the RERA Act. </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">4 Relief as Compensation\r\nfor inability/failure to discharge obligations as per sale agreement and RERA\r\nAct under </span></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Section 18 (3)</span></i></b></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> lacking in basic services which was initially\r\npromised such as gated community with full-proof security, no disclosure about\r\nstatus of Occupancy Certificate before handing over the possession, no receipts\r\nof recent payments being made, no prompt and timely communication to the\r\nqueries as essence of time was clearly flouted, no clarification on upcoming\r\nmaintenance charges to Applicants.</span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>',4200000.00,0.00,'2017-12-03 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">1 That the respondent\r\nbe restrained from imposing any penalty in whatsoever form it may be against\r\nthe complainant till the pendency and final outcome of the case as the\r\ncomplainant has stopped making any further payments in lieu of failure to\r\nhandover the possession within the stipulated timeframe as written in agreement\r\ni.e. 04.06.2015.</span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:\r\n36.0pt;line-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">2 That the respondent\r\nbe further stopped from initiating any legal proceeding, criminal or civil case\r\nor administrative order or any action whatsoever it may be against the\r\ncomplainant arising out of the same transaction i.e. related to </span></span><i><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Property No. 6/Ground Floor in\r\nWave Floor Sector-99,</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Block G , Country\r\nColonisers Pvt Ltd – Mohali</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></i><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:windowtext\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">3 That the respondent\r\nbe curtailed from siphoning of the funds which is already paid by complainant\r\nin whatsoever manner it may be. No deductions or fine or forfeiture of money be\r\nallowed till the pendency of present complaint. </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">4 That No action may\r\nkindly be taken on administrative side against complainant for not making the\r\nfuture payments and the right of complainant to seek delayed compensation may\r\nkindly be protected till the final disposal of complaint. This may kindly be\r\nseen in the light of order dated 30.10.2018 by Adjudicating Officer of this\r\nvery hon\'ble forum where Complaint no. AC/53/2018 instituted on 17.07.2018 has\r\nbeen ordered to be returned to the complainant in view of circular bearing no.\r\nRERA/Pb/.ENF/14 dated 29.10.2018 , relevant is item no. 7.4 i.e. Role of the\r\nAdjudicating officer in the context of complaint in form \'M\' and \'N\'. </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">5 That the complaint\r\nmay be revived from the same stage where the above Complaint no. AC/53/2018\r\ninstituted on 17.07.2018 is returned vide order dated 30.10.2018 in the\r\ninterest of justice and complainant\'s interest since no prejudice will be\r\ncaused to either of the parties.</span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">6\r\nAny other relief temporary or be it permanent which this authority may deem fit\r\nmay also be granted in the favour of complainants.</span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2015-06-04 00:00:00','Property No. 6/Ground Floor in Wave Floor Sector-99,  Block G ,','','',1,1,0,0,'Satish','2018-11-22 10:02:10.000','Satish','2018-11-22 10:02:10.000'),(345,1131,'1131',1225,'fafedfd6-7d94-407d-bfcd-4cea99a9625a','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','J N Singh','jurisaxisrera@gmail.com',9816400801,0,0,'312 2, Rani Ka Bagh','Shimla Road, NAHAN',14,544,'173001','1','312 2, Rani Ka Bagh','Shimla Road, NAHAN',14,544,'173001','Kamal Dahiya','jurisaxisrera@gmail.com',9729902008,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','Palm Garden','Manohar Infrastructure and Constructions Private Limited','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725016888,'SCO 139 141 Level 1 Sector 17C','',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139 141 Level 1 Sector 17C','',6,128,'160017','1','<p>The complainant had purchased a plot in the said project having an approximate 250 sq. yard.</p><p>The complainant had made payment of Rs 13,87,500/- at the time of allotment, on which the respondent had issued a letter for expression of interest to the complainant dated 26.03.2012 -<b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Annexure C-1</span></b>&nbsp;</p><p>The respondent sent a letter and assured that they would deliver the possession of plot by year 2015 -<b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Annexure C-2</span></b></p><p>The respondent had issued a letter in 17.03.2014 wherein they requested for further sum of deposit to the tune of Rs. 9,25,000/- and assured that the project has reached its final stage and they would be in a position to deliver the possession of plot by 2015 -&nbsp;<b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Annexure C-3</span></b></p><p>That being influenced by the assurances and representations made by the respondent, the complainant paid Rs.15,00,000/- on the asking of the respondent vide cheque dated 09 Jan 2018 -<b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Annexure C-4</span></b></p><p>The respondent had allotted plot No. 702 admeasuring 250 sq. yard area in year 2018 to the complainant.&nbsp; The respondent had issued a letter to the complainant dated 02.02.2018 wherein the respondent levied the charges of IDC, PLC, Possession charges or any arbitrary charges which were not disclosed or agreed for at the time of initial booking of the plot -&nbsp;<b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Annexure C-5</span></b></p><p>It is pertinent to mention here that the respondent has the intention to cheat the complainant since the beginning as it is proved by the malafide act and conduct of the respondent.</p><p>The Complainant has paid INR 28,87,500/- i.e. more than 70% of payment out of total consideration i.e. Basic Sale Price, agreed at the time of booking the plot till Jan.18 -&nbsp;<b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Annexure- C-6</span></b></p><p>The possession of the project was committed in the month of March 2015 and now in the month of November 2018 i.e. delay of 44 months from the date of the commitment, only 30% project is completed thus delaying the possession of the plot deliberately or for reasons known best to them.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>','<p>In view of the facts mentioned in preceding paragraphs, the complainant prays for the following relief(s):-&nbsp;</p><p>i.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To give necessary directions to the respondents for delivery of possession of plot&nbsp; along with interest for delay in delivery of possession till realization as per the provisions of Sec. 18 and Sec.19(3)of the RERA Act read with Rule 16 of PBRE(R&amp;D)Rules,2017.</p><p>ii.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To impose penalty upon the respondents as per the provisions of Section 60 of RERA Act for willful default committed by them.</p><p>iii.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To impose penalty upon the respondents as per the provisions of Section 61 of RERA Act for contravention of Sec.12, Sec.14, and Sec. 16 of RERA Act.</p><p>iv.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To issue directions to make liable every officer concerned i.e. Director, Manager, Secretary, or any other officer of the respondent’s company at whose instance, connivance, acquiescence, neglect any of the offences has been committed as mentioned in Sec.69 of RERA Act,2016 to be read with Punjab RERA Rules,2017.</p><p>v.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To recommend criminal action against the respondents for the criminal offence of cheating, fraud and criminal breach of trust under section 420,406 and 409 of the Indian Penal Code.</p><p>vi.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To issue direction to pay the cost of litigation.</p><p>vii.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Any other relief which this Hon’ble Authority deem fit and appropriate in view of the facts and circumstances of this complaint.</p><div><br></div>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>-</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'JNSingh1','2018-11-22 11:34:52.000','JNSingh1','2018-11-22 11:34:52.000'),(346,1127,'1127',1066,'3568b05d-bd51-44d0-b387-09a3505b7441','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','GVStar Estates LLP LLP','ramsingh.dil@gmail.com',8699904514,0,0,'House no 726, Sector 2 Panchkula','',13,15,'134102','1','House no 726, Sector 2 Panchkula','',13,15,'134102','Neeraj Sobti','Advocatesobti@yahoo.co.in',9872279500,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','FALCON VIEW,PHASE-II,SECTOR 66-A, MOHALI','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS LTD','janta@jantahousing.com',8284045724,1722294000,'SCO 39-42, sector 82','industrial area , mohali',28,507,'160062','1','SCO 39-42, sector 82','industrial area , mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nmso-hyphenate:none\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">That, in the year 2013, the\r\nRespondents made a number of assurances through various newspapers, marketing\r\nemails and telemarketing with regard to launching of their integrated\r\nresidential project under the name and style of “FALCON VIEW”, in Phase-II,\r\n(wrongly mentioned as Phase-I, in allotment letter dated 02.08.2013, Annexure\r\nC-1) Sector 66-A, Mohali, having salient features&nbsp;as such, the applicant\r\nmet the representative of the Respondents for the purchase of a residential\r\napartment in their said project. The Respondents assured that since the\r\ndevelopment activity, at the site, had started in full swing, as such, on\r\nbooking the apartment, in the said project, possession thereof, complete in all\r\nrespects, would be handed over to the purchasers, within a maximum period of 30\r\nmonths, from the date of execution of the Allotment Letter.</span><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; font-weight: 700;\">upto 01.02.2016</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">That applicant vide\r\ntheir application dated 02.04.2013 applied for an apartment and accordingly 4\r\nBHK Apartment i.e. No. E-401, 4<sup>th</sup> Floor, wing E, Facing Green,\r\nFalcon View, Phase-II, (wrongly mentioned as Phase-I, in allotment letter dated\r\n02.08.2013, Annexure C-1) Sector 66-A, Mohali, Punjab, measuring 3007 sq. ft.,\r\n@Rs.3,600/- per sq. ft., was allotted in favor of the applicant vide Allotment\r\nLetter dated 02.08.2013, along with details of plot and the total sale\r\nconsideration amount was fixed as Rs.1,08,25,200/-.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><b style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;That in-spite of the receipt of substantial amount against the said apartment the respondents have failed to complete the said apartment and further failed to offer the possession of the said apartment upto 01.02.2016.&nbsp;</span></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><b style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">That recently the applicant have come to know that the entire project of the respondents is illegal as the respondent have started the construction of the project without obtaining clearance from the environment and forest department as required under notification dated 14.09.2006 and the State Level Environment Impact Assessment Authority (SEIAA) had already initiated action against.<br></span><br></b></span><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:97%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:97%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:Times\">In view of the facts\r\nmentioned in paragraph 4 above, the complainant prays for the following\r\nrelief(s)</span><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">That as\r\nthe respondents have failed to comply with the terms and conditions of the\r\nallotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (Annexure C-1) and have failed to deliver the\r\npossession of the apartment/flat within the stipulated time. Therefore, the\r\napplicant as per section 18 of the RERA Act. 2016, is entitled for</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Refund principal amount of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">10,580,830/- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">of the\r\napplicant </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">along</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> with interest @ 18% P.a. from the date of actual payment till\r\nrealization. <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Pay compensation of Rs.5,00,000/- to the applicant for mental\r\nharassment, mental agony <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">iii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><font face=\"Tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Any other relief which this Hon’ble authority deems fit may also\r\nbe passed in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">favour</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;of the applicant.</span></font><b style=\"font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><o:p></o:p></b></p>',10825200.00,0.00,'2016-02-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Interim Order date - 30.10.2018</p><p>The adjudicating officer now can not deal with the case of the refund and interest and for that purpose the complaint has to be filled in the Form-M before the authority . For compensation only ,the party may file complaint in form-N.Thus , in view of these circumstances, the Adjudicating officer lacks the jurisdiction to grant relief of refund or interest thereon. Therefore, in the larger interest of justice, the complaint is ordered to be returned to the complainant , who is at liberty to file a fresh complaint before the authority as per the decision of learned authority. Copy of this order&nbsp; be supplied to&nbsp; both&nbsp; the parties under rules.</p>','1','','2013-08-02 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat no- E401,4th floor, Wing E, \r\nPhase II, Sector 66-A mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'GVstarLLP','2018-11-22 12:09:49.000','GVstarLLP','2018-11-22 12:09:49.000'),(347,1127,'1127',1066,'3568b05d-bd51-44d0-b387-09a3505b7441','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-22 12:12:44.000','GVStar Estates LLP LLP','ramsingh.dil@gmail.com',8699904514,0,0,'House no 726, Sector 2 Panchkula','',13,15,'134102','1','House no 726, Sector 2 Panchkula','',13,15,'134102','Neeraj Sobti','Advocatesobti@yahoo.co.in',9872279500,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','FALCON VIEW,PHASE-II,SECTOR 66-A, MOHALI','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS LTD','janta@jantahousing.com',8284045724,1722294000,'SCO 39-42, sector 82','industrial area , mohali',28,507,'160062','1','SCO 39-42, sector 82','industrial area , mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nmso-hyphenate:none\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; fo