receipt (deposited with GMADA) was provided to complainants. PLC was illegally charged as adjoining the plot there is Ganda Nalah carrying Sewerage and Urinal Waste is flowing. Nallah also carrying long bushes, jungle and country grass all over. On another side of plot there is a jungle upto last boundry of complex. Plot is down by 2-3 feet from road and adjoining plots due to digging earth by Respondents to make the Katcha passage while constructing complex. Ganda Nalah was previously a Rainy Storm Water Drain in monsoon season, but from the last 2-3 years it was converted into sewerage and urinal waste of adjoining villages and swaraj mazda factory which is in the vicinity of complex. Now this Ganda Nallah running throughout the year which is breeding ground for mosquitoes,&nbsp; insects and dangerous reptiles like snakes. Infrastructure of complex like sewerage, lighting, roads, habitable environment are incomplete. Paper possession of the plot was given on 20.07.2015 concealing the material fact as mentioned above and falsely assured that the discrepancies shall be set right. But till date nothing has been done. Plot is inhabitable. Complainants wrote regd. letters dated 10.10.2014, 08.08.2016, 14.09.2016, 23.11.2017 and 16.12.2017 for taking the action to remove discrepancies but all in vain. It is an inhabitable and unhealthy location where nobody can live-in. Respondent No.2 started demanding maintenance Charges when they are doing nothing on account of maintenance and when the plot is not habitable.&nbsp;</span></font></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">a).&nbsp;&nbsp; Relocation of the plot no. 401 measuring 500\r\nsq. yards be done to a suitable place, as per the choice of the complainants,\r\nat a preferable location (Corner Plot) with all amenities, facilities like\r\nroad, sewerage and water connection, metalled roads, street lights, levelling of\r\nplot at road level etc.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">b)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of the excess amount of\r\nRs.15,00,000/- charged from the complainants on account of PLC;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">c)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Respondents be directed to provide the proof\r\nof the EDC/ IDC deposited by the respondents with the GMADA/ any other\r\ncompetent authority out of the amount charged from the complainants.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">d)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Respondents may be restrained to demand the\r\nmaintenance charges till the time relocation to a habitable plot is not done.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">e).&nbsp;&nbsp; Pay interest @18% per annum from the dates of\r\nrespective payments till the date of actual realization of the amount;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -28.35pt;\">&nbsp;and</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">f).&nbsp;&nbsp; Pay Rs.1,10,000/- as the litigation charges\r\nand expenses incurred by it.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">g).&nbsp;&nbsp; Order any other relief that this Hon’ble\r\nCourt, SAS Nagar, Mohali, Pujab may deem fit and proper in the circumstances of\r\nthe present complaint.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:56.7pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">IN\r\nCASE RESPONDENTS FAILS TO RELOCATE THE PLOT AS PRAYED ABOVE, ALTERNATIVELY &nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:84.3pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-27.6pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund entire deposited amount of Rs.84,05,365/-.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">j).&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pay interest @18% per annum from the dates\r\nof respective payments till the date of actual realization of the amount;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -28.35pt;\">k).&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pay Rs.1,10,000/- as the litigation charges\r\nand expenses incurred by it.</span><br></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:85.05pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\">l).&nbsp; Order any other relief that this Hon’ble\r\nCourt, SAS Nagar, Mohali, Punjab may deem fit and proper in the circumstances\r\nof the present complaint.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',6000000.00,8405365.00,'2013-09-08 00:00:00.000','2015-07-20 00:00:00.000','<p>Respondents may be directed to deposit principle amount of Rs.84,05,365/- paid by the complainants to the Respondents before this Hon\'ble Court till decision of the present case.</p>','1','','2014-02-11 00:00:00','2011-09-08 00:00:00','plot no. 401 sector 114 golf Links - 1 Mohali.','','',1,1,0,0,'advravinder','2018-11-23 20:46:42.000','advravinder','2018-11-23 20:46:42.000'),(373,1139,'1139',1211,'962b01f9-ce50-4ce8-b650-bb1037f1b9e3','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Sanjay Dhiman','vermauvraj@gmail.com',9569656520,0,416668848153,'Flat No .115, Ground Floor, Noor Homes','Kharar Landranroad, Sector 115, Mohali',28,507,'160055','1','Flat No .115, Ground Floor, Noor Homes','Kharar Landranroad, Sector 115, Mohali',28,507,'160055','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0219','M/S. GGP BUILDTECH PRIVATE LIMITED','M/S. GGP BUILDTECH PRIVATE LIMITED(Mr. Ajay Gupta)','ajayguptaggp@gmail.com',9815990640,0,'402, Shivalik City, Sector 127','Kharar , SAS Nagar',28,507,'160055','1','402, Shivalik City, Sector 127','Kharar , SAS Nagar',28,507,'160055','1','<p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.12in; line-height: 103%\">&nbsp;That the project named Noor Homes is currently being\r\npromoted/developed by GGP Buildtech Pvt Limited. The Promoters of M/s\r\nGGP BUILDTECH PVT LTD started their business initially with a\r\nPartnership firm M/s Singla Builders &amp; Promoters in which Sh.\r\nAjay Gupta and Sh. Amandeep Singla were partners. That the Project\r\nNamed Noor Homes is launched by GGP Buildtech Pvt Limited in February\r\n2014. That the Builder (GGP Buildtech Pvt Limited) had come up with\r\nadvertisement/public offer to sell 1, 2, 3 BHK Apartments &amp; 3 BHK\r\nVillas to be constructed at Sector 115, Village Sante Majra, Tehsil\r\nKharar, District Mohali with a construction target to be completed in\r\n2017. That the Complainants (society members) start booking flats\r\nfrom Builder from 2014. That to some Complainants the flats were\r\nforcefully handed over by builder in incomplete stage. That some\r\nComplainants were forced to pay 100% payment to Builder for\r\nincomplete flats by threatening them from goons hired by builders.\r\nThat Some Complainants were forced to execute sale deed for less\r\nprice paying money in cash or for shell companies (Daya Infra) and\r\nthus frauding with GST and service tax.That These flats are\r\nincomplete to such extent that there is no permanent water\r\nconnection,internal roads, electricity, sewerage connections,\r\nSewerage treatment plant, staircase, streetlights, fire protection\r\nsystem etc.That these flats are handed over without obtaining\r\noccupancy certificate from MC khararThat Builder was approached time\r\nto time and several MOM’s were signed but till date.That MOM is\r\nattached as Annexure-1, where in Builder has initially agreed to\r\ncomplete the project by 31-March 2016.That vide MOM dated\r\n30-April-2017 Builder agreed to complete the project by 31-Jan-2018.\r\nThat again MOM vide 18.09.2017 Builder agreed to complete project in\r\nnext 6 months i.e Mar-2018. That status of project is same as\r\nmentioned in point No.9</p>','<p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\">Transfer of All Unsold Properties to Society (will be incorporated within 15 days of order by RERA)</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\">Direct PSPCL for permanent electricity connections for the 65\r\nfamilies (Complainant).</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\">Direct MC kharar for permanent water and\r\nsewerage connections to the society.</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\">Direct Inquiry against\r\ninvolvement of Municipal Corporation with Builder in cheating the\r\nPublic by allowing sale deed to be executed without issuing occupancy\r\ncertificate.</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\">Direct Inquiry against Builder regarding diversion of\r\nproject funds to other shell companies.</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\">Action against Builder for non\r\ncompletion of Project.Direct Inquiry against Builder regarding theft\r\nof GST.</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\">Pledge/Stay on selling if the Properties of Builder,\r\nPromoters, Directors with immediate effect to avoid misuse of\r\ndiverted funds.</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\"><br></p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\">Pass any other order/orders which PBRERA may deem fit\r\nin the facts and circumstances of the case.</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">Transfer of All Unsold Properties to Society (will be incorporated within 15 days of order by RERA)</span><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'uvrajverma','2018-11-23 21:22:17.000','uvrajverma','2018-11-23 21:22:17.000'),(374,1141,'1141',1106,'0fa4919e-f07b-4736-b6c4-5b115fc41a37','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Hardeep Singh','hardeep.licdo@gmail.com',8146320007,1765250553,606394546303,'LIC of India Opposite Bus Stand','Mandi Gobindgarh',28,204,'140308','1','Asst. Branch Manager','LIC of India, Mandi Gobindgarh, Distt- FatehGarh Sahib',28,204,'147301','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0091','Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises Chapparcheri','Sukhchain Singh and Hoshiar Singh','bbsbikpmohali@gmail.com',9888033671,0,'Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','Vill.Chapparchiri Kalan( H.B.No.195), Sector.92, Distt.SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','Vill.Chapparchiri Kalan( H.B.No.195), Sector.92, Distt.SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','<div>With due respect I want to explain each fact as given below;</div><div><br></div><div>1. That I have been harrassed by them very much since I booked two plots at POSH city of the above promoter on date 3.7.2017 as per the advertisement given by them on facebook and also at location before allotment of RERA No. Which falls under PB RERA Act 2016( as no promoter can advertise before RERA Approval)</div><div><br></div><div>2. That the two plots having No.158 on my wife name and No.124 on myself Name were alloted to me by them through the payment of Rs 100000 via cheque No. 971350 dt 3.7.17 and Rs 375000 via cheque No. 023730 dated 3.7.17 on the name of Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises which got cleared.</div><div><br></div><div>3. That both of them explain me that the project is RERA approved and got No very soon and you will got possession within 1 year upto 30.6.2018 but they got totally failed in doing so.</div><div><br></div><div>4. That they again demanded from me Rs 844360 via cheque No. 023731 dt 13.9.17 which also got cleared as to complete25% of Amount without doing any progress of the project and till this date also were unable to get RERA No.</div><div><br></div><div>5.That I have paid Total Amount of Rs. 13,19,360 &nbsp;till 13.9.2017 to them through all my cheques.</div><div><br></div><div>6. That they totally misleaded , misguided and also harrassed and tortured me mentally, when I visited there many times for getting LOI and Agreement documents since 1 year and 3 months.</div><div><br></div><div>7. That they have changed the maps of project many times and now they have started constructing Independent Floors (S+4) on the location of my booked plot No.124 and givent the contract to ACHME Ltd. &nbsp;without any intimation to me.</div><div><br></div><div>8. That the time of 1 year got passed and they totally failed even in refunding my Amount of Rs 1319360 with interest@18% plus harrassement Amount of Rs 200000 also, as I have requested to refund the amount through my mail send to them on 15.8.18.</div><div><br></div><div>9. I request yourself to help me in refunding my Amount with interest @18%plus harrassement Charge equal to 18 lakh.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks</div><div><br></div><div>Regards</div><div><br></div><div>Hardeep Singh</div>','<p>I want to explain that;</p><p><br></p><p>1.In view of my above explaination the Promoter totally failed in providing Service to Customers and also unable to refund the amount after the notice of 15days which very well falls under National Consumer Act 1986.</p><p><br></p><p>2.And also they have given advertisements for promotion of the project before 1 year without RERA Approval. Which very well falls under PB RERA Act 2016.</p><p><br></p><p>3. That they have been harrassed me very much by giving false statements and also tortured me mentally by saying that you can do anything and God will teach me lesson. I dont know what I have done wrong by paying them Rs 1319360. And I got problem of high BP and hypertension due to their mentally torture to me. I am now taking medicines due to them. So kindly fine them Rs 200000 for &nbsp;harrassement and mentally torture to me.</p><p><br></p><p>4. That the Amount with interest @18% rounded to Rs 16 lakh plus Rs 2lakh as harrassement and mentally torture Charges is equal to Rs 18 lakh.</p><p><br></p><p>5. Please help me in refunding my this Amount ov Rs 18 lakh from them.</p><p><br></p><p>I shall be thankful to you.</p><p><br></p><p>Hardeep Singh</p>',4750000.00,1319360.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Please help me in refunding my whole amount of Rs 1319360 with interest @18% Plus harrassement and mentally torture charge of Rs 2 lakh.</p><p><br></p><p>Total Amount Rs 18 lakh.</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you</p><p><br></p><p>Regards</p><p><br></p><p>Hardeep Singh</p>','1','','2017-07-03 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','158,124','','',1,0,0,0,'HSToor','2018-11-24 11:58:04.000','HSToor','2018-11-24 11:58:04.000'),(375,1138,'1138',1091,'e2da2916-c5af-4a15-acce-51dcf84d70a2','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Chaman Chandel','chamanchandel@gmail.com',8146000152,0,0,'House No. 146-A, ','Sector 42-A,',6,128,'160036','1','House No. 2378, ','Sector 35-C,',6,128,'160035','Rajeev Anand','anandlawoffice2378@gmail.com',9417807085,1722622364,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','Wave Estate Project','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd Through its MD','customercare@waveestate.in',0,0,'PO Rayon and Silk Mills','Adjoining Coca Cola Depot GT Road, Chheharta',28,39,'143105','0','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd. Wave Estate Project site office sector 85','SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">﻿The Complainant booked Apartment&nbsp;No.\r\n61 SF, 2nd Floor Sec- G, Wave Floor, Sec 99 Mohali on 05.02.2013 making initial\r\npayments <b>(Annexure C-1)﻿.</b> Agreement\r\ndated 11.07.2013 <b>(Annexure C-2)</b> was\r\nexecuted for area 1060sqFt @ 3773.58/sqFt.&nbsp;As per Clause 5.2, the Project\r\nwas to be developed and Apartment was to be handed over in 24 months &amp; by\r\nCl. 5.5, Rs. 5/sqFt/month was to be paid for delay. The Complainant was given\r\nloan in May 2013 &amp; revalidated in November 2014 <b>(Annexure C-3).</b>&nbsp;On 20.01.2015, the Complainant was made to\r\nfill another Agreement <b>(Annexure C-4)</b>\r\nand the Apartment of the Complainant was unilaterally changed <b>(Annexure C-5)</b> with new No. 43/SF, Wave\r\nFloor Sec 99, Mohali.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The Complainant’s Loan account facility\r\nwas endorsed <b>(Annexure C-6)</b> for the\r\nApartment. The Complainant found that site plan of Apartment has been changed by\r\nclosing bathroom door opening in bedroom etc.. Having found the Project and the\r\nApartment delayed, Complainant gave representation 31.10.2016 <b>(Annexure C-7)</b> that construction\r\nstarted with 2 years delay &amp; not completed. The complainant gave another\r\nrepresentation by email in May 2017 &amp; another representation dated 01.09.2017\r\n<b>(Annexure C-8)</b> that even after 4 1/2\r\nyears possession not offered. On 03.09.2017 <b>(Annexure C-9)</b> the Complainant wanted to meet the senior executive\r\nbut no time was given for meeting for delivery of possession.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The apartment was to be completed &amp; handed\r\nover by 23.01.2016 but not done against which Complainant gave representation\r\ndated 23.09.2017 <b>(Annexure C-10)</b>.&nbsp;\r\nThe Respondent made unilateral Deed of Settlement on 16.12.2017 <b>(Annexure C-11)</b> to give interest and\r\nalso possession by March 2018 but since not honoured by Respondent, the Deed of\r\nSettlement became redundant.&nbsp;Now on 08.10.2018 <b>(Annexure C-12)</b> a Statement of Account has been given wherein area\r\nincreased and money charged for that without any increase in Apartment area.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">The Complainant has no shelter inspite of spending huge amount &amp;\r\nleft in lurch.</span>','<p>The Apartment was to be handed over after completing the Project in 24 months + 6 Months i.e. from 11.07.13 by 11.01.16 &amp; monthly compensation of Rs5/SqFt/month was to be paid from Jan 2016 onwards till date but NOT PAID.\r\n</p><p>The Respondent has taken the total sale price as Rs. 3 Lakhs on 05.02.13 and 3 lakhs on 21.03.13+ Rs 968658 on 13.02.15 + Rs 231342 on 31.03.15+ 1057177 on 16.11.15 +Rs. 142823 on 16.11.15+ 6 lakhs on 22.04.17 totaling 36 Lakhs (+ service Tax on each payment) as also EMIs with interest.\r\n</p><p>Inspite of elapsing of over 5 years of Agreement, no development &amp; construction works have been completed in the Complex and the Promoter has failed in its obligation towards the Complex and Independent Residential Floor allotted to the Complainant. The Respondent Promoter is liable to pay the interest on the payment so received for the period of delay in offering possession after the completion of the development works of the project and the completion of the construction of the Independent Residential Floor. The possession is given in incomplete project. The relative of an Allottee who took possession recently suffered electrocution and was in ICU as received injuries and burns. The Apartment is not finished. The electric wires are open, potholes are not covered etc. The Promoter is just trying to meet the time limit without completion and full development.  \r\n</p><p>In view of the above : \r\n</p><p>(i) The Applicant is seeking compensation as applicable in Para 5.5 of Agreement dated 19.07.2013 from January 2016 onwards till date; \r\n</p><p>(ii) directions for completion of the development works of the project and the construction of the independent residential floor in question without any further delay and also offer the possession after the grant of Occupation Certificate of the Building and the Completion Certificate of the Wave Estate Project alongwith interest and compensation prescribed under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act 2016 as the action of the Respondent</p>',4000000.00,3600000.00,'2016-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Pending final decision on the complaint the\r\ncomplainant seeks issue of the following interim order </span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">:</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The\r\nrespondents be directed to complete the development works of the project and the\r\nconstruction of the independent residential floor in question without any\r\nfurther delay and also offer the possession after the grant of occupation\r\ncertificate of the Building and the Completion Certificate of the Wave Estate\r\nProject.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">The Promoter be also\r\ndirected to pay interim monthly interest and compensation till the completion\r\nof the project and the complex in question in the pendency of the complaint.</span><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2013-07-11 00:00:00','Independent Residential Floor No. 61 SF, 2nd Floor Sec- G, Wave Floor, Sec 99 Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'RajeevAnand','2018-11-24 12:02:33.000','RajeevAnand','2018-11-24 12:02:33.000'),(376,1138,'1138',1091,'e2da2916-c5af-4a15-acce-51dcf84d70a2','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Chaman Chandel','chamanchandel@gmail.com',8146000152,0,0,'House No. 146-A, ','Sector 42-A,',6,128,'160036','1','House No. 2378, ','Sector 35-C,',6,128,'160035','Rajeev Anand','anandlawoffice2378@gmail.com',9417807085,1722622364,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','Wave Estate Project','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd Through its MD','customercare@waveestate.in',0,0,'PO Rayon and Silk Mills','Adjoining Coca Cola Depot GT Road, Chheharta',28,39,'143105','0','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd. Wave Estate Project site office sector 85','SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">﻿The Complainant booked Apartment&nbsp;No.\r\n61 SF, 2nd Floor Sec- G, Wave Floor, Sec 99 Mohali on 05.02.2013 making initial\r\npayments <b>(Annexure C-1)﻿.</b> Agreement\r\ndated 11.07.2013 <b>(Annexure C-2)</b> was\r\nexecuted for area 1060sqFt @ 3773.58/sqFt.&nbsp;As per Clause 5.2, the Project\r\nwas to be developed and Apartment was to be handed over in 24 months &amp; by\r\nCl. 5.5, Rs. 5/sqFt/month was to be paid for delay. The Complainant was given\r\nloan in May 2013 &amp; revalidated in November 2014 <b>(Annexure C-3).</b>&nbsp;On 20.01.2015, the Complainant was made to\r\nfill another Agreement <b>(Annexure C-4)</b>\r\nand the Apartment of the Complainant was unilaterally changed <b>(Annexure C-5)</b> with new No. 43/SF, Wave\r\nFloor Sec 99, Mohali.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The Complainant’s Loan account facility\r\nwas endorsed <b>(Annexure C-6)</b> for the\r\nApartment. The Complainant found that site plan of Apartment has been changed by\r\nclosing bathroom door opening in bedroom etc.. Having found the Project and the\r\nApartment delayed, Complainant gave representation 31.10.2016 <b>(Annexure C-7)</b> that construction\r\nstarted with 2 years delay &amp; not completed. The complainant gave another\r\nrepresentation by email in May 2017 &amp; another representation dated 01.09.2017\r\n<b>(Annexure C-8)</b> that even after 4 1/2\r\nyears possession not offered. On 03.09.2017 <b>(Annexure C-9)</b> the Complainant wanted to meet the senior executive\r\nbut no time was given for meeting for delivery of possession.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The apartment was to be completed &amp; handed\r\nover by 23.01.2016 but not done against which Complainant gave representation\r\ndated 23.09.2017 <b>(Annexure C-10)</b>.&nbsp;\r\nThe Respondent made unilateral Deed of Settlement on 07.02.2018&nbsp;<b>(Annexure C-11)</b> to give interest and\r\nalso possession by March 2018 but since not honoured by Respondent, the Deed of\r\nSettlement became redundant.&nbsp;Now on 08.10.2018 <b>(Annexure C-12)</b> a Statement of Account has been given wherein area\r\nincreased and money charged for that without any increase in Apartment area.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">The Complainant has no shelter inspite of spending huge amount &amp;\r\nleft in lurch.</span>','<p>The Apartment was to be handed over after completing the Project in 24 months + 6 Months i.e. from 11.07.13 by 11.01.16 &amp; monthly compensation of Rs5/SqFt/month was to be paid from Jan 2016 onwards till date but NOT PAID.\r\n</p><p>The Respondent has taken the total sale price as Rs. 3 Lakhs on 05.02.13 and 3 lakhs on 21.03.13+ Rs 968658 on 13.02.15 + Rs 231342 on 31.03.15+ 1057177 on 16.11.15 +Rs. 142823 on 16.11.15+ 6 lakhs on 22.04.17 totaling 36 Lakhs (+ service Tax on each payment) as also EMIs with interest.\r\n</p><p>Inspite of elapsing of over 5 years of Agreement, no development &amp; construction works have been completed in the Complex and the Promoter has failed in its obligation towards the Complex and Independent Residential Floor allotted to the Complainant. The Respondent Promoter is liable to pay the interest on the payment so received for the period of delay in offering possession after the completion of the development works of the project and the completion of the construction of the Independent Residential Floor. The possession is given in incomplete project. The relative of an Allottee who took possession recently suffered electrocution and was in ICU as received injuries and burns. The Apartment is not finished. The electric wires are open, potholes are not covered etc. The Promoter is just trying to meet the time limit without completion and full development.  \r\n</p><p>In view of the above : \r\n</p><p>(i) The Applicant is seeking compensation as applicable in Para 5.5 of Agreement dated 19.07.2013 from January 2016 onwards till date; \r\n</p><p>(ii) directions for completion of the development works of the project and the construction of the independent residential floor in question without any further delay and also offer the possession after the grant of Occupation Certificate of the Building and the Completion Certificate of the Wave Estate Project alongwith interest and compensation prescribed under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act 2016 as the action of the Respondent</p>',4000000.00,3600000.00,'2016-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Pending final decision on the complaint the\r\ncomplainant seeks issue of the following interim order </span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">:</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The\r\nrespondents be directed to complete the development works of the project and the\r\nconstruction of the independent residential floor in question without any\r\nfurther delay and also offer the possession after the grant of occupation\r\ncertificate of the Building and the Completion Certificate of the Wave Estate\r\nProject.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">The Promoter be also\r\ndirected to pay interim monthly interest and compensation till the completion\r\nof the project and the complex in question in the pendency of the complaint.</span><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2013-07-11 00:00:00','Independent Residential Floor No. 61 SF, 2nd Floor Sec- G, Wave Floor, Sec 99 Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'RajeevAnand','2018-11-24 12:16:16.000','RajeevAnand','2018-11-24 12:16:16.000'),(377,1142,'1142',1228,'52a7a52a-f5c6-428c-9c85-891d0a06dbea','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Ranveer Sharma','advamitgoyal@hotmail.com',9820127935,0,0,'1003-B, Sterling Seaface, ','Near Poonam chambers, Anne besant Raod, Warli,',21,400,'400018','1','1003-B, Sterling Seaface, ','Near Poonam chambers, Anne besant Raod, Warli,',21,400,'400018','Amit Goyal','advamitgoyal@hotmail.com',9527700001,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0143','Parkwood Glade','parkwood','mail@parkwoodgroup.in',0,0,'1001, ','hemkunt ',10,429,'110019','1','1001, ','hemkunt ',10,429,'110019','1','<p>kfljsdlfj;llfjdflk&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>','<p>lkjfljl</p>',4997475.00,4700000.00,'2015-06-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>klsdljfl</p>','1','','2012-12-08 00:00:00','2012-12-08 00:00:00','jkgh','','',1,0,0,0,'amitgoyaladv','2018-11-24 13:20:10.000','amitgoyaladv','2018-11-24 13:20:10.000'),(378,1143,'1143',1228,'52a7a52a-f5c6-428c-9c85-891d0a06dbea','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Ranveer Sharma','advamitgoyal@hotmail.com',9820127935,0,0,'1003-B, Sterling Seaface, ','Near Poonam chambers, Anne besant Raod, Warli,',21,400,'400018','1','1003-B, Sterling Seaface, ','Near Poonam chambers, Anne besant Raod, Warli,',21,400,'400018','Amit Goyal','advamitgoyal@hotmail.com',9527700001,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0143','parkwood','m/s parkwood glade','mail@parkwoodgroup.in',1130824952,0,'m/s parkwood developers ','tehsil kharar ',10,429,'110019','1','m/s parkwood developers ','tehsil kharar ',10,429,'110019','1','<p>bxcugcmjbascasv</p>','<p>qxs cgqscnqw</p>',4997475.00,4700000.00,'2015-06-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>jhckhcn v,dnd&nbsp;</p>','1','','2012-12-08 00:00:00','2012-12-08 00:00:00','village santemajra tehsil kharar, distt. SAS nagar ','','',1,0,0,0,'amitgoyaladv','2018-11-24 13:50:28.000','amitgoyaladv','2018-11-24 13:50:28.000'),(379,1144,'1144',1146,'7dfad30e-4afa-4859-8a26-94b85edcd0f5','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Ashish Kumar Jain','jarnailthakur@yahoo.com',9815695783,0,495798240541,'c/o Sandeep Jain, 5368-C, Nicholson Road, Punjabi Mohalla, Ambala Cantt.','Ambala',13,1,'133001','1','c/o Sandeep Jain, 5368-C, Nicholson Road, Punjabi Mohalla, Ambala Cantt.','Ambala',13,1,'133001','J S Thakur','jarnailthakur@yahoo.com',9815695783,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0010','fashion technology park, sector 90, Mohali','Chandigarh Overseas Pvt. Ltd.','sanjaychugh.biz@gmail.com',9876499777,0,'SCO 196-197, Top Floor, Sector 34-A, Chandigarh','Chandigarh',6,128,'160022','1','SCO 196-197, Top Floor, Sector 34-A, Chandigarh','Chandigarh',6,128,'160022','0','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%\">The respondents came up with a\r\nproject in sector 90, Mohali, named as Fashion Technology Park in the year\r\n2006. The complainant booked 4 units of 100/125 sq. ft. each. On 02.09.2006and\r\npaid Rs. 5 lac out of the total amount payable Rs. 20 lac @ Rs. 5 lac per unit.\r\nTotal payment made by the complainant is Rs.19 lac. Construction was to\r\ncommence in 2<sup>nd</sup> week of sep 2006. He was allotted 4 units of 100 sq.\r\nft. each in Design Studio no. 6 on 5<sup>th</sup> floor. The respondents\r\nassured of fixed returns as also of a buy back scheme @7.5 lac per unit. The\r\nconstruction was to be completed in 30 months from Sep 2006, but the same was\r\nnever done. Further the Respondents &nbsp;purported to enter into a Developer Buyer\r\nagreement and one Lease agreement, obtained the complainant’s signatures thereon,\r\nasked him to collect the said agreements duly signed and dated by the\r\nauthorised persons which was never done.&nbsp;\r\nThe Respondents sent a letter dated 22.06.2009 offering to buy back the\r\n4 units @7.5 lac per unit. The complainant accepted the offer and was acknowledged\r\nby the Respondents &nbsp;vide their letter\r\ndated 13.01.2010. The Respondents paid a sum of Rs. 7.5 lac for buy back of one\r\nunit, but the balance amount of Rs. 22.50 lac for remaining three units was\r\nnever paid. The complainant was also assured of compensation for delay@ Rs. 50\r\nper sq. ft per month as per clause 28 of Developer Buyer agreement. Accordingly\r\nthey paid a sum of Rs.48388/- vide cheque dated 31.03.2010 only once and\r\nnothing thereafter. The Respondents have made the complainant to run from\r\npillar to post and have caused him great harassment and mental torture.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><i><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%\">The complainant</span></i><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%\">\r\nprays for a direction to the Respondents:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%\">1. To pay the balance amount of Rs.22,50,000/- with interest @18% p.a.\r\nwith effect from 02.03.2010 till actual payment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%\">2. To pay for delay @Rs.50/- per square foot per month w.e.f. 02.03.2010 along\r\nwith interest @18% per annum till actual payment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%\">3.To pay a sum of Rs.10 lacs for the mental torture, agony and harassment\r\nto the complainant and for making him run from pillar to post to avail his\r\nrights.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%\">4. To pay litigation costs to the tune of Rs.1,10,000/- which he has so\r\nfar incurred.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%\">5.&nbsp; To not to alienate, cancel the\r\nallotment,&nbsp; sell, transfer, mortgage,\r\netc. the allotted units in Design Studio no. 6 in the Fashion Technology Park\r\nSector 90, Mohali.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',2000000.00,1900000.00,'2010-03-02 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><i><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%\">The complainant</span></i><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%\">\r\nprays for a direction to the Respondents:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%\">1. To pay the balance amount of Rs.22,50,000/- with interest @18% p.a.\r\nwith effect from 02.03.2010 till actual payment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%\">2. To pay for delay @Rs.50/- per square foot per month w.e.f. 02.03.2010 along\r\nwith interest @18% per annum till actual payment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%\">3.To pay a sum of Rs.10 lacs for the mental torture, agony and harassment\r\nto the complainant and for making him run from pillar to post to avail his\r\nrights.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%\">4. To pay litigation costs to the tune of Rs.1,10,000/- which he has so\r\nfar incurred.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%\">5.&nbsp; To not to alienate, cancel the\r\nallotment,&nbsp; sell, transfer, mortgage,\r\netc. the allotted units in Design Studio no. 6 in the Fashion Technology Park\r\nSector 90, Mohali.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','2006-08-12 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Design Studio No.6 \r\nFour units of 100 sq ft each','','',2,0,0,0,'jarnailthakur','2018-11-25 16:33:01.000','jarnailthakur','2018-11-25 16:33:01.000'),(380,1108,'1108',1098,'81775a1c-ad46-40a6-b51a-c95cca91809d','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-26 00:12:48.000','Abhimanyu Singh Vinayak','abhi.vinayak@yahoo.co.in',9992015557,0,0,'44-45 SHIVAJI PARK','MODEL TOWN',13,21,'135001','1','T-1, 301, BESTECH PARK VIEW RESIDENCES','SECTOR 66',28,507,'160062','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','JLPL Falcon View Apartments, Phase-2, Tower C to H, Sector 66, Mohali - Punjab','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS PVT LTD','janta@jantahousing.com',8427100082,0,'Regd. Office and Corporate Office : SCO 39-42, Sector 82,','SAS Nagar, Mohali, Punjab',28,507,'140306','1','Regd. Office and Corporate Office : SCO 39-42, Sector 82,','SAS Nagar, Mohali, Punjab',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">In compliance with the orders of the Hon’ble\r\nAdjudicating Officer, passed on 1-11-18, in my Complaint No. AdCNo10222018,\r\nwhereby my complaint seeking Compensation in form of Interest has been returned. While erroneously applying circular No. RERA/Pb/ENF/14 dated 29.10.18 to my complaint, with\r\nRetrospective effect, I have been advised to file fresh complaint in Form M, which\r\nI hereby do.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">In my capacity as KARTA of Abhimanyu\r\nSingh Vinayak HUF, I, purchased an apartment from M/s. Janta Land Promoters Pvt\r\nLtd. The apartment Unit No. is 101, Tower D, Falcon View, sized 3122 sq ft. The\r\ntotal cost of the property was fixed at Rs.96,17,477/- Plus taxes. I paid\r\nRs.96,43,228/- to the company vide the following :&nbsp; I paid Rs.84,35,750/- vide\r\nReceipt No. 6518 dated 13/8/2016, Rs.11,12,000/- vide Receipt No. 3104 dated\r\n13/8/2016 &amp; Rs.95,478/- vide Receipt No. 6826 dated 28/9/2016.&nbsp; Thus altogether I\'ve\r\npaid 96% of the Total consideration amount. The Company, vide Allotment Letter\r\ndated 13/08/2016, promised to complete construction &amp; handover the\r\napartment in 12 months. Thus the effective date of possession was\r\n13/08/2017. Unfortunately, despite having paid 96% of the total amount, the\r\ncompany has failed to deliver the possession of the flat. Thus our joint family\r\nis compelled to live separately. My parents live in Yamunanagar whereas I,\r\nalong with my wife &amp; son live in Mohali in a small accommodation. We have\r\nbeen compelled to compromise with our comfort &amp; our future plannings. I\'ve\r\nbeen running from pillar to post to get the true status of construction &amp;\r\nthe date of actual possession, but to no avail. The office bearers of the\r\ncompany refuse to entertain my requests &amp; divulge any relevant information.\r\nI\'ve sent dozens of e-mails to the company &amp; its top officials, for\r\nconfirming the date of possession &amp; for seeking compensation for inordinate\r\ndelay. I\'ve visited the company office score of times but all my pleadings have fallen on deaf ears.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">That as per the Allotment cum Agreement, the company is charging penal interest from the buyers @10% for delay of first month, @12% for delay of second month &amp; @15% for delay thereafter. Whereas, after having paid Rs.96,43,228/- to the company, I\'ve merely received one cheque for Rs.44,413/- dated 12-2-18 from the Company/Builder, which amounts to 0.46% for years of delay.\r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Thus I seek parity &amp; equity between the interest/penalty paid by both buyer and seller to each. The interest that the builder/company ought to pay should be equal and at par with what they charge from the helpless buyers. Here it also worth mentioning that during this entire period of inordinate delay, there has not been any force majure or circumstances beyond the control of the developers, behind which the company might try to hide &amp; wriggle out from discharge of their lawful liability. HERE, I ALSO WISH TO BRING TO YOUR KIND NOTICE, TWO OTHER VERY IMPORTANT FACTORS, REGARDING WHICH THE CAUSE OF ACTION HAS NOT YET ARISEN, BUT IF THE COMPANY/BUILDER DELAYS FURTHER, I MAY SUFFER HUGE LOSSES IN THE FUTURE. Firstly : That I sold my industrial unit on 12 August 2016 &amp; purchased this apartment on 13 August 2016.Thus I saved Long Term Capitals Gain Tax . As per I.T. Act, if I do not get possession of new residential property in 36 months from date of sale of industrial unit, I shall have to return, entire LTCG Tax Rebate availed, with interest, which in my case may be about Rs.15 Lac Loss, for no fault of mine. Secondly : That Punjab Government has given a rebate of 3% on stamp duty for registrations till 31-3-2019. If the company delays in possession, I may suffer another loss of about Rs.3 Lac. However, I reserve my right to approach appropriate legal forums to recover these losses, if &amp; when they occur. RELIEF SOUGHT IN THE PRESENT COMPLAINT : I seek Interest as per the relevant provisions of RERA, for Inordinate Delay in possession, after having paid 96% of the total amount i.e.Rs.96,43,228/-.</span></p>',9617477.00,9643228.00,'2017-08-13 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">That during the pendency of this\r\npresent complaint, if the builder secures occupation certificate and offers\r\npossession to the buyers, the builder be directed to handover the possession to\r\nme, without forcing or coercing me to withdraw the present complaint. In such case, the builder/company may kindly be directed to deliver possession, pending\r\nfinal outcome/award.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">It is also prayed that since I have\r\nalready paid 96% of the total sale consideration, the builder be directed not\r\nto ask for any more amount until final order in this present complaint is\r\npassed by the Hon’ble Authority.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','2016-08-13 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat No.101, Tower-D, Falcon View, Sector 66-A, Mohali-Punjab.','','',1,1,0,0,'rachnabhi','2018-11-26 00:12:40.000','rachnabhi','2018-11-26 00:12:40.000'),(381,1139,'1139',1211,'962b01f9-ce50-4ce8-b650-bb1037f1b9e3','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-26 11:15:20.000','Sanjay Dhiman','vermauvraj@gmail.com',9569656520,0,416668848153,'Flat No .115, Ground Floor, Noor Homes','Kharar Landranroad, Sector 115, Mohali',28,507,'160055','1','Flat No .115, Ground Floor, Noor Homes','Kharar Landranroad, Sector 115, Mohali',28,507,'160055','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0219','M/S. GGP BUILDTECH PRIVATE LIMITED','M/S. GGP BUILDTECH PRIVATE LIMITED(Mr. Ajay Gupta)','ajayguptaggp@gmail.com',9815990640,0,'402, Shivalik City, Sector 127','Kharar , SAS Nagar',28,507,'160055','1','402, Shivalik City, Sector 127','Kharar , SAS Nagar',28,507,'160055','1','<p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.12in; line-height: 103%\">&nbsp;That the project named Noor Homes is currently being\r\npromoted/developed by GGP Buildtech Pvt Limited. </p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.12in; line-height: 103%\">The Promoters of M/s\r\nGGP BUILDTECH PVT LTD started their business initially with a\r\nPartnership firm M/s Singla Builders &amp; Promoters in which Sh.\r\nAjay Gupta and Sh. Amandeep Singla were partners. </p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.12in; line-height: 103%\">That the Project\r\nNamed Noor Homes is launched by GGP Buildtech Pvt Limited in February\r\n2014. That the Builder (GGP Buildtech Pvt Limited) had come up with\r\nadvertisement/public offer to sell 1, 2, 3 BHK Apartments &amp; 3 BHK\r\nVillas to be constructed at Sector 115, Village Sante Majra, Tehsil\r\nKharar, District Mohali with a construction target to be completed in\r\n2017. </p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.12in; line-height: 103%\">That the Complainants (society members) start booking flats\r\nfrom Builder from 2014. </p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.12in; line-height: 103%\">That to some Complainants the flats were\r\nforcefully handed over by builder in incomplete stage. </p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.12in; line-height: 103%\">That some\r\nComplainants were forced to pay 100% payment to Builder for\r\nincomplete flats by threatening them from goons hired by builders.</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.12in; line-height: 103%\">\r\nThat Some Complainants were forced to execute sale deed for less\r\nprice paying money in cash or for shell companies (Daya Infra) and\r\nthus frauding with GST and service tax.</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.12in; line-height: 103%\">That These flats are\r\nincomplete to such extent that there is no permanent water\r\nconnection,internal roads, electricity, sewerage connections,\r\nSewerage treatment plant, staircase, streetlights, fire protection\r\nsystem etc.</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.12in; line-height: 103%\">That these flats are handed over without obtaining\r\noccupancy certificate from MC kharar</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.12in; line-height: 103%\">That Builder was approached time\r\nto time and several MOM’s were signed but till date.That MOM is\r\nattached, where in Builder has initially agreed to\r\ncomplete the project by 31-March 2016.That vide MOM dated\r\n30-April-2017 Builder agreed to complete the project by 31-Jan-2018.\r\n</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.12in; line-height: 103%\">That again MOM vide 18.09.2017 Builder agreed to complete project in\r\nnext 6 months i.e Mar-2018. </p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.12in; line-height: 103%\">That status of project is non completed till date</p>','<p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\">Transfer of All Unsold Properties to Society (will be incorporated within 15 days of order by RERA)</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\">Direct PSPCL for permanent electricity connections for the 65\r\nfamilies (Complainant).</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\">Direct MC kharar for permanent water and\r\nsewerage connections to the society.</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\">Direct Inquiry against\r\ninvolvement of Municipal Corporation with Builder in cheating the\r\nPublic by allowing sale deed to be executed without issuing occupancy\r\ncertificate.</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\">Direct Inquiry against Builder regarding diversion of\r\nproject funds to other shell companies.</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\">Action against Builder for non\r\ncompletion of Project.Direct Inquiry against Builder regarding theft\r\nof GST.</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\">Pledge/Stay on selling if the Properties of Builder,\r\nPromoters, Directors with immediate effect to avoid misuse of\r\ndiverted funds.</p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\"><br></p><p lang=\"en-US\" class=\"western\" align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin-left: 0.12in; margin-right: 0.13in; line-height: 103%\">Pass any other order/orders which PBRERA may deem fit\r\nin the facts and circumstances of the case.</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">Instruct Builder to complete the project within 3 months.</span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">Transfer of All Unsold Properties to Society (will be incorporated within 15 days of order by RERA)</span><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'uvrajverma','2018-11-26 11:14:20.000','uvrajverma','2018-11-26 11:14:20.000'),(382,1109,'1109',1211,'962b01f9-ce50-4ce8-b650-bb1037f1b9e3','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-26 11:28:41.000','Yuvraj Verma','vermauvraj@gmail.com',9650106013,0,0,'Flat No .112, Ground Floor, Noor Homes','Kharar Landranroad, Sector 115, Mohali',28,507,'160055','1','Flat No .112, Ground Floor, Noor Homes','Kharar Landranroad, Sector 115, Mohali',28,507,'160055','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0219','Noor Homes, Sector 115, Village Santemajra,\r\nTehsil Kharar, SAS\r\nNagar, Mohali','M/s. GGP Buildtech Private Limited','ajayguptaggp@gmail.com',9815990640,9056607575,'Mr. Ajay Gupta, # 402, Shivalik City, Sector 127','Kharar, SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160055','1','Mr. Ajay Gupta, # 402, Shivalik City, Sector 127','Kharar, SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160055','1','<ol><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">That the project named Noor Homes is currently being promoted/developed by GGP Buildtech Pvt Limited.&nbsp;</span></li><li>The Promoters of M/s GGP BUILDTECH PVT LTD started their business initially with a Partnership firm M/s Singla Builders &amp; Promoters in which Sh. Ajay Gupta and Sh. Amandeep Singla were partners. </li><li>That the Project Named Noor Homes is launched by GGP Buildtech Pvt Limited in February 2014. </li><li>That the Builder (GGP Buildtech Pvt Limited) had come up with advertisement/public offer to sell 1, 2, 3 BHK Apartments &amp; 3 BHK Villas to be constructed at Sector 115, Village Sante Majra, Tehsil Kharar, District Mohali with a construction target to be completed in 2017. </li><li>That the Complainants (society members) start booking flats from Builder from 2014. </li><li>That to some Complainants the flats were forcefully handed over by builder in incomplete stage. </li><li>That some Complainants were forced to pay 100% payment to Builder for incomplete flats by threatening them from goons hired by builders. </li><li>That Some Complainants were forced to execute sale deed for less price paying money in cash or for shell companies (Daya Infra) and thus frauding with GST and service tax.</li><li>That These flats are incomplete to such extent that there is no permanent water connection,internal roads, electricity, sewerage connections, Sewerage treatment plant, staircase, streetlights, fire protection system etc.</li><li>That these flats are handed over without obtaining occupancy certificate from MC kharar</li><li>That Builder was approached time to time and several MOM’s were signed but till date.</li><li>That MOM is attached as Annexure-1, where in Builder has initially agreed to complete the project by 31-March 2016.</li><li>That vide MOM dated 30-April-2017 Builder agreed to complete the project by 31-Jan-2018.\r\n</li><li>\r\nThat again MOM vide 18.09.2017 Builder agreed to complete project in next 6 months i.e Mar-2018.&nbsp;</li><li>\r\nThat only 20% work completed in 5 years.</li></ol>','<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-fb04cf99-7fff-ac21-7c10-02d06f896346\"></span></p><ol style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><ol style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:lower-alpha;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Direct PSPCL for permanent electricity connections for the 65 families (Complainant).</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:lower-alpha;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Direct MC kharar for permanent water and sewerage connections to the society.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:lower-alpha;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Direct Inquiry against involvement of Municipal Corporation with Builder in cheating the Public by allowing sale deed to be executed without issuing occupancy certificate.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:lower-alpha;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Direct Inquiry against Builder regarding diversion of project funds to other shell companies.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:lower-alpha;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Action against Builder for non completion of Project.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:lower-alpha;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Direct Inquiry against Builder regarding theft of GST.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:lower-alpha;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Pledge/Stay on &nbsp;selling if the Properties of Builder, Promoters, Directors with immediate effect to avoid misuse of diverted funds.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:lower-alpha;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Pass any other order/orders which PBRERA may deem fit in the facts and circumstances of the case.</span></p></li></ol></ol>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ol><li><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; white-space: pre;\">Instruct Builder to complete the project within 3 months.</span></font></li><li><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; white-space: pre;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, RobotoDraft, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Transfer of All Unsold Properties to Society (will be incorporated within 15 days of order by RERA)</span><br></span></font></li></ol>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'uvrajverma','2018-11-26 11:17:32.000','uvrajverma','2018-11-26 11:17:32.000'),(383,1145,'1145',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-11 17:34:42.000','Pebam Sudesh','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,0,'H.No. 206 C, New Type-5','PGI Flats, Sector 24-A',6,128,'160023','1','H.No. 206 C, New Type-5','PGI Flats, Sector 24-A',6,128,'160023','Savinder Singh Gill','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','THE PALM','MANOHAR INFRASTRUCTURE AND CONSTRUCTIONS PRIVATE LIMITED','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,0,'SCO 139-141','SECTOR 17-C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-141','SECTOR 17-C',6,128,'160017','1','<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">The\r\napplicants on 29.02.2012 booked (C-1) a 250 sq yards plot @ RS.17500/- per sq\r\nyd (excluding EDC &amp; PLC) from the respondent in the project Palm Garden,\r\nMullanpur, Mohali. It was assured by the respondent that it has received all\r\nthe approvals except one or two which will be obtained within 2-3 months and\r\nthe possession of the plot will be delivered in 2 years. The applicant paid Rs.\r\n1312500 i.e. 30% of total sale consideration along with the application. The applicants\r\nvisited the office of the respondent and asked for allotment letter and buyer’s\r\nagreement, but the respondent insisted on more payment. It was only after a lot\r\nof persuasion that on confirmation of allotment letter (C-2) of plot no. 1370\r\nwas issued. Plot Buyer’s Agreement (C-3) executed between the applicants and\r\nrespondent on 28.04.2017, whereby even the area and the price was increased and\r\nthe applicants were not left with an option to protest as the respondent\r\nthreatened them about forfeiture of their money. The applicants have availed\r\nloan of Rs. 3062500 from HDFC Ltd. (C-4). The applicants have made a payment of Rs. 4677500 to the respondent and payment proofs are annexed as C-5. The respondent\r\nhas misrepresented the applicants since beginning and never informed them about the true picture of the\r\napprovals and the development. It had not even applied the permissions when the plot was sold to the\r\napplicants. A list of approvals and main agreement are attached as C-6 and C-7. The agreement executed by the respondent is also not as per the RERA Act. The applicants had earlier filed consumer complaint no. 270 of 2018 and the same was withdrawn with liberty to avail any other remedy available as per law (C-8).</span><br></p>','<p>(i) Directing the respondent to refund the principal amount i.e. Rs. 4677500/- as per Section 18\r\nof RERA along with interest to be calculated at the rate as contemplated under rule 16 of The Punjab\r\nState Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Rules, 2017, as the applicants have lost faith in the\r\nrespondent due to misrepresentation by it about the approvals and stages of development during all these\r\nyears and thus the applicants wish to withdraw from the project. Also the respondent has committed violation of various provisions of\r\nPAPRA and conditions of various approvals granted to it, as it could not collect any amount till the\r\nexemption is received under Section 44 of PAPRA which was received on 25.01.2017. The respondent\r\ncollected the money from the applicants in 2012. The approvals were granted to the respondent on the\r\nground that it will not sell any land/plot/space and collect money from the general public till exemption\r\nunder Section 44 of PAPRA is received. Also, inspite of receiving 50% of sale consideration the\r\nrespondent did not execute any sale agreement&nbsp; and the same was executed afeter a delay of more than 5 years and after having received more than 65% of the sale consideration. (ii) Directing the respondent to pay the compensation of Rs.10 lacs for deficiency in services, unfair trade practices &amp; harassment caused to the complainant &amp; for using their hard earned money for such a long period. (iii) Directing the respondent to pay litigation expenses to the tune of Rs. 50000/-. (iv) To take action against respondent under Section 61 of RERA for constant violation of provision of Section 13 of RERA as the respondent failed to issue any allotment letter &amp; execute the buyer’s agreement on time. For cancelling the extension granted to the respondent for constantly violating various provisions of RERA and for indulging into unfair trade practices and further cancelling the main registration of the respondent under RERA.</p>',5948405.00,4677500.00,'2019-09-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>The respondent be directed to provide the list of allottees to whom it has allotted/sold the 862 residential plots as per the layout plan approved by GMADA on 6.10.2015. The respondent has been duly registered under RERA for the said approved layout plan. As per the said approved layout plan, the respondent can sell 862 residential plots and 73 commercial plots/spaces.The respondent be directed to provide the list of hypothecated plots ,which are hypothecated to GMADA, out of the said approved 862 residential and 73 commercial plotsThe respondent be directed to provide the list of hypothected plots already allotted/sold to general public.The respondent be directed to provide the details of funds collected from the general public since 2010 in lieu of the said approved 862 residential plots which are part of approved layout plan and for which the respondent is duly registered under Section 3 of RERA and also, the detail where such amount has been utilized by the respondentThe respondent be directed to provide all the bank details where such amount has been deposited along with the statement of accounts since the year 2010. The respondent be directed to provide the details in respect of number of bookings made by the respondent since the year 2010 for the said 862 residential plots.&nbsp;</p>','1','','2017-03-07 00:00:00','2017-04-28 00:00:00','1370','','',2,0,0,0,'BeeG','2018-11-26 17:32:23.000','BeeG','2018-11-26 17:32:23.000'),(384,1137,'1137',1091,'e2da2916-c5af-4a15-acce-51dcf84d70a2','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-27 14:37:20.000','Vivek Jaggi','captvivekjaggi@yahoo.com',9582854003,0,0,'House No. 192, Lane D,','Lakshapuram Ladpur, Raipur Road, Dehradun',34,162,'248008','1','House No. 2378, Sector 35-C,','',6,128,'160035','Rajeev Anand','anandlawoffice2378@gmail.com',9417870805,1722622364,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','Wave Estate Project','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd Through its MD','customercare@waveestate.in',0,0,'PO Rayon and Silk Mills','Adjoining Coca Cola Depot GT Road, Chheharta',28,39,'143105','0','M/s Country Colonizers Pvt Ltd. Wave Estate Project site office sector 85','SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The Complainant booked Apartment&nbsp;No.\r\n67 SF, 2nd Floor Sec- G, Wave Floor, Sec 99 Mohali on 05.02.2013 making initial\r\npayments <b>(Annexure C-1)﻿.</b> Agreement\r\nwas executed for area 1060sqFt @ 3773.58/sqFt.&nbsp;As per Clause 5.2, the\r\nProject was to be developed and Apartment was to be handed over in 24 months\r\n&amp; by Cl. 5.5, Rs. 5/sqFt/month was to be paid for delay but copy of\r\nAgreement though signed not given to Complainant. The Complainant was given\r\nloan in June 2013<b>.</b>&nbsp;On 27.01.2015,\r\nthe Complainant was made to fill another Agreement <b>(Annexure C-2)</b> and the Apartment of the Complainant was\r\nunilaterally changed with new No. 44/SF, Wave Floor Sec 99, Mohali.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The Complainant found that site plan of\r\nApartment has been changed by closing bathroom door opening in bedroom etc.\r\nHaving found the Project and the Apartment delayed, the Complainant being in\r\nArmy and handicapped in monitoring the development pace due to hard and remote\r\narea posting kept approaching the Promoter Office telephonically that\r\nconstruction started with 2 years delay &amp; not completed &amp; that even\r\nafter 4 1/2 years possession not offered. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The apartment was to be completed &amp;\r\nhanded over by January 2016 but not done against which Complainant visited and\r\nmet the officials of the Promoter. The Respondent made unilateral Deed of\r\nSettlement on 28.06.2018 <b>(Annexure C-3)</b>\r\nto give interest and also possession but since not honoured by Respondent, the\r\nDeed of Settlement became redundant.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Now on 08.10.2018 <b>(Annexure C-4)</b> a Statement of Account has been given wherein area\r\nincreased and money charged for that without any increase in Apartment area.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">The Complainant has no shelter inspite of spending huge amount &amp;\r\nleft in lurch.</span><br></p>','<p>The Apartment was to be handed over after completing the Project in 24 months +6 Months &amp; monthly compensation of Rs5/SqFt/month was to be paid from Jan 2016 onwards till date but NOT PAID.\r\n</p><p>The Respondent has taken the total sale price as Rs. 3 Lakhs on 05.02.13 and 3 lakhs on 30.03.13 + 2 Lakhs on 27.03.15 + 10 Lakhs on 31.03.2015 + 42000 on 15.11.15 + 10 Lakhs on 18.11.2015 + 6 lakhs on 26.06.17 + 26000 on 30.07.17 + 86000 on 11.01.2018 totaling 36 Lakhs (+ service Tax on each payment) as also EMIs with interest.\r\n</p><p>Inspite of elapsing of over 5 years of Agreement, no development &amp; construction works have been completed in the Complex and the Respondent Promoter has failed in its obligation towards the Complex and Independent Floor allotted to the Complainant. The Respondent Promoter is liable to pay the interest on the payment so received for the period of delay in offering possession after the completion of the development works of the project and the completion of the construction of the Independent Residential Floor. The possession is given in incomplete project. The relative of an Allottee who took possession recently suffered electrocution and was in ICU as received injuries and burns. The Apartment is not finished. The electric wires are open, potholes are not covered etc. The Promoter is just trying to meet the time limit without completion and full development.  \r\n</p><p>In view of the above : \r\n</p><p>(i) The Applicant is seeking compensation as applicable in Para 5.5 of Agreement from January 2016 onwards till date; \r\n</p><p>(ii) directions for completion of the development works of the project and the construction of the independent residential floor in question without any further delay and also offer the possession after the grant of Occupation Certificate of the Building and the Completion Certificate of the Wave Estate Project alongwith interest and compensation prescribed under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act 2016 as the action of the Respondent.</p>',4000000.00,3600000.00,'2016-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Pending final decision on the complaint the\r\ncomplainant seeks issue of the following interim order :<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The respondents be directed to complete the\r\ndevelopment works of the project and the construction of the independent\r\nresidential floor in question without any further delay and also offer the\r\npossession after the grant of occupation certificate of the Building and the\r\nCompletion Certificate of the Wave Estate Project.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The Promoter be also\r\ndirected to pay interim monthly interest and compensation till the completion\r\nof the project and the complex in question in the pendency of the complaint</span>.</span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2015-01-27 00:00:00','Independent Residential Floor Bearing No. 67 SF, 2nd Floor Sec- G, Wave Floor, Sec 99 Mohali','','',1,1,0,0,'RajeevAnand','2018-11-26 18:42:33.000','RajeevAnand','2018-11-26 18:42:33.000'),(385,1129,'1129',1226,'5bc88368-bef1-4451-a36b-5d7ae9738025','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-26 21:45:33.000','Preeti Sudan','advmadhursharma@gmail.com',9780175460,0,0,'H.no 26, new moti bagh officers colony','',10,562,'110023','1','H.no 26, new moti bagh officers colony','',10,562,'110023','Madhur Sharma','advmadhursharma@gmail.com',9780175460,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0351','Sanskriti Homes (under promoter name)M/s. Sanskriti Golden Oak\r\nReal Estate Pvt. Ltd.,\r\nDLF Pocket R2, New\r\nChandigarh (Mullanpur),\r\nDistrict S.A.S. Nagar, \r\n','Ravi Garg','info@sanskritihomes.com',9501254111,0,'Sanskriti Homes through Director Ravi Garg Flat no 204 Tower no.3 Royal Estate amb. road  zirakpur','M/s. Sanskriti Golden Oak Real Estate Pvt. Ltd., DLF Pocket R2, New Chandigarh (Mullanpur), ',28,507,'140603','0','Sanskriti Homes Through Director Ravi Garg Flat no 204 Tower no.3 Royal Estate Amb. Road zirakpur',' Ravi Garg, Flat no 405, Tower no.18 Royal Estate, Ambala Road, near best price, zirakpur.',28,507,'140603','1','<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-align: justify;\">Th<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">at\r\nMs. Preeti Sudan, complainant had booked a Flat (SF2/R3/205/2) in the project “Sanskriti\r\nHomes in DLF” situated in Sector 3B, New Chandigarh (Mullanpur) [RERA\r\nRegistration no. PBRERA-SAS80PR0351] which was launched by the company\r\nSanskriti Golden Oak Real Estate Pvt. Ltdin 2014. The director and the one of\r\nthe main person of the company is Sh Ravi Garg S/o Ishwar Chander Garg R/o H no\r\n639 Sector 11-B, Chandigarh and Flat no 204, Tower no.3 Royal Estate, Ambala Road,\r\nnear best price, zirakpur, Mohali, Punjab and Flat no 405, Tower no.18 Royal\r\nEstate, Ambala Road, near best price, zirakpur, Mohali, Punjab. The company\r\n[M/s. Sanskriti Golden Oak Real Estate Pvt. Ltd., DLF Pocket R2, New Chandigarh\r\n(Mullanpur), District S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali] at the time of booking had promised\r\ncompletion of the project in 2 years. However, when it failed to even start the\r\nproject, I stopped making the payment and sought refund. The company kept on\r\nsending emails for making payments but there was no work on the ground. That Rs.15,38,700/-as\r\npayments was made to the company in 5 Installments. That when confronted Mr\r\nRavi Garg, Director, assured me the refund of booking amount and accordingly on\r\n8.9.2016 the original document of the flat were handed over to the company\r\nrepresentative Mr Bhushan Garg. However, for the last more then two years Mr\r\nRavi Garg has been not given back a single penny and is delaying the refund by\r\nmaking excuses. Everytime, when you ask him about the status of the refund, he\r\nseeks some time on one pretext or the other and then does not make the payment.\r\nAt one time he said that he will transfer the fund to my account through NEFT\r\nbut failed to do so. The same can be checked from his bank records. The\r\nallotment letter dated 11.06.2015 attached for your reference and also letter\r\ndated 08.09.2016 to refund the amount paid to them and giving back the original\r\ndocuments to them.</span></span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntab-stops:225.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:.5in;tab-stops:225.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Keeping in view this background, it requested that a\r\ncomplaint be lodged against Mr Ravi Garg and Sanskriti Golden Oak Real Estate\r\nPvt. Ltd for cheating, misrepresentation of facts and not refunding the money\r\nwith interest paid by me in spite of returning the original documents.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-indent: 0.5in;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:.5in;tab-stops:225.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">It is therefore, most respectfully and humbly prayed that\r\nthis Hon’ble forum may be please to:</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:225.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Award\r\nthe refund of the money (Rs.15,38,700/-) paid by the complainant to the\r\nRespondent.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:225.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Award\r\ninterest @24% with the effect from the date of signing of the allotment letter.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:225.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">I reserve my right to file complaint under form N for relief&nbsp;of compensation.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:225.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:225.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">To pass any other order or relief that this\r\nHon’ble forum may deem fit in the interest of justice.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>',6484200.00,1538700.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Respondent\"s personal and company bank accounts should be attached to the sum/amount give to him by the complainant.&nbsp;','1','','2015-06-11 00:00:00','2015-07-25 00:00:00','SF2/R3/205/II','','',1,1,0,0,'advmadhursharma','2018-11-26 21:45:24.000','advmadhursharma','2018-11-26 21:45:24.000'),(386,1146,'1146',1041,'096eee2a-089a-4edc-b9bc-175467695b4a','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','RAZNEE DEWAN','varinderkamboj@yahoo.com',9814028866,0,0,'2027 GURU NANAK VIHAR','SECTOR 48 C',6,128,'160047','1','2027 GURU NANAK VIHAR','SECTOR 48 C',6,128,'160047','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','FALCON VIEW APARTMENTS','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS PVT. LTD.','janta@jantahousing.com',0,0,'SCO 39-42','SECTOR 82',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39-42','SECTOR 82',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;</b><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Briefly the facts are&nbsp; submitted below:</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1)<span style=\"background:yellow\">I intended to buy “Construction Linked Plan”\r\nApartment D-502 in the Project Falcon View, Sector 66 A Mohali.</span>The Total\r\nCost of Apartment(3007 sq. feet)&nbsp;<span style=\"background:yellow\">was&nbsp;<b>1,12,50725</b>(excluding\r\nservice tax).</span>I had paid the Booking Amount&nbsp;<b><span style=\"background:yellow\">Rs 27,51,175(including Service Tax)&nbsp; dated Dec.\r\n8,2012.</span></b><span style=\"background:yellow\">It</span>&nbsp;was agreed\r\nthat the installments would be made in consonance with the progress of the Apartment\r\nin the Project.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">2)I\r\nreceived&nbsp;<span style=\"background:yellow\">Allotment Letter on&nbsp;<b>Mar\r\n8,2013</b></span>.As per clause 2.24 of&nbsp;<b><span style=\"background:yellow\">the\r\nallotment letter(Mar 8,2013),</span></b>the possession of Apartment was to be\r\ngiven within 30 months from the date of issue of Allotment letter\r\nmeaning&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"background:yellow\">the possession</span>&nbsp;was\r\nto be delivered upto&nbsp;<b><span style=\"background:yellow\">Sep 7,2015(Date Of\r\nPossession).The conditions imposed in the &nbsp;Allotment Letter were\r\nunilateral and favourable to the Builder/JLPL.</span></b><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3<span style=\"background:yellow\">)Till Sep. 7,2015 ie possession date</span>&nbsp;,<b><span style=\"background:yellow\">I had paid the Total&nbsp; Amount 80,13,676(including\r\ntax,Paid upto Aug 20,2015)</span></b>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<b><span style=\"background:\r\nyellow\">till Feb 26,2018</span></b><span style=\"background:yellow\">&nbsp;,Total\r\nAmount paid is&nbsp;<b>RS 1,08,14,247</b></span>&nbsp;. I have attached the\r\ndetails&nbsp; with Dates Payment Amount was paid.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;<b>I\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;pray for the following compensation(s)&nbsp;-</b><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1<span style=\"background:yellow\">)<b>Interest on all &nbsp;Payments made by me &nbsp;as\r\nprescribed by the Punjab RERA Act &nbsp;from the Date of Receipt of 1</b></span></span><b><sup><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background: yellow;\">st</span></sup></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background: yellow;\">&nbsp;Payment.</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">I&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\nwould also&nbsp; like&nbsp; to mention that JLPL started paying Rs 27,063 per\r\nmonth(almost) as&nbsp;<b>unilaterly imposed&nbsp;</b>&nbsp;in the agreement(Rs\r\n10 per square feet) from Oct.-Nov. 2015 for the delayed period.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;I pray to the &nbsp;Honourable Judge &nbsp;to&nbsp; provide\r\ninterest &nbsp;as per the Punjab RERA act,<span style=\"background:yellow\">the rate of interest under rules is 10.1% .</span></span></b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;Similar compensation has been awarded&nbsp; in the previous\r\nJudgements.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">2)As per “<b><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">Flat Holder\'s Card<i><span style=\"color:#000081\">” </span></i></span></b>provided July 12,2018,the Area of\r\nflat has been increased to 3208 sq feet.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">The Area of Flat as per <span style=\"background:yellow\">Allotment\r\nLetter dated <b>Mar 8,2013</b></span> is 3007 sq. feet. Amount as per 3550 per\r\nsq feet, has been demanded for Additional Area of 201 sq feet.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The Additional area of 201 sq. feet (</span></b><b>as per “</b><b><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">Flat Holder\'s Card<i><span style=\"color:#000081\">” </span></i></span></b><b>provided July 12,2018),is completely unjustifiable and irrational.It\r\nseems whimisical as it is mischiviously&nbsp;\r\nadded to extract more Money. <o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">I pray to the &nbsp;Honourable Judge &nbsp;for&nbsp; waiving the&nbsp; cost of&nbsp;\r\nadditional area which was recently added(Flat Holder’s Card).<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3)<span style=\"background:yellow\">A compensation of RS 10,00000(10\r\nLakh) for harassment,mental and physical agony and inconvenience.</span></span></b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">4)<b><span style=\"background:yellow\">Waiving of GST applicable</span></b>&nbsp;on the\r\noutstanding amount as GST being paid on account of late possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">5)<b><span style=\"background:yellow\">No further Payment be demanded until possession is\r\ngiven</span></b><span style=\"background:yellow\">.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">6)<b>A\r\ncorrect date of possession of the Apartment&nbsp; be provided and if possession\r\nnot handed over by that date,then Additional Compensation amount&nbsp; be\r\ndecided</b>.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',11250725.00,10814247.00,'2015-09-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5p