;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3)<span style=\"background: yellow;\">A compensation of RS 10,00000(10 Lakh) for harassment,mental and physical agony and inconvenience.</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">4)<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"background: yellow;\">Waiving of GST applicable</span></span>&nbsp;on the outstanding amount as GST being paid on account of late possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">5)<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"background: yellow;\">No further Payment be demanded until possession is given</span></span><span style=\"background: yellow;\">.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">6)<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">A correct date of possession of the Apartment&nbsp; be provided and if possession not handed over by that date,then Additional Compensation amount&nbsp; be decided</span>.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: roboto, serif; text-align: justify; background: yellow;\"></span><br></p>','1','','2013-03-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','D-502,FALCON VIEW APARTMENTS,SECTOR 66 A MOHALI','','',2,0,0,0,'VARINDER7','2018-11-27 00:15:43.000','VARINDER7','2018-11-27 00:15:43.000'),(388,1146,'1146',1041,'096eee2a-089a-4edc-b9bc-175467695b4a','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-13 13:19:51.000','RAZNEE DEWAN','varinderkamboj@yahoo.com',9814028866,0,0,'2027 GURU NANAK VIHAR','SECTOR 48 C',6,128,'160047','1','2027 GURU NANAK VIHAR','SECTOR 48 C',6,128,'160047','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','FALCON VIEW APARTMENTS','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS PVT. LTD.','janta@jantahousing.com',0,0,'SCO 39-42','SECTOR 82',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39-42','SECTOR 82',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;</b><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Briefly the facts are&nbsp; submitted below:</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1)<span style=\"background:yellow\">I intended to buy “Construction Linked Plan”\r\nApartment D-502 in the Project Falcon View, Sector 66 A Mohali.</span>The Total\r\nCost of Apartment(3007 sq. feet)&nbsp;<span style=\"background:yellow\">was&nbsp;<b>1,12,50725</b>(excluding\r\nservice tax).</span>I had paid the Booking Amount&nbsp;<b><span style=\"background:yellow\">Rs 27,51,175(including Service Tax)&nbsp; dated Dec.\r\n8,2012.</span></b><span style=\"background:yellow\">It</span>&nbsp;was agreed\r\nthat the installments would be made in consonance with the progress of the Apartment\r\nin the Project.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">2)I\r\nreceived&nbsp;<span style=\"background:yellow\">Allotment Letter on&nbsp;<b>Mar\r\n8,2013</b></span>.As per clause 2.24 of&nbsp;<b><span style=\"background:yellow\">the\r\nallotment letter(Mar 8,2013),</span></b>the possession of Apartment was to be\r\ngiven within 30 months from the date of issue of Allotment letter\r\nmeaning&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"background:yellow\">the possession</span>&nbsp;was\r\nto be delivered upto&nbsp;<b><span style=\"background:yellow\">Sep 7,2015(Date Of\r\nPossession).The conditions imposed in the &nbsp;Allotment Letter were\r\nunilateral and favourable to the Builder/JLPL.</span></b><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3<span style=\"background:yellow\">)Till Sep. 7,2015 ie possession date</span>&nbsp;,<b><span style=\"background:yellow\">I had paid the Total&nbsp; Amount 80,13,676(including\r\ntax,Paid upto Aug 20,2015)</span></b>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<b><span style=\"background:\r\nyellow\">till Feb 26,2018</span></b><span style=\"background:yellow\">&nbsp;,Total\r\nAmount paid is&nbsp;<b>RS 1,08,14,247</b></span>&nbsp;. I have attached the\r\ndetails&nbsp; with Dates Payment Amount was paid.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;<b>I\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;pray for the following compensation(s)&nbsp;-</b><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1<span style=\"background:yellow\">)<b>Interest on all &nbsp;Payments made by me &nbsp;as\r\nprescribed by the Punjab RERA Act &nbsp;from the Date of Receipt of 1</b></span></span><b><sup><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background: yellow;\">st</span></sup></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background: yellow;\">&nbsp;Payment.</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">I&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\nwould also&nbsp; like&nbsp; to mention that JLPL started paying Rs 27,063 per\r\nmonth(almost) as&nbsp;<b>unilaterly imposed&nbsp;</b>&nbsp;in the agreement(Rs\r\n10 per square feet) from Oct.-Nov. 2015 for the delayed period.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;I pray to the &nbsp;Honourable Judge &nbsp;to&nbsp; provide\r\ninterest &nbsp;as per the Punjab RERA act,<span style=\"background:yellow\">the rate of interest under rules is 10.1% .</span></span></b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;Similar compensation has been awarded&nbsp; in the previous\r\nJudgements.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">2)As per “<b><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">Flat Holder\'s Card<i><span style=\"color:#000081\">” </span></i></span></b>provided July 12,2018,the Area of\r\nflat has been increased to 3208 sq feet.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">The Area of Flat as per <span style=\"background:yellow\">Allotment\r\nLetter dated <b>Mar 8,2013</b></span> is 3007 sq. feet. Amount as per 3550 per\r\nsq feet, has been demanded for Additional Area of 201 sq feet.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The Additional area of 201 sq. feet (</span></b><b>as per “</b><b><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">Flat Holder\'s Card<i><span style=\"color:#000081\">” </span></i></span></b><b>provided July 12,2018),is completely unjustifiable and irrational.It\r\nseems whimisical as it is mischiviously&nbsp;\r\nadded to extract more Money. <o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">I pray to the &nbsp;Honourable Judge &nbsp;for&nbsp; waiving the&nbsp; cost of&nbsp;\r\nadditional area which was recently added(Flat Holder’s Card).<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3)<span style=\"background:yellow\">A compensation of RS 10,00000(10\r\nLakh) for harassment,mental and physical agony and inconvenience.</span></span></b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">4)<b><span style=\"background:yellow\">Waiving of GST applicable</span></b>&nbsp;on the\r\noutstanding amount as GST being paid on account of late possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">5)<b><span style=\"background:yellow\">No further Payment be demanded until possession is\r\ngiven</span></b><span style=\"background:yellow\">.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">6)<b>A\r\ncorrect date of possession of the Apartment&nbsp; be provided and if possession\r\nnot handed over by that date,then Additional Compensation amount&nbsp; be\r\ndecided</b>.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',11250725.00,10814247.00,'2015-09-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">I &nbsp;&nbsp;pray for the following compensation(s)&nbsp;-</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1<span style=\"background: yellow;\">)<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Interest on all &nbsp;Payments made by me &nbsp;as prescribed by the Punjab RERA Act &nbsp;from the Date of Receipt of 1</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><sup style=\"font-size: 10.5px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background: yellow;\">st</span></sup></span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background: yellow;\">&nbsp;Payment.</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">I&nbsp;&nbsp; would also&nbsp; like&nbsp; to mention that JLPL started paying Rs 27,063 per month(almost) as&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">unilaterly imposed&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;in the agreement(Rs 10 per square feet) from Oct.-Nov. 2015 for the delayed period.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;I pray to the &nbsp;Honourable Judge &nbsp;to&nbsp; provide interest&nbsp;&nbsp;as per the Punjab RERA act,<span style=\"background: yellow;\">the rate of interest under rules is 10.1% .</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;Similar compensation has been awarded&nbsp; in the previous Judgements.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">2)As per “<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Flat Holder\'s Card<i><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 129);\">”&nbsp;</span></i></span></span>provided July 12,2018,the Area of flat has been increased to 3208 sq feet.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">The Area of Flat as per&nbsp;<span style=\"background: yellow;\">Allotment Letter dated&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Mar 8,2013</span></span>&nbsp;is 3007 sq. feet. Amount as per 3550 per sq feet, has been demanded for Additional Area of 201 sq feet.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The Additional area of 201 sq. feet (</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">as per “</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Flat Holder\'s Card<i><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 129);\">”&nbsp;</span></i></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">provided July 12,2018),is completely unjustifiable and irrational.It seems whimisical as it is mischiviously&nbsp;&nbsp;added to extract more Money.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">I pray to the &nbsp;Honourable Judge &nbsp;for&nbsp; waiving the&nbsp;&nbsp;cost of&nbsp;&nbsp;additional area which was recently added(Flat Holder’s Card).<o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3)<span style=\"background: yellow;\">A compensation of RS 10,00000(10 Lakh) for harassment,mental and physical agony and inconvenience.</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">4)<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"background: yellow;\">Waiving of GST applicable</span></span>&nbsp;on the outstanding amount as GST being paid on account of late possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">5)<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"background: yellow;\">No further Payment be demanded until possession is given</span></span><span style=\"background: yellow;\">.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">6)<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">A correct date of possession of the Apartment&nbsp; be provided and if possession not handed over by that date,then Additional Compensation amount&nbsp; be decided</span>.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: roboto, serif; text-align: justify; background: yellow;\"></span><br></p>','1','','2013-03-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','D-502,FALCON VIEW APARTMENTS,SECTOR 66 A MOHALI','','',2,0,0,0,'VARINDER7','2018-11-27 08:04:33.000','VARINDER7','2018-11-27 08:04:33.000');
INSERT INTO `verified_table_tbl_rera_complaint_formm_details` VALUES (389,1147,'1147',1066,'3568b05d-bd51-44d0-b387-09a3505b7441','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','GVStar Estates LLP LLP','ramsingh.dil@gmail.com',8699904514,0,0,'House no 726, Sector 2 Panchkula','',13,15,'134102','1','House no 2322 sector 66 mohali','',28,507,'160062','Neeraj Sobti','Advocatesobti@yahoo.co.in',9872279500,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','Falcon view  phase 2,sas nagar sector 66A mohali','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS LTD','janta@jantahousing.com',8284045724,0,'SCO 39-42, sector 82','industrial area , mohali',28,507,'160062','1','SCO 39-42, sector 82','industrial area , mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p>That, in the year 2013, “FALCON VIEW”, in Phase-II, (wrongly mentioned as Phase-I, in allotment letter dated 02.08.2013, Annexure C-1) Sector 66-A, Mohali, 4 BHK Apartment i.e. No. E-401, 4th Floor, wing E, Facing Green, Falcon View, Phase-II, (wrongly mentioned as Phase-I, in allotment letter dated 02.08.2013, Annexure C-1) Sector 66-A, Mohali, Punjab, measuring 3007 sq. ft., @Rs.3,600/- per sq. ft., the total sale consideration amount was fixed as Rs.1,08,25,200/-. Copy of allotment letter is Annexure C-1.</p><p>Applicant paid the following amount to the respondents copies of all the receipts are Annexure C-2 to C-11</p><p>That as per Clause no.2.24 of the allotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (annexure C-1) the possession of the said apartment complete in all respects shall be delivered to the applicant by 01.02.2016, i.e. 30 months from the date of allotment letter i.e. 02.08.2013.\r\n</p><p>&nbsp;However the applicant after waited sufficiently again sent a reminder to the respondent on 12.06.2018, reminder and postal receipts are Annexure C-12 to C-17. </p><p>The applicant on 01.07.2018 took some photographs in his mobile showing the present incomplete status of the tower in which the flat of the applicant exist. Copies of the photographs are Annexure C-18 Colly.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>The entire project of the respondents is illegal,notification dated 14.09.2006 and the State Level Environment Impact Assessment Authority (SEIAA) had already initiated action against the respondent.\r\n</p><p>That earlier the complainant has filed a complaint before this Hon’ble court i.e. Complaint No. ADC/1007/2018, which was returned vide order&nbsp; dated 30.10.2018, with liberty to file fresh complaint on Form – M, copy of order is Annexure C-19. </p><p>Further in CWP. No.13152 of 2014, decided by the Hon’ble Punjab &amp; Haryana High Court, vide its order dated 04.04.2018, the respondent had agreed to refund the principal amount alongwith 18% interest and as such the respondents are also liable to refund the principal amount of the complainant C-21.</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:97%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:97%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:Times\">In view of the facts\r\nmentioned in paragraph 4 above, the complainant prays for the following\r\nrelief(s) <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">That as\r\nthe respondents have failed to comply with the terms and conditions of the\r\nallotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (Annexure C-1) and have failed to deliver the\r\npossession of the apartment/flat within the stipulated time. Therefore, the\r\napplicant as per section 18 of the RERA Act. 2016, is entitled for<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Refund principal amount of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">10,580,830/- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">of the\r\napplicant </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">along</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> with interest @ 18% P.a. from the date of actual payment till\r\nrealization. <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Pay compensation of Rs.5,00,000/- to the applicant for mental\r\nharassment, mental agony <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">iii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Any other relief which this Hon’ble authority deems fit may also\r\nbe passed in favor of the applicant.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:6.4pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nTimes\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>',10825200.00,10825200.00,'2016-02-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:97%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:97%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:Times\">In view of the facts\r\nmentioned in paragraph 4 above, the complainant prays for the following\r\nrelief(s) <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">That as\r\nthe respondents have failed to comply with the terms and conditions of the\r\nallotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (Annexure C-1) and have failed to deliver the\r\npossession of the apartment/flat within the stipulated time. Therefore, the\r\napplicant as per section 18 of the RERA Act. 2016, is entitled for<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Refund principal amount of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">10,580,830/- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">of the\r\napplicant </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">along</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> with interest @ 18% P.a. from the date of actual payment till\r\nrealization. <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Pay compensation of Rs.5,00,000/- to the applicant for mental\r\nharassment, mental agony <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">iii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Any other relief which this Hon’ble authority deems fit may also\r\nbe passed in favor of the applicant.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:6.4pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nTimes\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>','1','','2013-08-02 00:00:00','2013-08-02 00:00:00','Flat No E-401 , E wing, Falcon View, Sector 66 A, Sas Nagar Mohali','','',1,0,0,0,'GVstarLLP','2018-11-27 10:07:47.000','GVstarLLP','2018-11-27 10:07:47.000'),(390,1148,'1148',1052,'431fa145-0d87-4135-8675-676d71d47e05','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Shefali  Joshi','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7680044078,0,0,'House No 337, First Floor, Sector 8, Panchkula','',13,15,'134109','1','1007, E Block Golden Sand Apartments, Old Kalka Road, ZirakPur, Mohali, Punjab','',28,39,'140603','Ved Parkash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL34-PR0372','Shourya Greens','M/s shourya towers Pvt Ltd.','varun.sharma2021@gmail.com',7065300094,0,'Adj.Surya Enclave , H.B No.-307/2, Near Trinity college, Amritsar Bypass Road, jalandhar','',28,261,'144001','0','Regd,Off-78 B, Sector-D 2, group II, DDA flat, Kondli Gharoli','',10,120,'110096','1','<p>The respondent being promoters and developers are engaged in construction and sales of residential units/flats. One such project is Shourya Greens which is an ongoing project and is registered with the authority as per regn number above.\r\n</p><p>Initially, Shri Devinder Singh s/o Sh. Tika Ram &amp; Mr. Ashok Joshi booking the apartment nno E-101 in the aforesaid project of the respondent. A provisional allotment letter dated 03.04.2006 was issued to the allottees at a total  consideration of Rs. 21,91, 000/-(Annexure I).\r\n</p><p>Later on, the apartment was changed in the name of  Saumya Joshi d/o Mr. Ashok Joshi in place of Devinder Singh and Mr. Ashok Joshi remained co-allottee on 20.11.2007.\r\n</p><p>Therefore, the said apartment was changed in the name of Shefali Joshi D/o Ashok Joshi in place of Saumya Joshi and Ashok Joshi on the basis of application dated 10.06.2013. (Annexure II).\r\n</p><p>The respondent issued a letter dated 22.07.2011 confirmation the possession date as March 12 and also incorporated a clause that in case of delay in handing over the possession the respondent would pay penaly @ Rs. 5/- sq.ft per month. (Annexure III).\r\n</p><p>The respondent did not enter into a separate agreement to sell. Both the allotment letter and subsequent letter as per annexure III constitute agreement to sell.       \r\n</p><p>The respondent has issued a statement of account confirmation receipt of various payments from the allottee/s. (Annexure IV).\r\n</p><p>The respondent has also issued a No Dues Certificate dated 2.08.2013 confirming receipt of all payments towards consideration of the allotted unit by the allottee. (Annexure V).\r\n</p><p>Despite repeated reminders and visits to the project site, the respondent has not been able to offer the exact date of handing over of the possession till date.\r\n</p><p>The respondent has now taken a plea that revised timelines submitted with RERA, Punjab is 10.10.2022 and therefore the allottee is not entitled for early possession.\r\n</p><p>In view of the above, it is submitted that the complainant has lo</p>','<p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">In view of the above,</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">it is submitted that the respondent has violated\r\nthe provisions of Section 18 of the Act and prays for<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Refund of the amount of 21,28,896/-, along with\r\ninterest as per RERA&nbsp; Provisions from the respective dates of payments\r\nmade to the respondent.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">It is further prayed that the complainant may be\r\ncompensated by the respondent for an amount of Rs. 2,00,000/- on account of\r\nmental and economic sufferings to the complainant on account of delay in\r\nhanding over of the possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Thanking You,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Shefali Joshi<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Complainant<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Through<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Ved Parkash<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">CS in Practice<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Authorized Representative<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>',2151875.00,2151875.00,'2012-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Not Applicable</p>','1','','2006-04-03 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','E-1,101,Shourya greens','','',2,0,0,0,'shefalijoshi','2018-11-27 12:16:55.000','shefalijoshi','2018-11-27 12:16:55.000'),(391,1148,'1148',1052,'431fa145-0d87-4135-8675-676d71d47e05','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Shefali  Joshi','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7680044078,0,0,'House No 337, First Floor, Sector 8, Panchkula','',13,15,'134109','1','1007, E Block Golden Sand Apartments, Old Kalka Road, ZirakPur, Mohali, Punjab','',28,39,'140603','Ved Parkash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL34-PR0372','Shourya Greens','M/s shourya towers Pvt Ltd.','varun.sharma2021@gmail.com',7065300094,0,'Adj.Surya Enclave , H.B No.-307/2, Near Trinity college, Amritsar Bypass Road, jalandhar','',28,261,'144001','0','Regd,Off-78 B, Sector-D 2, group II, DDA flat, Kondli Gharoli','',10,120,'110096','1','<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">That the same cpomplaint was uploaded in Form N and it was rejected under technical grounds, the copy of order is attached and now it is being uploaded in Form M.</span></p><p>The respondent being promoters and developers are engaged in construction and sales of residential units/flats. One such project is Shourya Greens which is an ongoing project and is registered with the authority as per regn number above.\r\n</p><p>Initially, Shri Devinder Singh s/o Sh. Tika Ram &amp; Mr. Ashok Joshi booking the apartment nno E-101 in the aforesaid project of the respondent. A provisional allotment letter dated 03.04.2006 was issued to the allottees at a total  consideration of Rs. 21,91, 000/-(Annexure I).\r\n</p><p>Later on, the apartment was changed in the name of  Saumya Joshi d/o Mr. Ashok Joshi in place of Devinder Singh and Mr. Ashok Joshi remained co-allottee on 20.11.2007.\r\n</p><p>Therefore, the said apartment was changed in the name of Shefali Joshi D/o Ashok Joshi in place of Saumya Joshi and Ashok Joshi on the basis of application dated 10.06.2013. (Annexure II).\r\n</p><p>The respondent issued a letter dated 22.07.2011 confirmation the possession date as March 12 and also incorporated a clause that in case of delay in handing over the possession the respondent would pay penalty @ Rs. 5/- sq.ft per month. (Annexure III).\r\n</p><p>The respondent did not enter into a separate agreement to sell. Both the allotment letter and subsequent letter as per annexure III constitute agreement to sell.       \r\n</p><p>The respondent has issued a statement of account confirmation receipt of various payments from the allottee/s. (Annexure IV).\r\n</p><p>The respondent has also issued a No Dues Certificate dated 2.08.2013 confirming receipt of all payments towards consideration of the allotted unit by the allottee. (Annexure V).</p>','<p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">In view of the above,</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">it is submitted that the respondent has violated\r\nthe provisions of Section 18 of the Act and prays for<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Refund of the amount of 21,28,896/-, along with\r\ninterest as per RERA&nbsp; Provisions from the respective dates of payments\r\nmade to the respondent.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">It is further prayed that the complainant may be\r\ncompensated by the respondent for an amount of Rs. 2,00,000/- on account of\r\nmental and economic sufferings to the complainant on account of delay in\r\nhanding over of the possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Thanking You,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Shefali Joshi<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Complainant<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Through<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Ved Parkash<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">CS in Practice<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Authorized Representative<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>',2151875.00,2151875.00,'2012-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Not Applicable</p>','1','','2006-04-03 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','E-1,101,Shourya greens','','',2,0,0,0,'shefalijoshi','2018-11-27 12:26:29.000','shefalijoshi','2018-11-27 12:26:29.000'),(392,1148,'1148',1052,'431fa145-0d87-4135-8675-676d71d47e05','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-06 11:38:51.000','Shefali  Joshi','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7680044078,0,0,'House No 337, First Floor, Sector 8, Panchkula','',13,15,'134109','1','1007, E Block Golden Sand Apartments, Old Kalka Road, ZirakPur, Mohali, Punjab','',28,39,'140603','Ved Parkash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL34-PR0372','Shourya Greens','M/s shourya towers Pvt Ltd.','varun.sharma2021@gmail.com',7065300094,0,'Adj.Surya Enclave , H.B No.-307/2, Near Trinity college, Amritsar Bypass Road, jalandhar','',28,261,'144001','0','Regd,Off-78 B, Sector-D 2, group II, DDA flat, Kondli Gharoli','',10,120,'110096','1','<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">That the same cpomplaint was uploaded in Form N and it was rejected under technical grounds, the copy of order is attached and now it is being uploaded in Form M.</span></p><p>The respondent being promoters and developers are engaged in construction and sales of residential units/flats. One such project is Shourya Greens which is an ongoing project and is registered with the authority as per regn number above.\r\n</p><p>Initially, Shri Devinder Singh s/o Sh. Tika Ram &amp; Mr. Ashok Joshi booking the apartment nno E-101 in the aforesaid project of the respondent. A provisional allotment letter dated 03.04.2006 was issued to the allottees at a total  consideration of Rs. 21,91, 000/-(Annexure I).\r\n</p><p>Later on, the apartment was changed in the name of  Saumya Joshi d/o Mr. Ashok Joshi in place of Devinder Singh and Mr. Ashok Joshi remained co-allottee on 20.11.2007.\r\n</p><p>Therefore, the said apartment was changed in the name of Shefali Joshi D/o Ashok Joshi in place of Saumya Joshi and Ashok Joshi on the basis of application dated 10.06.2013. (Annexure II).\r\n</p><p>The respondent issued a letter dated 22.07.2011 confirmation the possession date as March 12 and also incorporated a clause that in case of delay in handing over the possession the respondent would pay penalty @ Rs. 5/- sq.ft per month. (Annexure III).\r\n</p><p>The respondent did not enter into a separate agreement to sell. Both the allotment letter and subsequent letter as per annexure III constitute agreement to sell.       \r\n</p><p>The respondent has issued a statement of account confirmation receipt of various payments from the allottee/s. (Annexure IV).\r\n</p><p>The respondent has also issued a No Dues Certificate dated 2.08.2013 confirming receipt of all payments towards consideration of the allotted unit by the allottee. (Annexure V).</p>','<p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">In view of the above,</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">it is submitted that the respondent has violated\r\nthe provisions of Section 18 of the Act and prays for<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Refund of the amount of 21,28,896/-, along with\r\ninterest as per RERA&nbsp; Provisions from the respective dates of payments\r\nmade to the respondent.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">It is further prayed that the complainant may be\r\ncompensated by the respondent for an amount of Rs. 2,00,000/- on account of\r\nmental and economic sufferings to the complainant on account of delay in\r\nhanding over of the possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Thanking You,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Shefali Joshi<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Complainant<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Through<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Ved Parkash<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">CS in Practice<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Authorized Representative<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>',2151875.00,2151875.00,'2012-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>That the Builder is voilating the RERA Rules as the Builder is not operating the Special Bank Account as per the RERA Rules.</p>','1','','2006-04-03 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','E-1,101,Shourya greens','','',1,1,0,0,'shefalijoshi','2018-11-27 12:30:00.000','shefalijoshi','2018-11-27 12:30:00.000'),(393,1149,'1149',1066,'3568b05d-bd51-44d0-b387-09a3505b7441','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','GVStar Estates LLP LLP','ramsingh.dil@gmail.com',8699904514,0,0,'House no 726, Sector 2 Panchkula','',13,15,'134102','1','House no 2322 sector 66 mohali','',28,507,'160062','Neeraj Sobti','Advocatesobti@yahoo.co.in',9872279500,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','Falcon View , Phase-2 sector-66A, mohali','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS LTD','janta@jantahousing.com',8284045724,0,'SCO 39-42, sector 82','industrial area , mohali',28,507,'160062','1','SCO 39-42, sector 82','industrial area , mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p>That applicant vide their application dated 02.04.2013 applied for an apartment and accordingly 4 BHK Apartment i.e. No. E-401, 4th Floor, wing E, Facing Green, Falcon View, Phase-II, (wrongly mentioned as Phase-I, the total sale consideration amount was fixed as Rs.1,08,25,200/-. Copy of allotment letter is Annexure C-1.\r\n</p><p>That as per the demands ,applicant paid the following amount to the respondents copies of all the receipts are Annexure C-2 to C-11\r\n</p><p>That as per Clause no.2.24 of the allotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (annexure C-1) the possession of the said apartment complete in all respects shall be delivered to the applicant by 01.02.2016, i.e. 30 months from the date of allotment letter i.e. 02.08.2013.\r\n</p><p>Reminder and postal receipts are Annexure C-12 to C-17. The applicant on 01.07.2018 took some photographs in his mobile showing the present incomplete status of the tower in which the flat of the applicant exist. Copies of the photographs are Annexure C-18 Colly.\r\n</p><p>The entire project of the respondents is illegal as the project without obtaining clearance from the environment and forest department as required under notification dated 14.09.2006 and the State Level Environment Impact Assessment Authority (SEIAA) had already initiated action against the respondent.\r\n</p><p>That earlier the complainant has filed a complaint before this Hon’ble court i.e. Complaint No. ADC/1007/2018, which was returned vide order dated 30.10.2018, with liberty to file fresh complaint on Form – M, copy of order is Annexure C-19. However during complaint the respondents have issued reply dated 24.08.2018, to the reminder notice of the complainant Annexure C-15, whereby the respondents have admitted the contents of notice and agreed to refund Rs.88,52,809/- to the complainant out of the total principal amount received. Copy of reply is Annexure C-20, The respondents are not legally entitled to deduct any amount. REF.- in CWP. No.13152 of 2014,&nbsp; the Hon’ble Punjab &amp; Haryan C-21.</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:97%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:97%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:Times\">In view of the facts\r\nmentioned in paragraph 4 above, the complainant prays for the following\r\nrelief(s) <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">That as\r\nthe respondents have failed to comply with the terms and conditions of the\r\nallotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (Annexure C-1) and have failed to deliver the\r\npossession of the apartment/flat within the stipulated time. Therefore, the\r\napplicant as per section 18 of the RERA Act. 2016, is entitled for<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Refund principal amount of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">10,580,830/- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">of the\r\napplicant </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">along</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> with interest @ 18% P.a. from the date of actual payment till\r\nrealization. <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Pay compensation of Rs.5,00,000/- to the applicant for mental\r\nharassment, mental agony <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">iii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Any other relief which this Hon’ble authority deems fit may also\r\nbe passed in favor of the applicant.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>',10825200.00,10580830.00,'2016-02-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:97%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:97%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:Times\">In view of the facts\r\nmentioned in paragraph 4 above, the complainant prays for the following\r\nrelief(s) <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">That as\r\nthe respondents have failed to comply with the terms and conditions of the\r\nallotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (Annexure C-1) and have failed to deliver the\r\npossession of the apartment/flat within the stipulated time. Therefore, the\r\napplicant as per section 18 of the RERA Act. 2016, is entitled for<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Refund principal amount of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">10,580,830/- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">of the\r\napplicant </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">along</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> with interest @ 18% P.a. from the date of actual payment till\r\nrealization. <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Pay compensation of Rs.5,00,000/- to the applicant for mental\r\nharassment, mental agony <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">iii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Any other relief which this Hon’ble authority deems fit may also\r\nbe passed in favor of the applicant.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>','1','','2013-08-02 00:00:00','2013-08-02 00:00:00','Flat no E-401 , Wing E, Phase-II, Sector 66A sas nagar Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'GVstarLLP','2018-11-27 13:39:11.000','GVstarLLP','2018-11-27 13:39:11.000'),(394,1150,'1150',1229,'6166bf56-8baf-4aa7-a05e-6b75f196cc86','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Ranveer  Sharma','advamitgoyal@hotmail.com',9527700001,0,0,'1003-B, Sterling Seaface, Annie Besant Road, ','Near Poonam Chambers, Worli',21,400,'400018','1','1003-B, Sterling Seaface, Annie Besant Road, ','Near Poonam Chambers, Worli',21,400,'400018','Amit Goyal','advamitgoyal@hotmail.com',9501549444,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS90-PC1234','abc','abc','abc@gmail.com',0,0,'asda','sda',28,507,'121212','1','asda','sda',28,507,'121212','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'Ranveerneha','2018-11-27 14:13:45.000','Ranveerneha','2018-11-27 14:13:45.000'),(395,1149,'1149',1066,'3568b05d-bd51-44d0-b387-09a3505b7441','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-27 18:00:03.000','GVStar Estates LLP LLP','ramsingh.dil@gmail.com',8699904514,0,0,'House no 726, Sector 2 Panchkula','',13,15,'134102','1','House no 2322 sector 66 mohali','',28,507,'160062','Neeraj Sobti','Advocatesobti@yahoo.co.in',9872279500,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','Falcon View , Phase-2 sector-66A, mohali','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS LTD','janta@jantahousing.com',8284045724,0,'SCO 39-42, sector 82','industrial area , mohali',28,507,'160062','1','SCO 39-42, sector 82','industrial area , mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p>That applicant vide their application dated 02.04.2013 applied for an apartment and accordingly 4 BHK Apartment i.e. No. E-401, 4th Floor, wing E, Facing Green, Falcon View, Phase-II, (wrongly mentioned as Phase-I, the total sale consideration amount was fixed as Rs.1,08,25,200/-. Copy of allotment letter is Annexure C-1.\r\n</p><p>That as per the demands ,applicant paid the following amount to the respondents copies of all the receipts are Annexure C-2 to C-11\r\n</p><p>That as per Clause no.2.24 of the allotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (annexure C-1) the possession of the said apartment complete in all respects shall be delivered to the applicant by 01.02.2016, i.e. 30 months from the date of allotment letter i.e. 02.08.2013.\r\n</p><p>Reminder and postal receipts are Annexure C-12 to C-17. The applicant on 01.07.2018 took some photographs in his mobile showing the present incomplete status of the tower in which the flat of the applicant exist. Copies of the photographs are Annexure C-18 Colly.\r\n</p><p>The entire project of the respondents is illegal as the project without obtaining clearance from the environment and forest department as required under notification dated 14.09.2006 and the State Level Environment Impact Assessment Authority (SEIAA) had already initiated action against the respondent.\r\n</p><p>That earlier the complainant has filed a complaint before this Hon’ble court i.e. Complaint No. ADC/1007/2018, which was returned vide order dated 30.10.2018, with liberty to file fresh complaint on Form – M, copy of order is Annexure C-19. However during complaint the respondents have issued reply dated 24.08.2018, to the reminder notice of the complainant Annexure C-15, whereby the respondents have admitted the contents of notice and agreed to refund Rs.88,52,809/- to the complainant out of the total principal amount received. Copy of reply is Annexure C-20, The respondents are not legally entitled to deduct any amount. REF.- in CWP. No.13152 of 2014,&nbsp; the Hon’ble Punjab &amp; Haryan C-21.</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:97%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:97%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:Times\">In view of the facts\r\nmentioned in paragraph 4 above, the complainant prays for the following\r\nrelief(s) <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">That as\r\nthe respondents have failed to comply with the terms and conditions of the\r\nallotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (Annexure C-1) and have failed to deliver the\r\npossession of the apartment/flat within the stipulated time. Therefore, the\r\napplicant as per section 18 of the RERA Act. 2016, is entitled for<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Refund principal amount of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">10,580,830/- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">of the\r\napplicant </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">along</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> with interest @ 18% P.a. from the date of actual payment till\r\nrealization. <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Pay compensation of Rs.5,00,000/- to the applicant for mental\r\nharassment, mental agony <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-22.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!