,'134003','1','H.No.181,Village:-Ghel','',13,1,'134003','gaurav gupta','gaurav69g@gmail.com',9888139269,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0033','M/S Omaxe Chandigarh Extension development Pvt Ltd.','M/s Omaxe Chandigarh Extension Development Pvt Ltd','info@omaxe.com',0,0,'Indian Trade Tower,Ist Floor,Madhya Marg Extension Road,New Chandigarh','Mullapur',28,507,'140901','1','Indian Trade Tower,Ist Floor,Madhya Marg Extension Road,New Chandigarh','Mullapur',28,507,'140901','1','<ol><li>That the applicants are family members / relatives and bonafide resident of above given addresses. The respondents are private real estate developer and engaged in the business of selling plots, built-up plots, town house, flats, kothis and other commercial and non-commercial properties in Omaxe Chandigarh Extension at Mullapur.</li><li>That applicants fell into the trap of respondents and purchased a residential plot of area 301.38 Sq yard from the opposite parties in January 2012 at Phase-3, Omaxe New Chandigarh Extension. Copy of request form dated 10.01.2012 vide which the respondents endorsed the plot in favour of applicants No.1 to 3 is attached as Annexure A-1. That the name of applicant no.4 was added in the booked plot vide Request Form dated 08.05.2013 is attached as Annexure A-2.</li><li>That Till date, the applicants have paid Rs.61,91,214/- against the demand of Rs.61,80,000/-. However, the respondents never executed buyer’s agreement against booking of plot.</li><li>That the applicants had been diligently and in good faith made payments to respondents towards booked plot and the payments has been duly acknowledged by the respondents. The copy of payment receipts are attached as Annexure A-3 (Collectively) &amp; Statement is attached as Annexure A- 4.</li><li>That the said plot was booked by applicants in January 2012 and entire demanded payment was completed as per demands of the respondents in March 2014. Still in 2018 i.e after more than 6 years from the date of booking the respondents are not able to complete / develop the project, obtain the requisite approvals from concerned authorities.The respondents are issuing false demand letters and false possession to the applicants, despite no development at site. Hence due to inordinate delay by respondents, the applicants are not supposed to wait and watch further and to stay in the respondents project and therefore applicants seeking refund of total amount paid along with interest as per RERA Act.<br></li></ol>','<ol><li>Allow the present application and direct the Respondents to refund the sum of Rs.61,91,214/- (Rs. Sixty One&nbsp; lacs Eighty Seven thousand five hundred fourteen only) to the applicants along with interest from the date of respective payments till its realization in accordance with section 18 of the Real Estate (Regulation and development) Act 2016.</li><li>Allow the present Application and direct the Respondent to make the payment of the sum of Rs. 10,00,000/- as lump sum compensation for causing Mental &amp; Physical Harassment and Agony to the applicants.</li><li>Allow the present Application and direct the Respondent to make the payment of the sum of Rs. 1,50,000/- as Costs of Litigation to the applicants.</li><li>Necessary actions may be taken against the respondents as provided under RERA Act.</li><li>Any other relief as deemed fit &amp; proper in the peculiar circumstances of the present lis may also be granted to the applicants in the interest of justice,fair play &amp; equity.<br></li></ol><div><br></div>',7227499.00,6191214.00,'2014-01-10 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NA</p>','1','','2012-01-10 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'complaint','2018-11-28 15:58:03.000','complaint','2018-11-28 15:58:03.000'),(403,1151,'1151',1053,'4b6cce0d-cb7b-46c0-9cff-6656bf5776c2','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Jasbir Singh','gaurav88g@gmail.com',9888139269,0,0,'H.No.181,Village:-Ghel','',13,1,'134003','1','H.No.181,Village:-Ghel','',1