kash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0124','Acme Eden Court','Acme Builders Pvt. Ltd.','contact@acmebuilders.in',8699174000,1724569000,'GH-10, Sector-91','JLPL, Mohali',28,507,'160071','1','GH-10, Sector-91','JLPL, Mohali',28,507,'160071','1','<p>aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa</p>','<p>ccccccccccccccccccccccccc</p>',7381250.00,5550000.00,'2016-04-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa</p>','1','','2013-04-02 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat No. 103, Tower-2, First Floor, Acme Eden Court, GH-10, Sector-91, JPL, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'atulmehan','2018-11-28 17:08:05.000','atulmehan','2018-11-28 17:08:05.000'),(406,1152,'1152',1173,'dd2e0667-81c8-4893-b732-43ed1d145484','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Atul Mehan','csvedparkash@gmail.com',9815075066,0,0,'Flat No. 1172, Pushpac Society','Sector-49 B, Chandigarh',6,128,'160047','1','Flat No. 1172, Pushpac Society','Sector-49 B, Chandigarh',6,128,'160047','Ved Parkash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0124','Acme Eden Court','Acme Builders Pvt. Ltd.','contact@acmebuilders.in',8699174000,1724569000,'GH-10, Sector-91','JLPL, Mohali',28,507,'160071','1','GH-10, Sector-91','JLPL, Mohali',28,507,'160071','1','<ul><li><li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Early the complaint was filed in Form N and now filling in Form M<span style=\"white-space:pre\">						</span></li><li>CONCISE STATEMENT OF FACTS AND GROUNDS OF COMPLAINT</li><li>That the respondent is developing Group Housing under the name and style of “Acme Eden Court” in the “JLPL Township” Sector 90-91, SAS Nagar, District Mohali.&nbsp;</li><li>That the original layout plan of the Äcme Eden Court” is attached at Annexure I.</li><li>That the applicant booked an apartment in the year 2010 with the respondent&nbsp; vide application for&nbsp; unit No 103, Floor 1, Tower 2 having an approximate super area of 2330 sq.ft. and paid an amount of Rs. 1,00,000/- towards booking amount as per payment receipt attached as Annexure II.</li><li>The the applicant made additional payment of Rs. 18,00,000/- on 02.04.2013 vide payment receipt attached as Annexure III. The allotment letter was issued to the applicant as attached at Annexure IV.&nbsp;</li><li>That the respondent signed Builder Buyer Agreement with the applicant on 05.04.2013 attached at Annexure V. The total consideration of the allotted unit was fixed at Rs. 7381250/- and the payment plan was defined in Plan-C of Schedule I referred in clause 2 of the agreement.&nbsp;</li><li>That despite no progress on construction work at project site, the applicant made payments as requested as per payment receipts dated 5.11.2015 attached as Annexure VI for PLC charges of Rs. 728125 plus service tax and Annexure VII towards construction work of 10% of BSP amounting to Rs. 5,23,169/- plus service tax,&nbsp;</li><li>That the applicant again cooperated with the respondent and in the hope of getting early possession of the allotted unit, paid additional amount of Rs 22,50,000/- including service tax on 3rd July 2015 as per payment receipts attached at Annexure VIII.</li><li>The respondent immediately on receipt of 80% of the amount of BSP, sent a reminder on 7th July, 2015 asking for balance payment of BSP, PLC and even the amount payable at the time of possession as attached at Annexed IX which was later kept in abeyance.</li></li></ul>','<ul><li><li>Thus a total of Rs. 55,50,000/- including service tax of Rs 2,24,793/- has been paid by the applicant up to 03.07.2015 with no corresponding progress on the construction of the residential complex/allotted unit.&nbsp;</li><li>The applicant has taken recent photographs of the project site as attached at Annexure X. These pics clearly indicate that the development works are still underway.</li><li>That the respondent has got the project registered with RERA, Punjab as per registration number PBRERA-SAS81-PR0124, being an ongoing project.&nbsp;</li><li>That Concise Facts of Statement with full details and Authority Letter is attached at Annexure XI</li><li>The applicant wishes to withdraw from the project on account of abnormal delay in completing development works, changes in original layout plan without the consent of the applicant and other allottees.</li><li>As per clause 15 of the Builder Buyer Agreement, the possession of the allotted unit was to be offered within 36 months from the date of signing of the said agreement i.e. on 1.04.2016.&nbsp;</li><li>In view of the points above, it is clearly established that the respondent has violated the provisions of Section 12, 14, 18 &amp; 19 of Real Estate (Development &amp; Regulations) Act, 2016.</li><li>It, is therefore, humbly prayed that the Hon’ble Adjudicating Officer may consider our submissions and order the respondent to refund our total amount of Rs. 55,50,000/- along with interest as per RERA provisions from the respective dates of payments made to the respondent and a compensation of Rs. 10,00,000/- for the economic and mental sufferings to the applicant.</li><li><br></li><li>Place&nbsp;</li><li>Date 28.11.2018<span style=\"white-space:pre\">								</span>Signatures of Atul Mehan</li><li><br></li><li><br></li><li>Through&nbsp;</li><li>Authorized Representative</li><li><br></li><li>(Ved Parkash)</li><li>CS in Practice</li></li></ul>',7381250.00,5550000.00,'2016-04-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NA</p>','1','','2013-04-02 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat No. 103, Tower-2, First Floor, Acme Eden Court, GH-10, Sector-91, JPL, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'atulmehan','2018-11-28 17:44:49.000','atulmehan','2018-11-28 17:44:49.000'),(407,1152,'1152',1173,'dd2e0667-81c8-4893-b732-43ed1d145484','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Atul Mehan','csvedparkash@gma