 Rate (“MCLR”)\r\nplus 2%. The current SBI MCLR is 8.50% pa so applicable interest rate for the\r\nrefund is taken as 10.50% pa..</span></li><li style=\"margin-left: 18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;color:#1A1A1A\">Direct the\r\nrespondent to repay to the complainants the expenses directly incurred by the\r\nComplainants in filing the RERA application ie </span>Litigation\r\nexpenses– for representing the Complainants before this Ld. Authority ie INR\r\n55,000 <b style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-size: 14pt;\">(Annexure C-6)</b></li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;color:#1A1A1A\">Compensation for Mental\r\nharassment to the tune of Rs. 1,00,000/- </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">To impose\r\npenalty upon the respondents as per the provisions of Section 61 of RERA Act\r\nfor contravention of Sections 11(3)(b) and 18 of the RERA Act.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">To issue\r\ndirections to make liable every officer concerned i.e. Director, Manager,\r\nSecretary, or any other officer of the respondent’s company at whose instance,\r\nconnivance, acquiescence, neglect any of the offences has been committed as\r\nmentioned in Sec. 69 of RERA Act, 2016 read with Punjab RERA Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">To recommend\r\ncriminal action against the respondents for the criminal offence of cheating,\r\nfraud and criminal breach of trust under section 420, 406 and 409 of the Indian\r\nPenal Code.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Any other\r\nrelief which this Hon’ble Authority deem fit and appropriate in view of the\r\nfacts and circumstances of this complaint.<o:p></o:p></span></li></ol><ol></ol>',4997475.00,4277666.00,'2015-06-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US\">No interim relief is being sought. The complainants only pray that the\r\npromoters be directed to return the amount paid with interest.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2012-12-08 00:00:00','Village Santemajra, Tehsil Kharar, District S.A.S. Nagar,  Punjab','','',2,0,0,0,'Ranveerneha','2018-11-28 18:47:02.000','Ranveerneha','2018-11-28 18:47:02.000'),(423,1153,'1153',1085,'416c72a3-a2db-42db-9e91-50fe152da8ff','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-29 11:28:08.000','SHANTANU MOITRA','MOITRA745@REDIFFMAIL.COM',9115934164,9115934164,0,'H.no 2287, ','SBI COLONY ',6,128,'160036','1','H.no 2287, ','SBI COLONY ',6,128,'160036','Satish Mishra','advocatesatish7@gmail.com',9988817966,7888356908,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0395','FATEH HOMES','Ms. BOPARAI DEVELOPERS','VIPULMONGALLB@GMAIL.COM',9855050311,9855050311,'H.NO 422','SECTOR 71',28,507,'160071','1','H.NO 422','SECTOR 71',28,507,'160071','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\">1 That the complainant is an ex-serviceman working as\r\nManager in SBI, Sector 17 Chandigarh who is currently staying in rented\r\naccommodation in Chandigarh provided by Bank along with his son and wife only. </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">2 That the complainant doesn’t have any fixed abode nor owns\r\nany house/property in Tricity. The complainant\r\nafter a long consideration and support from the family thought of purchasing a\r\nplot where he can construct house of his dreams. The respondent allured\r\ncomplainant to invest in the project without any statutory approvals or\r\nnecessary government clearances in April 2018.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">3 That on being deceived by misrepresentation and false\r\nassurances by respondent, complainant finally booked the plot no. 28 as seen in\r\nold site map appended as Annexure C-1 (colly) and paid Rs. 50,000/- through\r\ncheque on 02.04.2018 and another Rs. 2,50,000/- through RTGS on 07.04.2018 as\r\nseen in old agreement executed on 09.04.2018 duly appended as Annexure C-1\r\n(colly) having payment info.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">4 That the complainant was shocked &amp; disappointed when\r\nhe came to know that all statutory approvals, government clearances were taken\r\nlater after execution of old agreement dated 09.04.2018. Following are the date\r\nof approvals as seen in Annexure C-2 (colly):</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">i.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Encumbrance\r\nCertificate dated 23.07.2018</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">ii.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Registry/Conveyance\r\nof Land dated 12.07.2018</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">iii.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Certificate\r\nof Registration as Promoter dated 24.07.2018</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">iv.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; CLU\r\n(Change of Land Use) dated 30.05.2018</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">v.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Licence\r\nto Develop Colony dated 07.08.2018 </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">5 That on knowing above facts, respondent forced complainant\r\nto execute a new agreement on 14.08.2018 without any date of possession as seen\r\nin appended Annexure C-3 (colly) with new sitemap detrimental to &nbsp;interest of complainant. The old site map\r\n(Annexure C-1) was having a traffic passage in front whereas in new site map it\r\ndoes not. </p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">6 That respondent has flouted RERA provisions on many\r\naccounts which will be taken up during arguments.&nbsp;</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\">1 That the complainant seeks refund of the entire amount\r\npaid i.e. Rs. 3,00,000/- at SBI MCLR +2%&nbsp;\r\nrate of interest as stipulated in RERA Act for violating Sec 12 and\r\nproviding wrong information related to the project which has harmed the\r\ninterest of complainant. </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">2 That the respondent be penalized for not bringing\r\nAgreement for Sale in consonance with the Section 13 of RERA Act on many\r\naccounts and the penalty may be awarded to complainant as compensation. </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">3 That the respondent has further altered the sitemap\r\nwithout informing the complainant and violated Section 14 of the RERA Act. </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">4 That the respondent does not fulfill the criteria of Sec\r\n16 of the RERA Act and hence be penalized for it. The same may be awarded to\r\ncomplainant as compensation. </p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">5 That the respondent by altering the site map has failed to\r\ndischarge the obligation casted upon him under section 18 (3) of RERA Act\r\ntowards the complainant.&nbsp;</p>',2510000.00,300000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\">1 That the respondent be restrained from adopting any\r\ncoercive or pressure tactic to prevent siphoning of funds i.e. Rs. 3,00,000/-\r\nif any by the respondent during the pendency of case. </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">2 That the respondent be stopped from initiating any\r\ncriminal, civil or administrative action towards the complainant regarding the\r\nsame transaction during the pendency of complaint. </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">3 That the respondent be compulsory barred from imposing any\r\npenalty on complainant during the pendency of the case as complainant has\r\nstopped making the future payments. </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">4 That the respondent be curtailed from raising any future\r\npayment demands to complainant till the final outcome of the case. </p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">5 That the respondent be directed not to deduct any amount\r\nin any form, or manner whatsoever way from Rs. 3,00,000/- till the final\r\noutcome of the case.&nbsp;</p>','1','','2018-08-14 00:00:00','2018-04-09 00:00:00','Plot no. 28, FATEH HOMES, SECTOR 127, SANTEMAJRA, KHARAR, SAS NAGAR','','',1,1,0,0,'Satish','2018-11-28 22:13:06.000','Satish','2018-11-28 22:13:06.000'),(424,1154,'1154',1053,'4b6cce0d-cb7b-46c0-9cff-6656bf5776c2','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Suman Gupta','gaurav88g@gmail.com',9888139269,0,0,'H.No.201,GH-1','',13,15,'134116','1','H.No.201,GH-1','',13,15,'134116','Gaurav Gupta','gaurav69g@gmail.com',9888139269,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0085','Sushma Chandigarh Grande','Sushma Buildtech Limited','customercare@sushmabuildtech.com',9872889933,0,'M/s Sushma Buildtech Limited, Unit No. B107, Business complex at Elante Mall','ist floor, Industrial area Phase-1, Chandigarh',6,128,'160002','1','M/s Sushma Buildtech Limited, Unit No. B107, Business complex at Elante Mall','ist floor, Industrial area Phase-1, Chandigarh',6,129,'160002','1','<p>ABC</p>','<p>ABC</p>',7150500.00,6739476.00,'2015-10-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>ABC</p>','1','','2012-02-14 00:00:00','2012-04-06 00:00:00','I801, 8th floor, tower-1, villade Bishangarh & Bishanpura, mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'complaint','2018-11-28 23:35:51.000','complaint','2018-11-28 23:35:51.000'),(425,1155,'1155',1074,'173c8217-5ec2-4b34-b6c8-f76219a18b97','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','gurkirat bajwa','gbajwa9@rediffmail.com',9814031105,0,0,'220 -A','sarabha nagar',28,366,'141001','1','220 -A','sarabha nagar',28,366,'141001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0004','IREO Water\r\nFront, Pocket-2\r\n(Phase-I)','M/S ireo Waterfront Ludhiana','iwp@ireo.in',9810237279,0,'5, Dhanraj Chambers,','satbari',10,557,'110074','1','5, Dhanraj Chambers,','satbari',10,557,'110074','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; text-size-adjust: 100%; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">1.	You had entered into contract dated 27/06/2014 with Navjot kaur and Gurkirat Singh Bajwa for the sale of House/Villa No.L-550 of Type-L, having built up area of 1600 Sq. Ft. over the plot measuring 249.96 Sq. Yds. after construction and furnishing as per the contract.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; text-size-adjust: 100%; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">2.	That the total sale consideration of the villa was Rs.106,842,07/-. Out of which 25% was to be paid as earnest money and remaining amount was to be paid at the time of delivery of possession. We have deposited with you Rs.33,56,262/- and Rs.1,23,596/- as membership charges of Angsana club and spa, ireo waterfront against receipts.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; text-size-adjust: 100%; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">3.	That it was agreed by you in the contract that the construction shall be completed and possession will be given within 24 mth from the date of the contract. It was also agreed by you that after completion of the villa you will serve the completion notice within this period. Even after availing 6 mth more grace period the company was bound to complete the construction and deliver possession to us before 27/06/2016 by all means.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; text-size-adjust: 100%; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">4.	That it was agreed by you in the contract that in case you fail to deliver possession to us within the period mentioned above the company will pay compensation @ Rs.7.50 per sq. Ft. of built up area. It was also agreed therein that we shall be entitled to terminate the contract and get refund in case of failure on your part to perform the contract in specified time.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; text-size-adjust: 100%; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">5.	That we already had apprised ireo waterfront many times, our necessity for the villa and requested you to deliver possession in time as agreed. But both the construction and the amenities are incomplete till date. Now we have exhausted all efforts to get the villa completed and get possession within given time, there is no other option except to terminate the contract&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-family: roboto;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16.8667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">and get&nbsp; the refund of amount paid with interest</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16.8667px;\">.&nbsp;</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; line-height: 13.3pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">As&nbsp; M/S ireo waterfront ltd had also agreed to give possession of the vailla L-550 , which they failed to do with in promised period. Even&nbsp; there was never any reason beyond control of the company which constrained it not to complete the construction within 24 months and deliver its possession&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; line-height: 13.3pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Even they had to furnish and develop parks and club etc. in the colony and provide all amenities in and for the use of villa within agreed time. But they have failed in doing so till date.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; line-height: 13.3pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">a) &nbsp;We have no other option except to terminate the contract</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;dated 27.06.2014</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; b)&nbsp; Refund of the total amount paid to M/S ireo waterfront ltd&nbsp; with interest at 12 PA&nbsp; &nbsp;from the date of payment to the ireo waterfront ltd.&nbsp;&nbsp; Including the payment made to &nbsp;<u>ANGSANA club and SPA ireo waterfront&nbsp;</u>&nbsp;</span></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; line-height: 13.3pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">As&nbsp; M/S ireo waterfront ltd had also agreed to give possession of the vailla L-550 , which they failed to do with in promised period. Even&nbsp; there was never any reason beyond control of the company which constrained it not to complete the construction within 24 months and deliver its possession&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; line-height: 13.3pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Even they had to furnish and develop parks and club etc. in the colony and provide all amenities in and for the use of villa within agreed time. But they have failed in doing so till date.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; line-height: 13.3pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">a) &nbsp;We have no other option except to terminate the contract</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;dated 27.06.2014</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; b)&nbsp; Refund of the total amount paid to M/S ireo waterfront ltd&nbsp; with interest at 12 PA&nbsp; &nbsp;from the date of payment to the ireo waterfront ltd.&nbsp;&nbsp; Including the payment made to &nbsp;<u>ANGSANA club and SPA ireo waterfront&nbsp;</u>&nbsp;</span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'gurkirasinghbajwanavjotkaurbajwa','2018-11-29 12:39:31.000','gurkirasinghbajwanavjotkaurbajwa','2018-11-29 12:39:31.000'),(426,1154,'1154',1053,'4b6cce0d-cb7b-46c0-9cff-6656bf5776c2','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Suman Gupta','gaurav88g@gmail.com',9888139269,0,0,'H.No.201,GH-1','Sector-20',13,15,'134116','1','H.No.201,GH-1','Sector-20',13,15,'134116','Gaurav Gupta','gaurav69g@gmail.com',9888139269,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0085','Sushma Chandigarh Grande','Sushma Buildtech Limited','customercare@sushmabuildtech.com',9872889933,0,'M/s Sushma Buildtech Limited, Unit No. B107, Business complex at Elante Mall','ist floor, Industrial area Phase-1, Chandigarh',6,128,'160002','1','M/s Sushma Buildtech Limited, Unit No. B107, Business complex at Elante Mall','ist floor, Industrial area Phase-1, Chandigarh',6,129,'160002','1','<div>1. That the complainants are mother and son. Complainants applied for a Residential flat, in Respondent Project described as “SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE”. Respondent allotted the Residential Flat No.I801 on floor 8th in tower-I, 2250 Sq. Ft (Super Area) located at village Bishangarh and Bishanpura, MC Zirakpur, Mohali, to the complainants vide Allotment Letter dated 14.02.2012(Annexure C-1).&nbsp;</div><div>2. That thereafter the complainants entered into an Apartment Buyers Agreement&nbsp; dated 06.04.2012(Annexure C-2). The Basic Sale Price of the Flat was Rs. 71,50,500/-. The complainants were required to make payments as per the Construction linked payment plan.&nbsp;</div><div>3. That the complainants availed bank loan of Rs.50,00,000/- for timely payment to the respondent. Loan Sanction Letter is Annexure C-3.&nbsp;</div><div>4. That complainants as per demands of the respondent builder paid total payment of Rs.67,39,476/-to respondent. Copy of demand letter &amp; Payment details are attached as Annexure C-4 &amp; C-5.&nbsp;</div><div>5. That builder had to deliver the fully developed possession of the said flat to the complainants within 42 months from the date of execution of Apartment Buyers Agreement i.e till 06.10.2015.&nbsp;</div><div>6. That the complainants, had made the payment of more than 90% of the Total Sale Price of flat to the respondent. However respondent failed to deliver possession till today. The complainants cannot wait for indefinite period. Therefore no further wait by the complainants is not justified and hence the complainants are seeking refund of their amount U/S 18 of RERA Act.&nbsp;</div><div>7. That the complainant earlier filed CC/22/2018(Annexure C-6) under Form M same was withdrawn with liberty to file fresh. Complainant there after filed CC/49/2018(Annexure C-7) under Form N and same was decided on the bases of 7th meeting of Punjab State regulatory authority where adjudication officer is limited only for the purpose of adjudication of compensation only. Now complainant is filing present complaint under Form-M.</div><div><br></div>','<div>a.Allow the present application and direct the Respondents to refund the sum of Rs. 67,39,476/- to the applicants along with interest from the date of respective payments till its realization in accordance with section 18 of the Real Estate (Regulation and development) Act 2016;</div><div>b.To refund the interest paid by the applicant on the availed loan of Rs.50,00,000/-.</div><div>c.Allow the present Application and direct the Respondent to make the payment of the sum of Rs. 1,50,000/- as Costs of Litigation to the applicants;</div><div>d.Necessary actions may be taken against the respondents as provided under RERA Act.</div><div>e.Any other relief as deemed fit &amp; proper in the peculiar circumstances of the present lis may also be granted to the applicants; in the interest of justice, fair play &amp; equity.</div><div><br></div>',7150500.00,6739476.00,'2015-10-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NA</p>','1','','2012-02-14 00:00:00','2012-04-06 00:00:00','I801, 8th floor, tower-1, villade Bishangarh & Bishanpura, mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'complaint','2018-11-29 16:08:43.000','complaint','2018-11-29 16:08:43.000'),(427,1154,'1154',1053,'4b6cce0d-cb7b-46c0-9cff-6656bf5776c2','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-30 0