to the respondent. However respondent failed to deliver possession till today. The complainants cannot wait for indefinite period. Therefore no further wait by the complainants is not justified and hence the complainants are seeking refund of their amount U/S 18 of RERA Act.&nbsp;</div><div>7. That the complainant earlier filed CC/22/2018(Annexure C-6) under Form M same was withdrawn with liberty to file fresh. Complainant there after filed CC/49/2018(Annexure C-7) under Form N and same was decided on the bases of 7th meeting of Punjab State regulatory authority where adjudication officer is limited only for the purpose of adjudication of compensation only. Now complainant is filing present complaint under Form-M.</div><div><br></div>','<div>a.Allow the present application and direct the Respondents to refund the sum of Rs. 67,39,476/- to the applicants along with interest from the date of respective payments till its realization in accordance with section 18 of the Real Estate (Regulation and development) Act 2016;</div><div>b.To refund the interest paid by the applicant on the availed loan of Rs.50,00,000/-.</div><div>c.Allow the present Application and direct the Respondent to make the payment of the sum of Rs. 1,50,000/- as Costs of Litigation to the applicants;</div><div>d.Necessary actions may be taken against the respondents as provided under RERA Act.</div><div>e.Any other relief as deemed fit &amp; proper in the peculiar circumstances of the present lis may also be granted to the applicants; in the interest of justice, fair play &amp; equity.</div><div><br></div>',7150500.00,6739476.00,'2015-10-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NA</p>','1','','2012-02-14 00:00:00','2012-04-06 00:00:00','I801, 8th floor, tower-1, villade Bishangarh & Bishanpura, mohali','','',1,1,0,0,'complaint','2018-11-29 16:26:17.000','complaint','2018-11-29 16:26:17.000'),(428,1156,'1156',1237,'c6fe9702-458d-4d27-93ad-948d5689b68f','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-30 17:26:04.000','Preet Inder Singh','pisbhatia461@gmail.com',9501000044,0,0,'HOUSE NO 461','SECTOR 44A',6,128,'160047','1','HOUSE NO 461','SECTOR 44A',6,128,'160047','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PMO0021','BAJWA DEVELOPERS LTD','BAJWA DEVELOPERS','bajwadeveloperltd@gmail.com',0,0,'SUNNY BUSINESS CENTRE','5TH FLOOR,NEW SUNNY ENCLAVE ',28,507,'140301','1','SUNNY BUSINESS CENTRE','5TH FLOOR,NEW SUNNY ENCLAVE ',28,507,'140301','1','<p>I HAD PURCHASED A 3 BHK FLAT NO 3609 OF 1400 SQ FEET IN E35 SUNNY HEIGHTS AND MADE FULL AND FINAL PAYMENT TO M/S BAJWA DEVELOPERS LTD IN APRIL/MAY 2017 AND I WAS ISSUED A NDC BY THE SAID BUILDER ON 27/05/2017.(COPY ATTACHED) I HAD EVEN PAID THE APPLICABLE SERVICE TAX ALSO AS DESIRED BY THE DEVELOPER. </p><p>I WAS ASSURED THAT THE POSSESSION WILL BE GIVEN WITHIN 03 MONTHS.INSPITE OF VARIOUS VISTS TO THE DEVELOPERS OFFICE AND VERBAL ASSURANCES GIVEN BY THE CONCERNED PERSONS IN THE DEVELOPERS OFFICE, THE POSSESSION HAS STILL NOT BEEN GIVEN.I ALSO WROTE A LETTER DATED 28/03/2018 TO THE DEVELOPER BUT NOTHING HAS BEEN DONE IN THIS REGARD. NO INTIMATION HAS BEEN GIVEN TO ME TILL DATE.</p><p>A CURRENT VISIT TO THE SITE ALSO REVEALS THAT THE POSSESSION IS STILL NOT POSSIBLE GIVEN THE STATE OF CONSTRUCTION/COMPLETION OF THE PROJECT TILL DATE.</p>','<p>1) EITHER ASSURED POSSESSION OF THE FLAT OR COMPENSATION BY WAY OF ADJUSTING MONEY PAID TOWARDS ALLOTTING AND GIVING POSSESSION SOME OTHER FULLY COMPLETED FLAT OR SOME PLOT....</p><p>OR</p><p>2) REFUND OF THE MONEY PAID WITH APPLICABLE INTEREST</p>',2700000.00,2821500.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>1) IMMEDIATE PAYMENT OF INTEREST ON THE AMOUNT PAID</p><p>2) ALLOTTING SOME OTHER FULLY COMPLETED FLAT OR SOME PLOT</p>','1','','2017-05-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','3609, E35, SUNNY HEIGHTS','','',2,0,0,0,'pirochak','2018-11-29 21:57:30.000','pirochak','2018-11-29 21:57:30.000'),(429,1157,'1157',1119,'dae2bb68-2fa2-473d-a49d-c15de93bd3da','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.0