INTEREST. PHOTOGRAPHS SHOWING THAT RESPONDENTS USING THE FLAT AS BACK WAY ENTRY TO TOWER NO.9. EARLIER THIS WAS USED AS STORE ROOM BY RESPONDENTS AS CLEARLY DEPICTED IN PHOTOGRAPHS. VIOLATION OF RERA, 2016 BY NOT HANDING OVER POSSESSION. RESPONDENTS ALSO DOES NOT HAVE COMPLETION CERTIFICATE TILL DATE.</p>','<p>REFUND OF DEPOSITED AMOUNT OF RS.34,66,892/- ALONG WITH INTEREST AND COST OF LITIGATION RS.1,00,000/- AS IT CAUSED LOT OF HARRASSMENTS TO THE FATHER OF THE COMLAINANT WHO IS 85 YEARS OLD AND THE SAID FLAT WAS BOOKED FOR HIS RESIDENTIAL PURPOSES AS HE IS UNABLE TO CLIMB THE STAIRS. COMPLAINANT ALSO HAVING ANOTHER FLAT IN SAME TOWER AS FLAT NO. 203 WHICH WAS DELIVERED BUT SOMETIMES WHEN THERE IS NO POWER AND LIFT ARE NOT WORKING COMPLAINANT FATHER HAS TO FACE A LOT O FDIFFCULTY. THEREFORE IT IS PRAYED THAT REFUND OF DEPOSITED AMOUNT ALONGWITH PRESCRIBED INTEREST UNDER THE RERA ACT BE DIRECTED TO THE RESPONDENTS.</p>',3649243.00,3466892.00,'2013-09-04 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>RESPONDENTS BE DIRECTED TO DEPOSIT RS.34,66,892/- WITH THE AUTHORITY TILL THE DECISION OF PRESENT COMPLAINT WHEREBY REFUND IS SOUGHT.</p>','1','','2011-03-24 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','FLAT NO. G-03, TOWER NO.9, ORCHARD COUNTY, SECTOR 115 MOHALI','','',2,0,0,0,'advravinder','2018-11-30 07:05:16.000','advravinder','2018-11-30 07:05:16.000'),(430,1157,'1157',1119,'dae2bb68-2fa2-473d-a49d-c15de93bd3da','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-05 07:11:17.000','PAUL INDER SUKHIJA','advravinder@gmail.com',9815700280,0,0,'203, TOWER NO.9 ORCHARD COUNTY ','SECTOR 115 KHARAR - LANDRAN ROAD, MOHALI',28,507,'140301','1','D-711, Ravindra Apartments, Ravindra Enclave, Baltana','ZIrakpur',28,507,'140604','Ravinder Pal Singh','advravinder@gmail.com',9815700280,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0287','ANSAL LOTUS MELANGE PROJECTS PVT. LTD.','ANSAL LOTUS MELANGE PROJECTS PVT. LTD.','info@almprojects.com',9891049898,0,'SCO NO. 183-184, SECTOR 9-C, CHANDIGARH','',6,128,'160009','1','SCO NO. 183-184, S