RESIDENTIAL PURPOSES AS HE IS UNABLE TO CLIMB THE STAIRS. COMPLAINANT ALSO HAVING ANOTHER FLAT IN SAME TOWER AS FLAT NO. 203 WHICH WAS DELIVERED BUT SOMETIMES WHEN THERE IS NO POWER AND LIFT ARE NOT WORKING COMPLAINANT FATHER HAS TO FACE A LOT O FDIFFCULTY. THEREFORE IT IS PRAYED THAT REFUND OF DEPOSITED AMOUNT ALONGWITH PRESCRIBED INTEREST UNDER THE RERA ACT BE DIRECTED TO THE RESPONDENTS.</p>',3649243.00,3466892.00,'2013-09-04 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>RESPONDENTS BE DIRECTED TO DEPOSIT RS.34,66,892/- WITH THE AUTHORITY TILL THE DECISION OF PRESENT COMPLAINT WHEREBY REFUND IS SOUGHT.</p>','1','','2011-03-24 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','FLAT NO. G-03, TOWER NO.9, ORCHARD COUNTY, SECTOR 115 MOHALI','','',1,1,0,0,'advravinder','2018-11-30 07:44:32.000','advravinder','2018-11-30 07:44:32.000'),(431,1155,'1155',1074,'173c8217-5ec2-4b34-b6c8-f76219a18b97','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-30 10:28:53.000','gurkirat bajwa','gbajwa9@rediffmail.com',9814031105,0,762822836897,'220 -A','sarabha nagar',28,366,'141001','1','220 -A','sarabha nagar',28,366,'141001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0004','IREO Water\r\nFront, Pocket-2\r\n(Phase-I)','M/S ireo Waterfront Ludhiana','iwp@ireo.in',9810237279,0,'5, Dhanraj Chambers,','satbari',10,557,'110074','1','5, Dhanraj Chambers,','satbari',10,557,'110074','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; text-size-adjust: 100%; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">1. you had entered into contract dated 27/06/2014 with Navjot kaur and Gurkirat Singh Bajwa for the sale of House/Villa No.L-550 of Type-L, having built up area of 1600 Sq. Ft. over the plot measuring 249.96 Sq. Yds. after construction and furnishing as per the contract.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; text-size-adjust: 100%; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">2.	That the total sale consideration of the villa was Rs.106,842,07/-. Out of which 25% was to be paid as earnest money and remaining amount was to be paid at the time of delivery of possession. We have deposited with you Rs.33,56,262/- and Rs.1,23,596/- as membership charges of Angsana club and spa, ireo waterfront against receipts.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; text-size-adjust: 100%; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">3.	That it was agreed by you in the contract that the construction shall be completed and possession will be given within 24 mth from the date of the contract. It was also agreed by you that after completion of the villa you will serve the completion notice within this period. Even after availing 6 mth more grace period the company was bound to complete the construction and deliver possession to us before 27/06/2016 by all means.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; text-size-adjust: 100%; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">4.	That it was agreed by you in the contract that in case you fail to deliver possession to us within the period mentioned above the company will pay compensation @ Rs.7.50 per sq. Ft. of built up area. It was also agreed therein that we shall be entitled to terminate the contract and get refund in case of failure on your part to perform the contract in specified time.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; text-size-adjust: 100%; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">5.	That we already had apprised ireo waterfront many times, our necessity for the villa and requested you to deliver possession in time as agreed. But both the construction and the amenities are incomplete till date. Now we have exhausted all efforts to get the villa completed and get possession within given time, there is no other option except to terminate the contract&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-family: roboto;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16.8667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">and get&nbsp; the refund of amount paid with interest</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16.8667px;\">.&nbsp;</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; line-height: 13.3pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">As&nbsp; M/S ireo waterfront ltd had also agreed to give possession of the vailla L-550 , which they failed to do with in promised period. Even&nbsp; there was never any reason beyond control of the company which constrained it not to complete the construction within 24 months and deliver its possession&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; line-height: 13.3pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Even they had to furnish and develop parks and club etc. in the colony and provide all amenities in and for the use of villa within agreed time. But they have failed in doing so till date.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; line-height: 13.3pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">a) &nbsp;We have no other option except to terminate the contract</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;dated 27.06.2014</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;b)&nbsp; Refund of the total amount paid to M/S ireo waterfront ltd&nbsp; with interest at 12 PA&nbsp; &nbsp;from the date of payment to the ireo waterfront ltd.&nbsp;&nbsp; Including the payment made to &nbsp;<u>ANGSANA club and SPA ireo waterfront&nbsp;</u>&nbsp;</span></p>',10684207.00,3479858.00,'2016-06-26 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; line-height: 13.3pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">As&nbsp; M/S ireo waterfront ltd had also agreed to give possession of the vailla L-550 , which they failed to do with in promised period. Even&nbsp; there was never any reason beyond control of the company which constrained it not to complete the construction within 24 months and deliver its possession&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;