r in incomplete stage. That some Complainants were forced to pay 100% payment</p><p>to Builder for incomplete flats by threatening them from goons hired by builders. That Some Complainants</p><p>were forced to execute sale deed for less price paying money in cash or for shell companies (Daya Infra)</p><p>and thus frauding with GST and service tax.That These flats are incomplete to such extent that there is no</p><p>permanent water connection,internal roads, electricity, sewerage connections, Sewerage treatment plant,</p><p>staircase, streetlights, fire protection system etc.That these flats are handed over without obtaining</p><p>occupancy certificate from MC khararThat Builder was approached time to time and several MOM’s were</p><p>signed but till date.That MOM is attached as Annexure-1, where in Builder has initially agreed to complete</p><p>the project by 31-March 2016.That vide MOM dated 30-April-2017 Builder agreed to complete the project</p><p>by 31-Jan-2018. That again MOM vide 18.09.2017 Builder agreed to complete project in next 6 months i.e</p><p>Mar-2018. That status of project is same as mentioned in point No.9</p>','<p>Direct PSPCL for permanent electricity connections for the 65 families (Complainant).Direct MC kharar for</p><p>permanent water and sewerage connections to the society.Direct Inquiry against involvement of Municipal</p><p>Corporation with Builder in cheating the Public by allowing sale deed to be executed without issuing</p><p>occupancy certificate.Direct Inquiry against Builder regarding diversion of project funds to other shell</p><p>companies.Action against Builder for non completion of Project.Direct Inquiry against Builder regarding</p><p>theft of GST.Pledge/Stay on selling if the Properties of Builder, Promoters, Directors with immediate</p><p>effect to avoid misuse of diverted funds.Pass any other order/orders which PBRERA may deem fit in the</p><p>facts and circumstances of the case.</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Direct PSPCL for permanent electricity connections for the 65 families (Complainant).Direct MC kharar for</p><p>permanent water and sewerage connections to the society.Direct Inquiry against involvement of Municipal</p><p>Corporation with Builder in cheating the Public by allowing sale deed to be executed without issuing</p><p>occupancy certificate.Direct Inquiry against Builder regarding diversion of project funds to other shell</p><p>companies.Action against Builder for non completion of Project.Direct Inquiry against Builder regarding</p><p>theft of GST.Pledge/Stay on selling if the Properties of Builder, Promoters, Directors with immediate</p><p>effect to avoid misuse of diverted funds.Pass any other order/orders which PBRERA may deem fit in the</p><p>facts and circumstances of the case.</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'LeenaKumari','2018-11-30 10:38:08.000','LeenaKumari','2018-11-30 10:38:08.000'),(433,1158,'1158',1239,'d25b078a-2844-47e7-9d66-87c143312e53','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','LEENA KUMARI','cmavishal85@gmail.com',8968318866,0,0,'Flat No .226, Ground Floor, Noor Homes','Kharar Landranroad, Sector 111, Mohali',28,507,'160055','1','Flat No .226, Ground Floor, Noor Homes','Kharar Landranroad, Sector 111, Mohali',28,507,'160055','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0219','GGP Buildtech\r\nPrivate\r\nLimited Noor Homes','M/S. GGP BUILDTECH PRIVATE LIMITED','ajayguptaggp@gmail.com',9815990640,0,'Mr. Ajay Gupta, # 402, Shivalik City, Sector 127','Kharar, SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160055','1','Mr. Ajay Gupta, # 402, Shivalik City, Sector 127','Kharar, SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160055','1','<p>That the project named Noor Homes is currently being promoted/developed by GGP Buildtech Pvt</p><p>Limited. The Promoters of M/s GGP BUILDTECH PVT LTD started their business initially with a</p><p>Partnership firm M/s Singla Builders &amp; Promoters in which Sh. Ajay Gupta and Sh. Amandeep Singla</p><p>were partners. That the Project Named Noor Homes is launched by GGP Buildtech Pvt Limited in</p><p>February 2014. That the Builder (GGP Buildtech Pvt Limited) had come up with advertisement/public offer</p><p>to sell 1, 2, 3 BHK Apartments &amp; 3 BHK Villas to be constructed at Sector 115, Village Sante Majra, Tehsil</p><p>Kharar, District Mohali with a construction target to be completed in 2017. That the Complainants (society</p><p>members) start booking flats from Builder from 2014. That to some Complainants the flats were forcefully</p><p>handed over by builder in incomplete stage. That some Complainants were forced to pay 100% payment</p><p>to Builder for incomplete flats by threatening them from goons hired by builders. That Some Complainants</p><p>were forced to execute sale deed for less price paying money in cash or for shell companies (Daya Infra)</p><p>and thus frauding with GST and service tax.That These flats are incomplete to such extent that there is no</p><p>permanent water connection,internal roads, electricity, sewerage connections, Sewerage treatment plant,</p><p>staircase, streetlights, fire protection system etc.That these flats are handed over without obtaining</p><p>occupancy certificate from MC khararThat Builder was approached time to time and several MOM’s were</p><p>signed but till date.That MOM is attached as Annexure-1, where in Builder has initially agreed to complete</p><p>the project by 31-March 2016.That vide MOM dated 30-April-2017 Builder agreed to complete the project</p><p>by 31-Jan-2018. That again MOM vide 18.09.2017 Builder agreed to complete project in next 6 months i.e</p><p>Mar-2018. That status of project is same as mentioned in point No.9</p>','<p>Direct PSPCL for permanent electricity connections for the 65 families (Complainant).Direct MC kharar for</p><p>permanent water and sewerage connections to the society.Direct Inquiry against involvement of Municipal</p><p>Corporation with Builder in cheating the Public by allowing sale deed to be executed without issuing</p><p>occupancy certificate.Direct Inquiry against Builder regarding diversion of project funds to other shell</p><p>companies.Action against Builder for non completion of Project.Direct Inquiry against Builder regarding</p><p>theft of GST.Pledge/Stay on selling if the Properties of Builder, Promoters, Directors with immediate</p><p>effect to avoid misuse of diverted funds.Pass any other order/orders which PBRERA may deem fit in the</p><p>facts and circumstances of the case.</p><p>Due to known availability of the light there was loss of my income to the tune of Rs. 2,00,000/-</p><p>During the meeting on dated 5th November 2018 at GGP office health of my father&nbsp;deteriorated and the&nbsp; they have to rush to the hospital in emergency and they have to suffer a lot and treatment is till under going which may also led to surgery. A claim of Rs. 5,00,000/- is also prayed for harassment and health loss.</p><p>Claim the old&nbsp; RERA application charge RS. 2,000/-</p><p>Defame among the society claim Rs. 5,00,000/-</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Direct PSPCL for permanent electricity connections for the 65 families (Complainant).Direct MC kharar for</p><p>permanent water and sewerage connections to the society.Direct Inquiry against involvement of Municipal</p><p>Corporation with Builder in cheating the Public by allowing sale deed to be executed without issuing</p><p>occupancy certificate.Direct Inquiry against Builder regarding diversion of project funds to other shell</p><p>companies.Action against Builder for non completion of Project.Direct Inquiry against Builder regarding</p><p>theft of GST.Pledge/Stay on selling if the Properties of Builder, Promoters, Directors with immediate</p><p>effect to avoid misuse of diverted funds.Pass any other order/orders which PBRERA may deem fit in the</p><p>facts and circumstances of the case.</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'LeenaKumari','2018-11-30 10:56:36.000','LeenaKumari','2018-11-30 10:56:36.000'),(434,1133,'1133',1061,'feb522a9-b591-42ad-b827-d1fac41495ae','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','SUDESH KUMAR  DHAWAN','vikas3dhawan@gmail.com',9785325611,0,0,'#3B-51, JAWAHAR NAGAR','',29,213,'335001','1','#3B-51, JAWAHAR NAGAR','',29,213,'335001','BIRENDER SINGH DHILLON','CSPURIDHILLON@GMAIL.COM',9988933636,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PC0001','ROYAL BUSINESS PARK','MOTIA DEVELOPERS PRIVATE LIMITED','INFO@MOTIAGROUP.COM',8558844525,0,'Royal Citi','Chandigarh-Ambala Highway',28,507,'140603','1','Royal Citi','Chandigarh-Ambala Highway',28,507,'140603','1','<p>A</p>','<p>1. To direct the respondent to hand over the physical possession of the shop as per agreement&nbsp; to the complainant or to direct the respondent to refund the entire amount paid by the complainant i.e. ₹ 3500000 along with 24% interest from the date of respective payment till the actual realization of the entire amountTo direct the respondent to hand over the physical possession of the flat/apartme.&nbsp;</p><p>2. To pay complaint for the torture, sufferings, harassment and embarrassment etc caused to the complaint the reports their neglectful attitude in dealing with the complainant.&nbsp;</p><p>3. To impose penalty upon the respondent for not entering into a written&nbsp; agreement for sale and register the said agreement for sale which is required under section 13 of RERA act 2016 because the respondent accept a some more than 10% of the cost of shop.&nbsp;</p><p>4. Any other relief (s) which this Hon\'ble Authority may deem fit and proper may also be granted in favour of the complainant and against the respondent.</p>',4963632.00,3500000.00,'2017-11-15 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>B</p>','1','','2014-11-04 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Shop No 6, Ground Floor, Royal Business Park, Zirakpur (PB)','','',2,0,0,0,'SUDESHKUMARDHAWAN','2018-11-30 14:59:45.0