&nbsp; &nbsp;A copy of the Agreement is annexed herewith as ANNEXURE A-2.</li></li></ul>','<p>In view of the facts mentioned in Paragraph 4 above, the Applicant prays for the following compensation(s):-</p><p>Refund of an amount of Rs.50,95,339/- paid by the Applicants along with interest (highest marginal cost of lending rate of the State Bank of India+2%) from the respective dates of deposit till actual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.</p><p>Payment of compensation of Rs.10.00 lacs due to the inordinate delay on the part of the Respondent in failing to handover possession of the Allotted Unit; mental agony, harassment and escalation in the prices of the Real Estate as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.</p><p>Any other relief which the Applicants are entitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>',5701543.00,0.00,'2010-10-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<div><br></div><ul><li>Refund of an amount of Rs.50,95,339/- paid by the Applicants along with interest (highest marginal cost of lending rate of the State Bank of India+2%) from the respective dates of deposit till actual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.</li></ul>','1','','2007-10-05 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Unit No.TVM-L3-F11-1103 Tower No.F,The Views at Mohali Hills, Sector-105, SAS Nagar Mohali (Pb)','','',2,0,0,0,'jasbirsinghc','2018-12-04 13:53:46.000','jasbirsinghc','2018-12-04 13:53:46.000'),(458,1166,'1166',1244,'04c5757f-b88d-445e-8905-46acb1e6dbed','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','SUMIT  KUMAR','jurisaxisrera@gmail.com',9729902009,0,0,'4E/10 NORTH SRI KRISHNA PURI RAM KRISHNA PATH PATNA','',5,455,'800013','1','4E/10 NORTH SRI KRISHNA PURI RAM KRISHNA PATH PATNA','',5,455,'800013','KAMALJEET DAHIYA','jurisaxisrera@gmail.com',9729902009,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM GARDEN','MANOHAR INFRASTRUCTURE AND CONSTRUCTIONS PVT. LTD.','nbs@manoharrealty.com',1725016888,1725016888,'SCO 139 141 LEVEL 1 SECTOR 17 C','',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139 141 LEVEL 1 SECTOR 17 C','',6,128,'160017','1','<p>The complainant had purchased a plot in the said project having an approximate 250 sq. yard.The complainant had made payment of Rs 13,87,500/- at the time of allotment, on which the respondent had issued an Application Acknowledgment to the complainant dated 09.04.2012 -Annexure C-1. The respondent sent a letter and assured that they would deliver the possession of plot by year 2015 -Annexure C-2. The respondent had issued a letter in 18.03.2014 wherein they requested for further sum of deposit to the tune of Rs. 9,25,000/- and assured that the project has reached its final stage and they would be in a position to deliver the possession of plot by 2015 - Annexure C-3.The complainant had paid Rs 15,50,000/- to the respondent, for which the respondent had issued receipts to the complainant dated 29.01.2018 Annexure C-4.The respondent had allotted plot No. 1069 admeasuring 250 sq. yard area in year 2018 to the complainant.&nbsp; The respondent had issued a letter to the complainant dated 15.02.2018 wherein the respondent levied the charges of IDC,PLC, Possession charges or any arbitrary charges which were not disclosed oragreed for at the time of initial booking of the plot - Annexure C-5. It is pertinent to mention here that the respondent has the intention to cheat the complainant since the beginning as it is proved by the malafide act and conduct of the respondent. The Complainant has paid INR 21,87,500/- i.e. more than 70% of payment out of total consideration i.e. Basic Sale Price, agreed at the time of booking the plot till Jan.18 - Annexure C-6.The possession of the project was committed in the month of March 2015 and now in the month of November 2018 i.e. delay of 44 months from the date of the commitment, only 30% project is completed thus delaying the possession of the plot deliberately or for reasons known best to them.<br></p>','<p>In view of the facts mentioned in preceding paragraphs, the complainant prays for the following relief(s):-&nbsp;</p><p>i.To give necessary directions to the respondent for the compensation as the respondent has fail to give the possession as per the provisions of Sec. 18 and Sec.19(4)of the RERA Act read with Rule 16 of PBRE(R&amp;D)Rules,2017.</p><p>ii.To direct the respondent to pay the compensation under section 12 of the RERA Act, 2016.</p><p>iii.To issue directions to make liable every officer concerned i.e. Director, Manager, Secretary, or any other officer of the respondent’s company at whose instance, connivance, acquiescence, neglect any of the offences has been committed as mentioned in Sec.69 of RERA Act,2016 to be read with Punjab RERA Rules, 2017.</p><p>iv.To recommend criminal action against the respondents for the criminal offence of cheating, fraud and criminal breach of trust under section 420,406 and 409 of the Indian Penal Code.</p><p>v.To issue direction to pay the cost of litigation.</p><p>vi.To issue direction to pay the compensation to complainant for compensation for his mental agony, pain and harassment.</p><p>vii.Any other relief which this Hon’ble Authority deem fit and appropriate in view of the facts and circumstances of this complaint.</p>',4625000.00,2187500.00,'2015-03-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>i. To direct the respondent not to demand any further amount whatsoever from the complainant. ii. The Respondent should be restrained from harassing the complainant in any manner whatsoever. iii. Any other interim relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deem fit and appropriate in view of the facts and circumstances of this complaint.</p>','1','','2012-04-09 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','PLOT NUMBER 1069 VILLAGES MULLANPUR DHANAURAN AND MASATGARH LPA MULLANPUR SAS NAGAR','','',2,0,0,0,'sumitkumar001','2018-12-04 17:38:24.000','sumitkumar001','2018-12-04 17:38:24.000'),(459,1166,'1166',1244,'04c5757f-b88d-445e-8905-46acb1e6dbed','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','SUMIT  KUMAR','jurisaxisrera@gmail.com',9729902009,0,0,'4E/10 NORTH SRI KRISHNA PURI RAM KRISHNA PATH PATNA','',5,455,'800013','1','4E/10 NORTH SRI KRISHNA PURI RAM KRISHNA PATH PATNA','',5,455,'800013','KAMALJEET DAHIYA','jurisaxisrera@gmail.com',9729902009,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM GARDEN','MANOHAR INFRASTRUCTURE AND CONSTRUCTIONS PVT. LTD.','nbs@manoharrealty.com',1725016888,1725016888,'SCO 139 141 LEVEL 1 SECTOR 17 C','',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139 141 LEVEL 1 SECTOR 17 C','',6,128,'160017','1','<p>The complainant had purchased a plot in the said project having an approximate 250 sq. yard.The complainant had made payment of Rs 13,87,500/- at the time of allotment, on which the respondent had issued an Application Acknowledgment to the complainant dated 09.04.2012 -Annexure C-1. The respondent sent a letter and assured that they would deliver the possession of plot by year 2015 -Annexure C-2. The respondent had issued a letter in 18.03.2014 wherein they requested for further sum of deposit to the tune of Rs. 9,25,000/- and assured that the project has reached its final stage and they would be in a position to deliver the possession of plot by 2015 - Annexure C-3. The complainant had paid Rs 15,50,000/- to the respondent, for which the respondent had issued receipts to the complainant dated 29.01.2018 Annexure C-4. The respondent had allotted plot No. 1069 admeasuring 250 sq. yard area in year 2018 to the complainant.&nbsp; The respondent had issued a letter to the complainant dated 15.02.2018 wherein the respondent levied the charges of IDC,PLC, Possession charges or any arbitrary charges which were not disclosed or agreed for at the time of initial booking of the plot - Annexure C-5. It is pertinent to mention here that the respondent has the intention to cheat the complainant since the beginning as it is proved by the malafide act and conduct of the respondent. The Complainant has paid INR 21,87,500/- i.e. more than 70% of payment out of total consideration i.e. Basic Sale Price, agreed at the time of booking the plot till Jan.18 - Annexure C-6.The possession of the project was committed in the month of March 2015 and now in the month of November 2018 i.e. delay of 44 months from the date of the commitment, only 30% project is completed thus delaying the possession of the plot deliberately or for reasons known best to them.<br></p>','<p>In view of the facts mentioned in preceding paragraphs, the complainant prays for the following relief(s):-&nbsp;</p><p>i.To give necessary directions to the respondent for the compensation as the respondent has fail to give the possession as per the provisions of Sec. 18 and Sec.19(4)of the RERA Act read with Rule 16 of PBRE(R&amp;D)Rules,2017.</p><p>ii.To direct the respondent to pay the compensation under section 12 of the RERA Act, 2016.</p><p>iii.To issue directions to make liable every officer concerned i.e. Director, Manager, Secretary, or any other officer of the respondent’s company at whose instance, connivance, acquiescence, neglect any of the offences has been committed as mentioned in Sec.69 of RERA Act,2016 to be read with Punjab RERA Rules, 2017.</p><p>iv.To recommend criminal action against the respondents for the criminal offence of cheating, fraud and criminal breach of trust under section 420,406 and 409 of the Indian Penal Code.</p><p>v.To issue direction to pay the cost of litigation.</p><p>vi.To issue direction to pay the compensation to complainant for compensation for his mental agony, pain and harassment.</p><p>vii.Any other relief which this Hon’ble Authority deem fit and appropriate in view of the facts and circumstances of this complaint.</p>',4625000.00,2187500.00,'2015-03-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>i. To direct the respondent not to demand any further amount whatsoever from the complainant. </p><p>ii. The Respondent should be restrained from harassing the complainant in any manner whatsoever. </p><p>iii. Any other interim relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deem fit and appropriate in view of the facts and circumstances of this complaint.</p>','1','','2012-04-09 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','PLOT NUMBER 1069 VILLAGES MULLANPUR DHANAURAN AND MASATGARH LPA MULLANPUR SAS NAGAR','','',2,0,0,0,'sumitkumar001','2018-12-04 18:22:19.000','sumitkumar001','2018-12-04 18:22:19.000'),(460,1124,'1124',1010,'a182232b-88d6-4711-8baa-f8a026fb675f','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-16 19:16:05.000','SUJATHA RAGHUNANDAN','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988100005,1724181010,711442413353,'#102, Sector 10 A','',6,128,'160011','1','#102, Sector 10 A','',6,128,'160011','HIMANSHU RAJ','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988200001,1724190909,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0013','ATS GOLF MEADOWS 1','ATS ESTATES PRIVATE LIMITED','pradeep.rathee@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS TOWER, PLOT NO.16','SECTOR 35, NOIDA',33,216,'201305','1','ATS TOWER, PLOT NO.16','SECTOR 35, NOIDA',33,216,'201305','1','<p>Facts in Brief</p><p>i<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the complainant is a citizen of India and is residing at the above mentioned address. The Aadhar card of the complainant is annexed as ANNEXURE C 1. The complainant has given her hard earned money in the OPs Project ATS GOLF MEADOWS I situated in Dera Bassi SAS Nagar Mohali Punjab for purchasing the residential plot based on assurance and promises of the OP which later on proved to be the false assurances and promises.</p><p><br></p><p>ii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the opposite party is a Company and has at all material points of time been and is still engaged in the commercial business of developing and selling housing projects flats plots and other construction layouts to various individuals and or others in lieu of valuable considerations for profit being their primary objective.</p><p><br></p><p>iii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the OP is a Builder Company and as part of their business venture decided to develop a residential space in the name of ATS GOLF MEADOWS I situated in Dera bassi SAS Nagar Punjab. The OP Builder had published various web and news advertisements as well as visual advertisements to attract the public at large to purchase residential space in the said project The OP had promised the complainant state of the art residential spaces that are affordable yet modern and well equipped residential project within a stipulated time period.</p><p>iv<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the complainant being fascinated by the projection of the said project by the Opposite Party booked a 350 Sq. yard plot in OP s project ATS GOLF MEADOWS I situated in Dera bassi SAS Nagar Punjab in the year 2005. That it is pertinent to mention here that the complainant had paid the complete amount against the said property booked to the OP by 2005 2006. That it is pertinent to mention here that OP did not possess any clearance license from the competent authority to develop the said project at that time. The Customer ledger of the complainant is annexed as ANNEXURE C 2.<br></p>','<p>Relief Sought</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to compensate the complainant in the shape of refund of the complete amount which has been deposited against the residential property so booked by the complainant along with an Interest on the amount from the date of deposit at the rate of 20 per sent&nbsp; till the actual realization of the complete amount within 90 days according to section 18 1 Real Estate Regulation And Development Act 2016 18 2 Real Estate Regulation And Development Act 2016 Section 19 4 of The Real Estate Regulation And Development Act 2016 r w Rule 16 and Rule 17 of Punjab State Real Estate Regulation and Development Rules 2017.</p><p>ii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs. 2000000&nbsp; for causing mental agony caused to the complainant.</p><p><br></p><p>iii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs. 1400000 to the complainant as the deficiency in services for keeping the complainant in dark in regard to the progress of the property.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>iv<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span> To direct the OP to pay Rs. 1400000&nbsp; for causing physical harassment caused to the complainant.</p><p><br></p><p>v<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay 5% of the total estimated cost of the project under section 61 of Real Estate Regulation and Development Act 2016</p><p><br></p><p>vi<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To revoke the license of the OP under section 7 of the Real Estate Regulation and Development act 2016.</p><p><br></p><p>vii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Any other relief or claim which the Hon ble Authority deems appropriate.</p><div><br></div>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Not prayed</p>','1','','2009-04-25 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2018-12-05 10:50:40.000','lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2018-12-05 10:50:40.000'),(461,1126,'1126',1010,'a182232b-88d6-4711-8baa-f8a026fb675f','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-16 19:00:01.000','RAGHUNANDAN SATHYANARAYAN RAO','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988100005,1724181010,711442413353,'#102, Sector 10 A','',6,128,'160011','1','#102, Sector 10 A','',6,128,'160011','HIMANSHU RAJ','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988200001,1724190909,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0013','ATS GOLF MEADOWS 1','ATS ESTATES PRIVATE LIMITED','pradeep.rathee@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS TOWER, PLOT NO.16','SECTOR 35, NOIDA',33,216,'201305','1','ATS TOWER, PLOT NO.16','SECTOR 35, NOIDA',33,216,'201305','1','<p>Facts in Brief</p><p>i<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the complainant is a citizen of India and is residing at the above mentioned address. The Aadhar card of the complainant is annexed as ANNEXURE C 1. The complainant has given his hard earned money in the OPs Project ATS GOLF MEADOWS I situated in Dera Bassi SAS Nagar Mohali Punjab for purchasing the residential plot based on assurance and promises of the OP which later on proved to be the false assurances and promises.</p><p><br></p><p>ii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the opposite party is a Company and has at all material points of time been and is still engaged in the commercial business of developing and selling housing projects flats plots and other construction layouts to various individuals and or others in lieu of valuable considerations for profit being their primary objective.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>iii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the OP is a Builder Company and as part of their business venture decided to develop a residential space in the name of ATS GOLF MEADOWS I situated in Dera bassi SAS Nagar Punjab. The OP Builder had published various web and news advertisements as well as visual advertisements to attract the public at large to purchase residential space in the said project The OP had promised the complainant state of the art residential spaces that are affordable yet modern and well equipped residential project within a stipulated time period.</p><p>iv<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the complainant being fascinated by the projection of the said project by the Opposite Party booked a 500 Sq. yard plot in OP s project ATS GOLF MEADOWS I situated in Dera bassi SAS Nagar Punjab in the year 2005. That it is pertinent to mention here that the complainant had paid the complete amount against the said property booked to the OP by 2005 2006. That it is pertinent to mention here that OP did not possess any clearance license from the competent authority to develop the said project at that time. The Customer ledger of the complainant is annexed as ANNEXURE C 2.<br></p>','<p>Relief Sought</p><p>i<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to compensate the complainant in the shape of refund of the complete amount which has been deposited against the residential property so booked by the complainant along with an Interest on the amount from the date of deposit at the rate of 20 per sent&nbsp; till the actual realization of the complete amount within 90 days according to section 18 1 Real Estate Regulation And Development Act 2016 18 2 Real Estate Regulation And Development Act 2016 Section 19 4 of The Real Estate Regulation And Development Act 2016 r w Rule 16 and Rule 17 of Punjab State Real Estate Regulation and Development Rules 2017</p><p>ii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs. 2000000&nbsp; for causing mental agony caused to the complainant.</p><p><br></p><p>iii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs. 1400000 to the complainant as the deficiency in services for keeping the complainant in dark in regard to the progress of the property.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>iv<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span> To direct the OP to pay Rs. 1400000&nbsp; for causing physical harassment caused to the complainant.</p><p><br></p><p>v<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay 5 per cent of the total estimated cost of the project under section 61 of Real Estate Regulation and Development Act 2016</p><p><br></p><p>vi<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To revoke the license of the OP under section 7 of the Real Estate Regulation and Development act 2016.</p><p>vii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Any other relief or claim which the Hon ble Authority deems appropriate.</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Not Prayed</p>','1','','2009-04-25 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2018-12-05 11:09:55.000','lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2018-12-05 11:09:55.000'),(462,1166,'1166',1244,'04c5757f-b88d-445e-8905-46acb1e6dbed','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','SUMIT  KUMAR','jurisaxisrera@gmail.com',9729902009,0,0,'4E/10 NORTH SRI KRISHNA PURI RAM KRISHNA PATH PATNA','',5,455,'800013','1','4E/10 NORTH SRI KRISHNA PURI RAM KRISHNA PATH PATNA','',5,455,'800013','KAMALJEET DAHIYA','jurisaxisrera@gmail.com',9729902009,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM GARDEN','MANOHAR INFRASTRUCTURE AND CONSTRUCTIONS PVT. LTD.','nbs@manoharrealty.com',1725016888,1725016888,'SCO 139 141 LEVEL 1 SECTOR 17 C','',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139 141 LEVEL 1 SECTOR 17 C','',6,128,'160017','1','<p>The complainant had purchased a plot in the said project having an approximate 250 sq. yard.The complainant had made payment of Rs 13,87,500/- at the time of allotment, on which the respondent had issued an Application Acknowledgment to the complainant dated 09.04.2012 -Annexure C-1. The respondent sent a letter and assured that they would deliver the possession of plot by year 2015 -Annexure C-2. The respondent had issued a letter in 18.03.2014 wherein they requested for further sum of deposit to the tune of Rs. 9,25,000/- and assured that the project has reached its final stage and they would be in a position to deliver the possession of plot by 2015 - Annexure C-3. The complainant had paid Rs 15,50,000/- to the respondent, for which the respondent had issued receipts to the complainant dated 29.01.2018 Annexure C-4. The respondent had allotted plot No. 1069 admeasuring 250 sq. yard area in year 2018 to the complainant.&nbsp; The respondent had issued a letter to the complainant dated 15.02.2018 wherein the respondent levied the charges of IDC,PLC, Possession charges or any arbitrary charges which were not disclosed or agreed for at the time of initial booking of the plot - Annexure C-5. It is pertinent to mention here that the respondent has the intention to cheat the complainant since the beginning as it is proved by the malafide act and conduct of the respondent. The Complainant has paid INR 21,87,500/- i.e. more than 70% of payment out of total consideration i.e. Basic Sale Price, agreed at the time of booking the plot till Jan.18 - Annexure C-6.The possession of the project was committed in the month of March 2015 and now in the month of November 2018 i.e. delay of 44 months from the date of the commitment, only 30% project is completed thus delaying the possession of the plot deliberately or for reasons known best to them.<br></p>','<p>In view of the facts mentioned in preceding paragraphs, the complainant prays for the following relief(s):-&nbsp;</p><p>i.To give necessary directions to the respondents for delivery of possession of plot&nbsp; along with interest for delay in delivery of possession till realization as per the provisions of Sec. 18 and Sec.19(3)of the RERA Act read with Rule 16 of PSRE(R&amp;D)Rules,2017.</p><p>ii.To impose penalty upon the respondents as per the provisions of Section 60 of RERA Act for willful default committed by them.</p><p>iii.To impose penalty upon the respondents as per the provisions of Section 61 of RERA Act for contravention of Sec.12, Sec.14, and Sec. 16 of RERA Act.</p><p>iv.To issue directions to make liable every officer concerned i.e. Director, Manager, Secretary, or any other officer of the respondent’s company at whose instance, connivance, acquiescence, neglect any of the offences has been committed as mentioned in Sec.69 of RERA Act,2016 to be read with Punjab RERA Rules,2017.</p><p>v.To recommend criminal action against the respondents for the criminal offence of cheating, fraud and criminal breach of trust under section 420,406 and 409 of the Indian Penal Code.</p><p>vi.To issue direction to pay the cost of litigation.</p><p>vii.To issue direction to pay the compensation to complainant for compensation for his mental agony, pain and harassment.</p><p>viii.Any other relief which this Hon’ble Authority deem fit and appropriate in view of the facts and circumstances of this complaint.</p><div><br></div>',4625000.00,2187500.00,'2015-03-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>i. To direct the respondent not to demand any further amount whatsoever from the complainant. </p><p>ii. The Respondent should be restrained from harassing the complainant in any manner whatsoever. </p><p>iii. Any other interim relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deem fit and appropriate in view of the facts and circumstances of this complaint.</p>','1','','2012-04-09 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','PLOT NUMBER 1069 VILLAGES MULLANPUR DHANAURAN AND MASATGARH LPA MULLANPUR SAS NAGAR','','',2,0,0,0,'sumitkumar001','2018-12-05 11:21:03.000','sumitkumar001','2018-12-05 11:21:03.000'),(463,1166,'1166',1244,'04c5757f-b88d-445e-8905-46acb1e6dbed','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','SUMIT  KUMAR','jurisaxisrera@gmail.com',9729902009,0,0,'4E/10 NORTH SRI KRISHNA PURI RAM KRISHNA PATH PATNA','',5,455,'800013','1','4E/10 NORTH SRI KRISHNA PURI RAM KRISHNA PATH PATNA','',5,455,'800013','KAMALJEET DAHIYA','jurisaxisrera@gmail.com',9729902009,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM GARDEN','MANOHAR INFRASTRUCTURE AND CONSTRUCTIONS PVT. LTD.','nbs@manoharrealty.com',1725016888,1725016888,'SCO 139 141 LEVEL 1 SECTOR 17 C','',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139 141 LEVEL 1 SECTOR 17 C','',6,128,'160017','1','<p>The complainant had purchased a plot in the said project having an approximate 250 sq. yard.The complainant had made payment of Rs 13,87,500/- at the time of allotment, on which the respondent had issued an Application Acknowledgment to the complainant dated 09.04.2012 -Annexure C-1. The respondent sent a letter and assured that they would deliver the possession of plot by year 2015 -Annexure C-2. The respondent had issued a letter in 18.03.2014 wherein they r