 spaces that are affordable yet modern and well equipped residential project within a stipulated time period.</p><p><br></p>','<p>Relief Sought</p><p>i<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to compensate the complainant in the shape of refund of the complete amount which has been deposited against the residential property so booked by the complainant along with an Interest on the amount from the date of deposit at the rate of 20 per cent&nbsp; till the actual realization of the complete amount within 90 days according to section 18 1 Real Estate Regulation And Development Act 2016 18 2 Real Estate Regulation And Development Act 2016 Section 19 4 of The Real Estate Regulation And Development Act 2016 r w Rule 16 and Rule 17 of Punjab State Real Estate Regulation and Development Rules 2017.</p><p>ii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs. 2000000&nbsp; for causing mental agony caused to the complainant.</p><p><br></p><p>iii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs. 1400000 to the complainant as the deficiency in services for keeping the complainant in dark in regard to the progress of the property.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>iv<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs. 1400000&nbsp; for causing physical harassment caused to the complainant.</p><p><br></p><p>v<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the respondent to pay Rs. 100000 as litigation cost as the complainant was constrained to file the same because of the callous and indifferent attitude of the opposite party.</p><p><br></p><p>vi<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To revoke the license of the OP under section 7 of the Real Estate Regulation and Development act 2016.</p><p><br></p><p>vii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Any other relief or claim which the Hon ble Authority deems appropriate.</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Not Prayed','1','','2015-08-30 00:00:00','0