inant&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">with&nbsp; Rs. 1,33000 and they also delayed the\r\nComplainant’s allotment agreement Which was got executed on</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">05.03.2013\r\nannexed as&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Annexure C-</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">3</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;with</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">a\r\ndelay of more than one year. but no possession was given after many requests&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">5).\r\nThat&nbsp; Respondents issued a letter stating offer of fit out possession on\r\n22.06.2017</span><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">copy\r\nis</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">annexed</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Annexure C-4</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">.\r\nand it was assured by the respondent that after the whole payment the\r\npossession will be given to him. On believing this and after suffering a lot,\r\ncomplainant agreed to their terms and cleared all the dues (approx Rs. 32 lacs)\r\ndated 29.03.2018&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">copy is\r\nannexed as&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Annexure C-5.</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">6).</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Roboto;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">that after giving all the\r\npayment possession was still not given and then on 06.09.2018&nbsp;respondents\r\nasked the complainant to sign the&nbsp;settlement agreement and having no other\r\noption complainant&nbsp;signed it in hope of getting the possession but still\r\nno possession was given . Then the&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Complainant sent the legal notice </span><b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Annexure C-6</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"> to the respondents and\r\nthen the possession was given in the end of november</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">.</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">1).\r\nDirect the respondent to pay and Compensate for all the delay, inconvenience,\r\nharassment given to the complainant by the respondent and further the amount of\r\ninterest till the physical possession &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">given\r\nby them from the date of booking of the flat at the tune of Rs. Ten Lacs. 2). Award cost of litigation of\r\nRs. 1 lac in favor of the complainant and against the respondent. 3). Pass such\r\nother and further order(s) as this Hon’ble authority may deem fit and proper in\r\nthe facts and circumstances of the present case.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>',2927100.00,3197102.00,'2015-09-05 00:00:00.000','2018-11-23 00:00:00.000','<p>Not Applicable</p>','1','','2013-03-05 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Unit No. 105, First Floor, Tower GT-6, Build Area 1630 SQ. FT','','',2,0,0,0,'Trozan','2018-12-05 18:34:14.000','Trozan','2018-12-05 18:34:14.000'),(473,1168,'1168',1233,'d2a1f0ed-7a16-44e8-9590-5e568e27fcb7','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Malkit Singh','malkit.singh@nabard.org',6239648955,1722972303,0,'Flat no. B 303 ','NABARD Vihar',28,507,'160062','1','Flat no. B 303 ','NABARD Vihar',28,507,'160062','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0227','Sunny Enclave - Chando Gobindgarg','J S Bajwa','bajwadeveloperltd@gmail.com',9814014381,1605035000,'Bajwa Developers Ltd., Sunny Business Centre','5th Floor, New Sunny Enclave, Kharar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','Bajwa Developers Ltd., Sunny Business Centre','5th Floor, New Sunny Enclave, Kharar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'malkit.singh@nabard.org','2018-12-06 15:52:26.000','malkit.singh@nabard.org','2018-12-06 15:52:26.000'),(474,1168,'1168',1233,'d2a1f0ed-7a16-44e8-9590-5e568e27fcb7','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Malkit Singh','malkit.singh@nabard.org',6239648955,1722972303,0,'Flat no. B 303 ','NABARD Vihar',28,507,'160062','1','Flat no. B 303 ','NABARD Vihar',28,507,'160062','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0227','Sunny Enclave - Chando Gobindgarg','J S Bajwa','bajwadeveloperltd@gmail.com',9814014381,1605035000,'Bajwa Developers Ltd., Sunny Business Centre','5th Floor, New Sunny Enclave, Kharar, Mohali',28,507,'140301','1','Bajwa Developers Ltd., Sunny Business Centre','5th Floor, New Sunny Enclave, Kharar, Mohali',28,507,'140301','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-ZW\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">I ,\r\nMalkit Singh alongwith my wife Mrs . Namarta Singh had purchased a 200 sq&nbsp; yards plot number 2225 in Sector 123 Jandpur\r\n, Kharar , Distt. Mohali on 31.12.2013. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-ZW\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">At the\r\ntime of purchase in addition to consideration of Rs. 17.00 Lakh given for purchase,\r\nRs. 1.70 Lakh was incurred as registry charges &amp; Rs. 10000 as transfer charges,\r\nI was also made to pay Rs. 3.80 Lakhs as External Development Charges (EDC)\r\nwith a commitment to develop the roads &amp; provide other basic amenities in a\r\ntime bound manner.&nbsp;&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-ZW\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Sir , a\r\nperiod of nearly 5 years have since lapsed , the said plot till date doesn’t\r\nhave access to pucca road in absence of which we are neither able to construct\r\nhouse for self-living nor able to sell at prevailing market price in the area. We\r\nhave been visiting the developer from time to time but no attention has been\r\npaid in this regard.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-ZW\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-ZW\">The developer may kindly be instructed to develop\r\nthe road immediately to enable us to construct the house or sell the same.\r\nDelayed development has deprived us from construct of our house or to sell the\r\nsame &amp; buy at some better location.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-ZW\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-ZW\">Till the time development is done, developer may\r\nkindly be instructed to pay interest @18% on all the expenses incurred in this\r\nregard i.e. on Rs. 22.60 Lakhs (details as above ) from the date of purchase of\r\nthe said plot i.e. 31.12.2013 as an opportunity cost of all options lost during\r\nthe period of 5 years.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'malkit.singh@nabard.org','2018-12-06 15:54:24.000','malkit.singh@nabard.org','2018-12-06 15:54:24.000'),(475,1168,'1168',1233,'d2a1f0ed-7a16-44e8-9590-5e568e27fcb7','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Malkit Singh','malkit.singh@nabard.org',6239648955,1722972303,0,'Flat no. B 303 ','NABARD Vihar',28,507,'160062','1','Flat no. B 303 ','NABARD Vihar',28,507,'160062','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0227','Sunny Enclave - Chando Gobindgarg','J S Bajwa','bajwadeveloperltd@gmail.com',9814014381,1605035000,'Bajwa Developers Ltd., Sunny Business Centre','5th Floor, New Sunny Enclave, Kharar, Mohali',28,507,'140301','1','Bajwa Developers Ltd., Sunny Business Centre','5th Floor, New Sunny Enclave, Kharar, Mohali',28,507,'140301','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-ZW\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">I ,\r\nMalkit Singh alongwith my wife Mrs . Namarta Singh had purchased a 200 sq&nbsp; yards pl