ing losses as construction cost is increasing day by day.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-ZW\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-ZW\">Till the time development is done, developer may\r\nkindly be instructed to pay interest @18% on all the expenses incurred in this\r\nregard i.e. on Rs. 22.60 Lakhs (details as above ) from the date of purchase of\r\nthe said plot i.e. 31.12.2013 as an opportunity cost of all options lost during\r\nthe period of 5 years.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'malkit.singh@nabard.org','2018-12-06 16:23:48.000','malkit.singh@nabard.org','2018-12-06 16:23:48.000'),(476,1168,'1168',1233,'d2a1f0ed-7a16-44e8-9590-5e568e27fcb7','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Malkit Singh','malkit.singh@nabard.org',6239648955,1722972303,0,'Flat no. B 303 ','NABARD Vihar',28,507,'160062','1','Flat no. B 303 ','NABARD Vihar',28,507,'160062','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0227','Sunny Enclave - Chando Gobindgarg','J S Bajwa','bajwadeveloperltd@gmail.com',9814014381,1605035000,'Bajwa Developers Ltd., Sunny Business Centre','5th Floor, New Sunny Enclave, Kharar, Mohali',28,507,'140301','1','Bajwa Developers Ltd., Sunny Business Centre','5th Floor, New Sunny Enclave, Kharar, Mohali',28,507,'140301','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-ZW\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">I ,\r\nMalkit Singh alongwith 