ayment possession was still not given and then on 06.09.2018&nbsp;respondents\r\nasked the complainant to sign the&nbsp;settlement agreement&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-weight: 700;\">C-8)</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;and having no other\r\noption complainant&nbsp;signed it, in hope of getting the possession but still\r\nno possession was given . Then the&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 18px;\">Complainant sent the legal notice (</span><b style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Annexure C-9)</span></b><font face=\"Bookman Old Style, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;to the respondents and\r\nthen the possession was given in the end of November. But no interest has been paid till date.</span></font></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">1).\r\nDirect the respondent to pay and Compensate for all the delay, inconvenience,\r\nharassment given to the complainant by the respondent and further the amount of\r\ninterest till the physical possession &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">given\r\nby them from the date of booking of the flat at the tune of Rs. Ten Lacs. 2). Award cost of litigation of\r\nRs. 1 lac in favor of the complainant and against the respondent. 3). Pass such\r\nother and further order(s) as this Hon’ble authority may deem fit and proper in\r\nthe facts and circumstances of the present case.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r