irect PSPCL for permanent electricity connections for the 65 families (Complainant).Direct MC kharar for permanent water and sewerage connections to the society.Direct Inquiry against involvement of Municipal Corporation with Builder in cheating the Public by allowing sale deed to be executed without issuing occupancy certificate.Direct Inquiry against Builder regarding diversion of project funds to other shell companies.Action against Builder for non completion of Project.Direct Inquiry against Builder regarding theft of GST.Pledge/Stay on&nbsp; selling if the Properties of Builder, Promoters, Directors with immediate effect to avoid misuse of diverted funds.Pass any other order/orders which PBRERA may deem fit in the facts and circumstances of the case.</p><p>b. As we are facing mentally, physically, socially and financially&nbsp; due to the non availability of electricity at our residence and the following financial relief is sought.</p><p>1. During the visit and meeting with the builder on dated 5th Nov 2018 our parents faced medical emergency and we have to rush to the hospital and till date he is under treatment and suffering. An amount of Rs. 5,00,000/- as&nbsp; claim may be consider for the health loss and mental stress to the family.</p><p>2. Due to non availability of electricity&nbsp; for the last and two and half month which cause social defamation.&nbsp;&nbsp;An amount of&nbsp; Rs. 3,00,000/- as&nbsp; claim may be consider.</p><p>3.&nbsp; As we are providing freelancer financial services which badly effected by the non availability of electricity which cause financial loss to the tune of Rs. 2,00,000/-&nbsp;</p><p>4. Litigation and RERA application as per actual estimated to the tune of Rs. 50,000/-</p><p>c. The final we pray that as alternative the complete amount as consideration of the flat along with the interest.</p><p><br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>a. Direct PSPCL for permanent electricity connections f