: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;I pray to the &nbsp;Honourable Judge &nbsp;to&nbsp; provide interest&nbsp;&nbsp;as per the Punjab RERA act,<span style=\"background: yellow;\">the rate of interest under rules is 10.1% .</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;Similar compensation has been awarded&nbsp; in the previous Judgements.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">2)As per “<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Flat Holder\'s Card<i><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 129);\">”&nbsp;</span></i></span></span>provided July 12,2018,the Area of flat has been increased to 3208 sq feet.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">The Area of Flat as per&nbsp;<span style=\"background: yellow;\">Allotment Letter dated&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Mar 8,2013</span></span>&nbsp;is 3007 sq. feet. Amount as per 3550 per sq feet, has been demanded for Additional Area of 201 sq feet.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The Additional area of 201 sq. feet (</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">as per “</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Flat Holder\'s Card<i><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 129);\">”&nbsp;</span></i></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">provided July 12,2018),is completely unjustifiable and irrational.It seems whimisical as it is mischiviously&nbsp;&nbsp;added to extract more Money.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">I pray to the &nbsp;Honourable Judge &nbsp;for&nbsp; waiving the&nbsp;&nbsp;cost of&nbsp;&nbsp;additional area which was recently added(Flat Holder’s Card).<o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3)<span style=\"background: yellow;\">A compensation of RS 10,00000(10 Lakh) for harassment,mental and physical agony and inconvenience.</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">4)<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"background: yellow;\">Waiving of GST applicable</span></span>&nbsp;on the outstanding amount as GST being paid on account of late possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">5)<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"background: yellow;\">No further Payment be demanded until possession is given</span></span><span style=\"background: yellow;\">.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">6)<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">A correct date of possession of the Apartment&nbsp; be provided and if possession not handed over by that date,then Additional Compensation amount&nbsp; be decided</span>.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: roboto, serif; text-align: justify; background: yellow;\"></span><br></p>','1','','2013-03-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','D-502,FALCON VIEW APARTMENTS,SECTOR 66 A MOHALI','','',1,1,0,0,'VARINDER7','2018-12-13 14:54:48.000','VARINDER7','2018-12-13 14:54:48.000'),(520,1180,'1180',1172,'fe8a123a-24f0-4e44-a8e1-3e154d6acf61','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-15 11:25:08.000','Ramesh Mittal','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9934787251,0,0,'Mittal House, Main Road','Near Pankaj Cinema, Raxaul',5,188,'845305','1','253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM SPRING','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:150%;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Applicant,\r\non 21.10.2013 booked a (C1) 250 sq yards plot @RS. 20000 per sq yd from the\r\nrespondent in Palm Spring.Respondent assured that it has all approvals except\r\nlayout which will be obtained within 2-3 months &amp; possession will be\r\ndelivered in 2 years.A broacher (C2) was also provided to applicant before\r\nbooking. Applicant paid Rs. 1500000 i.e 30% of sale consideration vide two\r\ncheques (C3) dated 21.10.13 &amp; 19.12.13. Insipte of repeated\r\nrequests,respondent did not issue any allotment letter &amp; execute the\r\nagreement.Respondent had even concealed that it was not having CLU &amp; it was\r\nin September,2014(C4)it informed the applicant that it has received the CLU now\r\n&amp; allotment shall be made in Dec,2014.The applicant was shocked after\r\nknowing that, as he was under impression that respondent was having all the\r\napprovals. Since the respondent assured to make allotment in Dec, 2014 the\r\napplicant chose to have the plot since substantial amount was already paid by\r\nhim.But the respondent did not issue any allotment letter even by the said\r\ndate.The respondent even failed to start any development.Inspite of number of\r\nvisits,repeated requests and assurances, the respondent did not issue any\r\nallotment letter &amp; execute the agreement during year 2014 to 2018.Email was\r\nalso sent to respondent on 17.08.18 (C5)requesting the respondent to refund the\r\namount since the respondent failed to issue any allotment letter &amp; execute\r\nagreement.Then the respondent telephonically informed the applicant that it\r\nwill sell the plot at premium of Rs. 2000 per sq yd and refund the amount to\r\nhim, And for that purpose also asked the bank detail,which was duly sent by the\r\napplicant vide email dated 21.08.18(C6).The respondent has misrepresented the\r\napplicant since beginning and never informed him about the true picture of the approvals\r\nand development.It had not even applied the necessary permissions when the plot\r\nwas sold to applicant.A list of dates of approvals C7 and some important\r\napprovals as C8 &amp; C9<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<ol><li><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: 15.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Directing the respondent\r\nto refund the principle amount i.e. Rs. 1500000 along with interest as\r\ncontemplated under rule 16 of The Punjab RERA Rules, 2017, as the complainants\r\nhave lost faith in the respondent due to misrepresentation by it about the\r\napprovals &amp; stages of development during all these years ,did not issue any\r\nallotment letter &amp; execute the agreement till date, failed to develop the\r\nproject &amp; thus the complainants wish to withdraw from the project. Also the\r\nrespondent has committed violation of various provisions of PAPRA &amp;\r\nconditions of various approvals granted to it, as it could not collect any\r\namount till the exemption is received under Section 44 of PAPRA which was\r\ngranted on 25.1.17.The respondent collected the money from the complainant in\r\n2013.The approvals were granted to the respondent on the ground that it will\r\nnot sell any plot &amp; collect money from the general public till exemption\r\nunder Section 44 of PAPRA is received.Also, inspite of receiving 30% of sale\r\nconsideration the respondent did not execute any agreement &amp; issue a plot\r\nnumber till date &amp; asking the complainant to pay more money for getting the\r\nallotment letter &amp; execution of agreement in violation of Section 13 of\r\nRERA.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: 15.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: 15.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">2.&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">To take action against respondent under Section\r\n61 of RERA for constant violation of provision of Section 13 of RERA as the\r\nrespondent failed to issue any allotment letter &amp; execute the buyer’s\r\nagreement till date, inspite of receiving 30% of sale consideration&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: 15.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">For\r\ncancelling the registration of the respondent and the extension granted to the\r\nrespondent for constantly violating various provisions of RERA and for\r\nindulging into unfair trade practices.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: 15.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: 15.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p></div></li></ol>',5000000.00,1500000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;\r\nmargin-bottom:0in;margin-left:37.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-19.5pt;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nmso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">A.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the list of allottees to whom it has\r\nallotted/sold the 862 residential plots as per the layout plan approved by\r\nGMADA on 6.10.2015 and for which it is registered under RERA. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;\r\nmargin-bottom:0in;margin-left:37.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-19.5pt;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nmso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">B.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the details in respect of funds collected\r\nfrom the general public since 2010 in lieu of 862 residential plots which are\r\npart of approved layout and registered under Section 3 of RERA and also, the detail\r\nwhere such amount has been utilized by the respondent. Also,the respondent be\r\ndirected to provide all the bank details where such amount has been deposited\r\nalong with the statement of accounts, since the year 2010 and where such amount\r\nhas been utilized.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;\r\nmargin-bottom:0in;margin-left:37.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-19.5pt;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nmso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">C.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The respondent be directed to provide the details in respect of number of\r\nbookings done by it since the year 2010 for the said 862 residential plots<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;\r\nmargin-bottom:0in;margin-left:37.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-19.5pt;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nmso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">D.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the list of hypothecated plots which are hypothecated\r\nto GMADA, out of the approved 862 residential plots and 73 commercial plots.\r\nAlso, the respondent be directed to provide the list of hypothected plots sold\r\nto general public.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:150%;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'rerafilingformn','2018-12-13 17:07:53.000','rerafilingformn','2018-12-13 17:07:53.000'),(521,1183,'1183',1164,'c03f036c-8689-4b09-adbb-924304b6bb39','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Raman Takiar','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',7018407600,0,0,'House No. 4','Sector-19A',6,128,'160019','1','House No 253','Sector-4,Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM SPRINGS','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Complainant, on 26.02.2011 booked(C-1)a 350 sq\r\nyards plot @ RS.18000 per sq yd (excluding EDC &amp; PLC)from the respondent in\r\nthe project Palm Springs, Mullanpur, Mohali. It was assured&nbsp;by respondent\r\nthat it has received all the approvals except one or two which will be obtained\r\nwithin 2-3 months &amp; the possession of the plot will be delivered in 2\r\nyears.The applicant paid Rs. 1890000 i.e. 30% of total sale\r\nconsideration.Thereafter the applicant chose to have a 250 sq yard plot instead\r\nof 350 sq yard &amp; accordingly requested(C-2) respondent to change the size\r\nof plot. The said request was accepted. Out of the amount of Rs. 1890000, respondent\r\nadjusted Rs. 1350000/- i.e. 30 % sale consideration towards 250 sq yrd plot @\r\nRs 18000 per sq yrd and only refunded Rs. 490000(C-3) instead of Rs. 540000.The\r\nrespondent issued an acknowledgement(C-4) for the 250 sq yards plot wherein it\r\narbitrarily incorporated the condition of paying the IDC which was never agreed\r\nbetween the parties. When resisted by the applicant, the respondent threatened\r\nthe applicant that his money will be forfeited if IDC charges are not paid.\r\nAlso in the said acknowledgment the respondent only acknowledged Rs. 1350000/-\r\ninstead of Rs. 1400000/-. On being confronted,the respondent assured to adjust\r\nremaining 50000/- at the time of agreement.Inspite of number of visits,\r\nrepeated requests and assurances, the respondent did not issue any allotment\r\nletter and execute the buyer’s agreement till date. A legal notice(C-5) was\r\nalso sent to it but to no avail.The respondent has misrepresented the applicant\r\nsince&nbsp;beginning and never informed him about the true picture of the\r\napprovals and the development . It had not even applied the permissions when\r\nthe plot was sold to the applicant. A list of approvals along with the dates\r\nwhen the same were applied and obtained is attached as C-6 and some important\r\napprovals as C-7 &amp; C-8.The respondent was not having approval or sanction\r\nfor collecting money.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p>ABC</p>',4500000.00,1400000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>ABC</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'Ramantakiar','2018-12-13 19:12:13.000','Ramantakiar','2018-12-13 19:12:13.000'),(522,1183,'1183',1164,'c03f036c-8689-4b09-adbb-924304b6bb39','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Raman Takiar','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',7018407600,0,0,'House No. 4','Sector-19A',6,128,'160019','1','House No 253','Sector-4,Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM SPRINGS','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Complainant, on 26.02.2011 booked(C-1)a 350 sq\r\nyards plot @ RS.18000 per sq yd (excluding EDC &amp; PLC)from the respondent in\r\nthe project Palm Springs, Mullanpur, Mohali. It was assured&nbsp;by respondent\r\nthat it has received all the approvals except one or two which will be obtained\r\nwithin 2-3 months &amp; the possession of the plot will be delivered in 2\r\nyears.The applicant paid Rs. 1890000 i.e. 30% of total sale\r\nconsideration.Thereafter the applicant chose to have a 250 sq yard plot instead\r\nof 350 sq yard &amp; accordingly requested(C-2) respondent to change the size\r\nof plot. The said request was accepted. Out of the amount of Rs. 1890000, respondent\r\nadjusted Rs. 1350000/- i.e. 30 % sale consideration towards 250 sq yrd plot @\r\nRs 18000 per sq yrd and only refunded Rs. 490000(C-3) instead of Rs. 540000.The\r\nrespondent issued an acknowledgement(C-4) for the 250 sq yards plot wherein it\r\narbitrarily incorporated the condition of paying the IDC which was never agreed\r\nbetween the parties. When resisted by the applicant, the respondent threatened\r\nthe applicant that his money will be forfeited if IDC charges are not paid.\r\nAlso in the said acknowledgment the respondent only acknowledged Rs. 1350000/-\r\ninstead of Rs. 1400000/-. On being confronted,the respondent assured to adjust\r\nremaining 50000/- at the time of agreement.Inspite of number of visits,\r\nrepeated requests and assurances, the respondent did not issue any allotment\r\nletter and execute the buyer’s agreement till date. A legal notice(C-5) was\r\nalso sent to it but to no avail.The respondent has misrepresented the applicant\r\nsince&nbsp;beginning and never informed him about the true picture of the\r\napprovals and the development . It had not even applied the permissions when\r\nthe plot was sold to the applicant. A list of approvals along with the dates\r\nwhen the same were applied and obtained is attached as C-6 and some important\r\napprovals as C-7 &amp; C-8.The respondent was not having approval or sanction\r\nfor collecting money.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 15.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Directing the respondent to refund the principle\r\namount i.e. Rs. 1400000 along with interest as contemplated under rule 16 of\r\nThe Punjab RERA Rules, 2017, as the complainant has lost faith in the\r\nrespondent due to misrepresentation by it about the approvals &amp; stages of\r\ndevelopment during all these years ,did not issue any allotment letter &amp;\r\nexecute the agreement till date, failed to develop the project &amp; thus the\r\ncomplainant wish to withdraw from the project. Also the respondent has\r\ncommitted violation of various provisions of PAPRA &amp; conditions of various\r\napprovals granted to it, as it could not collect any amount till the exemption\r\nis received under Section 44 of PAPRA which was granted on 25.1.17.The\r\nrespondent collected the money from the complainant in 2011.The approvals were\r\ngranted to the respondent on the ground that it will not sell any plot &amp;\r\ncollect money from the general public till exemption under Section 44 of PAPRA\r\nis received.Also, inspite of receiving 30% of sale consideration the respondent\r\ndid not execute any agreement &amp; issue a plot number till date &amp; asking\r\nthe complainant to pay more money for getting the allotment letter &amp; execution\r\nof agreement in violation of Section 13 of RERA.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; line-height: 15.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 15.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">To take action against\r\nrespondent under Section 61 of RERA for constant violation of provision of\r\nSection 13 of RERA as the respondent failed to issue any allotment letter &amp;\r\nexecute the buyer’s agreement till date, inspite of receiving 30% of sale\r\nconsideration&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; line-height: 15.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 15.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">For cancelling the registration of the\r\nrespondent and the extension granted to the respondent for constantly violating\r\nvarious provisions of RERA and for indulging into unfair trade practices.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',4500000.00,1400000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:37.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-19.5pt;\r\nline-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">A.The respondent be\r\ndirected to provide the list of allottees to whom it has allotted/sold the 862\r\nresidential plots as per the layout plan approved by GMADA on 6.10.2015 and for\r\nwhich it is registered under RERA.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:37.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-19.5pt;\r\nline-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">B.</span><span style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to provide the\r\ndetails in respect of funds collected from the general public since 2010 in\r\nlieu of 862 residential plots which are part of approved layout and registered\r\nunder Section 3 of RERA and also, the detail where such amount has been\r\nutilized by the respondent. Also,the respondent be directed to provide all the\r\nbank details where such amount has been deposited along with the statement of\r\naccounts, since the year 2010 and where such amount has been utilized.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:37.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-19.5pt;\r\nline-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">C.</span><span style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to provide the details in respect of\r\nnumber of bookings done by it since the year 2010 for the said 862 residential\r\nplots</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:37.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-19.5pt;\r\nline-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">D.</span><span style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to provide the list\r\nof hypothecated plots which are hypothecated to GMADA, out of the approved 862\r\nresidential plots and 73 commercial plots. Also, the respondent be directed to\r\nprovide the list of hypothected plots sold to general public.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'Ramantakiar','2018-12-13 19:19:44.000','Ramantakiar','2018-12-13 19:19:44.000'),(523,1183,'1183',1164,'c03f036c-8689-4b09-adbb-924304b6bb39','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Raman Takiar','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',7018407600,0,0,'House No. 4','Sector-19A',6,128,'160019','1','House No 253','Sector-4,Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM SPRINGS','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Complainant, on 26.02.2011 booked(C-1)a 350 sq\r\nyards plot @ RS.18000 per sq yd (excluding EDC &amp; PLC)from the respondent in\r\nthe project Palm Springs, Mullanpur, Mohali. It was assured&nbsp;by respondent\r\nthat it has received all the approvals except one or two which will be obtained\r\nwithin 2-3 months &amp; the possession of the plot will be delivered in 2\r\nyears.The applicant paid Rs. 1890000 i.e. 30% of total sale\r\nconsideration.Thereafter the applicant chose to have a 250 sq yard plot instead\r\nof 350 sq yard &amp; accordingly requested(C-2) respondent to change the size\r\nof plot. The said request was accepted. Out of the amount of Rs. 1890000, respondent\r\nadjusted Rs. 1350000/- i.e. 30 % sale consideration towards 250 sq yrd plot @\r\nRs 18000 per sq yrd and only refunded Rs. 490000(C-3) instead of Rs. 540000.The\r\nrespondent issued an acknowledgement(C-4) for the 250 sq yards plot wherein it\r\narbitrarily incorporated the condition of paying the IDC which was never agreed\r\nbetween the parties. When resisted by the applicant, the respondent threatened\r\nthe applicant that his money will be forfeited if IDC charges are not paid.\r\nAlso in the said acknowledgment the respondent only acknowledged Rs. 1350000/-\r\ninstead of Rs. 1400000/-. On being confronted,the respondent assured to adjust\r\nremaining 50000/- at the time of agreement.Inspite of number of visits,\r\nrepeated requests and assurances, the respondent did not issue any allotment\r\nletter and execute the buyer’s agreement till date. A legal notice(C-5) was\r\nalso sent to it but to no avail.The respondent has misrepresented the applicant\r\nsince&nbsp;beginning and never informed him about the true picture of the\r\napprovals and the development . It had not even applied the permissions when\r\nthe plot was sold to the applicant. A list of approvals along with the dates\r\nwhen the same were applied and obtained is attached as C-6 and some important\r\napprovals as C-7 &amp; C-8.The respondent was not having approval or sanction\r\nfor collecting money.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 15.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Directing the respondent to refund the principle\r\namount i.e. Rs. 1400000 along with interest as contemplated under rule 16 of\r\nThe Punjab RERA Rules, 2017, as the complainant has lost faith in the\r\nrespondent due to misrepresentation by it about the approvals &amp; stages of\r\ndevelopment during all these years ,did not issue any allotment letter &amp;\r\nexecute the agreement till date, failed to develop the project &amp; thus the\r\ncomplainant wish to withdraw from the project. Also the respondent has\r\ncommitted violation of various provisions of PAPRA &amp; conditions of various\r\napprovals granted to it, as it could not collect any amount till the exemption\r\nis received under Section 44 of PAPRA which was granted on 25.1.17.The\r\nrespondent collected the money from the complainant in 2011.The approvals were\r\ngranted to the respondent on the ground that it will not sell any plot &amp;\r\ncollect money from the general public till exemption under Section 44 of PAPRA\r\nis received.Also, inspite of receiving 30% of sale consideration the respondent\r\ndid not execute any agreement &amp; issue a plot number till date &amp; asking\r\nthe complainant to pay more money for getting the allotment letter &amp; execution\r\nof agreement in violation of Section 13 of RERA.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; line-height: 15.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 15.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">To take action against\r\nrespondent under Section 61 of RERA for constant violation of provision of\r\nSection 13 of RERA as the respondent failed to issue any allotment letter &amp;\r\nexecute the buyer’s agreement till date, inspite of receiving 30% of sale\r\nconsideration&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; line-height: 15.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 15.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">For cancelling the registration of the\r\nrespondent and the extension granted to the respondent for constantly violating\r\nvarious provisions of RERA and for indulging into unfair trade practices.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',4500000.00,1400000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:37.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-19.5pt;\r\nline-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">A.The respondent be\r\ndirected to provide the list of allottees to whom it has allotted/sold the 862\r\nresidential plots as per the layout plan approved by GMADA on 6.10.2015 and for\r\nwhich it is registered under RERA.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:37.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-19.5pt;\r\nline-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">B.</span><span style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to provide the\r\ndetails in respect of funds collected from the general public since 2010 in\r\nlieu of 862 residential plots which are part of approved layout and registered\r\nunder Section 3 of RERA and also, the detail where such amount has been\r\nutilized by the respondent. Also,the respondent be directed to provide all the\r\nbank details where such amount has been deposited along with the statement of\r\naccounts, since the year 2010 and where such amount has been utilized.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:37.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-19.5pt;\r\nline-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">C.</span><span style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to provide the details in respect of\r\nnumber of bookings done by it since the year 2010 for the said 862 residential\r\nplots</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:37.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-19.5pt;\r\nline-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">D.</span><span style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to provide the list\r\nof hypothecated plots which are hypothecated to GMADA, out of the approved 862\r\nresidential plots and 73 commercial plots. Also, the respondent be directed to\r\nprovide the list of hypothected plots sold to general public.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'Ramantakiar','2018-12-13 19:28:53.000','Ramantakiar','2018-12-13 19:28:53.000'),(524,1184,'1184',1250,'bc502035-2e0d-4d0d-ab5b-b3bf8a32e5e8','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','raj kumar chaudhary','mgarg14@gmail.com',9872840114,0,0,'house no. 250, new dashmesh nagar','rama mandi, jalandhar',28,261,'144005','1','house no. 250, new dashmesh nagar','rama mandi, jalandhar',28,261,'144005','Munish Gupta','guptalegal44@gmail.com',9814061084,1724016068,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0023','geetu constructions pvt ltd','geetu constructions pvt ltd','info@gcplmohali.com',0,1725032649,'sco 219, 2nd floor','sector 37c',6,128,'160036','1','sco 219, 2nd floor','sector 37c',6,128,'160036','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Allured by advertisements and\r\npromises of marketing persons of respondent, in order to have a residential\r\napartment for himself, applicant booked 3BHK apartment in project of\r\nrespondents by paying initial sum of Rs. 1 lakh on 10.09.2012. Total sale consideration\r\nof the unit was fixed as Rs.37,50,000/-. Receipt qua deposit was issued which\r\nis attached. Later as per demands raised telephonically, complainant deposited\r\nRs. 4 lakh vide RTGS on 21.11.2012 and paid another sum of Rs. 1,50,000/- on\r\n11.03.2013 vide Transaction no. 00000869309682A1 from HDFC Bank Jalandhar. All\r\namounts were paid from Account of complainant of HDFC Bank . Statement\r\nreflecting all transactions is attached. Despite receipt of Rs. 6.5 Lakh\r\n(almost 20 % ) , neither allotment letter has been issued , nor any buyers\r\nagreement has been executed , which is violaton of provisions of PAPRA as well\r\nas RERA. Builder has been requested time and again regarding allotment letter,\r\nbuyers agreement and even status of project, but to no use. Complainant is fed\r\nup of the false promises given since 2013 and as such now has decided to\r\nwithdraw from the project. Legal notice dated 23.7.2018 has been served\r\ninforming intention of complainant but to no use and therefore, instant\r\ncomplaint is being filed. Copy of legal notice and postal receipt is attached.</span><o:p></o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">It is therefore, respectfully\r\nprayed that amount of Rs.6.5 Lakh deposited be ordered to be refunded with\r\ninterest from respective dates of deposits and suitable compensation and\r\nlitigation expenses be also ordered in favour of complainant for mental agony,\r\nharassment caused by respondent.</span></p>',3750000.00,650000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>respondents bank account be ordered to be attached</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'rajkumarchaudhary4444','2018-12-14 19:39:54.000','rajkumarchaudhary4444','2018-12-14 19:39:54.000'),(525,1185,'1185',1252,'c82b11a7-bdf7-4a4e-9d10-e1db708e636e','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Sarita Singh','dps.legalconsultants@gmail.com',9888104511,0,0,'House No.3, Kishore Colony, Bhupinder Road, Patiala','',28,454,'147001','1','House No.3, Kishore Colony, Bhupinder Road, Patiala','',28,454,'147001','Pushpinder Kaushal','dps.legalconsultants@gmail.com',9888104511,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0154','Country Colonizers Private Limited','Country Colonizers Private Limited','ritu.vansil@waveestate.in',0,0,'P.O. Rayon & Silk Mills, Adjoining Coca Cola Depot, G.T. Road, Chheharta, Amritsar, Punjab','',28,39,'143105','1','P.O. Rayon & Silk Mills, Adjoining Coca Cola Depot, G.T. Road, Chheharta, Amritsar, Punjab','',28,39,'143105','0','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">1-<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'>That\r\ncomplainants booked one 3 BHK Apartment with the respondent at their Project\r\n“Wave Gardens”, SAS Nagar, Sector-85 &amp; 99, District Mohali, Punjab on <u>16.10.2012</u>\r\nby paying Rs.<u>5,00,000</u>/- vide Receipt No.IR2012000945. Brochure is <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><u>C-1</u></b> &amp; Receipt is <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><u>C-2</u></b>. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">2-<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'>That\r\nafter passing of three years, <span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp;</span>provisional allotment was made &amp; Apartment\r\nNo.0202, J Jasmine, 2<sup><font size=\"3\">nd</font></sup> Floor, Type 3 BHK with Servant Quarter in\r\nGroup Housing Development named as “Wave Gardens”, SAS Nagar, Sector-85 &amp;\r\n99, District Mohali, having a chargeable super area of approximately 2,283.00\r\nSq. Feet (212.10 Sq Meters) &amp; having Built-up Area 1,932.00 Sq Feet (179.49\r\nSq Meters) was allotted to complainants and in this regard “Apartment\r\nAllottee(s) Arrangement” was executed on 19<sup><font size=\"3\">th</font></sup> October, 2015, which\r\nis <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><u>C-3</u></b>. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">3-<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'>That\r\ntotal sale consideration of the Apartment including taxes as provided by respondent\r\nis <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><u>Rs.1,026,69,282/-</u></b>, the\r\nprice details is <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><u>C-4</u></b> and the\r\ncomplainants had opted for the “Subvention Payment Linked Plan”, where the\r\npayments had to be made as per the Payment Schedule detailed therein, which\r\nwill be accordingly to progress in the Development of the project. The\r\ncomplainants opted for Preferential Location. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">4-<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'>That\r\nthe complainants had duly paid an amount of <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:&#10;normal\"><u>Rs.34,36,440/-</u></b>, which was acknowledged by respondents, but\r\nin Customer Statement Account, the respondents had wrongly mentioned as <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><u>Rs.33,24,040/-</u></b> various receipts\r\nare <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><u>C-5</u> to <u>C-7</u></b> &amp;\r\nStatement is <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><u>C-8</u></b>.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">5-<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'>That\r\ndespite receipt of the said amount, there was no development in the above-said\r\nproject of the respondents till date and the said project is totally in an\r\nabandoned condition. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13.33px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">6-<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'>That\r\nthe complainants had left with no other option except to seek their refund,\r\nwhich was sought vide e-mails &amp; despite receipt of e-mails, only response\r\nwas given that “<b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">Your request is under process</b>”,\r\nbut till date refund was not made. E-mails is <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:&#10;normal\"><u>C-9 (Colly. containing pages 1 to 10)</u></b>.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><font face=\"Times New Roman\"></font><br></p>','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">1-<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'>That\r\nthe complainants have been suffering on account of the acts &amp; conduct of\r\nthe respondents, so the amount deposited by the complainants is liable to be\r\nrefunded. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">2-<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'>That\r\nfurther as per Clause No.5.1 of the Apartment Allottee(s) Arrangement, the\r\ndevelopment of the said project and the Apartment was to be completed within 30\r\nmonths alongwith an extended period of six months from the date of execution of\r\nthe Apartment Allottee(s) Arrangement i.e. <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><u>19.10.2015</u></b>\r\nand from the date of start of construction of Group Housing named as “Wave\r\nGardens” whichever is later, however, even the said period has already been\r\nelapsed i.e. by <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><u>19.10.2018</u></b>\r\nand by this date, the project as well as the Apartment has to be completed in\r\ntotality, as per the projections made by the respondents in their Brochures,\r\nhowever, on the other hand, till date, there is no such development, so the\r\namount deposited by the complainants is liable to be refunded. It is also worth\r\nmention here that as per Clause 5.5 of the Apartment Allottee(s) Arrangement,\r\nin case of delay in construction of the Unit, the delay charges at the rate of\r\nRs.5 per Sq. Feet (super area) per month were payable to the complainants.\r\nHowever, the respondents failed to complete/develop the project, so as to\r\ndeliver possession of the unit, in question to the complainants within the\r\nstipulated period.<span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">3-<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'>That\r\ndue the act and conduct of the respondents, the complainants have been\r\ncontinuously suffering mentally, physically &amp; economically.<span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13.33px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">4-<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'>Hence,\r\nthe complainants are seeking the following directions to the respondents:- </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 115%; font-family: \"Bookman Old Style\",\"serif\"; font-size: 12.5pt;\'>To refund the amount of <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><u>Rs.34,36,440/-</u></b>, alongwith\r\ninterest @ 18% per annum from the respective dates of deposit till realization.</span><b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>no</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'tinks123','2018-12-14 20:29:28.000','tinks123','2018-12-14 20:29:28.000'),(526,1184,'1184',1250,'bc502035-2e0d-4d0d-ab5b-b3bf8a32e5e8','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-16 15:19:24.000','raj kumar chaudhary','mgarg14@gmail.com',9872840114,0,0,'house no. 250, new dashmesh nagar','rama mandi, jalandhar',28,261,'144005','1','house no. 250, new dashmesh nagar','rama mandi, jalandhar',28,261,'144005','Munish Gupta','guptalegal44@gmail.com',9814061084,1724016068,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0023','geetu constructions pvt ltd','geetu constructions pvt ltd','info@gcplmohali.com',0,1725032649,'sco 219, 2nd floor','sector 37c',6,128,'160036','1','sco 219, 2nd floor','sector 37c',6,128,'160036','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Allured by advertisements and\r\npromises of marketing persons of respondent, in order to have a residential\r\napartment for himself, applicant booked 3BHK apartment in project of\r\nrespondents by paying initial sum of Rs. 1 lakh on 10.09.2012. Total sale consideration\r\nof the unit was fixed as Rs.37,50,000/-. Receipt qua deposit was issued which\r\nis attached. Later as per demands raised telephonically, complainant deposited\r\nRs. 4 lakh vide RTGS on 21.11.2012 and paid another sum of Rs. 1,50,000/- on\r\n11.03.2013 vide Transaction no. 00000869309682A1 from HDFC Bank Jalandhar. All\r\namounts were paid from Account of complainant of HDFC Bank . Statement\r\nreflecting all transactions is attached. Despite receipt of Rs. 6.5 Lakh\r\n(almost 20 % ) , neither allotment letter has been issued , nor any buyers\r\nagreement has been executed , which is violaton of provisions of PAPRA as well\r\nas RERA. Builder has been requested time and again regarding allotment letter,\r\nbuyers agreement and even status of project, but to no use. Complainant is fed\r\nup of the false promises given since 2013 and as such now has decided to\r\nwithdraw from the project. Legal notice dated 23.7.2018 has been served\r\ninforming intention of complainant but to no use and therefore, instant\r\ncomplaint is being filed. Copy of legal notice and postal receipt is attached.</span><o:p></o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">It is therefore, respectfully\r\nprayed that amount of Rs.6.5 Lakh deposited be ordered to be refunded with\r\ninterest from respective dates of deposits and suitable compensation and\r\nlitigation expenses be also ordered in favour of complainant for mental agony,\r\nharassment caused by respondent.</span></p>',3750000.00,650000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>respondents bank account be ordered to be attached</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'rajkumarchaudhary4444','2018-12-14 21:14:35.000','rajkumarchaudhary4444','2018-12-14 21:14:35.000'),(527,1186,'1186',1269,'e03c7b9d-d8a0-485d-985d-807b962c7216','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-16 15:50:30.000','Rachna  Verma','csvedparkash@gmail.com',9815447788,0,0,'#261, Sector-8, Panchkula','',13,15,'134109','1','#261, Sector-8, Panchkula','',13,15,'134109','Ved Parkash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PC0006','International Trade Tower','Omaxe Limited','customerrelations_chandigarh@omaxe.com',0,0,'#262, Sector-8, Panchkula','',13,15,'134109','1','#262, Sector-8, Panchkula','',13,15,'134109','1','<p>1. That the complainants applied for allotment of a commercial unit in International Trade Tower situated at Chandigarh promoted by M/s Omaxe in Omaxe township at Mullanpur.&nbsp;</p><p>2. That Omaxe through their Marketting Company M/s Bhanu Infratech Private Limited issued Provisional Allotment of Ommercial Unit-INTT/01/Shop/57 in the International Trade Tower on 30th&nbsp; April, 2017 , after receipt of part of booking amount of Rs.1,00,000/- including Service Tax amount. Total Booking amount payable was Rs.3,00,000/- as per the terms of Contract. Annexure 1.&nbsp;</p><p>3. The Total amount of Consideration of the allotted Commercial unit was Rs.67,46,294/-and&nbsp; All the details of booking amount paid/ payable and total consideration amount are detailed in the Demand letter dated 11.05.2017 of the respondent Company.&nbsp;</p><p>4. That the Respondent company obtained documents from the Complainants for arranging Loan from bank but later on informed that the Loan amount could not be sanctioned for the allotted Commercial Unit.&nbsp;</p><p>5. Accordingly&nbsp; the Complainants requested for refund of the amount immediately and submitted the requisite Documents for processing the refund on 13.07.2017. Annexure II.&nbsp;</p><p>6. That, instead of processing the refund, the Respondent Company sent us a reminder for payment of outstanding amount alongwith and threatened to cancel the allotment in case of Non-Payment by the Applicants on 27.09.2017. Annexure III.&nbsp;</p><p>7. That the Complainants&nbsp; keep on pursuing for refund of the amount and sent reminders of money on 10.10.2017 and 01.11.2017. But did not got any response.&nbsp; Annexure IV.&nbsp;</p><p>8. That the respondent company sent a letter dated 15.01.2018 intimating the cancellation of the Allotted unit vide letter dated 06.10.2017 and also mentioned that the amount paid has been forfieted. Annexure V&nbsp;</p><p>9. That vide email dated June 16th, 2018, the Respondent Company intimated an amount of Rs.1,40,659.16/- has been paid&nbsp; as Service Tax against the Allotted unit. Annexure VI. &nbsp;</p><p><br></p>','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-indent: -18pt;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt;\">That the statements made by the\r\nRespondent Company at 8 and 9 are contradictory which shows their malafiding in\r\nnot returning the Booking Amount of the Complainant . And, the Allotted Unit\r\nhas already been sold to as per details complied by the Complainant. <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><u>Annexure VII</u></b>.<b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><u></u></b></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13.33px 48px;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13.33px 48px;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13.33px 48px;\"><br></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><font face=\"Times New Roman\"></font><br></p>',6746294.00,100000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p style=\"background-color: transparent; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 13.33px; margin-left: 48px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><u style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18.66px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\">Prayer:</span></u></b></p><p style=\"background-color: transparent; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"background-color: transparent; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 13.33px; margin-left: 48px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18.66px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\">It is a\r\nRegistered Project with RERA Registration No.-PBRERA-SAS80-PC0006</span></p><p style=\"background-color: transparent; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"background-color: transparent; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 13.33px; margin-left: 48px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18.66px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\">Respondent\r\nCompany has violated Section 18 and 19 of the Act. It is respectfully prayed\r\nthat the Respondent Company may be directed to refund the amount alongwith\r\ninterest as per RERA Provisions.</span></p><p style=\"background-color: transparent; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"background-color: transparent; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 13.33px; margin-left: 48px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18.66px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','INTT/01/Shop/57','','',2,0,0,0,'rachnaverma1','2018-12-16 14:53:48.000','rachnaverma1','2018-12-16 14:53:48.000'),(528,1187,'1187',1270,'76b13f72-f47d-4af3-baf6-5d64e8a86512','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-16 19:11:03.000','Nisha Garg','khushistationaryshop@gmail.com',9888306242,0,0,'H. No. 341, Phase-2, Ram Darbar Colony, Industrial Area, Chandigarh','',6,128,'160002','1','H. No. 341, Phase-2, Ram Darbar Colony, Industrial Area, Chandigarh','',6,128,'160002','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PM0055','Balaji Enclave','Saini Group of Companies ','infosgoc@gmail.com',0,0,'SCO 1, Opposite Power House','NH-22, Lalru, Punjab',28,507,'140105','1','SCO 1, Opposite Power House','NH-22, Lalru, Punjab',28,507,'140105','1','<p>The husband of the complaint contacted said promoter for purchasing a plot in said project. On this said promoter agreed to sell plot no. 41 in said project to the husband of complainant. On receiving the total sale price of said plot said promoter executed a power of attorney in the name of the husband of the complainant authorizing him to sell, mortgage, gift etc. the said plot to anyone. Said power of attorney is duly registered with Sub-Registrar, Derabassi. Thereafter the said promotor and husband of the complainant executed a sale deed iin favour of the complainant which is duly registered with &nbsp;Sub Registrar, Dera bassi vide wasika no. 667 dated 16.05.2017. Thereafter, complainant gave an application to the Tehsildar, Derabassi to execute intkal of said plot in the name of the complainant. The Tehsildar marked the said application to Area Patwari who in its report dated 22.03.2018 reported that the said land has already been sold and its intkal cannot be executed in favour of the complainant. In this way said promoter has done fraud with the complainant and her husband.&nbsp;</p>','<p>The said plot was purchased by the complainant and her husband for their residential purpose as they are not having any residential property in thier name anywhere in India. So the intkal of said plot should be done in the name of the complainant and its possession should be provided to the complainant. &nbsp;</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>The authorities should be directed to not to transfer the said plot in name of anyone.&nbsp;</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'Nisha1234','2018-12-16 15:48:56.000','Nisha1234','2018-12-16 15:48:56.000'),(529,1188,'1188',1271,'33c16377-7e87-4eb9-827c-5f93f69bf7d5','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-16 17:22:15.000','SUJATA RANA','ranaravi99@yahoo.in',9418488996,0,373687986628,'Flat No. 548, block-24, Sector-3, New Shimla-9','Near Shiv Mandir',14,533,'171009','1','FLAT HO.42, BLOCK NO.1, TYPE-IV','GOVT. COLONY, KASUMPTI SHIMLA-9',14,533,'171009','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0065','Arcadia Country Homes','Primary Estates and Developers Private Limited','primaryestates@gmail.com',9592231111,0,'M/s. Primary Estates and Developers Private Limited, ','SCO 43, Ground Floor, Behind KFC, New Sunny Enclave, Sector 125, SAS Nagar, Mohali.',28,507,'140301','0','Primary Estates & Developers Pvt. Ltd ','Arcadia Park East, SCO No- 4 & 5,  Ludhiana-Chandigarh, NH-95, Besides St.Ezra International School,',28,507,'140301','0','<p>I have to submit that\r\n:</p><p>I have booked an independent floor/Flat No. 1254/SF in Arcadia country homes to with Primary Estates &amp; Developers Pvt. Ltd and have paid Rs.22,00,000/-only until now starting from June, 2016 to June, 2017 against a total agreed value of Rs. 30,00,000/only for the said flat.&nbsp;</p><p>At time of booking I was told that I will get this flat within time limit of 15 months from commencement i.e. June-2016 but the project have been delayed abnormally and final stopped.That many times I found the site deadly locked or find a new face of contractor executing the work saying that the old one had left. This continuous 6th, 7th change of executing contractor or agencies left the quality issues ignored and not attended too till date. One fine morning I was surprised to know that the sale persons have left the organisation and the office have been shifted to new location and I have not been informed.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>That I latest visited the site as well as your new office on 14/07/2018 and was surprised to see that the position at site is not different to that what was in march-2018. Neither the quality has been improved nor has the progress been geared up. As per the present status of site I am sure to say that it will not be completed even by the end of 2019 that too with very poor quality.\r\n</p><p>Keeping in view the abnormal delay and poor quality of construction, the irresponsible attitude of the company, I requested for refund of my amount as the promoters have not stood by its commitments, neither valued my needs and satisfaction nor its commitment. I have&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-align: justify;\">written\r\nto the promoters through mail on dated: 17/07/2018; then on 18/08/2018 then on\r\n12/09/2018 but nothing have been heard from the promoters.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-IN;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">Keeping\r\nin view the abnormal delay and poor quality of construction, irresponsible\r\nattitude of the promoters, in my\r\nopinion they have not stood by its commitments, neither valued my needs\r\nand satisfaction nor its commitment. So feeling aggrieved being cheated I requested&nbsp; to kindly refund my entire amount with all\r\nconsequential benefits/dues.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-IN;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\"><br></span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-IN;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',3000000.00,2200000.00,'2018-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: New; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">I would like to request only to refund my entire amount with all consequential benefits/dues.</span><br></p>','1','','2016-10-08 00:00:00','2016-10-08 00:00:00','1254/SF, Residential flat in Country Home project, Mohali Sector 123','','',2,0,0,0,'sujatarana','2018-12-16 15:56:19.000','sujatarana','2018-12-16 15:56:19.000'),(530,1189,'1189',1247,'79ebe07e-2dcd-4db9-b9bf-d83f90187768','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Dhiraj Gurvinder Singh','gurdhiraj@yahoo.co.in',9855578712,0,0,'house no 1083','Phase 9',28,507,'160062','1','house no 1083','Phase 9',28,507,'160062','Amit Sharma','amit@lawyer.com',9878222444,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','ATS Casa Espana ','ATS Infrabuild Private Limited','pradeep.rathee@atsgreens.com',0,0,'ATS Casa Espana Street, sector 121','NH 21',28,507,'160055','1','ATS Casa Espana Street, sector 121','NH 21',28,507,'160055','1','<p>1.That the Respondent in the first instance, had launched a Group Housing Project in Mohali, Sector 121, Punjab, under the name and style of “ATS Casa Espana”.&nbsp; The complainant booked an apartment on 28.02.2014. A statement showing the account status of the respondent reflecting the amount of plot is annexed as Annexure C/1.&nbsp; In the interregnum, the Respondent had issued an Allotment Letter dated 20-06-2014 confirming the allotment of a Residential apartment No. 09062, on 6th floor of tower no.9 having super built up area of 222.97 sq.mtr equivalent to 2400 sq.feet, at sector 121 Mohali, Punjab(hereinafter referred to as the “Allotted Unit”). A copy of the Allotment Letter dated 20-06-2014 issued by the Respondent is being annexed to the instant complaint as Annexure C/2. As per the recitals of the aforesaid agreement, the total sale consideration of the Allotted Unit was fixed at Rs. 99,50,000/- which is as per ‘schedule III’ of allotment letter.</p><p>2.That to the surprise of the complainant, the respondent had issued a demand letter demanding EDC charges dated 07.08.2018 to the tune of 487476/- and now more than 5 lakhs. It is pertinent to mention here that the EDC charges were promised to be paid by the respondent including change in EDC charges (if any) as already included in the total sale consideration i.e 99,50,000/- and hence, they were specifically deleted from the SCHEDULE III of the Allotment Letter Dated 20.06.2014, so that there is no confusion afterwards. Schedule III is appended with the allotment letter annexed as ANNEXURE C/2 and demand letters are annexed as ANNEXURE C/3.&nbsp;</p><p>3. That even as per the trecitals of the allotment letter Annexure C/2, clause 4.1 \"The entire consideration payable by the buyer, towards the absolute purchase of the apartment along with exclusive right to use and occupy the car park space in terms of this agreement, shall be the \'Total Amount Payable\' as mentioned in Schedule III thereto.\" Hence demands for EDC again is unlawful</p><p><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\">﻿﻿<span style=\"font-family:&quot;roboto&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That in view of the\r\nfacts and circumstances of the case detailed hereinabove, the Respondent on account\r\nof &nbsp;being deficient in rendering services\r\nto the Complainant and by virtue of having adopting unfair trade practices and\r\nas such, this Hon’ble Authority may be pleased to allow the above mentioned\r\ncomplaint as under:- <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;roboto&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">1.To restrain the\r\nRespondent from demanding the EDC Charges which has already been paid by the\r\nComplainant.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;roboto&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">2.To order the\r\nRespondent from raising any other arbitrary demands and charges which the\r\nComplainant has already paid.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;roboto&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">It is, therefore,\r\nrespectfully prayed that in the light of the facts and circumstances detailed\r\nhereinabove, the instant complaint may kindly be allowed and the relief, as\r\nprayed for in the forgoing paragraph of the instant complaint, may kindly be\r\nawarded in favor of the Complainant and against the Respondent in the interests\r\nof justice, equity and good conscience.</span></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Notice of motion be issued to the Respondents and stay in favour of the Complainant against the respondent for EDC charges Demands because an interest on the EDC charges are being added in the demand of EDC charges.<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'amit.heman@gmail.com','2018-12-16 18:42:49.000','amit.heman@gmail.com','2018-12-16 18:42:49.000'),(531,1189,'1189',1247,'79ebe07e-2dcd-4db9-b9bf-d83f90187768','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Dhiraj Gurvinder Singh','gurdhiraj@yahoo.co.in',9855578712,0,0,'house no 1083','Phase 9',28,507,'160062','1','house no 1083','Phase 9',28,507,'160062','Amit Sharma','amit@lawyer.com',9878222444,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','ATS Casa Espana ','ATS Infrabuild Private Limited','pradeep.rathee@atsgreens.com',0,0,'ATS Casa Espana Street, sector 121','NH 21',28,507,'160055','1','ATS Casa Espana Street, sector 121','NH 21',28,507,'160055','1','<p>1.That the Respondents in the first instance, had launched a Group Housing Project in Mohali, Sector 121, Punjab, under the name and style of “ATS Casa Espana”.&nbsp; The complainant booked an apartment on 28.02.2014.&nbsp; In the interregnum, the Respondents had issued an Allotment Letter dated 20-06-2014 confirming the allotment of a Residential apartment No. 09062, on 6th floor of tower no.9 having super built up area of 222.97 sq.mtr equivalent to 2400 sq.feet, at sector 121 Mohali, Punjab(hereinafter referred to as the “Allotted Unit”).&nbsp; As per the recitals of the aforesaid agreement, the total sale consideration of the Allotted Unit was fixed at Rs. 99,50,000/- which is as per ‘schedule III’ of allotment letter. A statement showing the account status of the respondents reflecting the amount of plot is annexed as Annexure C/1 and Allotment Letter dated 20-06-2014 issued by the Respon