-SAS81-PR0119','Mohali Hills','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'Kamalroopsooch','2018-12-18 14:36:42.000','Kamalroopsooch','2018-12-18 14:36:42.000'),(542,1193,'1193',1280,'b364f9db-f8bf-4d03-9c07-d43a8d8e4b6f','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Kamalroop  Sooch','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','Sector 18B Chandigarh',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','Sector 18B Chandigarh',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','Mohali Hills','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Application Form: 14.3.2007<o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Allotment\r\nLetter: 30.3.2007 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;iii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Apartment\r\nBuyer’s Agreement: 29.2.08<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;iv)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Allotted\r\nUnit No. TVM-H3-F11-1104 in ‘The Views’ at Mohali Hills, Sector-105, SAS Nagar,\r\nDistrict Mohali<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;v) &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Total\r\nsale consideration of Rs. 49,59,650/- <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Construction Linked Instalment Plan<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vii) &nbsp;&nbsp; Amount paid upto 23.8.2012:Rs. 42,71,510/-<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">viii)&nbsp;&nbsp; As per Clause 21.1 of the Agreement read with\r\nClause 23.1 made it abundantly clear that time was the essence of the contract\r\nand hence, possession of the Allotted Unit was required to be handed over to\r\nthe Applicants by the Respondent positively on or before 30.6.2010.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">v)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Aggrieved by the aforesaid omission and\r\nlapse of the Respondent, the Applicants had written a letter/e-mail to the\r\nRespondent for rescinding the contract and for seeking refund of the principal\r\namount paid by the Applicants in respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith\r\ninterest.&nbsp; Till date, however, the\r\naforesaid demand raised by the Applicants has not been acceded to by the\r\nRespondent and thus, vide the instant complaint, the Applicants seek refund of\r\nthe monies paid by them to the Respondent alongwith interest.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That it is pertinent to mention herein that\r\nin spite of the fact that the Applicants had sought refund of the principal\r\namount paid by the Applicants alongwith interest, the Respondents have\r\narbitrarily continued to issue Demand Notices to the Applicants for payment of\r\ninstalments as per the payment schedule appended with the Buyer’s agreement.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of an amount of Rs. 42,71,510/-\r\npaid by the Applicants alongwith interest (highest marginal cost of lending\r\nrate of the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of deposit till\r\nactual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other relief which the Applicant is\r\nentitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'Kamalroopsooch','2018-12-18 14:40:17.000','Kamalroopsooch','2018-12-18 14:40:17.000'),(543,1194,'1194',1281,'ecd6bbdb-27b0-4972-ac46-2f0682f35b3d','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Sundeep Singh Pawar','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','MOHALI HILLA','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Allotment Letter:24.4.07 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Buyer’s Agreement:10.4.08 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">iii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Agreement executed between Sundeep Singh\r\nPawar and Mrs. Harinder Kaur Pawar and the Respondent in respect of the Unit\r\nNo. H1-FPH-PH-01 for a total sale consideration of Rs. 98,59,200/- of super\r\narea of 2900 sq. Ft. Subsequently, the Unit was changed TVM-H1-F10-1001.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">iv)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; On the basis of an affidavit sworn by the\r\nCo-Applicant Kamaljit Kaur Pawar, an endorsement dated 10.4.08 was made in the\r\nAgreement dated 10.4.08 whereby the co-allottees of the Allotted Unit No. were\r\nformally recorded as the Applicants herein viz. Sundeep Singh Pawar and\r\nKamaljit Kaur Pawar. Subsequently, the Allotted Unit was changed to\r\nTVM-L2-F12-1202. Further, vide an Addendum, due to modification in the layout\r\nplan, Unit No. TVM-L2-F12-1202, Sector-105, Mohali Hills, Mohali was changed to\r\nUnit No. TVM-L2-F08-802 having a super area of 2600 sq. ft for which the total\r\nsale consideration was fixed at Rs. 83,20,505/- as indicated in the letter\r\ndated 15.9.10 issued by the Respondent. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">v)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Construction Linked Instalment Plan<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi) &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Amount paid upto 23.10.13: Rs. 72,61,148/- <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; As per Clause 21.1 of the Agreement read\r\nwith Clause 23.1 possession of the Allotted Unit was required to be handed over\r\nto the Applicants by the Respondent positively on or before 24.7.10.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">viii)&nbsp;&nbsp; Aggrieved by the omission of the Respondent,\r\nthe Applicants had written a letter/e-mail to the Respondent for rescinding the\r\ncontract and for seeking refund of the principal amount paid by the Applicants\r\nin respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith interest.&nbsp; Till date, however, the aforesaid demand\r\nraised by the Applicants has not been acceded to by the Respondent.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ix)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; In spite of the fact that the Applicants\r\nhad sought refund of the principal amount alongwith interest, the Respondents\r\nhave arbitrarily continued to issue Demand Notices to the Applicants for\r\npayment of instalments as per the payment schedule appended with the Buyer’s\r\nagreement.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of an amount of Rs. 72,61,148/-\r\npaid by the Applicants alongwith interest (highest marginal cost of lending\r\nrate of the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of deposit till\r\nactual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other relief which the Applicants are\r\nentitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'sundeepsinghpawar','2018-12-18 14:59:53.000','sundeepsinghpawar','2018-12-18 14:59:53.000'),(544,1181,'1181',1261,'87a17578-cb7d-4b63-b1e8-f97fd8b674d5','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Ravikant Sawhney','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9815400414,0,0,'B-XXX-891','near Mothu Ram Pump, sherpur, Sherpur',28,366,'142036','1','B-XXX-891','near Mothu Ram Pump, sherpur, Sherpur',28,366,'142036','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','Mohali Hills (Group Housing)','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'40, Ground Floor','Central Plaza, sector 105',28,507,'140306','1','40, Ground Floor','Central Plaza, sector 105',28,507,'140306','1','<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Applicant: M/s APS International Pvt Ltd \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Allotment letter : 15.1.2008\r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Allotted Unit: Apartment No. K3-FPH-PH-01 in “The Views” at Mohali Hills in Sector-105, SAS Nagar, District Mohali</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">• Buyer\'s Agreement :29.2.2008\r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Total sale consideration of Rs. 1,10,52,008/- at the rate of Rs. 2950/- per sq. foot of super area of 3250 sq. ft.   \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Construction Linked Instalment Plan amount paid till date: Rs. 1,01,71,173/- was paid by the Applicant to the Respondent upto 28.10.2014. \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	As per Clause 21.1 of the Buyer’s Agreement, the Respondent was under a contractual obligation to handover possession of the Allotted Unit within a period of 36 months from the date of allotment with a further relaxation of 90 days over and above the stipulated time period for the purpose of applying for and obtaining an Occupation Certificate in respect of the Group Housing Complex.  \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	That Clause 21.1 of the Agreement read with Clause 23.1 made it abundantly clear that time was the essence of the contract and hence, possession of the Allotted Unit was required to be handed over to the Applicant by the Respondent positively on or before 15.4.2011.  Till date, however, despite a lapse of more than 6 years, possession of the Allotted Unit has not been offered or handed over to the Applicant and this willful omission and lapse on the part of the Respondent constitutes a willful and material breach of the Agreement dated 29.2.2008 executed between the parties.  \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Aggrieved by the aforesaid omission and lapse of the Respondent, the Applicant had written a letter/e-mail dated 29.9.2017 to the Respondent for rescinding the contract and for seeking refund of the principal amount paid by the Applicant in respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith interest.  Till date, however, the aforesaid demand raised by the Applicant has not been acceded to by the Respondent and thus, vide the instant complaint, the Applicant seek refund of the monies paid by it to the Respondent alongwith interest</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of an amount of Rs. 1,01,71,173/-\r\npaid by the Applicant alongwith interest (highest marginal cost of lending rate\r\nof the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of deposit till\r\nactual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other relief which the Applicant is\r\nentitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',11052008.00,10171173.00,'2011-04-15 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>N.A.</p>','1','','2008-01-15 00:00:00','2008-02-29 00:00:00','K3-FPH-PH-01 “The Views” at Mohali Hills in Sector-105, SAS Nagar, District Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'APSInternational','2018-12-18 17:46:59.000','APSInternational','2018-12-18 17:46:59.000'),(545,1193,'1193',1280,'b364f9db-f8bf-4d03-9c07-d43a8d8e4b6f','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Kamalroop  Sooch','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','Sector 18B Chandigarh',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','Sector 18B Chandigarh',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','Mohali Hills','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land