e-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Construction Linked Instalment Plan<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vii) &nbsp;&nbsp; Amount paid upto 23.8.2012:Rs. 42,71,510/-<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">viii)&nbsp;&nbsp; As per Clause 21.1 of the Agreement read with\r\nClause 23.1 made it abundantly clear that time was the essence of the contract\r\nand hence, possession of the Allotted Unit was required to be handed over to\r\nthe Applicants by the Respondent positively on or before 30.6.2010.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">v)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Aggrieved by the aforesaid omission and\r\nlapse of the Respondent, the Applicants had written a letter/e-mail to the\r\nRespondent for rescinding the contract and for seeking refund of the principal\r\namount paid by the Applicants in respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith\r\ninterest.&nbsp; Till date, however, the\r\naforesaid demand raised by the Applicants has not been acceded to by the\r\nRespondent and thus, vide the instant complaint, the Applicants seek refund of\r\nthe monies paid by them to the Respondent alongwith interest.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That it is pertinent to mention herein that\r\nin spite of the fact that the Applicants had sought refund of the principal\r\namount paid by the Applicants alongwith interest, the Respondents have\r\narbitrarily continued to issue Demand Notices to the Applicants for payment of\r\ninstalments as per the payment schedule appended with the Buyer’s agreement.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of an amount of Rs. 42,71,510/-\r\npaid by the Applicants alongwith interest (highest marginal cost of lending\r\nrate of the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of deposit till\r\nactual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other relief which the Applicant is\r\nentitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',4959650.00,4271510.00,'2010-06-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>...</p>','1','','2007-03-30 00:00:00','2008-02-29 00:00:00','TVM-H3-F11-1104 in ‘The Views’ at Mohali Hills, Sector-105, SAS Nagar, District Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'Kamalroopsooch','2018-12-18 18:09:39.000','Kamalroopsooch','2018-12-18 18:09:39.000'),(546,1194,'1194',1281,'ecd6bbdb-27b0-4972-ac46-2f0682f35b3d','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Sundeep Singh Pawar','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','MOHALI HILLs','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Allotment Letter:24.4.07 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Buyer’s Agreement:10.4.08 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">iii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Agreement executed between Sundeep Singh\r\nPawar and Mrs. Harinder Kaur Pawar and the Respondent in respect of the Unit\r\nNo. H1-FPH-PH-01 for a total sale consideration of Rs. 98,59,200/- of super\r\narea of 2900 sq. Ft. Subsequently, the Unit was changed TVM-H1-F10-1001.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">iv)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; On the basis of an affidavit sworn by the\r\nCo-Applicant Kamaljit Kaur Pawar, an endorsement dated 10.4.08 was made in the\r\nAgreement dated 10.4.08 whereby the co-allottees of the Allotted Unit No. were\r\nformally recorded as the Applicants herein viz. Sundeep Singh Pawar and\r\nKamaljit Kaur Pawar. Subsequently, the Allotted Unit was changed to\r\nTVM-L2-F12-1202. Further, vide an Addendum, due to modification in the layout\r\nplan, Unit No. TVM-L2-F12-1202, Sector-105, Mohali Hills, Mohali was changed to\r\nUnit No. TVM-L2-F08-802 having a super area of 2600 sq. ft for which the total\r\nsale consideration was fixed at Rs. 83,20,505/- as indicated in the letter\r\ndated 15.9.10 issued by the Respondent. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">v)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Construction Linked Instalment Plan<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi) &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Amount paid upto 23.10.13: Rs. 72,61,148/- <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; As per Clause 21.1 of the Agreement read\r\nwith Clause 23.1 possession of the Allotted Unit was required to be handed over\r\nto the Applicants by the Respondent positively on or before 24.7.10.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">viii)&nbsp;&nbsp; Aggrieved by the omission of the Respondent,\r\nthe Applicants had written a letter/e-mail to the Respondent for rescinding the\r\ncontract and for seeking refund of the principal amount paid by the Applicants\r\nin respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith interest.&nbsp; Till date, however, the aforesaid demand\r\nraised by the Applicants has not been acceded to by the Respondent.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ix)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; In spite of the fact that the Applicants\r\nhad sought refund of the principal amount alongwith interest, the Respondents\r\nhave arbitrarily continued to issue Demand Notices to the Applicants for\r\npayment of instalments as per the payment schedule appended with the Buyer’s\r\nagreement.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of an amount of Rs. 72,61,148/-\r\npaid by the Applicants alongwith interest (highest marginal cost of lending\r\nrate of the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of deposit till\r\nactual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other relief which the Applicants are\r\nentitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>',8320505.00,7261148.00,'2010-07-24 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>..</p>','1','','2007-04-24 00:00:00','2008-04-10 00:00:00','Unit No. TVM-L2-F08-802 ‘The Views’ at Mohali Hills, Sector-105, SAS Nagar, District Mohali, Punjab.','','',2,0,0,0,'sundeepsinghpawar','2018-12-18 18:14:16.000','sundeepsinghpawar','2018-12-18 18:14:16.000'),(547,1195,'1195',1285,'16c97337-63b6-4d1f-93b2-1a78bf3f4367','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Parshottam Dhillon','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013126,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','Mohali Hills','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'ParshottamDhillon','2018-12-18 18:45:36.000','ParshottamDhillon','2018-12-18 18:45:36.000'),(548,1195,'1195',1285,'16c97337-63b6-4d1f-93b2-1a78bf3f4367','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Parshottam Dhillon','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013126,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','Mohali Hills','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Original Applicants: Mr. Sundeep Singh\r\nPawar and Mrs. Harinder Kaur Pawar <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Allotment letter dated 24.4.2007 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">iii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Apartment Buyer’s Agreement: 10.4.08 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">iv)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Allotted Unit No. H1-FPH-PH-01 in ‘The\r\nViews’ at Mohali Hills, Sector-105, SAS Nagar, District Mohali <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">v)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Total sale consideration of Rs.\r\n98,59,200/- <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The Allotted Unit was subsequently\r\ntransferred in the names of Parshottam Dhillon and Gurjeet Kaur Dhillon i.e.\r\nthe Applicants herein vide a letter dated 20.3.09 issued by the\r\nRespondent.&nbsp; The requisite endorsement on\r\nthe Allotment Letter as well as other documents including the Buyer’s Agreement\r\nwas made by the Respondent.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Construction Linked Instalment Plan <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">viii)&nbsp;&nbsp; Amount paid upto 23.8.2013:Rs. 85,06,496/- <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ix)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  Clause 21.1 of the Agreement read with\r\nClause 23.1 made it abundantly clear that time was the essence of the contract\r\nand hence, possession of the Allotted Unit was required to be handed over to\r\nthe Applicants by the Respondent positively on or before 24.7.2010.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">x)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Aggrieved by the aforesaid omission and\r\nlapse of the Respondent, the Applicants had written a letter/e-mail to the\r\nRespondent for rescinding the contract and for seeking refund of the principal\r\namount paid by the Applicants in respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith\r\ninterest.&nbsp; Till date, however, the\r\naforesaid demand raised by the Applicants has not been acceded to by the\r\nRespondent and thus, vide the instant complaint, the Applicants seek refund of\r\nthe monies paid by them to the Respondent alongwith interest.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">xi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That it is pertinent to mention herein that\r\nin spite of the fact that the Applicants had sought refund of the principal\r\namount paid by the Applicants alongwith interest, the Respondents have\r\narbitrarily continued to issue Demand Notices to the Applicants for payment of\r\ninstalments as per the payment schedule appended with the Buyer’s agreement.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of an amount of Rs. 85,06,496/-\r\npaid by the Applicants alongwith interest (highest marginal cost of lending\r\nrate of the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of deposit till\r\nactual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other relief which the Applicants are\r\nentitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NA</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'ParshottamDhillon','2018-12-18 18:46:11.000','ParshottamDhillon','2018-12-18 18:46:11.000'),(549,1196,'1196',1286,'d5cccd55-ed50-4972-b984-310c180b5690','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Narwar Singh Bhogal','kashika.juneja91@gmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','MOHALI HILLS','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',6,128,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',6,128,'140306','1','<p>ABC</p>','<p>ABC</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>ABC</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'Narwarbhogal','2018-12-18 19:06:04.000','Narwarbhogal','2018-12-18 19:06:04.000'),(550,1197,'1197',1287,'fcebf583-f701-4375-a441-163b29a0faf5','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Brinder  Singh','kashika.juneja91@gmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013125,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','Mohali Hills','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','<p>abc</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of an amount of Rs.\r\n1,02,21,448/-paid by the Applicants alongwith interest (highest marginal cost\r\nof lending rate of the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of\r\ndeposit till actual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read\r\nwith Rule 16 of the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development)\r\nRules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other relief which the Applicant is\r\nentitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'brindersingh1','2018-12-18 19:26:16.000','brindersingh1','2018-12-18 19:26:16.000'),(551,1181,'1181',1261,'87a17578-cb7d-4b63-b1e8-f97fd8b674d5','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Ravikant Sawhney','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9815400414,0,0,'B-XXX-891','near Mothu Ram Pump, sherpur, Sherpur',28,366,'142036','1','B-XXX-891','near Mothu Ram Pump, sherpur, Sherpur',28,366,'142036','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','Mohali Hills (Group Housing)','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'40, Ground Floor','Central Plaza, sector 105',28,507,'140306','1','40, Ground Floor','Central Plaza, sector 105',28,507,'140306','1','<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Applicant: M/s APS International Pvt Ltd \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Allotment letter : 15.1.2008\r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Allotted Unit: Apartment No. K3-FPH-PH-01 in “The Views” at Mohali Hills in Sector-105, SAS Nagar, District Mohali</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">• Buyer\'s Agreement :29.2.2008\r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Total sale consideration of Rs. 1,10,52,008/- at the rate of Rs. 2950/- per sq. foot of super area of 3250 sq. ft.   \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Construction Linked Instalment Plan amount paid till date: Rs. 1,01,71,173/- was paid by the Applicant to the Respondent upto 28.10.2014. \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	As per Clause 21.1 of the Buyer’s Agreement, the Respondent was under a contractual obligation to handover possession of the Allotted Unit within a period of 36 months from the date of allotment with a further relaxation of 90 days over and above the stipulated time period for the purpose of applying for and obtaining an Occupation Certificate in respect of the Group Housing Complex.  \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	That Clause 21.1 of the Agreement read with Clause 23.1 made it abundantly clear that time was the essence of the contract and hence, possession of the Allotted Unit was required to be handed over to the Applicant by the Respondent positively on or before 15.4.2011.  Till date, however, despite a lapse of more than 6 years, possession of the Allotted Unit has not been offered or handed over to the Applicant and this willful omission and lapse on the part of the Respondent constitutes a willful and material breach of the Agreement dated 29.2.2008 executed between the parties.  \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Aggrieved by the aforesaid omission and lapse of the Respondent, the Applicant had written a letter/e-mail dated 29.9.2017 to the Respondent for rescinding the contract and for seeking refund of the principal amount paid by the Applicant in respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith interest.  Till date, however, the aforesaid demand raised by the Applicant has not been acceded to by the Respondent and thus, vide the instant complaint, the Applicant seek refund of the monies paid by it to the Respondent alongwith interest</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of an amount of Rs. 1,01,71,173/-\r\npaid by the Applicant alongwith interest (highest marginal cost of lending rate\r\nof the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of deposit till\r\nactual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other relief which the Applicant is\r\nentitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',11052008.00,10171173.00,'2011-04-15 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>N.A.</p>','1','','2008-01-15 00:00:00','2008-02-29 00:00:00','K3-FPH-PH-01 “The Views” at Mohali Hills in Sector-105, SAS Nagar, District Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'APSInternational','2018-12-18 19:32:20.000','APSInternational','2018-12-18 19:32:20.000'),(552,1181,'1181',1261,'87a17578-cb7d-4b63-b1e8-f97fd8b674d5','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-19 14:34:01.000','Ravikant Sawhney','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9815400414,0,0,'B-XXX-891','near Mothu Ram Pump, sherpur, Sherpur',28,366,'142036','1','B-XXX-891','near Mothu Ram Pump, sherpur, Sherpur',28,366,'142036','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','Mohali Hills (Group Housing)','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'40, Ground Floor','Central Plaza, sector 105',28,507,'140306','1','40, Ground Floor','Central Plaza, sector 105',28,507,'140306','1','<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Applicant: M/s APS International Pvt Ltd \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Allotment letter : 15.1.2008\r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Allotted Unit: Apartment No. K3-FPH-PH-01 in “The Views” at Mohali Hills in Sector-105, SAS Nagar, District Mohali</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">• Buyer\'s Agreement :29.2.2008\r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Total sale consideration of Rs. 1,10,52,008/- at the rate of Rs. 2950/- per sq. foot of super area of 3250 sq. ft.   \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Construction Linked Instalment Plan amount paid till date: Rs. 1,01,71,173/- was paid by the Applicant to the Respondent upto 28.10.2014. \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	As per Clause 21.1 of the Buyer’s Agreement, the Respondent was under a contractual obligation to handover possession of the Allotted Unit within a period of 36 months from the date of allotment with a further relaxation of 90 days over and above the stipulated time period for the purpose of applying for and obtaining an Occupation Certificate in respect of the Group Housing Complex.  \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	That Clause 21.1 of the Agreement read with Clause 23.1 made it abundantly clear that time was the essence of the contract and hence, possession of the Allotted Unit was required to be handed over to the Applicant by the Respondent positively on or before 15.4.2011.  Till date, however, despite a lapse of more than 6 years, possession of the Allotted Unit has not been offered or handed over to the Applicant and this willful omission and lapse on the part of the Respondent constitutes a willful and material breach of the Agreement dated 29.2.2008 executed between the parties.  \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Aggrieved by the aforesaid omission and lapse of the Respondent, the Applicant had written a letter/e-mail dated 29.9.2017 to the Respondent for rescinding the contract and for seeking refund of the principal amount paid by the Applicant in respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith interest.  Till date, however, the aforesaid demand raised by the Applicant has not been acceded to by the Respondent and thus, vide the instant complaint, the Applicant seek refund of the monies paid by it to the Respondent alongwith interest</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of an amount of Rs. 1,01,71,173/-\r\npaid by the Applicant alongwith interest (highest marginal cost of lending rate\r\nof the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of deposit till\r\nactual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other relief which the Applicant is\r\nentitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',11052008.00,10171173.00,'2011-04-15 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>N.A.</p>','1','','2008-01-15 00:00:00','2008-02-29 00:00:00','K3-FPH-PH-01 “The Views” at Mohali Hills in Sector-105, SAS Nagar, District Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'APSInternational','2018-12-19 11:04:00.000','APSInternational','2018-12-19 11:04:00.000'),(553,1198,'1198',1283,'a69593cc-e858-492f-ab4c-c34fdd75b5d8','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Harinder Dhillon','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013125,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','MOHALI HILLS','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Allotment letter: 24.4.2007 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Apartment Buyer’s Agreement: 12.12.08 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">iii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Unit No. L3-F12-1203 in ‘The Views’ at\r\nMohali Hills<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">iv)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Amendment Agreement dated 27.8.2015 was\r\nexecuted between the Applicants and the Respondent whereby, while retaining all\r\nother clauses and provisions of the Buyer’s Agreement dated 12.12.2008, Unit\r\nNo. TVM-L2-F11-1101 having a super area of 2600 sq. Ft was allotted to the\r\nApplicants at the rate of Rs. 2950/- per sq. foot and consequently, the total\r\nsale consideration payable in respect of the Allotted Unit was revised from Rs.\r\n62,72,558/- to Rs. 83,40,000/-.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">v)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Construction Linked Instalment Plan<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Amount paid upto 7.2.2014: Rs. 72,96,406/- <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; As per Clause 21.1 of the Apartment Buyer’s\r\nAgreement, the Respondent was under a contractual obligation to handover\r\npossession of the Allotted Unit within a period of 36 months from the date of\r\nallotment with a further relaxation of 90 days over.&nbsp; Hence, possession of the Allotted Unit was\r\nrequired to be handed over to the Applicants by the Respondent positively on or\r\nbefore 24.7.2010 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Aggrieved by the aforesaid omission and\r\nlapse of the Respondent, the Applicants had written a letter/e-mail to the\r\nRespondent for rescinding the contract and for seeking refund of the principal\r\namount paid by the Applicants in respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith\r\ninterest.&nbsp; Till date, however, the\r\naforesaid demand raised by the Applicants has not been acceded to by the\r\nRespondent and thus, vide the instant complaint, the Applicants seek refund of\r\nthe monies paid by them to the Respondent alongwith interest. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">viii)&nbsp;&nbsp; That it is pertinent to mention herein that\r\nin spite of the fact that the Applicants had sought refund of the principal\r\namount paid by the Applicants alongwith interest, the Respondents have\r\narbitrarily continued to issue Demand Notices to the Applicants for payment of\r\ninstalments as per the payment schedule appended with the Buyer’s agreement.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of an amount of Rs. 72,96,406/-\r\npaid by the Applicants alongwith interest (highest marginal cost of lending\r\nrate of the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of deposit till\r\nactual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other relief which the Applicant is\r\nentitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',8340000.00,7296406.00,'2010-07-24 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>..</p>','1','','2008-11-04 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','UNIT NO. TVM-L2-F11-1101, TOWER NO. L, \'The Views\' at Mohali Hills','','',2,0,0,0,'Harinderdhillon','2018-12-19 11:11:32.000','Harinderdhillon','2018-12-19 11:11:32.000'),(554,1191,'1191',1175,'fdc30a3a-7552-4e5c-8f07-8c6e1d95cb8c','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Manjit Singh Chimni','amangr@gmail.com',9855999111,8873092885,409690247527,'Flat No 201, HEWO Apartments','MDC, Sector 6',13,15,'134114','1','Flat No 201, HEWO Apartments','MDC, Sector 6',13,15,'134114','VANEESH KHANNA','vaneeshkhanna@yahoo.co.in',9814301225,7973088659,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0085','SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE BY SUSHMA BUILDTECH LTD','SUSHMA BUILDTECH LTD','info@sushmabuildtech.com',7307980092,1724610092,'Unit No B107 Business Complex at Elante Mall','1st Floor Industrial Area Phase 1 ',6,128,'160002','1','Unit No B107 Business Complex at Elante Mall','1st Floor Industrial Area Phase 1 ',6,128,'160002','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>abc</p>',6850000.00,6360329.00,'2015-10-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','2012-08-06 00:00:00','2012-08-06 00:00:00','FLAT NO H10I 1ST FLOOR \r\nTOWER H SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE\r\nZIRAKPUR DISTT SAS NAGAR MOHALI ','','',2,0,0,0,'manjit305','2018-12-19 13:08:00.000','manjit305','2018-12-19 13:08:00.000'),(555,1191,'1191',1175,'fdc30a3a-7552-4e5c-8f07-8c6e1d95cb8c','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Manjit Singh Chimni','amangr@gmail.com',9855999111,8873092885,409690247527,'Flat No 201, HEWO Apartments','MDC, Sector 6',13,15,'134114','1','Flat No 201, HEWO Apartments','MDC, Sector 6',13,15,'134114','VANEESH KHANNA','vaneeshkhanna@yahoo.co.in',9814301225,7973088659,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0085','SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE BY SUSHMA BUILDTECH LTD','SUSHMA BUILDTECH LTD','info@sushmabuildtech.com',7307980092,1724610092,'Unit No B107 Business Complex at Elante Mall','1st Floor Industrial Area Phase 1 ',6,128,'160002','1','Unit No B107 Business Complex at Elante Mall','1st Floor Industrial Area Phase 1 ',6,128,'160002','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The complaints are senior citizens Husband &amp;\r\nWife resident of Chirkunda, Jharkhand wanting to shift to chandigarh booked a\r\nflat with SUSHMA BUILDTECH LTD in their project SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE,\r\nZirakpur, Distt: SAS Nagar, Mohali – Flat No: H-101 (Measuring 2085 sq ft), Ist\r\nFloor, Tower-H.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The Flat was booked via Allotment Letter Dated:\r\n06.08.2012 and subsequently executed Apartment Buyers Agreement on 06.08.2012.\r\nAs per agreement total consideration price was Rs.&nbsp;&nbsp;68,50,000/- and\r\nthe complainants have paid Rs. 61,65,000/- + Service tax Rs. 1,95,329/-. Balance\r\nRemaining to be paid Rs. 6,85,000/- + Taxes.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">As per Agreement Dated: 06.08.2012, Clause 14 the\r\npossession date was 38 months from the date of execution of Agreement i.e.\r\n05.10.2015.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The respondents have failed to deliver the\r\npossession till date. The Complaints on assurance of respondents had sold their\r\nhouse property in home town – Chirkunda, Jharkhand on 24.05.2018 and have\r\nshifted permanently in a rental accomodation at Flat No: 201, HEWO Apartments,\r\nSector 6, Mansa Devi Complex, Panchkula.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The complaints are aggrieved party. The respondents\r\nhave failed to address their grievances for delay in possession for more than 3\r\nyears. A Legal notice was also served to them in his context on 15.07.2018. The\r\nrespondents had shown no interest to our complaint and have adopted a very\r\nindifferent attitude.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p>abc</p>',6850000.00,6360329.00,'2015-10-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','2012-08-06 00:00:00','2012-08-06 00:00:00','FLAT NO H10I 1ST FLOOR \r\nTOWER H SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE\r\nZIRAKPUR DISTT SAS NAGAR MOHALI ','','',2,0,0,0,'manjit305','2018-12-19 13:08:31.000','manjit305','2018-12-19 13:08:31.000'),(556,1191,'1191',1175,'fdc30a3a-7552-4e5c-8f07-8c6e1d95cb8c','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Manjit Singh Chimni','amangr@gmail.com',9855999111,8873092885,409690247527,'Flat No 201, HEWO Apartments','MDC, Sector 6',13,15,'134114','1','Flat No 201, HEWO Apartments','MDC, Sector 6',13,15,'134114','VANEESH KHANNA','vaneeshkhanna@yahoo.co.in',9814301225,7973088659,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0085','SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE BY SUSHMA BUILDTECH LTD','SUSHMA BUILDTECH LTD','info@sushmabuildtech.com',7307980092,1724610092,'Unit No B107 Business Complex at Elante Mall','1st Floor Industrial Area Phase 1 ',6,128,'160002','1','Unit No B107 Business Complex at Elante Mall','1st Floor Industrial Area Phase 1 ',6,128,'160002','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The complaints are senior citizens Husband &amp;\r\nWife resident of Chirkunda, Jharkhand wanting to shift to chandigarh booked a\r\nflat with SUSHMA BUILDTECH LTD in their project SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE,\r\nZirakpur, Distt: SAS Nagar, Mohali – Flat No: H-101 (Measuring 2085 sq ft), Ist\r\nFloor, Tower-H.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The Flat was booked via Allotment Letter Dated:\r\n06.08.2012 and subsequently executed Apartment Buyers Agreement on 06.08.2012.\r\nAs per agreement total consideration price was Rs.&nbsp;&nbsp;68,50,000/- and\r\nthe complainants have paid Rs. 61,65,000/- + Service tax Rs. 1,95,329/-. Balance\r\nRemaining to be paid Rs. 6,85,000/- + Taxes.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">As per Agreement Dated: 06.08.2012, Clause 14 the\r\npossession date was 38 months from the date of execution of Agreement i.e.\r\n05.10.2015.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The respondents have failed to deliver the\r\npossession till date. The Complaints on assurance of respondents had sold their\r\nhouse property in home town – Chirkunda, Jharkhand on 24.05.2018 and have\r\nshifted permanently in a rental accomodation at Flat No: 201, HEWO Apartments,\r\nSector 6, Mansa Devi Complex, Panchkula.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The complaints are aggrieved party. The respondents\r\nhave failed to address their grievances for delay in possession for more than 3\r\nyears. A Legal notice was also served to them in his context on 15.07.2018. The\r\nrespondents had shown no interest to our complaint and have adopted a very\r\nindifferent attitude.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">That due to the deficiency in service on the part of the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;resulting into a big&nbsp;harassment,&nbsp;tension&nbsp;and&nbsp;apprehension&nbsp;as well as monetary loss, the complainants are entitled to the&nbsp;following&nbsp;reliefs from the&nbsp;respondents:</span></p><ol><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -18pt;\">IMMEDIATE POSSESSION of the fully developed&nbsp;apartment&nbsp;as promised by the&nbsp;respondents.</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p>INTEREST PART: Interest&nbsp;minimum @12%&nbsp;on the&nbsp;entire amount deposited by the complainants on the date of deposit till the date of offer of possession.</o:p></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;had charged interest @24% PA for the period of delay in the payment of installments of the consideration price of the&nbsp;apartment</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">RENT &amp; MAINTENANCE:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Amount of rent and&nbsp;maintenance&nbsp;charges paid / to be paid by the complaint in respect of the rented flat where they are presently residing from 01.05.2018, till the date of handing over the possession of the&nbsp;apartment.</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">LOSS OF INCOME TAX REBATE ON HOME LOAN:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Rs. 78,180/- on account of loss of rebate on the interest paid on the&nbsp;housing&nbsp;loan from India Bulls due to non-delivery of&nbsp;possession&nbsp;by the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;for the years 2016-17 and&nbsp;2017-18 as well as for the period till the date of offering of&nbsp;possession&nbsp;of the&nbsp;apartment.</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">GST:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;to be asked to pay the difference of the amount of Service tax &amp; the GST payable on the&nbsp;balance&nbsp;consideration&nbsp;amount.</span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.8pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">It is therefore prayed that the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;be directed to give the above mention reliefs to the complainants as the&nbsp;complaints&nbsp;are entitled to the above said relief in&nbsp;lieu&nbsp;of the facts and circumstances explained.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.8pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">PLEASE NOTE: WE HAVE ALSO FILED FOR OTHER RELIEFS UNDER FORM - N AS THE NEW RERA RULES</span></p>',6850000.00,6360329.00,'2015-10-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">RELIEFS SOUGHT:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><ol><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -18pt;\">IMMEDIATE POSSESSION of the fully developed&nbsp;apartment&nbsp;as promised by the&nbsp;respondents.</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p>INTEREST PART: Interest&nbsp;minimum @12%&nbsp;on the&nbsp;entire amount deposited by\r\nthe complainants on the date of deposit till the date of offer of possession.</o:p></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12p