ion reliefs to the complainants as the&nbsp;complaints&nbsp;are entitled to the above said relief in&nbsp;lieu&nbsp;of the facts and circumstances explained.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.8pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">PLEASE NOTE: WE HAVE ALSO FILED FOR OTHER RELIEFS UNDER FORM - N AS THE NEW RERA RULES</span></p>',6850000.00,6360329.00,'2015-10-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">RELIEFS SOUGHT:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><ol><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: -18pt;\">IMMEDIATE POSSESSION of the fully developed&nbsp;apartment&nbsp;as promised by the&nbsp;respondents.</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p>INTEREST PART: Interest&nbsp;minimum @12%&nbsp;on the&nbsp;entire amount deposited by\r\nthe complainants on the date of deposit till the date of offer of possession.</o:p></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;had\r\ncharged interest @24% PA for the period of delay in the payment of installments\r\nof the consideration price of the&nbsp;apartment</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">RENT &amp; MAINTENANCE:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"