ns-serif;\">PLEASE NOTE: WE HAVE ALSO FILED FOR OTHER RELIEFS UNDER FORM - N AS THE NEW RERA RULES</span></p><ol><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;margin-left:32.2pt;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:\r\nnormal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;margin-left:32.2pt;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:\r\nnormal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p></li></ol>','1','','2012-08-06 00:00:00','2012-08-06 00:00:00','FLAT NO H10I 1ST FLOOR \r\nTOWER H SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE\r\nZIRAKPUR DISTT SAS NAGAR MOHALI ','','',2,0,0,0,'manjit305','2018-12-19 13:35:12.000','manjit305','2018-12-19 13:35:12.000'),(558,1198,'1198',1283,'a69593cc-e858-492f-ab4c-c34fdd75b5d8','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Harinder Dhillon','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013125,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','MOHALI HILLS','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Allotment letter: 24.4.2007 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Apartment Buyer’s Agreement: 12.12.08 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">iii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Unit No. L3-F12-1203 in ‘The Views’ at\r\nMohali Hills<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">iv)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Amendment Agreement dated 27.8.2015 was\r\nexecuted between the Applicants and the Respondent whereby, while retaining all\r\nother clauses and provisions of the Buyer’s Agreement dated 12.12.2008, Unit\r\nNo. TVM-L2-F11-1101 having a super area of 2600 sq. Ft was allotted to the\r\nApplicants at the rate of Rs. 2950/- per sq. foot and consequently, the total\r\nsale consideration payable in respect of the Allotted Unit was revised from Rs.\r\n62,72,558/- to Rs. 83,40,000/-.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">v)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Construction Linked Instalment Plan<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Amount paid upto 7.2.2014: Rs. 72,96,406/- <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; As per Clause 21.1 of the Apartment Buyer’s\r\nAgreement, the Respondent was under a contractual obligation to handover\r\npossession of the Allotted Unit within a period of 36 months from the date of\r\nallotment with a further relaxation of 90 days over.&nbsp; Hence, possession of the Allotted Unit was\r\nrequired to be handed over to the Applicants by the Respondent positively on or\r\nbefore 24.7.2010 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Aggrieved by the aforesaid omission and\r\nlapse of the Respondent, the Applicants had written a letter/e-mail to the\r\nRespondent for rescinding the contract and for seeking refund of the principal\r\namount paid by the Applicants in respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith\r\ninterest.&nbsp; Till date, however, the\r\naforesaid demand raised by the Applicants has not been acceded to by the\r\nRespondent and thus, vide the instant complaint, the Applicants seek refund of\r\nthe monies paid by them to the Respondent alongwith interest. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">viii)&nbsp;&nbsp; That it is pertinent to mention herein that\r\nin spite of the fact that the Applicants had sought refund of the principal\r\namount paid by the Applicants alongwith interest, the Respondents have\r\narbitrarily continued to issue Demand Notices to the Applicants for payment of\r\ninstalments as per the payment schedule appended with the Buyer’s agreement.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of an amount of Rs. 72,96,406/-\r\npaid by the Applicants alongwith interest (highest marginal cost of lending\r\nrate of the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of deposit till\r\nactual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other relief which the Applicant is\r\nentitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',8340000.00,7296406.00,'2010-07-24 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>..</p>','1','','2008-11-04 00:00:00','2008-12-12 00:00:00','UNIT NO. TVM-L2-F11-1101, TOWER NO. L, \'The Views\' at Mohali Hills','','',2,0,0,0,'Harinderdhillon','2018-12-19 14:13:59.000','Harinderdhillon','2018-12-19 14:13:59.000'),(559,1193,'1193',1280,'b364f9db-f8bf-4d03-9c07-d43a8d8e4b6f','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-19 14:37:30.000','Kamalroop  Sooch','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','Sector 18B Chandigarh',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','Sector 18B Chandigarh',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','Mohali Hills','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Application Form: 14.3.2007<o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Allotment\r\nLetter: 30.3.2007 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;iii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Apartment\r\nBuyer’s Agreement: 29.2.08<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;iv)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Allotted\r\nUnit No. TVM-H3-F11-1104 in ‘The Views’ at Mohali Hills, Sector-105, SAS Nagar,\r\nDistrict Mohali<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;v) &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Total\r\nsale consideration of Rs. 49,59,650/- <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Construction Linked Instalment Plan<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vii) &nbsp;&nbsp; Amount paid upto 23.8.2012:Rs. 42,71,510/-<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">viii)&nbsp;&nbsp; As per Clause 21.1 of the Agreement read with\r\nClause 23.1 made it abundantly clear that time was the essence of the contract\r\nand hence, possession of the Allotted Unit was required to be handed over to\r\nthe Applicants by the Respondent positively on or before 30.6.2010.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">v)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Aggrieved by the aforesaid omission and\r\nlapse of the Respondent, the Applicants had written a letter/e-mail to the\r\nRespondent for rescinding the contract and for seeking refund of the principal\r\namount paid by the Applicants in respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith\r\ninterest.&nbsp; Till date, however, the\r\naforesaid demand raised by the Applicants has not been acceded to by the\r\nRespondent and thus, vide the instant complaint, the Applicants seek refund of\r\nthe monies paid by them to the Respondent alongwith interest.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That it is pertinent to mention herein that\r\nin spite of the fact that the Applicants had sought refund of the principal\r\namount paid by the Applicants alongwith interest, the Respondents have\r\narbitrarily continued to issue Demand Notices to the Applicants for payment of\r\ninstalments as per the payment schedule appended with the Buyer’s agreement.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of an amount of Rs. 42,71,510/-\r\npaid by the Applicants alongwith interest (highest marginal cost of lending\r\nrate of the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of deposit till\r\nactual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other relief which the Applicant is\r\nentitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',4959650.00,4271510.00,'2010-06-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>...</p>','1','','2007-03-30 00:00:00','2008-02-29 00:00:00','TVM-H3-F11-1104 in ‘The Views’ at Mohali Hills, Sector-105, SAS Nagar, District Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'Kamalroopsooch','2018-12-19 14:37:27.000','Kamalroopsooch','2018-12-19 14:37:27.000'),(560,1194,'1194',1281,'ecd6bbdb-27b0-4972-ac46-2f0682f35b3d','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-19 14:38:50.000','Sundeep Singh Pawar','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','MOHALI HILLs','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Allotment Letter:24.4.07 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Buyer’s Agreement:10.4.08 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">iii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Agreement executed between Sundeep Singh\r\nPawar and Mrs. Harinder Kaur Pawar and the Respondent in respect of the Unit\r\nNo. H1-FPH-PH-01 for a total sale consideration of Rs. 98,59,200/- of super\r\narea of 2900 sq. Ft. Subsequently, the Unit was changed TVM-H1-F10-1001.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">iv)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; On the basis of an affidavit sworn by the\r\nCo-Applicant Kamaljit Kaur Pawar, an endorsement dated 10.4.08 was made in the\r\nAgreement dated 10.4.08 whereby the co-allottees of the Allotted Unit No. were\r\nformally recorded as the Applicants herein viz. Sundeep Singh Pawar and\r\nKamaljit Kaur Pawar. Subsequently, the Allotted Unit was changed to\r\nTVM-L2-F12-1202. Further, vide an Addendum, due to modification in the layout\r\nplan, Unit No. TVM-L2-F12-1202, Sector-105, Mohali Hills, Mohali was changed to\r\nUnit No. TVM-L2-F08-802 having a super area of 2600 sq. ft for which the total\r\nsale consideration was fixed at Rs. 83,20,505/- as indicated in the letter\r\ndated 15.9.10 issued by the Respondent. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">v)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Construction Linked Instalment Plan<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi) &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Amount paid upto 23.10.13: Rs. 72,61,148/- <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; As per Clause 21.1 of the Agreement read\r\nwith Clause 23.1 possession of the Allotted Unit was required to be handed over\r\nto the Applicants by the Respondent positively on or before 24.7.10.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">viii)&nbsp;&nbsp; Aggrieved by the omission of the Respondent,\r\nthe Applicants had written a letter/e-mail to the Respondent for rescinding the\r\ncontract and for seeking refund of the principal amount paid by the Applicants\r\nin respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith interest.&nbsp; Till date, however, the aforesaid demand\r\nraised by the Applicants has not been acceded to by the Respondent.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ix)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; In spite of the fact that the Applicants\r\nhad sought refund of the principal amount alongwith interest, the Respondents\r\nhave arbitrarily continued to issue Demand Notices to the Applicants for\r\npayment of instalments as per the payment schedule appended with the Buyer’s\r\nagreement.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of an amount of Rs. 72,61,148/-\r\npaid by the Applicants alongwith interest (highest marginal cost of lending\r\nrate of the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of deposit till\r\nactual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other relief which the Applicants are\r\nentitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>',8320505.00,7261148.00,'2010-07-24 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>..</p>','1','','2007-04-24 00:00:00','2008-04-10 00:00:00','Unit No. TVM-L2-F08-802 ‘The Views’ at Mohali Hills, Sector-105, SAS Nagar, District Mohali, Punjab.','','',2,0,0,0,'sundeepsinghpawar','2018-12-19 14:38:48.000','sundeepsinghpawar','2018-12-19 14:38:48.000'),(561,1192,'1192',1254,'f975078e-bd45-46ae-9ad3-968463b14972','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Ranjeev  Rai','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','Mohali Hills','M/s. EMAAR MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakkar@emmarmgf.in',0,0,'EMAAR MGF Land Ltd','40, Ground Floor, Central Plaza, Sector 105',28,507,'140306','1','EMAAR MGF Land Ltd','40, Ground Floor, Central Plaza, Sector 105',28,507,'140306','1','<p>abc&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'Ranjeevrai','2018-12-19 14:49:41.000','Ranjeevrai','2018-12-19 14:49:41.000'),(562,1196,'1196',1286,'d5cccd55-ed50-4972-b984-310c180b5690','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Narwar Singh Bhogal','kashika.juneja91@gmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','MOHALI HILLS','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',6,128,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',6,128,'140306','1','<p>ABC</p>','<p>ABC</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>ABC</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'Narwarbhogal','2018-12-19 15:43:43.000','Narwarbhogal','2018-12-19 15:43:43.000'),(563,1196,'1196',1286,'d5cccd55-ed50-4972-b984-310c180b5690','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Narwar Singh Bhogal','kashika.juneja91@gmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','MOHALI HILLS','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',6,128,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',6,128,'140306','1','<p>ABC</p>','<p>ABC</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>ABC</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'Narwarbhogal','2018-12-19 15:47:30.000','Narwarbhogal','2018-12-19 15:47:30.000'),(564,1192,'1192',1254,'f975078e-bd45-46ae-9ad3-968463b14972','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Ranjeev  Rai','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','Mohali Hills','M/s. EMAAR MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakkar@emmarmgf.in',0,0,'EMAAR MGF Land Ltd','40, Ground Floor, Central Plaza, Sector 105',28,507,'140306','1','EMAAR MGF Land Ltd','40, Ground Floor, Central Plaza, Sector 105',28,507,'140306','1','<p>i) Applicant: Ranjeev Singh Rai (name incorrectly stated as Rajeev Singh Rai)&nbsp;</p><p>ii) Application:14.3.2007&nbsp;</p><p>iii) Buyer’s Agreement:1.9.2009&nbsp;</p><p>iv) Construction Linked Installment Plan for total Consideration:Rs. 99,15,199</p><p>v) Amount paid till 21.8.2012:Rs. 86,41,522/-</p><p>vi) As per Clause 21.1 of the Apartment Buyer’s Agreement, the Respondent was under a contractual obligation to handover possession of the Allotted Unit within a period of 36 months from the date of allotment with a further relaxation of 90 days over and above the stipulated time period for the purpose of applying for and obtaining an Occupation Certificate in respect of the Group Housing Complex.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>vii) Date of Possession as per Clause 21.1 of the Agreement r/w Clause 23.1:on or before 1.12.2012.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>viii) Till date, however, despite a lapse of more than 6 years, possession of the Allotted Unit has neither been offered nor handed over to the Applicants and this wilful omission and lapse on the part of the Respondent constitutes a wilful and material breach of the Agreement executed between the parties.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>ix) Aggrieved by the aforesaid omission of the Respondent,the Applicant had written a letter/e-mail dated 9.2.2017 to the Respondent for rescinding the contract and for seeking refund of the principal amount paid by the Applicant in respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith interest. Till date,however, the aforesaid demand raised by the Applicant has not been acceded to by the Respondent and thus, vide the instant complaint, the Applicants seek refund of the monies paid by him to the Respondent alongwith interest and compensation.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>x) In spite of the fact that the Applicant had sought refund of the principal amount paid by the Applicants alongwith interest, the Respondents have arbitrarily continued to issue Demand Notices to the Applicant for payment of instalments as per the payment schedule.</p>','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'Ranjeevra