AS81-PR0119','Mohali Hills','M/s. EMAAR MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakkar@emmarmgf.in',0,0,'EMAAR MGF Land Ltd','40, Ground Floor, Central Plaza, Sector 105',28,507,'140306','1','EMAAR MGF Land Ltd','40, Ground Floor, Central Plaza, Sector 105',28,507,'140306','1','<p>i) Applicant: Ranjeev Singh Rai (name incorrectly stated as Rajeev Singh Rai)&nbsp;</p><p>ii) Application:14.3.2007&nbsp;</p><p>iii) Buyer’s Agreement:1.9.2009&nbsp;</p><p>iv) Construction Linked Installment Plan for total Consideration:Rs. 99,15,199</p><p>v) Amount paid till 21.8.2012:Rs. 86,41,522/-</p><p>vi) As per Clause 21.1 of the Apartment Buyer’s Agreement, the Respondent was under a contractual obligation to handover possession of the Allotted Unit within a period of 36 months from the date of allotment with a further relaxation of 90 days over and above the stipulated time period for the purpose of applying for and obtaining an Occupation Certificate in respect of the Group Housing Complex.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>vii) Date of Possession as per Clause 21.1 of the Agreement r/w Clause 23.1:on or before 1.12.2012.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>viii) Till date, however, despite a lapse of more than 6 years, possession of the Allotted Unit has neither been offered nor handed over to the Applicants and this wilful omission and lapse on the part of the Respondent constitutes a wilful and material breach of the Agreement executed between the parties.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>ix) Aggrieved by the aforesaid omission of the Respondent,the Applicant had written a letter/e-mail dated 9.2.2017 to the Respondent for rescinding the contract and for seeking refund of the principal amount paid by the Applicant in respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith interest. Till date,however, the aforesaid demand raised by the Applicant has not been acceded to by the Respondent and thus, vide the instant complaint, the Applicants seek refund of the monies paid by him to the Respondent alongwith interest and compensation.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>x) In spite of the fact that the Applicant had sought refund of the principal amount paid by the Applicants alongwith interest, the Respondents have arbitrarily continued to issue Demand Notices to the Applicant for payment of instalments as per the payment schedule.</p>','<p>i) Refund of an amount of Rs. 86,41,522/- paid by the Applicants alongwith interest (highest marginal cost of lending rate of the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of deposit till actual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.</p><p>ii) Any other relief which the Applicants are entitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>',9915199.00,8641522.00,'2012-12-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>N.A.</p>','1','','2007-03-14 00:00:00','2009-09-01 00:00:00','H3 FPH PH04, TOWER H, THE VIEWS AT MOHALLI HILLS','','',2,0,0,0,'Ranjeevrai','2018-12-19 18:18:27.000','Ranjeevrai','2018-12-19 18:18:27.000'),(575,1198,'1198',1283,'a69593cc-e858-492f-ab4c-c34fdd75b5d8','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-19 18:20:06.000','Harinder Dhillon','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013125,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','MOHALI HILLS','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Allotment letter: 24.4.2007 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Apartment Buyer’s Agreement: 12.12.08 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">iii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Unit No. L3-F12-1203 in ‘The Views’ at\r\nMohali Hills<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">iv)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Amendment Agreement dated 27.8.2015 was\r\nexecuted between the Applicants and the Respondent whereby, while retaining all\r\nother clauses and provisions of the Buyer’s Agreement dated 12.12.2008, Unit\r\nNo. TVM-L2-F11-1101 having a super area of 2600 sq. Ft was allotted to the\r\nApplicants at the rate of Rs. 2950/- per sq. foot and consequently, the total\r\nsale consideration payable in respect of the Allotted Unit was revised from Rs.\r\n62,72,558/- to Rs. 83,40,000/-.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">v)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Construction Linked Instalment Plan<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Amount paid upto 7.2.2014: Rs. 72,96,406/- <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; As per Clause 21.1 of the Apartment Buyer’s\r\nAgreement, the Respondent was under a contractual obligation to handover\r\npossession of the Allotted Unit within a period of 36 months from the date of\r\nallotment with a further relaxation of 90 days over.&nbsp; Hence, possession of the Allotted Unit was\r\nrequired to be handed over to the Applicants by the Respondent positively on or\r\nbefore 24.7.2010 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Aggrieved by the aforesaid omission and\r\nlapse of the Respondent, the Applicants had written a letter/e-mail to the\r\nRespondent for rescinding the contract and for seeking refund of the principal\r\namount paid by the Applicants in respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith\r\ninterest.&nbsp; Till date, however, the\r\naforesaid demand raised by the Applicants has not been acceded to by the\r\nRespondent and thus, vide the instant complaint, the Applicants seek refund of\r\nthe monies paid by them to the Respondent alongwith interest. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">viii)&nbsp;&nbsp; That it is pertinent to mention herein that\r\nin spite of the fact that the Applicants had sought refund of the principal\r\namount paid by the Applicants alongwith interest, the Respondents have\r\narbitrarily continued to issue Demand Notices to the Applicants for payment of\r\ninstalments as per the payment schedule appended with the Buyer’s agreement.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of an amount of Rs. 72,96,406/-\r\npaid by the Applicants alongwith interest (highest marginal cost of lending\r\nrate of the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of deposit till\r\nactual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other relief which the Applicant is\r\nentitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',8340000.00,7296406.00,'2010-07-24 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>..</p>','1','','2008-11-04 00:00:00','2008-12-12 00:00:00','UNIT NO. TVM-L2-F11-1101, TOWER NO. L, \'The Views\' at Mohali Hills','','',2,0,0,0,'Harinderdhillon','2018-12-19 18:20:01.000','Harinderdhillon','2018-12-19 18:20:01.000'),(576,1195,'1195',1285,'16c97337-63b6-4d1f-93b2-1a78bf3f4367','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-19 18:21:31.000','Parshottam Dhillon','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,0,'House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','1','House No. 607','sector 18B',6,128,'160018','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013126,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','Mohali Hills','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','40, Central Plaza, Ground Floor, Sector 105 Mohali',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Original Applicants: Mr. Sundeep Singh\r\nPawar and Mrs. Harinder Kaur Pawar <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Allotment letter dated 24.4.2007 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">iii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Apartment Buyer’s Agreement: 10.4.08 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">iv)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Allotted Unit No. H1-FPH-PH-01 in ‘The\r\nViews’ at Mohali Hills, Sector-105, SAS Nagar, District Mohali <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">v)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Total sale consideration of Rs.\r\n98,59,200/- <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The Allotted Unit was subsequently\r\ntransferred in the names of Parshottam Dhillon and Gurjeet Kaur Dhillon i.e.\r\nthe Applicants herein vide a letter dated 20.3.09 issued by the\r\nRespondent.&nbsp; The requisite endorsement on\r\nthe Allotment Letter as well as other documents including the Buyer’s Agreement\r\nwas made by the Respondent.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">vii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Construction Linked Instalment Plan <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">viii)&nbsp;&nbsp; Amount paid upto 23.8.2013:Rs. 85,06,496/- <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ix)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  Clause 21.1 of the Agreement read with\r\nClause 23.1 made it abundantly clear that time was the essence of the contract\r\nand hence, possession of the Allotted Unit was required to be handed over to\r\nthe Applicants by the Respondent positively on or before 24.7.2010.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">x)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Aggrieved by the aforesaid omission and\r\nlapse of the Respondent, the Applicants had written a letter/e-mail to the\r\nRespondent for rescinding the contract and for seeking refund of the principal\r\namount paid by the Applicants in respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith\r\ninterest.&nbsp; Till date, however, the\r\naforesaid demand raised by the Applicants has not been acceded to by the\r\nRespondent and thus, vide the instant complaint, the Applicants seek refund of\r\nthe monies paid by them to the Respondent alongwith interest.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-32.25pt;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">xi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That it is pertinent to mention herein that\r\nin spite of the fact that the Applicants had sought refund of the principal\r\namount paid by the Applicants alongwith interest, the Respondents have\r\narbitrarily continued to issue Demand Notices to the Applicants for payment of\r\ninstalments as per the payment schedule appended with the Buyer’s agreement.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of an amount of Rs. 85,06,496/-\r\npaid by the Applicants alongwith interest (highest marginal cost of lending\r\nrate of the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of deposit till\r\nactual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other relief which the Applicants are\r\nentitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',9859200.00,8506496.00,'2010-07-24 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NA</p>','1','','2007-04-24 00:00:00','2008-04-10 00:00:00','Unit No. H1 FPH PH 01, Tower H, \"the Views\" at Mohali Hills','','',1,1,0,0,'ParshottamDhillon','2018-12-19 18:21:28.000','ParshottamDhillon','2018-12-19 18:21:28.000'),(577,1204,'1204',1284,'354f8531-7e8c-420b-8e3f-36306084d8dc','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Saurabh Sharma','saurabh11nov@gmail.com',9815578420,0,0,'House No 1501, First Floor, ','Phase-10, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','HOUSE NO 1501 FIRST FLOOR','PHASE 10, Mohali',28,507,'160062','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0090','Sandwoods Infratech Projects Pvt. Ltd.','SK Baagolia','info@sandwoods.com',9501050944,1724634870,'SCO: 222-223, 3rd Floor, ','Sector 34A,',6,128,'160022','1','SCO: 222-223, 3rd Floor, ','Sector 34A,',6,128,'160022','1','<p>Dear Sir,</p><p>We have purchased a flat from Sandwoods Infratech Projects Pvt.\r\n      Ltd. in year 2014 &amp; made apartment buyer agreement on 26th of\r\n      Nov. 2014. The details of the apartment is mentioned below:</p><p><u><b>Project Details:-</b></u><br>\r\n    </p><p>\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    Project Name : Sandwoods Opulencia, Sector-110, Village Bhagomajra,\r\n    Mohali<br>\r\n    Tower No. - D3<br>\r\n    Apartment No. - 109<br>\r\n    Floor - 4th<br>\r\n    Super Area : 1325 Sq. ft. and the basis sale price is Rs.\r\n    40,28,000/- (forty lacs twenty eight thousand only)<br>\r\n    The above stated basic price of apartment is exclusive of (EDC)\r\n    External Development Charges, preferential location charges, club\r\n    membership fee, power back up, Sales tax etc.<br>\r\n    So far amount Rs. 36.5 lacs approx&nbsp; has been deposited &amp;\r\n    mutually agreed that Sandwoods will pay the interest amount until\r\n    possession.<br>\r\n    </p><p><u><b>Problem Statement:-</b></u> <br>\r\n    </p><p>Possession offered in November 2017 &amp; we received official\r\n      communication from Sandwoods with the letter dated 5-9-2017.\r\n      Simultaneously my Pre-EMI interest amount was stopped being\r\n      credited into my account. WHEREAS in actual project was not at all\r\n      ready for possession which in fact<u> <b>even today it is not\r\n          livable with our toddlers.</b></u> Then after my official mail\r\n      dated 28 Sept 2017 the Pre-EMI payment was again started being\r\n      paid by the Sandwoods.</p><p>\r\n    \r\n    </p><p>Now again Sandwoods Opulencia has offered us possession of our\r\n      apartment &amp; again stopped payment of my interest payment of\r\n      loan.<b> Also they have started imposing the maintenance charges\r\n        w.e.f. December 1, 2018 whereas the current situation is very\r\n        disappointing as there is not ready like committed fully\r\n        equipped club house, children\'s play area, gym, green gardens,\r\n        swimming pool, indoor games &amp; main gate etc.</b></p>','<p>We no longer want to associate with Sandwoods group as so far\r\n      nothing is fullfilled by the company at the time of purchase. Even\r\n      basic amenities are not ready &amp; company is offering us\r\n      possession which clearly depicts wrong commitment which made us to\r\n      think strongly of our decision making of buying apartment from\r\n      Sandwoods &amp; has lost complete trust that we will be getting\r\n      all the services after possession. Now we request for the\r\n      cancellation of my apartment with all my dues with interest to be\r\n      paid back by Sandwood Company.</p><p>\r\n    </p><p>Thanks in advance for your necessary help &amp; support.</p>',4028000.00,36.50,'2017-11-26 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Sir, we need our hard earned money back.</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2014-11-26 00:00:00','Flat No. 109, Tower D3, Sandwoods Opilencia, Sector-110, Village Bhagomajra, Mohali ','','',2,0,0,0,'Saurabh11nov','2018-12-19 22:47:10.000','Saurabh11nov','2018-12-19 22:47:10.000'),(578,1205,'1205',1042,'ad5aedc0-ba34-46fe-90ba-d852bb0b013c','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Kuljit Sidhu','kssidhuprof@gmail.com',9876831867,0,0,'344 URBAN ESTATE, PHASE 1','Patiala',28,454,'147002','1','344 URBAN ESTATE, PHASE 1','Patiala',28,454,'147002','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PC0001','Royal Business Park','Motia Developers Private Limited','info@motiagroup.com',8558844525,0,'Motia Developers Private Limited','Chandigarh-Ambala Highway, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','Motia Developers Private Limited','Chandigarh-Ambala Highway, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>abc</p>',4447415.00,4250362.00,'2017-02-04 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>N.A.</p>','1','','2016-02-05 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','31B, 3rd Floor, Royal Business Park','','',2,0,0,0,'kssidhu','2018-12-20 10:42:38.000','kssidhu','2018-12-20 10:42:38.000'),(579,1206,'1206',1288,'75c85526-b13e-468b-b949-3d63597db423','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Paramjit Kaur','aspk_10@yahoo.co.in',9855780470,0,0,'544, College Road','Civil LInes,',28,366,'141001','1','544, College Road','Civil LInes,',28,366,'141001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0060','Ireo Waterfront pvt Ltd','Madhukar Tulsi','iwpl@ireo.in',9810237279,0,'SCO 628, sector 9-D','1st & 2nd Floor, Madhya Marg',6,128,'160009','0','C-4, 1st Floor','Malviya Nagar',10,557,'110017','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">It is submitted that I had booked an independent floor with the above\r\nstated company in their project Ireo Waterfront situated at Ludhiana. The\r\napplication for allotment was submitted on 2/01/2013 for Unit no. <b>X002C</b> for Second Floor having super\r\narea 1271 square yard in a plot size of 200.9 sq yard having proportional\r\nrights in the said plot. The agreement was executed on 11/09/2013 for this unit\r\n.The basic price of unit as per agreement is Rs.3985000.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">In these years&nbsp; I have visited\r\nthe site office of company regarding completion of the unit but every time I find\r\na new representative from company side with some false promises of early\r\ndelivery.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">Clause no 12.3 of agreement states that normal period of delivery is\r\n24 months from the date of execution of agreement. The company had also asked\r\nfor a grace period of 180 days for delay in delivery. But it has been more than\r\nfive years from date of execution of agreement but no possession has been\r\noffered despite major percentage of payment as demanded by the company has been\r\npaid.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">Also please refer to clause 12.5 of agreement which states that in\r\nevent of delay by company in submitting notice of completion beyond 12 months\r\nfrom the end of grace period then the allottee shall become entitled to opt for\r\ntermination.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">I have made all the payments diligently as and when advised by the\r\ncompany. Till date an amount of Rs 4097341/- has been paid (basic + tax) by me\r\nto the company as per their demand letters received by me but there is no sign\r\nof completion and delivery of the above said unit. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size: 6pt;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">I had purchased this unit for my son who was to start his career. All\r\nmy hopes have been dashed and we had to invest in making additional\r\nconstruction at my husband’s parental house to create an accommodation for him.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">You are humbly requested to get my unit cancelled and my money along\r\nwith market rate of interest along with suitable compensation be returned to\r\nme.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">It is submitted that I had booked an independent floor with the above\r\nstated company in their project Ireo Waterfront situated at Ludhiana. The\r\napplication for allotment was submitted on 2/01/2013 for Unit no. <b>X002C</b> for Second Floor having super\r\narea 1271 square yard in a plot size of 200.9 sq yard having proportional\r\nrights in the said plot. The agreement was executed on 11/09/2013 for this unit\r\n.The basic price of unit as per agreement is Rs.3985000.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">In these years&nbsp; I have visited\r\nthe site office of company regarding completion of the unit but every time I find\r\na new representative from company side with some false promises of early\r\ndelivery.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">Clause no 12.3 of agreement states that normal period of delivery is\r\n24 months from the date of execution of agreement. The company had also asked\r\nfor a grace period of 180 days for delay in delivery. But it has been more than\r\nfive years from date of execution of agreement but no possession has been\r\noffered despite major percentage of payment as demanded by the company has been\r\npaid.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">Also please refer to clause 12.5 of agreement which states that in\r\nevent of delay by company in submitting notice of completion beyond 12 months\r\nfrom the end of grace period then the allottee shall become entitled to opt for\r\ntermination.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">I have made all the payments diligently as and when advised by the\r\ncompany. Till date an amount of Rs 4097341/- has been paid (basic + tax) by me\r\nto the company as per their demand letters received by me but there is no sign\r\nof completion and delivery of the above said unit. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size: 6pt;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">I had purchased this unit for my son who was to start his career. All\r\nmy hopes have been dashed and we had to invest in making additional\r\nconstruction at my husband’s parental house to create an accommodation for him.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">You are humbly requested to get my unit cancelled and my money along\r\nwith market rate of interest along with suitable compensation be returned to\r\nme.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',39850000.00,4097341.00,'2015-09-10 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">It is submitted that I had booked an independent floor with the above\r\nstated company in their project Ireo Waterfront situated at Ludhiana. The\r\napplication for allotment was submitted on 2/01/2013 for Unit no. <b>X002C</b> for Second Floor having super\r\narea 1271 square yard in a plot size of 200.9 sq yard having proportional\r\nrights in the said plot. The agreement was executed on 11/09/2013 for this unit\r\n.The basic price of unit as per agreement is Rs.3985000.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">In these years&nbsp; I have visited\r\nthe site office of company regarding completion of the unit but every time I\r\nfind a new representative from company side with some false promises of early\r\ndelivery.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">Clause no 12.3 of agreement states that normal period of delivery is\r\n24 months from the date of execution of agreement. The company had also asked\r\nfor a grace period of 180 days for delay in delivery. But it has been more than\r\nfive years from date of execution of agreement but no possession has been\r\noffered despite major percentage of payment as demanded by the company has been\r\npaid.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">Also please refer to clause 12.5 of agreement which states that in\r\nevent of delay by company in submitting notice of completion beyond 12 months\r\nfrom the end of grace period then the allottee shall become entitled to opt for\r\ntermination.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">I have made all the payments diligently as and when advised by the\r\ncompany. Till date an amount of Rs 4097341/- has been paid (basic + tax) by me\r\nto the company as per their demand letters received by me but there is no sign\r\nof completion and delivery of the above said unit. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size: 6pt;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">I had purchased this unit for my son who was to start his career. All\r\nmy hopes have been dashed and we had to invest in making additional\r\nconstruction at my husband’s parental house to create an accommodation for him.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nVerdana\">You are humbly requested to get my unit cancelled and my money along\r\nwith market rate of interest along with suitable compensation be returned to\r\nme.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','2013-09-11 00:00:00','2013-09-11 00:00:00','X002 C','','',1,0,0,0,'paramkaur','2018-12-20 11:33:12.000','paramkaur','2018-12-20 11:33:12.000'),(580,1204,'1204',1284,'354f8531-7e8c-420b-8e3f-36306084d8dc','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-21 10:50:09.000','Saurabh Sharma','saurabh11nov@gmail.com',9815578420,0,0,'House No 1501, First Floor, ','Phase-10, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','HOUSE NO 1501 FIRST FLOOR','PHASE 10, Mohali',28,507,'160062','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0090','Sandwoods Infratech Projects Pvt. Ltd.','SK Baagolia','info@sandwoods.com',9501050944,1724634870,'SCO: 222-223, 3rd Floor, ','Sector 34A,',6,128,'160022','1','SCO: 222-223, 3rd Floor, ','Sector 34A,',6,128,'160022','1','<p>Dear Sir,</p><p>We have purchased a flat from Sandwoods Infratech Projects Pvt.\r\n      Ltd. in year 2014 &amp; made apartment buyer agreement on 26th of\r\n      Nov. 2014. The details of the apartment is mentioned below:</p><p><u><b>Project Details:-</b></u><br>\r\n    </p><p>\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    Project Name : Sandwoods Opulencia, Sector-110, Village Bhagomajra,\r\n    Mohali<br>\r\n    Tower No. - D3<br>\r\n    Apartment No. - 109<br>\r\n    Floor - 4th<br>\r\n    Super Area : 1325 Sq. ft. and the basis sale price is Rs.\r\n    40,28,000/- (forty lacs twenty eight thousand only)<br>\r\n    The above stated basic price of apartment is exclusive of (EDC)\r\n    External Development Charges, preferential location charges, club\r\n    membership fee, power back up, Sales tax etc.<br>\r\n    So far amount Rs. 36.5 lacs approx&nbsp; has been deposited &amp;\r\n    mutually agreed that Sandwoods will pay the interest amount until\r\n    possession.<br>\r\n    </p><p><u><b>Problem Statement:-</b></u> <br>\r\n    </p><p>Possession offered in November 2017 &amp; we received official\r\n      communication from Sandwoods with the letter dated 5-9-2017.\r\n      Simultaneously my Pre-EMI interest amount was stopped being\r\n      credited into my account. WHEREAS in actual project was not at all\r\n      ready for possession which in fact<u> <b>even today it is not\r\n          livable with our toddlers.</b></u> Then after my official mail\r\n      dated 28 Sept 2017 the Pre-EMI payment was again started being\r\n      paid by the Sandwoods.</p><p>\r\n    \r\n    </p><p>Now again Sandwoods Opulencia has offered us possession of our\r\n      apartment &amp; again stopped payment of my interest payment of\r\n      loan.<b> Also they have started imposing the maintenance charges\r\n        w.e.f. December 1, 2018 whereas the current situation is very\r\n        disappointing as there is not ready like committed fully\r\n        equipped club house, children\'s play area, gym, green gardens,\r\n        swimming pool, indoor games &amp; main gate etc.</b></p>','<p>We no longer want to associate with Sandwoods group as so far\r\n      nothing is fullfilled by the company at the time of purchase. Even\r\n      basic amenities are not ready &amp; company is offering us\r\n      possession which clearly depicts wrong commitment which made us to\r\n      think strongly of our decision making of buying apartment from\r\n      Sandwoods &amp; has lost complete trust that we will be getting\r\n      all the services after possession. Now we request for the\r\n      cancellation of my apartment with all my dues with interest to be\r\n      paid back by Sandwood Company.</p><p>\r\n    </p><p>Thanks in advance for your necessary help &amp; support.</p>',4028000.00,36.50,'2017-11-26 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Sir, we need our hard earned money back.</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2014-11-26 00:00:00','Flat No. 109, Tower D3, Sandwoods Opilencia, Sector-110, Village Bhagomajra, Mohali ','','',1,1,0,0,'Saurabh11nov','2018-12-20 11:33:30.000','Saurabh11nov','2018-12-20 11:33:30.000'),(581,1207,'1207',1291,'3eb2066a-1568-4aaa-85a1-53ef2b0ad2ad','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Harjinder  kaur','csvedparkash@gmail.com',9988888089,0,0,'#1403-B, Sector-37-B Chandigarh','',6,128,'160037','1','#1403-B, Sector-37-B Chandigarh','',6,128,'160037','Ved Parkash','csvedpakash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0262','M/s Bajwa Developers','M/s Hanumanta Land Promoters Pvt.Ltd','bajwadevelopers@gmail.com',9988888089,0,'Micro Homes, SCO-18-19, Megha Market, Opp.-Naval Air Force group Housing Society, ','Sunny Enclave Sextor-123, Mohali',28,507,'140301','1','Micro Homes, SCO-18-19, Megha Market, Opp.-Naval Air Force group Housing Society, ','Sunny Enclave Sextor-123, Mohali',28,507,'140301','1','<p>CONCISE STATEMENT OF FACTS&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1. That M/s Bajwa Developers be its head office at __________________ is a pleading developer in Real Estate Projects in Mohali/Kharar area and has also developed more than 50 real estate projectta. That as a part of the overall development plan the respondent developed Sector-123, as per the Layout Plan attached as Annexure I.The respondent has obtained all necessary approvals from competent authorities for the said project.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2. The Respondent engages developers for constructions of towers within the approved Layout Plan as specified in Annexure I. One of the developers is M/s Hanumanta Land Promoters who has undertaken to develop apartments in area marked in layout plan as above . The registered deed entered into between M/s Bajwa&nbsp; Developers Ltd and M/s Hanumanta Land Promoters Pvt.Ltd attached as Annexure II. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>3. In view of points (1.) and (2). Above, it is established that both M/s Bajwa Developers and M/s Hanumanta Land Promoters are promoters and co-promoters in this Real Estate Project constructed by M/s Hanumanta Land Promoters. The overall project as per the layout plan is registered with RERA vide RERA No.-_____________.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>4. That the complainant booked Appartment No.- 2 BHK Flat No.- GF(A) in Micro Homes SCO-18-19, Group Housing Society , Sunny Enclave, Sector-123 , Greater Mohali at a consideration of Rs.21,00,000/- as per the Allotment Letter attached as Annexure III.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>5. The Builder Buyer Agreement was signed between the 2 parties is attached as Annexure IV.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>6. That the applicant has made all the payments , the summary of the same is attached as Annexure V.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>7. The Co-Promoter was to give possession&nbsp; of the allotted apartment dated.-______ which has already expired .There is no progress on development of the projectat all and possession is not expected in the near future .&nbsp;<br></p>','<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;\"><span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt;\">Since, there is a delay in handing\r\nover, the complainant wishes to withdraw from the project and seeks refund and\r\ninterest on the amount paid as per RERA Provisions . The overall project is\r\nregistered with RERA by M/s Bajwa Developers and M/s Hanumanta Land Promoters\r\nhas not got its project registered with RERA, both the respondents jointly or\r\nseparately may be directed to pay the amount of refund and interest to the\r\ncomplainant.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><font face=\"Times New Roman\"></font><br></p>',2100000.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NA</p>','1','','2013-08-19 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00',' 2 BHK Flat No.-23 GF(A)','','',2,0,0,0,'harjinderkaur','2018-12-20 13:39:38.000','harjinderkaur','2018-12-20 13:39:38.000'),(582,1132,'1132',1193,'109a020f-7ac8-4af7-9194-064fff6a2fe0','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-27 13:27:50.000','Bhupinder Singh','parveen.ch.2@gmail.com',8882950006,0,0,'Ward No. 10, Balachaur','tehsil Balachaur',28,527,'144521','1','Ward No. 10, Balachaur','tehsil Balachaur',28,527,'144521','PARVEEN CHAUDHARY','parveen.ch.2@gmail.com',8882950006,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0039','Industrial knowledge (fashion Technology) Park at sector 90 SAS Nagar','Chandigarh overseas Pvt. Ltd','jbp@j90.in',0,1149879480,'M/s. Chandigarh Overseas Pvt. Ltd., SCO 249, Sector 44-C, Chandigarh.','',6,128,'160047','1','M/s. Chandigarh Overseas Pvt. Ltd., SCO 249, Sector 44-C, Chandigarh.','',6,128,'160047','1','<p>1. That the respondent M/s Chandigarh overseas Pvt. Ltd launched a scheme called “Small Investors Scheme” vide which a share in design studio of an area measuring 100 sq feet on the 4th floors of Industrial Knowledge(Fashion Technology) Park Sector 90, SAS Nagar was offered to the Prospector Buyer(s) on the free hold basis as a co-owner of  Design Studio.\r\n</p><p>2.	That the complainant Trilok Singh submitted application No. 104045 dated 18.01.2008 for purchase of one unit i.e. measuring 100 Sq feet for total consideration of Rs. 6,50,000/- and  again he purchased six more unit @ Rs. 6,50,000/- per unit, vide another Developer Buyer Agreement dated  18.03.2018 and lease deed was executed between complainant and respondent No. 2.  As per above said agreement, complainant paid        Rs. 50,000/- to respondent No. 1 vide receipt dated 18.01.2008 and further sum of Rs. 34,56,000/- was paid to respondent vide receipt dated 18.03.2008.  Further Rs. 5,26,000/- was paid to respondent No. 1 vide receipt dated 19.03.2008.  Complainant had paid sum of                 Rs. 40,32,000/- for purchase of said seven units to respondents.\r\n</p><p>3.	That as per Developer Buyer Agreements the possession was to be delivered after 30 months from the date of start of construction, but till filing of the complaint, respondent has failed to deliver physical possession of said units to complainant.&nbsp; An additional lease agreement was also made as mentioned in para 5th of the developer buyer agreement regarding rent with M/s Green Field Sites Management pvt ltd and no rent has been paid till now as mentioned in the agreement.</p>','<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">It is therefore submitted through this complaint\r\nthat the respondents have failed to comply with the conditions mentioned in the developer buyer agreement so the respondents may be directed to give the possession of units as per the\r\ndeveloper buyer agreements dated 31.01.2008 &amp; 18.03.2008 along with the\r\nrent or the interest as described in the agreements qua and if the respondent\r\ndo not give the possession as per the agreements qua, in that event the amount\r\nof Rs. 40,32,000/- along with the interest @ Rs. 1% per month on the principle\r\namount may be paid to the complainant.</span><br></p>',4550000.00,4032000.00,'2010-07-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\nmso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-18.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">That\r\nduring the pendency of the complaint the property of respondent may be attached\r\nand amount paid by the complainant to the respondent may be got returned.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2008-01-31 00:00:00','floor no. 4, block A2 Industrial Knowledge (fashion Technology) Park, sector 90, SAS Nagar (Punjab)','','',2,0,0,0,'parveenchaudhary','2018-12-20 13:56:05.000','parveenchaudhary','2018-12-20 13:56:05.000'),(583,1132,'1132',1193,'109a020f-7ac8-4af7-9194-064fff6a2fe0','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-20 13:56:52.000','Bhupinder Singh','parveen.ch.2@gmail.com',8882950006,0,0,'Ward No. 10, Balachaur','tehsil Balachaur',28,527,'144521','1','Ward No. 10, Balachaur','tehsil Balachaur',28,527,'144521','PARVEEN CHAUDHARY','parveen.ch.2@gmail.com',8882950006,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0039','Industrial knowledge (fashion Technology) Park at sector 90 SAS Nagar','Chandigarh overseas Pvt. Ltd','jbp@j90.in',0,1149879480,'M/s. Chandigarh Overseas 