. 314600. Copy of letter/statement is C-7. Inspite of repeated requests, respondent did not give the detail of increased area.It also started demanding Rs. 78912 towards maintenance advance which it cannot demand. Work has not been completed as per the specifications mentioned in brochure. Apartment is not habitable. Photographs are C-8. Loan document C-9. No completion certificate has been received</p>','<ol><li>To direct the respondent to handover the possession of the apartment complete in all respect along with the specifications as provided in the brochure (*C-1) &amp; Letter (C-3), along with the interest for the delay in possession, to be calculated w.e.f. 20.05.2017 till the date of actual delivery of possession after obtaining the completion certificate.</li><li>To direct the respondent not to charge Rs. 314000/- towards the enhanced area as there has been no change in the area of the flat.</li><li>To direct the respondent not to charge Rs. 78912/- towards the maintenance advance of two years.</li></ol>',0.00,5246662.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ol><li>To direct the respondent to complete all the pending work and complete the same as per the specifications as mentioned in the brochure (C-1) &amp; letter (C-3)</li><li>To direct the respondent to provide all the common facilities&nbsp;</li></ol>','1','','2014-05-01 00:00:00','2014-05-20 00:00:00','Flat No.50, Tower A, 5th Floor, Type- 3BHK, Super Area 1950 sq ft','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2018-12-23 21:34:32.000','rerafilingformm','2018-12-23 21:34:32.000'),(610,1212,'1212',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Meenal Lall','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,0,'NA 802, Sapthagiri Splendor','BDM-IV',17,67,'560076','0','253, Sector-4, MDC','Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0090','SANDWOODS OPULENCIA','M/s Sandwoods Infratech Private L