Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PC0019','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','rera@waveestate.in',0,0,' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali)',28,507,'140308','1',' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali)',28,507,'140308','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">I had booked independent first floor in Wave\r\nEstate, Sector-99 under subvention scheme by initial payment of Rs.\r\n3,00,000/- vide cheque no. 60113 dated 08.02.2013. Next payment was made vide\r\ncheque no. 60117 dated 19.04.2013 amounting Rs. 3,18,540/-. It was committed to\r\nmake delivery within 2 years.&nbsp;</span>However, M/s Country Colonisers Pvt.\r\nLtd. executed the agreement on 07.02.2015 as per which possession was to be\r\noffered within 24 months along with an extended grace period of 6 months.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Accordingly, I arranged for accommodation on\r\nrent in Apr’2017 and have been paying both rent and EMIs as the subvention\r\nperiod had lapsed. Due to inordinate delay I lost faith in the project and requested\r\nthe developers through e-mails to refund my deposits. However there was no\r\nresponse from their end as they continued to defer possession and progress on\r\nsite was very slow. They agreed to settle only pre-EMI interest from Aug’17 (24+6\r\nmonths from date of agreement) onwards and offered to deliver possession in Mar’18.\r\nDeveloper even failed to meet that deadline and n</span>ow when I informed the builder that I have filed complaint in RERA on 15.11.2018 they have sent possession letter on 29.11.2018 which is dated 08.10.2018 just to get away with the complaint as it is not possible that they can keep the letter with themselves for over 50 days.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">After so much of agony, I do not want to remain\r\nassociated with the developer and request for return of all deposits (including\r\nEMIs) with interest.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">In\r\nlight of the case facts brought out hereinabove, association with the project has not only been loss of time,\r\nmoney and effort but has caused a lot of mental harassment. It is therefore requested to refund entire\r\ndeposits including EMIs paid to bank with interest.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',4000000.00,3000000.00,'2017-08-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','It is prayed to stop the EMIs till final decision as I am not able to pay both rent and EMI.&nbsp;','1','','2015-02-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','40, First Floor, Sector-99, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'mukesh013128','2018-12-24 15:36:46.000','mukesh013128','2018-12-24 15:36:46.000'),(620,1215,'1215',1297,'6b42a79f-6ea5-4dc4-a49f-3988c623f205','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-26 10:57:38.000','Ajay Kumar Goyal','narender.advocate@yahoo.com',9878229707,0,0,'H. No. 154, ','Avas Vikas, Rudrapur',34,599,'263153','1','H. No. 154, ','Avas Vikas, Rudrapur',34,599,'263153','Narender Yadav','narender.advocate@yahoo.com',9878229707,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PC0007','Omaxe Chandigarh Extension Developers Pvt. Ltd.','Nittin Gupta','info@omaxe.com',9711800256,0,'SCO 139-140 Madhya Marg','Sector - 8',6,128,'160008','0','7, LSC','Kalkaji',10,429,'110019','1','<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">That the complainants booked the unit for their\r\nchildren so that they could do some business peacefully and earn their\r\nlivelihood. That complainants booked an office space of 906.83 sq. ft. in the\r\nproject of respondents on 06.07.2010 and opted for construction link plan.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"> The\r\nrespondents allotted the Unit No. ITTC/SIXTH/OFFICE-603A to the complainants. The\r\ntotal price of the plot was fixed at Rs. 45,65,852.67/- and </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">paid\r\nRs. </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">35,79,347.10/-\r\nto the respondents till date. It is pertinent to mention here that the\r\ncomplainant has deposited Rs. 2,10,180/- through RTGS against which the\r\nrespondents have not issued any receipt. The copy of the receipts attached\r\nherewith as <b>Annexure C-1.</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"> The\r\nrespondents have to give the possession of the Unit in 30 Months from the date\r\nof start of construction of the said tower or within an extended period of six\r\nmonths, the respondents have to hand over the possession in 3 years as per\r\nclause 26 of the allotment letter. It is pertinent to mention here that it was\r\nclear that construction have started in the year 2010, as per the demand\r\nletters issued by the respondents. The respondents have to hand over the\r\npossession of the unit latest by 06.01.2013. A copy of the allotment letter is\r\nattached herewith as <b>Annexure C-2</b>.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">That the complainants sent a legal notice dated\r\n21.04.2016 was sent to the respondents to refund the amount Rs. 35,79,347.10/-\r\npaid by the complainants within 15 days. Copy of legal notice and receipt is <b>Annexure C-3</b>.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">That the complainant filed the complaint before\r\nHon’ble State Consumer Dispute Redressal Commission, vide CC/507 of 2017\r\nwherein the Hon’ble State Commission Punjab held that the unit is a commercial\r\nproperty and as such the matter is not cognizable by the Consumer Forum. The\r\ncomplainants are at liberty to seek the redressal of their grievance before\r\ncompetent forum. A copy of the order dated 17.07.2018 is attached herewith as <b>Annexure C-4</b>.</span><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;\">A)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Directing the\r\nOpposite Party to refund the entire amount of Rs. </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">35,79,347.10/-</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">\r\ndue to unfair trade practice alongwith interest @ 18 % P.A. from the respective\r\ndates of deposits till realization.; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;\">B)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Award compensation on\r\naccount of causing financial risk, hardship, mental agony, harassment,\r\nemotional disturbance caused to the Complainant due to the actions/omissions;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;\">C)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Opposite parties may\r\nbe directed to pay as litigation expenses;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;\">D)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">orders to dispense\r\nwith the filing of the certified copies/true typed/fair copies of Annexures.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;\">E)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Grant any other\r\nrelief which this Hon’ble Forum may deem fit and proper under the facts and\r\ncircumstances of the present case.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',4565852.67,3579347.10,'2013-07-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">That complainants\r\npray through this complaint to refund the entire amount deposited by the\r\ncomplainants i.e., Rs. 35,79,347.10/-, alongwith interest prescribed in RERA\r\nRules and regulations.</span><br></p>','1','','2014-06-06 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Office - 603A, Sixth Floor, India Trade Tower, Mullanapur, SAS Nagar, Punjab.','','',1,1,0,0,'VineetYadav','2018-12-25 10:49:55.000','VineetYadav','2018-12-25 10:49:55.000'),(621,1216,'1216',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Suparna Randhawa','dpsrandhawa@hotmail.com',9914400088,0,0,'House No.29','Sector-16',6,128,'160015','1','House No. 253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM GARDEN','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p>ABC</p>','<p>ABC</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>ABC</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2018-12-25 12:59:53.000','rerafilingformm','2018-12-25 12:59:53.000'),(622,1216,'1216',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Suparna Randhawa','dpsrandhawa@hotmail.com',9914400088,0,0,'House No.29','Sector-16',6,128,'160015','1','House No. 253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM GARDEN','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p>ABC</p>','<p>ABC</p>',9250000.00,2775000.00,'2013-12-18 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ol><li style=\"margin-left: 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to issue the allotment letter to the complainant and\r\nexecute the buyer’s agreement in respect of 500 sq yards plot booked by the\r\ncomplainant.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The respondent\r\nbe directed to provide the list of allottees to whom it has allotted/sold the\r\n862 residential plots as per the layout plan approved by GMADA on 6.10.2015 and\r\nfor which it is duly registered under RERA.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">&nbsp;The respondent be directed to provide the\r\ndetails in respect of funds collected from the general public since 2010 in\r\nlieu of 862 residential plots which are part of approved layout and registered\r\nunder Section 3 of RERA and also, the detail where such amount has been\r\nutilized by the respondent. Also, the respondent be directed to provide all the\r\nbank details where such amount has been deposited along with the statement of\r\naccounts, since the year 2010 and where such amount has been utilized.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 7pt; line-height: 200%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The respondent be\r\ndirected to provide the details in respect of number of bookings done by it\r\nsince the year 2010 for the said 862 residential plots along with the list of\r\napplicants who had applied for booking of plots.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the details as regards the criteria adopted\r\nby it for allotting the plot numbers to different applicants through pick and\r\nchoose policy.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the list of total applicants and further, the\r\nlist to whom it has already allotted the plot along with the list of applicants\r\nto whom it has not allotted the plots till date. </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the list of hypothecated plots which are\r\nhypothecated to GMADA, out of the approved 862 residential plots and 73\r\ncommercial plots. Also, the respondent be directed to provide the list of\r\nhypothected plots sold to general public.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n0in;margin-left:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n0in;margin-left:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:200%;\r\nmso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2018-12-25 13:20:22.000','rerafilingformm','2018-12-25 13:20:22.000'),(623,1216,'1216',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Suparna Randhawa','dpsrandhawa@hotmail.com',9914400088,0,0,'House No.29','Sector-16',6,128,'160015','1','House No. 253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM GARDEN','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p>ABC</p>','<ol><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ndirect the respondent to issue allotment letter in respect of 500 sq yard plot\r\nand execute the buyer’s agreement in compliance with Section 13 of RERA.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\nhand over the actual physical possession of the plot after issuing the\r\nallotment letter and execution of buyer’s agreement. The complainant is ready\r\nto pay the balance sale consideration. The respondent was not having any\r\nauthority to collect the money from general public before 25.1.2017. <o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ndirect the respondent not to charge any other charges from the complainant\r\nexcept EDC and PLC (if any) since the plot was sold to the complainant @Rs18500/-\r\nper sq yards excluding EDC and PLC (if any).<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ndirect the respondent to pay interest at the rate as contemplated under Rule 16\r\nof Punjab RERA Rules, for the period of delay in delivering the possession to\r\nbe calculated from the committed date of possession i.e. 18.12.2013 till the\r\ndate of handing over the actual physical possession after obtaining the\r\ncompletion certificate. <o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ntake action against the respondent under Section 61 of RERA for not complying\r\nthe provision of Section 13 which makes it mandatory for a promoter to execute\r\nthe buyer agreement on receiving 10% of sale consideration. Inspite of repeated\r\nrequest the respondent has not offered the buyer’s agreement rather it is\r\ndemanding more money for executing the same which is a clear violation of\r\nSection 13. The respondent was not even having any approval, rather it had not\r\neven applied the necessary permissions when the plot was sold to the\r\ncomplainant. The respondent got the exemption under Section 44 of PAPRA on\r\n25.1.2017. Before the said date it could not collect any money from general\r\npublic. In the present case the respondent collected the money form the\r\ncomplainant in 2011.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ntake action against the respondent for collecting the money from the\r\ncomplainant before getting all the approvals and for indulging into unfair\r\ntrade practices<o:p></o:p></span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',9250000.00,2775000.00,'2013-12-18 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ol><li style=\"margin-left: 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to issue the allotment letter to the complainant and\r\nexecute the buyer’s agreement in respect of 500 sq yards plot booked by the\r\ncomplainant.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The respondent\r\nbe directed to provide the list of allottees to whom it has allotted/sold the\r\n862 residential plots as per the layout plan approved by GMADA on 6.10.2015 and\r\nfor which it is duly registered under RERA.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">&nbsp;The respondent be directed to provide the\r\ndetails in respect of funds collected from the general public since 2010 in\r\nlieu of 862 residential plots which are part of approved layout and registered\r\nunder Section 3 of RERA and also, the detail where such amount has been\r\nutilized by the respondent. Also, the respondent be directed to provide all the\r\nbank details where such amount has been deposited along with the statement of\r\naccounts, since the year 2010 and where such amount has been utilized.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 7pt; line-height: 200%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The respondent be\r\ndirected to provide the details in respect of number of bookings done by it\r\nsince the year 2010 for the said 862 residential plots along with the list of\r\napplicants who had applied for booking of plots.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the details as regards the criteria adopted\r\nby it for allotting the plot numbers to different applicants through pick and\r\nchoose policy.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the list of total applicants and further, the\r\nlist to whom it has already allotted the plot along with the list of applicants\r\nto whom it has not allotted the plots till date. </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the list of hypothecated plots which are\r\nhypothecated to GMADA, out of the approved 862 residential plots and 73\r\ncommercial plots. Also, the respondent be directed to provide the list of\r\nhypothected plots sold to general public.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n0in;margin-left:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n0in;margin-left:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:200%;\r\nmso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2018-12-25 13:21:15.000','rerafilingformm','2018-12-25 13:21:15.000'),(624,1216,'1216',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Suparna Randhawa','dpsrandhawa@hotmail.com',9914400088,0,0,'House No.29','Sector-16',6,128,'160015','1','House No. 253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM GARDEN','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p>ABC</p>','<ol><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ndirect the respondent to issue allotment letter in respect of 500 sq yard plot\r\nand execute the buyer’s agreement in compliance with Section 13 of RERA.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height