ary permissions when the plot was sold to the\r\ncomplainant. The respondent got the exemption under Section 44 of PAPRA on\r\n25.1.2017. Before the said date it could not collect any money from general\r\npublic. In the present case the respondent collected the money form the\r\ncomplainant in 2011.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ntake action against the respondent for collecting the money from the\r\ncomplainant before getting all the approvals and for indulging into unfair\r\ntrade practices<o:p></o:p></span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',9250000.00,2775000.00,'2013-12-18 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ol><li style=\"margin-left: 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to issue the allotment letter to the complainant and\r\nexecute the buyer’s agreement in respect of 500 sq yards plot booked by the\r\ncomplainant.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The respondent\r\nbe directed to provide the list of allottees to whom it has allotted/sold the\r\n862 residential plots as per the layout plan approved by GMADA on 6.10.2015 and\r\nfor which it is duly registered under RERA.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">&nbsp;The respondent be directed to provide the\r\ndetails in respect of funds collected from the general public since 2010 in\r\nlieu of 862 residential plots which are part of approved layout and registered\r\nunder Section 3 of RERA and also, the detail where such amount has been\r\nutilized by the respondent. Also, the respondent be directed to provide all the\r\nbank details where such amount has been deposited along with the statement of\r\naccounts, since the year 2010 and where such amount has been utilized.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 7pt; line-height: 200%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The respondent be\r\ndirected to provide the details in respect of number of bookings done by it\r\nsince the year 2010 for the said 862 residential plots along with the list of\r\napplicants who had applied for booking of plots.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the details as regards the criteria adopted\r\nby it for allotting the plot numbers to different applicants through pick and\r\nchoose policy.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the list of total applicants and further, the\r\nlist to whom it has already allotted the plot along with the list of applicants\r\nto whom it has not allotted the plots till date. </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the list of hypothecated plots which are\r\nhypothecated to GMADA, out of the approved 862 residential plots and 73\r\ncommercial plots. Also, the respondent be directed to provide the list of\r\nhypothected plots sold to general public.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n0in;margin-left:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n0in;margin-left:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:200%;\r\nmso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2018-12-25 13:27:27.000','rerafilingformm','2018-12-25 13:27:27.000'),(625,1216,'1216',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Suparna Randhawa','dpsrandhawa@hotmail.com',9914400088,0,0,'House No.29','Sector-16',6,128,'160015','1','House No. 253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM GARDEN','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:200%;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">A\r\nplot measuring 500 sq yards @18500 per sq yards was booked by complainant in\r\nthe project Palm Garden being developed by the respondent, vide application(C-1)dated\r\n18.12.11 &amp; booking amount of Rs. 2775000 i.e. 30% of sale consideration was\r\npaid.Before purchasing the said plot,respondent had assured the complainant\r\nthat it is having all the approvals for the development of project except\r\nlayout plan approval which will be approved within 30 days &amp; possession be\r\ndelivered within 2 years &amp; buyer’s agreement will executed within 3 months.A\r\npayment plan(C-2)was also given to the complainant.An acknowledgment (C-3)dated\r\n2.4.2012 was issued.But inspite of repeated requests by the complainant,the respondent\r\nhas failed to issue any allotment letter &amp; execute buyer’s agreement within\r\nthe said period and even till date.Many times complainant visited the office of\r\nrespondent for getting the allotment letter and buyer agreement but to no\r\navail.There was no development on the site &amp; the respondent kept the\r\ncomplainant in dark about the approvals. A legal notice (C-4) dated 30.8.2018\r\nwas sent to respondent in which sequence of events have been duly incorporated,\r\nwhich may kindly be treated as part of pleadings.After that complainant\r\nreceived a call from respondent who invited him to its office for redressal of\r\nhis grievances.Accordingly, complainant went there in 3<sup>rd</sup> week of\r\nOctober, 2018,where the respondent assured that allotment letter would be duly\r\nissued &amp; buyer’s agreement would also be executed if the complainant further\r\ndeposit a sum of Rs. 1850000 i.e 20% sale consideration.But the complainant\r\nasked the respondent to first issue the allotment letter &amp; execute the\r\nagreement. Respondent refused to issue the same without getting any further\r\namount.The complainant has been harassed for so many years due to unfair trade\r\npractices on the part of respondent.A list of dates of approvals(C-5) &amp;\r\nimportant approvals as(C-6&amp;C-7).Complaint for registration of FIR to\r\nvigilance as C-8.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<ol><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ndirect the respondent to issue allotment letter in respect of 500 sq yard plot\r\nand execute the buyer’s agreement in compliance with Section 13 of RERA.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\nhand over the actual physical possession of the plot after issuing the\r\nallotment letter and execution of buyer’s agreement. The complainant is ready\r\nto pay the balance sale consideration. The respondent was not having any\r\nauthority to collect the money from general public before 25.1.2017. <o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ndirect the respondent not to charge any other charges from the complainant\r\nexcept EDC and PLC (if any) since the plot was sold to the complainant @Rs18500/-\r\nper sq yards excluding EDC and PLC (if any).<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ndirect the respondent to pay interest at the rate as contemplated under Rule 16\r\nof Punjab RERA Rules, for the period of delay in delivering the possession to\r\nbe calculated from the committed date of possession i.e. 18.12.2013 till the\r\ndate of handing over the actual physical possession after obtaining the\r\ncompletion certificate. <o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ntake action against the respondent under Section 61 of RERA for not complying\r\nthe provision of Section 13 which makes it mandatory for a promoter to execute\r\nthe buyer agreement on receiving 10% of sale consideration. Inspite of repeated\r\nrequest the respondent has not offered the buyer’s agreement rather it is\r\ndemanding more money for executing the same which is a clear violation of\r\nSection 13. The respondent was not even having any approval, rather it had not\r\neven applied the necessary permissions when the plot was sold to the\r\ncomplainant. The respondent got the exemption under Section 44 of PAPRA on\r\n25.1.2017. Before the said date it could not collect any money from general\r\npublic. In the present case the respondent collected the money form the\r\ncomplainant in 2011.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ntake action against the respondent for collecting the money from the\r\ncomplainant before getting all the approvals and for indulging into unfair\r\ntrade practices<o:p></o:p></span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',9250000.00,2775000.00,'2013-12-18 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ol><li style=\"margin-left: 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to issue the allotment letter to the complainant and\r\nexecute the buyer’s agreement in respect of 500 sq yards plot booked by the\r\ncomplainant.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The respondent\r\nbe directed to provide the list of allottees to whom it has allotted/sold the\r\n862 residential plots as per the layout plan approved by GMADA on 6.10.2015 and\r\nfor which it is duly registered under RERA.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">&nbsp;The respondent be directed to provide the\r\ndetails in respect of funds collected from the general public since 2010 in\r\nlieu of 862 residential plots which are part of approved layout and registered\r\nunder Section 3 of RERA and also, the detail where such amount has been\r\nutilized by the respondent. Also, the respondent be directed to provide all the\r\nbank details where such amount has been deposited along with the statement of\r\naccounts, since the year 2010 and where such amount has been utilized.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 7pt; line-height: 200%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The respondent be\r\ndirected to provide the details in respect of number of bookings done by it\r\nsince the year 2010 for the said 862 residential plots along with the list of\r\napplicants who had applied for booking of plots.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the details as regards the criteria adopted\r\nby it for allotting the plot numbers to different applicants through pick and\r\nchoose policy.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the list of total applicants and further, the\r\nlist to whom it has already allotted the plot along with the list of applicants\r\nto whom it has not allotted the plots till date. </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to provide the list of hypothecated plots which are\r\nhypothecated to GMADA, out of the approved 862 residential plots and 73\r\ncommercial plots. Also, the respondent be directed to provide the list of\r\nhypothected plots sold to general public.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n0in;margin-left:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n0in;margin-left:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:200%;\r\nmso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2018-12-25 13:28:15.000','rerafilingformm','2018-12-25 13:28:15.000'),(626,1217,'1217',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Kirandeep Kaur','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9815143759,0,0,'HOUSE NO. 38','PHASE IX',28,507,'160062','1','HOUSE NO.253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM GARDEN','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p>ABC</p>','<p>ABC</p>',9250000.00,2775000.00,'2013-12-18 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>ABC</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2018-12-25 13:53:29.000','rerafilingformm','2018-12-25 13:53:29.000'),(627,1217,'1217',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Kirandeep Kaur','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9815143759,0,0,'HOUSE NO. 38','PHASE IX',28,507,'160062','1','HOUSE NO.253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM GARDEN','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p>ABC</p>','<p>ABC</p>',9250000.00,2775000.00,'2013-12-18 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>ABC</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2018-12-25 13:59:42.000','rerafilingformm','2018-12-25 13:59:42.000'),(628,1217,'1217',1141,'