a section as any\r\nother, of the Act. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-2.3pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">b. </span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">&nbsp;The facts given in Para (4) above establish\r\nthat Respondent has failed to deliver possession of the allotted Unit including\r\nCar Parking by the stipulated date in Agreement of Sale. &nbsp;Section 18 of the Act provides that, if the\r\npromoter fails to complete or is unable to give possession by such a date for\r\nany reason and the allottee(s) wishes to withdraw from the project, he shall be\r\nliable to return the amount received by him along with interest including\r\ncompensation.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-2.3pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;Complainants are withdrawing from the project\r\nand claiming here the following relief. They will file a separate application\r\nfor compensation with the Adjudicating Officer.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">I. Refund of Amount\r\nReceived</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">\r\n(Annexure2): <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:62.55pt;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Amounts\r\nreceived up to 7.7. 2015 (Annexure 7) - Rs 3655608.00<b><sup><o:p></o:p></sup></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" sty