nt applicants\r\nthrough pick and choose policy.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to provide the list of total applicants\r\nand further, the list to whom it has already allotted the plot along with the list\r\nof applicants to whom it has not allotted the plots till date. </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to provide the list of hypothecated\r\nplots which are hypothecated to GMADA, out of the approved 862 residential\r\nplots and 73 commercial plots. Also, the respondent be directed to provide the\r\nlist of hypothected plots sold to general public.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n0in;margin-left:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n0in;margin-left:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:200%;\r\nmso-layout-grid-align:none;text-auto