ve been duly incorporated, which may kindly be treated as part of pleadings. After that complainant received a call from respondent who invited him to its office for redressal of his grievances.Accordingly, complainant along with their family friend Mrs Suparna Randhawa who also received the similar call, went there in 3rd week of October, 2018,where the respondent assured that allotment letter would be duly issued &amp; buyer’s agreement would also be executed if the complainant further deposit a sum of Rs. 1850000 i.e 20% sale consideration.But the complainant asked the respondent to first issue the allotment letter &amp; execute the agreement. Respondent refused to issue the same without getting any further amount.The complainant has been harassed for so many years due to unfair trade practices on the part of respondent.A list of dates of approvals(C-4) &amp; important approvals as(C-5 &amp; C-6)</p>','<ol><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ndirect the respondent to issue allotment letter in respect of 500 sq yard plot\r\nand execute the buyer’s agreement in compliance with Section 13 of RERA.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\nhand over the actual physical possession of the plot after issuing the\r\nallotment letter and execution of buyer’s agreement. The complainant is ready\r\nto pay the balance sale consideration. The respondent was not having any\r\nauthority to collect the money from general public before 25.1.2017. <o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ndirect the respondent not to charge any other charges from the complainant\r\nexcept EDC and PLC (if any) since the plot was sold to the complainant @Rs18500/-\r\nper sq yards excluding EDC and PLC (if any).<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ndirect the respondent to pay interest at the rate as contemplated under Rule 16\r\nof Punjab RERA Rules, for the period of delay in delivering the possession to\r\nbe calculated from the committed date of possession i.e. 18.12.2013 till the\r\ndate of handing over the actual physical possession after obtaining the\r\ncompletion certificate. <o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ntake action against the respondent under Section 61 of RERA for not complying\r\nthe provision of Section 13 which makes it mandatory for a promoter to execute\r\nthe buyer agreement on receiving 10% of sale consideration. Inspite of repeated\r\nrequest the respondent has not offered the buyer’s agreement even after getting itself registered under RERA rather it is\r\ndemanding more money for executing the same which is a clear violation of\r\nSection 13. The respondent was not even having any approval, rather it had not\r\neven applied the necessary permissions when the plot was sold to the\r\ncomplainant. The respondent got the exemption under Section 44 of PAPRA on\r\n25.1.2017. Before the said date it could not collect any money from general\r\npublic. In the present case the respondent collected the money form the\r\ncomplainant in 2011-12.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ntake action against the respondent for collecting the money from the\r\ncomplainant before getting all the approvals and for indulging into unfair\r\ntrade practices<o:p></o:p></span></li></ol>',9250000.00,2775000.00,'2013-12-18 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ol><li style=\"margin-left: 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to issue the allotment letter to the\r\ncomplainant and execute the buyer’s agreement in respect of 500 sq yards plot\r\nbooked by the complainant.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to provide the list of allottees to whom\r\nit has allotted/sold the 862 residential plots as per the layout plan approved\r\nby GMADA on 6.10.2015 and for which it is duly registered under RERA.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;The respondent be directed\r\nto provide the details in respect of funds collected from the general public\r\nsince 2010 in lieu of 862 residential plots which are part of approved layout\r\nand registered under Section 3 of RERA and also, the detail where such amount\r\nhas been utilized by the respondent. Also, the respondent be directed to\r\nprovide all the bank details where such amount has been deposited along with\r\nthe statement of accounts, since the year 2010 and where such amount has been\r\nutilized.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 7pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be\r\ndirected to provide the details in respect of number of bookings done by it\r\nsince the year 2010 for the said 862 residential plots along with the list of\r\napplicants who had applied for booking of plots.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to provide the details as regards the\r\ncriteria adopted by it for allotting the plot numbers to different applicants\r\nthrough pick and choose policy.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to provide the list of total applicants\r\nand further, the list to whom it has already allotted the plot along with the list\r\nof applicants to whom it has not allotted the plots till date. </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to provide the list of hypothecated\r\nplots which are hypothecated to GMADA, out of the approved 862 residential\r\nplots and 73 commercial plots. Also, the respondent be directed to provide the\r\nlist of hypothected plots sold to general public.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n0in;margin-left:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n0in;margin-left:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:200%;\r\nmso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2018-12-26 12:29:03.000','rerafilingformm','2018-12-26 12:29:03.000'),(650,1218,'1218',1302,'d89b0206-2eb1-4682-91b3-2181af1261fa','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NEELAM PATHAK','n.pathak0312@gmail.com',9888487871,0,598979893949,'PALM 101, ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','HIGH LAND MARG, ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','1','PALM 101, ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','HIGH LAND MARG, ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','YOGESH PATHAK','yogeshpathak@hotmail.com',9041639575,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0044','ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','ANSAL HOUSING AND CONSTRUCTION LTD.','kushagr.ansal@ansals.com',0,0,'15 UGF Indra Prakash','21 Barkhamba Road',10,120,'110001','1','15 UGF Indra Prakash','21 Barkhamba Road',10,120,'110001','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'neelam','2018-12-26 12:46:38.000','neelam','2018-12-26 12:46:38.000'),(651,1219,'1219',1262,'8269d3c9-9d36-4e0e-b0cc-25f0ac9700fd','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Mrs Mohinder Sidhu','kssidhuprof@gmail.com',8288998791,0,0,'344 URBAN ESTATE, PHASE 1','Patiala',28,454,'147002','1','344 URBAN ESTATE, PHASE 1','Patiala',28,454,'147002','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PC0001','Royal Business Park','Motia Developers Private Limited','info@motiagroup.com',8558844525,0,'M/s Motia Developers Private Limited','Chandigarh-Ambala Highway, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','M/s Motia Developers Private Limited','Chandigarh-Ambala Highway, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>xyz</p>',4447415.00,4250362.00,'2017-02-04 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>N.A.</p>','1','','2016-02-05 00:00:00','2016-02-05 00:00:00','31B-3rd Floor, Royal Business Park,\r\nChandigarh-Ambala Highway, Zirakpur','','',1,0,0,0,'mpsidhu','2018-12-26 18:26:09.000','mpsidhu','2018-12-26 18:26:09.000'),(652,1220,'1220',1302,'d89b0206-2eb1-4682-91b3-2181af1261fa','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NEELAM PATHAK','n.pathak0312@gmail.com',9888487871,0,598973893949,'PALM 101, ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','HIGH LAND MARG, ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','1','PALM 101, ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','HIGH LAND MARG, ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','YOGESH PATHAK','yogeshpathak@hotmail.com',9041639575,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0044','ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','ANSAL HOUSING AND CONSTRUCTION LTD.','kushagr.ansal@ansals.com',0,0,'15 UGF Indra Prakash','21 Barakhamba Road',10,120,'110001','1','15 UGF Indra Prakash','21 Barakhamba Road',10,120,'110001','1','<p>abc&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'neelam','2018-12-26 20:11:04.000','neelam','2018-12-26 20:11:04.000'),(653,1181,'1181',1261,'87a17578-cb7d-4b63-b1e8-f97fd8b674d5','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-19 14:34:01.000','Ravikant Sawhney','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9815400414,0,0,'B-XXX-891','near Mothu Ram Pump, sherpur, Sherpur',28,366,'142036','1','B-XXX-891','near Mothu Ram Pump, sherpur, Sherpur',28,366,'142036','Gaurav Chopra','gaurav.chopra@hotmail.com',9814013127,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','Mohali Hills (Group Housing)','Emaar MGF Land Ltd','sorabh.kakar@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'40, Ground Floor','Central Plaza, sector 105',28,507,'140306','1','40, Ground Floor','Central Plaza, sector 105',28,507,'140306','1','<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Applicant: M/s APS International Pvt Ltd \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Allotment letter : 15.1.2008\r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Allotted Unit: Apartment No. K3-FPH-PH-01 in “The Views” at Mohali Hills in Sector-105, SAS Nagar, District Mohali</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">• Buyer\'s Agreement :29.2.2008\r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Total sale consideration of Rs. 1,10,52,008/- at the rate of Rs. 2950/- per sq. foot of super area of 3250 sq. ft.   \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Construction Linked Instalment Plan amount paid till date: Rs. 1,01,71,173/- was paid by the Applicant to the Respondent upto 28.10.2014. \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	As per Clause 21.1 of the Buyer’s Agreement, the Respondent was under a contractual obligation to handover possession of the Allotted Unit within a period of 36 months from the date of allotment with a further relaxation of 90 days over and above the stipulated time period for the purpose of applying for and obtaining an Occupation Certificate in respect of the Group Housing Complex.  \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	That Clause 21.1 of the Agreement read with Clause 23.1 made it abundantly clear that time was the essence of the contract and hence, possession of the Allotted Unit was required to be handed over to the Applicant by the Respondent positively on or before 15.4.2011.  Till date, however, despite a lapse of more than 6 years, possession of the Allotted Unit has not been offered or handed over to the Applicant and this willful omission and lapse on the part of the Respondent constitutes a willful and material breach of the Agreement dated 29.2.2008 executed between the parties.  \r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">•	Aggrieved by the aforesaid omission and lapse of the Respondent, the Applicant had written a letter/e-mail dated 29.9.2017 to the Respondent for rescinding the contract and for seeking refund of the principal amount paid by the Applicant in respect of the Allotted Unit alongwith interest.  Till date, however, the aforesaid demand raised by the Applicant has not been acceded to by the Respondent and thus, vide the instant complaint, the Applicant seek refund of the monies paid by it to the Respondent alongwith interest</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Refund of an amount of Rs. 1,01,71,173/-\r\npaid by the Applicant alongwith interest (highest marginal cost of lending rate\r\nof the State Bank of India + 2%) from the respective dates of deposit till\r\nactual realization as per Sections 18 and 19(4) of the Act read with Rule 16 of\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other relief which the Applicant is\r\nentitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and\r\nthe Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',11052008.00,10171173.00,'2011-04-15 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>N.A.</p>','1','','2008-01-15 00:00:00','2008-02-29 00:00:00','K3-FPH-PH-01 “The Views” at Mohali Hills in Sector-105, SAS Nagar, District Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'APSInternational','2018-12-26 20:40:12.000','APSInternational','2018-12-26 20:40:12.000'),(654,1221,'1221',1302,'d89b0206-2eb1-4682-91b3-2181af1261fa','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NEELAM PATHAK','n.pathak0312@gmail.com',9888487871,0,598973893949,'PALM 101, ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','HIGH LAND MARG, ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','1','PALM 101, ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','HIGH LAND MARG, ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','YOGESH PATHAK','yogeshpathak@hotmail.com',9041639575,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0044','ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','ANSAL HOUSING AND CONSTRUCTION LTD.','kushagr.ansal@ansals.com',0,0,'15 UGF Indra Prakash','21 Barakhamba Road',10,120,'110001','1','15 UGF Indra Prakash','21 Barakhamba Road',10,120,'110001','1','<p>abc&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'neelam','2018-12-26 20:51:22.000','neelam','2018-12-26 20:51:22.000'),(655,1222,'1222',1299,'f05423d6-8aeb-41cc-9669-749a50a90d4d','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','VICKY  FRANCIS','vf18jan@gmail.com',9996767263,0,0,'217 Rajesh Colony','Near old court',13,21,'135003','1','2125','Phase 10',28,507,'160062','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','Falcon View Apartments','Janta Land Promoters Pvt. Ltd.','janta@jantahousing.com',0,0,'SCO 39 42','JLPL Industrial Area Sector 82',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39-42','JLPL Industrial Area Sector 82',28,507,'140306','0','<p>aaaa</p>','<p>aaaa</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>rtttyy</p>','0','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'vf18jan','2018-12-27 02:36:32.000','vf18jan','2018-12-27 02:36:32.000'),(656,1223,'1223',1299,'f05423d6-8aeb-41cc-9669-749a50a90d4d','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','VICKY  FRANCIS','vf18jan@gmail.com',9996767263,0,0,'217 Rajesh Colony','Near old court',13,21,'135003','1','2125','Phase 10',28,507,'160062','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','Falcon View Apartments','Janta Land Promoters Pvt. Ltd.','janta@jantahousing.com',0,0,'SCO 39-42','Sector 82 JLPL',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39-42','Sector 82 JLPL',28,507,'140306','1','<p>SDDEEDCDD</p>','<p>AFFVF</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>ASDFFFF</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'vf18jan','2018-12-27 03:21:02.000','vf18jan','2018-12-27 03:21:02.000'),(657,1223,'1223',1299,'f05423d6-8aeb-41cc-9669-749a50a90d4d','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-20 16:50:30.000','VICKY  FRANCIS','vf18jan@gmail.com',9996767263,0,0,'217 Rajesh Colony','Near old court',13,21,'135003','1','2125','Phase 10',28,507,'160062','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','Falcon View Apartments','Janta Land Promoters Pvt. Ltd.','janta@jantahousing.com',0,0,'SCO 39-42','Sector 82 JLPL',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39-42','Sector 82 JLPL',28,507,'140306','1','<p>The complainants agreed to purchase the Apartment No. E-1402, Facing Green in Wing “E” at 14th Floor in (Super Mega) Falcon View, Phase-1, Sector 66-A, Mohali for an amount of Rs. 96,92,942/-. Annexure C-1 Allotment letter \r\n</p><p>After the authorized representatives of the respondent builder committed that they will complete and handover the apartment within 18 months and there is also possibility that they will hand over prior to the committed date.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>And thereafter the complainants paid the booking amount of Rs. 11,00,000/- to the respondent on 23.06.2015 vide receipt no. 3055. The copy of the receipt dated 23.06.2015 is appended herewith as Annexure C-2. \r\n</p><p>The complainants chose the Down Payment Plan . The payment plan is reproduced here as under for the kind perusal of this Hon’ble Court:\r\n</p><p>S. No.	Due Dates	Payment\r\n</p><p>1	17.08.2015	Rs. 81,17,540/- (BSP) + Rs. 2,00,000/- (Car Parking Charges) + applicable service tax on date\r\n</p><p>2.	On the delivery of possession	Rs. 5,19,140/- (Balance 5% BSP) + Rs. 1,50,650/- (IFMS) + Rs. 1,80,780/- (Club Charges) + 45,195/- (Power backup) + applicable service tax on date\r\n</p><p>&nbsp;G. Total	Rs. 86,36,680/- (Basic) + Rs. 5,76,625/- (Other Charges) + along with applicable service tax on date\r\n</p><p>\r\nThat it is the admitted fact that the complainants had made the payment of Rs. 86,86,477/- BSP along with all the applicable taxes on 27.08.2015. The copy of the receipts dated 27.08.2015 is appended herewith as Annexure C-3.&nbsp;</p><p>That it is submitted that as per the clause 2.24 of the allotment letter, the respondent was to deliver the possession of the apartment within 18 months from the date of issue of allotment letter i.e. on or before 22.12.2016. \r\n</p><p>The contentions of the complainant is that despite having paid 95% of the BSP and additional Rs 2000,00 as car parking charges along with the applicable service charges i.e Total of Rs 97,86,477 well within time, He has still not been offered possession of the flat which was to be completed by 23.12.2016</p>','<ul><li>To direct the respondent to complete the development&nbsp; &nbsp;of project and construction of the apartment and deliver the possession of it along with all the facilities.</li><li>Interest on the payment paid by the complainant till the date of delivery of possession of the apartment as prescribed by the act.</li><li>A compensation of Rs 500.000 for the inconvenience caused and the the mental agony faced</li></ul>',10682250.00,9786477.00,'2016-12-22 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ul><li>To direct the respondent to complete the development&nbsp; &nbsp;of project and construction of the apartment and deliver the possession of it along with all the facilities.</li></ul>','1','','2018-06-23 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','1402 E Wing Falcon View\r\nSector 66-A Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'vf18jan','2018-12-27 03:36:55.000','vf18jan','2018-12-27 03:36:55.000'),(658,1224,'1224',1302,'d89b0206-2eb1-4682-91b3-2181af1261fa','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NEELAM PATHAK','n.pathak0312@gmail.com',9888487871,0,598973893949,'PALM 101, ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','HIGH LAND MARG, ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','1','PALM 101, ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','HIGH LAND MARG, ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','YOGESH PATHAK','yogeshpathak@hotmail.com',9041639575,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0044','ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','ANSAL HOUSING AND CONSTRUCTION LTD. ','kushagr.ansal@ansals.com',0,0,'15 UGF Indra Prakash','21 Barakhamba Road',10,120,'110001','1','15 UGF Indra Prakash','21 Barakhamba Road',10,120,'110001','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'neelam','2018-12-27 08:23:01.000','neelam','2018-12-27 08:23:01.000'),(659,1188,'1188',1271,'33c16377-7e87-4eb9-827c-5f93f69bf7d5','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-16 17:22:15.000','SUJATA RANA','ranaravi99@yahoo.in',9418488996,0,373687986628,'Flat No. 548, block-24, Sector-3, New Shimla-9','Near Shiv Mandir',14,533,'171009','1','FLAT HO.42, BLOCK NO.1, TYPE-IV','GOVT. COLONY, KASUMPTI SHIMLA-9',14,533,'171009','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0065','Arcadia Country Homes','Primary Estates and Developers Private Limited','primaryestates@gmail.com',9592231111,0,'M/s. Primary Estates and Developers Private Limited, ','SCO 43, Ground Floor, Behind KFC, New Sunny Enclave, Sector 125, SAS Nagar, Mohali.',28,507,'140301','0','Primary Estates & Developers Pvt. Ltd ','Arcadia Park East, SCO No- 4 & 5,  Ludhiana-Chandigarh, NH-95, Besides St.Ezra International School,',28,507,'140301','0','<p>I have to submit that\r\n:</p><p>I have booked an independent floor/Flat No. 1254/SF in Arcadia country homes to with Primary Estates &amp; Developers Pvt. Ltd and have paid Rs.22,00,000/-only until now starting from June, 2016 to June, 2017 against a total agreed value of Rs. 30,00,000/only for the said flat.&nbsp;</p><p>At time of booking I was told that I will get this flat within time limit of 15 months from commencement i.e. June-2016 but the project have been delayed abnormally and final stopped.That many times I found the site deadly locked or find a new face of contractor executing the work saying that the old one had left. This continuous 6th, 7th change of executing contractor or agencies left the quality issues ignored and not attended too till date. One fine morning I was surprised to know that the sale persons have left the organisation and the office have been shifted to new location and I have not been informed.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>That I latest visited the site as well as your new office on 14/07/2018 and was surprised to see that the position at site is not different to that what was in march-2018. Neither the quality has been improved nor has the progress been geared up. As per the present status of site I am sure to say that it will not be completed even by the end of 2019 that too with very poor quality.\r\n</p><p>Keeping in view the abnormal delay and poor quality of construction, the irresponsible attitude of the company, I requested for refund of my amount as the promoters have not stood by its commitments, neither valued my needs and satisfaction nor its commitment. I have&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-align: justify;\">written\r\nto the promoters through mail on dated: 17/07/2018; then on 18/08/2018 then on\r\n12/09/2018 but nothing have been heard from the promoters.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-IN;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">Keeping\r\nin view the abnormal delay and poor quality of construction, irresponsible\r\nattitude of the promoters, in my\r\nopinion they have not stood by its commitments, neither valued my needs\r\nand satisfaction nor its commitment. So feeling aggrieved being cheated I requested&nbsp; to kindly refund my entire amount with all\r\nconsequential benefits/dues.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-IN;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\"><br></span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-IN;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',3000000.00,2200000.00,'2018-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: New; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">I would like to request only to refund my entire amount with all consequential benefits/dues.</span><br></p>','1','','2016-10-08 00:00:00','2016-10-08 00:00:00','1254/SF, Residential flat in Country Home project, Mohali Sector 123','','',2,0,0,0,'sujatarana','2018-12-27 08:28:06.000','sujatarana','2018-12-27 08:28:06.000'),(660,1115,'1115',1214,'236d33c7-52c2-47c2-9d91-8289ee07ebac','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-12 16:38:20.000','Mukesh Gupta','mukeshgupta.31@gmail.com',9417217902,0,0,'B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PC0019','Wave Estate, Block-G','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','rera@waveestate.in',0,0,' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali)',28,507,'140308','1',' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali)',28,507,'140308','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">I had booked independent first floor in Wave\r\nEstate, Sector-99 under subvention scheme by initial payment of Rs.\r\n3,00,000/- vide cheque no. 60113 dated 08.02.2013. Next payment was made vide\r\ncheque no. 60117 dated 19.04.2013 amounting Rs. 3,18,540/-. It was committed to\r\nmake delivery within 2 years.&nbsp;</span>However, M/s Country Colonisers Pvt.\r\nLtd. executed the agreement on 07.02.2015 as per which possession was to be\r\noffered within 24 months along with an extended grace period of 6 months.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Accordingly, I arranged for accommodation on\r\nrent in Apr’2017 and have been paying both rent and EMIs as the subvention\r\nperiod had lapsed. Due to inordinate delay I lost faith in the project and requested\r\nthe developers through e-mails to refund my deposits. However there was no\r\nresponse from their end as they continued to defer possession and progress on\r\nsite was very slow. They agreed to settle only pre-EMI interest from Aug’17 (24+6\r\nmonths from date of agreement) onwards and offered to deliver possession in Mar’18.\r\nDeveloper even failed to meet that deadline and n</span>ow when I informed the builder that I have filed complaint in RERA on 15.11.2018 they have sent possession letter on 29.11.2018 which is dated 08.10.2018 just to get away with the complaint as it is not possible that they can keep the letter with themselves for over 50 days.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">After so much of agony, I do not want to remain\r\nassociated with the developer and request for return of all deposits (including\r\nEMIs) with interest.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">In\r\nlight of the case facts brought out hereinabove, association with the project has not only been loss of time,\r\nmoney and effort but has caused a lot of mental harassment. It is therefore requested to refund entire\r\ndeposits including EMIs paid to bank with interest.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',4000000.00,3000000.00,'2017-08-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','It is prayed to stop the EMIs till final decision as I am not able to pay both rent and EMI.&nbsp;','1','','2015-02-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','40, First Floor, Sector-99, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'mukesh013128','2018-12-27 10:02:56.000','mukesh013128','2018-12-27 10:02:56.000'),(661,1115,'1115',1214,'236d33c7-52c2-47c2-9d91-8289ee07ebac','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-12 16:38:20.000','Mukesh Gupta','mukeshgupta.31@gmail.com',9417217902,0,0,'B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','Wave Estate, Block-G','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','rera@waveestate.in',0,0,' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali)',28,507,'140308','1',' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali)',28,507,'140308','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">I had booked independent first floor in Wave\r\nEstate, Sector-99 under subvention scheme by initial payment of Rs.\r\n3,00,000/- vide cheque no. 60113 dated 08.02.2013. Next payment was made vide\r\ncheque no. 60117 dated 19.04.2013 amounting Rs. 3,18,540/-. It was committed to\r\nmake delivery within 2 years.&nbsp;</span>However, M/s Country Colonisers Pvt.\r\nLtd. executed the agreement on 07.02.2015 as per which possession was to be\r\noffered within 24 months along with an extended grace period of 6 months.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(3