, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Accordingly, I arranged for accommodation on\r\nrent in Apr’2017 and have been paying both rent and EMIs as the subvention\r\nperiod had lapsed. Due to inordinate delay I lost faith in the project and requested\r\nthe developers through e-mails to refund my deposits. However there was no\r\nresponse from their end as they continued to defer possession and progress on\r\nsite was very slow. They agreed to settle only pre-EMI interest from Aug’17 (24+6\r\nmonths from date of agreement) onwards and offered to deliver possession in Mar’18.\r\nDeveloper even failed to meet that deadline and n</span>ow when I informed the builder that I have filed complaint in RERA on 15.11.2018 they have sent possession letter on 29.11.2018 which is dated 08.10.2018 just to get away with the complaint as it is not possible that they can keep the letter with themselves for over 50 days.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">After so much of agony, I do not want to remain\r\nassociated with the developer and request for return of all deposits (including\r\nEMIs) with interest.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">In\r\nlight of the case facts brought out hereinabove, association with the project has not only been loss of time,\r\nmoney and effort but has caused a lot of mental harassment. It is therefore requested to refund entire\r\ndeposits including EMIs paid to bank with interest.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',4000000.00,3180000.00,'2017-08-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','It is prayed to stop the EMIs till final decision as I am not able to pay both rent and EMI.&nbsp;','1','','2015-02-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','40, First Floor, Sector-99, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'mukesh013128','2018-12-27 10:11:49.000','mukesh013128','2018-12-27 10:11:49.000'),(663,1115,'1115',1214,'236d33c7-52c2-47c2-9d91-8289ee07ebac','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-27 10:17:04.000','Mukesh Gupta','mukeshgupta.31@gmail.com',9417217902,0,0,'B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','Wave Estate, Block-G','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','rera@waveestate.in',0,0,' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali)',28,507,'140308','1',' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali)',28,507,'140308','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">I had booked independent first floor in Wave\r\nEstate, Sector-99 under subvention scheme by initial payment of Rs.\r\n3,00,000/- vide cheque no. 60113 dated 08.02.2013. Next payment was made vide\r\ncheque no. 60117 dated 19.04.2013 amounting Rs. 3,18,540/-. It was committed to\r\nmake delivery within 2 years.&nbsp;</span>However, M/s Country Colonisers Pvt.\r\nLtd. executed the agreement on 07.02.2015 as per which possession was to be\r\noffered within 24 months along with an extended grace period of 6 months.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Accordingly, I arranged for accommodation on\r\nrent in Apr’2017 and have been paying both rent and EMIs as the subvention\r\nperiod had lapsed. Due to inordinate delay I lost faith in the project and requested\r\nthe developers through e-mails to refund my deposits. However there was no\r\nresponse from their end as they continued to defer possession and progress on\r\nsite was very slow. They agreed to settle only pre-EMI interest from Aug’17 (24+6\r\nmonths from date of agreement) onwards and offered to deliver possession in Mar’18.\r\nDeveloper even failed to meet that deadline and n</span>ow when I informed the builder that I have filed complaint in RERA on 15.11.2018 they have sent possession letter on 29.11.2018 which is dated 08.10.2018 just to get away with the complaint as it is not possible that they can keep the letter with themselves for over 50 days.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">After so much of agony, I do not want to remain\r\nassociated with the developer and request for return of all deposits (including\r\nEMIs) with interest.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">In\r\nlight of the case facts brought out hereinabove, association with the project has not only been loss of time,\r\nmoney and effort but has caused a lot of mental harassment. It is therefore requested to refund entire\r\ndeposits including EMIs paid to bank with interest.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',4000000.00,3180000.00,'2017-08-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','It is prayed to stop the EMIs till final decision as I am not able to pay both rent and EMI.&nbsp;','1','','2015-02-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','40, First Floor, Sector-99, Mohali','','',1,1,0,0,'mukesh013128','2018-12-27 10:16:43.000','mukesh013128','2018-12-27 10:16:43.000'),(664,1124,'1124',1010,'a182232b-88d6-4711-8baa-f8a026fb675f','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-16 19:16:05.000','SUJATHA RAGHUNANDAN','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988100005,1724181010,711442413353,'#102, Sector 10 A','',6,128,'160011','1','#102, Sector 10 A','',6,128,'160011','HIMANSHU RAJ','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988200001,1724190909,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0013','ATS GOLF MEADOWS 1','ATS ESTATES PRIVATE LIMITED','pradeep.rathee@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS TOWER, PLOT NO.16','SECTOR 35, NOIDA',33,216,'201305','1','ATS TOWER, PLOT NO.16','SECTOR 35, NOIDA',33,216,'201305','1','<p class=\"normal\">The complainant\r\nhad booked a plot measuring <b>350 SQ. YARD\r\n</b>at OPs project <b>ATS GOLF MEADOWS I</b>\r\nin the year 2005. That it is pertinent to mention here that OP did not possess any\r\nof the requisite clearances license from the competent authority to develop the\r\nsaid project at that time The complainant has paid the WHOLE AMOUNT CONSIDERATION\r\nagainst the said unit to the Opposite Party in the year 2005-2006.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"normal\">That on <b>25.04.2009, </b>the OP furnished an\r\nALLOTMENT LETTER to the complainant and allotted a plot measuring <b>402.80 Sq. Yard</b>, identified by unique\r\nNo. <b><u>60 Pocket II</u></b> in the said\r\nproject. That it is pertinent to mention here that complainant had opted for <b>350 Sq. yard</b> plot but the same was\r\nincreased to <b>402.80 Sq. Yard</b> without\r\nany intimation consent from the complainant. That the OP promised through\r\nverbal assurance and Verbal Agreement that the possession will be handed over\r\nto the complainant by <b>25.04.2011</b>,\r\ni.e. 2 years from the date of allotment, but Op failed to do so. That on <b>18.12.2012, </b>Opposite Party demanded EDC\r\nagainst the said plot from the complainant even though the complainant had\r\nalready paid the complete consideration against the said unit to the OP back in\r\nthe year 2005-2006. The OP had also revised the area of the plot allotted to\r\nthe complainant from <b>402.80</b> Sq.\r\nYard. to <b>324.867</b> Sq. Yard and the\r\ncomplainant was also given a New Plot No. i.e. <b>84, </b>in OPs project<b> ATS GOLF\r\nMEADOWS I. </b>It was again assured by the complainant that the possession will\r\nbe given by <b>18.12.2014</b> i.e. 2 years\r\nfrom the date of allotment. That OP on <b>23.01.2013\r\n</b>again re-revised the plot area from <b>324.867\r\nSq. yard</b> to <b>417 Sq. Yard</b> and\r\nre-allotted a new number i.e. <b>Plot No.\r\n157</b> to the complainant. That on <b>18.12.2014</b>,\r\nOP again failed to complete its legal obligation and hand over the plot to the\r\ncomplainant.<b> </b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"normal\" style=\"tab-stops:211.5pt;border:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;\r\nmso-border-shadow:yes\">Therefore,\r\nthe complainant craves the indulgence of the REAL ESTATE REGULATORY AUTHORITY\r\nto direct the OP to refund the entire amount as per RERA CENTRAL ACT AND RERA STATE\r\nRULES.<o:p></o:p></p>','<p>i<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>To direct the OP to compensate the complainant in the shape of refund of the complete amount which has been deposited against the residential property so booked by the complainant along with an Interest on the amount from the date of deposit at the rate of 20 per sent&nbsp; till the actual realization of the complete amount within 90 days according to section 18 1 Real Estate Regulation And Development Act 2016 18 2 Real Estate Regulation And Development Act 2016 Section 19 4 of The Real Estate Regulation And Development Act 2016 r w Rule 16 and Rule 17 of Punjab State Real Estate Regulation and Development Rules 2017.<br></p><p>ii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs. 2000000&nbsp; for causing mental agony caused to the complainant.</p><p><br></p><p>iii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs. 1400000 to the complainant as the deficiency in services for keeping the complainant in dark in regard to the progress of the property.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>iv<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span> To direct the OP to pay Rs. 1400000&nbsp; for causing physical harassment caused to the complainant.</p><p><br></p><p>v<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay 5% of the total estimated cost of the project under section 61 of Real Estate Regulation and Development Act 2016</p><p><br></p><p>vi<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To revoke the license of the OP under section 7 of the Real Estate Regulation and Development act 2016.</p><p><br></p><p>vii<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Any other relief or claim which the Hon ble Authority deems appropriate.</p><div><br></div>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Not prayed</p>','1','','2009-04-25 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2018-12-27 10:21:34.000','lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2018-12-27 10:21:34.000'),(665,1124,'1124',1010,'a182232b-88d6-4711-8baa-f8a026fb675f','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-27 10:22:01.000','SUJATHA RAGHUNANDAN','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988100005,1724181010,711442413353,'#102, Sector 10 A','',6,128,'160011','1','#102, Sector 10 A','',6,128,'160011','HIMANSHU RAJ','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988200001,1724190909,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0013','ATS GOLF MEADOWS 1','ATS ESTATES PRIVATE LIMITED','pradeep.rathee@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS TOWER, PLOT NO.16','SECTOR 35, NOIDA',33,216,'201305'