lat within time limit of 15 months from commencement i.e. June-2016 but the project have been delayed abnormally and final stopped.That many times I found the site deadly locked or find a new face of contractor executing the work saying that the old one had left. This continuous 6th, 7th change of executing contractor or agencies left the quality issues ignored and not attended too till date. One fine morning I was surprised to know that the sale persons have left the organisation and the office have been shifted to new location and I have not been informed.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>That I latest visited the site as well as your new office on 14/07/2018 and was surprised to see that the position at site is not different to that what was in march-2018. Neither the quality has been improved nor has the progress been geared up. As per the present status of site I am sure to say that it will not be completed even by the end of 2019 that too with very poor quality.\r\n</p><p>Keeping in view the abnormal delay and poor quality of construction, the irresponsible attitude of the company, I requested for refund of my amount as the promoters have not stood by its commitments, neither valued my needs and satisfaction nor its commitment. I have&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-align: justify;\">written\r\nto the promoters through mail on dated: 17/07/2018; then on 18/08/2018 then on\r\n12/09/2018 but nothing have been heard from the promoters.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&