so-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%;\">RWA is unable to claim the possession of common areas.</span></span></span></li></ol><p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%;\">After getting login ID, AHCL created neither webpage on RERA Pb site nor entered project details, hence allowed to pass time of 3 weeks set by RERA for this vide cir. dated May 9,2018, see Annexure I.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%;\">Documents on Development Plan&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%;\">and&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%;\">Details of Court Cases sought from AHCL vide Memo No.163 of 21.8.2017 are not available on record see Annexure J, notwithstanding claims made in&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%;\">Diary No. 1227 dated 01.09.2017 see Annexure K. Question arises, as to whether the same was ever submitted by AHCL.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%;\">RWA is already in place, over 10 years&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%;\">have lapsed but&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%;\">completion certificate for the project is pending.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%;\">State Consumer Forum&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%;\">Pb judgement dt. Feb2, 2018 clearly states </span><b><i><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%;\">The completion certificate is not issued by competent authority because the builder has made deviations, violations in construction; it is his duty to rectify those deviations or bring the deviations within permissible limits.&nbsp;</span></i></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%;\">See Annexure H.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%;\">A sister concern of AHCL, provides essential services against hefty maintenance fees, while delivering poor services. AHCL never responded to our concerns. Such indifferent attitude forced residents to unanimously hold back quarterly payment, in protest.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%;\">Maintenance by builder is allowed before handing over of project to RWA by charging reasonable charges, which is 35 percent higher, approximately in existing charges due to application of 18 percent GST and maintenance of unsold flats see Annexure N.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br></p>','<p><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Information in contravenes to the Section 4:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Failure of the promoter to comply with the instruction given in respect of Specific date of completion of the project has been dealt with under Section 60 of the RERA 2016. The RERA&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Punjab is requested to take a note of failure of the promoter to comply with the above instructions and requested to take a view, suitably.</span></p><p><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Promoter’s obligation of disclosure:&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Failure of the promoter to comply with the orders for uploading of information on web site within 3 weeks has been dealt with under Section 63 of the RERA 2016. The RERA&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Punjab is requested to take a note of failure of the promoter to comply its orders and requested to take a view,suitably.</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Project deficiencies:&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">In compliance to the obligations, responsibilities and functions as per section 11.4.a of the Central RER Act 2016, the builder may kindly be directed to complete the shortcomings in respect of the project.</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\">Completion Certificate</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\">: As per section 11.4.b of the Central RERA 2016 and the Rule 9.1.i of Punjab RERA 2017, the builder may kindly be directed to obtain Completion Certificate within the time specified by your good selves.</span></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\">Recognition of RWA</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\">: As per section 11.4.e of the Central RERA 2016:&nbsp;<b>The promoter shall be responsible for enabling the formation of association, society or coop. society, as the case may be, of allottees or a federation of the same,........ within a period of three months of the majority of allottees have booked their plot, apartment.......&nbsp;</b>Hence, the builder may kindly be directed to recognize and transfer the project to the already formed RWA.</span><br></span></span></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'neelam','2018-12-28 09:36:29.000','neelam','2018-12-28 09:36:29.000'),(701,1230,'1230',1302,'d89b0206-2eb1-4682-91b3-2181af1261fa','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NEELAM PATHAK','n.pathak0312@gmail.com',9888487871,0,598973893949,'PALM 101, ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','HIGH LAND MARG, ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','1','PALM 101, ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','HIGH LAND MARG, ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','YOGESH PATHAK','yogeshpathak@hotmail.com',9041639575,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0044','ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','ANSAL HOUSING AND CONSTRUCTION LTD.','kushagr.ansal@ansals.com',0,0,'15 UGF INDRA PRAKASH','21 BARAKHAMBA ROAD',10,120,'110001','1',