5%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Project deficiencies:&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">In compliance to the obligations, responsibilities and functions as per section 11.4.a of the Central RER Act 2016, the builder may kindly be directed to complete the shortcomings in respect of the project.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\">Completion Certificate</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\">: As per section 11.4.b of the Central RERA 2016 and the Rule 9.1.i of Punjab RERA 2017, the builder may kindly be directed to obtain Completion Certificate within the time specified by your good selves.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\">Recognition of RWA</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 115%;\">: As per section 11.4.e of the Central RERA 2016:&nbsp;<b>The promoter shall be responsible for enabling the formation of association, society or coop. society, as the case may be, of allottees or a federation of the same,........ within a period of three months of the majority of allottees have booked their plot, apartment.......&nbsp;</b>Hence, the builder may kindly be directed to recognize and transfer the project to the already formed RWA.</span></li></ol>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'neelam','2018-12-28 09:37:48.000','neelam','2018-12-28 09:37:48.000'),(702,1230,'1230',1302,'d89b020