ht:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Failure of the promoter to comply with the instruction\r\ngiven in respect of&nbsp; Specific date of\r\ncompletion of the project has been dealt with under Section 60 of the RERA\r\n2016. The RERAPunjab is requested to take a note of failure of the promoter to\r\ncomply with the above instructions and requested to take a view, suitably.</span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Promoter’s obligation of disclosure:&nbsp; </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Failure of the promoter to comply with the orders for\r\nup loading of information on website within 3 weeks has been dealt with under\r\nSection 63 of the RERA 2016. The RERAPunjab is requested to take a note of\r\nfailure of the promoter to comply its orders and requested to take a view,\r\nsuitably.</span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Project deficiencies: </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">In compliance to the obligations, responsibilities and functions as\r\nper section 11.4.a of the Central Real Estate&nbsp;\r\nAct 2016, the builder may kindly be directed to complete the\r\nshortcomings in respect of the project.</span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Completion Certificate</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"> : As per section 11.4.b of the Central Real\r\nEstate Act 2016 and the Rule 9.1.i of Punjab RERA 2017, the builder may kindly\r\nbe directed obtain Completion Certificate within the time specified by RERA Punjab.</span><br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'neelam','2018-12-28 14:59:35.000','neelam','2018-12-28 14:59:35.000'),(724,1232,'1232',1302,'d89b0206-2eb1-4682-91b3-2181af1261fa','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NEELAM PATHAK','n.pathak0312@gmail.com',9888487871,0,598973893949,'PALM 101, ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','HIGH LAND MARG, ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','1','PALM 101, ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','HIGH LAND MARG, ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','Yogesh Pathak','yogeshpathak@hotmail.com',9041639575,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0044','Ansal Woodbury Apartments','Ansal Housing and Construction Ltd.','kushagr.ansal@Ansals.com',0,0,'15 UGF Indra Prakash','21 Barakhamba Road',10,120,'110001','1','15 UGF Indra Prakash','21 Barakhamba Road',10,120,'110001','1','<p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;\r\nline-height:150%;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Detailed Form M is submitted as Annexure Form M, whereas gist of the\r\nrequest is being submitted here under.</span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;\r\nline-height:150%;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Project Registration is valid for completion period, declared by the\r\nbuilder in Form B, see Annexure C. AHCL will