M, whereas gist of the\r\nrequest is being submitted here under.</span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;\r\nline-height:150%;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Project Registration is valid for completion period, declared by the\r\nbuilder in Form B, see Annexure C. AHCL willfully omitted project completion date,\r\nresulting in:</span></p><ul><li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Open registration, requiring no further extension of the project.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">RWA is unable to claim the possession of common areas.&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;\r\nline-height:150%;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">After getting login ID, AHCL created neither web page on RERA Punjab\r\nsite nor entered project details, hence allowed to pass time of 3 weeks set by\r\nRERA for this vide cir. dated May 9, 2018, see Annexure I.</span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;\r\nline-height:150%;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Documents on Development Plan&nbsp;and&nbsp;Details of Court Cases\r\nsought from AHCL vide Memo No.163 of 21.8.2017 are not available on record see\r\nAnnexure J, notwithstanding claims made in&nbsp;Diary No.1227 dated 01.09.2017\r\nsee Annexure K. Question arises, as to whether the same were ever submitted by\r\nAHCL.</span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"marg