t: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"> : As per section 11.4.b of the Central Real\r\nEstate Act 2016 and the Rule 9.1.i of Punjab RERA 2017, the builder may kindly\r\nbe directed obtain Completion Certificate within the time specified by RERA Punjab.</span></li><li><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Recognition of RWA</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:&nbsp; As per\r\nsection 11.4.e of the Central Real Estate Act 2016: </span><b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;The\r\npromoter shall be responsible for enabling the formation of association,\r\nsociety&nbsp;or coop. society, as the case may be, of&nbsp; allottees or a\r\nfederation of the same, ........within a period of&nbsp;three months of the\r\nmajority of allottees have booked their plot, apartment....... </span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Hence, the builder may kindly be\r\ndirected to recognize and transfer the project to the already formed RWA.</span></span><br></li></ol>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Going\r\nby the facts detailed in para 4 above and the fact that in absence of Completion Certificate/Occupancy Certificate, execution of\r\ntransfer documents for common areas in favor of RWA is not possible.\r\nPending final decision on the requests sought detailed in para 5 the\r\ncomplainant seeks the issuance of the following interim order </span><i><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">as per Section 36 of RERA 2016</span></i><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:</span></span></p><ol><li><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The builder be directed to handover maintenance function of the complex\r\nto the residents’ welfare association, formed by them and registered with the\r\nRegistrar Cooperative Societies, Punjab.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Directing the respondent to ensure continuation\r\nof the services and maintenance, as are being provided by the maintenance\r\nagency Sunrise Estate Management Services, during intervening period of transfer process, free of cost.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The&nbsp;respondent be barred from any further recovery of\r\ncharges on account of services and maintenance from the flat owners.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to make payment of the services and maintenance\r\ncharges of unsold flats to RWA.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The respondent be\r\ndirected to obtain and furnish Completion Certificate/ Occupancy Certificate\r\nwithin the time specified by the RERA Punjab.</span></li></ol>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'neelam','2018-12-28 15:05:54.000','neelam','2018-12-28 15:05:54.000'),(730,1232,'1232',1302,'d89b0206-2eb1-4682-91b3-2181af1261fa','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NEELAM PATHAK','n.pathak0312@gmail.com',9888487871,0,598973893949,'PALM 101, ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','HIGH LAND MARG, ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','1','PALM 101, ANSAL WOODBURY APARTMENTS','HIGH LAND MARG, ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','Yogesh Pathak','yogeshpathak@hotmail.com',9041639575,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0044','Ansal Woodbury Apartments','Ansal Housing and Construction Ltd.','kushagr.ansal@Ansals.com',0,0,'15 UGF Indra Prakash','21 Barakhamba Road',10,120,'110001','1','15 UGF Indra Prakash','21 Barakhamba Road',10,120,'110001','1','<p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;\r\nline-he