nguage:AR-SA\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Going\r\nby the facts detailed in para 4 above and the fact that in absence of Completion Certificate/Occupancy Certificate, execution of\r\ntransfer documents for common areas in favor of RWA is not possible.\r\nPending final decision on the requests sought detailed in para 5 the\r\ncomplainant seeks the issuance of the following interim order </span><i><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">as per Section 36 of RERA 2016</span></i><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:</span></span></p><ol><li><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The builder be directed to handover maintenance function of the complex\r\nto the residents’ welfare association, formed by them and registered with the\r\nRegistrar Cooperative Societies, Punjab.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Directing the respondent to ensure continuation\r\nof the services and maintenance, as are being provided by the maintenance\r\nagency Sunrise Estate Management Services, during intervening period of transfer process, free of cost.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The&nbsp;respondent be barred from any further recovery of\r\ncharges on account of services and maintenance from the flat owners.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The\r\nrespondent be directed to make payment of the services and maintenance\r\ncharges of unsold flats to RWA.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The respondent be\r\ndirected to obtain and furnish Completion Certificate/ Occupancy Certificate\r\nwithin the time specified by the RERA Punjab.</span></li></ol>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'neelam','2018-12-28 15:07:55.000','neelam','2018-12-28 15:07:55.000'),(732,1233,'1233',1302,'d89b0206-2eb1-4682-91b3-2181af1261fa','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NEELAM PATHAK','n.pathak0312@gmail.com',9888487871,0,598973893949,'PALM 101, ANSAL WO