.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Maintenance by builder is allowed\r\nbefore handing over of project to RWA by charging only reasonable charges</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%;\"><font face=\"Roboto\">. This is not in our case.</font></span></p><ol><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Maintenance by RWA will be\r\nexempted vide SN. 77 on page 19 of GST Notification dated June 28, 2017, see\r\nAnnexure N; and</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Maintenance charges for unsold flats being borne by the\r\nallottees.</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">This is forming approximately 35 percent of the existing charges.</span></p>','<ol><li><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Information in contravenes to the Section 4:&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Failure of the promoter to\r\ncomply with the instruction given in respect of&nbsp; Specific date of\r\ncompletion of the project has been dealt with under Section 60 of the RERA\r\n2016. The RERA Punjab is requested to take a note of failure of the promoter to\r\ncomply with the above instructions and requested to take a view, suitably.</span></span></li><li><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Promoter’s\r\nobligation of disclosure:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Failure of the promoter to comply with\r\nthe orders for up loading of information on website within 3 weeks has been\r\ndealt with under Section 63 of the RERA 2016. The RERA Punjab is requested to\r\ntake a note of failure of the promoter to comply its orders and requested to\r\ntake a view, suitably.</span></span></li><li><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Project deficiencies:&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">In compliance to the\r\nobligations, responsibilities and functions as per section 11.4.a of the\r\nCentral Real Estate&nbsp; Act 2016, the builder may kindly be directed to\r\ncomplete the shortcomings in respect of the project.</span></span></li><li><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Completion Certificate</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;:\r\nAs per section 11.4.b of the Central Real Estate Act 2016 and the Rule 9.1.i of\r\nPunjab RERA 2017, the builder may kindly be directed obtain Completion\r\nCertificate within the time specified by RERA Punjab.</span></span></li><li><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Recognition of RWA</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:&nbsp;\r\nAs per section 11.4.e of the Central Real Estate Act 2016:&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;The\r\npromoter shall be responsible for enabling the formation of association,\r\nsociety&nbsp;or coop. society, as the case may be, of&nbsp; allottees or a\r\nfederation of the same, ........within a period of&nbsp;three months of the\r\nmajority of allottees have booked their plot, apartment.......&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Hence,\r\nthe builder may kindly be directed to recognize and transfer the project to the\r\nalready formed RWA.</span></span><br></li></ol>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Going by the facts detailed in para 4 above and the fact that in absence\r\nof Completion Certificate/Occupancy Certificate, execution of transfer\r\ndocuments for common areas in favor of RWA is not possible. Pending final\r\ndecision on the requests sought detailed in para 5 the complainant seeks the\r\nissuance of the following interim order&nbsp;</span><i><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">as per Section 36 of RERA 2016</span></i><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:</span></span></p><ol><li><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The\r\nbuilder be directed to handover maintenance function of the complex to the\r\nresidents’ welfare association, formed by them and registered with the\r\nRegistrar Cooperative Societies, Punjab.</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Roboto;\">Directing the respondent to\r\nensure continuation of the services and maintenance, as are being provided by\r\nthe maintenance agency Sunrise Estate Management Services, during intervening\r\nperiod of transfer process, free of cost.</span></li><li>The&nbsp;respondent be barred from any\r\nfurther recovery of charges on account of services and maintenance from the\r\nflat owners.</li><li>The respondent be directed to make payment of the services and\r\nmaintenance charges of unsold flats to RWA.</li><li>The respondent be directed to obtain\r\nand furnish Completion Certificate/ Occupancy Certificate within the time\r\nspecified by the RERA Punjab.<br></li></ol>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'neelam','2018-12-28 15:34:13.000','neelam','2018-12-28 15:34:13.000'),(744,1176,'1176',1257,'c1104234-21e5-41f4-9b9d-64c03c6afb7d','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-25 12:40:05.000','Harjot Kaur  Khera','jagdeepkhera@gmail.com',9417000453,0,0,'21 D (White Gate) ','Sarabha Nagar',28,366,'141001','1','21 D (White Gate) ','Sarabha Nagar',28,366,'141001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0154','M/S Country Colonisers Pvt Ltd\r\nWave Estate, Sector 85 \r\nSAS Nagar, Mohali 140308','Wave Estate, Sector 85, SAS Nagar, Mohalil','rera@waveestate.in',0,0,'Country Colonisers Pvt Ltd','Wave Estate, Sector 85',28,507,'140308','1','Country Colonisers Pvt Ltd','Wave Estate, Sector 85',28,507,'140308','1','<p>1. Initial application for allotment made on 16-10-2006 along with payment of Rs 396000</p><p>2. No work done on ground till 2014. Meanwhile changes of plans, change of project name, change of master plans done.&nbsp;</p><p>3. Fresh agreement done on 30-01-14 along with allotment of unit number K 401 in Kannedia Tower of group housing scheme.&nbsp;</p><p>4. Promoter has been unable to deliver the mentioned unit number K 401 till date, even after demanding and accepting payments on construction linked plan.&nbsp;</p><p>5. Promoter has arbitrarily and forcibly shifted allocation of unit from K tower to F tower on 28-07-17</p><p>6. Complainants have made application to builder for cancellation of allotment along with refund of payments made on 23-10-17 but no reply or refund received from builder.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>','<p>Refund of payments done along with applicable interest&nbsp;</p><p>1. 396000 since 16-10-2006</p><p>2. 209685 since 14-03-2014</p><p>3. 411946 since 25-06-2014</p><p>4. 426321 since 28-03-2016</p><p><br></p>',0.00,1443952.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'jskhera','2018-12-29 08:05:34.000','jskhera','2018-12-29 08:05:34.000'),(745,1176,'1176',1257,'c1104234-21e5-41f4-9b9d-64c03c6afb7d','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-29 08:09:42.000','Harjot Kaur  Khera','jagdeepkhera@gmail.com',9417000453,0,0,'21 D (White Gate) ','Sarabha Nagar',28,366,'141001','1','21 D (White Gate) ','Sarabha Nagar',28,366,'141001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0154','M/S Country Colonisers Pvt Ltd\r\nWave Estate, Sector 85 \r\nSAS Nagar, Mohali 140308','Wave Estate, Sector 85, SAS Nagar, Mohalil','rera@waveestate.in',0,0,'Country Colonisers Pvt Ltd','Wave Estate, Sector 85',28,507,'140308','1','Country Colonisers Pvt Ltd','Wave Estate, Sector 85',28,507,'140308','1','<p>1. Initial application for allotment made on 16-10-2006 along with payment of Rs 396000</p><p>2. No work done on ground till 2014. Meanwhile changes of plans, change of project name, change of master plans done.&nbsp;</p><p>3. Fresh agreement done on 30-01-14 along with allotment of unit number K 401 in Kannedia Tower of group housing scheme.&nbsp;</p><p>4. Promoter has been unable to deliver the mentioned unit number K 401 till date, even after demanding and accepting payments on construction linked plan.&nbsp;</p><p>5. Promoter has arbitrarily and forcibly shifted allocation of unit from K tower to F tower on 28-07-17</p><p>6. Complainants have made application to builder for cancellation of allotment along with refund of payments made on 23-10-17 but no reply or refund received from builder.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>','<p>Refund of payments done along with applicable interest&nbsp;</p><p>1. 396000 since 16-10-2006</p><p>2. 209685 since 14-03-2014</p><p>3. 411946 since 25-06-2014</p><p>4. 426321 since 28-03-2016</p><p><br></p>',0.00,1443952.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'jskhera','2018-12-29 08:08:57.000','jskhera','2018-12-29 08:08:57.000'),(746,1234,'1234',1311,'d4bfd6db-9fb2-4eaa-ba16-0539fc46a714','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Gaurav Kumar','gaurav4478@gmail.com',9815978440,0,0,'130, Amrit Colony, Panj Peer Road,','Opposite Dairy Complex, Haibowal Khurd',28,366,'141001','1','130, Amrit Colony, Panj Peer Road,','Opposite Dairy Complex, Haibowal Khurd',28,366,'141001','Prabhjot Singh Sachdeva','',9988126268,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0052','Ireo Waterfront Private Limited','Varun Khanna','varun.khanna@ireo.in',0,0,'Ireo Campus, Archview Drive, Ireo City,','Golf Course Extension Road, Sector 59',13,5,'122101','1','Ireo Campus, Archview Drive, Ireo City,','Golf Course Extension Road, Sector 59',13,5,'122101','0','<p><br></p>','<p><br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><br></p>','0','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'gaurav4478','2018-12-30 10:29:08.000','gaurav4478','2018-12-30 10:29:08.000'),(747,1234,'1234',1311,'d4bfd6db-9fb2-4eaa-ba16-0539fc46a714','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Gaurav Kumar','gaurav4478@gmail.com',9815978440,0,0,'130, Amrit Colony, Panj Peer Road,','Opposite Dairy Complex, Haibowal Khurd',28,366,'141001','1','130, Amrit Colony, Panj Peer Road,','Opposite Dairy Complex, Haibowal Khurd',28,366,'141001','Prabhjot Singh Sachdeva','',9988126268,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0052','Ireo Waterfront Private Limited','Varun Khanna','varun.khanna@ireo.in',0,0,'Ireo Campus, Archview Drive, Ireo City,','Golf Course Extension Road, Sector 59',13,5,'122101','1','Ireo Campus, Archview Drive, Ireo City,','Golf Course Extension Road, Sector 59',13,5,'122101','1','<p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt;\'>Brief\r\nfacts of the complaint are, Complainants had booked a built up <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Coral floor situated at Ireo Waterfront Pvt.\r\nLtd., Sidhwan Canal Road, V. Dewatwal, Ludhiana with the respondents in December\r\n2012. The respondents had allotted built up floor no.X012A coral floor having\r\nsuper area of 1532 sq ft., on the plot measuring 236.8 sq yards and the agreement\r\nto the effect was executed on 25.09.2013 (copy enclosed) but latter on\r\nrespondents had changed the same to X26A arbitrarily. In order to buy peace and\r\nharmony complainants accepted the same, after exchange of several emails,\r\nwithout prejudice to their rights. The complainants had made the payments, by\r\navailing bank loan of Rs.40 lacs @9.20%, as and when demanded by the\r\nrespondents and till date</span><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt;\'> </span><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt;\'>Rs.53,56,581/-\r\n(51,88,041/- for built up floor + 1,68,540/- for club membership) had been paid\r\nin total (Annexure and relevant documents enclosed). As per the terms of\r\nagreement notice of completion is to be given by the respondents within the\r\nperiod of 24 months + 180 days (Grace Period). But till date i.e. more than\r\nfive years from the date of execution of agreement respondents had not\r\ndelivered the possessions of built up floor. We approached respondents</span><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt;\'> </span><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt;\'>number of times but they kept on lingering on\r\nthe matter on one pretext or the other by making whimsical or illogical excuses\r\nand also insisted the complainant to take another unit but as and when the\r\ncomplainants intends to accept their offer, then on very next meeting, they changed\r\ntheir earlier proposal and offered some another proposal (emails attached). The\r\nrespondents are now pressurizing the complainants to get an alternative unit\r\nwhich is neither agreed between the parties nor acceptable/feasible to the\r\ncomplainants. Legal notice is also served upon the respondents through counsel\r\n(Copy encls.), but response to the same is received till date.</span></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><br></p>','<p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt;\'>It is, therefore, respectfully prayed that the\r\nrespondents may kindly be directed to refund the amount of Rs.53,56,581/- along\r\nwith interest over and above the interest which the complainants are paying to\r\nthe HDFC bank from which they have availed the loan facility for purchase the\r\nproperty, from the date of execution of the agreement till the realization of\r\nthe amount, the complainants are also entitled to get a compensation to the\r\ntune of Rs.5 Lakh on account of mental pain, agony and harassment suffered by\r\nthem as provided U/s 14 (3) and Section 19 of the said Act. </span></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt;\'><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>The strict\r\naction U/s 7 &amp; 8 is also required to be taken against the respondents for\r\nviolating the provisions of The Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development Act).</span></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><span style=\'line-height: 115%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Droid Sans\"; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\'><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 2;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Any other relief which the\r\ncomplainants seems entitled to by this Hon\'ble Authority, may also be granted\r\nto the complainants in the interest of justice and equity. </span><br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><br></p>','0','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'gaurav4478','2018-12-30 10:43:51.000','gaurav4478','2018-12-30 10:43:51.000'),(748,1234,'1234',1311,'d4bfd6db-9fb2-4eaa-ba16-0539fc46a714','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Gaurav Kumar','gaurav4478@gmail.com',9815978440,0,0,'130, Amrit Colony, Panj Peer Road,','Opposite Dairy Complex, Haibowal Khurd',28,366,'141001','1','130, Amrit Colony, Panj Peer Road,','Opposite Dairy Complex, Haibowal Khurd',28,366,'141001','Prabhjot Singh Sachdeva','prabhjotsinghsachdeva@ymail.com',9988126268,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0052','Ireo Waterfront Private Limited','Varun Khanna','varun.khanna@ireo.in',0,0,'Ireo Campus, Archview Drive, Ireo City,','Golf Course Extension Road, Sector 59',13,5,'122101','1','Ireo Campus, Archview Drive, Ireo City,','Golf Course Extension Road, Sector 59',13,5,'122101','1','<p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n<br></font></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt;\'>Brief\r\nfacts of the complaint are, Complainants have booked a Built Up <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Coral floor situated at Ireo Waterfront Pvt.\r\nLtd., Sidhwan Canal Road, V. Dewatwal, Ludhiana with the respondents in December\r\n2012. The respondents have allotted built up floor no.X012A coral floor having\r\nsuper area of 1532 sq ft., on the plot measuring 236.8 sq yards and the agreement\r\nto the effect was executed on 25.09.2013 (copy enclosed) but latter on\r\nrespondents had changed the same to X26A arbitrarily and without the consent of\r\ncomplainants. In order to buy peace and harmony complainants accepted the same,\r\nafter exchange of several emails, without prejudice to their rights. The complainants\r\nhave made the payments to the respondents and till date</span><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt;\'> </span><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt;\'>Rs.53,56,581/- (51,88,041/- for built up\r\nfloor + 1,68,540/- for club membership) have been paid in total. The Complainants\r\nhave also availed a loan of Rs.40 lacs from HDFC Ltd. @ 9.20% for making\r\npayments. <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>As per the terms of agreement\r\nnotice of completion is to be given by the respondents within the period of 24\r\nmonths + 180 days (Grace Period). But till date i.e. even after the lapse of\r\nmore than five years from the date of execution of agreement, the respondents\r\nhave not delivered the possessions of built up floor. We approached respondents</span><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt;\'> </span><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt;\'>number of times but they kept on lingering on\r\nthe matter and also insisted the complainant to take another unit but as and\r\nwhen the complainants intends to accept their offer, then on very next meeting,\r\nthey changed their earlier proposal and offered some another proposal (emails\r\nattached). The respondents are now pressurizing the complainants to get an\r\nalternative unit which is neither agreed between the parties nor\r\nacceptable/feasible to the complainants. Legal notice dated 21.12.2018 was also\r\nserved upon the respondents through counsel, but they failed to do the needful.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><br></p>','<p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><font face=\"Arial\"></font><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n<br></font></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt;\'>It is, therefore, respectfully prayed that the\r\nrespondents may kindly be directed to refund the amount of Rs.53,56,581/- along\r\nwith interest over and above the interest which the complainants are paying to\r\nthe HDFC Ltd. from which they have availed the loan facility for purchase the\r\nproperty, from the date of execution of the agreement till the realization of\r\nthe amount, the complainants are also entitled to get a compensation to the\r\ntune of Rs.5 Lakh on account of mental pain, agony and harassment suffered by\r\nthem as provided U/s 14 (3) and Section 19 of the said Act. </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n<br></font></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt;\'><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>The strict\r\naction U/s 7 &amp; 8 is also required to be taken against the respondents for\r\nviolating the provisions of The Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development Act).</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><span style=\'line-height: 115%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Droid Sans\"; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\'><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 2;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Any other relief which the complainants\r\nseems entitled to by this Hon\'ble Authority, may also be granted to the\r\ncomplainants in the interest of justice and equity. </span><br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 14pt;\'>The\r\nrespondents may kindly be directed to deposit at least 50% of the amount\r\nalongwith interest as interim relief as a condition precedent before filling\r\ntheir written statement/ defence. The respondents may also be restrained from\r\nchanging current allotted unit X026A coral floor to any other coral floor unit\r\nduring the pendency of proceedings.</span></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'gaurav4478','2018-12-30 14:32:59.000','gaurav4478','2018-12-30 14:32:59.000'),(749,1235,'1235',1312,'6192c304-cccb-4808-870c-b203098a180a','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Charanjeet Singh Bagga','csbkb1983@gmail.com',9424492156,0,435060324845,'Juniper 403, Ansal Woodbury Apartments','High Land Marg, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','Juniper 403, Ansal Woodbury Apartments','High Land Marg, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','Yogesh Pathak','yogeshpathak@hotmail.com',9041639575,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0044','Ansal Woodbury Apartments ','Ansal Housing and Construction Ltd.','kushagr.ansal@ansals.com',0,0,'15 UGF Indra Prakash','21 Barakhamba Road',10,120,'110001','1','15 UGF Indra Prakash','21 Barakhamba Road',10,120,'110001','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'csbkb','2018-12-30 19:15:07.000','