<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Husband of the complainant approached the Respondents for booking of one showroom floated by the Respondent.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Respondents also allured the Complainant of ASSURED RETURNS on the amount invested till the date of possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Initially complainant booked one showroom bearing No. 6UGF measuring 1772 sq. ft. @ Rs.30,12,400/-.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Agreement executed on 09.02.2010 (A-2)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Complainant deposited Rs.28,61,780/- on 30.01.2010.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Agreement executed on 09.02.2010 promising possession within 42 months maximum.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Respondent was liable to pay Rs.53,847/- per month which was paid by 31.03.2012.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Since the construction of the showroom was very slow complainant decided to shift in other showroom in same project.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Respondent offered two showrooms bearing no. 03SF and 04SF.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Complainant paid Rs.20,00,000/- more on 25.05.2012 jointly against both showrooms.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Price of each showroom was fixed as Rs.25,00,000/-. Each unit is measuring 1588 sq. ft.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Complainant paid total Rs.48,61,780/- till date for both showrooms. Rs.24,30,890/- against each unit. balance Rs.69,110/- to be paid on offer of possession which never offered till date.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: roboto, serif; font-size: 10.5pt;\">New Agreement of SF04 showroom executed on 08.06.2012&nbsp; wherein possession was to be given within 42 months maximum which expired on 08.12.2016. As per new agreement Rs.1,06,563/- was to be paid as assured return per quarter per showroom (i.e. Rs.35,521/- per month).&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: roboto, serif; font-size: 10.5pt;\">Assured Returns stopped after JULY, 2016 violating the terms of the agreement as well as provisions of RERA.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Construction has been stopped in between. Possession not offered till date. Neither obtained completion and occupation certificates.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: roboto, serif; font-size: 10.5pt;\">Respondents are in arrears of Rs.1065630/- (01.07.2016 to 31.12.2018) as ASSURED RETURN and they may be directed to deposit the said amount as interim measure.</span><br></p><p></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Present application filed seeking possession of the Unit No.04SF alongwith assured returns till actual possession of unit.</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">SEEKING POSSESSION OF THE UNIT NO. 04SF, CITI&nbsp; CENTRE PROJECT, SECTOR 115 MOHALI<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">ASSURED RETURN AMOUNTING TO RS.10,65,630/- DUE W.E.F. 01.07.2016 TILL 31.12.2018<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">FUTURE ASSURED RETURNS TILL ACTUAL POSSESSION OF SHOWROOM No. 04 SF.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">RS,1,10,000/- AS COST OF LITIGATION.&nbsp;</span></p>',2500000.00,2430890.00,'2016-12-08 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>ResPONDENTS MAY BE DIRECTED TO DEPOSIT RS.10,65,630/- BEFORE THIS HON\'BLE AUTHORITY&nbsp; QUA ASSURED RETURN OF THE SHOWROOM SR-04SF, CITI CENTRE SECTOR 115 MOHALI FOR THE PERIOD 01.07.2016 TO 31.12.2018.</p>','1','','2012-06-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','SR-04SF, Citi Centre, Sector 115 Greater Mohali, Punjab','','',2,0,0,0,'advravinder','2019-01-08 11:45:21.000','advravinder','2019-01-08 11:45:21.000'),(825,1256,'1256',1119,'dae2bb68-2fa2-473d-a49d-c15de93bd3da','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','DAKSHA','advravinder@gmail.com',9815700280,0,0,'H. NO. 1/3 BIJAI PALACE (COLONY)','MANDI',14,382,'175001','1','H. NO. 1/3 BIJAI PALACE (COLONY)','MANDI',14,382,'175001','Ravinderpal Singh','advravinder@gmail.com',9815700280,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PC0076','CITI CENTRE','ANSAL LOTUS MELANGE PROJECTS PVT. LTD.','info@almprojects.com',0,0,'SCO 183-184, SECTOR 9-C CHANDIGARH','',6,128,'160009','1','SCO 183-184, 