 style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Present application filed seeking possession of the Unit No.04SF alongwith assured returns till actual possession of unit.</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">SEEKING POSSESSION OF THE UNIT NO. 04SF, CITI&nbsp; CENTRE PROJECT, SECTOR 115 MOHALI<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">ASSURED RETURN AMOUNTING TO RS.10,65,630/- DUE W.E.F. 01.07.2016 TILL 31.12.2018<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">FUTURE ASSURED RETURNS TILL ACTUAL POSSESSION OF SHOWROOM No. 04 SF.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">RS,1,10,000/- AS COST OF LITIGATION.&nbsp;</span></p>',2500000.00,2430890.00,'2016-12-08 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>RESPONDENTS MAY BE DIRECTED TO DEPOSIT RS.10,65,630/- BEFORE THIS HON\'BLE AUTHORITY&nbsp; QUA ASSURED RETURN OF THE SHOWROOM SR-04SF, CITI CENTRE SECTOR 115 MOHALI FOR THE PERIOD 01.07.2016 TO 31.12.2018.</p>','1','','2012-06-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','SR-04SF, Citi Centre, Sector 115 Greater Mohali, Punjab','','',2,0,0,0,'advravinder','2019-01-08 11:54:49.000','advravinder','2019-01-08 11:54:49.000'),(826,1257,'1257',1328,'618de951-2d16-4aaf-8311-cb9ee983566e','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-08 16:47:29.000','Adhip Manchanda','manchandaadhip@gmail.com',9872458886,0,0,'#46 Air Force Enclave Dhakoli','',28,507,'160104','1','D-61 Phase-5 Industrial Area ','',28,507,'160055','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0091','M/S BABA BANDA SINGH BAHADUR  ENTERPRISES','SUKHCHAIN SINGH','bbsbikpmohali@gmail.com',9915322330,0,'H.B.NO 195','VILLAGE CHAPPARCHIRI KALAN SECTOR 92',28,507,'140307','1','H.B.NO 195','VILLAGE CHAPPARCHIRI KALAN SECTOR 92',28,507,'140307','1','<p>With due respect, I want to intimate that i have BOOKED ONE PLOT (NO. B-11) SIZE( 250 SQUARE YARDS) in the NAME of ADHIP MANCHANDA and AVISH MANCHANDA dated 14 APRIL 2014 in KNOWLEDGE PARK developed by M/S BABA BANDA SINGH BAHADUR (BBSB) ENTERPRISES. I have already submitted the 33% PAYMENT against booking of Plot as per BBSB ENTERPRISES conditions and also have the agreement copy, Provisional Allotment Letter and Receipts of the payments made by us.</p><p>But till date they have failed to give us possession of the plot, also if asked any question regarding this, they keep on giving us dates from past 4-5 years and mislead/ misguide us.</p><p>Now on the same land that we have agreement for, they have developed another project in the NAME of POSH CITY of residential township and MR. SUKHCHAIN has sold our land to ACME BUILDERS without any information given to us.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>','We want the same PLot with the same area as per the agreement.&nbsp;',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','We request you that we want the same plot at the same location for whivch we have the agreement copy, provisional allotment letter and the reciepts. As Mr. Sukhchain and Mr. Hoshiar singh has misguided us from last 4-5 years and had taken the money against that plot along with development charges.','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'Adhip@17','2019-01-08 12:14:46.000','Adhip@17','2019-01-08 12:14:46.000'),(827,1258,'1258',1119,'dae2bb68-2fa2-473d-a49d-c15de93bd3da','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','DAKSHA','advravinder@gmail.com',9815700280,0,0,'H. NO. 1/3 BIJAI PALACE (COLONY)','MANDI',14,382,'175001','1','ZIrakpur','MANDI',28,39,'140604','Ravinder Pal Singh','advravinder@gmail.com',9815700280,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PC0076','CITI CENTRE','ANSAL LOTUS MELANGE PROJECTS PVT. LTD.','info@almprojects.com',0,0,'SCO NO. 183-184, SECTOR 9-C, CHANDIGARH','',6,128,'160009','1','SCO NO. 183-184, SECTOR 9-C, CHANDIGARH','',6,128,'160009','1','<p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Respondents\r\ncame up with commercial project as CITI CENTRE at Sector 115 Mohali.<u1:p></u1:p></span>\r\nHusband of the complainant approached the Respondents for booking of one\r\nshowroom floated by the Respondent.<u1:p></u1:p>\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\">Respondents also allured the Complainant of ASSURED RETURNS on the amount\r\ninvested till the date of possession.<u1:p></u1:p>\r\nInitially complainant booked one showroom bearing No. 6UGF measuring 1772 sq.\r\nft. @ Rs.30,12,400/-.<u1:p></u1:p> </p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\">Agreement\r\nexecuted on 09.02.2010 (A-2)<u1:p></u1:p>\r\nComplainant deposited Rs.28,61,780/- on 30.01.2010.<u1:p></u1:p>\r\nAgreement executed on 09.02.2010 promising possession within 42 months maximum.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><u1:p></u1:p>Respondent\r\nwas liable to pay Rs.53,847/- per month which was paid by 31.03.2012.<u1:p></u1:p>\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\">Since the construction of the showroom was very slow complainant decided to\r\nshift in other showroom in same project.<u1:p></u1:p>\r\nRespondent offered two showrooms bearing no. 03SF and 04SF.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\">Complainant\r\npaid Rs.20,00,000/- more on 25.05.2012 jointly against both showrooms.<u1:p></u1:p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\">Price of each showroom was fixed as Rs.25,00,000/-. Each unit is measuring 1588\r\nsq. ft.<u1:p></u1:p> Complainant paid\r\ntotal Rs.48,61,780/- till date for both showrooms. Rs.24,30,890/- against each\r\nunit. Balance Rs.69,110/- to be paid on offer of possession which never offered\r\ntill date. </p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\">New Agreement of SF03 showroom executed on 08.06.2012&nbsp;\r\nwherein possession was to be given within 42 months maximum which expired on\r\n08.12.2016. As per new agreement Rs.1,06,563/- was to be paid as assured return\r\nper quarter per showroom (i.e. Rs.35,521/- per month).&nbsp;Assured Returns stopped after JULY, 2016\r\nviolating the terms of the agreement as well as provisions of RERA. </p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\">Construction\r\nhas been stopped in between. Possession not offered till date. Neither obtained\r\ncompletion and occupation certificates.<u1:p></u1:p>\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\">Respondents are in arrears of Rs.10,65,630/- (01.07.2016 to 31.12.2018) as ASSURED\r\nRETURN and they may be directed to deposit the said amount as interim measure.\r\nPresent application filed seeking possession of the Unit No.03SF alongwith\r\nassured returns till actual possession of unit.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><o:p></o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">SEEKING POSSESSION OF THE UNIT NO.\r\n03SF, CITI&nbsp; CENTRE PROJECT, SECTOR 115 MOHALI<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">ASSURED RETURN AMOUNTING TO\r\nRS.10,65,630/- DUE W.E.F. 01.07.2016 TILL 31.12.2018<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">FUTURE ASSURED RETURNS TILL ACTUAL\r\nPOSSESSION OF SHOWROOM No. 03 SF.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">RS,1,10,000/- AS COST OF LITIGATION.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',2500000.00,2430890.00,'2016-12-08 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">RESPONDENTS MAY BE DIRECTED TO\r\nDEPOSIT RS.10,65,630/- BEFORE THIS HON\'BLE AUTHORITY&nbsp; QUA ASSURED RETURN\r\nOF THE SHOWROOM SR-03 SF, CITI CENTRE SECTOR 115 MOHALI FOR THE PERIOD\r\n01.07.2016 TO&nbsp; 31.12.2018.</span><o:p></o:p></p>','1','','2012-06-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','SR-03 SF\r\n','','',2,0,0,0,'advravinder','2019-01-08 12:23:49.000','advravinder','2019-01-08 12:23:49.000'),(828,1200,'1200',1272,'51d11184-3a8e-4a16-9673-559a2472f6c0','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-08 15:52:13.000','Rajesh Verma','rajfine123@gmail.com',9991203671,0,0,'Flat no 515 tower b4 The Eminence','Zirakpur, distt s.a.s. nagar',28,507,'140603','1','Dena bank dera bassi','Ambala Chandigarh highway,dera bassi',28,507,'140507','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0396','SUSHMA VALENCIA','SUSHMA DEVELOPERS PVT. LTD.','ankitg@sushmabuildtech.com',0,0,'unit no b-107 business complex at elante mall,first floor','ind. area, phase 1,chandigarh 160009',6,128,'160009','1','unit no b-107 business complex at elante mall,first floor','ind. area, phase 1,chandigarh 160009',6,128,'160009','1','<p>&nbsp;</p><div>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px;\">I have \r\nbooked a flat in feb 2018 in sushma valencia( builder name is SUSHMA DEVELOPERS \r\nPVT. LTD, PBRERA-SAS80-PR0396) at price 62 lakh for which i have paid rs. 620000 \r\nto builder through cheques . I have requested them several times to issue me \r\nreceipts but every time neither they issued receipts nor done any agreement with \r\nme..........After a lot of harassment, i have decided to cancel the flat.for \r\ncancellation, builder issued me their own proforma for flat cancellation. I have \r\nsubmitted the affidavit with clauses (i),(ii) &amp; (iii), but they tampered \r\nthis affidavit and inserted clause (iv) to grab my hard earned money.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px;\">They have \r\nrefunded me rs. 525424/- and refused to pay remaining rs. 94576/- which is \r\ncompletely illegal and lawful...without receipts, without agreement,they should \r\nnot deduct .</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px;\">Please Please&nbsp;\r\nprovide me justice so that i can recover my hard earned money from builder.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px;\">Thanks and \r\nregards.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: roboto; font-size: 14px;\">Rajesh \r\nverma</p></div>','<p>&nbsp;1. My pending amount 94576 rs.</p><p>2. interest of rs. 620000 which builder has used for more than 8 months till now</p><p>3. mental harassment charges.</p><p>4. legal notice fee 2000 rs.&nbsp;</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>&nbsp;mentioned in point 5.</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'RAJESHVERMA3671','2019-01-08 15:52:03.000','RAJESHVERMA3671','2019-01-08 15:52:03.000'),(829,1259,'1259',1329,'d1170524-ff7f-4d19-8a8a-753468087d33','FormTypeM