ont-family: roboto, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">As per Agreement Dated: 06.08.2012, Clause 14 the\r\npossession date was 38 months from the date of execution of Agreement i.e.\r\n05.10.2015.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The respondents have failed to deliver the\r\npossession till date. The Complaints on assurance of respondents had sold their\r\nhouse property in home town – Chirkunda, Jharkhand on 24.05.2018 and have\r\nshifted permanently in a rental accomodation at Flat No: 201, HEWO Apartments,\r\nSector 6, Mansa Devi Complex, Panchkula.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The complaints are aggrieved party. The respondents\r\nhave failed to address their grievances for delay in possession for more than 3\r\nyears. A Legal notice was also served to them in his context on 15.07.2018. The\r\nrespondents had shown no interest to our complaint and have adopted a very\r\nindifferent attitude.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">That due to the deficiency in service on the part of the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;resulting into a big&nbsp;harassment,&nbsp;tension&nbsp;and&nbsp;apprehension&nbsp;as well as monetary loss, the complainants are entitled to the&nbsp;following&nbsp;reliefs from the&nbsp;respondents:</span></p><ol><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: -18pt;\">IMMEDIATE POSSESSION of the fully developed&nbsp;apartment&nbsp;as promised by the&nbsp;respondents.</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p>INTEREST PART: Interest&nbsp;minimum @12%&nbsp;on the&nbsp;entire amount deposited by the complainants on the date of deposit till the date of offer of possession.</o:p></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;had charged interest @24% PA for the period of delay in the payment of installments of the consideration price of the&nbsp;apartment</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">RENT &amp; MAINTENANCE:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Amount of rent and&nbsp;maintenance&nbsp;charges paid / to be paid by the complaint in respect of the rented flat where they are presently residing from 01.05.2018, till the date of handing over the possession of the&nbsp;apartment.</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">LOSS OF INCOME TAX REBATE ON HOME LOAN:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Rs. 78,180/- on account of loss of rebate on the interest paid on the&nbsp;housing&nbsp;loan from India Bulls due to non-delivery of&nbsp;possession&nbsp;by the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;for the years 2016-17 and&nbsp;2017-18 as well as for the period till the date of offering of&nbsp;possession&nbsp;of the&nbsp;apartment.</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">GST:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;to be asked to pay the difference of the amount of Service tax &amp; the GST payable on the&nbsp;balance&nbsp;consideration&nbsp;amount.</span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.8pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">It is therefore prayed that the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;be directed to give the above mention reliefs to the complainants as the&nbsp;complaints&nbsp;are entitled to the above said relief in&nbsp;lieu&nbsp;of the facts and circumstances explained.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.8pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">PLEASE NOTE: WE HAVE ALSO FILED FOR OTHER RELIEFS UNDER FORM - N AS THE NEW RERA RULES</span></p>',6850000.00,6360329.00,'2015-10-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">RELIEFS SOUGHT:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><ol><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: -18pt;\">IMMEDIATE POSSESSION of the fully developed&nbsp;apartment&nbsp;as promised by the&nbsp;respondents.</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p>INTEREST PART: Interest&nbsp;minimum @12%&nbsp;on the&nbsp;entire amount 