/ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">It is therefore prayed that the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;be directed to\r\ngive the above mention reliefs to the complainants as\r\nthe&nbsp;complaints&nbsp;are entitled to the above said relief\r\nin&nbsp;lieu&nbsp;of the facts and circumstances explained.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">PLEASE NOTE: WE HAVE ALSO FILED FOR OTHER RELIEFS UNDER FORM - N AS THE NEW RERA RULES</span></p><ol><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;margin-left:32.2pt;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:\r\nnormal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;margin-left:32.2pt;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:\r\nnormal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p></li></ol>','1','','2012-08-06 00:00:00','2012-08-06 00:00:00','FLAT NO H10I 1ST FLOOR \r\nTOWER H SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE\r\nZIRAKPUR DISTT SAS NAGAR MOHALI ','','',2,0,0,0,'manjit305','2019-01-10 11:44:46.000','manjit305','2019-01-10 11:44:46.000'),(837,1191,'1191',1175,'fdc30a3a-7552-4e5c-8f07-8c6e1d95cb8c','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-10 13:37:19.000','Manjit Singh Chimni','amangr@gmail.com',9855999111,8873092885,409690247527,'Flat No 201, HEWO Apartments','MDC, Sector 6',13,15,'134114','1','Flat No 201, HEWO Apartments','MDC, Sector 6',13,15,'134114','VANEESH KHANNA','vaneeshkhanna@yahoo.co.in',9814301