an><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">It is </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">pertinent</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;to\r\nmention here that due to anxiety and </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">uncertainty</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;created by </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">respondents</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">, the\r\napplicant suffered heart attach and had to undergo angioplasty at Colombia Asia\r\nHospital Kolkata on 15.08.2017. The Complainants had taken </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Housing</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;loan from\r\nIndia Bulls and were entitled for rebate under IT Act @30% on the interest paid\r\non Rs. 1370000/- but since the possession has not been given the complainant\r\ncould not claim </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">the</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;set rebate. </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Since\r\nGST has been enacted the builders are insisting on GST@12% on balance pymt\r\nwhereas the </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">complaints</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;would have paid Service </span></font><a href=\"mailto:Tax@4.5%25\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Tax@4.5%</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\nhad they given the possession on time. A Legal notice was also served to them\r\nin his context on 15.07.2018. The respondents had shown no interest to our\r\ncomplaint and have adopted a very indifferent attitude. The complaints have\r\nbeen regularly visiting the site and the head office since 2015.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">That due to the deficiency in service on the part of the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;resulting into a big&nbsp;harassment,&nbsp;tension&nbsp;and&nbsp;apprehension&nbsp;as well as monetary loss, the complainants are entitled to the&nbsp;following&nbsp;reliefs from the&nbsp;respondents:</span></p><ol><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: -18pt;\">IMMEDIATE POSSESSION of the fully developed&nbsp;apartment&nbsp;as promised by the&nbsp;respondents.</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p>INTEREST PART: Interest&nbsp;minimum @12%&nbsp;on the&nbsp;entire amount deposited by the complainants on the date of deposit till the date of offer of possession.</o:p></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;had charged interest @24% PA for the period of delay in the payment of installments of the consideration price of the&nbsp;apartment</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">RENT &amp; MAINTENANCE:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Amount of rent and&nbsp;maintenance&nbsp;charges paid / to be paid by the complaint in respect of the rented flat where they are presently residing from 01.05.2018, till the date of handing over the possession of the&nbsp;apartment.</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">LOSS OF INCOME TAX REBATE ON HOME LOAN:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Rs. 78,180/- on account of loss of rebate on the interest paid on the&nbsp;housing&nbsp;loan from India Bulls due to non-delivery of&nbsp;possession&nbsp;by the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;for the years 2016-17 and&nbsp;2017-18 as well as for the period till the date of offering of&nbsp;possession&nbsp;of the&nbsp;apartment.</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">GST:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;to be asked to pay the difference of the amount of Service tax &amp; the GST payable on the&nbsp;balance&nbsp;consideration&nbsp;amount.</span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.8pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">It is therefore prayed that the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;be directed to give the above mention reliefs to the complainants as the&nbsp;complaints&nbsp;are entitled to the above said relief in&nbsp;lieu&nbsp;of the facts and circumstances explained.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.8pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">PLEASE NOTE: WE HAVE ALSO FILED FOR OTHER RELIEFS UNDER FORM - N AS THE NEW RERA RULES</span></p>',6850000.00,6360329.00,'2015-10-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">RELIEFS SOUGHT:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><ol><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: -18pt;\">IMMEDIATE POSSESSION of the fully developed&nbsp;apartment&nbsp;as promised by the&nbsp;respondents.</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p>INTEREST PART: Interest&nbsp;minimum @12%&nbsp;on the&nbsp;entire amount deposited by\r\nthe complainants on the date of deposit till the date of offer of possession.</o:p></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;had\r\ncharged interest @24% PA for the period of delay in the payment of installments\r\nof the consideration price of the&nbsp;apartment</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">RENT &amp; MAINTENANCE:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Amount of rent\r\nand&nbsp;maintenance&nbsp;charges paid / to be paid by the complaint in respect\r\nof the rented flat where they are presently residing from 01.05.2018, till the\r\ndate of handing over the possession of the&nbsp;apartment.</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">LOSS OF INCOME TAX REBATE ON HOME LOAN:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Rs. 78,180/- on\r\naccount of loss of rebate on the interest paid on the&nbsp;housing&nbsp;loan from India Bulls due to non-delivery of&nbsp;possession&nbsp;by the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;for\r\nthe years 2016-17 and&nbsp;2017-18 as well as for the period till the date of\r\noffering of&nbsp;possession&nbsp;of the&nbsp;apartment.</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">GST:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;to\r\nbe asked to pay the difference of the amount of Service tax &amp; the GST\r\npayable on the&nbsp;balance&nbsp;consideration&nbsp;amount.</span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">It is therefore prayed that the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;be directed to\r\ngive the above mention reliefs to the complainants as\r\nthe&nbsp;complaints&nbsp;are entitled to the above said relief\r\nin&nbsp;lieu&nbsp;of the facts and circumstances explained.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">PLEASE NOTE: WE HAVE ALSO FILED FOR OTHER RELIEFS UNDER FORM - N AS THE NEW RERA RULES</span></p><ol><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;margin-left:32.2pt;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:\r\nnormal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;margin-left:32.2pt;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:\r\nnormal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p></li></ol>','1','','2012-08-06 00:00:00','2012-08-06 00:00:00','FLAT NO H10I 1ST FLOOR \r\nTOWER H SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE\r\nZIRAKPUR DISTT SAS NAGAR MOHALI ','','',1,1,0,0,'manjit305','2019-01-10 13:36:37.000','manjit305','2019-01-10 13:36:37.000'),(838,1262,'1262',1335,'77ccbba8-e0a7-4588-99a6-06679fd06bb3','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-10 18:01:01.000','Dharam Singh','dimingexorcism@gmail.com',9815385019,0,0,'#99/12','Phase-9',28,507,'160062','1','#99/12','Phase-9',28,507,'160062','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0091','M/S BABA BANDA SINGH BAHADUR ENTERPRISES','SUKHCHAIN SINGH','bbsbikpmohali@gmail.com',9915322330,0,'H.B. NO. 195','VILLAGE CHAPPARCHIRI KALAN SECTOR 92',28,507,'140307','1','H.B. NO. 195','VILLAGE CHAPPARCHIRI KALAN SECTOR 92',28,507,'140307','1','<p>With due respect , I want to intimate that I have booked one plot (no A-1) Size (250 SQ yds) in the name of Mr. DHARAM SINGH dated 22-04-2015 Knowledge park developed by M/s Baba Banda Singh Bahadur(BBSB) Enterprises. I have alredy submitted 30% payment against booking of plot as per BBSB enterprises condition and also have agreement copy , allotment copy and the receipts of the payment made by us.</p><p><br></p><p>But till date they have failed to give us possession of the plot, also asked any question regarding this they keep on giving us the dates from past 4 years and misleads and misguided us.</p><p><br></p><p>Now on the same land that we have agreement for , they have developed another project in the name of POSH CITY of residential township and M/S Sukhchain Singh sold a land to ACME BUILDER with any information given to us.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>','<p>We want the same plot with the same area as per the agreement.<br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>We request to that we want the same plot as the same location for which we have the agreement copy and the receipts as Mr Sukhchain Singh and Mr Hosihar Singh has misguided us from last 4 years and had taken the money against the plot along with development charges.<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'MUNDI@1','2019-01-10 15:01:37.000','MUNDI@1','2019-01-10 15:01:37.000'),(839,1263,'1263',1237,'c6fe9702-458d-4d27-93ad-948d5689b68f','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Preet Inder Singh','pisbhatia461@gmail.com',9501000044,0,0,'HOUSE NO 461','SECTOR 44A',6,128,'160047','1','HOUSE NO 461','SECTOR 44A',6,128,'160047','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PRO261_','BAJWA DEVELOPERS','BALDEV SINGH','bajwadevelopers2011@gmail.com',0,0,'2552, SUNNY ENCLAVE','SECTOR 125',28,507,'140301','1','2552, SUNNY ENCLAVE','SECTOR 125',28,507,'140301','1','<p>I HAD PURCHASED A 3 BHK FLAT NO 3609 OF 1400 SQ FEET IN E35 SUNNY HEIGHTS AND MADE FULL AND FINAL PAYMENT TO M/S BAJWA DEVELOPERS LTD IN APRIL/MAY 2017 AND I WAS ISSUED A NDC BY THE SAID BUILDER ON 27/05/2017(COPY ATTACHED).I HAD EVEN PAID THE APPLICABLE SERVICE TAX AS DESIRED BY THE DEVELOPER.I WAS ASSURED THAT THE POSSESSION WILL BE GIVEN WITHIN 03 MONTHS.INSPITE OF THE VARIOUS VISITS TO THE DEVELOPERS OFFICE AND VERBAL ASSURANCES GIVEN BY THE CONCERNED PERSONS IN THE DEVELOPERS OFFICE.THE POSSESSION HAS STILL NOT BEEN GIVEN. I ALSO WROTE A LETTER DATED 28/03/2018 TO THE DEVELOPER BUT NOTHING HAS BEEN DONE TILL DATE. A CURRENT VISIT TO THE SAID SITE ALSO REVEALED THAT THE POSSESSION IS STILL FAR AWAY GIVEN THE STATE OF CONSTRUCTION/COMPLETION OF THE PROJECT TILL DATE.</p>','<p>1) EITHER ASSURED POSSESSION OF THE FLAT OR COMPENSATION BY WAY OF ADJUSTING MONEY PAID TOWARDS ALLOTTING AND GIVING POSSESSION IN SOME FULLY COMPLETED FLAT OR PLOT...OR</p><p>2) REFUND OF MONEY PAID WITH APPLICABLE INTEREST.</p>',2700000.00,2821500.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>1) IMMEDIATE PAYMENT OF INTEREST ON THE AMOUNT PAID</p><p>2) ALLOTTING SOME OTHER FULLY COMPLETED FLAT OR A PLOT</p>','1','','2017-05-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','3609, E35, SUNNY HEIGHTS','','',1,0,0,0,'pirochak','2019-01-10 20:27:47.000','pirochak','2019-01-10 20:27:47.000'),(840,1156,'1156',1237,'c6fe9702-458d-4d27-93ad-948d5689b68f','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-11 09:34:36.000','Preet Inder Singh','pisbhatia461@gmail.com',9501000044,0,0,'HOUSE NO 461','SECTOR 44A',6,128,'160047','1','HOUSE NO 461','SECTOR 44A',6,128,'160047','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PRO261_','BAJWA DEVELOPERS LTD','BALDEV SINGH','bajwadevelopers2011@gmail.com',0,0,'2552, sunny enclave','sector 125',28,507,'140301','1','2552, sunny enclave','sector 125',28,507,'140301','1','<p>I HAD PURCHASED A 3 BHK FLAT NO 3609 OF 1400 SQ FEET IN E35 SUNNY HEIGHTS AND MADE FULL AND FINAL PAYMENT TO M/S BAJWA DEVELOPERS LTD IN APRIL/MAY 2017 AND I WAS ISSUED A NDC BY THE SAID BUILDER ON 27/05/2017.(COPY ATTACHED) I HAD EVEN PAID THE APPLICABLE SERVICE TAX ALSO AS DESIRED BY THE DEVELOPER. </p><p>I WAS ASSURED THAT THE POSSESSION WILL BE GIVEN WITHIN 03 MONTHS.INSPITE OF VARIOUS VISTS TO THE DEVELOPERS OFFICE AND VERBAL ASSURANCES GIVEN BY THE CONCERNED PERSONS IN THE DEVELOPERS OFFICE, THE POSSESSION HAS STILL NOT BEEN GIVEN.I ALSO WROTE A LETTER DATED 28/03/2018 TO THE DEVELOPER BUT NOTHING HAS BEEN DONE IN THIS REGARD. NO INTIMATION HAS BEEN GIVEN TO ME TILL DATE.</p><p>A CURRENT VISIT TO THE SITE ALSO REVEALS THAT THE POSSESSION IS STILL NOT POSSIBLE GIVEN THE STATE OF CONSTRUCTION/COMPLETION OF THE PROJECT TILL DATE.</p>','<p>1) EITHER ASSURED POSSESSION OF THE FLAT OR COMPENSATION BY WAY OF ADJUSTING MONEY PAID TOWARDS ALLOTTING AND GIVING POSSESSION SOME OTHER FULLY COMPLETED FLAT OR SOME PLOT....</p><p>OR</p><p>2) REFUND OF THE MONEY PAID WITH APPLICABLE INTEREST</p>',2700000.00,2821500.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>1) IMMEDIATE PAYMENT OF INTEREST ON THE AMOUNT PAID</p><p>2) ALLOTTING SOME OTHER FULLY COMPLETED FLAT OR SOME PLOT</p>','1','','2017-05-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','3609, E35, SUNNY HEIGHTS','','',2,0,0,0,'pirochak','2019-01-11 09:34:29.000','pirochak','2019-01-11 09:34:29.000'),(841,1264,'1264',1010,'a182232b-88d6-4711-8baa-f8a026fb675f','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-14 13:39:24.000','SUNDAR KRISHNAN','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988100005,1724181010,434498329217,'#102, Sector 10 A','',6,128,'160011','1','#102, Sector 10 A','',6,128,'160011','HIMANSHU RAJ','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988200001,1724190909,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0013','ATS GOLF MEADOWS-I','ATS ESTATES PRIVATE LIMITED','pradeep.rathee@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'711/92, DEEPALI','NEHRU PLACE, NEW DELHI',10,429,'110019','1','711/92, DEEPALI','NEHRU PLACE, NEW DELHI',10,429,'110019','1','<p>The complainant had booked a plot measuring 350 SQ. YARD at OPs project ATS GOLF MEADOWS I in the year 2005. That it is pertinent to mention here that OP did not possess any of the requisite clearances license from the competent authority to develop the said project at that time The complainant has paid the COMPLETE AMOUNT against the said unit to the Opposite Party in the year 2005.&nbsp;</p><p>That on 03.11.2009 the OP furnished an ALLOTMENT LETTER and allotted a plot to the complainant measuring 388.11 Sq. Yard, indentified by unique No. 120 in the said project. That it is pertinent to mention here that the OP had arbitrarily reduced the area of the plot which was booked. That the OP promised through verbal assurance and Verbal Agreement that the possession will be handed over to the complainant by 03.11.2011, i.e. 2 years from the date of allotment, but Op failed to do so. That the OP had raised a Demand for EDC from the complainant at exorbitant rate after the expiry of deemed date of possession 8 years after the date of booking. That OP had threatened to cancel the allotment and deduct the Earnest money if the demanded EDC is not paid. The complainant complied with the demands of OP and deposited the amount against EDC but till date the possession of the unit has not been handed over.&nbsp;</p><p>Therefore, the complainant craves the indulgence of the Honble RERA authority to hand to direct the OP to refund the entire amount as per the RERA CENTRAL ACT AND RERA STATE RULES.</p>','<p>1.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to compensate the complainant in the shape of refund the complete amount which has been deposited against the residential property so booked by the complainant along with an Interest on the amount from the date of deposit at the rate of 20 per cent&nbsp; till the actual realization of the complete amount within 90 days according to section 18 1 Real Estate Regulation And Development Act, 2016, 18 2 Real Estate Regulation And Development Act, 2016, Section 19 4 of The Real Estate Regulation And Development Act, 2016, r w Rule 16 and Rule 17 of Punjab State Real Estate Regulation and Development Rules, 2017</p><p><br></p><p>2.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs. 20,00,000&nbsp; for causing mental agony caused to the complainant.</p><p><br></p><p>3.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs. 14,00,000 to the complainant as the deficiency in services for keeping the complainant in dark in regard to the progress of the property.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>4.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span> To direct the OP to pay Rs. 14,00,000&nbsp; for causing physical harassment caused to the complainant.</p><p><br></p><p>5.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay 5 per cent of the total estimated cost of the project under section 61 of Real Estate Regulation and Development Act, 2016</p><p><br></p><p>6.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To revoke the license of the OP under section 7 of the Real Estate Regulation and Development act, 2016.</p><p><br></p><p>Any other relief or claim which the Honble Authority deems appropriate.</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Not Prayed</p>','1','','2009-11-03 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2019-01-11 15:24:33.000','lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2019-01-11 15:24:33.000'),(842,1265,'1265',1325,'ba7e9568-25c6-4f4e-80be-eab9afc56f7a','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','SANDEEP BANSAL','bansalz@gmail.com',9212014142,1143592524,0,'B-3/9','JANAK PURI',10,562,'110058','1','B-3/9','JANAK PURI',10,562,'110058','SHYAM LAL BANSAL','slbansal4242@gmail.com',9899171794,1143592524,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','EMAAR MGF LAND LIMITED','EMAAR MGF LAND LIMITED','feedback@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'SCO 120','SECTOR 17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 120','SECTOR 17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p>That earlier the complaint case was filed on 06TH OCTOBER 2017 on N Form bearing no AO 07 2017 before the Adjudicating Officer Claiming</p><p>Return of the amount deposited by the complainant with the respondent along with interest and hence complaints in which this relief is claimed should be filed under Form M and will be decided by the Authority or its Concerned Bench</p><p>Vide order dated 28TH NOVEMBER 2018 passed by the Adjudicating Officer to return the complaint with the liberty to file a fresh complaint before the Authority hence fresh case complaint is submitted with following details Annexure P1</p><p>That apartment booked on dated 12TH AUGUST 2006 with Emaar MGF Land Limited in the VIEWS at Mohali Hills Sector 105 SAS Nagar District Mohali&nbsp; Punjab</p><p>That vide apartment allotment letter dated 06th APRIL 2007 for Unit No F3 502 on 5th Floor Annexure P3 Unit Code TVM F3 F05 502</p><p>Builder Buyers Agreement signed between both the parties on 14TH MARCH 2008 Annexure P4</p><p>That the possession was committed by the Builder&nbsp; within 36 months with 6 months grace period from the date of allotment letter dated 06TH APRIL 2007 as per agreement clause 21 1 of the Builder Buyers Agreement ie upto 06TH OCTOBER 2010</p><p>That Apartment cost is Rs 4727150 as per schedule of payment at page no 44 of the Builder Buyers Agreement and after allowing 5 percent basic installment waived off payment on time Apartment cost comes to Rs 4506817 Rs 4727150 Less Rs 220333 waived off amount</p><p>Total amount paid Rs 4132278 Annexure P5 upto 13TH DECEMBER 2013 thereafter no construction activities were done by the builder at the site</p>','<p>As per the Builder Buyers Agreement clause no 21 1 Annexure P4 builder failed to handover the possession as per commitments dated 06TH DECEMBER 2010 so far I have not been offered possession which is violation of the Obligation and Responsibilities of sale agreement</p><p>I being an aggrieved person filed a complaint under section 31 with the Authority for violation and contravention of provisions of this Act as mentioned in Section 31 of RERA Act 2016</p><p>Keeping in view the present status of the project and intervening circumstances The complainant cannot wait for possession indefinite period already delayed 98 months and suffered huge financial losses</p><p>I intend to withdraw from the project and as per section 18 1 of the Real Estate Regulation and Development of the Act 2016 I have made a demand to the promoter to return the amount received by him in respect of the apartment allotted to me along with interest at the rate of 15 percent per anuum compounded quarterly as per agreement clause 21 10 2 page no 30 moreover promoter EMAAR MGF enhanced delayed payment interest at the rate of 24 percent per annum from the allottee wef 01ST JANUARY 2009 as evident exhibit P 10 The promoter has failed to return the amount received by him along with the interest which is an obligation on the promoter as per section 18 1 I reserve my rights to seek compensation from the promoter for which I made separate application to the adjudicating officer</p>',4727150.00,4132278.00,'2010-04-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Pending final decision on the complaint the complainant seeks issue of the following interim order</p><p>To pay the arrears of the interest accrued so far shall be paid to the complainant within 30 days from the date of issuance of this order and thereafter monthly payment of interest till return the amount paid by the complainant</p><div><br></div>','1','','2007-04-06 00:00:00','2008-03-14 00:00:00','UNIT NO F3 502 THE VIEWS MOHALI HILLS SECTOR 105 SAS NAGAR','','',1,0,0,0,'SANDEEPBANSAL','2019-01-11 15:36:22.000','SANDEEPBANSAL','2019-01-11 15:36:22.000'),(843,1266,'1266',1325,'ba7e9568-25c6-4f4e-80be-eab9afc56f7a','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-15 19:12:51.000','SANDEEP BANSAL','bansalz@gmail.com',9212014142,1143592524,560059476998,'B-3/9','JANAK PURI',10,562,'110058','1','B-3/9','JANAK PURI',10,562,'110058','SHYAM LAL BANSAL','slbansal4242@gmail.com',9899171794,1143592524,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','EMAAR MGF LAND LIMITED','EMAAR MGF LAND LIMITED','feedback@emaarmgf.com',0,1723314800,'SCO 120','Sector 17C 2nd Floor Cabin No 203',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 120','Sector 17C 2nd Floor Cabin No 203',6,128,'160017','1','<p>That earlier the complaint case was filed on 06TH OCTOBER 2017 on N Form bearing no AO 07 2017 before the Adjudicating Officer Claiming</p><p>Return of the amount deposited by the complainant with the respondent along with interest and hence complaints in which this relief is claimed should be filed under Form M and will be decided by the Authority or its Concerned Bench</p><p>Vide order dated 28TH NOVEMBER 2018 passed by the Adjudicating Officer to return the complaint with the liberty to file a fresh complaint before the Authority hence fresh case complaint is submitted with following details Annexure P1</p><p>That apartment booked on dated 12TH AUGUST 2006 with Emaar MGF Land Limited in the VIEWS at Mohali Hills Sector 105 SAS Nagar District Mohali&nbsp; Punjab</p><p>That vide apartment allotment letter dated 06th APRIL 2007 for Unit No F3 502 on 5th Floor Annexure P3 Unit Code TVM F3 F05 502</p><p>Builder Buyers Agreement signed between both the parties on 14TH MARCH 2008 Anneuxre P4</p><p>That the possession was committed by the Builder&nbsp; within 36 months with 6 months grace period from the date of allotment letter dated 06TH APRIL 2007 as per agreement clause 21 1 of the Builder Buyers Agreement ie upto 06TH OCTOBER 2010</p><p>That Apartment cost is Rs 4727150 as per schedule of payment at page no 44 of the Builder Buyers Agreement and after allowing 5 percent basic installment waived off payment on time Apartment cost comes to Rs 4506817 Rs 4727150 Less Rs 220333 waived off amount</p><p>Total amount paid Rs 4132278 Annexure P5 upto 13TH DECEMBER 2013 thereafter no construction activities were done by the builder at the site</p>','<p>As per the Builder Buyers Agreement clause no 21 1 Annexure P4 builder failed to handover the possession as per commitments dated 06TH DECEMBER 2010 so far I have not been offered possession which is violation of the Obligation and Responsibilities of sale agreement</p><p>I being an aggrieved person filed a complaint under section 31 with the Authority for violation and contravention of provisions of this Act as mentioned in Section 31 of RERA Act 2016</p><p>Keeping in view the present status of the project and intervening circumstances The complainant cannot wait for possession indefinite period already delayed 98 months and suffered huge financial losses</p><p>I intend to withdraw from the project and as per section 18 1 of the Real Estate Regulation and Development of the Act 2016 I have made a demand to the promoter to return the amount received by him in respect of the apartment allotted to me along with interest at the rate of 15 percent per anuum compounded quarterly as per agreement clause 21 10 2 page no 30 moreover promoter EMAAR MGF enhanced delayed payment interest at the rate of 24 percent per annum from the allottee wef 01ST JANUARY 2009 as evident exhibit P 10 The promoter has failed to return the amount received by him along with the interest which is an obligation on the promoter as per section 18 1 I reserve my rights to seek compensation from the promoter for which I made separate application to the adjudicating officer</p>',4727150.00,4132278.00,'2010-04-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Pending final decision on the complaint the complainant seeks issue of the following interim order</p><p>To pay the arrears of the interest accrued so far shall be paid to the complainant within 30 days from the date of issuance of this order and thereafter monthly payment of interest till return the amount paid by the complainant</p>','1','','2007-04-06 00:00:00','2008-03-14 00:00:00','UNIT NO F3 502 THE VIEWS MOHALI HILLS SECTOR 105 SAS NAGAR','','',1,1,0,0,'SANDEEPBANSAL','2019-01-11 16:04:22.000','SANDEEPBANSAL','2019-01-11 16:04:22.000'),(844,1267,'1267',1338,'a14a6627-fb57-4589-90fb-ac52fbab3bc2','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','PRAVIN AGRAWAL','pravin_baa@yahoo.com',9648227755,0,0,'15/79(2)','CIVIL LINES',33,297,'208001','1','15/79(2)','CIVIL LINES',33,297,'208001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','WAVE ESTATE, BLOCK H','COUNTRY COLONISERS PVT LTD','rera@waveestate.in',7290015352,0,'P.O. Rayon and Silk Mills, adjoining Coca Cola Depot','GT Road, Chheharta',28,39,'143105','0','Sector 85','SAS Nagar',28,507,'160062','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">I booked a residential flat\r\n(Flat No. WG/H/0502) in Wave Garden, Sector 85, Mohali as per allotment letter\r\nDtd. 24/11/2012. As per Clause 5.1 of the allotment letter, possession of the\r\nflat was to be given by the builder within 36 months of the allotment i.e. upto\r\nNovember 2015. I have made total payment of Rs. 79,85,207/- towards the cost of\r\nFlat as per the demand of the builder. I wrote various letters, mails and had\r\ntelephonic conversation time to time to the company staff, to know about the\r\nstatus of the project. Company never responded and also never confirmed the\r\ndate of possession. Even after lapse of 6 years, project is still incomplete.\r\nFinally I vide my registered letter Dtd 26/07/2018, requested the company to\r\ncancel my flat booking and refund the total amount paid by me with interest but\r\nthe company is neither responding nor refunding the money.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1) Refund of\r\ntotal money deposited/paid by me to the Company against booking of Flat No.\r\nWG/H/0502.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">2) Payment of\r\nInterest @ 24% p.a. on the amount deposited/paid by me to the Company.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3) Payment of\r\ncompensation as per RERA Rules.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">4) Any other\r\nrelief as the Honourable Regulatory authority deem fit.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">As per reliefs sought in Point\r\nNo 5 above.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'PravinAgrawal','2019-01-12 11:17:55.000','PravinAgrawal','2019-01-12 11:17:55.000'),(845,1267,'1267',1338,'a14a6627-fb57-4589-90fb-ac52fbab