his mental agony, pain and harassment.</p><p>viii.Any other relief which this Hon’ble Authority deem fit and appropriate in view of the facts and circumstances of this complaint.</p><div><br></div>',55000.00,5425746.00,'2015-05-21 00:00:00.000','2015-05-21 00:00:00.000','<p>i.To direct the respondent not to demand any further amount whatsoever from the complainant.</p><p>ii.The respondent should be restrained from harassing the complainant in any manner whatsoever.</p><p>iii.Any other interim relief which this Hon’ble Authority deem fit and appropriate in view of the facts and circumstances of this complaint.</p><div><br></div>','1','','2017-10-11 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Apartment No 1502 Tower 5 Block D Floor 14 Type 2 Sector 88 Sahibzada Ajit Singh Nagar Punjab 140308','','',2,0,0,0,'kamalmakkar1','2019-01-13 12:34:50.000','kamalmakkar1','2019-01-13 12:34:50.000'),(860,1238,'1238',1316,'04ea4248-150e-4148-81b6-34afe1ec1b06','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Kamal Makkar','jurisaxisrera@gmail.com',9729902009,0,358412254419,'424 Sector 20 Kaithal','',13,9,'136027','1','424 Sector 20 Kaithal','',13,9,'136027','Kamal Dahiya','jurisaxisrera@gmail.com',9729902009,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0121','Purab Premium Apartments','Greater Mohali Area Development Authority','ce@gmada.gov.in',1722215512,0,'PUDA Bhawan Sector 62 District SAS Nagar Mohali ','',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA Bhawan Sector 62 District SAS Nagar Mohali ','',28,507,'160062','1','<p>Respondent opened scheme for public from 12.12.11 to 12.01.12 as Annexure C-1. The depicted salient features were as Annexure C-2. Respondent informed vide letter dated 23.03.2012 of the waiting list no. 65 &amp; complainant to submit the documents before 23.04.12 as Annexure C-3. Letter of intent for allotment was issued on 21.05.12 and tentative price was Rs 55,00,000. As per Para 3(II) delivery was to be within a period of 36 months from the date of issuance of the said letter. Possession date was 21.05