 ( Earlier knows as M/s Yellowstone infra pvt limited ) &amp; M/s GBP development agreement made which mentioned that  GBP is co developer for the purpose of selling ,marketing ,development ,construction &amp; execution of M/s Aeropolis  project, but the agreement made  have no where mentioned about the earlier allotees to whome the M/s Aeropolis infra ( Earlier knows as M/s Yellowstone infra pvt limited ) have not given possession of the plots since long even after getting the payment from the allotees who have invested.</p>','<p>With reference to the fact of the complaint, It is requested thru your goodself The company ( M/s Aeropolis infra ( Earlier knows as M/s Yellowstone infra pvt limited )</p><p><br></p><p>1.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The Allotees list should be displayed on rera site.</p><p>2.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The Annexure missing on the website also to be attached.</p><p>3.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The joint development action plan made between&nbsp; &nbsp;M/s&nbsp; Aeropolis infra ( Earlier knows as M/s Yellowstone infra pvt limited ) &amp; M/s GBP should also be update in Yellowstone website &amp; in turn should also be updated with Rera.</p><p>4.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The old allotees detail who have invested hard money since long with M/s Aeropolis infra ( Earlier known as M/s Yellowstone infra Pvt limited ) should also be mentioned about their treatment in M/s GBP agreement .</p><div><br></div>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>With reference to the fact of the complaint, It is requested thru your goodself The company ( M/s Aeropolis infra ( Earlier knows as M/s Yellowstone infra pvt limited )</p><p><br></p><p>1.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>The Allotees list should be displayed on rera site.</p><p>2.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>The Annexure missing on the website also to be attached.</p><p>3.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>The joint development action plan made between&nbsp; &nbsp;M/s&nbsp; Aeropolis infra ( Earlier knows as M/s Yellowstone infra pvt limited ) &amp; M/s GBP should also be update in Yellowstone website &amp; in turn should also be updated with Rera.</p><p>4.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>The old allotees detail who have invested hard money since long with M/s Aeropolis infra ( Earlier known as M/s Yellowstone infra Pvt limited ) should also be mentioned about their treatment in M/s GBP agreement .</p><div><br></div>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'Yellowstoneallotees','2019-01-16 13:54:56.000','Yellowstoneallotees','2019-01-16 13:54:56.000'),(881,1247,'1247',1273,'1dbf4637-f288-44fd-b82c-234353e5ccb8','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-20 17:10:31.000','SANJAY GOYAL','advrajivbhatia9@gmail.com',8847215131,0,0,'HOUSE NO. 44-45','CENTRAL TOWN, VILLAGE DAAD, POST OFFICE LALTON KALAN, PAKHOWAL ROAD',28,366,'141010','1','HOUSE NO. 44-45','CENTRAL TOWN, VILLAGE DAAD, POST OFFICE LALTON KALAN, PAKHOWAL ROAD',28,366,'141010','RAJIV K. BHATIA, ADVOCATE','advrajivbhatia9@gmail.com',9501814939,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0166','THE IMPERIAL GOLF ESTATE','M/s. Emerald Lands (India) Private Limited','ashok.sharma@imperialgolfestate.com',0,1244550340,'Registered office at 2nd Floor, C-8/1-A, Vasant Vihar, New Delhi-110057','',10,120,'110057','1','Registered office at 2nd Floor, C-8/1-A, Vasant Vihar, New Delhi-110057','',10,120,'110057','1','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">At that time of booking, respondent represented of having all sufficient\r\napprovals, clear ownership and clear and well approach from main\r\nLudhiana-Ferozpur Road as per master plan of Glada and is an approachable\r\nproject to live with 18 Hole Golf Course, 8ft. boundary wall with long trees\r\nbesides boundary, ultra modern club house with swimming pool and many more\r\nfacilities would be there. Complainant under their representation got booked a\r\nplot no. K-3, measuring 268.26 sq. yards on 30.10.2013 Plot was allotted to\r\ncomplainant by vide Allotment Letter dated 15.11.2013. BSP of the plot was Rs.\r\n36,21,510/- excluding EDC, IFSD,PLC and Golf Club Membership fee. Till date a\r\nsum of Rs. 18,00,000/- has already been paid by complainant which is almost 50%\r\nof the BSP. Respondent assured that complainant shall get the possession of the\r\nfully developed plot within 18 months from the date of allotment along with the\r\nentire basic amenities as per their broachers and advertisement. Possession of\r\nthe&nbsp; plot not delivered as per their commitments and as per their\r\npromises. No sign of development was observed as promised by respondents. Roads\r\nare in pathetic condition, internal roads are still unconstructed, there are no\r\nelectricity connection arrangements as well as basic amenities such as water,\r\nsewerage, park roads, boundary wall is not constructed as yet. Club house as\r\npromised by respondent at the time of booking is still not constructed. Further\r\nthere are no signs of 18 Hole Golf courses as promised by respondent. Revenue Rastas\r\nof the villages have not been yet acquired resulting which people of the\r\nvillage roaming within the township with their cattle as such there are\r\ninsufficient security arrangements have been made. Respondents were supposed to\r\nhandover the possession of said plot to complainant till March. 2015 but\r\ninspite of the lapse of almost 4 years, there is no development at site. Further\r\nno plot buyer agreement is executed till date.</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">In view of the factual matrix as mentioned above\r\nin para 4 of this complaint and in view of the facts that despite lapse of 4 years\r\n&nbsp;respondent even failed to get the plot buyer\r\nagreement executed with complainant and further failed to offer possession of the\r\ncomplete project alongwith all basic amenities as per their advertisement and brouchers\r\nand with clear approach from Ludhiana Ferozepur Road, complainant seeks kind indulgence\r\nof this Hon’ble Authority in granting following reliefs: 1. To refund the entire\r\namount paid by complainant i. e. </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:\r\nAR-SA\">Rs. 18,00,000/- (Rupees Eighteen Lac only)</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">\r\nalongwith interest @ 18% per annum from the date of respective payments till\r\nthe realization alongwith Rs.5 Lac as compensation for mental harassment\r\nsuffered by complainant and Rs.55,000/- cost of Litigation 2. Any other relief that\r\nthis Hon’ble Authority may deem fit and appropriate in view of the facts and circumstances\r\nof the present complaint.</span><br></p>',3621510.00,2300000.00,'2015-05-15 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>nil</p>','1','','2013-11-15 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','plot no. k-3, The Imperial Golf Estate, Ludhiana.','','',1,1,0,0,'advrajivbhatia9','2019-01-17 16:25:42.000','advrajivbhatia9','2019-01-17 16:25:42.000'),(882,1248,'1248',1273,'1dbf4637-f288-44fd-b82c-234353e5ccb8','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-20 17:14:32.000','RENU GOYAL','advrajivbhatia9@gmail.com',8847215131,0,0,'HOUSE NO. 44-45','CENTRAL TOWN, VILLAGE DAAD, POST OFFICE LALTON KALAN, PAKHOWAL ROAD',28,366,'141001','1','HOUSE NO. 44-45','CENTRAL TOWN, VILLAGE DAAD, POST OFFICE LALTON KALAN, PAKHOWAL ROAD',28,366,'141001','RAJIV K. BHATIA, ADVOCATE','advrajivbhatia9@gmail.com',9501814939,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0166','THE IMPERIAL GOLF ESTATE','M/s. Emerald Lands (India) Private Limited','ashok.sharma@imperialgolfestate.com',0,1244550340,'Registered office at 2nd Floor, C-8/1-A, Vasant Vihar, New Delhi-110057','',10,120,'110057','1','Registered office at 2nd Floor, C-8/1-A, Vasant Vihar, New Delhi-110057','',10,120,'110057','1','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">At that time of booking, respondent represented of having all sufficient\r\napprovals, clear ownership and clear and well approach from main\r\nLudhiana-Ferozpur Road as per master plan of Glada and is an approachable\r\nproject to live with 18 Hole Golf Course, 8ft. boundary wall with long trees\r\nbesides boundary, ultra modern club house with swimming pool and many more\r\nfacilities would be there. Complainant under their representation got booked a\r\nplot no. A-6, measuring 1982.04 sq. yards on 18.04.2013 Plot was allotted to\r\ncomplainant by vide Allotment Letter dated 26.06.2013. BSP of the plot was Rs. 2,67,57,540/-\r\nexcluding EDC, IFSD,PLC and Golf Club Membership fee. Till date a sum of Rs. 2,54,19,663/-\r\nhas already been paid by complainant which is almost 95% of the BSP. Plot buyer\r\nagreement was executed on 17.07.2013. Respondent agreed in clause 12.1 that\r\ncomplainant shall get the possession of the fully developed plot within 24\r\nmonths from the date of agreement along with the entire basic amenities as per\r\ntheir broachers and advertisement. Possession of the&nbsp; plot not delivered\r\nas per their commitments and as per their promises. No sign of development was\r\nobserved as promised by respondents. Roads are in pathetic condition, internal\r\nroads are still unconstructed, there are no electricity connection arrangements\r\nas well as basic amenities such as water, sewerage, park roads, boundary wall\r\nis not constructed as yet. Club house as promised by respondent at the time of\r\nbooking is still not constructed. Further there are no signs of 18 Hole Golf\r\ncourses as promised by respondent. Revenue Rastas of the villages have not been\r\nyet acquired resulting which people of the village roaming within the township\r\nwith their cattle as such there are insufficient security arrangements have\r\nbeen made. Respondents were supposed to handover the possession of said plot to\r\ncomplainant till july. 2015 but inspite of the lapse of almost 4 years, there\r\nis no development at site.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">In view of the factual matrix as mentioned above in\r\npara 4 of this complaint and in view of the facts that despite lapse of 4 years\r\n&nbsp;respondent even failed to get the plot buyer\r\nagreement executed with complainant and further failed to offer possession of the\r\ncomplete project alongwith all basic amenities as per their advertisement and brouchers\r\nand with clear approach from Ludhiana Ferozepur Road, complainant seeks kind indulgence\r\nof this Hon’ble Authority in granting following reliefs: 1. To refund the entire\r\namount paid by complainant i. e. </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Rs.\r\n2,54,19,663/-</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">\r\nalongwith interest @ 18% per annum from the date of respective payments till\r\nthe realization alongwith Rs.5 Lac as compensation for mental harassment\r\nsuffered by complainant and Rs.55,000/- cost of Litigation 2. Any other relief that\r\nthis Hon’ble Authority may deem fit and appropriate in view of the facts and circumstances\r\nof the present complaint.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',26757540.00,25419663.00,'2015-07-17 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NIL</p>','1','','2013-06-26 00:00:00','2013-07-17 00:00:00','Plot no. A-6, The Imperial Golf Estates, Ludhiana.','','',1,1,0,0,'advrajivbhatia9','2019-01-17 16:27:34.000','advrajivbhatia9','2019-01-17 16:27:34.000'),(883,1249,'1249',1273,'1dbf4637-f288-44fd-b82c-234353e5ccb8','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-20 17:19:19.000','MANJU GOYAL','advrajivbhatia9@gmail.com',8847215131,0,0,'HOUSE NO. 44-45','CENTRAL TOWN, VILLAGE DAAD, POST OFFICE LALTON KALAN, PAKHOWAL ROAD',28,366,'141001','1','HOUSE NO. 44-45','CENTRAL TOWN, VILLAGE DAAD, POST OFFICE LALTON KALAN, PAKHOWAL ROAD',28,366,'141001','RAJIV K. BHATIA, ADVOCATE','advrajivbhatia9@gmail.com',9501814939,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0166','THE IMPERIAL GOLF ESTATE','M/s. Emerald L