r\nas well as basic amenities such as water, sewerage, park roads, boundary wall\r\nis not constructed as yet. Club house as promised by respondent at the time of\r\nbooking is still not constructed. Further there are no signs of 18 Hole Golf\r\ncourses as promised by respondent. Revenue Rastas of the villages have not been\r\nyet acquired resulting which people of the village roaming within the township\r\nwith their cattle as such there are insufficient security arrangements have\r\nbeen made. Respondents were supposed to handover the possession of said plot to\r\ncomplainant till july. 2015 but inspite of the lapse of almost 4 years, there\r\nis no development at site.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">In view of the factual matrix as mentioned above in\r\npara 4 of this complaint and in view of the facts that despite lapse of 4 years\r\n&nbsp;respondent even failed to get the plot buyer\r\nagreement executed with complainant and further failed to offer possession of the\r\ncomplete project alongwith all basic amenities as per their advertisement and brouchers\r\nand with clear approach from Ludhiana Ferozepur Road, complainant seeks kind indulgence\r\nof this Hon’ble Authority in granting following reliefs: 1. To refund the entire\r\namount paid by complainant i. e. </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Rs.\r\n2,47,31,987/-</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">\r\nalongwith interest @ 18% per annum from the date of respective payments till\r\nthe realization alongwith Rs.5 Lac as compensation for mental harassment\r\nsuffered by complainant and Rs.55,000/- cost of Litigation 2. Any other relief that\r\nthis Hon’ble Authority may deem fit and appropriate in view of the facts and circumstances\r\nof the present complaint.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',26033670.00,24731987.00,'2015-07-17 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>nil</p>','1','','2013-06-26 00:00:00','2013-07-17 00:00:00','Plot no. A-5 The Imperial Golf  Estate, Ludhiana.','','',1,1,0,0,'advrajivbhatia9','2019-01-17 16:30:30.000','advrajivbhatia9','2019-01-17 16:30:30.000'),(884,1156,'1156',1237,'c6fe9702-458d-4d27-93ad-948d5689b68f','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-17 17:05:09.000','Preet Inder Singh','pisbhatia461@gmail.com',9501000044,0,0,'HOUSE NO 461','SECTOR 44A',6,128,'160047','1','HOUSE NO 461','SECTOR 44A',6,128,'160047','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0261','SUNNY HEIGHTS','BALDEV SINGH','bajwadevelopers2011@gmail.com',0,0,'2552, sunny enclave','sector 125',28,507,'140301','1','2552, sunny enclave','sector 125',28,507,'140301','1','<p>I HAD PURCHASED A 3 BHK FLAT NO 3609 OF 1400 SQ FEET IN E35 SUNNY HEIGHTS AND MADE FULL AND FINAL PAYMENT TO M/S BAJWA DEVELOPERS LTD IN APRIL/MAY 2017 AND I WAS ISSUED A NDC BY THE SAID BUILDER ON 27/05/2017.(COPY ATTACHED) I HAD EVEN PAID THE APPLICABLE SERVICE TAX ALSO AS DESIRED BY THE DEVELOPER. </p><p>I WAS ASSURED THAT THE POSSESSION WILL BE GIVEN WITHIN 03 MONTHS.INSPITE OF VARIOUS VISTS TO THE DEVELOPERS OFFICE AND VERBAL ASSURANCES GIVEN BY THE CONCERNED PERSONS IN THE DEVELOPERS OFFICE, THE POSSESSION HAS STILL NOT BEEN GIVEN.I ALSO WROTE A LETTER DATED 28/03/2018 TO THE DEVELOPER BUT NOTHING HAS BEEN DONE IN THIS REGARD. NO INTIMATION HAS BEEN GIVEN TO ME TILL DATE.</p><p>A CURRENT VISIT TO THE SITE ALSO REVEALS THAT THE POSSESSION IS STILL NOT POSSIBLE GIVEN THE STATE OF CONSTRUCTION/COMPLETION OF THE PROJECT TILL DATE.</p>','<p>1) EITHER ASSURED POSSESSION OF THE FLAT OR COMPENSATION BY WAY OF ADJUSTING MONEY PAID TOWARDS ALLOTTING AND GIVING POSSESSION SOME OTHER FULLY COMPLETED FLAT OR SOME PLOT....</p><p>OR</p><p>2) REFUND OF THE MONEY PAID WITH APPLICABLE INTEREST</p>',2700000.00,2821500.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>1) IMMEDIATE PAYMENT OF INTEREST ON THE AMOUNT PAID</p><p>2) ALLOTTING SOME OTHER FULLY COMPLETED FLAT OR SOME PLOT</p>','1','','2017-05-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','3609, E35, SUNNY HEIGHTS','','',1,1,0,0,'pirochak','2019-01-17 17:05:00.000','pirochak','2019-01-17 17:05:00.000'),(885,1272,'1272',1348,'9e6eb098-b2d6-4eb1-9a76-81729ebe6097','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Ramphal Mahla','sanchitpunia@yahoo.in',9812169608,0,0,'1509, Phase 10, SAS Nagar','',28,507,'160062','1','1509, Phase 10, SAS Nagar','',28,507,'160062','Sanchit Punia','sanchitpuniadvocate@gmail.com',9780181988,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0116','IT CITY Mohali SAS Nagar, 750 Plot Scheme','Greater Mohali Area Development Authority','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62, SAS Nagar','',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62, SAS Nagar','',28,507,'160062','1','<p><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\nRoboto;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:\r\nAR-SA\">Respondent invited application for allotment of Plots bearing size\r\n256.66 Sq. Yds. under 750 residential Plots in IT City S.A.S Nagar, Mohali as\r\nAnnexure C-1.&nbsp;The Brochure(C-1)&nbsp;at page number 14 specifically\r\ncontain&nbsp;under the heading&nbsp;of Ownership and Possession (clause 2) that\r\nPhysical Possession will be given within one year from the date of issuance of\r\nLetter of intent. &nbsp;&nbsp;As per schedule draw of plots held on 21.09.2016\r\nand accordingly Neha D/o Rajesh Kumar was declared successful in category \'A\'\r\nvide serial number 90. Consequentially the letter of intent dated 11.11.2016\r\nwas issued in favour of Neha vide application number 3880 measuring 256.66 Sq.\r\nyard. in 750 Plot Scheme as Annexure C-2. As per clause 15 of terms and\r\nconditions in the letter&nbsp;of intent the physical possession of the plot was\r\nto be handed over within one year from the date of letter&nbsp;of intent i.e.\r\n11.11.2017. Thereafter Neha D/o Rajesh Kumar submitted an application for\r\ntransfer in the name of Menu Sethi W/o Manoj Sethi and&nbsp;consequentially\r\nvide letter dated 02.11.2017&nbsp;letter of intent was transferred in favour of\r\nMenu Sethi as Annexure C-3 with same terms and conditions. Further&nbsp;Menu\r\nSethi applied for transfer of letter&nbsp;of intent in favour of complainant as\r\nAnnexure C-4. Accordingly vide letter dated 17.07.2018 letter of intent number\r\n51493 dated 11.11.2016 was transferred in the favour of complainant as Annexure\r\nC-5 with same terms and condition as was annexed with 11.11.2016. It would be\r\njustify to mention here that complainant had pad Rs. 57,57,013/- till date and\r\nfor the kind perusal of the Hon\'ble Authority the ledge is annexed as Annexure\r\nC- 6. The sole grievance of the complainant is that respondent failed to\r\ndeliver the physical possession within a period of one year as per clause 15 of\r\nterms and condition of letter of intent (Page 27) and is\r\narbitrarily&nbsp;charging 12% interest on the instalments with 18%&nbsp;Penal\r\nInterest, being un-lawful and arbitrary.&nbsp;</span><br></p>','<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\nRoboto;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">I)\r\nRespondent may be directed to refund the un-lawful interest (including Penal\r\nInterest) so charged by the them after the lapse of&nbsp;deemed dated\r\n(11.11.2017) of handing over physical possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\nRoboto;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">ii)\r\nRespondent may be directed to pay 18%&nbsp;interest on the submitted amount due\r\nto delay in possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\nRoboto;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">ii) Respondent\r\nshould be directed to&nbsp;charge interest at law rate and&nbsp;refund the\r\nexcessive&nbsp;interest amount&nbsp;so charged till date. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\nRoboto;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">iii)\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;Respondent may be directed to refund all the amount with&nbsp;18 %\r\ninterest. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\nRoboto;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">iv)\r\nRespondent may be directed to hand over the Physical Possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; 