height:115%\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Registration granted under section 5 of the Real\r\nEstate (Regulation and Development) Act, to the respondent may kindly be\r\nrevoked&nbsp;under Section 7(1) (d) of this act&nbsp;as the respondent promoter\r\nis indulges in unfair and fraudulent practices&nbsp;by cheating the applicant,\r\nafter preparing many documents and by not providing any clear information to\r\nthe applicant regarding the policy/procedure adopted by the company&nbsp;and\r\nhad created loss to the state exchequer by not paying the legal state\r\ntaxes.&nbsp;Respondent be directed to pay the actual balance amount of land\r\n(i.e. Rs. 6 Crore) purchased from the applicant along with interest, as\r\napplicant does not want to take any plot from them. Further compensation on\r\naccount of delaying the payment of the applicant by preparing false documents\r\njust to commit fraud with the applicant and the state as per the Rules of\r\nPunjab State Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Rules which provides\r\nState Bank of India highest marginal cost of lending rate plus 2% from the\r\nrespective date of deposit made by the complainants. Further directions may\r\nkindly be issued to the respondents to pay Rs. 10 Lacs to the applicant for\r\nmental and physical harassment and on the account of the deficiency in the\r\nservices and unfair trade practice committed by the respondents.&nbsp;Further\r\ndirections may kindly be issued to the respondents to pay Rs. 1,00,000/- on\r\naccount of litigation charges to the applicant.&nbsp;It is further prayed that\r\nthis Hon\'ble Tribunal may grant any other relief, which it deems fit and\r\nproper, in the facts and circumstances of the present case, in the interest of\r\njustice, equity and fair play.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',39000000.00,37301044.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Bank\r\nAccounts of the Respondent may kindly be freezed during the pendency of present\r\npetition.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Sale\r\nand purchase of Plots/Flats constructed therein the project of the respondent may\r\nkindly be stopped.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Respondent\r\nmay kindly be directed not to alter in the land or may be stopped from creating\r\nany third party right over the land in dispute.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n13.0pt;line-height:115%\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','2012-05-29 00:00:00','2011-11-21 00:00:00','R-1/C/209,R-1/C/210,R-1/C/211,R-1/C/212 DLF HYDE PARK, ESTATE PROJECT, NEW CHANDIGARH','','',2,0,0,0,'AGAM','2019-01-20 12:00:45.000','AGAM','2019-01-20 12:00:45.000'),(890,1274,'1274',1352,'de2bf970-ae4b-4e02-b522-259c28a4be8e','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','yellowstoneallotees yellowstoneallotees','yellowstoneallotees@gmail.com',9316132795,0,0,'yellowstoneallotees  ','1759 Phase 5',28,507,'160059','1','yellowstoneallotees  ','1759 Phase 5',28,507,'160059','yellowstoneallotees  ','yellowstoneallotees@gmail.com',9316132795,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0089','M/s Aeropolis infrastructure Pvt Ltd ( new name of Earlier project M/S sukham infrastructure Pvt ltd.','Tejinder singh Bhatia','aprajit@ylinfocity.in',9915022222,0,'M/s Aeropolis infrastructure Pvt Ltd ( new name of Earlier project M/S sukham infrastructure ','Sector 66 , Near to Phase 11 Maszid near Baba white house Mohali',28,507,'160066','1','M/s Aeropolis infrastructure Pvt Ltd ( new name of Earlier project M/S sukham infrastructure ','Sector 66 , Near to Phase 11 Maszid near Baba white house Mohali',28,507,'160066','0','<font size=\"3\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">M/s Aeropolis Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd. Aeropolis city, Sector 66A, S A S Nagar Mohali 160062 </p><p>\r\n</p><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Kindly refer our letter 15.11.2018, Regarding missing information of M/S Aeropolis Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd. Project (AEROPOLIS CITY sector 66A, Mohali) RERA registration No. PB-RERA-SAS81-PM0089) Regarding missing information on website of RERA, </p><p>\r\n</p><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">and subsequently your letter No.RERA-AM(I)2018/5521 dated 30.11.2018. </p><p>\r\n</p><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">It is with regret to bring to your kind notice that Aeropolis Infrastructures Pvt. Ltd. has not yet complied with your orders. </p><p>\r\n</p><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">For your reference the Association is attaching the list of our members who have invested with abovementioned builder in 2009/2010, Whose names builders should have displayed on the RERA website as per RERA rule 15(D)(i). </p><p>\r\n</p><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">We are given to understand that Builder deliberately hiding this information. </p><p>\r\n</p><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">2. Also in Joint Development Agreement, Which is submitted to your good office, and association obtained copies thru RTI, It has come to our notice that they have not attached various annexure which are part of the J.D.A.</p><p>\r\n</p><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">3. The  other issue is that that company has made  an Joint development agreement with M/s GBP ( Gupta Builders &amp; promoters ). M/s  Aeropolis infra ( Earlier knows as M/s Yellowstone infra pvt limited ). The company website have no where mentioned about the GBP agreement.</p><p>\r\n</p><p>4. The other issue is that M/s  Aeropolis infra ( Earlier knows as M/s Yellowstone infra pvt limited ) &amp; M/s GBP development agreement made which mentioned that  GBP is co developer for the purpose of selling ,marketing ,development ,construction &amp; execution of M/s Aeropolis  project, but the agreement made  have no where mentioned about the earlier allotees to whome the M/s Aeropolis infra ( Earlier knows as M/s Yellowstone infra pvt limited ) have not given possession of the plots since long even after getting the payment from the allotees who have invested their hard earned money</p></font><p><br></p>','<font size=\"3\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">With reference to the fact of the complaint, It is requested thru your goodself The company ( M/s Aeropolis infra ( Earlier knows as M/s Yellowstone infra pvt limited )</p><p>\r\n</p><p align=\"JUSTIFY\"></p></font><dir><font size=\"3\">\r\n</font><dir><font size=\"3\">\r\n</font><dir><font size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">1.	<font size=\"3\">The Allotees list should be displayed on rera site.</font></p><font size=\"3\">\r\n</font><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">2.	<font size=\"3\">The Annexure missing on the website also to be attached.</font></p><font size=\"3\">\r\n</font><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">3.	<font size=\"3\">The joint development action plan made between   M/s  Aeropolis infra ( Earlier knows as M/s Yellowstone infra pvt limited ) &amp; M/s GBP should also be update in Yellowstone website &amp; in turn should also be updated with Rera.</font></p><font size=\"3\">\r\n</font><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">4.	<font size=\"3\">The old allotees detail who have invested hard money since long with M/s Aeropolis infra ( Earlier known as M/s Yellowstone infra Pvt limited ) should also be mentioned about their treatment in M/s GBP agreement</font> . </p>\r\n<font size=\"3\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\"></p>\r\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">　</p>\r\n</font><font face=\"Segoe Print\" size=\"3\"><font face=\"Segoe Print\" size=\"3\"><span lang=\"\"><p>　</p></span></font></font></dir><font face=\"Segoe Print\" size=\"3\"><font face=\"Segoe Print\" size=\"3\">\r\n</font></font></dir><font face=\"Segoe Print\" size=\"3\"><font face=\"Segoe Print\" size=\"3\">\r\n</font></font></dir><p><font face=\"Segoe Print\" size=\"3\"><font face=\"Segoe Print\" size=\"3\">\r\n</font></font><br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<font size=\"3\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">With reference to the fact of the complaint, It is requested thru your goodself The company ( M/s Aeropolis infra ( Earlier knows as M/s Yellowstone infra pvt limited )</p><p>\r\n</p><p align=\"JUSTIFY\"></p></font><dir><font size=\"3\">\r\n</font><dir><font size=\"3\">\r\n</font><dir><font size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">1.	<font size=\"3\">The Allotees list should be displayed on rera site.</font></p><font size=\"3\">\r\n</font><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">2.	<font size=\"3\">The Annexure missing on the website also to be attached.</font></p><font size=\"3\">\r\n</font><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">3.	<font size=\"3\">The joint development action plan made between   M/s  Aeropolis infra ( Earlier knows as M/s Yellowstone infra pvt limited ) &amp; M/s GBP should also be update in Yellowstone website &amp; in turn should also be updated with Rera.</font></p><font size=\"3\">\r\n</font><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">4.	<font size=\"3\">The old allotees detail who have invested hard money since long with M/s Aeropolis infra ( Earlier known as M/s Yellowstone infra Pvt limited ) should also be mentioned about their treatment in M/s GBP agreement</font> . </p>\r\n<font size=\"3\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\"></p>\r\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">　</p>\r\n</font><font face=\"Segoe Print\" size=\"3\"><font face=\"Segoe Print\" size=\"3\"><span lang=\"\"><p>　</p></span></font></font></dir><font face=\"Segoe Print\" size=\"3\"><font face=\"Segoe Print\" size=\"3\">\r\n</font></font></dir><font face=\"Segoe Print\" size=\"3\"><font face=\"Segoe Print\" size=\"3\">\r\n</font></font></dir><p><font face=\"Segoe Print\" size=\"3\"><font face=\"Segoe Print\" size=\"3\">\r\n</font></font><br></p>','0','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'Yellostoneallotees','2019-01-20 12:32:39.000','Yellostoneallotees','2019-01-20 12:32:39.000'),(891,1275,'1275',1353,'e8ac273a-1078-4419-9fe1-68696ab55f3e','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-22 10:46:09.000','Parvesh Bansal','parvesh.vicky@gmail.com',8054776864,0,0,'H. NO 124, Sector 2-A, Adarsh Nagar','Mandi Gobindgarh',28,204,'147301','1','H. NO 124, Sector 2-A, Adarsh Nagar','Mandi Gobindgarh',28,204,'147301','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0085','SUSHMA BUILDTECH\'S \'SUHMA GRANDE\'','BHARAT MITTAL','BHARAT@SUSHMABUILDTECH.COM',0,0,'Unit No. B-107, Business Complex at Elante Mall','1st Floor, Industrial Area, Phase – 1',6,128,'160009','1','Unit No. B-107, Business Complex at Elante Mall','1st Floor, Industrial Area, Phase – 1',6,128,'160009','1','<p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 10pt;\"><span style=\'background: white; color: black; line-height: 115%; font-family: \"roboto\",\"serif\"; font-size: 10.5pt;\'>I booked a 4 BHK flat with\r\nSushma Buildtech Group, in their project Sushma Grande in Zirakpur. Booking\r\ndate was 10th October 2014, allotment date was 1st Dec 2014, and buyer seller\r\nagreement signed on 13th December 2016. Expected date of possession was promised\r\nto be in June 2017, but till date possession has not been handed out.</span></p><p><br></p>','<p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 10pt;\"><span style=\'background: white; color: black; line-height: 115%; font-family: \"roboto\",\"serif\"; font-size: 10.5pt;\'>Possession of the flat at the\r\nearliest, and interest (as per Punjab&nbsp; RERA guidelines) on the paid amount\r\nfrom the promised date of possession till date of the settlement of this complaint,\r\nfollowed by monthly interest payment till the possession of the flat</span></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><br></p>',7167500.00,6250088.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','I-703','','',2,0,0,0,'ParveshBansal','2019-01-21 18:58:14.000','ParveshBansal','2019-01-21 18:58:14.000'),(892,1276,'1276',1356,'c508c4b1-7ed2-4e3d-a40c-4b237fc5ea93','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-22 16:15:54.000','MOHAMMAD  ISHA','mood.isha00000@gmail.com',9988897185,0,0,'#2730','SECTOR-55',6,128,'160055','1','#2730','SECTOR-55',6,128,'160055','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0091','M/S BABA BANDA SINGH BAHADUR ENTERPRISES','SUKHCHAIN SINGH','bbsbikpmohali@gmail.com',9915322330,0,'H.B.NO 195','VILLAGE CHAPPARCHIRI KALAN, SECTOR 92',28,507,'140307','1','H.B.NO 195','VILLAGE CHAPPARCHIRI KALAN, SECTOR 92',28,507,'140307','1','<p>With due respect , I want to intemate that Ihave booked one plot (no C-4) Size (250 SQ yds) in the name of MOHAMMAD ISHA dated 02-07-2015 Knowledge park developed by M/s Baba Banda Singh Bahadur(BBSB) Enterprises. I have alredy submitted 30% payment against booking of plot as per BBSB enterprises condition and also have the agreement and the recipts of the payment made by us.</p><p><br></p><p>But till date they have failed to give us possision of the plot, also asked any question regarding this they keepo on giving us the dates from past 4 years and misleads and misguided us.</p><p><br></p><p>Now on the same land that we have agrement for , they have developed another project in the name of POSH CITY of residential township and M/S Sukhchain Singh sold a land to ACME BUILDER with any information given to us.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>','<p>We want the same plot with the same area as per the agreement.<br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>We request to that we want the same plot as the same location for which we have the agreement copy and the recipts the as M/S Sukhchain Singh and M/s Hosihar Singh has misguided us from last 4 years and had taken the money against the plot along with development charges.<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'Moodisha@1','2019-01-22 11:50:16.000','Moodisha@1','2019-01-22 11:50:16.000'),(893,1277,'1277',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','PUNJAB URBAN PLANNING AND DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><span style=\"font-size: 11.000000pt; font-family: \'Helvetica\'\">I purchased plot number 65C at Old Jail site (As known as PUDA SPORTS ENCLAVE), Jalandhar on\r\n22/04/2016 via PUDA auction. The plot was purchased for Rs 1,14,02,358 excluding the cess. The cess\r\namount paid was Rs 2,28,047. The size of the plot is 222.92 sq. mtrs. On 17/08/2016 I received the\r\nallotment letter (Annexure A) in Clause 4 sub clause (i) it is mentioned that the possession shall be handed\r\nover within 1 year of the Auction, after completion of development works. Details of the instalments made\r\nby me are attached in Annexure B (Payment Schedule for Plot 65 C Old Jail Site Jalandhar). All the\r\npayments except TDS deposited amount Rs 48,866.97 on 14/04/2018 Annexure C (Form 16B) are also\r\nshown in the Ledger downloaded from PUDA/JDA website (Annexure D). The possession was delayed by\r\nover 2 years and 3 months. I was offered possession on 02/07/2018. Attached is the possession letter\r\n(Annexure E). I would like to keep the plot and not withdraw from the project. On 14/04/2018 I made lump\r\nsum payment of the and availed 5% discount on the balance payment.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><span style=\"font-size: 11.000000pt; font-family: \'Helvetica\'\">I seek relief of interest on principal amount paid by me for delay in the possession @18% PA on the\r\nmonthly compounding basis. This delay has put me in significant financial constraints, physical and\r\nmental stress. I also seek compensation of Rs 5 Lakh for Physical and metal stress for being dragged in\r\nthe litigation to seek relief through this complaint.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>',11402358.00,11276364.58,'2017-04-22 00:00:00.000','2018-06-26 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','2016-08-17 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','65-C Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','','',2,0,0,0,'nikhil_sp1','2019-01-22 13:03:38.000','nikhil_sp1','2019-01-22 13:03:38.000'),(894,1277,'1277',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','PUNJAB URBAN PLANNING AND DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">I purchased plot number 65-C at Old Jail site (As known as PUDA SPORTS ENCLAVE), Jalandhar on\r\n22/04/2016 via PUDA auction. The plot was purchased for Rs 1,14,02,358 excluding the cess. The cess\r\namount paid was Rs 2,28,047. The size of the plot is 222.92 sq. mtrs. On 17/08/2016 I received the\r\nallotment letter (Annexure A) in Clause 4 sub clause (i) it is mentioned that the possession shall be handed\r\nover within 1 year of the Auction, after completion of development works. Details of the instalments made\r\nby me are attached in Annexure B (Payment Schedule for Plot 65 C Old Jail Site Jalandhar). All the\r\npayments except TDS deposited amount Rs 48,866.97 on 14/04/2018 Annexure C (Form 16B) are also\r\nshown in the Ledger downloaded from PUDA/JDA website (Annexure D). The possession was delayed by\r\nover 2 years and 3 months. I was offered possession on 02/07/2018. Attached is the possession letter\r\n(Annexure E). I would like to keep the plot and not withdraw from the project. On 14/04/2018 I made lump\r\nsum payment of the plot by taking a loan from Punjab National Bank&nbsp; and availed 5% discount on the balance payment. After making lump sum payment I applied for No Due Certificate on 02/05/2018 and its been almost 9 months and I have still not </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">received</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;the No Due Certificate.</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><span style=\"font-size: 11.000000pt; font-family: \'Helvetica\'\">I seek relief of interest on principal amount paid by me for delay in the possession @18% PA on the\r\nmonthly compounding basis. This delay has put me in significant financial constraints, physical and\r\nmental stress. I also seek compensation of Rs 5 Lakh for Physical and metal stress for being dragged in\r\nthe litigation to seek relief through this complaint.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>