1 00:00:00.000','Nidhi Bhardwaj','nidhi22.bhardwaj@gmail.com',9056114295,0,0,'1008/1','Sector 45-B',6,128,'160047','1','2004, Verka Enclave','Sector 49',6,128,'160047','Vipin Kumar','vipin268@gmail.com',9914099255,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','Casa Espana','ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd','email@atsgreens.com',0,0,'711/92,','Deepali, Nehru Place,',10,120,'110019','1','711/92,','Deepali, Nehru Place,',10,120,'110019','1','<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><ol><li style=\"margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Complainants\r\nbooked an apartment Type-B/131/Flat No. 7071 with the OP and paid an amount of\r\nRs. 100000/- to the OP vide cheque as booking amount. </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The\r\nBasic sale price of the apartment is Rs. 92,00,000/-.</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">On dated 10.06.2014, the Complainants paid an amount of Rs.\r\n12,00,000/- to the OP vide cheque. On dated 24.06.2014, the OP issued allotment\r\nletter in the name of the Complainants with respect to said flat.</span><b><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></u></b></li><li style=\"margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">On the same date ie 24.06.2014, an “Apartment Buyer Agreement”\r\nwas entered between the Op as 1st part and the Complainants as 2nd part. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">On the same\r\ndate, a Tripartite Agreement was entered between the Complainant on 1st Part,\r\nthe OP on 2nd Part and the HDFC bank on 3rd Part and a loan of an amount of Rs.\r\n69,00,000/- granted to the Complainant in favour of the OP for the said\r\napartment. As on today, the Complainants have cleared and repaid the whole\r\namount of the loan to the HDFC. The HDFC bank has issued certificate dated\r\n03.10.2017 for the same.</span><b><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span></u></b></span><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></u></b></li><li style=\"margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Complaint\r\npaid an amount of Rs. 2,00,000/- on dated 30.01.2016 and Rs. 2,08,000/- dated\r\n18.08.2016 vide cheques as EDC.</span><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></u></b></li><li style=\"margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">As on today,\r\nthe Complainants have paid a total amount of Rs. 99,22,207/- to the OP. </span><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></u></b></li><li style=\"margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">As per the\r\nbuyers agreement, the construction of the apartment was to be completed within\r\nperiod of 42 months (with grace period of 3 months) from the date of agreement\r\nie to be completed by 24.03.2018. Hence as on today there is a delay of about\r\n10 months approx on the part of the OP for giving the possession. </span><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></u></b></li><li style=\"margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">After completion of the stipulated period, the Complainants\r\napproached the OP and asked about the status of the project and possession. But\r\nthe OP did not give any satisfactory reply and delaying the matter on one\r\npretext or the other.</span><b><u><o:p></o:p></u></b></span></li><li style=\"margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 14px;\">Complainants issued notice to the OP by email dated 17.12.2018\r\nand asked the OP for the delay compensation @ 12% on the said flat. The OP\r\nreplied to the notice, admitted the delay but refused to pay the compensation @\r\n12%.&nbsp;</span></li></ol>','\r\n\r\n<ol><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 10pt 3pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">To develop the\r\nsaid project and handover the possession of apartment immediately.</span><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 10pt 3pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">To pay delay\r\ninterest at the same rate that the buyer had to pay in case of default i.e. @\r\n18% </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">from\r\nagreed date of possession i.e. </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">22.02.2018</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">\r\ntill actual delivery of possession.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ol>',9200000.00,9922207.00,'2018-03-24 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ol><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 10pt 3pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">To pay delay\r\ninterest at the same rate that the buyer had to pay in case of default i.e. @\r\n18% </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">from\r\nagreed date of possession i.e. </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">22.02.2018</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">\r\ntill actual delivery of possession.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 10pt 3pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\">Any other relief which the Hon’ble Authority may deem\r\nfit.</li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 10pt 3pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ol>','1','','2014-06-24 00:00:00','2014-06-24 00:00:00','Type-B/131/Flat No. 7071 at ATS CASA ESPANA situated at Sector 121, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'vipinK','2019-01-22 17:05:27.000','vipinK','2019-01-22 17:05:27.000'),(902,1278,'1278',1203,'1cc7ee4f-bdbb-4adc-aaba-bf2382465ef3','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nidhi Bhardwaj','nidhi22.bhardwaj@gmail.com',9056114295,0,0,'1008/1','Sector 45-B',6,128,'160047','1','2004, Verka Enclave','Sector 49',6,128,'160047','Vipin Kumar','vipin268@gmail.com',9914099255,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','Casa Espana','ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd','email@atsgreens.com',0,0,'711/92,','Deepali, Nehru Place,',10,120,'110019','1','711/92,','Deepali, Nehru Place,',10,120,'110019','1','<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><ol><li style=\"margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Complainants\r\nbooked an apartment Type-B/131/Flat No. 7071 with the OP and paid an amount of\r\nRs. 100000/- to the OP vide cheque as booking amount. </span><span style=\"font-size: