font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ol>',9200000.00,9922207.00,'2018-03-24 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ol><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 10pt 3pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">To pay delay\r\ninterest at the same rate that the buyer had to pay in case of default i.e. @\r\n18% </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">from\r\nagreed date of possession i.e. </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">22.02.2018</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">\r\ntill actual delivery of possession.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 10pt 3pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\">Any other relief which the Hon’ble Authority may deem\r\nfit.</li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 10pt 3pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ol>','1','','2014-06-24 00:00:00','2014-06-24 00:00:00','Type-B/131/Flat No. 7071 at ATS CASA ESPANA situated at Sector 121, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'vipinK','2019-01-22 17:06:00.000','vipinK','2019-01-22 17:06:00.000'),(903,1278,'1278',1203,'1cc7ee4f-bdbb-4adc-aaba-bf2382465ef3','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nidhi Bhardwaj','nidhi22.bhardwaj@gmail.com',9056114295,0,0,'1008/1','Sector 45-B',6,128,'160047','1','2004, Verka Enclave','Sector 49',6,128,'160047','Vipin Kumar','vipin268@gmail.com',9914099255,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','Casa Espana','ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd','email@atsgreens.com',0,0,'711/92,','Deepali, Nehru