 to the HDFC. The HDFC bank has issued certificate dated\r\n03.10.2017 for the same.</span><b><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span></u></b></span><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></u></b></li><li style=\"margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Complaint\r\npaid an amount of Rs. 2,00,000/- on dated 30.01.2016 and Rs. 2,08,000/- dated\r\n18.08.2016 vide cheques as EDC.</span><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></u></b></li><li style=\"margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">As on today,\r\nthe Complainants have paid a total amount of Rs. 99,22,207/- to the OP including all taxes and other charges.</span></li><li style=\"margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">As per the\r\nbuyers agreement, the construction of the apartment was to be completed within\r\nperiod of 42 months (with grace period of 3 months) from the date of agreement\r\nie to be completed by 24.03.2018. Hence as on today there is a delay of about\r\n10 months approx on the part of the OP for giving the possession. </span><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></u></b></li><li style=\"margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;f