00:00','2016-11-18 00:00:00','SCO 20 Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','','',2,0,0,0,'bhupinderjuneja55','2019-01-24 15:15:25.000','bhupinderjuneja55','2019-01-24 15:15:25.000'),(919,1164,'1164',1078,'d8d4f172-3c37-4e70-b72a-876b113f98f3','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-29 12:53:00.000','Keshav Rai Dhanda ','vikramsinghchahal@gmail.com',9781750447,0,0,'H. No.B-1-1315','Opposite Old Courts, Civil Lines',28,366,'141001','1','H. No.B-1-1315','Opposite Old Courts, Civil Lines',28,366,'141001','Vikram Singh Chahal','vikramsinghchahal@gmail.com',9781750447,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0060','M/s. Ireo Waterfront Pvt. Ltd','IREO Waterfront Pvt. Ltd','iwp@ireo.in',0,0,'A-11, 1st Floor, Neeti Bagh, New Delhi South Delhi','',10,557,'110049','1','A-11, 1st Floor, Neeti Bagh, New Delhi South Delhi','',10,557,'110049','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The complainant fell fray to the\r\ntall claims made by the O.Ps. wherein they claimed for setting up a Township in\r\nLudhiana and the complainant decided to purchase one Villa on Construction\r\nLinked Plan. On 31.03.2011 complainant paid a sum of Rs.16,43,000/- towards the\r\nbooking price of Villa No.C-I-167. The said Villa was to be constructed upto\r\nsecond floor having built up area of 4556 sq. ft. on plot measuring 374.56 sq.\r\nYds., having basic sale price of Rs.1,59,46,000/-. Villa Buyer’s Agreement (ANX-C001)\r\ndated 23.09.2011 was executed. As per clause No.11.3 of the said agreement the\r\npossession was to be offered on or before 22.09.2013. The complainant from time\r\nto time made the payment of the consideration money and also availed loan from\r\nBank of India amounting to Rs.74,50,000/- and executed a Tripartite Agreement (ANX-C002)\r\nin May 2012. The complainant as such made the total payment of Rs.1,60,82,520/-\r\n. Copies of the receipts are ANX-C003 Colly. The Ops has grossly failed to\r\nabide with the terms and conditions as such the O.Ps. had left the project in\r\nlurch. </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Feeling\r\ncheated at the hands of the O.Ps. the complainant started raising protest as\r\nsuch the o.Ps. in order to save their skin issued notice dated 20.01.2016 in\r\nwhich it was mentioned that the allotment of the Villa was cancelled vide\r\nletter dated 21.04.2014. The said letter was not received by the complainants. That\r\nthe alleged cancellation letter is illegal as the complainants had paid the 95%\r\nof the consideration money.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.5pt; line-height: 115%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:13.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">That the present complaint is within limitation as the letter dated 12.02.2016 has till date not been responded to by the Opposite Parties. Further the Opposite Parties have failed to obtain the Completion and Occupation Certificate and complete the development work as per the Agreement, as such the cause of action are continuing in nature. \r\n</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">That this Hon’ble Court has the jurisdiction to entertain the present complaint as the project of the Opposite Parties has been registered under the “RERA Act” vide PR0060POCKET-I and is located at Ludhiana which is within the jurisdiction of this Hon’ble Court. \r\n</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">That earlier the complainants had filed complaint before this Hon’ble Court the same was dismissed in default vide order 21.03.2018 on account of noting down of wrong date. The complaint of the complainant was yet to be registered and no notice was sent to the O.Ps. therefore, res-judicata is not applicable to the present case. Further the subsequent complaint filed by the complainants was disposed off by the Adjudicating Officer vide order dated 01.11.2018 on account of the passing of the Circular dated 29.10.2018.\r\n</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">RELIEF: The complainant being fed up by the acts of omission and commission on the part of the O.Ps. is left with no other option but to file the present complaint seeking the refund of the amount of the Rs.1,60,82,520/- alongwith interest @ 12% beside cost of litigation to the tune of Rs.2,00,000/- and compensation of Rs.10,00,0</span></font></p>',16889971.00,16082520.00,'2013-09-29 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Any interim relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deems fit in the present circumstances.&nbsp;</p>','0','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2011-09-23 00:00:00','Villa No.C-I-167','','',2,0,0,0,'P43982017','2019-01-24 16:25:00.000','P43982017','2019-01-24 16:25:00.000'),(920,1164,'1164',1078,'d8d4f172-3c37-4e70-b72a-876b113f98f3','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-29 12:53:00.000','Keshav Rai Dhanda ','vikramsinghchahal@gmail.com',9781750447,0,0,'H. No.B-1-1315','Opposite Old Courts, Civil Lines',28,366,'141001','1','H. No.B-1-1315','Opposite Old Courts, Civil Lines',28,366,'141001','Vikram Singh Chahal','vikramsinghchahal@gmail.com',9781750447,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0060','M/s. Ireo Waterfront Pvt. Ltd','IREO Waterfront Pvt. Ltd','iwp@ireo.in',0,0,'A-11, 1st Floor, Neeti Bagh, New Delhi South Delhi','',10,557,'110049','1','A-11, 1st Floor, Neeti Bagh, New Delhi South Delhi','',10,557,'110049','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The complainant fell fray to the\r\ntall claims made by the O.Ps. wherein they claimed for setting up a Township in\r\nLudhiana and the complainant decided to purchase one Villa on Construction\r\nLinked Plan. On 31.03.2011 complainant paid a sum of Rs.16,43,000/- towards the\r\nbooking price of Villa No.C-I-167. The said Villa was to be constructed upto\r\nsecond floor having built up area of 4556 sq. ft. on plot measuring 374.56 sq.\r\nYds., having basic sale price of Rs.1,59,46,