the present case. Further the subsequent complaint filed by the complainants was disposed off by the Adjudicating Officer vide order dated 01.11.2018 on account of the passing of the Circular dated 29.10.2018.\r\n</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">RELIEF: The complainant being fed up by the acts of omission and commission on the part of the O.Ps. is left with no other option but to file the present complaint seeking the refund of the amount of the Rs.1,60,82,520/- alongwith interest @ 12% beside cost of litigation to the tune of Rs.2,00,000/- and compensation of Rs.10,00,0</span></font></p>',16889971.00,16082520.00,'2013-09-29 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Any interim relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deems fit in the present circumstances.&nbsp;</p>','0','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2011-09-23 00:00:00','Villa No.C-I-167','','',1,1,0,0,'P43982017','2019-01-24 16:52:48.000','P43982017','2019-01-24 16:52:48.000'),(922,1279,'1279',1357,'defafd2a-a305-4a38-9251-73a5e317e083','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bhupinder Paul Juneja & Anshul Juneja','junejatyres55@gmail.com',9876630855,0,0,'128 Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128 Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62','SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62','SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p>We purchased SCO plot number 20 on 18/11/2016 via PUDA auction. The price of plot is Rs 15743700 excluding cancer cess. The cancer cess amount paid is Rs 314874. At the time of Auction we were given a brochure (Annexure A) in which clause 7 point (a) stated \"No Interest will be charged from the allottees till the offer of possession/deemed possession\".&nbsp; On 22/03/2017 we received the allotment letter (Annexure B) in which it was mentioned under clause 4 section (i) \"Possession of the plot shall be handed over to the allottee within 90 days of issue of allotment letter\". Its been more than 2 years and 2 months since auction but we still have not been given possession. The development works are still not completed at the site. We have been paying instalments as per the conditions allotment letter. As the possession was not given at the time of paying instalments we paid the instalments without interest as per the conditions of the brochure. All the payment except the TDS paid are shown in ledger downloaded from the PUDA/JDA website (Annexure C). TDS form16B attached (Annexure D). On 27/02/2018 we received a show cause notice (Annexure E) saying we owe Rs 1382456 on our plot. When inquired regarding this notice we were told we didn\'t interest deposit that\'s why we were issued the show cause notice. We replied (Annexure F) to the show cause notice on 22/03/2018 but we haven\'t received any reply from PUDA. We would like to keep the plot and not withdraw from the project.</p>','<p>dasd</p>',15743700.00,0.00,'2017-06-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>dasda</p>','1','','2017-03-22 00:00:00','2016-11-18 00:00:00','SCO 20 Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','','',2,0,0,0,'bhupinderjuneja55','2019-01-25 11:34:08.000','bhupinderjuneja55','2019-01-25 11:34:08.000'),(923,1279,'1279',1357,'defafd2a-a305-4a38-9251-73a5e317e083','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bhupinder Paul Juneja & Anshul Juneja','junejatyres55@gmail.com',9876630855,0,0,'128 Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128 Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62','SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62','SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p>We purchased SCO plot number 20 on 18/11/2016 via PUDA auction. The price of plot is Rs 15743700 excluding cancer cess. The cancer cess amount paid is Rs 314874. At the time of Auction we were given a brochure (Annexure A) in which clause 7 point (a) stated \"No Interest will be charged from the allottees till the offer of possession/deemed possession\".&nbsp; On 22/03/2017 we received the allotment letter (Annexure B) in which it was mentioned under clause 4 section (i) \"Possession of the plot shall be handed over to the allottee within 90 days of issue of allotment letter\". Its been more than 2 years and 2 months since auction but we still have not been given possession. The development works are still not completed at the site. We have been paying instalments as per the conditions allotment letter. As the possession was not given at the time of paying instalments we paid the instalments without interest as per the conditions of the brochure. All the payment except the TDS paid are shown in ledger downloaded from the PUDA/JDA website (Annexure C). TDS form16B attached (Annexure D). On 27/02/2018 we received a show cause notice (Annexure E) saying we owe Rs 1382456 on our plot. When inquired regarding this notice we were told we didn\'t interest deposit that\'s why we were issued the show cause notice. We replied (Annexure F) to the show cause notice on 22/03/2018 but we haven\'t received any reply from PUDA. We would like to keep the plot and not withdraw from the project.</p>','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">We seek relief of interest on principal amount paid by me for delay in the possession @18% PA on the\r\nmonthly compounding basis. This delay has put us in significant financial constraints, physical and\r\nmental stress. We also seek compensation of Rs 5 Lakh for Physical and metal stress for being dragged in\r\nthe litigation to seek relief through this complaint. PUDA/JDA should complete all the </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">necessary</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;development works at the site and issue possession letters at the earliest. Also we would like PUDA/JDA to give us in </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">writing</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;that we will not be charged interest till the possession letter is issued after completion of development works</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>',15743700.00,0.00,'2017-06-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>dasda</p>','1','','2017-03-22 00:00:00','2016-11-18 00:00:00','SCO 20 Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','','',2,0,0,0,'bhupinderjuneja55','2019-01-25 11:39:52.000','bhupinderjuneja55','2019-01-25 11:39:52.000'),(924,1279,'1279',1357,'defafd2a-a305-4a38-9251-73a5e317e083','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bhupinder Paul Juneja & Anshul Juneja','junejatyres55@gmail.com',9876630855,0,0,'128 Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128 Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62','SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62','SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p>We purchased SCO plot number 20 on 18/11/2016 via PUDA auction. The price of plot is Rs 15743700 excluding cancer cess. The cancer cess amount paid is Rs 314874. At the time of Auction we were given a brochure (Annexure A) in which clause 7 point (a) stated \"No Interest will be charged from the allottees till the offer of possession/deemed possession\".&nbsp; On 22/03/2017 we received the allotment letter (Annexure B) in which it was mentioned under clause 4 section (i) \"Possession of the plot shall be handed over to the allottee within 90 days of issue of allotment letter\". Its been more than 2 years and 2 months since auction but we still have not been given possession. The development works are still not completed at the site. We have been paying instalments as per the conditions allotment letter. As the possession was not given at the time of paying instalments we paid the instalments without interest as per the conditions of the brochure. All the payment except the TDS paid are shown in ledger downloaded from the PUDA/JDA website (Annexure C). TDS form16B attached (Annexure D). On 27/02/2018 we received a show cause notice (Annexure E) saying we owe Rs 1382456 on our plot. When inquired regarding this notice we were told we didn\'t interest deposit that\'s why we were issued the show cause notice. We replied (Annexure F) to the show cause notice on 22/03/2018 but we haven\'t received any reply from PUDA. We would like to keep the plot and not withdraw from the project.</p>','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">We seek relief of interest on principal amount paid by me for delay in the possession @18% PA on the\r\nmonthly compounding basis. This delay has put us in significant financial constraints, physical and\r\nmental stress. We also seek compensation of Rs 5 Lakh for Physical and metal stress for being dragged in\r\nthe litigation to seek relief through this complaint. PUDA/JDA should complete all the </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">necessary</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;development works at the site and issue possession letters at the earliest. Also we would like PUDA/JDA to give us in </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">writing</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;that we will not be charged interest till the possession letter is issued after completion of development works.</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>',15743700.00,0.00,'2017-06-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 11pt;\">PUDA/JDA to give us in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14.6667px;\">writing</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;that we will not be charged interest till the possession letter is issued after completion of development works.</span><br></p>','1','','2017-03-22 00:00:00','2016-11-18 00:00:00','SCO 20 Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','','',2,0,0,0,'bhupinderjuneja55','2019-01-25 11:41:02.000','bhupinderjuneja55','2019-01-25 11:41:02.000'),(925,1280,'1280',1253,'70b12b4c-e79c-4d06-9369-5f060352ed65','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Tejbir Singh Sawhney','tssawhney@yahoo.com',9876604020,0,0,'401 Tower H ','La Lagune Golf Course Road Sector 54',13,5,'122003','1','401 Tower H ','La Lagune Golf Course Road Sector 54',13,5,'122003','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0003','Falcon View Apartments \r\nPhase 1','Janta Land Promoters Pvt Ltd ','janta@jantahousing.com',0,0,'SCO 39 - 42 , Sector 82 ','SAS Nagar , Mohali ',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39 - 42 , Sector 82 ','SAS Nagar , Mohali ',28,507,'140306','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>acbbh</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>cdvdvd</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'AnkitChowdhri','2019-01-25 11:59:38.000','AnkitChowdhri','2019-01-25 11:59:38.000'),(926,1280,'1280',1253,'70b12b4c-e79c-4d06-9369-5f060352ed65','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Tejbir Singh Sawhney','tssawhney@yahoo.com',9876604020,0,0,'401 Tower H ','La Lagune Golf Course Road Sector 54',13,5,'122003','1','401 Tower H ','La Lagune Golf Course Road Sector 54',13,5,'122003','Ankit Chowdhri','ankit_chowdhri@hotmail.com',9814433585,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0003','Falcon View Apartments \r\nPhase 1','Janta Land Promoters Pvt Ltd ','janta@jantahousing.com',0,0,'SCO 39 - 42 , Sector 82 ','SAS Nagar , Mohali ',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39 - 42 , Sector 82 ','SAS Nagar , Mohali ',28,507,'140306','1','<p>i)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the Respondent was engaged in the development of the Super Mega Mixed Use Integrated Industrial Park Project of 263.38 acre of land in sector 66 – A,82 and 83, Mohali.&nbsp;</p><p>ii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the Applicant had applied for allotment of one 4 BHk flat in the above sated project vide application form dated 01.06.2013 which is annexed herewith as Annexure C-1.</p><p>iii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That in reference thereof the applicant was allotted a Unit No./ Apartment No. C-901 in the above-mentioned project along with a construction linked plan vide an allotment letter 27.04.2013 which is annexed herewith as Annexure C-2.</p><p>iv)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The as per the Construction Linked Installment Plan appended to the aforesaid Agreement in pursuance wherein the applicant was required to pay Rs.1,08,43,200/- out of which the complainant had already paid Rs.27,94,563/- (Principal Rs.26,94,595/- and Service Tax of Rs.99,968/-) vide receipts Nos. 4422 and 4889 dated 01.06.2013 and 18.07.2013 respectively.&nbsp; An amount of Rs.10,934,794.00/- was paid by the Applicant to the Respondent upto 21.02.2018 as reflected in the flat holders card annexed herewith as Annexure C-3.</p><p>v)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the respondent was to hand over possession within 30 months from date of allotment As per Clause 2.24 of Annexure C-2 which has not been complied with till date despite repeated reminders.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>vi)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That finally reminder dated 02.10.2018 vide email is annexed herewith as Annexure C-4.</p><p>vii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That aggrieved therewith the applicant seeks to invoke the jurisdiction of this Hon’ble forum for relief.&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>','<p>acbbh</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>cdvdvd</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'AnkitChowdhri','2019-01-25 12:04:30.000','AnkitChowdhri','2019-01-25 12:04:30.000'),(927,1280,'1280',1253,'70b12b4c-e79c-4d06-9369-5f060352ed65','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Tejbir Singh Sawhney','tssawhney@yahoo.com',9876604020,0,0,'401 Tower H ','La Lagune Golf Course Road Sector 54',13,5,'122003','1','401 Tower H ','La Lagune Golf Course Road Sector 54',13,5,'122003','Ankit Chowdhri','ankit_chowdhri@hotmail.com',9814433585,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0003','Falcon View Apartments \r\nPhase 1','Janta Land Promoters Pvt Ltd ','janta@jantahousing.com',0,0,'SCO 39 - 42 , Sector 82 ','SAS Nagar , Mohali ',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39 - 42 , Sector 82 ','SAS Nagar , Mohali ',28,507,'140306','1','<p>i)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the Respondent was engaged in the development of the Super Mega Mixed Use Integrated Industrial Park Project of 263.38 acre of land in sector 66 – A,82 and 83, Mohali.&nbsp;</p><p>ii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the Applicant had applied for allotment of one 4 BHk flat in the above sated project vide application form dated 01.06.2013 which is annexed herewith as Annexure C-1.</p><p>iii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That in reference thereof the applicant was allotted a Unit No./ Apartment No. C-901 in the above-mentioned project along with a construction linked plan vide an allotment letter 27.04.2013 which is annexed herewith as Annexure C-2.</p><p>iv)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The as per the Construction Linked Installment Plan appended to the aforesaid Agreement in pursuance wherein the applicant was required to pay Rs.1,08,43,200/- out of which the complainant had already paid Rs.27,94,563/- (Principal Rs.26,94,595/- and Service Tax of Rs.99,968/-) vide receipts Nos. 4422 and 4889 dated 01.06.2013 and 18.07.2013 respectively.&nbsp; An amount of Rs.10,934,794.00/- was paid by the Applicant to the Respondent upto 21.02.2018 as reflected in the flat holders card annexed herewith as Annexure C-3.</p><p>v)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the respondent was to hand over possession within 30 months from date of allotment As per Clause 2.24 of Annexure C-2 which has not been complied with till date despite repeated reminders.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>vi)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That finally reminder dated 02.10.2018 vide email is annexed herewith as Annexure C-4.</p><p>vii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That aggrieved therewith the applicant seeks to invoke the jurisdiction of this Hon’ble forum for relief.&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>','<p>i)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the respondent to deliver the flat to the complainant immediately without any increased charges..&nbsp;</p><p>ii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the respondent to pay interest on the Amount of Rs.1,09,34,794/- i.e. the payment made by the applicant till date as prescribed by the Act and the Rules framed there under.&nbsp;</p><p>iii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To waive off GST applicable on the outstanding amount.</p><p>iv)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To issue directions to pay cost of litigation so incurred by the complainant to the tune of Rs.2,00,000/-.</p><p>v)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To issue direction to pay compensation to the complainant for the compensation for his mental agony,pain and harassment to the tune of Rs.5,00,000/-.&nbsp;</p><p>vi)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Any other relief which the Applicant is entitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>cdvdvd</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'AnkitChowdhri','2019-01-25 12:05:24.000','AnkitChowdhri','2019-01-25 12:05:24.000'),(928,1279,'1279',1357,'defafd2a-a305-4a38-9251-73a5e317e083','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bhupinder Paul Juneja & Anshul Juneja','junejatyres55@gmail.com',9876630855,0,0,'128 Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128 Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62','SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62','SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p>We purchased SCO plot number 20 on 18/11/2016 via PUDA auction. Total area of the plot is 147 square meters. The price of plot is Rs 15743700 excluding cancer cess. The cancer cess amount paid is Rs 314874. At the time of Auction we were given a brochure (Annexure A) in which clause 7 point (a) stated \"No Interest will be charged from the allottees till the offer of possession/deemed possession\".&nbsp; On 22/03/2017 we received the allotment letter (Annexure B) in which it was mentioned under clause 4 section (i) \"Possession of the plot shall be handed over to the allottee within 90 days of issue of allotment letter\". Its been more than 2 years and 2 months since auction but we still have not been given possession. The development works are still not completed at the site. We have been paying instalments as per the conditions allotment letter. As the possession was not given at the time of paying instalments we paid the instalments without interest as per the conditions of the brochure. All the payment except the TDS paid are shown in ledger downloaded from the PUDA/JDA website (Annexure C). TDS form16B attached (Annexure D). On 27/02/2018 we received a show cause notice (Annexure E) saying we owe Rs 1382456 on our plot. When inquired regarding this notice we were told we didn\'t interest deposit that\'s why we were issued the show cause notice. We replied (Annexure F) to the show cause notice on 22/03/2018 but we haven\'t received any reply from PUDA. We would like to keep the plot and not withdraw from the project.</p>','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">We seek relief of interest on principal amount paid by me for delay in the possession @18% PA on the\r\nmonthly compounding basis. This delay has put us in significant financial constraints, physical and\r\nmental stress. We also seek compensation of Rs 5 Lakh for Physical and metal stress for being dragged in\r\nthe litigation to seek relief through this complaint. PUDA/JDA should complete all the </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">necessary</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;development works at the site and issue possession letters at the earliest. Also we would like PUDA/JDA to give us in </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">writing</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;that we will not be charged interest till the possession letter is issued after completion of development works.</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>',15743700.00,0.00,'2017-06-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 11pt;\">PUDA/JDA to give us in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14.6667px;\">writing</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;that we will not be charged interest till the possession letter is issued after completion of development works.</span><br></p>','1','','2017-03