,'70b12b4c-e79c-4d06-9369-5f060352ed65','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Tejbir Singh Sawhney','tssawhney@yahoo.com',9876604020,0,0,'401 Tower H ','La Lagune Golf Course Road Sector 54',13,5,'122003','1','401 Tower H ','La Lagune Golf Course Road Sector 54',13,5,'122003','Ankit Chowdhri','ankit_chowdhri@hotmail.com',9814433585,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0003','Falcon View Apartments \r\nPhase 1','Janta Land Promoters Pvt Ltd ','janta@jantahousing.com',0,0,'SCO 39 - 42 , Sector 82 ','SAS Nagar , Mohali ',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39 - 42 , Sector 82 ','SAS Nagar , Mohali ',28,507,'140306','1','<p>i)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the Respondent was engaged in the development of the Super Mega Mixed Use Integrated Industrial Park Project of 263.38 acre of land in sector 66 – A,82 and 83, Mohali.&nbsp;</p><p>ii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the Applicant had applied for allotment of one 4 BHk flat in the above sated project vide application form dated 01.06.2013 which is annexed herewith as Annexure C-1.</p><p>iii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That in reference thereof the applicant was allotted a Unit No./ Apartment No. C-901 in the above-mentioned project along with a construction linked plan vide an allotment letter 27.04.2013 which is annexed herewith as Annexure C-2.</p><p>iv)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The as per the Construction Linked Installment Plan appended to the aforesaid Agreement in pursuance wherein the applicant was required to pay Rs.1,08,43,200/- out of which the complainant had already paid Rs.27,94,563/- (Principal Rs.26,94,595/- and Service Tax of Rs.99,968/-) vide receipts Nos. 4422 and 4889 dated 01.06.2013 and 18.07.2013 respectively.&nbsp; An amount of Rs.10,934,794.00/- was paid by the Applicant to the Respondent upto 21.02.2018 as reflected in the flat holders card annexed herewith as Annexure C-3.</p><p>v)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the respondent was to hand over possession within 30 months from date of allotment As per Clause 2.24 of Annexure C-2 which has not been complied with till date despite repeated reminders.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>vi)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That finally reminder dated 02.10.2018 vide email is annexed herewith as Annexure C-4.</p><p>vii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That aggrieved therewith the applicant seeks to invoke the jurisdiction of this Hon’ble forum for relief.&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>','<p>i)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the respondent to deliver the flat to the complainant immediately without any increased charges.</p><p>ii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the respondent to pay interest on the Amount of Rs.1,09,34,794/- i.e. the payment made by the applicant till date as prescribed by the Act and the Rules framed there under.&nbsp;</p><p>iii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To waive off GST applicable on the outstanding amount.</p><p>iv)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To issue directions to pay cost of litigation so incurred by the complainant to the tune of Rs.2,00,000/-.</p><p>v)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To issue direction to pay compensation to the complainant for the compensation for his mental agony,pain and harassment to the tune of Rs.5,00,000/-.&nbsp;</p><p>vi)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Any other relief which the Applicant is entitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>To direct the respondent to deliver the flat to the complainant immediately without any increased charges</p><p><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'AnkitChowdhri','2019-01-26 12:53:28.000','AnkitChowdhri','2019-01-26 12:53:28.000'),(935,1280,'1280',1253,'70b12b4c-e79c-4d06-9369-5f060352ed65','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-28 20:05:38.000','Tejbir Singh Sawhney','tssawhney@yahoo.com',9876604020,0,0,'401 Tower H ','La Lagune Golf Course Road Sector 54',13,5,'122003','1','401 Tower H ','La Lagune Golf Course Road Sector 54',13,5,'122003','Ankit Chowdhri','ankit_chowdhri@hotmail.com',9814433585,1724630585,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0003','Falcon View Apartments \r\nPhase 1','Janta Land Promoters Pvt Ltd ','janta@jantahousing.com',0,0,'SCO 39 - 42 , Sector 82 ','SAS Nagar , Mohali ',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39 - 42 , Sector 82 ','SAS Nagar , Mohali ',28,507,'140306','1','<p>i)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the Respondent was engaged in the development of the Super Mega Mixed Use Integrated Industrial Park Project of 263.38 acre of land in sector 66 – A,82 and 83, Mohali.&nbsp;</p><p>ii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the Applicant had applied for allotment of one 4 BHk flat in the above sated project vide application form dated 01.06.2013 which is annexed herewith as Annexure C-1.</p><p>iii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That in reference thereof the applicant was allotted a Unit No./ Apartment No. C-901 in the above-mentioned project along with a construction linked plan vide an allotment letter 27.04.2013 which is annexed herewith as Annexure C-2.</p><p>iv)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The as per the Construction Linked Installment Plan appended to the aforesaid Agreement in pursuance wherein the applicant was required to pay Rs.1,08,43,200/- out of which the complainant had already paid Rs.27,94,563/- (Principal Rs.26,94,595/- and Service Tax of Rs.99,968/-) vide receipts Nos. 4422 and 4889 dated 01.06.2013 and 18.07.2013 respectively.&nbsp; An amount of Rs.10,934,794.00/- was paid by the Applicant to the Respondent upto 21.02.2018 as reflected in the flat holders card annexed herewith as Annexure C-3.</p><p>v)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the respondent was to hand over possession within 30 months from date of allotment As per Clause 2.24 of Annexure C-2 which has not been complied with till date despite repeated reminders.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>vi)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That finally reminder dated 02.10.2018 vide email is annexed herewith as Annexure C-4 to no avail.</p><p>vii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That aggrieved therewith the applicant seeks to invoke the jurisdiction of this Hon’ble forum for relief as the provisions of RERA have been violated owing to undue delay in delivery of possession of the flat to the complainant.&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>','<p>i)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the respondent to deliver the flat to the complainant immediately without any increased charges.</p><p>ii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the respondent to pay interest on the Amount of Rs.1,09,34,794/- i.e. the payment made by the applicant till date as prescribed by the Act and the Rules framed there under.&nbsp;</p><p>iii)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To waive off GST applicable on the outstanding amount.</p><p>iv)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To issue directions to pay cost of litigation so incurred by the complainant to the tune of Rs.2,00,000/-.</p><p>v)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To issue direction to pay compensation to the complainant for the compensation for his mental agony, pain and harassment to the tune of Rs.5,00,000/-.&nbsp;</p><p>vi)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Any other relief which the Applicant is entitled for under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation &amp; Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>To direct the respondent to deliver the flat to the complainant immediately without any increased charges.</p><p><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'AnkitChowdhri','2019-01-28 10:47:13.000','AnkitChowdhri','2019-01-28 10:47:13.000'),(936,1279,'1279',1357,'defafd2a-a305-4a38-9251-73a5e317e083','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bhupinder Paul Juneja & Anshul Juneja','junejatyres55@gmail.com',9876630855,0,0,'128 Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128 Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority','ca@puda.gov.in',0,1722215202,'PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62','SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62','SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p>We purchased SCO plot number 20 at Old Jail Site, Jalandhar on 18/11/2016 via PUDA auction. Total area of the plot is 147 square meters. The price of plot is Rs 15743700 excluding cancer cess. The cancer cess amount paid is Rs 314874. At the time of Auction we were given a brochure (Annexure A) in which clause 7 point (a) stated \"No Interest will be charged from the allottees till the offer of possession/deemed possession\".&nbsp; On 22/03/2017 we received the allotment letter (Annexure B) in which it was mentioned under clause 4 section (i) \"Possession of the plot shall be handed over to the allottee within 90 days of issue of allotment letter\". Its been more than 2 years and 2 months since auction but we still have not been given possession. The development works are still not completed at the site. We have been paying instalments as per the conditions allotment letter. As the possession was not given at the time of paying instalments we paid the instalments without interest as per the conditions of the brochure. All the payment except the TDS deposited by us on behalf of PUDA are shown in ledger downloaded from the PUDA/JDA website (Annexure C). TDS form16B attached and schedule payment including TDS&nbsp; (Annexure D). On 27/02/2018 we received a show cause notice (Annexure E) saying we owe Rs 1382456 on our plot. When inquired regarding this notice we were told we didn\'t interest deposit that\'s why we were issued the show cause notice. We replied (Annexure F) to the show cause notice on 22/03/2018 but we haven\'t received any reply from PUDA. We visited the PUDA office Jalandhar many times haven\'t been able to get any concrete answer regarding interest and possession. We would like to keep the plot and not withdraw from the project.</p>','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">We seek relief of interest on principal amount paid by us for delay in the possession @18% PA on the\r\nmonthly compounding basis. This delay has put us in significant financial constraints, physical and\r\nmental stress. We also seek compensation of Rs 5 Lakh for Physical and metal stress for being dragged in\r\nthe litigation to seek relief through this complaint. PUDA/JDA should complete all the </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">necessary</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;development works at the site and issue possession letters at the earliest. Also we would like PUDA/JDA to give us in </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">writing</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;that we will not be charged interest till the possession letter is issued after completion of development works.</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>',15743700.00,10253548.57,'2017-06-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 11pt;\">PUDA/JDA to give us in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14.6667px;\">writing</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;that we will not be charged interest till the possession letter is issued after completion of development works.</span><br></p>','1','','2017-03-22 00:00:00','2016-11-18 00:00:00','SCO 20 Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','','',2,0,0,0,'bhupinderjuneja55','2019-01-28 12:55:31.000','bhupinderjuneja55','2019-01-28 12:55:31.000'),(937,1281,'1281',1362,'b6c0e62b-2e2f-4146-9b93-02cbf8130bc3','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-08 10:37:56.000','Permila Gupta','chambernumber209@gmail.com',9417042502,0,0,'house no. 125-A, Chopra Garden ','Vivek high school, near harshree nath mandir',13,21,'135001','1','house no. 125-A, Chopra Garden ','Vivek high school, near harshree nath mandir',13,21,'135001','varun katyal','chambernumber209@gmail.com',9814652121,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0367','M/S Unitech limited','M/S Unitech limited','sanctions_hry@unitechgroup.com',0,0,'Regd. Office at 6, community centre','saket, new delhi',10,429,'110017','1','Regd. Office at 6, community centre','saket, new delhi',10,429,'110017','1','<p>In 2011-2012, the complainant handed over different cheque of rs 37,22,333/-&nbsp; to opposite party for booking flat no. 0505, floor 5, tower A-4 in gardens sectoe 97 uni world city, mohali. but the project is delayed.<br></p>','<p>In 2011-2012, the complainant handed over different cheque of rs 37,22,333/-&nbsp; to opposite party for booking flat no. 0505, floor 5, tower A-4 in gardens sectoe 97 uni world city, mohali. but the project is delayed. The complainant is no longer interested in taking the possession.<br></p>',4108275.00,3722333.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>In 2011-2012, the complainant handed over different cheque of rs 37,22,333/-&nbsp; to opposite party for booking flat no. 0505, floor 5, tower A-4 in gardens sectoe 97 uni world city, mohali. but the project is delayed. The said flat should have been delivered to the complainant in 36 months but its been delayed by making false promises.&nbsp;<br></p>','1','','2011-03-16 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'varun_katyal2121','2019-01-28 13:56:01.000','varun_katyal2121','2019-01-28 13:56:01.000'),(938,1282,'1282',1362,'b6c0e62b-2e2f-4146-9b93-02cbf8130bc3','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Permila Gupta','chambernumber209@gmail.com',9417042502,0,0,'house no. 125-A, Chopra Garden ','Vivek high school, near harshree nath mandir',13,21,'135001','1','house no. 125-A, Chopra Garden ','Vivek high school, near harshree nath mandir',13,21,'135001','varun katyal','chambernumber209@gmail.com',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0367','unitech ','m/s unitech limited','sanctions_hry@unitechgroup.com',0,0,'regd. office at 6, community centre','saket, new delhi',10,429,'110017','1','regd. office at 6, community centre','saket, new delhi',10,429,'110017','1','<p>In 2011-2012, the complainant handed over cheque of rs 37,22,333/-&nbsp; to opposite party for booking flat no. 0505, floor 5, tower A-4 in gardens sectoe 97 uni world city, mohali.<br></p>','<p>In 2011-2012, the complainant handed over cheque of rs 37,22,333/-&nbsp; to opposite party for booking flat no. 0505, floor 5, tower A-4 in gardens sectoe 97 uni world city, mohali.<br></p>',4108275.00,3722333.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>In 2011-2012, the complainant handed over cheque of rs 37,22,333/-&nbsp; to opposite party for booking flat no. 0505, floor 5, tower A-4 in gardens sectoe 97 uni world city, mohali.<br></p>','1','','2011-03-16 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','flat no. 0504, floor 5, tower A-4 in gardens sector 97 Uni world city, mohali','','',1,0,0,0,'varun_katyal2121','2019-01-28 14:36:30.000','varun_katyal2121','2019-01-28 14:36:30.000'),(939,1283,'1283',1085,'416c72a3-a2db-42db-9e91-50fe152da8ff','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Vinay Kumar Sood','abc@gmail.com',7888356908,7888356908,0,'224 A, LAST LANE, SHASTRI NAGAR','Mani Majra',6,128,'160101','1','224 A, LAST LANE, SHASTRI NAGAR','Mani Majra',6,111,'160101','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','abc','abc','abc@gmail.com',0,0,'abc','',6,128,'160101','0','abc','',3,44,'160100','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'Satish','2019-01-28 15:18:02.000','Satish','2019-01-28 15:18:02.000'),(940,1284,'1284',1085,'416c72a3-a2db-42db-9e91-50fe152da8ff','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Vinay Kumar Sood','vinay.sood@yahoo.co.in',9463990426,9463990426,0,'A 402 Aakashganga Konkane Chowk','Pimple Saudagar Rahatani',21,470,'411017','1','A 402 Aakashganga Konkane Chowk','Pimple Saudagar Rahatani',21,470,'411017','Jagan Nath Bhandari','jagan2702@gmail.com',9855677966,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','ATS CASA Espana ','ATS Infrabuild Private Limited','parmod.kumar@atsgreens.com',8289011177,0,'711/92 Deepali, Nehru Place','',10,562,'110019','0','16, ATS Tower Sector 135','Noida',33,216,'201301','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'Satish','2019-01-28 15:49:52.000','Satish','2019-01-28 15:49:52.000'),(941,1284,'1284',1085,'416c72a3-a2db-42db-9e91-50fe152da8ff','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-29 07:01:25.000','Vinay Kumar Sood','vinay.sood@yahoo.co.in',9463990426,9463990426,0,'A 402 Aakashganga Konkane Chowk','Pimple Saudagar Rahatani',21,470,'411017','1','A 402 Aakashganga Konkane Chowk','Pimple Saudagar Rahatani',21,470,'411017','Jagan Nath Bhandari','jagan2702@gmail.com',9855677966,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','ATS CASA Espana ','ATS Infrabuild Private Limited','parmod.kumar@atsgreens.com',8289011177,0,'711/92 Deepali, Nehru Place','',10,562,'110019','0','16, ATS Tower Sector 135','Noida',33,216,'201301','1','<p>That Applicants booked a Flat in respondent’s project namely “ATS Casa Epsana” at Sector-121, District- S.A.S. Nagar, Punjab vide Agreement dated 27.03.2017. Copy of said agreement is Annexure A-1. That as per Schedule III of Annexure A-1 the total sale consideration price was Rs. 96,28,400/- but till date applicants have paid Rs. 98,79,132/-. Copy of ledger Subsidiary Ledger is Annexure A-2.  \r\n</p><p>That as per Clause 6.2 of Annexure A-1, Developer endeavor to complete the construction of the Apartment by December 2017, along with grace period of three months &amp; will hand over the possession to complainants. It is further mentioned that respondent will send the possession Notice &amp; offer possession of Flat to complainants, as &amp; when the company receives the occupation certificate from competent authority. \r\n</p><p>That the applicants after December 2017 asked the status of possession by personal visit to the site of project, &amp; through various phone calls &amp; emails but did not get any answer for the possession status. That on 18th March 2018 applicants visited the site &amp; inquired about the delay in possession then officers of respondent told that the construction is going in full swing but without any commitment for the possession date. Applicants remained in constant contact with respondent over phone &amp; then again followed with email on 6th June 2018 &amp; reply received from Developer on 11th June 2018, clearly saying that they do not have any clarity on the possession of the flat, hence possession indefinitely on 18th August 2018 again representative of applicants visited the site &amp; applicants followed with mail, copy attached wherein respondent was informed for delay &amp; penalty claim at 18% interest on the money paid. Since no satisfactory reply was coming for possession therefore, on 27th October 2018 complainant sent a speed post letter &amp; also copied on email copy enclosed, wherein giving notice for delayed possession penalty at 12% interest. Annexure C may be read for facts.</p>','<p>I.&nbsp; <span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the clause 6.3 Annexure A-1 is liable to be set aside as this term and condition is against the natural justice and fair play, if the payment is delayed on the part of applicants then respondent is entitled to 12% interest on delayed payment whereas when respondent failed to deliver the possession on time then applicants is entitled only Rs.5 P/M per square feet on Super Built Up Area of the apartment. It is arbitrary and illegal in nature hence liable to be set aside.&nbsp; If the respondent is entitled for the interest 12% PA on delay of payment then Applicants are also entitled for same rate of interest on paid amount i.e. Rs. 78,03,703/- from 31.12.2017 till 10.01.2019.</p><p>II. <span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That in view of email dated 20.04.2018 the applicants are entitled for 12% interest on Rs. 20,00,000/- paid as early payment. From 13.04.2018 to 10.01.2019 the interest comes out Rs.1,78,191/- approx.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span></p><p>III. <span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The respondent should further penalized for violation of Sec 18 of RERA Act as despite the receiving of amount of Rs. 98,79,132/- the respondent have not handed over the possession to the applicants.</p><p>IV. <span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That further the illegal demands for Maintenance charges of Rs.84,960/- and outstanding amount of Rs.3,63,996/- by respondent raised vide Annexure A-4 is liable to set aside in terms and condition of Annexure A-1 and Annexure A-2.</p><p>V. That the applicants have suffered the loss of Rs.50,000/- as litigation expenses as the respondent have dragged the applicants in unnecessarily litigation. So respondent are liable to pay the Rs.50,000/- to the applicants.&nbsp;</p><p>VI.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Any other appropriate remedy or relief which this Authority may deem fit in the present circumstances may also be awarded in the favour of Applicants.</p>',9628400.00,9879132.00,'2017-12-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>That the respondent be directed not to initiate any action, impose penalty or penal interest or any other monetary/physical harm or to flat during the pendency of this application. Further, respondent be restrained from selling the Flat in question to anyone till the pendency of the dispute nor create any 3rd party interest in the favour of anyone.&nbsp;</p>','1','','2017-03-27 00:00:00','2017-03-27 00:00:00','Type B flat on 19th Floor, Tower  no. 7, Unit 07191 ','','',1,1,0,0,'Satish','2019-01-28 15:53:26.000','Satish','2019-01-28 15:53:26.000'),(942,1279,'1279',1357,'defafd2a-a305-4a38-9251-73a5e317e083','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bhupinder Paul Juneja & Anshul Juneja','junejatyres55@gmail.com',9876630855,0,0,'128 Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128 Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority','ca@puda.gov.in',0,1722215202,'PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62','SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62','SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p>We purchased SCO plot number 20 at Old Jail Site, Jalandhar on 18/11/2016 via PUDA auction. Total area of the plot is 147 square meters. The price of plot is Rs 15743700 excluding cancer cess. The cancer cess amount paid is Rs 314874. At the time of Auction we were given a brochure (Annexure A) in which clause 7 point (a) stated \"No Interest will be charged from the allottees till the offer of possession/deemed possession\".&nbsp; On 22/03/2017 we received the allotment letter (Annexure B) in which it was mentioned under clause 4 section (i) \"Possession of the plot shall be handed over to the allottee within 90 days of issue of allotment letter\". Its been more than 2 years and 2 months since auction but we still have not been given possession. The development works are still not completed at the site. We have been paying instalments as per the conditions allotment letter. As the possession was not given at the time of paying instalments we paid the instalments without interest as per the conditions of the brochure. All the payment except the TDS deposited by us on behalf of PUDA are shown in ledger downloaded from the PUDA/JDA website (Annexure C). TDS form16B attached and schedule payment including TDS&nbsp; (Annexure D). On 27/02/2018 we received a show cause notice (Annexure E) saying we owe Rs 1382456 on our plot. When inquired regarding this notice we were told we didn\'t interest deposit that\'s why we were issued the show cause notice. We replied (Annexure F) to the show cause notice on 22/03/2018 but we haven\'t received any reply from PUDA. We visited the PUDA office Jalandhar many times haven\'t been able to get any concrete answer regarding interest and possession. Now on 28/01/2019, I have received another show cause notice (Annexure G) which says I owe Rs 3700000 as balance from last 3 instalments. I have replied to the show cause notice (Annexure H) on 29/01/2019.&nbsp; We would like to keep the plot and not withdraw from the project.</p>','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">We seek relief of interest on principal amount paid by us for delay in the possession @18% PA on the\r\nmonthly compounding basis. This delay has put us in significant financial constraints, physical and\r\nmental stress. We also seek compensation of Rs 10 Lakh for Physical and metal stress for being dragged in\r\nthe litigation to seek relief through this complaint. PUDA/JDA should complete all the </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">necessary</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;development works at the site and issue possession letters at the earliest. Also we would like PUDA/JDA to give us in </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">writing</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;that we will not be charged interest till the possession letter is issued after completion of development works.</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>',15743700.00,10253548.57,'2017-06-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 11pt;\">PUDA/JDA to give us in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14.6667px;\">writing</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;that we will not be charged interest till the possession letter is issued after completion of development works.</span><br></p>','1','','2017-03-22 00:00:00','2016-11-18 00:00:00','SCO 20 Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','','',2,0,0,0,'bhupinderjuneja55','2019-01-28 16:37:18.000','bhupinderjuneja55','2019-01-28 16:37:18.000'),(943,1279,'1279',1357,'defafd2a-a305-4a38-9251-73a5e317e083','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bhupinder Paul Juneja & Anshul Juneja','junejatyres55@gmail.com',9876630855,0,0,'128 Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128 Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority','ca@puda.gov.in',0,1722215202,'PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62','SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62','SAS Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p>We purchased SCO plot number 20 at Old Jail Site, Jalandhar on 18/11/2016 via PUDA auction. Total area of the plot is 147 square meters. The price of plot is Rs 15743700 excluding cancer cess. The cancer cess amount paid is Rs 314874. At the time of Auction we were given a brochure (Annexure A) in which clause 7 point (a) stated \"No Interest will be charged from the allottees till the offer of possession/deemed possession\".&nbsp; On 22/03/2017 we received the allotment letter (Annexure B) in which it was mentioned under clause 4 section (i) \"Possession of the plot shall be handed over to the allottee within 90 days of issue of allotment letter\". Its been more than 2 years and 2 months since auction but we still have not been given possession. The development works are still not completed at the site. We have been paying instalments as per the conditions allotment letter. As the possession was not given at the time of paying instalments we paid the instalments without interest as per the conditions of the brochure. All the payment except the TDS deposited by us on behalf of PUDA are shown in ledger downloaded from the PUDA/JDA website (Annexure C). TDS form16B attached and schedule payment including TDS&nbsp; (Annexure D). On 27/02/2018 we received a show cause notice (Annexure E) saying we owe Rs 1382456 on our plot. When inquired regarding this notice we were told we didn\'t interest deposit that\'s why we were issued the show cause notice. We replied (Annexure F) to the show cause notice on 22/03/2018 but we haven\'t received any reply from PUDA. We visited the PUDA office Jalandhar many times haven\'t been able to get any concrete answer regarding interest and possession. Now on 28/01/2019, I have received another show cause notice (Annexure G) which says I owe Rs 3700000 as balance from last 3 instalments. I have replied to the show cause notice (Annexure H) on 29/01/2019.&nbsp; We would like to keep the plot and not withdraw from the project.</p>','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">We seek relief of interest on principal amount paid by us for delay in the possession @18% PA on the\r\nmonthly compounding basis. This delay has put us in significant financial constraints, physical and\r\nmental stress. We also seek compensation of Rs 10 Lakh for Physical and metal stress for being dragged in\r\nthe litigation to seek relief through this complaint. PUDA/JDA should complete all the </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">necessary</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;development works at the site and issue possession letters at the earliest. Also we would like PUDA/JDA to give us in </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">writing</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;that we will not be charged interest till the possession letter is issued after completion of development works.</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>',15743700.00,10253548.57,'2017-06-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 11pt;\">PUDA/JDA to give us in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14.6667px;\">writing</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;that we will not be charged interest till the possession letter is issued after completion of development works.</span><br></p>','1','','2017-03-22 00:00:00','2016-11-18 00:00:00','SCO 20 Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','','',1,0,0,0,'bhupinderjuneja55','2019-01-28 16:39:48.000','bhupinderjuneja55','2019-01-28 16:39:48.000'),(944,1285,'1285',1355,'e083ff7d-3771-429b-91e6-5fc4a8440d00','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-30 09:48:28.000','Joginder  Sethi','jogindersethi@ymail.com',9814010738,0,0,'E-402, Rishi Apartments','Sector - 70',28,507,'160071','1','E-402, Rishi Apartments','Sector - 70',28,507,'160071','','',0,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS79-PM0058','M/S. SBP Dream City Pvt. Ltd.,','AMANDEEP SINGLA','god@sbpgroup.in',0,1724972200,'SCO 146-148 FIRST FLOOR ','SECTOR-43B',6,128,'160043','0','Sante Majra Road','Khara Mohali',28,507,'140301','1','<p>I very humbly submit to your good self that I have been mislead, misinformed and cheated by the renowned builders SBP in their project GOD Zirapur. I have booked a flat by depositing Rs.2 lakhs and I was allowed flat no. 1137 in tower no 3 on 11th floor.&nbsp; Receipt of&nbsp; Rs.&nbsp; 2 lacs is enclosed a Annexed - A1. However, I received a letter dated 27/11/18 from the promoter SBP Dream city Pvt. Ltd.,&nbsp; asking me enter into apartment buyers agreement failing which the application dated. 17/04/18 would be rejected and&nbsp; booking of flat flat&nbsp; cancelled. However I obtained a copy of document purported to be allotment letter which is tampered from unit no 1137 to 1140 ( over writing). Since I have booked flat no 1137 which is corner flat, however the promoter has changed it to flat no. 1137 to 1140 without my consent and i do not want to take flat no 1140 and was interested in flat no 1137 only .&nbsp;</p><p>I have also issued legal notice dt. 10/12/18 the promoter to refund Rs. 2 lacs with cost and litigation expense copy of legal notice is attached&nbsp; Annexed - A-2.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;It is there from prayed that the amount deposited by the undersigned may please be ordered to be returned along with interest.</p><p><br></p><p>Respectfully Yours</p><p>Joginder Sethi</p><div><br></div>','<p>&nbsp;It is there from prayed that the amount deposited by the undersigned may please be ordered to be returned along with interest.</p><div><br></div>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>&nbsp;It is there from prayed that the amount deposited by the undersigned may please be ordered to be returned along with interest.</p><div><br></div>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'jogindersethi','2019-01-28 18:52:41.000','jogindersethi','2019-01-28 18:52:41.000'),(945,1286,'1286',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Harjinder Singh Kohli','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.comm',9501142800,0,0,'1191','Sector-42B',6,128,'160036','1','House No. 253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0004','Ireo Waterfront','Ireo waterfront Private Limited','iwpl@ireo.in',0,1613040290,'Ireo Waterfront, Sidhwan Canal Road','Opp Ferozpur Road, Village Dewatwal',28,366,'141001','0','SCO 16-17, Fortune Chambers','Opposite Ludhiana Stock Exchange',28,366,'141001','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2019-01-30 09:48:42.000','rerafilingformm','2019-01-30 09:48:42.000'),(946,1286,'1286',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Harjinder Singh Kohli','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.comm',9501142800,0,0,'1191','Sector-42B',6,128,'160036','1','House No. 253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0004','Ireo Waterfront','Ireo waterfront Private Limited','iwpl@ireo.in',0,1613040290,'Ireo Waterfront, Sidhwan Canal Road','Opp Ferozpur Road, Village Dewatwal',28,366,'141001','0','SCO 16-17, Fortune Chambers','Opposite Ludhiana Stock Exchange',28,366,'141001','1','abc','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2019-01-30 09:50:42.000','rerafilingformm','2019-01-30 09:50:42.000'),(947,1286,'1286',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Harjinder Singh Kohli','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.comm',9501142800,0,0,'1191','Sector-42B',6,128,'160036','1','House No. 253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0004','Ireo Waterfront','Ireo waterfront Private Limited','iwpl@ireo.in',0,1613040290,'Ireo Waterfront, Sidhwan Canal Road','Opp Ferozpur Road, Village Dewatwal',28,366,'141001','0','SCO 16-17, Fortune Chambers','Opposite Ludhiana Stock Exchange',28,366,'141001','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">Complainant booked a residential flat bearing No. CC-T3-02-203, Type-H measuring 1306 sq ft (121.33 sq mtr) for total sale consideration of Rs.5747919/-. Complainant has paid Rs.1336820 till date but till today neither buyer’s agreement has been executed nor did the respondent start any development of group housing. Respondent acknowledged the receipt of application dated 22.2.13 and receipt of Rs. 3 lacs vide A-1 and further demanded Rs. 234728/- by 24.3.13 and Rs. 802092/- by 23.5.13, which was duly paid by the complainant( Ann A-3 &amp; A-4). A provisional allotment letter was issued and flat No. CG-T3-02-203 was provisionally allotted (A-5). Respondent had assured to deliver the possession within 2 years. Respondent failed to mail the buyer agreement as promised. Inspite of repeated requests, the buyer agreement was not executed. In June, 2014 a request was made through email to refund the amount with interest since there was no development. Complainant received a letter vide (A-6) which it was informed that development work is progressing well but infact there was no development. Complainant also called for refund and it was assured that his request for refund will be processed shortly. Thereafter many times request for refund was made but to no avail. Respondent failed to start the construction of group housing.email was also sent on 9.4.2015 (A-6) and a call was also made to Amrik Singh, on 1.10.2015 but to avail. A letter dated 21.7.2017 was also sent to respondent for refund but there was response from respondent. Since there is no development and construction activity of group housing in which the flat of complainant is located, and considerable time has also passed, the complainant does not wish to have a flat and thus wish to withdraw from the project.The respondent has indulged into unfair trade practices by not informing about the progress of project and it even failed to start the construction of group housing and kept the complainant for so many years.</span></font></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To direct the\r\nrespondent to refund the principal amount of Rs. 1336820/- as per Section 18 of\r\nRERA along with interest as prescribed under rule 16 of Punjab RERA Rules, since\r\nthe respondent has failed to start any construction of group housing and consequently\r\nhas failed to handover the possession and thus the complainant wishes to\r\nwithdraw from the project and therefore is seeking refund of the amount paid by\r\nhim along with interest. The complainant will file separate complaint for\r\nclaiming compensation.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',5747919.00,1336820.00,'2015-02-22 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>To direct the respondent to furnish details regarding the group housing project and the reason for not starting the construction of group housing flats</p>','1','','2013-11-25 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','CG-T3-02-203','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2019-01-30 11:29:16.000','rerafilingformm','2019-01-30 11:29:16.000'),(948,1286,'1286',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Harjinder Singh Kohli','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.comm',9814257243,0,0,'1191','Sector-42D',6,128,'160036','1','House No. 253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0004','Ireo Waterfront','Ireo waterfront Private Limited','iwpl@ireo.in',0,1613040290,'Ireo Waterfront, Sidhwan Canal Road','Opp Ferozpur Road, Village Dewatwal',28,366,'141001','0','SCO 16-17, Fortune Chambers','Opposite Ludhiana Stock Exchange',28,366,'141001','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">Complainant booked a residential flat bearing No. CC-T3-02-203, Type-H measuring 1306 sq ft (121.33 sq mtr) for total sale consideration of Rs.5747919/-. Complainant has paid Rs.1336820 till date but till today neither buyer’s agreement has been executed nor did the respondent start any development of group housing. Respondent acknowledged the receipt of application dated 22.2.13 and receipt of Rs. 3 lacs vide A-1 and further demanded Rs. 234728/- by 24.3.13 and Rs. 802092/- by 23.5.13, which was duly paid by the complainant( Ann A-3 &amp; A-4). A provisional allotment letter was issued and flat No. CG-T3-02-203 was provisionally allotted (A-5). Respondent had assured to deliver the possession within 2 years. Respondent failed to mail the buyer agreement as promised. Inspite of repeated requests, the buyer agreement was not executed. In June, 2014 a request was made through email to refund the amount with interest since there was no development. Complainant received a letter vide (A-6) which it was informed that development work is progressing well but infact there was no development. Complainant also called for refund and it was assured that his request for refund will be processed shortly. Thereafter many times request for refund was made but to no avail. Respondent failed to start the construction of group housing.email was also sent on 9.4.2015 (A-6) and a call was also made to Amrik Singh, on 1.10.2015 but to avail. A letter dated 21.7.2017 was also sent to respondent for refund but there was response from respondent. Since there is no development and construction activity of group housing in which the flat of complainant is located, and considerable time has also passed, the complainant does not wish to have a flat and thus wish to withdraw from the project.The respondent has indulged into unfair trade practices by not informing about the progress of project and it even failed to start the construction of group housing and kept the complainant for so many years.</span></font></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To direct the\r\nrespondent to refund the principal amount of Rs. 1336820/- as per Section 18 of\r\nRERA along with interest as prescribed under rule 16 of Punjab RERA Rules, since\r\nthe respondent has failed to start any construction of group housing and consequently\r\nhas failed to handover the possession and thus the complainant wishes to\r\nwithdraw from the project and therefore is seeking refund of the amount paid by\r\nhim along with interest. The complainant will file separate complaint for\r\nclaiming compensation.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',5747919.00,1336820.00,'2015-02-22 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>To direct the respondent to furnish details regarding the group housing project and the reason for not starting the construction of group housing flats</p>','1','','2013-11-25 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','CG-T3-02-203','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2019-01-30 11:31:26.000','rerafilingformm','2019-01-30 11:31:26.000'),(949,1286,'1286',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Harjinder Singh Kohli','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.comm',9814257243,0,0,'1191','Sector-42D',6,128,'160036','1','House No. 253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0004','Ireo Waterfront','Ireo waterfront Private Limited','iwpl@ireo.in',0,1613040290,'Ireo Waterfront, Sidhwan Canal Road','Opp Ferozpur Road, Village Dewatwal',28,366,'141001','0','SCO 16-17, Fortune Chambers','Opposite Ludhiana Stock Exchange',28,366,'141001','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">Complainant booked a residential flat bearing No. CC-T3-02-203, Type-H measuring 1306 sq ft(121.33 sq mtr)for total sale consideration of Rs.5747919/-. Complainant has paid Rs.1336820 till date but till today neither buyer’s agreement has been executed nor did the respondent start any development of group housing. Respondent acknowledged the receipt of application dated 22.2.13 and receipt of Rs. 3 lacs vide A-1 and further demanded Rs. 234728/- by 24.3.13 and Rs. 802092/- by 23.5.13,which was duly paid by the complainant(Ann A-2 &amp; A-3).A provisional allotment letter was issued and flat No. CG-T3-02-203 was provisionally allotted (A-4).Respondent had assured to deliver the possession within 2 years. Respondent failed to mail the buyer agreement as promised.Inspite of repeated requests, the buyer agreement was not executed. In June, 2014 a request was made through email to refund the amount with interest since there was no development. Complainant received a letter vide(A-5)which it was informed that development work is progressing well but infact there was no development. Complainant also called for refund and it was assured that his request for refund will be processed shortly. Thereafter many times request for refund was made but to no avail. Respondent failed to start the construction of group housing. Email was also sent on 9.4.2015 (A-6) and a call was also made to Amrik Singh,on 1.10.2015 but to avail. A letter dated 21.7.2017 (A-7) was also sent to respondent for refund but there was response from respondent. Since there is no development and construction activity of group housing in which the flat of complainant is located, and considerable time has also passed, the complainant does not wish to have a flat and thus wish to withdraw from the project.The respondent has indulged into unfair trade practices by not informing about the progress of project and it even failed to start the construction of group housing and kept the complainant in loop for many years.</span></font></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To direct the\r\nrespondent to refund the principal amount of Rs. 1336820/- as per Section 18 of\r\nRERA along with interest as prescribed under rule 16 of Punjab RERA Rules, since\r\nthe respondent has failed to start any construction of group housing and consequently\r\nhas failed to handover the possession and thus the complainant wishes to\r\nwithdraw from the project and therefore is seeking refund of the amount paid by\r\nhim along with interest. The complainant will file separate complaint for\r\nclaiming compensation.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',5747919.00,1336820.00,'2015-02-22 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>To direct the respondent to furnish details regarding the group housing project and the reason for not starting the construction of group housing flats</p>','1','','2013-11-25 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','CG-T3-02-203','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2019-01-30 11:41:36.000','rerafilingformm','2019-01-30 11:41:36.000'),(950,1287,'1287',1364,'35ea0d15-93a6-49f4-afc6-fcb51741f763','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-30 15:58:26.000','Harvinder Singh','narinder2273@gmail.com',9914952929,0,0,'J 403, Imperial Heights, Sector 115','Kharar - Landran road',28,507,'140307','1','#2273, Sector 44C','Chandigarh',6,128,'160043','Narinder Pal Sharma','narinder2273@gmail.com',9876609052,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0046','Imperial Heights','WWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd','info@wwicsestates.com',9888909978,0,'A-12, Industrial Area, Phase-VI, Mohali','',28,507,'160055','1','A-12, Industrial Area, Phase-VI, Mohali','',28,507,'160055','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">1&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;The complainants applied for the allotment and\r\npaid the initial&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Payment of Rs. </span><b style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">5,79,750/-\r\n</b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(Rupees Five lakhs Seventy Nine Thousand Seven Hundred and Fifty only)\r\nalongwith the application which was registered as J-403 dated </span><b style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">26.12.2011</b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"> and on the basis of said\r\napplication, Apartment No.J-403 was allotted to the complainants on fourth\r\nfloor at the basic price of Rs. </span><b style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">26,66,850/-</b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">\r\nwhich was subsequently converted to Subvention Scheme according to which no EMI\r\nwas required to be paid till possession and accordingly basic price was\r\nenhanced to Rs. </span><b style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">28,40,775/-</b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"> and the\r\nrespondent company also entered into an Agreement for Apartment.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-36.0pt;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">1.2 &nbsp; &nbsp;That the complainants after paying entire price of the aforesaid\r\nApartment as per terms and conditions have got the possession of the Apartment\r\non dated <b>15.11.2017</b> and also got the\r\nno due certificate for the Apartment in favour of complainants, <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-36.0pt;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">1.3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That\r\nthe complainants have deposited the all the charges against the sale deed i.e.\r\nRs. 2,21,392/- (Stamp Duty, Registry charges and other charges) as per the\r\nrespondents demand. After that complainants have made several requests by\r\npersonal visits, phone calls as well as through email communications to the\r\nrespondents to get the sale deed executed but the respondents are not\r\nresponding and are illegally demanding maintenance charges. There<a name=\"_GoBack\"></a> conduct is in gross violation of terms and conditions of\r\nthe Agreement of Apartment entered with the complainants. &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n200%\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-36.0pt;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">1.4 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That due to the act<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.7pt\"> </span>and<span style=\"letter-spacing:3.2pt\"> </span>conduct\r\n<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.55pt\">of</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:2.2pt\">\r\n</span>the respondent/Company, the Complainants</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">have suffered\r\n<span style=\"letter-spacing:.35pt\">great</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:\r\n2.95pt\"> </span>mental <span style=\"letter-spacing:.55pt\">as</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:1.55pt\"> </span>well<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.45pt\"> </span>as <span style=\"letter-spacing:.05pt\">physical</span>\r\n<span style=\"letter-spacing:.95pt\">stress</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:\r\n2.65pt\"> </span>&amp;<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.5pt\"> </span>strain. Therefore,\r\nthe complainants are &nbsp;entitled&nbsp; to get the sale deed executed .<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n36.0pt;line-height:200%\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: 36pt;\">Respectfully prayed that the present complaint may kindly be allowed and following relief may kindly be awarded to the Complainant against the</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: 36pt; color: rgb(89, 93, 100);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: 36pt;\">Opposite Parties:-</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 1.3pt 24.55pt 0.0001pt 126pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 28px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 37.3333px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">a)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 37.3333px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Respondent/Company be directed to get the sale&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 1.3pt 24.55pt 0.0001pt 144pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 28px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 37.3333px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">deed registered within the period of 15 days.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 126pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 28px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 37.3333px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">b)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 37.3333px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The respondent/ Company may also be directed to pay to<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 108pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 28px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 37.3333px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;the Complainant the cost of litigation amounting to&nbsp;&nbsp;Rs. 15,000/-.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 126pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 28px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 37.3333px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">c)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 37.3333px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Any other relief that this Hon’ble Authority deems fit and&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">proper in view of the facts and circumstances of the complaint, may also be awarded to the Complainants in the interest of justice.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:126.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"></p>',3166519.00,3166519.00,'2015-06-30 00:00:00.000','2017-11-15 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n16.0pt;line-height:200%\">Respondent may kindly be restrained from claiming\r\nmaintenance charges illegally till the agreed amenities not provided and sale\r\ndeed not executed.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','2011-12-26 00:00:00','2012-06-20 00:00:00','J403, Imperial Heights\r\nSector 115, Kharar- Landran road, SAS Nagar, Mohali 140307','','',1,1,0,0,'narinder2273','2019-01-30 11:48:45.000','narinder2273','2019-01-30 11:48:45.000'),(951,1286,'1286',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Harjinder Singh Kohli','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.comm',9814257243,0,0,'1191','Sector-42D',6,128,'160036','1','House No. 253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0004','Ireo Waterfront','Ireo waterfront Private Limited','iwpl@ireo.in',0,1613040290,'Ireo Waterfront, Sidhwan Canal Road','Opp Ferozpur Road, Village Dewatwal',28,366,'141001','0','SCO 16-17, Fortune Chambers','Opposite Ludhiana Stock Exchange',28,366,'141001','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">Complainant booked a residential flat bearing No. CC-T3-02-203, Type-H measuring 1306 sq ft(121.33 sq mtr)for total sale consideration of Rs.5747919/-. Complainant has paid Rs.1336820 till date but till today neither buyer’s agreement has been executed nor did the respondent start any development of group housing. Respondent acknowledged the receipt of application dated 22.2.13 and receipt of Rs. 3 lacs vide A-1 and further demanded Rs. 234728/- by 24.3.13 and Rs. 802092/- by 23.5.13,which was duly paid by the complainant(Ann A-2 &amp; A-3).A provisional allotment letter was issued and flat No. CG-T3-02-203 was provisionally allotted (A-4).Respondent had assured to deliver the possession within 2 years. Respondent failed to mail the buyer agreement as promised.Inspite of repeated requests, the buyer agreement was not executed. In June, 2014 a request was made through email to refund the amount with interest since there was no development. Complainant received a letter vide(A-5)which it was informed that development work is progressing well but infact there was no development. Complainant also called for refund and it was assured that his request for refund will be processed shortly. Thereafter many times request for refund was made but to no avail. Respondent failed to start the construction of group housing. Email was also sent on 9.4.2015 (A-6) and a call was also made to Amrik Singh,on 1.10.2015 but to avail. A letter dated 21.7.2017 (A-7) was also sent to respondent for refund but there was response from respondent. Since there is no development and construction activity of group housing in which the flat of complainant is located, and considerable time has also passed, the complainant does not wish to have a flat and thus wish to withdraw from the project.The respondent has indulged into unfair trade practices by not informing about the progress of project and it even failed to start the construction of group housing and kept the complainant in loop for many years.</span></font></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To direct the\r\nrespondent to refund the principal amount of Rs. 1336820/- as per Section 18 of\r\nRERA along with interest as prescribed under rule 16 of Punjab RERA Rules, since\r\nthe respondent has failed to start any construction of group housing and consequently\r\nhas failed to handover the possession and thus the complainant wishes to\r\nwithdraw from the project and therefore is seeking refund of the amount paid by\r\nhim along with interest. The complainant will file separate complain