yle=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;given at the time of auction (Annexure F).</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">I seek relief of interest on principal amount paid by me for delay in the possession @18% PA on the\r\nmonthly compounding basis. Now as I haven\'t got the No Due Certificate and bank refusing to lend money for construction because of PUDA\'s delay in providing No Due Certificate. PUDA should charge Non construction charges 3 years&nbsp; after the date of issue of No Due certificate instead of date of possession. As I am ready to </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">construct</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;but due to delays by PUDA in giving possession and No Due Certificate I will have to bear the escalation of construction charges. I also seek Rs 60000 as Litigation charges and Rs 1 lakh for </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">Harassment</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;and Mental Agony.&nbsp;</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>',11402358.00,11276364.58,'2017-04-22 00:00:00.000','2018-06-26 00:00:00.000','<p>PUDA should provide me the No Due Certificate with no further delay as the bank has been asking me for the same. So that I can get loan from bank for construction.</p>','1','','2016-08-17 00:00:00','2016-04-22 00:00:00','65-C Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','','',1,1,0,0,'nikhil_sp1','2019-02-05 15:21:18.000','nikhil_sp1','2019-02-05 15:21:18.000'),(985,1288,'1288',1369,'0e157dcb-4e45-4c7a-a3cd-d4664ae34cf8','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Uniroyal Industries Limited through Akhil Mahajan','csvedparkash@gmail.com',9876011456,0,0,'Plot No. 365, Insdustral Area','Phase-II, Pachkula',13,15,'134113','1','Plot No. 365, Insdustral Area','Phase-II, Pachkula',13,15,'134113','Ved Parkash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0124','Acme Eden Court','Acme Builders Pvt. Ltd','contact@acmebuilders.in',8592122888,1724625000,'GH-10, JLPL','Sector-91 Mohali',28,507,'160032','1','GH-10, JLPL','Sector-91 Mohali',28,507,'160032','1','<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That M/s Uniroyal Industries Limited with its Corporate Office at Plot No 365, Industrial Estate, Phase II, Panchkula-134113, the Complainant, booked a Flat No T1/1002, Sector 91, Acme Eden Court, Mohali (Punjab)-141001 on 11.05.2011 from M/s Acme Builders Private Limited with its Corporate Office at SCO 2449-50, First Floor, Sector 22-C, Chandigarh, the Respondent. A copy of the brochure, commercial details and advance registration form are attached as Annexure C/1(Colly).</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the complainant&nbsp; made initial booking amount of 24,50,0000/- along with advance registration form and one more payment amounting to Rs. 1,17,775/- as per details annexed as C/2.</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The respondent issued allotment letter for the allotted unit on 15.12.2012 attached as C/3.</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The respondent entered into Builder Buyer Agreement (Annexed as C/4) with the complainant 13.12.2012 at a total consideration of Rs. 90,87,212/- inclusive of PLC, Maintenance Security etc. The allotted unit measured super area of 2345 sq.ft. That as per clause 15 of the said builder buyer agreement, the respondent was to offer possession within 42 months from the date of the said agreement, which arrives at 13.06.2016.</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the complainant opted for subvention payment plan annexed to the agreement which was later on converted into CLP vide amendment date 31.12.2012 to the said agreement, annexed as C/5.</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The complainant made additional payments amounting to Rs. 3,19,773/- and Rs. 158,689/- from their own account as per details annexed as C/6.</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The complainant got the home loan approval from the PNB Housing Finance Limited for an amount of Rs. 61,30,443/-. Out of the said home loan approval account, an amount of Rs. 55,63,515/- has been paid to the respondent as per details annexed as C/7.<br></div>','<p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The complainant got the home loan approval from the PNB Housing Finance Limited for an amount of Rs. 61,30,443/-. Out of the said home loan approval account, an amount of Rs. 55,63,515/- has been paid to the respondent as per details annexed as C/7.</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Thus total payments made by the complainant to the respondent amount to Rs. 86,09,752/- as per Statement of Account annexed as C/8.</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the residential project is still not complete and the development of common areas is very low. Being an ongoing project, the said project is registered with RERA vide Registration No PBRERA-SAS81-PR0124.&nbsp;</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the above project of the respondent is registered with RERA with Registration Number PBRERA-SAS80-PC0007, being an ongoing project.&nbsp;</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The project is already delayed by more than 2 years and 8 months where the respondent received majority of the payments between 2011 and 2014 suggesting diversion of funds by the respondent. The complainant has lost faith that the respondent would be able to offer early possession after obtaining completion/occupancy certificate from the competent authorities.</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>In view of the above facts, the respondent has violated the provisions mentioned u/s 12, 18 and 19 of the Act.&nbsp;</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The complainant wishes to withdraw from the project on account of delayed possession of the allocated unit.&nbsp;</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>It is most respectfully prayed that the respondent be directed to refund the entire amount paid to the respondent along with interest as per provisions of the Act.</p><div><br></div>',9087212.00,8609752.00,'2016-06-13 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Not Applicable</p>','1','','2012-12-15 00:00:00','2012-12-13 00:00:00','Flat No. 1002, 10th Floor, Tower-1, Acme Eden Court, GH-10, JLPL Sector-90-91, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'uniroyalindustries','2019-02-06 13:25:02.000','uniroyalindustries','2019-02-06 13:25:02.000'),(986,1288,'1288',1369,'0e157dcb-4e45-4c7a-a3cd-d4664ae34cf8','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Uniroyal Industries Limited through Akhil Mahajan','csvedparkash@gmail.com',9876011456,0,0,'Plot No. 365, Insdustral Area','Phase-II, Pachkula',13,15,'134113','1','Plot No. 365, Insdustral Area','Phase-II, Pachkula',13,15,'134113','Ved Parkash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0124','Acme Eden Court','Acme Builders Pvt. Ltd','contact@acmebuilders.in',8592122888,1724625000,'GH-10, JLPL','Sector-91 Mohali',28,507,'160032','1','GH-10, JLPL','Sector-91 Mohali',28,507,'160032','1','<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That M/s Uniroyal Industries Limited with its Corporate Office at Plot No 365, Industrial Estate, Phase II, Panchkula-134113, the Complainant, booked a Flat No T1/1002, Sector 91, Acme Eden Court, Mohali (Punjab)-141001 on 11.05.2011 from M/s Acme Builders Private Limited with its Corporate Office at SCO 2449-50, First Floor, Sector 22-C, Chandigarh, the Respondent. A copy of the brochure, commercial details and advance registration form are attached as Annexure C/1(Colly).</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the complainant&nbsp; made initial booking amount of 24,50,0000/- along with advance registration form and one more payment amounting to Rs. 1,17,775/- as per details annexed as C/2.</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The respondent issued allotment letter for the allotted unit on 15.12.2012 attached as C/3.</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The respondent entered into Builder Buyer Agreement (Annexed as C/4) with the complainant 13.12.2012 at a total consideration of Rs. 90,87,212/- inclusive of PLC, Maintenance Security etc. The allotted unit measured super area of 2345 sq.ft. That as per clause 15 of the said builder buyer agreement, the respondent was to offer possession within 42 months from the date of the said agreement, which arrives at 13.06.2016.</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the complainant opted for subvention payment plan annexed to the agreement which was later on converted into CLP vide amendment date 31.12.2012 to the said agreement, annexed as C/5.</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The complainant made additional payments amounting to Rs. 3,19,773/- and Rs. 158,689/- from their own account as per details annexed as C/6.</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The complainant got the home loan approval from the PNB Housing Finance Limited for an amount of Rs. 61,30,443/-. Out of the said home loan approval account, an amount of Rs. 55,63,515/- has been paid to the respondent as per details annexed as C/7.<br></div>','<p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The complainant got the home loan approval from the PNB Housing Finance Limited for an amount of Rs. 61,30,443/-. Out of the said home loan approval account, an amount of Rs. 55,63,515/- has been paid to the respondent as per details annexed as C/7.</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Thus total payments made by the complainant to the respondent amount to Rs. 86,09,752/- as per Statement of Account annexed as C/8.</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the residential project is still not complete and the development of common areas is very low. Being an ongoing project, the said project is registered with RERA vide Registration No PBRERA-SAS81-PR0124.&nbsp;</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the above project of the respondent is registered with RERA with Registration Number PBRERA-SAS80-PC0007, being an ongoing project.&nbsp;</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The project is already delayed by more than 2 years and 8 months where the respondent received majority of the payments between 2011 and 2014 suggesting diversion of funds by the respondent. The complainant has lost faith that the respondent would be able to offer early possession after obtaining completion/occupancy certificate from the competent authorities.</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>In view of the above facts, the respondent has violated the provisions mentioned u/s 12, 18 and 19 of the Act.&nbsp;</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The complainant wishes to withdraw from the project on account of delayed possession of the allocated unit.&nbsp;</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>It is most respectfully prayed that the respondent be directed to refund the entire amount paid to the respondent along with interest as per provisions of the Act.</p><div><br></div>',9087212.00,8609752.00,'2016-06-13 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Not Applicable</p>','1','','2012-12-15 00:00:00','2012-12-13 00:00:00','Flat No. 1002, 10th Floor, Tower-1, Acme Eden Court, GH-10, JLPL Sector-90-91, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'uniroyalindustries','2019-02-06 13:25:31.000','uniroyalindustries','2019-02-06 13:25:31.000'),(987,1296,'1296',1348,'9e6eb098-b2d6-4eb1-9a76-81729ebe6097','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Dr. Asmita Mahla Bhambri','sanchitpunia@yahoo.in',9812169608,0,0,'1509, Phase 10, Sector-64, SAS Nagar','',28,507,'160062','1','1509, Phase 10, Sector-64, SAS Nagar','',28,507,'160062','Sanchit Punia','sanchitpuniaadvocate@gmail.com',9780181988,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0116','The Greater\r\nMohali Area\r\nDevelopment\r\nAuthority, IT City','The Greater Mohali Area Development Authority','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'The Chief Administrator, Greater Mohali Area Development Authority, ','PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62, District S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','The Chief Administrator, Greater Mohali Area Development Authority, ','PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62, District S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Respondent invited application for allotment of Plots bearing size 500 Sq.\r\nYard under 750 residential Plots in IT City S.A.S Nagar, Mohali as Annexure\r\nC-1.&nbsp;The Brochure(C-1)&nbsp;at page number 14 specifically\r\ncontain&nbsp;under the heading&nbsp;of Ownership and Possession (clause 2) that\r\nPhysical Possession will be given within one year from the date of issuance of\r\nLetter of intent. &nbsp;&nbsp;As per schedule draw of plots held on 21.09.2016\r\nand accordingly Barkha Ram S/o Ganga Ram resident of VPO Gulahar, Patiala was\r\ndeclared successful in category \'B\' vide serial number 215 with reference to\r\napplication Form No.15502 . Consequentially the letter of intent dated\r\n22.06.2017 was issued in favour of Barkha Ram vide Letter of Intent number\r\n26780 measuring 500 Sq. yard. in 750 Plot Scheme as Annexure C-2. As per clause\r\n15 of terms and conditions in the letter&nbsp;of intent the physical possession\r\nof the plot was to be handed over within one year from the date of\r\nletter&nbsp;of intent i.e. 22.06.2017. Thereafter Barkha Ram S/o Ganag Ram\r\nsubmitted an application for transfer(Annexure C-3) of letter on intent in the\r\nname of present Complainant&nbsp; and&nbsp;consequentially vide letter dated\r\n07.12.2017&nbsp; letter of intent was transferred in favour of present\r\ncomplainant (Annexure C-4). The bare perusal of C-4 specifically contend one\r\nthing that terms and condition so attached with letter of intent dated\r\n22.06.2017 is binding on complainant. It would be justify to mention here that\r\ncomplainant had pad Rs. 51,36,800/- till date and for the kind perusal of the Hon\'ble\r\nAuthority the ledge is annexed as Annexure C- 5. The sole grievance of the\r\ncomplainant is that respondent failed to deliver the physical possession within\r\na period of one year(22.06.2018) as per clause 15 of terms and condition of\r\nletter of intent (Page 27) and Clause 2 of&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Ownership and\r\nPossession at page number 14 of C-1, and&nbsp;is arbitrarily&nbsp;charging 12%\r\ninterest on the&nbsp;installments&nbsp;with 18%&nbsp;Penal Interest, being\r\nun-lawful and arbitrary.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">I) Respondent may\r\nbe directed to refund the un-lawful interest (including Penal Interest) so\r\ncharged by the them after the lapse of&nbsp;deemed dated (22.06.2018) of\r\nhanding over physical possession.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">ii) Respondent\r\nmay be directed to pay 18%&nbsp;interest on the submitted amount due to delay\r\nin possession.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">ii) Respondent\r\nshould be directed to&nbsp;charge interest at law rate and&nbsp;refund the\r\nexcessive&nbsp;interest amount&nbsp;so charged till date.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">iii)\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;Respondent may be directed to refund all the amount charged under\r\nthe head of interest or penal interest with&nbsp;18 % interest.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">iv) Respondent\r\nmay be directed to hand over the Physical Possession.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">v) To issue\r\ndirection to pay the cost of litigation</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">vi) To issue\r\ndirection to pay compensation to complainant for mental agony, pain and\r\nharassment</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#333333;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">vii)\r\nAny other relief which this authority deem fit and appropriate in view of the\r\nfacts and circumstances.</span><br></p>',10000000.00,5136800.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\nRoboto;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">I) To\r\ndirect the respondent not to demand nay further amount what so ever from the\r\ncomplainant.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\nRoboto;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">ii)&nbsp;\r\nThe respondent should be restrained form harassing the complainant in any\r\nmanner whatsoever.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">iii) Any other interim\r\nrelief which this Hon\'ble Authority deem fit and appropriate in view of the\r\nfacts and circumstance of the present compliant.&nbsp;</span><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'SANCHITPUNIA','2019-02-06 14:35:27.000','SANCHITPUNIA','2019-02-06 14:35:27.000'),(988,1288,'1288',1369,'0e157dcb-4e45-4c7a-a3cd-d4664ae34cf8','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Uniroyal Industries Limited through Akhil Mahajan','csvedparkash@gmail.com',9876011456,0,0,'Plot No. 365, Insdustral Area','Phase-II, Pachkula',13,15,'134113','1','Plot No. 365, Insdustral Area','Phase-II, Pachkula',13,15,'134113','Ved Parkash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0124','Acme Eden Court','Acme Builders Pvt. Ltd','contact@acmebuilders.in',8592122888,1724625000,'GH-10, JLPL','Sector-91 Mohali',28,507,'160032','1','GH-10, JLPL','Sector-91 Mohali',28,507,'160032','1','<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That M/s Uniroyal Industries Limited with its Corporate Office at Plot No 365, Industrial Estate, Phase II, Panchkula-134113, the Complainant, booked a Flat No T1/1002, Sector 91, Acme Eden Court, Mohali (Punjab)-141001 on 11.05.2011 from M/s Acme Builders Private Limited with its Corporate Office at SCO 2449-50, First Floor, Sector 22-C, Chandigarh, the Respondent. A copy of the brochure, commercial details and advance registration form are attached as Annexure C/1(Colly).</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the complainant&nbsp; made initial booking amount of 24,50,0000/- along with advance registration form and one more payment amounting to Rs. 1,17,775/- as per details annexed as C/2.</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The respondent issued allotment letter for the allotted unit on 15.12.2012 attached as C/3.</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The respondent entered into Builder Buyer Agreement (Annexed as C/4) with the complainant 13.12.2012 at a total consideration of Rs. 90,87,212/- inclusive of PLC, Maintenance Security etc. The allotted unit measured super area of 2345 sq.ft. That as per clause 15 of the said builder buyer agreement, the respondent was to offer possession within 42 months from the date of the said agreement, which arrives at 13.06.2016.</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the complainant opted for subvention payment plan annexed to the agreement which was later on converted into CLP vide amendment date 31.12.2012 to the said agreement, annexed as C/5.</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The complainant made additional payments amounting to Rs. 3,19,773/- and Rs. 158,689/- from their own account as per details annexed as C/6.</div><div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The complainant got the home loan approval from the PNB Housing Finance Limited for an amount of Rs. 61,30,443/-. Out of the said home loan approval account, an amount of Rs. 55,63,515/- has been paid to the respondent as per details annexed as C/7.<br></div>','<p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The complainant got the home loan approval from the PNB Housing Finance Limited for an amount of Rs. 61,30,443/-. Out of the said home loan approval account, an amount of Rs. 55,63,515/- has been paid to the respondent as per details annexed as C/7.</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Thus total payments made by the complainant to the respondent amount to Rs. 86,09,752/- as per Statement of Account annexed as C/8.</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the residential project is still not complete and the development of common areas is very low. Being an ongoing project, the said project is registered with RERA vide Registration No PBRERA-SAS81-PR0124.&nbsp;</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the above project of the respondent is registered with RERA with Registration Number PBRERA-SAS80-PC0007, being an ongoing project.&nbsp;</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The project is already delayed by more than 2 years and 8 months where the respondent received majority of the payments between 2011 and 2014 suggesting diversion of funds by the respondent. The complainant has lost faith that the respondent would be able to offer early possession after obtaining completion/occupancy certificate from the competent authorities.</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>In view of the above facts, the respondent has violated the provisions mentioned u/s 12, 18 and 19 of the Act.&nbsp;</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The complainant wishes to withdraw from the project on account of delayed possession of the allocated unit.&nbsp;</p><p>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>It is most respectfully prayed that the respondent be directed to refund the entire amount paid to the respondent along with interest as per provisions of the Act.</p><div><br></div>',9087212.00,8609752.00,'2016-06-13 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Not Applicable</p>','1','','2012-12-15 00:00:00','2012-12-13 00:00:00','Flat No. 1002, 10th Floor, Tower-1, Acme Eden Court, GH-10, JLPL Sector-90-91, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'uniroyalindustries','2019-02-06 15:02:41.000','uniroyalindustries','2019-02-06 15:02:41.000'),(989,1296,'1296',1348,'9e6eb098-b2d6-4eb1-9a76-81729ebe6097','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-06 17:29:54.000','Dr. Asmita Mahla Bhambri','sanchitpunia@yahoo.in',9812169608,0,0,'1509, Phase 10, Sector-64, SAS Nagar','',28,507,'160062','1','1509, Phase 10, Sector-64, SAS Nagar','',28,507,'160062','Sanchit Punia','sanchitpuniaadvocate@gmail.com',9780181988,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0116','The Greater\r\nMohali Area\r\nDevelopment\r\nAuthority, IT City','The Greater Mohali Area Development Authority','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'The Chief Administrator, Greater Mohali Area Development Authority, ','PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62, District S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','The Chief Administrator, Greater Mohali Area Development Authority, ','PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62, District S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Respondent invited application for allotment of Plots bearing size 500 Sq.\r\nYard under 750 residential Plots in IT City S.A.S Nagar, Mohali as Annexure\r\nC-1.&nbsp;The Brochure(C-1)&nbsp;at page number 14 specifically\r\ncontain&nbsp;under the heading&nbsp;of Ownership and Possession (clause 2) that\r\nPhysical Possession will be given within one year from the date of issuance of\r\nLetter of intent. &nbsp;&nbsp;As per schedule draw of plots held on 21.09.2016\r\nand accordingly Barkha Ram S/o Ganga Ram resident of VPO Gulahar, Patiala was\r\ndeclared successful in category \'B\' vide serial number 215 with reference to\r\napplication Form No.15502 . Consequentially the letter of intent dated\r\n22.06.2017 was issued in favour of Barkha Ram vide Letter of Intent number\r\n26780 measuring 500 Sq. yard. in 750 Plot Scheme as Annexure C-2. As per clause\r\n15 of terms and conditions in the letter&nbsp;of intent the physical possession\r\nof the plot was to be handed over within one year from the date of\r\nletter&nbsp;of intent i.e. 22.06.2017. Thereafter Barkha Ram S/o Ganag Ram\r\nsubmitted an application for transfer(Annexure C-3) of letter on intent in the\r\nname of present Complainant&nbsp; and&nbsp;consequentially vide letter dated\r\n07.12.2017&nbsp; letter of intent was transferred in favour of present\r\ncomplainant (Annexure C-4). The bare perusal of C-4 specifically contend one\r\nthing that terms and condition so attached with letter of intent dated\r\n22.06.2017 is binding on complainant. It would be justify to mention here that\r\ncomplainant had pad Rs. 51,36,800/- till date and for the kind perusal of the Hon\'ble\r\nAuthority the ledge is annexed as Annexure C- 5. The sole grievance of the\r\ncomplainant is that respondent failed to deliver the physical possession within\r\na period of one year(22.06.2018) as per clause 15 of terms and condition of\r\nletter of intent (Page 27) and Clause 2 of&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Ownership and\r\nPossession at page number 14 of C-1, and&nbsp;is arbitrarily&nbsp;charging 12%\r\ninterest on the&nbsp;installments&nbsp;with 18%&nbsp;Penal Interest, being\r\nun-lawful and arbitrary.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">I) Respondent may\r\nbe directed to refund the un-lawful interest (including Penal Interest) so\r\ncharged by the them after the lapse of&nbsp;deemed dated (22.06.2018) of\r\nhanding over physical possession.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">ii) Respondent\r\nmay be directed to pay 18%&nbsp;interest on the submitted amount due to delay\r\nin possession.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">ii) Respondent\r\nshould be directed to&nbsp;charge interest at law rate and&nbsp;refund the\r\nexcessive&nbsp;interest amount&nbsp;so charged till date.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">iii)\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;Respondent may be directed to refund all the amount charged under\r\nthe head of interest or penal interest with&nbsp;18 % interest.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">iv) Respondent\r\nmay be directed to hand over the Physical Possession.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">v) To issue\r\ndirection to pay the cost of litigation</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">vi) To issue\r\ndirection to pay compensation to complainant for mental agony, pain and\r\nharassment</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#333333;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">vii)\r\nAny other relief which this authority deem fit and appropriate in view of the\r\nfacts and circumstances.</span><br></p>',10000000.00,5136800.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\nRoboto;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">I) To\r\ndirect the respondent not to demand nay further amount what so ever from the\r\ncomplainant.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\nRoboto;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:EN\">ii)&nbsp;\r\nThe respondent should be restrained form harassing the complainant in any\r\nmanner whatsoever.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#333333;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">iii) Any other interim\r\nrelief which this Hon\'ble Authority deem fit and appropriate in view of the\r\nfacts and circumstance of the present compliant.&nbsp;</span><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'SANCHITPUNIA','2019-02-06 15:11:58.000','SANCHITPUNIA','2019-02-06 15:11:58.000'),(990,1288,'1288',1369,'0e157dcb-4e45-4c7a-a3cd-d4664ae34cf8','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Uniroyal Industries Limited through Akhil Mahajan','csvedparkash@gmail.com',9876011456,0,0,'Plot No. 365, Insdustral Area','Phase-II, Pachkula',13,15,'134113','1','Plot No. 365, Insdustral Area','Phase-II, Pachkula',13,15,'134113','Ved Parkash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0124','Acme Eden Court','Acme Builders Pvt. Ltd','contact@acmebuilders.in',8592122888,1724625000,'GH-10, JLPL','Sector-91 Mohali',28,507,'160032','1','GH-10, JLPL','Sector-91 Mohali',28,507,'160032','1','<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That M/s Uniroyal Industries Limited with its Corporate Office at Plot No 365, Industrial Estate,