 in the market in the year 2009.&nbsp; Promoters issued Misleading and False adds in the Media or otherwise using names of Big Corporate Houses such as MukeshAmbani led Reliance group, The Dalmias, Bergruen( US ) and Yellow stone Chandigarh based firm.</p><p>2.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>On 17th Feb. 2010, Sukhm issued the Allotment letter in which it is on record and mentioned that “THAT ALLOTMENT LETTER IS SUBJECT TO SIGNING OF THE BUYER/SELLER AGREEMENT WITHIN 60 DAYS FROM THE ISSUANCE OF THIS LETTER.</p><p>3.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>But M/s Sukhm has issued the BUYER/SELLER AGREEMENT in August 2013, In Buyer/Seller Agreement Clause 7 (a) read as ( Development of the said IT/Industrial Plots is likely to be completed within a tentative period of 18 months from the date of this Agreement.)</p><p>4.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>We have paid under pressure up to 65% of the BSP.</p><p>5.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>On 26.09.2018, M/s Sukham Infrastructures Pvt. Ltd. has signed Joint Development Agreement with GBP Group.</p><p>6.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>ON PAYMENT OF PLC, THE PLOTS ALLOTED TO US BY M/S SUKHM, IN THE LAND, WHICH TILL DATE, DOES NOT BELONG TO SUKHM/GBP</p><p>7.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>M/s Sukhm does not respond to our letter or e mails and also do not answer our phone calls.</p><p>8.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>As on date the status at the site of the project is as follows.</p><p>a)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Development work is insignificant, which can be verified.</p><p>b)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>No demarcation of plots.</p><p>c)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>No services are available.</p><p>d)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Patches of land which are shown on their approved maps, still not owned/ bought by them.</p><p>9.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>As on date we strongly believe that promoters :-</p><p>a)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Does not have the approved layout plan from the competent Authority BEING DEFAULTER IN PAYMENT OF EDC.</p><p>b)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>May not have valid agreement with State Govt. as on date.</p><p>c)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>May have not acquired/purchased land which is part of promoters approved maps.</p>','<p>In view of the facts stated above , when promoters have failed on all fronts to give possession of plots even after 9 years of our investment,&nbsp; We request your honor as under to save us as we have invested all our life’s savings in this project.</p><p>a.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Direct the promoters and Govt. Authorities concerned to develop the Project immediately and give possession of plots to us.</p><p>b.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Payment of interest on the amount paid @ 18% p.a. (compounded) for the delay in giving the possession of plots.</p><p>c.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Pay compensation&nbsp; as per Seller/Buyers Agreement.</p><p>Any other relief which RERA may feel appropriate.</p>',7095726.00,4967690.00,'2015-02-08 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>a.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Payment of interest on the&nbsp; amount paid @ 18% (compound) for the delay in giving possession of plots.</p><p>b.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Pay compensation for the mental harassment and agony suffered by us so long.</p><p>c.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Any other relief which RERA may feel appropriate.</p><p>d.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Direct the promoters and Govt. Authorities concerned to develop the Project immediately and give possession of plots to us.</p>','1','','2010-02-17 00:00:00','2013-08-08 00:00:00','Plot Number IT/P/MS/05, M/s. Aeropolis Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd., Aeropolis City, Sector 66-A, S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali-160062','','',2,0,0,0,'devraj306','2019-02-08 13:14:33.000','devraj306','2019-0