project and complainant moved representation (ANNEXURE-C005) to the respondent dated&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">07.11.2016 for the\r\nre-allotment of some alternate plot taking the objections</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.</span></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">That as per the clause 4 of the allotment letter </span><b><i><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">the\r\npossession of the said plot shall be handed over to the allottee after the completion\r\nof the development works at the site or 18 months from the date of issuance of\r\nthe allotment letter whichever is earlier</span></i></b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">. The respondents have failed\r\nto offer possession to the allottee and paid fraud and used the payments accumulated\r\nfrom the allottee and yielding interest thereon.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14px;\">That the complainant\r\nhave lost all hopes of getting a owning a dream house in Mohali and no more\r\ninterested in the project as the development of the project is pathetically\r\nslow and despite of the lapse of the promised possession date (28.03.2018) the\r\nrespondents have miserably failed to develop the project in a time bound manner and failed in giving possession</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: -0.25in;\">&nbsp; of the said plot.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: -0.25in;\">T</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; That the respondents allotted the unfeasible plot to the complainant which is at no stretch of imagination would be acceptable to any reasonable person taking into account the adjoining STP and High Voltage wires and Electricity Pillars which are nuisance to the allottee. The Respondents failed in re-allotting any alternate plot in time bound manner and shattered the dreams of the complainant to own a house in Mohali.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -0.25in;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Therefore, the complainant\r\nprays before this Hon’ble Authority to direct the respondents to refund of the\r\nhard earned money of Rs 14,90,370(</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Fourteen\r\nLac Ninety Thousand Three Hundred Seventy</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">) along with interest @18% p.a. in\r\nthe interest of justice and equity.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -0.25in;\"><br></span></p>',5961480.00,0.00,'2018-03-26 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Any interim relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deems proper in the facts and circumstances of the case.&nbsp;</p>','1','','2016-09-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Plot No 600, Gateway City Mohali Sector 118-19','','',2,0,0,0,'P43982017','2019-02-08 22:30:15.000','P43982017','2019-02-08 22:30:15.000'),(1005,1300,'1300',1385,'65d968ed-979d-4eaf-8fbc-2c5e547cbcb4','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','LALIT  gROVER','lalitgrover77@gmail.com',9803199151,1724185200,0,'FLAT NO 262','aDVOCATE ENCLAVE sECTOR 49A',6,128,'160047','1','FLAT NO 262','aDVOCATE ENCLAVE sECTOR 49A',6,128,'160047','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','ATS CASA ESPANA ','PARMOD KUMAR','parmod.kumar@atsgreens.com',8288029992,0,'ATS Casa espana BUD Majra ','Sector 121',28,507,'160055','1','ATS Casa espana BUD Majra ','Sector 121',28,507,'160055','1','<p>dear sir,</p><p>This complaint is regarding delay possession compensation of flat no 4101 IN ATS CASA ESPAANA&nbsp; A project of ATS infrabuild pvt limited having registered&nbsp; office in Noida.</p><p>Total delay period is 12 months 6 days . &nbsp;</p><p>Builder has send PCC letter on 7th Jan&nbsp; 2019. where as as per agreement possession date was dec 2017.</p><p>Builder is denying for compensation amount and asking for balance payment without considering my multiple requests to entertain compensation amount .</p><p>Builder is not abiding the RERA RULE book and recent judgements in the same matter ,</p><p>I suffered mentally and financially .paying rental rs 21859 per month and emi 57000. Ripple effects like schooling of kids job planning and borrowing to pay rentals.</p>','<p>my pray for relief -</p><p>1) Compensation of delay possession as per 18% compounded ROI .</p><p>2) Reimbursement of rental amount Rs 21849 per month for delay period.</p><p>3) Mental harassment due to financial burden paying EMI , house rent and not able to plan schooling of kids due to uncertainty of home location .</p><p>4) Immediate possession of flat without paying pre possession demand of Rs 18.30lac . it means till the date of decision by RERA on my complaint .</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>not applicable</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'lalitgrover77','2019-02-09 00:39:54.000','lalitgrover77','2019-02-09 00:39:54.000'),(1006,1300,'1300',1385,'65d968ed-979d-4eaf-8fbc-2c5e547cbcb4','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','LALIT  gROVER','lalitgrover77@gmail.com',9803199151,1724185200,0,'FLAT NO 262','aDVOCATE ENCLAVE sECTOR 49A',6,128,'160047','1','FLAT NO 262','aDVOCATE ENCLAVE sECTOR 49A',6,128,'160047','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','ATS CASA ESPANA ','PARMOD KUMAR','parmod.kumar@atsgreens.com',8288029992,0,'ATS Casa espana BUD Majra ','Sector 121',28,507,'160055','1','ATS Casa espana BUD Majra ','Sector 121',28,507,'160055','1','<p>dear sir,</p><p>This complaint is regarding delay possession compensation of flat no 4101 IN ATS CASA ESPAANA&nbsp; A project of ATS infrabuild pvt limited having registered&nbsp; office in Noida. customer ID number is REGCA/00350/16-17</p><p>Total delay period is 12 months 6 days . &nbsp;</p><p>Builder has send PCC letter on 7th Jan&nbsp; 2019. where as as per agreement possession date was dec 2017.</p><p>Builder is denying for compensation amount and asking for balance payment without considering my multiple requests to entertain compensation amount .</p><p>Builder is not abiding the RERA RULE book and recent judgements in the same matter ,</p><p>I suffered mentally and financially .paying rental rs 21859 per month and emi 57000. Ripple effects like schooling of kids job planning and borrowing to pay rentals.</p>','<p>my pray for relief -</p><p>1) Compensation of delay possession as per 18% compounded ROI .</p><p>2) Reimbursement of rental amount Rs 21849 per month for delay period.</p><p>3) Mental harassment due to financial burden paying EMI , house rent and not able to plan schooling of kids due to uncertainty of home location .</p><p>4) Immediate possession of flat without paying pre possession demand of Rs 18.30lac . it means till the date of decision by RERA on my complaint .</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>not applicable</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'lalitgrover77','2019-02-09 01:02:36.000','lalitgrover77','2019-02-09 01:02:36.000'),(1007,1300,'1300',1385,'65d968ed-979d-4eaf-8fbc-2c5e547cbcb4','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','LALIT  gROVER','lalitgrover77@gmail.com',9803199151,1724185200,555153696762,'FLAT NO 262','aDVOCATE ENCLAVE sECTOR 49A',6,128,'160047','1','FLAT NO 262','aDVOCATE ENCLAVE sECTOR 49A',6,128,'160047','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','ATS CASA ESPANA ','PARMOD KUMAR','parmod.kumar@atsgreens.com',8288029992,0,'ATS Casa espana BUD Majra ','Sector 121',28,507,'160055','1','ATS Casa espana BUD Majra ','Sector 121',28,507,'160055','1','<p>dear sir,</p><p>This complaint is regarding delay possession compensation of flat no 4101 IN ATS CASA ESPAANA&nbsp; A project of ATS infrabuild pvt limited having registered&nbsp; office in Noida. customer ID number is REGCA/00350/16-17</p><p>Total delay period is 12 months 6 days . &nbsp;</p><p>Builder has send PCC letter on 7th Jan&nbsp; 2019. where as as per agreement possession date was dec 2017.</p><p>Builder is denying for compensation amount and asking for balance payment without considering my multiple requests to entertain compensation amount .</p><p>Builder is not abiding the RERA RULE book and recent judgements in the same matter ,</p><p>I suffered mentally and financially .paying rental rs 21859 per month and emi 57000. Ripple effects like schooling of kids job planning and borrowing to pay rentals.</p>','<p>my pray for relief -</p><p>1) Compensation of delay possession as per 18% compounded ROI .</p><p>2) Reimbursement of rental amount Rs 21849 per month for delay period.</p><p>3) Mental harassment due to financial burden paying EMI , house rent and not able to plan schooling of kids due to uncertainty of home location .</p><p>4) Immediate possession of flat without paying pre possession demand of Rs 18.30lac . it means till the date of decision by RERA on my complaint .</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>not applicable</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'lalitgrover77','2019-02-09 01:05:57.000','lalitgrover77','2019-02-09 01:05:57.000'),(1008,1170,'1170',1249,'633d568c-6bc4-4a67-ac48-2650be8f8a83','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-11 11:34:36.000','Meenu Minocha','kangan_1993@yahoo.in',9810617548,0,0,'E-3, Lajpat Nagar-III','2nd Floor, Delhi-24',10,557,'110024','1','E-3, Lajpat Nagar-III','2nd Floor, Delhi-24',10,557,'110024','Baani Chhibber','baanichbr@gmail.com',9876658773,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0010','Industrial Knowledge (Fashion Technology) Park, Sector 90, SAS Nagar, Mohali, Punjab','M/s Chandigarh Overseas Pvt. Ltd.','chdoverseas@rediffmail.com',0,0,'SCO 249','Sector 44-C',6,128,'160047','0','SCO 196-197, Top Floor','Sector 34-A',6,128,'160032','1','<p><br></p><p>The complainant booked a space/unit of Super area of 125 Sq. ft. in Design Studio No. 11, Floor No. 6, Block A1 in Industrial Knowledge (Fashion Technology) Park, Sector 90, SAS Nagar, Mohali for total amount of Rs. 5,00,000/- vide Application Form No. 103859 dt. 05.12.2006. Complainant &amp; respondent had executed Developer Buyer Agreement dt. 24.12.2007. The complainant has made a total payment of Rs. 4,75,000/- till date &amp; balance was to be made at the time of possession. Also, the complainant had purchased two units from the respondent &amp; separate complaint has been filed for other unit. The Complainant was promised the delivery of possession within the period of 30 months from the date of start of construction but the possession of the said unit has not been delivered to the complainant so far. The construction of the project was delayed and by the promised date i.e. the end of 2009 &amp; till now the construction of the said project is incomplete due to which the complainant had suffered immense mental &amp; physical harassment. That as per the agreement, the complainant was entitled to receive Rs. 50 per square feet per month as delay charges which amounts to Rs. 6250/- p.m., if the possession was not delivered at the agreed time. The said delay charges were also paid by the respondent from 26.03.2010 till 02.01.2012 only amounting to Rs. 2,92,742/- for two units and thereafter no delay charges have been paid to the complainant. The act of the respondent is in clear violation of provisions of RERA Act &amp; Rules. Section 18 of the RERA Act mandates a promoter to return the amount received in respect of a plot with interest at the prescribed rate and compensation at the wish of the buyer in case the promoter fails to give possession. If the buyer wishes to continue &amp; get the possession of plot then the promoter shall pay monthly interest on delay of each month and handover the possession. The documents annexed herewith may be read as part &amp; parcel of the complainant.&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>','<p>The complainant prays for the following reliefs:</p><p>(i) an order/direction to the respondent to deliver the possession of the units as per the Developer Buyer Agreement, along with interest @10.15 % p.a. i,e prevailing applicable State Bank of India Highest Marginal Cost of Lending Rate plus two percent from the date of payments till the date of possession of the units &amp; accept the balance payment.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>(ii) Levy a penalty of 5% of the estimated cost of the real estate project for breach of its obligation to deliver possession on time under the Act.</p><p>(iii) Pass an order/direction to the respondent to pay an amount of Rs.12,500/- (Rupees Ten Lakh Fifty Thousand only) p.m for both the units as delay charges from the period starting from 01.02.2012 till actual realization to the complainant, along with the interest @ 10.15% p.a i,e prevailing applicable State Bank of India Highest Marginal Cost of Lending Rate plus two percent.&nbsp;</p><p>(iv) If the Respondent is not able to give the possession of the units as per the agreement then in the alternative, direction to the Respondent to return the amounts paid with interest from the date of payment till the actual realization as per the RERA Rule 15 with the prevailing applicable State Bank of India Highest Marginal Cost of Lending Rate plus two percent i.e. 10.15%</p><p>(v) Pass any other order/direction in favour of the complainant &amp; against the respondent as deem fit by the authority.</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Pending final decision on the complaint the complainant seeks issue of direction to the Respondent not to sell/transfer/allot the units to any third person.</p><div><br></div>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'BaaniChhibber','2019-02-09 17:08:34.000','BaaniChhibber','201