mpal Singh Dhillon','rajeshbhathejaadv@yahoo.com',9814226530,0,0,'Dhillon Farm, H.No. 1010, Kotakpura Road, ','Moga',28,393,'142001','1','Rajesh Bhatheja, H.No. 114, Sector-65','Mohali',28,507,'160062','Rajesh Bhatheja, Advocate','rajeshbhathejaadv@yahoo.com',9814226530,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0121','Purab Premium Apartments','Greater Mohali Area Development Authority','eoh@gmada.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62, ','Mohali',28,507,'160062','0','PUDA Bhawan, Sector 62, ','Mohali',28,39,'160062','1','<p>Complainant app<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">lied for a flat in the project namely Purab Premium Apartment-II, Sector 88, SAS Nagar, Mohali vide application number PPA000454 and paid earnest money of Rs.435200/-.&nbsp; T</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14px;\">he\r\ncomplainant was allotted</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14px;\">a residential\r\napartment type 3 and letter of allotment of residential apartment Type 3 in the\r\nPurab Premium Apartment II in General Category at Sector 88, SAS Nagar was\r\nissued vide letter No.GMADA-EO/2014/13973 dated 5.6.2014. T</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14px;\">entative price of the Apartment Type 3 was Rs.8700000. A</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14px;\">s\r\nper clause 3 of the Letter of intent, the possession\r\nof the allotted apartment shall be handed over in the month of December 2015. The Complainant made balance payment as per Plan-B and till date the complainant has deposited a sum of Rs.9863825/-. V</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14px;\">ide\r\nletter Memo No.GMADA-EO/2016-33950 dated 25.7.2016&nbsp; the complainant was informed that in a draw held on 06 Jan 2016 and apartment 1302, Tower 8,\r\nBlock-C, Floor-12, Type 3 covered area 1904.67 has been allotted to the\r\ncomplainant.</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14px;\">after\r\nreceiving letter dated 25.7.2016&nbsp; complainant came to know that as per allotment letter dated\r\n25.7.2016, apartment no.1303 has been wrongly allotted but\r\nin fact as per draw apartment no.1302, Block-3, Tower No. A, Floor no.12 was\r\nallotted to the complainant. So vide letter dated 30.8.2106, the complainant requested\r\nto the respondents to cancel the allotment letter and offer of possession dated\r\n25.7.2016 and requested to issue new allotment letter and offer of possession\r\nby making necessary corrections. Thereafter the complainant received letter no.44719 dated 23.9.2016 from the respondents whereby they assured that new allotment letter of possession with regard to flat No. 1302, Tower-A-3 will be issued to the complainant but nothing was done. So the complainant sent letter dated 02.11.2017 and also sent legal notice dated&nbsp; 08.08.2018 but till date possession of allotted apartment has not been given.so the complainant is filing the present complaint alongwith the documents annexed herewith.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The respondents may be directed to\r\nrefund an amount of Rs.98,63,825/- (Rupees Ninety Eight lacs Sixty Three\r\nthousand Eight hundred Twenty Five) paid by the complainant alongwith interest as\r\nper the provisions of the RERA Act.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 18.6667px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The respondents may be directed to refund an amount of Rs.98,63,825/- (Rupees Ninety Eight lacs Sixty Three thousand Eight hundred Twenty Five) paid by the complainant alongwith interest as per the provisions of the RERA Act.</span>&nbsp;</span>No Interim relief requested.</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'rajeshbhatheja','2019-02-10 15:09:24.000','rajeshbhatheja','2019-02-10 15:09:24.000'),(1013,1298,'1298',1078,'d8d4f172-3c37-4e70-b72a-876b113f98f3','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Jasneet Kaur Chahal through her GPA Paramjit Kaur ','vikramsinghchahal@gmail.com',9781750447,0,0,'House no 159, Teg Colony, Patiala','Patiala',28,454,'147001','1','#159, Teg Colony, Patiala','Patiala',28,454,'147001','vikram singh chahal','vikramsinghchahal@gmail.com',9781750447,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0022','GATEWAY CITY SECTOR 118-119, SAS NAGAR MOHALI ','Chief Administrator, PUDA','se@puda.gov.in',1725063022,0,'PUDA Bhawan','Sector 62, SAS Nagar',28,507,'160063','1','PUDA Bhawan','Sector 62, SAS Nagar',28,507,'160063','1','<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">1. That the present complaint is being filed through Paramjit Kaur who is the lawful GPA of Jasneet Kaur Chahal hereinafter refered to as complainant. Copy of the GPA is ANNEXURE-C001.\r\n</span><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">2. That the complainant filed the application form along with prescribed fee for the allotment of residential plot in the GATEWAY CITY SECTOR 118-119, SAS NAGAR MOHALI. On being successful in draws of plots, Letter Of Intent (LOI) vide No. 22294 dated 10.06.2015 (ANNEXURE-C002) was issued with demand of Rs. 8,06,400 and Rs. 1,07,520, which was paid by the complainant vide receipts dated 09.07.2015 (ANNEXURE-C003 Colly). \r\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">3. That the respondents thereafter issued allotment letter (ANNEXURE-C004) vide No. 45219 dated 27.09.2016 for Plot No. 600 measuring 283.88sq.yards @ Rs 21,000/- per Sq.yd for the total consideration of Rs 59,61,480/-. \r\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">4. That thereafter going through the layout plan issued by the respondents, the complainant deemed it proper to physically verify the allotted plot at the site of the project but to her utter surprise, no demarcation was done of the plot and after lot of efforts and struggle, the complainant spotted her allotted plot. But to her utter shock, the allotted plot is adjoining the sewage treatment plant (STP) and the area is filled with bad odour from the STP which is  nuisance to the allottee.\r\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">5.In addition to that the high voltage electricity wires and electricity pillars are next to the said plot making it inhabitable and dangerous. The complainant moved representation (ANNEXURE-C005) dated 07.11.2016  to the respondent for the re-allotment of some alternate plot but the respondents never paid any heed to it.\r\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">6. That as per clause 4 of the allotment letter the possession of the said plot shall be handed over to the allottee after the completion of the development works at the site or 18 months from the date of issuance of the allotment letter whichever is earlier. The respondents have failed in giving possession of the said plot in within time.</span></div>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">That the complainant has\r\nlost all hopes of owning a dream house in Mohali and now is no more interested\r\nin the said plot as the development of the project is pathetically slow and\r\ndespite the lapse of the promised possession date (28.03.2018), the respondents\r\nhave miserably failed to deliver the possession of said plot in a time bound\r\nmanner.</span></p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.65pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">That\r\nthe respondents allotted the unfeasible plot to the complainant which, by no\r\nstretch of imagination, would be acceptable to any prudent person taking into\r\naccount the adjoining STP, High Voltage wires and Electricity Pillars which would\r\nbe a perpetual source of nuisance to the allottee. The respondents failed in re-allotting\r\nany alternate plot in time bound manner.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.65pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Therefore,\r\nthe complainant prays this Hon’ble Authority to direct the respondents to\r\nrefund the hard earned money of Rs.14,90,370 [</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Fourteen Lac Ninety Thousand\r\nThree Hundred Seventy</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">) along with interest @18% p.a. in the interest of\r\njustice, equity and fair play.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>',5961480.00,0.00,'2018-03-26 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Any interim relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deems proper in the facts and circumstances of the case.&nbsp;</p>','1','','2016-09-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Plot No 600, Gateway City Mohali Sector 118-19','','',2,0,0,0,'P43982017','2019-02-11 20:16:41.000','P43982017','2019-02-11 20:16:41.000'),(1014,1303,'1303',1255,'9bb53a1d-6d25-411b-98ab-32c07efb3d65','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Ashok Kumar Goyal ','sumeeta4@gmail.com',7973585119,0,0,'1758','Sector 23-B',6,128,'160023','1','1758','Sector 23-B',6,128,'160023','Gurditt Singh Saini','advocategssaini@gmail.com',9815973578,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PM0039','Chandigarh Royale City Promoters Pvt. Ltd.','Pardeep Kumar Bansal','chandigarhroyalecity@gmail.com',9217092181,0,'Village Karala','Post office Banur, Tehsil Derabassi',28,507,'140601','1','Village Karala','Post office Banur, Tehsil Derabassi',28,507,'140601','1','<div class=\"Section1\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Sir,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">After\r\ngoing through a news item in ‘Hindustan Times’ newspaper dated 4.8.2012,\r\nComplainants applied for 200 Sq. Yds plot in August 2012 @ </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">13750/- per sq. Yds. &amp;\r\npaid an amount of </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">7\r\nLac vide cheque on dt 27.8.2012. The Complainants opted for subvention plan of\r\npayment through their approved financial institution i.e. M/S Dewan Housing\r\nFinance corporation Limited(DHFL) vide which loan from one of their approved DHFL\r\nwas being given and the installments of which were initially to be paid by the\r\nRespondents for 18 months or till offer of the possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">A\r\nletter dt.5.2.2013 was issued by the Respondents intimating the complainant\r\nabout sanctioning of the lay out plan and the approval of project and demand of\r\npayment due as per schedule given therein which includes EDC being asked and\r\ncomplaints were also asked to enter into the buyer agreement. Thereafter\r\nRespondents issued a provisional allotment dt. 27.9.2013 allotting a Plot\r\nNo.410 measuring 200 sq. yds and complainants had entered into plot buyer\r\nagreement with the Respondents on the same day.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">A\r\nLoan of the Complainants was approved by DHFL for </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">2062000/- and the payments\r\nof </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">47100/-\r\n&amp; </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">1692935/-\r\nwere credited into the account of the Respondents on 1.12.2013 &amp; further </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">204710/- on 29.1.2014.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">There\r\nwas no progress in the development at site and its huge delay in the execution\r\nof the project. The plot allotted to them was neither demarcated nor does any\r\npromise given at the time of booking seem to be fulfilled in near future. Even respondents\r\nare not having all approvals and sanctions from the competent athourities in\r\nrespect of the entire 200 acres project. None of the promises and assurances of\r\nhaving a smart city seems to have been achieved by the Respondents and as such\r\nthe complainants have been deceived by the Respondents. The Respondents with\r\ntheir ulterior motive to avoid the further payment of EMI under the subvention\r\nplan, sent an offer of possession of plot on 7.10.2014 to the complainants.</span></p></div>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The\r\ncomplainants have been allured and deceived upon by the Respondents while\r\nshattering their dream of a sweet home within the vicinity of Chandigarh. The\r\ncomplainants seek refund of their amount along with other relief inter alia\r\nbased on following grounds:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The Respondents deceived the complainant\r\nby alluring them for depositing an amount of </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">26,44,745/- in their project\r\nwithout having approvals and necessary permissions from the competent\r\nauthorities for such a long time, as such Complainants seeks refund of the\r\namount of <br>\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;background:#F1F1F1\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">26,44,745/-\r\ntowards the amount deposited in respect of payment of the plot.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The complainants are also entitled for\r\ninterest @18% per annum from the date of its deposit till realization on the\r\namount of refund <br>\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">26,44,745/-.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">iii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The complainants are also entitled for </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">50,000/- on account of\r\ndeficiency in service &amp; unfair trade practice on the part of respondents resulting\r\nmonetary loss and for causing physical harassment as well as mental agony to\r\nthe complainants.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">iv)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The complainants are also entitled for sum\r\nof </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">50,000/-\r\ntowards the cost of uncalled and unnecessarily litigation and court fee.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">v)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any\r\nother relief which this Hon’ble Forum may deem fit and proper be also granted\r\nto the complainants against the Respondents.</span><br></p>',3276250.00,2644745.00,'2015-09-27 00:00:00.000','2013-09-27 00:00:00.000','Respondents may kindly be directed to refund the amount&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 12.5pt; line-height: 33.3333px; font-family: &quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;, sans-serif;\">`&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 12.5pt; line-height: 33.3333px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">26,44,745/-</span>&nbsp;to the Complainants along with interest @ 18% from date of deposit.','1','','2013-09-27 00:00:00','2013-09-27 00:00:00','410','','',2,0,0,0,'VakilSaini','2019-02-11 21:38:55.000','VakilSaini','2019-02-11 21:38:55.000'),(1015,1303,'1303',1255,'9bb53a1d-6d25-411b-98ab-32c07efb3d65','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-20 19:20:53.000','Ashok Kumar Goyal ','sumeeta4@gmail.com',7973585119,0,0,'1758','Sector 23-B',6,128,'160023','1','1758','Sector 23-B',6,128,'160023','Gurditt Singh Saini','advocategssaini@gmail.com',9815973578,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PM0039','Chandigarh Royale City Promoters Pvt. Ltd.','Pardeep Kumar Bansal','chandigarhroyalecity@gmail.com',9217092181,0,'Village Karala','Post office Banur, Tehsil Derabassi',28,507,'140601','1','Village Karala','Post office Banur, Tehsil Derabassi',28,507,'140601','1','<div class=\"Section1\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Sir,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">After\r\ngoing through a news item in ‘Hindustan Times’ newspaper dated 4.8.2012,\r\nComplainants applied for 200 Sq. Yds plot in August 2012 @ </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">13750/- per sq. Yds. &amp;\r\npaid an amount of </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">7\r\nLac vide cheque on dt 27.8.2012. The Complainants opted for subvention plan of\r\npayment through their approved financial institution i.e. M/S Dewan Housing\r\nFinance corporation Limited(DHFL) vide which loan from one of their approved DHFL\r\nwas being given and the installments of which were initially to be paid by the\r\nRespondents for 18 months or till offer of the possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">A\r\nletter dt.5.2.2013 was issued by the Respondents intimating the complainant\r\nabout sanctioning of the lay out plan and the approval of project and demand of\r\npayment due as per schedule given therein which includes EDC being asked and\r\ncomplaints were also asked to enter into the buyer agreement. Thereafter\r\nRespondents issued a provisional allotment dt. 27.9.2013 allotting a Plot\r\nNo.410 measuring 200 sq. yds and complainants had entered into plot buyer\r\nagreement with the Respondents on the same day.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">A\r\nLoan of the Complainants was approved by DHFL for </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">2062000/- and the payments\r\nof </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">47100/-\r\n&amp; </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">1692935/-\r\nwere credited into the account of the Respondents on 1.12.2013 &amp; further </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">204710/- on 29.1.2014.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">There\r\nwas no progress in the development at site and its huge delay in the execution\r\nof the project. The plot allotted to them was neither demarcated nor does any\r\npromise given at the time of booking seem to be fulfilled in near future. Even respondents\r\nare not having all approvals and sanctions from the competent athourities in\r\nrespect of the entire 200 acres project. None of the promises and assurances of\r\nhaving a smart city seems to have been achieved by the Respondents and as such\r\nthe complainants have been deceived by the Respondents. The Respondents with\r\ntheir ulterior motive to avoid the further payment of EMI under the subvention\r\nplan, sent an offer of possession of plot on 7.10.2014 to the complainants.</span></p></div>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The\r\ncomplainants have been allured and deceived upon by the Respondents while\r\nshattering their dream of a sweet home within the vicinity of Chandigarh. The\r\ncomplainants seek refund of their amount along with other relief inter alia\r\nbased on following grounds:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The Respondents deceived the complainant\r\nby alluring them for depositing an amount of </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">26,44,745/- in their project\r\nwithout having approvals and necessary permissions from the competent\r\nauthorities for such a long time, as such Complainants seeks refund of the\r\namount of <br>\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;background:#F1F1F1\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">26,44,745/-\r\ntowards the amount deposited in respect of payment of the plot.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The complainants are also entitled for\r\ninterest @18% per annum from the date of its deposit till realization on the\r\namount of refund <br>\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">26,44,745/-.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">iii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The complainants are also entitled for </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">50,000/- on account of\r\ndeficiency in service &amp; unfair trade practice on the part of respondents resulting\r\nmonetary loss and for causing physical harassment as well as mental agony to\r\nthe complainants.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">iv)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The complainants are also entitled for sum\r\nof </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">50,000/-\r\ntowards the cost of uncalled and unnecessarily litigation and court fee.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">v)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any\r\nother relief which this Hon’ble Forum may deem fit and proper be also granted\r\nto the complainants against the Respondents.</span><br></p>',3276250.00,2644745.00,'2015-09-27 00:00:00.000','2013-09-27 00:00:00.000','Respondents may kindly be directed to refund the amount&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 12.5pt; line-height: 33.3333px; font-family: &quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;, sans-serif;\">`&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 12.5pt; line-height: 33.3333px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">26,44,745/-</span>&nbsp;to the Complainants along with interest @ 18% from date of deposit.','0','','2013-09-27 00:00:00','2013-09-27 00:00:00','410','','',1,1,0,0,'VakilSaini','2019-02-11 21:39:51.000','VakilSaini','2019-02-11 21:39:51.000'),(1016,1304,'1304',1395,'f330a6af-dd6e-444b-80e9-9b6a803ad8ff','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-14 08:53:23.000','Anil Vivan singh Singh','contact@khillanattorneys.com',9779525511,0,0,'Flat No.303 Block A1 Nirmal Chhaya Towers VIP Road Zirakpur','',28,507,'140603','1','A5 403 Nirmal Chhaya Towers VIP Road Zirakpur','',28,507,'140603','Mandeep Singh Khillan','cotact@khillanattorneys.com',9779525511,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0007','ATS Golf Meadows Lifestyle ','ATS ESTATES PRIVATE LIMITED','compliances@atsgreens.com',0,0,'711/92 Deepali Nehru Place','New Delhi',10,429,'110019','0','ATS GOLF MEADOWS PRELUDE, Barwala Road,  Dera Bassi','',28,507,'140507','1','<ul><li><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 12pt;\">The\r\nRespondent No.1 is a private limited company and Respondent No.2 is its\r\nManaging Director. Respondents are developing a project namely ATS Golf Meadows\r\nLifestyle at Dera Bassi on the land owned by others as per terms of Development\r\nagreement dated 20.07.2007. The Private Respondent and other directors of\r\nRespondent Company are in complete control of the management and day to day\r\nbusiness and affairs of builder.</span></li><li><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 12pt;\">The Complainants jointly applied\r\nfor allotment of one apartment vide application dated 26.12.2012 and were\r\nallotted apartment no.7084 on 8th floor in tower no.7 with two\r\nbasement car parkings vide Agreement dated 21.01.2013 subject to payment of\r\nRs. 56.80 Lakhs to the Respondents.</span></li><li><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 12pt;\">The Complainants have\r\npaid Rs. 4749620 to the Respondents.</span></li><li><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 12pt;\">Possession of the\r\nallotted unit as per clause 14 of the agreement dated 21.01.2013 was to be\r\nhandover within 36 months and complete in all respects. </span></li><li><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 12pt;\">The Respondents have neither handed over nor have\r\neven offered the possession of the allotted unit within the time agreed as per\r\nagreement moreover in spite of receiving substantial amount. <i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">In view of the inordinate delay in not\r\nhanding over possession the Complainants submitted letter dated 06.08.2018\r\nseeking refund of their amount with interest under the provisions of Section 18\r\nof the Real Estate Regulation and Development Act 2016</i> and have even sent\r\na reminder to the same vide letter dated 26.10.2018 but to no avail as the\r\nRespondents have not acted upon the request given therein.</span></span></li></ul><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><font face=\"Times New Roman\"></font><b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></p>','<ul><li>That the <span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 12pt;\">Complainant prays for grant of the following Relief by passing of directions,\r\norders which this Honorable Authority deems fit and appropriate</span></li><li><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 12pt;\">Direct the Respondents to refund the complete\r\namount deposited by the <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">C</b>omplainants\r\nalongwith interest as provided in section 18 of RERA Act, 2016 and rule 16 of RERA Act.</span></li><li><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">Direct the\r\nRespondents to pay compensation at the rate of 24 percent on the total amount principal plus interest there upon from 6th November 2018 till date\r\nof final payment because the Respondents should have paid the Complainants the\r\nprincipal amount alongwith the interest thereon on or before 6th November 2018 as per the provisions of section 18 of RERA Act read with Rule\r\n16 and 17 of The Punjab State Real Estate Regulation and Development Rules 2017 which they failed to do.</span></li><li><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">Direct the\r\nRespondents to pay to the Complainants Rs 50000 as legal costs.</span></li><li><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">Direct the\r\nRespondents to pay to the Complainants Rs 4 lacs for mental agony and stress.</span></li><li><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 12pt;\">Pass any other order or direction which this\r\nHonorable Authority thinks fit and necessary for adjudication of the present\r\ncomplaint in interest of justice and equity.</span></li></ul><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><font face=\"Times New Roman\"></font><br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ul><li><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">Restrain the Respondent from cancelling or\r\ncreating any third party rights interalia including transferring&nbsp; selling mortgaging of the allotted unit to\r\nanyone till refunding the amount claimed with interest or till adjudication of this complaint which ever is earlier.</span><b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></li></ul>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'anilsingh','2019-02-12 12:28:52.000','anilsingh','2019-02-12 12:28:52.000'),(1017,1305,'1305',1368,'06cc119c-147e-47df-9860-9a89e157b105','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Yash paul kathpal','ykayhpal@yaoo.com',9814466639,0,0,'Pine 201, ANSAL Woodburry Apartment, Near PSEB Grid, nabha Road , Zirakur','',28,507,'140603','1','sco 117-118, 2nd floor , sector 17 B','',6,128,'160017','Saksham Arora','advsaksham@gmail.com',9872628189,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0044','M/S Ansal Woodburry Apartments','M/S Ansals housing and construction pvt. ltd.','ahcl@ansals.com',0,0,'606, 6th floor, indra prakash, 21, barakhamba road, New Delhi -110001','',10,429,'110001','1','606, 6th floor, indra prakash, 21, barakhamba road, New Delhi -110001','',10,429,'110001','1','<p>ab</p>','<p>abc</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>abc</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'AdvSaksham','2019-02-12 12:38:18.000','AdvSaksham','2019-02-12 12:38:18.000'),(1018,1298,'1298',1078,'d8d4f172-3c37-4e70-b72a-876b113f98f3','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Jasneet Kaur Chahal through her GPA Paramjit Kaur ','vikramsinghchahal@gmail.com',9781750447,0,0,'House no 159, Teg Colony, Patiala','Patiala',28,454,'147001','1','#159, Teg Colony, Patiala','Patiala',28,454,'147001','vikram singh chahal','vikramsinghchahal@gmail.com',9781750447,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0022','GATEWAY CITY SECTOR 118-119, SAS NAGAR MOHALI ','Chief Administrator, PUDA','se@puda.gov.in',1725063022,0,'PUDA Bhawan','Sector 62, SAS Nagar',28,507,'160063','1','PUDA Bhawan','Sector 62, SAS Nagar',28,507,'160063','1','<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">1. That the present complaint is being filed through Paramjit Kaur who is the lawful GPA of Jasneet Kaur Chahal hereinafter refered to as complainant. Copy of the GPA is ANNEXURE-C001.\r\n</span><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">2. That the complainant filed the application form along with prescribed fee for the allotment of residential plot in the GATEWAY CITY SECTOR 118-119, SAS NAGAR MOHALI. On being successful in draws of plots, Letter Of Intent (LOI) vide No. 22294 dated 10.06.2015 (ANNEXURE-C002) was issued with demand of Rs. 8,06,400 and Rs. 1,07,520, which was paid by the complainant vide receipts dated 09.07.2015 (ANNEXURE-C003 Colly). \r\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">3. That the respondents thereafter issued allotment letter (ANNEXURE-C004) vide No. 45219 dated 27.09.2016 for Plot No. 600 measuring 283.88sq.yards @ Rs 21,000/- per Sq.yd for the total consideration of Rs 59,61,480/-. \r\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">4. That thereafter going through the layout plan issued by the respondents, the complainant deemed it proper to physically verify the allotted plot at the site of the project but to her utter surprise, no demarcation was done of the plot and after lot of efforts and struggle, the complainant spotted her allotted plot. But to her utter shock, the allotted plot is adjoining the sewage treatment plant (STP) and the area is filled with bad odour from the STP which is  nuisance to the allottee.\r\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">5.In addition to that the high voltage electricity wires and electricity pillars are next to the said plot making it inhabitable and dangerous. The complainant moved representation (ANNEXURE-C005) dated 07.11.2016  to the respondent for the re-allotment of some alternate plot but the respondents never paid any heed to it.\r\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">6. That as per clause 4 of the allotment letter the possession of the said plot shall be handed over to the allottee after the completion of the development works at the site or 18 months from the date of issuance of the allotment letter whichever is earlier. The respondents have failed in giving possession of the said plot in within time.</span></div>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">That the complainant has\r\nlost all hopes of owning a dream house in Mohali and now is no more interested\r\nin the said plot as the development of the project is pathetically slow and\r\ndespite the lapse of the promised possession date (28.03.2018), the respondents\r\nhave miserably failed to deliver the possession of said plot in a time bound\r\nmanner.</span></p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.65pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">That\r\nthe respondents allotted the unfeasible plot to the complainant which, by no\r\nstretch of imagination, would be acceptable to any prudent person taking into\r\naccount the adjoining STP, High Voltage wires and Electricity Pillars which would\r\nbe a perpetual source of nuisance to the allottee. The respondents failed in re-allotting\r\nany alternate plot in time bound manner.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.65pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Therefore,\r\nthe complainant prays this Hon’ble Authority to direct the respondents to\r\nrefund the hard earned money of Rs.14,90,370 [</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Fourteen Lac Ninety Thousand\r\nThree Hundred Seventy</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">) along with interest @18% p.a. in the interest of\r\njustice, equity and fair play.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>',5961480.00,0.00,'2018-03-26 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Any interim relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deems proper in the facts and circumstances of the case.&nbsp;</p>','1','','2016-09-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Plot No 600, Gateway City Mohali Sector 118-19','','',2,0,0,0,'P43982017','2019-02-12 15:27:01.000','P43982017','2019-02-12 15:27:01.000'),(1019,1298,'1298',1078,'d8d4f172-3c37-4e70-b72a-876b113f98f3','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-12 15:27:51.000','Jasneet Kaur Chahal through her GPA Paramjit Kaur ','vikramsinghchahal@gmail.com',9781750447,0,0,'House no 159, Teg Colony, Patiala','Patiala',28,454,'147001','1','#159, Teg Colony, Patiala','Patiala',28,454,'147001','vikram singh chahal','vikramsinghchahal@gmail.com',9781750447,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0022','GATEWAY CITY SECTOR 118-119, SAS NAGAR MOHALI ','Chief Administrator, PUDA','se@puda.gov.in',1725063022,0,'PUDA Bhawan','Sector 62, SAS Nagar',28,507,'160063','1','PUDA Bhawan','Sector 62, SAS Nagar',28,507,'160063','1','<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">1. That the present complaint is being filed through Paramjit Kaur who is the lawful GPA of Jasneet Kaur Chahal hereinafter refered to as complainant. Copy of the GPA is ANNEXURE-C001.\r\n</span><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">2. That the complainant filed the application form along with prescribed fee for the allotment of residential plot in the GATEWAY CITY SECTOR 118-119, SAS NAGAR MOHALI. On being successful in draws of plots, Letter Of Intent (LOI) vide No. 22294 dated 10.06.2015 (ANNEXURE-C002) was issued with demand of Rs. 8,06,400 and Rs. 1,07,520, which was paid by the complainant vide receipts dated 09.07.2015 (ANNEXURE-C003 Colly). \r\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">3. That the respondents thereafter issued allotment letter (ANNEXURE-C004) vide No. 45219 dated 27.09.2016 for Plot No. 600 measuring 283.88sq.yards @ Rs 21,000/- per Sq.yd for the total consideration of Rs 59,61,480/-. \r\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">4. That thereafter going through the layout plan issued by the respondents, the complainant deemed it proper to physically verify the allotted plot at the site of the project but to her utter surprise, no demarcation was done of the plot and after lot of efforts and struggle, the complainant spotted her allotted plot. But to her utter shock, the allotted plot is adjoining the sewage treatment plant (STP) and the area is filled with bad odour from the STP which is  nuisance to the allottee.\r\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">5.In addition to that the high voltage electricity wires and electricity pillars are next to the said plot making it inhabitable and dangerous. The complainant moved representation (ANNEXURE-C005) dated 07.11.2016  to the respondent for the re-allotment of some alternate plot but the respondents never paid any heed to it.\r\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">6. That as per clause 4 of the allotment letter the possession of the said plot shall be handed over to the allottee after the completion of the development works at the site or 18 months from the date of issuance of the allotment letter whichever is earlier. The respondents have failed in giving possession of the said plot in within time.</span></div>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">That the complainant has\r\nlost all hopes of owning a dream house in Mohali and now is no more interested\r\nin the said plot as the development of the project is pathetically slow and\r\ndespite the lapse of the promised possession date (28.03.2018), the respondents\r\nhave miserably failed to deliver the possession of said plot in a time bound\r\nmanner.</span></p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.65pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">That\r\nthe respondents allotted the unfeasible plot to the complainant which, by no\r\nstretch of imagination, would be acceptable to any prudent person taking into\r\naccount the adjoining STP, High Voltage wires and Electricity Pillars which would\r\nbe a perpetual source of nuisance to the allottee. The respondents failed in re-allotting\r\nany alternate plot in time bound manner.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.65pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Therefore,\r\nthe complainant prays this Hon’ble Authority to direct the respondents to\r\nrefund the hard earned money of Rs.14,90,370 [</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Fourteen Lac Ninety Thousand\r\nThree Hundred Seventy</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">) along with interest @18% p.a. in the interest of\r\njustice, equity and fair play.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>',5961480.00,0.00,'2018-03-26 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Any interim relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deems proper in the facts and circumstances of the case.&nbsp;</p>','1','','2016-09-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Plot No 600, Gateway City Mohali Sector 118-19','','',1,1,0,0,'P43982017','2019-02-12 15:27:44.000','P43982017','2019-02-12 15:27:44.000'),(1020,1306,'1306',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bee Gee Builtech','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,0,'SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','1','SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','Savinder Singh Gill','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103','Palm Village','Gurpal Singh','guranhad@gmail.com',7347606235,0,'C-1202, 12th Floor, Tower-C, Palm Village','Village Desumajra, Sector-126',28,507,'140301','1','C-1202, 12th Floor, Tower-C, Palm Village','Village Desumajra, Sector-126',28,507,'140301','0','<p>That the complainant no. 1 is the promoter having RERA registration no. PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103, has\r\ndeveloped project under the name and style of “PALM VILLAGE”, located in Sector-126, NH-21, S.A.S.\r\nNagar, Mohali. The complainant no. 2 is a maintenance agency which has been entrusted upon with the\r\nmaintenance of the project of the complainant no. 1. It is pertinent to mention here that both the\r\ncomplainants have entered into an agreement for the said reason. That the respondents are allottee of\r\nthe complainant no. 1 who had applied for an apartment measuring 2180 sq. ft. (Approximate Super Area)\r\non 25.04.2013 in the abovementioned project and in pursuance of the said booking, he was allotted flat\r\nno. C-1202 on 12th Floor in Tower C vide allotment letter dated 25.08.2015. That a buyer’s agreement was\r\nsigned between the complainant no. 1 and the respondents on 25.08.2015. The respondents were thereafter\r\noffered possession of the said apartment and the possession was\r\ntaken over by the respondents on 26.11.2015. Further it is pertinent to mention here that in the possession\r\nhanding over letter, the respondents had undertaken to pay the maintenance charges after taking over\r\npossession of the said apartment and had also undertaken to enter into a maintenance agreement. The\r\nrespondents thereafter, entered into a maintenance agreement dated 26.11.2015 with the complainant\r\nno. 2. That the respondents despite been in possession of the said apartment, has not been paying the\r\nmaintenance charges fixed as per the maintenance agreement and is enjoying all the services free of\r\ncost. It is further pertinent to mention here that a number of public notices has been got attached in the\r\nsociety whereby the respondents were called upon various times for payment of the maintenance charges\r\nbut no heed was paid to the said notices by the respondents.&nbsp;<br></p>','<p>Directing the respondents to pay the amount of Rs. 74,222/- due towards the maintenance\r\ncharges. Directing the respondent to pay compensation of Rs. 25,000/- to the complainants<br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Directing the respondents to pay interest on the due amount as mentioned in the maintenance\r\nagreement till the pendency of the present complaint till actual payment.<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'BeeG','2019-02-12 15:36:06.000','BeeG','2019-02-12 15:36:06.000'),(1021,1306,'1306',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bee Gee Builtech','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,0,'SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','1','SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','Savinder Singh Gill','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103','Palm Village','Gurpal Singh','guranhad@gmail.com',7347606235,0,'C-1202, 12th Floor, Tower-C, Palm Village','Village Desumajra, Sector-126',28,507,'140301','1','C-1202, 12th Floor, Tower-C, Palm Village','Village Desumajra, Sector-126',28,507,'140301','0','<p>That the complainant no. 1 is the promoter having RERA registration no. PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103, has\r\ndeveloped project under the name and style of “PALM VILLAGE”, located in Sector-126, NH-21, S.A.S.\r\nNagar, Mohali. The complainant no. 2 is a maintenance agency which has been e