ondents on 25.08.2015. The respondents were thereafter\r\noffered possession of the said apartment and the possession was\r\ntaken over by the respondents on 26.11.2015. Further it is pertinent to mention here that in the possession\r\nhanding over letter, the respondents had undertaken to pay the maintenance charges after taking over\r\npossession of the said apartment and had also undertaken to enter into a maintenance agreement. The\r\nrespondents thereafter, entered into a maintenance agreement dated 26.11.2015 with the complainant\r\nno. 2. That the respondents despite been in possession of the said apartment, has not been paying the\r\nmaintenance charges fixed as per the maintenance agreement and is enjoying all the services free of\r\ncost. It is further pertinent to mention here that a number of public notices has been got attached in the\r\nsociety whereby the respondents were called upon various times for payment of the maintenance charges\r\nbut no heed was paid to the said notices by the respondents.&nbsp;<br></p>','<p>Directing the respondents to pay the amount of Rs. 74,222/- due towards the maintenance\r\ncharges. Directing the respondent to pay compensation of Rs. 25,000/- to the complainants<br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Directing the respondents to pay interest on the due amount as mentioned in the maintenance\r\nagreement till the pendency of the present complaint till actual payment.<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'BeeG','2019-02-12 16:50:16.000','BeeG','2019-02-12 16:50:16.000'),(1025,1307,'1307',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-12 18:57:00.000','Bee Gee Builtech','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,0,'SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','1','SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','Savinder Singh Gill','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103','Palm Villa