spite been in possession of the said apartment, has not been paying the maintenance\r\ncharges fixed as per the maintenance agreement and is enjoying all the services free of cost. It is further\r\npertinent to mention here that a number of public notices has been got attached in the society whereby\r\nthe respondent was called upon various times for payment of the maintenance charges but no heed was\r\npaid to the said notices by the respondents.<br></p>','<p>&nbsp;Directing the respondent to pay the amount of Rs. 34,727/- due towards the maintenance charges.\r\nDirecting the respondent to pay compensation of Rs. 25,000/- to the complainants<br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Directing the respondents to pay interest on the due amount as mentioned in the maintenance agreement\r\ntill the pendency of the present complaint till actual payment.&nbsp;<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'BeeG','2019-02-13 16:51:46.000','BeeG','2019-02-13 16:51:46.000'),(1031,1144,'1144',1146,'7dfad30e-4afa-4859-8a26-94b85edcd0f5','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-07 15:42:32.000','Ashish Kumar Jain','jarnailthakur@yahoo.com',9815695783,0,495798240541,'c/o Sandeep Jain, 5368-C, Nicholson Road, Punjabi Mohalla, Ambala Cantt.','Ambala',13,1,'133001','1','c/o Sandeep Jain, 5368-C, Nicholson Road, Punjabi Mohalla, Ambala Cantt.','Ambala',13,1,'133001','J S Thakur','jarnailthakur@yahoo.com',9815695783,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0010','Fashion Technology Park\r\n(formerly registered as Jade Business Park)','Chandigarh Overseas Pvt. Ltd.','sanjaychugh.biz@gmail.com',9876499777,0,'SCO 196-197, Top Floor, Sector 34-A, Chandigarh','Chandigarh',6,128,'160022','1','SCO 196-197, Top Floor, Sector 34-A, Chandigarh','Chandigarh',6,128,'160022','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%\">The respondents came up with a\r\nproject in sector 90, Mohali, named as Fashion Technology Park in the year\r\n2006. The complainant booked 4 units of 100/125 sq. ft. each. On 02.09.2006and\r\npaid Rs. 5 lac out of the total amount payable Rs. 20 lac @ Rs. 5 lac per unit.\r\nTotal payment made by the complainant is Rs.19 lac. Construction was to\r\ncommence in 2<sup>nd</sup> week of sep 2006. He was allotted 4 units of 100 sq.\r\nft. each in Design Studio no. 6 on 5<sup>th</sup> floor. The respondents\r\nassured of fixed returns as also of a buy back scheme @7.5 lac per unit. The\r\nconstruction was to be completed in 30 months from Sep 2006, but the same was\r\nnever done. Further the Respondents &nbsp;purported to enter into a Developer Buyer\r\nagreement and one Lease agreement, obtained the complainant’s signatures thereon,\r\nasked him to collect the said agreements duly signed and dated by the\r\nauthorised persons which was never done.&nbsp;\r\nThe Respondents sent a letter dated 22.06.2009 offering to buy back the\r\n4 units @7.5 lac per unit. The complainant accepted the offer and was acknowledged\r\nby the Respondents &nbsp;vide their letter\r\ndated 13.01.2010. The Respondents paid a sum of Rs. 7.5 lac for buy back of one\r\nunit, but the balance amount of Rs. 22.50 lac for remaining three units was\r\nnever paid. The complainant was also assured of compensation for delay@ Rs. 50\r\nper sq. ft per month as per clause 28 of Developer Buyer agreement. Accordingly\r\nthey paid a sum of Rs.48388/- vide cheque dated 31.03.2010 only once and\r\nnothing thereafter. The Respondents have made the complainant to run from\r\npillar to post and have caused him great harassment and mental torture.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">The complainant</span></i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;line-height:115%\"> prays for a direction to the Respondents:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">1. To pay the balance amount of Rs.7,50,000/-for one of the four\r\nunits with interest @18% p.a. with effect from 02.03.2010 till actual payment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">2. To pay for delay @Rs.50/- per square foot per month w.e.f.\r\n02.03.2010 along with interest @18% per annum till actual payment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">3.To pay a sum of Rs.10 lacs for the mental torture, agony\r\nand harassment to the complainant and for making him run from pillar to post to\r\navail his rights.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">4. To pay litigation costs to the tune of Rs.1,10,000/- which\r\nhe has so far incurred.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">5.&nbsp; To not to alienate,\r\ncancel the allotment,&nbsp; sell, transfer,\r\nmortgage, etc. the allotted units in Design Studio no. 6 in the Fashion\r\nTechnology Park Sector 90, Mohali.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',2000000.00,1900000.00,'2010-03-02 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.