h\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%\">The respondents came up\r\nwith a project in sector 90, Mohali, named as Fashion Technology Park in the\r\nyear 2006. The complainant booked 4 units of 100/125 sq. ft. each. On\r\n02.09.2006and paid Rs. 5 lac out of the total amount payable Rs. 20 lac @ Rs. 5\r\nlac per unit. Total payment made by the complainant is Rs.19 lac. Construction\r\nwas to commence in 2<sup>nd</sup> week of sep 2006. He was allotted 4 units of\r\n100 sq. ft. each in Design Studio no. 6 on 5<sup>th</sup> floor. The respondents\r\nassured of fixed returns as also of a buy back scheme @7.5 lac per unit. The\r\nconstruction was to be completed in 30 months from Sep 2006, but the same was\r\nnever done. Further the Respondents &nbsp;purported to enter into a Developer Buyer\r\nagreement and one Lease agreement, obtained the complainant’s signatures\r\nthereon, asked him to collect the said agreements duly signed and dated by the\r\nauthorised persons which was never done.&nbsp;\r\nThe Respondents sent a letter dated 22.06.2009 offering to buy back the\r\n4 units @7.5 lac per unit. The complainant accepted the offer and was\r\nacknowledged by the Respondents &nbsp;vide\r\ntheir letter dated 13.01.2010. The Respondents paid a sum of Rs. 7.5 lac for\r\nbuy back of one unit, but the balance amount of Rs. 22.50 lac for remaining\r\nthree units was never paid. The complainant was also assured of compensation\r\nfor delay@ Rs. 50 per sq. ft per month as per clause 28 of Developer Buyer\r\nagreement. Accordingly they paid a sum of Rs.48388/- vide cheque dated\r\n31.03.2010 only once and nothing thereafter. The Respondents have made the\r\ncomplainant to run from pillar to post and have caused him great harassment and\r\nmental torture.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">The complainant</span></i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;line-height:115%\"> prays for a direction to the Respondents:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">1. To pay the balance amount of Rs.7,50,000/-for one of the four\r\nunits with interest @18% p.a. with effect from 02.03.2010 till actual payment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">2. To pay for delay @Rs.50/- per square foot per month w.e.f.\r\n02.03.2010 along with interest @18% per annum till actual payment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">3.To pay a sum of Rs.10 lacs for the mental torture, agony\r\nand harassment to the complainant and for making him run from pillar to post to\r\navail his rights.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">4. To pay litigation costs to the tune of Rs.1,10,000/- which\r\nhe has so far incurred.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">5.&nbsp; To not to alienate,\r\ncancel the allotment,&nbsp; sell, transfer,\r\nmortgage, etc. the allotted units in Design Studio no. 6 in the Fashion\r\nTechnology Park Sector 90, Mohali.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',2000000.00,1900000.00,'2010-03-02 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">The complainant</span></i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;line-height:115%\"> prays for a direction to the Respondents:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">1. To pay the balance amount of Rs.7,50,000/-for one of the four\r\nunits with interest @18% p.a. with effect from 02.03.2010 till actual payment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">2. To pay for delay @Rs.50/- per square foot per month w.e.f.\r\n02.03.2010 along with interest @18% per annum till actual payment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">3.To pay a sum of Rs.10 lacs for the mental torture, agony\r\nand harassment to the complainant and for making him run from pillar to post to\r\navail his rights.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">4. To pay litigation costs to the tune of Rs.1,10,000/- which\r\nhe has so far incurred.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%\">5.&nbsp; To not to alienate,\r\ncancel the allotment,&nbsp; sell, transfer,\r\nmortgage, etc. the allotted units in Design Studio no. 6 in the Fashion\r\nTechnology Park Sector 90, Mohali.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','2006-08-12 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Design Studiio No. 6 one of four units of 100 Sq. Ft ','','',1,0,0,0,'jarnailthakur','2019-02-13 20:16:48.000','jarnailthakur','2019-02-13 20:16:48.000'),(1035,1311,'1311',1401,'01434d26-c105-4368-b89f-f5a01c3765ee','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Jagmeet  Singh','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,0,'House No-.32 A, WARD NO. 01','Model Town, Tohana',13,4,'125120','1','House No-.32 A, WARD NO. 01','Model Town, Tohana',13,4,'125120','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0047','Emerging Heights III','M/s Emerging India Corporation Pvt Ltd','info@emergingindia.in',1725042900,0,'SCO-46-47, First Floor, Sector-9 D, Near Mattka Chowk, ','Madhya Marg, Chandigarh',6,128,'160009','1','SCO-46-47, First Floor, Sector-9 D, Near Mattka Chowk, ','Madhya Marg, Chandigarh',6,128,'160009','1','<p>CONCISE STATEMENT OF FACTS AND GROUNDS OF COMPLAINT.That Mr. Jagmeet Singh, S/o Mr. Gurdeep Singh, resident of House No. 1, Model Town, Tohana, Fatehabad, the Complainant, booked a 2BHK, First Floor, measuring total area 720 sq.ft in the project “Premium Trinity Homes” vide application number EV/TRP/1122 dated 18.05.2015 promoted with M/s&nbsp; Emerging Valley Pvt. Ltd, the respondent. A copy of the provisional allotment letter issued by the respondent is attached herewith as Annexure C/1.The complainant made three payments amounting to Rs. 6,59,117/- to the respondent from 3rd March, 2015 to 23rd December, 2015. The details of payment receipts/payment confirmation letter issued by the respondent are attached as Annexure C/2 (Colly).The complainant made further payments of Rs. 2,80,200/- to the respondent on 23.06.2016 as per payment receipts attached as Annexure C/3 (Colly).The respondent issued final allotment of 2bhk Residential Unit, measuring total area 1285 sq.ft in Emerging Heights III Project of the respondent at a total consideration of Rs. 30,00,000/-. The allotted unit is E-604 in “Emerging Heights III” as against the originally allotted unit of “Premium Trinity Homes Project of the respondent which was of 720 sq.ft at a price of 19,78,250/-. A copy of the final allotment letter containing all terms and conditions is attached herewith as Annexure C/4.The Complainant made further payments of Rs.13,10,883/- to the respondent on 06.09.2016 &amp; 22.09.2016 as per payment receipts attached as Annexure C/5 (Colly).The Complainant was required to make total payment of Rs. 22,50,000/- as CLP and balance Rs.750,000/- was to be made at the time of possession. As per payment details mentioned at Annexure C/2 (Colly), C/3(Colly) &amp; C/5(Colly), the complainant has made total payment of Rs. 22,50,000/- to the respondent.The respondent vide its letter dated 26.09.2016 has issued payment confirmation letter having received an amount of Rs. 22,50,000 from complainant.Annexure C/6</p>','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:&#10;auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:&#10;EN-IN\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">As per the final allotment letter,\r\nthe respondent was to offer possession of the allotted unit on 31.03.2017 which\r\nhas not been offered till date. The Complainant followed up with respondent\r\nnumber of times through personal visits/letters. The complainant’s letters\r\ndated 02.08.2017 and 19.04.2018 attached as Annexure C/7, did not elicit any\r\nresponse from the respondent. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:&#10;auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:&#10;EN-IN\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">The respondent has got the project\r\nregistered with the Authority vide RERA Registration Number PBRERA-SAS80-PR0047,\r\nbeing an ongoing project.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:&#10;auto;text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:&#10;115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:&#10;auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:&#10;EN-IN\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">That the residential project is still\r\nnot complete and may not be able to offer possession of the allotted unit in\r\nnear future after obtaining completion/occupancy certificate from the competent\r\nauthorities. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:&#10;auto;text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:&#10;115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:&#10;auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:&#10;EN-IN\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">The complainant has lost faith in the\r\npromoters/project and wishes to withdraw from the project as the project has\r\nalready got delayed by one year and more than 10 months from the issue of final\r\nallotment letter by the respondent.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:&#10;auto;text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:&#10;115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:&#10;auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:&#10;EN-IN\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">In view of the above facts, the\r\nrespondent has violated the provisions of Section 18, 19 of the Act.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:auto;&#10;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:&#10;EN-IN\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">It is most respectfully prayed that\r\nthe respondent be directed to refund the entire amount paid to the respondent\r\nalong with interest as per provisions of the Act.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike><br></strike></p><p>Through&nbsp;</p><p>Ved Parkash&nbsp;</p><p>(Auhtorised Representative)</p><p><br></p>',3000000.00,2250000.00,'2017-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NIL</p>','1','','2016-09-06 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','E-604','','',2,0,0,0,'jagmeetsingh','2019-02-14 11:06:49.000','jagmeetsingh','2019-02-14 11:06:49.000'),(1036,1312,'1312',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','dfs','dfasdf','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'Outside Old Sabzi Mandi','Near Hotel Dolphin',28,39,'144001','1','Outside Old Sabzi Mandi','Near Hotel Dolphin',28,39,'144001','0','<p>fwefefrfef</p>','<p>ffwef</p>',11402358.00,10253548.57,'2019-02-04 00:00:00.00