Sheeshmahal Appartments','Shalimar Bagh',10,440,'110088','1','DA-620, Sheeshmahal Appartments','Shalimar Bagh',10,440,'110088','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PM0027','Credo Assets Private Limited ','Alok Kapoor','info@cityofdreams.in',7087004209,0,'SCO-146,147,148 II Floor','Sector-43 B',6,128,'160042','1','SCO-146,147,148 II Floor','Sector-43 B',6,128,'160042','1','<p>The officials of above said accused have approached to the complainant regarding their project of \" CITY OF DREAMS 1\" at Sec-116, Landran- Kharar Road, SAS Nagar, Punjab, in respect of the allotment of the Flat No.3019 3rd Floor, Tower No. COD1 C.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIt is pertinent to mention here that the said agreement was dated 30.04.2018 but the signature of the complainant was taken in the month of June, 2018.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe complainant has paid the sum of Rs.2,50,000/- to the above said accused. However it was assured to the complainant by the above said accused that he will provide the loan to the complainant.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nBut despite the several efforts and requests made by the complainant, the above said accused did not provide the loan to the complainant. After that on instructions of the accused, the complainant had applied for the loan with the bank at Delhi but the same was refused.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nNot only this, the above said accused through their advocate sent the legal notice to the complainant and even grabbed the earnest money amount of the complainant of Rs.2,50,000/-.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe above said company has committed the cheating, fraud and misinterpretation with the complainant and hence the complainant is left with no other alternative but to approach your goodself.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIt is, therefore requested to your goodself to kindly look into the matter and take some strict legal action against the said company, at the earliest.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<!--/data/user/0/com.samsung.android.app.notes/files/share/clipdata_190214_233406_955.sdoc--></p>','<p>It is requested to your goodself to kindly look into the matter and take some strict legal action against the said company, at the earliest.&nbsp;</p><p>It is pertinent to mention here that the said agreement was dated 30.04.2018 but the signature of the complainant was taken in month of June,2018. Not only this, the above said accused through their advocate sent the legal notice to the complainant and even grabbed the earnest money amount of the complainant of Rs.2,50,000/-.&nbsp;</p><p>The complainant has paid the sum of Rs.2,50,000/- to the above said accused. However it was assured to the complainant by the above said accused that he will provide the loan to the complainant. But despite several efforts and requests made by the complainant, the above said accused did not provide the loan to the complainant. After that on instructions of the accused, the complainant has applied for the loan with the bank at Delhi but the same was refused. So the complainant by the company\'s legal procedure has applied for the refund amount of Rs.2,50,000/- which the same was refused by the above said accused.</p><p>It is therefore requested to your goodself to kindly look into the matter so that the complainant gets his refund amount of Rs.2,50,000/- with interest from the company as soon as possible.</p>',2955006.00,250000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>The complainant wants his refunded amount of Rs.2,50,000/- with interest from the above said accused company on the grounds that the above said company has committed the cheating, fraud and misinterpretation with the complainant and hence the complainant is left with no other alternative but to approach your goodself.&nbsp;<!--/data/user/0/com.samsung.android.app.notes/files/share/clipdata_190214_233503_822.sdoc--><br></p>','1','','2018-04-30 00:00:00','2018-04-30 00:00:00','Flat No.-3019, on the 3rd Floor, Tower No.- COD1 C in \" CITY OF DREAMS 1\" at Sec-116, Landran- Kharar Road, Kharar, SAS Nagar,  Punjab ','','',1,0,0,0,'Ajaysingh6572','2019-02-14 23:40:09.000','Ajaysingh6572','2019-02-14 23:40:09.000'),(1041,1316,'1316',1400,'f6d9a53b-fba9-4e9d-8090-aef1e9133d5e','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-15 06:56:45.000','Ajay Singh  Bhadwal','ajays6572@gmail.com',9810075563,0,0,'DA-620, Sheeshmahal Appartments','Shalimar Bagh',10,440,'110088','1','DA-620, Sheeshmahal Appartments','Shalimar Bagh',10,440,'110088','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PM0027','Credo Assets Private Limited ','Alok Kapoor','info@cityofdreams.in',7087004209,0,'SCO-146,147,148 II Floor','Sector-43 B',6,128,'160042','1','SCO-146,147,148 II Floor','Sector-43 B',6,128,'160042','1','<p>The officials of above said accused have approached to the complainant regarding their project of \" CITY OF DREAMS 1\" at Sec-116, Landran- Kharar Road, SAS Nagar, Punjab, in respect of the allotment of the Flat No.3019 3rd Floor, Tower No. COD1 C.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIt is pertinent to mention here that the said agreement was dated 30.04.2018 but the signature of the complainant was taken in the month of June, 2018.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe complainant has paid the sum of Rs.2,50,000/- to the above said accused. However it was assured to the complainant by the above said accused that he will provide the loan to the complainant.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nBut despite the several efforts and requests made by the complainant, the above said accused did not provide the loan to the complainant. After that on instructions of the accused, the complainant had applied for the loan with the bank at Delhi but the same was refused.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nNot only this, the above said accused through their advocate sent the legal notice to the complainant and even grabbed the earnest money amount of the complainant of Rs.2,50,000/-.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe above said company has committed the cheating, fraud and misinterpretation with the complainant and hence the complainant is left with no other alternative but to approach your goodself.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIt is, therefore requested to your goodself to kindly look into the matter and take some strict legal action against the said company, at the earliest.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<!--/data/user/0/com.samsung.android.app.notes/files/share/clipdata_190215_064303_096.sdoc--></p>','<p>It is requested to your goodself to kindly look into the matter and take some strict legal action against the said company, at the earliest.&nbsp;<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIt is pertinent to mention here that the said agreement was dated 30.04.2018 but the signature of the complainant was taken in month of June,2018. Not only this, the above said accused through their advocate sent the legal notice to the complainant and even grabbed the earnest money amount of the complainant of Rs.2,50,000/-.&nbsp;<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe complainant has paid the sum of Rs.2,50,000/- to the above said accused. However it was assured to the complainant by the above said accused that he will provide the loan to the complainant. But despite several efforts and requests made by the complainant, the above said accused did not provide the loan to the complainant. After that on instructions of the accused, the complainant has applied for the loan with the bank at Delhi but the same was refused. So the complainant by the company\'s legal procedure has applied for the refund amount of Rs.2,50,000/- which the same was refused by the above said accused.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIt is therefore requested to your goodself to kindly look into the matter so that the complainant gets his refund amount of Rs.2,50,000/- with interest from the company as soon as possible.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<!--/data/user/0/com.samsung.android.app.notes/files/share/clipdata_190215_064334_653.sdoc--></p>',2955006.00,250000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>The complainant wants his refunded amount of Rs.2,50,000/- with interest from the above said accused company on the grounds that the above said company has committed the cheating, fraud and misinterpretation with the complainant and hence the complainant is left with no other alternative but to approach your goodself.&nbsp;<!--/data/user/0/com.samsung.android.app.notes/files/share/clipdata_190215_064417_034.sdoc--><br></p>','1','','2018-04-30 00:00:00','2018-04-30 00:00:00','Flat No.3019,on 3rd floor, Tower No. COD1 C in \" CITY of DREAMS 1 \" at Sec-116, Landran- Kharar Road,  Kharar, SAS Nagar,  Punjab ','','',1,1,0,0,'Ajaysingh6572','2019-02-15 06:42:29.000','Ajaysingh6572','2019-02-15 06:42:29.000'),(1042,1317,'1317',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bee Gee Builtech','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,0,'SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','1','SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','Savinder Singh Gill','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103','Palm Village','Pankaj Kumar Soni','soni.sonipankaj@gmail.com',9418289137,0,'B-1101, 11th floor, Tower-B, Palm Village','Village Desumajra, Sector-116',28,507,'140301','1','B-1101, 11th floor, Tower-B, Palm Village','Village Desumajra, Sector-116',28,507,'140301','1','<p>That the complainant no. 1 is the promoter having RERA registration no. PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103, has\r\ndeveloped project under the name and style of “PALM VILLAGE”, located in Sector-126, NH-21, S.A.S.\r\nNagar, Mohali. The complainant no. 2 is a maintenance agency which has been entrusted upon with the\r\nmaintenance of the project of the complainant no. 1. It is pertinent to mention here that both the\r\ncomplainants have entered into an agreement for the said reason. That the respondents are allottees of\r\nthe complainant no. 1 who had purchased an apartment measuring 2180 sq. ft. (Approximate Super Area) in resale on 12.10.2016 in the abovementioned project and they were allotted flat\r\nno. C-1101 on 11th Floor in Tower-B vide re-allotment letter dated 12.10.2016. That a buyer’s agreement\r\nwas signed between the complainant no. 1 and the original allotees on 17.09.2012. The respondents were\r\nthereafter offered possession of the said apartment and the possession was taken over by the original allottee on 25.05.2016. Further it is pertinent to mention here that in the possession handing over\r\nletter, the respondents had undertaken to pay the maintenance charges after taking over possession of\r\nthe said apartment and had also undertaken to enter into a maintenance agreement. The original allottees thereafter, entered into a maintenance agreement dated 25.05.2016 with the complainant no. 2. That the\r\nrespondents despite been in possession of the said apartment, has not been paying the maintenance\r\ncharges fixed as per the maintenance agreement and is enjoying all the services free of cost. It is further\r\npertinent to mention here that a number of public notices has been got attached in the society whereby\r\nthe respondents were called upon various times for payment of the maintenance charges but no heed\r\nwas paid to the said notices by the respondents.&nbsp;<br></p>','<p>Directing the respondents to pay the amount of Rs. 39,569/- due towards the maintenance charges.\r\nDirecting the respondent to pay compensation of Rs. 25,000/- to the complainants<br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Directing the respondents to pay interest on the due amount as mentioned in the maintenance agreement\r\ntill the pendency of the present complaint till actual payment.<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'BeeG','2019-02-15 12:01:16.000','BeeG','2019-02-15 12:01:16.000'),(1043,1318,'1318',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bee Gee Builtech','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,0,'SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','1','SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','Savinder Singh Gill','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103','Palm Village','Mamta Handa','strikerbrother@gmail.com',9816070090,0,'# 91, sector-3, Roura','Bilaspur',14,106,'174001','1','# 91, sector-3, Roura','Bilaspur',14,106,'174001','1','<p>That the complainant no. 1 is the promoter having RERA registration no. PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103, has\r\ndeveloped project under the name and style of “PALM VILLAGE”, located in Sector-126, NH-21, S.A.S.\r\nNagar, Mohali. The complainant no. 2 is a maintenance agency which has been entrusted upon with the\r\nmaintenance of the project of the complainant no. 1. It is pertinent to mention here that both the\r\ncomplainants have entered into an agreement for the said reason. That the respondent is allottee of\r\nthe complainant no. 1 who had applied for an apartment measuring 2180 sq. ft. (Approximate Super Area)\r\non 02.05.2014 in the abovementioned project and in pursuance of the said booking, they were allotted flat\r\nno. B-1201 on 12th Floor in Tower-B vide allotment letter dated 02.05.2014. That a buyer’s agreement\r\nwas signed between the complainant no. 1 and the respondent on 02.05.2014. The respondent was thereafter offered possession of the said apartment and the possession was taken over by the\r\nrespondent on 22.04.2015. Further it is pertinent to mention here that in the possession handing over\r\nletter, the respondent had undertaken to pay the maintenance charges after taking over possession of\r\nthe said apartment and had also undertaken to enter into a maintenance agreement. The respondent thereafter, entered into a maintenance agreement dated 22.04.2015 with the complainant no. 2. That the\r\nrespondent despite been in possession of the said apartment, has not been paying the maintenance\r\ncharges fixed as per the maintenance agreement and is enjoying all the services free of cost. It is further\r\npertinent to mention here that a number of public notices has been got attached in the society whereby\r\nthe respondent were called upon various times for payment of the maintenance charges but no heed\r\nwas paid to the said notices by the respondent.&nbsp;<br></p>','<p>Directing the respondent to pay the amount of Rs. 89,985/- due towards the maintenance charges.\r\nDirecting the respondent to pay compensation of Rs. 25,000/- to the complainants&nbsp;<br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Directing the respondent to pay interest on the due amount as mentioned in the maintenance agreement\r\ntill the pendency of the present complaint till actual payment.<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'BeeG','2019-02-15 12:21:19.000','BeeG','2019-02-15 12:21:19.000'),(1044,1311,'1311',1401,'01434d26-c105-4368-b89f-f5a01c3765ee','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-15 12:37:46.000','Jagmeet  Singh','csvedparkash@gmail.com',9802345000,0,0,'House No-.32 A, WARD NO. 01','Model Town, Tohana',13,4,'125120','1','House No-.32 A, WARD NO. 01','Model Town, Tohana',13,4,'125120','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0047','Emerging Heights III','M/s Emerging India Corporation Pvt Ltd','info@emergingindia.in',1725042900,0,'SCO-46-47, First Floor, Sector-9 D, Near Mattka Chowk, ','Madhya Marg, Chandigarh',6,128,'160009','1','SCO-46-47, First Floor, Sector-9 D, Near Mattka Chowk, ','Madhya Marg, Chandigarh',6,128,'160009','1','<p>CONCISE STATEMENT OF FACTS AND GROUNDS OF COMPLAINT.That Mr. Jagmeet Singh, S/o Mr. Gurdeep Singh, resident of House No. 1, Model Town, Tohana, Fatehabad, the Complainant, booked a 2BHK, First Floor, measuring total area 720 sq.ft in the project “Premium Trinity Homes” vide application number EV/TRP/1122 dated 18.05.2015 promoted with M/s&nbsp; Emerging Valley Pvt. Ltd, the respondent. A copy of the provisional allotment letter issued by the respondent is attached herewith as Annexure C/1.The complainant made three payments amounting to Rs. 6,59,117/- to the respondent from 3rd March, 2015 to 23rd December, 2015. The details of payment receipts/payment confirmation letter issued by the respondent are attached as Annexure C/2 (Colly).The complainant made further payments of Rs. 2,80,200/- to the respondent on 23.06.2016 as per payment receipts attached as Annexure C/3 (Colly).The respondent issued final allotment of 2bhk Residential Unit, measuring total area 1285 sq.ft in Emerging Heights III Project of the respondent at a total consideration of Rs. 30,00,000/-. The allotted unit is E-604 in “Emerging Heights III” as against the originally allotted unit of “Premium Trinity Homes Project of the respondent which was of 720 sq.ft at a price of 19,78,250/-. A copy of the final allotment letter containing all terms and conditions is attached herewith as Annexure C/4.The Complainant made further payments of Rs.13,10,883/- to the respondent on 06.09.2016 &amp; 22.09.2016 as per payment receipts attached as Annexure C/5 (Colly).The Complainant was required to make total payment of Rs. 22,50,000/- as CLP and balance Rs.750,000/- was to be made at the time of possession. As per payment details mentioned at Annexure C/2 (Colly), C/3(Colly) &amp; C/5(Colly), the complainant has made total payment of Rs. 22,50,000/- to the respondent.The respondent vide its letter dated 26.09.2016 has issued payment confirmation letter having received an amount of Rs. 22,50,000 from complainant.Annexure C/6</p>','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:&#10;auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:&#10;EN-IN\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">As per the final allotment letter,\r\nthe respondent was to offer possession of the allotted unit on 31.03.2017 which\r\nhas not been offered till date. The Complainant followed up with respondent\r\nnumber of times through personal visits/letters. The complainant’s letters\r\ndated 02.08.2017 and 19.04.2018 attached as Annexure C/7, did not elicit any\r\nresponse from the respondent. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:&#10;auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:&#10;EN-IN\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">The respondent has got the project\r\nregistered with the Authority vide RERA Registration Number PBRERA-SAS80-PR0047,\r\nbeing an ongoing project.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:&#10;auto;text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:&#10;115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:&#10;auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:&#10;EN-IN\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">That the residential project is still\r\nnot complete and may not be able to offer possession of the allotted unit in\r\nnear future after obtaining completion/occupancy certificate from the competent\r\nauthorities. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:&#10;auto;text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:&#10;115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:&#10;auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:&#10;EN-IN\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">The complainant has lost faith in the\r\npromoters/project and wishes to withdraw from the project as the project has\r\nalready got delayed by one year and more than 10 months from the issue of final\r\nallotment letter by the respondent.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:&#10;auto;text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:&#10;115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:&#10;auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:&#10;EN-IN\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">In view of the above facts, the\r\nrespondent has violated the provisions of Section 18, 19 of the Act.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:25.1pt;mso-add-space:auto;&#10;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:&#10;EN-IN\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;&#10;line-height:115%;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">It is most respectfully prayed that\r\nthe respondent be directed to refund the entire amount paid to the respondent\r\nalong with interest as per provisions of the Act.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike><br></strike></p><p>Through&nbsp;</p><p>Ved Parkash&nbsp;</p><p>(Auhtorised Representative)</p><p><br></p>',3000000.00,2250000.00,'2017-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NIL</p>','1','','2016-09-06 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','E-604','','',1,1,0,0,'jagmeetsingh','2019-02-15 12:37:35.000','jagmeetsingh','2019-02-15 12:37:35.000'),(1045,1319,'1319',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bee Gee Builtech','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,0,'SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','1','SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','Savinder Singh Gill','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103','Palm Village','Rohit Bhayana','r.bhayana28@gmail.com',9877777767,0,'C-901, 9th floor, Tower-C, Palm Village','village-Desumajra, sector-126',28,507,'140301','1','C-901, 9th floor, Tower-C, Palm Village','village-Desumajra, sector-126',28,507,'140301','1','<p>That the complainant no. 1 is the promoter having RERA registration no. PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103, has\r\ndeveloped project under the name and style of “PALM VILLAGE”, located in Sector-126, NH-21, S.A.S.\r\nNagar, Mohali. The complainant no. 2 is a maintenance agency which has been entrusted upon with the\r\nmaintenance of the project of the complainant no. 1. It is pertinent to mention here that both the\r\ncomplainants have entered into an agreement for the said reason. That the respondents are allottees of\r\nthe complainant no. 1 who had applied for an apartment measuring 2180 sq. ft. (Approximate Super Area)\r\non 15.03.2016 in the abovementioned project and in pursuance of the said booking, they were allotted flat\r\nno. C-901 on 9th Floor in Tower-C vide allotment letter dated 21.03.2016. That a buyer’s agreement\r\nwas signed between the complainant no. 1 and the respondents on 21.03.2016. The respondents were\r\nthereafter offered possession of the said apartment and the possession was taken over by the\r\nrespondents on 31.03.2016. Further it is pertinent to mention here that in the possession handing over\r\nletter, the respondents had undertaken to pay the maintenance charges after taking over possession of\r\nthe said apartment and had also undertaken to enter into a maintenance agreement. The respondents\r\nthereafter, entered into a maintenance agreement dated 31.03.2016 with the complainant no. 2. That the\r\nrespondents despite been in possession of the said apartment, has not been paying the maintenance\r\ncharges fixed as per the maintenance agreement and is enjoying all the services free of cost. It is further\r\npertinent to mention here that a number of public notices has been got attached in the society whereby\r\nthe respondents were called upon various times for payment of the maintenance charges but no heed\r\nwas paid to the said notices by the respondents.&nbsp;<br></p>','<p>Directing the respondents to pay the amount of Rs. 45,878/- due towards the maintenance charges.\r\nDirecting the respondent to pay compensation of Rs. 25,000/- to the complainants<br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Directing the respondents to pay interest on the due amount as mentioned in the maintenance agreement\r\ntill the pendency of the present complaint till actual payment.<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'BeeG','2019-02-15 12:38:46.000','BeeG','2019-02-15 12:38:46.000'),(1046,1320,'1320',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bee Gee Builtech','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,0,'SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','1','SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','Savinder Singh Gill','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103','Palm Village','Kusum Kaushal','sahil_kaushal@rediffmail.com',9878687838,0,'D-301, 3rd floor, Tower-D, Palm Village','Village-Desumajra, Sector-126',28,507,'140301','1','D-301, 3rd floor, Tower-D, Palm Village','Village-Desumajra, Sector-126',28,507,'140301','1','<p>That the complainant no. 1 is the promoter having RERA registration no. PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103, has\r\ndeveloped project under the name and style of “PALM VILLAGE”, located in Sector-126, NH-21, S.A.S.\r\nNagar, Mohali. The complainant no. 2 is a maintenance agency which has been entrusted upon with the\r\nmaintenance of the project of the complainant no. 1. It is pertinent to mention here that both the\r\ncomplainants have entered into an agreement for the said reason. That the respondents are allottees of\r\nthe c