taken to enter into a maintenance agreement. The original allottees thereafter, entered into a maintenance agreement dated 25.05.2016 with the complainant no. 2. That the\r\nrespondents despite been in possession of the said apartment, has not been paying the maintenance\r\ncharges fixed as per the maintenance agreement and is enjoying all the services free of cost.<br></p>','<p>Directing the respondents to pay the amount of Rs. 39,569/- due towards the maintenance charges.\r\nDirecting the respondent to pay compensation of Rs. 25,000/- to the complainants.<br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Directing the respondents to pay interest on the due amount as mentioned in the maintenance agreement\r\ntill the pendency of the present complaint till actual payment.<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'BeeG','2019-02-19 12:02:02.000','BeeG','2019-02-19 12:02:02.000'),(1072,1325,'1325',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bee Gee Builtech','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,0,'SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','1','SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','Savinder Singh Gill','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103','Palm Village','Varinder Singh Jawanda','varinders@milleniumsystem.com',9810093075,0,'#-231-E, Greater Kailash Part-1','New Delhi',10,429,'110048','1','#-231-E, Greater Kailash Part-1','New Delhi',10,429,'110048','0','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">That\r\nthe complainant no. 1 is a promoter having RERA registration no.\r\nPBRERA-SAS80-PR0103, which has developed project under the name and style of\r\n“PALM VILLAGE”, located in Sector-126, NH-21, S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali. The\r\ncomplainant no. 2 is a maintenance agency which has been entrusted upon with\r\nthe maintenance of the project of the complainant no. 1. It is pertinent to\r\nmention here that both the complainants have entered into an agreement for the\r\nsaid reason. That the respondent is allottee of the complainant no. 1 who\r\nhad purchased an apartment measuring 2180 sq. ft. (Approximate Super Area) in\r\nresale on 16.03.2016 in the abovementioned project and he was allotted flat\r\nno. D-1001 on 10th Floor in Tower-D vide re-allotment letter dated 29.04.2016.\r\nThat a buyer’s agreement was signed between the complainant no. 1 and the\r\noriginal allotee on 24.04.2014. The respondent was thereafter offered\r\npossession of the said apartment and the possession was taken over by the\r\noriginal allottees on 02.09.2015. The said agreement was endorsed in the name of\r\nrespondent after resale of the said apartment and all the rights and\r\nliabilities were undertaken by the respondent as they had stepped into the\r\nshoes of the original allottees.&nbsp; It is pertinent to mention here that in the\r\npossession handing over letter, the respondent had undertaken to pay the\r\nmaintenance charges after taking over possession of the said apartment and had\r\nalso undertaken to enter into a maintenance agreement. The original allottees thereafter, entered into a maintenance agreement dated 02.09.2015 with the\r\ncomplainant no. 2. That the respondent despite been in possession of the said\r\napartment, has not been paying the maintenance charges fixed as per the\r\nmaintenance agreement and is enjoying all the services free of cost.</span><o:p></o:p></p>','<p>&nbsp;Directing the respondent to pay the amount of Rs. 46,304/- due towards the maintenance charges.\r\nDirecting the respondent to pay compensation of Rs. 25,000/- to the complainants<br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Directing the respondent to pay interest on the due amount as mentioned in the maintenance agreement\r\ntill the pendency of the present complaint till actual payment.&nbsp;<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'BeeG','2019-02-19 12:27:16.000','BeeG','2019-02-19 12:27:16.000'),(1073,1326,'1326',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Manjit Kaur ','sanjiv10109@rediffmail.com',9815910109,0,0,'H. NO. 908, Tower-18, Motia Royal','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','H. NO. 908, Tower-18, Motia Royal','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','Sanjiv Sharma','sanjiv10109@rediffmail.com',9815910109,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PB0105','Urban Vatika','Home and Land Planners','urbanvatikazpr@gmail.com',7508500986,0,'Opposite Bus Stand, Adjoining Paras Downtown Mall','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','Opposite Bus Stand, Adjoining Paras Downtown Mall','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<p>The&nbsp;</p>','<p>the</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>the</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'BeeG','2019-02-19 13:37:15.000','BeeG','2019-02-19 13:37:15.000'),(1074,1326,'1326',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Manjit Kaur ','sanjiv10109@rediffmail.com',9815910109,0,0,'H. NO. 908, Tower-18, Motia Royal','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','H. NO. 908, Tower-18, Motia Royal','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','Sanjiv Sharma','sanjiv10109@rediffmail.com',9815910109,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PB0105','Urban Vatika','Home and Land Planners','urbanvatikazpr@gmail.com',7508500986,0,'Opposite Bus Stand, Adjoining Paras Downtown Mall','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','Opposite Bus Stand, Adjoining Paras Downtown Mall','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<p><br></p>','<p>in the view of the above submissions the respondent be directed to following :</p><p>(1) To refund the amount paid i.e. 35,11,840/- along with interest @ 12% P.A from the resective date of deposit till reliazation.</p><p>(2) To Pay litigation expences amounting to Rs. 1,00,000/-.</p><p>Any other relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deem fit in the interest of justice.</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>The respondent be directed to produce the completion certificate and occupation certificated from the competent authority.</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'BeeG','2019-02-19 13:44:37.000','BeeG','2019-02-19 13:44:37.000'),(1075,1326,'1326',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Manjit Kaur ','sanjiv10109@rediffmail.com',9815910109,0,0,'H. NO. 908, Tower-18, Motia Royal','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','H. NO. 908, Tower-18, Motia Royal','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','Sanjiv Sharma','sanjiv10109@rediffmail.com',9815910109,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PB0105','Urban Vatika','Home and Land Planners','urbanvatikazpr@gmail.com',7508500986,0,'Opposite Bus Stand, Adjoining Paras Downtown Mall','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','Opposite Bus Stand, Adjoining Paras Downtown Mall','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The\r\ncomplainants booked the&nbsp; Flat with the respondent non 2.11.2017. The total\r\nvalue of the Flat was 4592000/- including GST of Rs. 492000. The complainant\r\ndeposited the total amount of Rs. 3511840/- for which the complainant took the\r\nloan of Rs. 1534952/- from Infoline Housing Finance Ltd. The respondents at the\r\ntime of booking assured that possession shall be handed over by all means by\r\n31.3.2018. The complainant kept on depositing the amount as desired by the\r\nrespondent from time to time. &nbsp;But till\r\ndate, the respondent failed to hand over the possession to the applicant\r\non&nbsp; one pretext or another. The complainant\r\nhas invested whole retiral benefits for the purchase of the flat as he has no\r\nresidential accommodation in the tricity. The respondent till date has not\r\nhanded over the possession of &nbsp;the Flat\r\nand the complainant was forced to take rented accommodation at the rate of Rs.\r\n14000/- per month. Beside the same, the complainant is also paying interest on\r\nthe loan amount. The whole pension of the complainant is being exhausted in payment\r\nof rent as well as payment on interest on loan amount. The respondent till date\r\nhas not clearly mentioned as to when the actual physical possession complete in\r\nall respect shall be given. The complainants have now lost charm in having\r\ntheir own property and thus want the refund of their whole amount deposited with\r\nthe respondent. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>','<p>in the view of the above submissions the respondent be directed to following :</p><p>(1) To refund the amount paid i.e. 35,11,840/- along with interest @ 12% P.A from the resective date of deposit till reliazation.</p><p>(2) To Pay litigation expences amounting to Rs. 1,00,000/-.</p><p>Any other relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deem fit in the interest of justice.</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>The respondent be directed to produce the completion certificate and occupation certificate from the competent authority.</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'BeeG','2019-02-19 13:55:04.000','BeeG','2019-02-19 13:55:04.000'),(1076,1326,'1326',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Manjit Kaur ','sanjiv10109@rediffmail.com',9815910109,0,0,'H. NO. 908, Tower-18, Motia Royal','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','H. NO. 908, Tower-18, Motia Royal','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','Sanjiv Sharma','sanjiv10109@rediffmail.com',9815910109,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PB0105','Urban Vatika','Home and Land Planners','urbanvatikazpr@gmail.com',7508500986,0,'Opposite Bus Stand, Adjoining Paras Downtown Mall','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','Opposite Bus Stand, Adjoining Paras Downtown Mall','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The\r\ncomplainants booked the&nbsp; Flat with the respondent non 2.11.2017. The total\r\nvalue of the Flat was 4592000/- including GST of Rs. 492000. The complainant\r\ndeposited the total amount of Rs. 3511840/- for which the complainant took the\r\nloan of Rs. 1534952/- from Infoline Housing Finance Ltd. The respondents at the\r\ntime of booking assured that possession shall be handed over by all means by\r\n31.3.2018. The complainant kept on depositing the amount as desired by the\r\nrespondent from time to time. &nbsp;But till\r\ndate, the respondent failed to hand over the possession to the applicant\r\non&nbsp; one pretext or another. The complainant\r\nhas invested whole retiral benefits for the purchase of the flat as he has no\r\nresidential accommodation in the tricity. The respondent till date has not\r\nhanded over the possession of &nbsp;the Flat\r\nand the complainant was forced to take rented accommodation at the rate of Rs.\r\n14000/- per month. Beside the same, the complainant is also paying interest on\r\nthe loan amount. The whole pension of the complainant is being exhausted in payment\r\nof rent as well as payment on interest on loan amount. The respondent till date\r\nhas not clearly mentioned as to when the actual physical possession complete in\r\nall respect shall be given. The complainants have now lost charm in having\r\ntheir own property and thus want the refund of their whole amount deposited with\r\nthe respondent. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>','<p>in the view of the above submissions the respondent be directed to following :</p><p>(1) To refund the amount paid i.e. 35,11,840/- along with interest @ 12% P.A from the resective date of deposit till reliazation.</p><p>(2) To Pay litigation expences amounting to Rs. 1,00,000/-.</p><p>Any other relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deem fit in the interest of justice.</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>The respondent be directed to produce the completion certificate and occupation certificate from the competent authority.</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'BeeG','2019-02-19 13:55:59.000','BeeG','2019-02-19 13:55:59.000'),(1077,1327,'1327',1379,'2d137ca6-59a8-435c-b0fc-c1fa08ff883c','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-13 11:45:47.000','Maninder Singh','Savvy.Maninder@gmail.com',8360895838,0,0,'212, Sant Nagar','street No. 1, Amritsar Road',28,393,'142001','1','212, Sant Nagar','street No. 1, Amritsar Road',28,393,'142001','Charanjeet Singh','advcharanjeetsingh709@gmail.com',9988181003,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0386','Ireo Waterfront Pvt  Ltd','Rajiv Gupta','Rajiv.Gupta@ire.in',9501004421,0,'M/s. Ireo Waterfront Pvt Ltd,  C-14 First Floor,','Malviya Nagar, South Delhi',10,557,'110017','0','M/s.Ireo Waterfront (P)Ltd., SCO-16-17, ','Basement,Fortune Chambers, Opp. Ludhiana stock exchange,  Ferozepur Gandhi Market',28,366,'141001','0','<p>144.67 sq yards TYPE-T-PLOT-X137 Plot was booked on the payment of Rs. 150000/- in Ireo water front Pvt ltd. pocket 7 ,Ludhiana, vide receipt No. 15030417.The plot was provisionally allotted on Dated 24.02.2015. 90% of total sale consideration had been paid and the plot was to be allotted till August 2017 including the grace period.&nbsp; The remaining 10% was to be given at the time of possession as per the payment plan. Till date no Possession has been given.&nbsp; now I wish to withdraw from the project and my full payment&nbsp; with interest be refunded to me. Out of Total amount of Rs 3189974/-&nbsp; Rs 29,62,120 has been paid. An interest of Rs. 4,68,641 of bank has also been paid till date.</p>','<p><a href=\"Relief:-\">Relief:-</a></p><p>It is respectfully prayed the the entire amount plus interest paid to Bank and interest @ 18% be refunded back to me till the realisation of the amount.</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>None</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'Charanjeetsingh23','2019-02-19 14:39:15.000','Charanjeetsingh23','2019-02-19 14:39:15.000'),(1078,1328,'1328',1106,'0fa4919e-f07b-4736-b6c4-5b115fc41a37','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Hardeep Singh','hardeep.licdo@gmail.com',8146320007,1765250553,606394546303,'VPO.Sohana, Sector.77','Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','Asst. Branch Manager','LIC of India, Mandi Gobindgarh, Distt- FatehGarh Sahib',28,204,'147301','','',0,0,'Agent','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0091','Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','Hoshiar Singh and Sukhchain Singj','bbsbikpmohali@gmail.com',9915322330,0,'Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','Vill.Chapparchiri Kalan( H.B.No.195), Sector.92, Distt.SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','Vill.Chapparchiri Kalan( H.B.No.195), Sector.92, Distt.SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','<p>With due respect the facts are given below.</p><p>1. That I have booked two plots having No. 158 and 124 in the POSH CITY of the promoter as per the advertisement given in facebook and at location on 03.07.2017 by paying Rs 1lac advance through cheque.</p><p>2. Later their salesman convinced me to pay 25% advance by saying many plus points of the project but without any RERA approval, as I was not aware about RERA at that time and paid the total amount 1319360 as 25% for both the plots.</p><p>3. But they go on changing Plot nos of their own as their Map changed 3 times even after RERA approval.</p><p>4. After that they had not make a single call or correspondence with me regarding my Plot No 158 and 124.</p><p>5. I called Mr Sukhchain and Hoshiar Singh many times to fix time for meeting but he totally failed to meet and solve the issue. They neither Refund my amount nor given me allotment letter.</p><p>6. In August 2018 whattsup chat Mr Sukhchain asked me to send email for Refund of Amount with interest , I email him but inspite of refunding the amount he started threatening me and demanding the original documents which are already with them in my file.</p><p>7. After long harrassement of more than 15 minths I served them a legal notice to them through my advocate also but it also goes in vain and got no response from them.</p><p>8. Kindly help me either to takeover possession of my Plots which have been allotted by them. If they fail to do so then please fine them litigation fees and harassment/ mentally torture charge of Rs 2 lac alingwith Refund of my Amount Rs 1319360 with interest till date.</p><p>9. I shall be thankful to you for this act of kindness.</p>','<div>Sir,&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>I want relief for mentally torture and harassment ie Rs 100000.</div><div>I want &nbsp;litigation fees of Rs 100000.</div><div><br></div><div>The total relief Rs 200000 along with refund of my Amount Rs 1319360 plus interest till date.</div>',4750000.00,1319360.00,'2018-04-16 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Sir</p><p><br></p><p>It is my humble request that kindly take strict action against shch defaulters who dont follow any rules. </p><p>They booked my plots without any RERA approval, and their Map also got changed 3 times. They Advertised before RERA approval. Hence totally disobey RERA authority.</p><p>They used my huge amount of Rs 1319360 for their purpose and I loss my interest of the Amount till date as I have paid thrm this amount from my FD.</p><p>They harrassed me a lot and also mentally torture due to which I got sufferred from high BP and hypertension and now taking medicines due to them.</p><p>So kindly order against them. And order them to Refund my entire Amount of Rs1319360 along with interest till date and fine them a charge of Rs 2lac for harassement and mentally torture and litigation Fees.</p><p>Thanks</p><p><br></p>','1','','2017-07-03 00:00:00','2017-08-19 00:00:00','Plot No. 158, 124. POSH City. Village Chapparchiri Sector 92 Mohali','','',1,0,0,0,'HSToor','2019-02-19 19:18:14.000','HSToor','2019-02-19 19:18:14.000'),(1079,1329,'1329',1106,'0fa4919e-f07b-4736-b6c4-5b115fc41a37','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Hardeep Singh','hardeep.licdo@gmail.com',8146320007,1765250553,0,'VPO.Sohana, Sector.77','Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','Asst. Branch Manager','LIC of India, Mandi Gobindgarh, Distt- FatehGarh Sahib',28,204,'147301','','',0,0,'Agent','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0091','Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','bbsbikpmohali@gmail.com',9915322330,0,'Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','Vill.Chapparchiri Kalan( H.B.No.195), Sector.92, Distt.SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','Vill.Chapparchiri Kalan( H.B.No.195), Sector.92, Distt.SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','<p>With due respect the facts are given below.</p><p>1. That I have booked two plots having No. 158 and 124 in the POSH CITY of the promoter as per the advertisement given in facebook and at location on 03.07.2017 by paying Rs 1lac advance through cheque.</p><p>2. Later their salesman convinced me to pay 25% advance by saying many plus points of the project but without any RERA approval, as I was not aware about RERA at that time and paid the total amount 1319360 as 25% for both the plots.</p><p>3. But they go on changing Plot nos of their own 