urteen\r\nthousand four hundered thirty two only) against a total price of Rs.63,50,000\r\n(sixty three lakhs fifty thousand only).&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">6.\r\nThat the complainant was shocked to see that the developer has not completed\r\nthe project as per agreement and the work was going on at a slow pace. So, the\r\ncomplainant has stopped the balance payment against the total sum of\r\nRs.63,50,000 (Sixty Three Lakhs Fifty thousand only).&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">7.That\r\nthe complainant has a dream to live in her own house but her dream to live in\r\nher own house was shattered because of the non fullfillment of the commitment of\r\nthe developer to deliver possession on or before 1.12.2016.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1. The\r\ncomplainant has lost the faith in the developer and is no more interested to\r\nretain herself with the project and hence wants to take her money back along\r\nwith the interest and Rs.2,00,000 (Two lakhs only) for mental agony which she\r\nhas suffered from the developer and Rs.1,00,000 One Lakh only as litigation\r\ncost which the complainant has to suffer on account of the developer.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm\"><br></p>',6350000.00,5514432.00,'2016-12-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The developer\r\nshould be ordered not to issue any further notice for the recovery of any\r\namount as the same irritates her which effects the health of the complainant.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat no 190 F.f Block A wave estate Sector 85, SAS nagar Mohali','','',1,1,0,0,'adv.karanjindal','2019-02-21 13:32:05.000','adv.karanjindal','2019-02-21 13:32:05.000'),(1093,1317,'1317',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-21 18:32:35.000','Bee Gee Builtech','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,0,'SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','1','SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108','Savinder Singh Gill','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103','Palm Village','Pankaj Kumar Soni','soni.sonipankaj@gmail.com',9418289137,0,'B-1101, 11th floor, Tower-B, Palm Village','Village Desumajra, Sector-116',28,507,'140301','1','B-1101, 11th floor, Tower-B, Palm Village','Village Desumajra, Sector-116',28,507,'140301','1','<p>That the complainant no. 1 is the promoter having RERA registration no. PBRERA-SAS80-PR0103, has\r\ndeveloped project under the name and style of “PALM VILLAGE”, located in Sector-126, NH-21, S.A.S.\r\nNagar, Mohali. The complainant no. 2 is a maintenance agency which has been entrusted upon with the\r\nmaintenance of the project of the complainant no. 1. It is pertinent to mention here that both the\r\ncomplainants have entered into an agreement for the said reason. That the respondents are allottees of\r\nthe complainant no. 1 who had purchased an apartment measuring 2180 sq. ft. (Approximate Super Area) in resale on 12.10.2016 in the abovementioned project and they were allotted flat\r\nno. C-1101 on 11th Floor in Tower-B vide re-allotment letter dated 12.10.2016. That a buyer’s agreement\r\nwas signed between the complainant no. 1 and the original allotees on 17.09.2012. The respondents were\r\nthereafter offered possession of the said apartment and the possession was taken over by the original allottee on 25.05.2016. The said agreement was endorsed in the name of respondents after resale of the said apartment and all the rights and liabilities were undertaken by the respondents as they had stepped into the shoes of the original allottee.&nbsp; It is pertinent to mention here that in the possession handing over\r\nletter, the respondents had undertaken to pay the maintenance charges after taking over possession of\r\nthe said apartment and had also undertaken to enter into a maintenance agreement. The original allottees thereafter, entered into a maintenance agreement dated 25.05.2016 with the complainant no. 2. That the\r\nrespondents despite been in possession of the said apartment, has not been paying the maintenance\r\ncharges fixed as per the maintenance agreement and is enjoying all the services free of cost.<br></p>','<p>Directing the respondents to pay the amount of Rs. 39,569/- due towards the maintenance charges.\r\nDirecting the respondent to pay compensation of Rs. 25,000/- to the complainants.<br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Directing the respondents to pay interest on the due amount as mentioned in the maintenance agreement\r\ntill the pendency of the present complaint till actual payment.<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'BeeG','2019-02-21 16:38:58.000','BeeG','2019-02-21 16:38:58.000'),(1094,1212,'1212',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-24 15:32:20.000','Meenal Lall','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,0,'NA 802, Sapthagiri Splendor','BDM-IV',17,67,'560076','0','253, Sector-4, MDC','Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0090','SANDWOODS OPULENCIA','M/s Sandwoods Infratech Private Limited','info@sandwoods.com',0,1725003871,'SCO 222-223','Sector-34',6,128,'160022','1','SCO 222-223','Sector-34',6,128,'160022','1','<p>Respondent allotted a 3BHK residential apartment No.50,TowerA,5th floor,Super Area 1950 sq ft to the complainant.A brochure (C-1) was given to the complainant mentioning the detail regarding the facilities to be provided.Respondent issued the allotment letter dated 1.5.2014 (C-2).The total sale consideration of unit was fixed as Rs. 5070000.It was agreed at that all the specifications will be provided except Ac’s.Respondent also assured to provide cupboards in all the bedrooms(C-3). Buyer’s agreement (C-4) was signed on 20.5.14,as per which the possession was to be handed over within a period of 36 months.Complainant has paid Rs. 5246662(including tax of Rs. 186411&amp; EDC of Rs. 243750)Out of said amount, she has paid Rs. 4816500/- towards the basic price, out of total sale consideration of Rs. 5070000/-. Receipts of Rs.4629635/- (C-5) Apart from the amount of receipts, an amount of Rs. 264859/- &amp; 352168/- paid on 22/5/16 &amp; 2/9/17, thus totaling Rs. 5246662/-. Vide letter 13.8.18 (C-6), it was informed that unit has reached pre-possession stage &amp; more money was demanded, also that the super area has been increased to 2192 sq ft and demanded Rs. 629200/- in lieu of that. On 17.8.18, complainant took up the matter &amp; asked the reason for not informing her earlier about the increase. On visiting the site, the complainant found the area of flat to be same and no addition was found. Next day, complainant visited the respondent &amp; conveyed it that there is no increase. Then respondent made the reduction of 50% &amp; asked him to pay Rs. 314600. Copy of letter/statement is C-7.Inspite of repeated requests, respondent did not give the detail of increased area.It also started demanding Rs. 78912 towards maintenance advance which it cannot demand.Work has not been completed as per the specifications mentioned in brochure.Apartment is not habitable. Photographs are C-8. Loan sanction letter and order dated 19.11.2018 passed by SCRDC is C-9.No completion certificate has been received.</p>','<ol><li>To direct the respondent to handover the possession of the apartment complete in all respect along with the specifications as provided in the brochure (C-1) &amp; Letter (C-3), along with the interest for the delay in possession, to be calculated w.e.f. 20.05.2017 till the date of actual delivery of possession after obtaining the completion certificate.</li><li>To direct the respondent not to charge Rs. 314000/- towards the enhanced area as there has been no change in the area of the flat.The respondent has arbitrarily increased the area. Moreover it has never informed the complainant that area will be increased. It is only in August, 2018 vide letter Annexure C-6, it informed that area has been increased.</li><li>To direct the respondent not to charge Rs. 78912/- towards the maintenance advance of two years.</li></ol>',0.00,5246662.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ol><li>To direct the respondent to complete all the pending work and complete the same as per the specifications as mentioned in the brochure (C-1) &amp; letter (C-3)</li><li>To direct the respondent to provide all the common facilities</li></ol>','1','','2014-05-01 00:00:00','2014-05-20 00:00:00','Flat No.50, Tower A, 5th Floor, Type- 3BHK, Super Area 1950 sq ft','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2019-02-21 22:07:24.000','rerafilingformm','2019-02-21 22:07:24.000'),(1095,1212,'1212',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-21 22:10:13.000','Meenal Lall','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,0,'NA 802, Sapthagiri Splendor','BDM-IV',17,67,'560076','0','253, Sector-4, MDC','Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0090','SANDWOODS OPULENCIA','M/s Sandwoods Infratech Private Limited','info@sandwoods.com',0,1725003871,'SCO 222-223','Sector-34',6,128,'160022','1','SCO 222-223','Sector-34',6,128,'160022','1','<p>Respondent allotted a 3BHK residential apartment No.50,TowerA,5th floor,Super Area 1950 sq ft to the complainant.A brochure (C-1) was given to the complainant mentioning the detail regarding the facilities to be provided.Respondent issued the allotment letter dated 1.5.2014 (C-2).The total sale consideration of unit was fixed as Rs. 5070000.It was agreed at that all the specifications will be provided except Ac’s.Respondent also assured to provide cupboards in all the bedrooms(C-3). Buyer’s agreement (C-4) was signed on 20.5.14,as per which the possession was to be handed over within a period of 36 months.Complainant has paid Rs. 5246662(including tax of Rs. 186411&amp; EDC of Rs. 243750)Out of said amount, she has paid Rs. 4816500/- towards the basic price, out of total sale consideration of Rs. 5070000/-. Receipts of Rs.4629635/- (C-5) Apart from the amount of receipts, an amount of Rs. 264859/- &amp; 352168/- paid on 22/5/16 &amp; 2/9/17, thus totaling Rs. 5246662/-. Vide letter 13.8.18 (C-6), it was informed that unit has reached pre-possession stage &amp; more money was demanded, also that the super area has been increased to 2192 sq ft and demanded Rs. 629200/- in lieu of that. On 17.8.18, complainant took up the matter &amp; asked the reason for not informing her earlier about the increase. On visiting the site, the complainant found the area of flat to be same and no addition was found. Next day, complainant visited the respondent &amp; conveyed it that there is no increase. Then respondent made the reduction of 50% &amp; asked him to pay Rs. 314600. Copy of letter/statement is C-7.Inspite of repeated requests, respondent did not give the detail of increased area.It also started demanding Rs. 78912 towards maintenance advance which it cannot demand.Work has not been completed as per the specifications mentioned in brochure.Apartment is not habitable. Photographs are C-8. Loan sanction letter and order dated 19.11.2018 passed by SCRDC is C-9.No completion certificate has been received.</p>','<ol><li>To direct the respondent to handover the possession of the apartment complete in all respect along with the specifications as provided in the brochure (C-1) &amp; Letter (C-3), along with the interest for the delay in possession, to be calculated w.e.f. 20.05.2017 till the date of actual delivery of possession after obtaining the completion certificate.</li><li>To direct the respondent not to charge Rs. 314000/- towards the enhanced area as there has been no change in the area of the flat.The respondent has arbitrarily increased the area. Moreover it has never informed the complainant that area will be increased. It is only in August, 2018 vide letter Annexure C-6, it informed that area has been increased.</li><li>To direct the respondent not to charge Rs. 78912/- towards the maintenance advance of two years.</li></ol>',0.00,5246662.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ol><li>To direct the respondent to complete all the pending work and complete the same as per the specifications as mentioned in the brochure (C-1) &amp; letter (C-3)</li><li>To direct the respondent to provide all the common facilities</li></ol>','1','','2014-05-01 00:00:00','2014-05-20 00:00:00','Flat No.50, Tower A, 5th Floor, Type- 3BHK, Super Area 1950 sq ft','','',1,1,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2019-02-21 22:10:09.000','rerafilingformm','2019-02-21 22:10:09.000'),(1096,1332,'1332',1392,'b0c69931-11bf-4451-8cc2-008248f1614e','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','M/s India Insight Tours Pvt. Ltd.','jaspalsinghpannu@gmail.com',9646784784,0,0,'98-P, Basement and Ground Floor','Sector-30, Gurugram',13,5,'122001','0','Regd. Office at # 9066, C-Block','Pocket-9, Vasant Kunj, New Delhi',10,557,'110070','Jaspal Singh Pannu','jaspalsinghpannu@gmail.com',9646784784,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0231','The Views at Mohali Hills by EMAAR MGF Land ','M/s Emaar MGF Land Ltd.','feedback@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'SCO 120-122 First Floor','Sector 17-C, Chandigarh',6,128,'160017','0','ECG House, 28 Kasturba Gandhi Marg','New Delhi',10,120,'110001','1','<p>The Respondent launched a Project by the name of “The Views at Mohali Hills”. In response to an inquiry about the project, the Respondent through e-mail dated 01.11.2006 (Annexure C-1) provided details of the project to the Complainant, specifically assuring that the project would be completed in the next 36 months. The complainant up to 01.05.2007 deposited a total amount of Rs.15,71,325/- with the Respondent for the provisional allotment of Unit/Apartment no. C-3/1001 on 10th floor situated in above project(Annexure C-2). The complainant on 15.02.2012 (Annexure C-3) received an e-mail from the Respondent informing that the construction of Tower ‘C’ has not started yet.\r\n</p><p>The Complainant was informed by the Respondent vide letter dated 04.12.2013 that unit no. TVM L3-F02-203 has been allotted in place of earlier allotted unit no. TVM C-3 F10-1001 (Annexure C-4). Then vide e-mail dated 21.04.2015 (Annexure C-5) after exchanging numerous emails the complainant informed Respondent regarding consent for relocation to another Unit bearing No. TVM F-1-F07-701 in F tower, but the Respondent issued notice through email dated 20.07.2015 (Annexure C-6) and raised a demand of Rs.5,39,382/- to be paid by the complainant on the due date i.e. 20.08.2015, illegally and arbitrarily. The complainant thereafter requested the Respondent to refund the amount of Rs.15,71,325/- along with interest from the date of deposit till signing of the amended agreement (Annexure C-7) but the Respondent rejected the same.\r\n</p><p>The complainant received a cheque of Rs.8,27,050/- (Annexure C-8) dated 02.08.2017 from the Respondent, which was en-cashed by the complainant under protest. Most importantly, the complainant had deposited the amount as Rs.15,71,325/- (Annexure C-9(Colly.)) for the unit i.e. TVM-C3-F10-1001 and buyers agreement dated 04.02.2008 was also executed for the same. Complainant requested for refund of complete amount of Rs.15,71,325/- along with interest, but the same has been denied.</p>','<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Grounds of Relief:-<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:36.0pt;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">That the complainant had deposited total amount as Rs.15,71,325/-\r\nfor the unit i.e. TVM-C3-F10-1001 and buyers agreement dated 04.02.2008&nbsp;\r\nwas also executed for the same, but the Respondent has failed to deliver timely\r\npossession of the same.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:36.0pt;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">That in pursuance of the demand of the Complainant, the Respondent\r\nhas repaid only part amount of Rs.8,27,050/-&nbsp;irrespective\r\nof receiving total amount of Rs.15,71,325/- received up to 01.05.2007. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:36.0pt;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">That the Respondent failed to honour his commitment made to the\r\nComplainant thereby causing severe distress and financial injury, and only\r\npartial amount of Rs.8,27,050/- has\r\nbeen refunded by the Respondent, despite receiving total amount of Rs.15,71,325/-\r\nup to 01.05.2007 from the Complainant. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Prayer:-<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:36.0pt;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">That the Respondent be directed to refund the complete amount of Rs.15,71,325/-\r\nas deposited by the Complainant with the Respondent, along with prescribed\r\ninterest i.e. lending rate along with compensation; and /or &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">2. That this Hon’ble Authority may pass any other Order\r\nor Direction, as it may deem appropriate in </span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">the facts and circumstances of the\r\npresent case.</span><br></p>',0.00,1571325.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NIL</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','TVM-C3-F10-1001, Sector 104-105, Mohali, SAS Nagar, Punjab','','',2,0,0,0,'jaspalsinghpannu','2019-02-22 12:36:39.000','jaspalsinghpannu','2019-02-22 12:36:39.000'),(1097,1333,'1333',1412,'eac1bbd1-41a7-401c-b5c4-7978e6951783','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Damanjit Singh','daman_3344@yahoo.com',9814108763,0,0,'H no 3344','Sector 23 D',6,128,'160023','1','H no 3344','Sector 23 D',6,128,'160023','CA. Deepak Garg','cadeepakgarg@gmail.com',9855519149,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','ATS INGRABUILD PVT LTD CASA ESPANA','ATS INFRABUILD PRIVATE LIMITED','EMAIL@ATSGREENS.COM',0,0,'ATS INFRABUILD PRIVATE LIMITED','711/92 DEEPALI NEHRU PLACE',10,429,'110019','1','ATS INFRABUILD PRIVATE LIMITED','711/92 DEEPALI NEHRU PLACE',10,429,'110019','1','<p>bOOKING<br></p>','<p>rELIEF<br></p>',11560710.00,10491073.00,'2017-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>AS THINKS FIT BY HONBLE AUTHORITY<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2017-10-28 00:00:00','Apartment No. 4PH2, 26th Floor, 4th Tower, ATS Casa Espana, Sector 121, Near Verka Milk Plant, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'damanjit','2019-02-22 14:47:46.000','damanjit','2019-02-22 14:47:46.000'),(1098,1333,'1333',1412,'eac1bbd1-41a7-401c-b5c4-7978e6951783','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Damanjit Singh','daman_3344@yahoo.com',9814108763,0,0,'H no 3344','Sector 23 D',6,128,'160023','1','H no 3344','Sector 23 D',6,128,'160023','CA. Deepak Garg','cadeepakgarg@gmail.com',9855519149,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','ATS INGRABUILD PVT LTD CASA ESPANA','ATS INFRABUILD PRIVATE LIMITED','EMAIL@ATSGREENS.COM',0,0,'ATS INFRABUILD PRIVATE LIMITED','711/92 DEEPALI NEHRU PLACE',10,429,'110019','1','ATS INFRABUILD PRIVATE LIMITED','711/92 DEEPALI NEHRU PLACE',10,429,'110019','1','<p>BOOKING</p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'>ON OCTOBER 25, 2017, DAMANJIT SINGH, HEREIN AFTER REFERRED AS COMPLAINANT HAD BOOKED A RESIDENTIAL APARTMENT NO 4PH2, HAVING CARPET AREA 247.58 SQ. MT. TYPE B, ON 26TH FLOOR IN TOWER NO 4, BY GIVING AN ADVANCE OF RS. 7500000 ( NO RECEIPT WAS ISSUED TILL DTAE). THE SAID CHEQUE WAS DULY ENCASHED BY ATS INFRABUILD PVT LTD (HEREIN AFTER REFERRED AS RESPONDENT.</span></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'>EXECUTION OF AGREEMENT</span></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'>THE THIRTY TWO PAGE AGREEMENT WAS DULY EXECUTED ON DATED 28TH 2017, WHEREIN DATE OF POSSESSION OF APARTMENT WAS DESCRIBED AS 31ST DECEMBER 2017 WITH A GRACE PERIOD OF 3 MONTHS KINDLY REFER PARA 7.1 ON PAGE 10 OF SAID AGREEMENT.</span></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'>PAYMENTS MADE TILL DATE</span></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'>TOTAL AMOUNT TILL DATE WAS PAID AGAINST BASIC COST IS RS 10491073 ALONG WITH GST OF RS 1258928</span></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'>POSSESSION LATE BY MORE THAN ONE YEAR </span></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'>AS PER AGREEMENT THE POSSESSION HAS TO HANDOVER BY DECEMBER 31 2017 BUT PAPER POSSESSION WAS GIVEN ONLY ON 7TH JANUARY 2019, HOWEVER NO PHYSICAL POSSESSION WAS GIVEN UPTODATE<font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"></font></span></font></span></font></span></font></p><p>GROUND OF CLAIM</p><p>1 EVEN AFTER PASSING OF MORE THAN ONE YEAR FROM THE DATE AS MENTIONED IN AGREEMENT TO SELL, THE RESPONDENANT IS FAILED TO HANDOVER THE ACTUAL POSSESSION</p><p>2 COMPLAINANT HAD PAID RS 10491073 AGAINST BASIC COST ALONG WITH 1258928 AGAINST GST TILL NO PHYSICAL POSSESSION WAS GIVEN</p><p>3 COMPLAINANT HAD TAKEN A HOUSING LOAN OF RS. 4145090 AND PAYING AN MONTHLY INSTALMENT OF RS. 40819</p><p>4 COMPLAINANT AND HIS FAMILY IS FACING GREAT MENTAL AGONY ALONGWITH FINANCIAL LOSS DUE TO FAILURE OF RESPONDENT.</p>','<p><br></p>',11560710.00,10491073.00,'2017-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>AS THINKS FIT BY HONBLE AUTHORITY<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2017-10-28 00:00:00','Apartment No. 4PH2, 26th Floor, 4th Tower, ATS Casa Espana, Sector 121, Near Verka Milk Plant, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'damanjit','2019-02-22 15:07:27.000','damanjit','2019-02-22 15:07:27.000'),(1099,1333,'1333',1412,'eac1bbd1-41a7-401c-b5c4-7978e6951783','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-22 15:12:56.000','Damanjit Singh','daman_3344@yahoo.com',9814108763,0,0,'H no 3344','Sector 23 D',6,128,'160023','1','H no 3344','Sector 23 D',6,128,'160023','CA. Deepak Garg','cadeepakgarg@gmail.com',9855519149,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','ATS INGRABUILD PVT LTD CASA ESPANA','ATS INFRABUILD PRIVATE LIMITED','EMAIL@ATSGREENS.COM',0,0,'ATS INFRABUILD PRIVATE LIMITED','711/92 DEEPALI NEHRU PLACE',10,429,'110019','1','ATS INFRABUILD PRIVATE LIMITED','711/92 DEEPALI NEHRU PLACE',10,429,'110019','1','<p>BOOKING</p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'>ON OCTOBER 25, 2017, DAMANJIT SINGH, HEREIN AFTER REFERRED AS COMPLAINANT HAD BOOKED A RESIDENTIAL APARTMENT NO 4PH2, HAVING CARPET AREA 247.58 SQ. MT. TYPE B, ON 26TH FLOOR IN TOWER NO 4, BY GIVING AN ADVANCE OF RS. 7500000 ( NO RECEIPT WAS ISSUED TILL DTAE). THE SAID CHEQUE WAS DULY ENCASHED BY ATS INFRABUILD PVT LTD (HEREIN AFTER REFERRED AS RESPONDENT.</span></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'>EXECUTION OF AGREEMENT</span></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'>THE THIRTY TWO PAGE AGREEMENT WAS DULY EXECUTED ON DATED 28TH 2017, WHEREIN DATE OF POSSESSION OF APARTMENT WAS DESCRIBED AS 31ST DECEMBER 2017 WITH A GRACE PERIOD OF 3 MONTHS KINDLY REFER PARA 7.1 ON PAGE 10 OF SAID AGREEMENT.</span></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'>PAYMENTS MADE TILL DATE</span></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'>TOTAL AMOUNT TILL DATE WAS PAID AGAINST BASIC COST IS RS 10491073 ALONG WITH GST OF RS 1258928</span></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'>POSSESSION LATE BY MORE THAN ONE YEAR </span></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'>AS PER AGREEMENT THE POSSESSION HAS TO HANDOVER BY DECEMBER 31 2017 BUT PAPER POSSESSION WAS GIVEN ONLY ON 7TH JANUARY 2019, HOWEVER NO PHYSICAL POSSESSION WAS GIVEN UPTODATE<font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><span style=\'line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\'><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"></font></span></font></span></font></span></font></p><p>GROUND OF CLAIM</p><p>1 EVEN AFTER PASSING OF MORE THAN ONE YEAR FROM THE DATE AS MENTIONED IN AGREEMENT TO SELL, THE RESPONDENANT IS FAILED TO HANDOVER THE ACTUAL POSSESSION</p><p>2 COMPLAINANT HAD PAID RS 10491073 AGAINST BASIC COST ALONG WITH 1258928 AGAINST GST TILL NO PHYSICAL POSSESSION WAS GIVEN</p><p>3 COMPLAINANT HAD TAKEN A HOUSING LOAN OF RS. 4145090 AND PAYING AN MONTHLY INSTALMENT OF RS. 40819</p><p>4 COMPLAINANT AND HIS FAMILY IS FACING GREAT MENTAL AGONY ALONGWITH FINANCIAL LOSS DUE TO FAILURE OF RESPONDENT.</p>','<p>RELIEF SOUGHT</p><p>LUMPSUM INTEREST U/S 18(1) FROM JANUARY 2018 TILL THE DATE OF ACTUAL POSSESSION</p><p>1 INTEREST U/S 18(1) OF THE REAL ESTATE (REGULATION AND DEVELOPMENT) ACT 2016 ON AMOIUNT PAID OF RS 10491073 AT THE RATE SPECIFIED IN CLAUSE 16 AND 17 OF REAL ESTATE (REGULATION AND DEVELOPMENT) RULES PUNJAB. ALSO IN REFERENCE TO SETTLED LAW BY HONBLE AUTHORITY PUNJAB IN CASE OF NIKHIL KAWATRA AND RANJINI G VS MR. KULWANT SINGH MD OF JANTA LAND PROMOTERS PVT LTD.</p><p>2. ANY OTHER RELIEF AS HONBLE&nbsp;AUTHORITY THINKS MAY FIT<br></p>',11560710.00,10491073.00,'2017-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>AS THINKS FIT BY HONBLE AUTHORITY<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2017-10-28 00:00:00','Apartment No. 4PH2, 26th Floor, 4th Tower, ATS Casa Espana, Sector 121, Near Verka Milk Plant, Mohali','','',1,1,0,0,'damanjit','2019-02-22 15:11:03.000','damanjit','2019-02-22 15:11:03.000'),(1100,1332,'1332',1392,'b0c69931-11bf-4451-8cc2-008248f1614e','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-26 15:19:15.000','M/s India Insight Tours Pvt. Ltd.','jaspalsinghpannu@gmail.com',9646784784,0,0,'98-P, Basement and Ground Floor','Sector-30, Gurugram',13,5,'122001','0','Regd. Office at # 9066, C-Block','Pocket-9, Vasant Kunj, New Delhi',10,557,'110070','Jaspal Singh Pannu','jaspalsinghpannu@gmail.com',9646784784,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0231','The Views at Mohali Hills by EMAAR MGF Land ','M/s Emaar MGF Land Ltd.','feedback@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'SCO 120-122 First Floor','Sector 17-C, Chandigarh',6,128,'160017','0','ECG House, 28 Kasturba Gandhi Marg','New Delhi',10,120,'110001','1','<p>The Respondent launched a Project by the name of “The Views at Mohali Hills”. In response to an inquiry about the project, the Respondent through e-mail dated 01.11.2006 (Annexure C-1) provided details of the project to the Complainant, specifically assuring that the project would be completed in the next 36 months. The complainant up to 01.05.2007 deposited a total amount of Rs.15,71,325/- with the Respondent for the provisional allotment of Unit/Apartment no. C-3/1001 on 10th floor situated in above project(Annexure C-2). The complainant on 15.02.2012 (Annexure C-3) received an e-mail from the Respondent informing that the construction of Tower ‘C’ has not started yet.\r\n</p><p>The Complainant was informed by the Respondent vide letter dated 04.12.2013 that unit no. TVM L3-F02-203 has been allotted in place of earlier allotted unit no. TVM C-3 F10-1001 (Annexure C-4). Then vide e-mail dated 21.04.2015 (Annexure C-5) after exchanging numerous emails the complainant informed Respondent regarding consent for relocation to another Unit bearing No. TVM F-1-F07-701 in F tower, but the Respondent issued notice through email dated 20.07.2015 (Annexure C-6) and raised a demand of Rs.5,39,382/- to be paid by the complainant on the due date i.e. 20.08.2015, illegally and arbitrarily. The complainant thereafter requested the Respondent to refund the amount of Rs.15,71,325/- along with interest from the date of deposit till signing of the amended agreement (Annexure C-7) but the Respondent rejected the same.\r\n</p><p>The complainant received a cheque of Rs.8,27,050/- (Annexure C-8) dated 02.08.2017 from the Respondent, which was en-cashed by the complainant under protest. Most importantly, the complainant had deposited the amount as Rs.15,71,325/- (Annexure C-9(Colly.)) for the unit i.e. TVM-C3-F10-1001 and buyers agreement dated 04.02.2008 was also executed for the same. Complainant requested for refund of complete amount of Rs.15,71,325/- along with interest, but the same has been denied.</p>','<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Grounds of Relief:-<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:36.0pt;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">That the complainant had deposited total amount as Rs.15,71,325/-\r\nfor the unit i.e. TVM-C3-F10-1001 and buyers agreement dated 04.02.2008&nbsp;\r\nwas also executed for the same, but the Respondent has failed to deliver timely\r\npossession of the same.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:36.0pt;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">That in pursuance of the demand of the Complainant, the Respondent\r\nhas repaid only part amount of Rs.8,27,050/-&nbsp;irrespective\r\nof receiving total amount of Rs.15,71,325/- received up to 01.05.2007. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:36.0pt;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">That the Respondent failed to honour his commitment made to the\r\nComplainant thereby causing severe distress and financial injury, and only\r\npartial amount of Rs.8,27,050/- has\r\nbeen refunded by the Respondent, despite receiving total amount of Rs.15,71,325/-\r\nup to 01.05.2007 from the Complainant. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Prayer:-<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:36.0pt;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">That the Respondent be directed to refund the complete amount of Rs.15,71,325/-\r\nas deposited by the Complainant with the Respondent, along with prescribed\r\ninterest i.e. lending rate along with compensation; and /or &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">2. That this Hon’ble Authority may pass any other Order\r\nor Direction, as it may deem appropriate in </span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">the facts and circumstances of the\r\npresent case.</span><br></p>',0.00,1571325.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NIL</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','TVM-C3-F10-1001, Sector 104-105, Mohali, SAS Nagar, Punjab','','',1,1,0,0,'jaspalsinghpannu','2019-02-22 17:18:04.000','jaspalsinghpannu','2019-02-22 17:18:04.000'),(1101,1326,'1326',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Manjit Kaur ','sanjiv10109@rediffmail.com',9815910109,0,0,'H. NO. 908, Tower-18, Motia Royal','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','H. NO. 908, Tower-18, Motia Royal','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','Sanjiv Sharma','sanjiv10109@rediffmail.com',9815910109,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PB0105','Urban Vatika','Home and Land Planners','urbanvatikazpr@gmail.com',7508500986,0,'Opposite Bus Stand, Adjoining Paras Downtown Mall','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','Opposite Bus Stand, Adjoining Paras Downtown Mall','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The\r\ncomplainants booked the&nbsp; Flat with the respondent non 2.11.2017. The total\r\nvalue of the Flat was 4592000/- including GST of Rs. 492000. The complainant\r\ndeposited the total amount of Rs. 3511840/- for which the complainant took the\r\nloan of Rs. 1534952/- from Infoline Housing Finance Ltd. The respondents at the\r\ntime of booking assured that possession shall be handed over by all means by\r\n31.3.2018. The complainant kept on depositing the amount as desired by the\r\nrespondent from time to time. &nbsp;But till\r\ndate, the respondent failed to hand over the possession to the applicant\r\non&nbsp; one pretext or another. The complainant\r\nhas invested whole retiral benefits for the purchase of the flat as he has no\r\nresidential accommodation in the tricity. The respondent till date has not\r\nhanded over the possession of the Flat\r\nand the complainant was forced to take rented accommodation at the rate of Rs.\r\n14000/- per month. Beside the same, the complainant is also paying interest on\r\nthe loan amount. The whole pension of the complainant is being exhausted in payment\r\nof rent as well as payment on interest on loan amount. The respondent till date\r\nhas not clearly mentioned as to when the actual physical possession complete in\r\nall respect shall be given. The complainants have now lost charm in having\r\ntheir own property and thus want the refund of their whole amount deposited with\r\nthe respondent. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>','<p>in the view of the above submissions the respondent be directed to following :</p><p>(1) To refund the amount paid i.e. 35,11,840/- along with interest @ 12% P.A from the resective date of deposit till reliazation.</p><p>(2) To Pay litigation expences amounting to Rs. 1,00,000/-.</p><p>Any other relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deem fit in the interest of justice.</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>The respondent be directed to produce the completion certificate and occupation certificate from the competent authority.</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'BeeG','2019-02-23 11:54:06.000','BeeG','2019-02-23 11:54:06.000'),(1102,1334,'1334',1361,'a52599d4-e47a-4877-8e30-d95c9ef9cf7f','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-26 10:20:11.000','SUMAN DHAUNDIYAL','kailashicwai@gmail.com',9818401409,0,0,'D-102,ARYA SAMAJ ROAD','UTTAM NAGAR',10,628,'110059','1','D-102,ARYA SAMAJ ROAD','UTTAM NAGAR',10,628,'110059','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0096','SBP HOUSING PARK','AMAN SINGLA','info@sbpgroup.in',9316004240,0,'SCO-146-148','1st floor sector -43B',6,128,'160043','1','SCO-146-148','1st floor sector -43B',6,128,'160043','1','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"background: white; margin: 0px 0px 0px 72px; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.65pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: \"Verdana\",\"sans-serif\";\'>On 20<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;January 2013\r\nthe undersigned underwent an agreement (Copy enclosed) with the said builder <span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp;</span>for purchase of apartment for <span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp;</span>approximately 1130 sq feet in the complex\r\ncalled SBP Housing Park for a total value of Rs.25,50,000/-. All the payment\r\nhas been made (down payment + home loan) except for Rs.1, 27,499/- , which is\r\nthe last instalment due </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"background: white; margin: 0px 0px 0px 72px; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.65pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: \"Verdana\",\"sans-serif\";\'>&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"background: white; margin: 0px 0px 0px 75.6px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: \"Verdana\",\"sans-serif\";\'>In Dec18 and Jan19, 3 numbers of\r\nlegal notices were received from their advocate. The first 2 notices (copy\r\nenclosed) demanded the payment of the last instalment. Despite our response to\r\nfirst 2 notices (copy enclosed) and earlier communication, another legal notice\r\nhas been received from their advocate which says our allotment has been\r\ncancelled and that we should now proceed for refund of amount paid by us </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><font face=\"Times New Roman\"></font><br></p>','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"background: white; margin: 0px 0px 0px 75.6px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: \"Verdana\",\"sans-serif\";\'>As per article 4(possession) <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">(copy enclosed)</b> of the agreement, the\r\nflat should have been handed over on or before 31<sup>st</sup>&nbsp;December\r\n2014.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"background: white; margin: 0px 0px 0px 75.6px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: \"Verdana\",\"sans-serif\";\'>As a compensation for non-compliance\r\nof the same, simple interest at the rate equivalent to rate of fixed deposit\r\noffered by SBI would be charged for the gap period (for the amount paid).&nbsp;\r\n</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"background: white; margin: 0px 0px 0px 75.6px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: \"Verdana\",\"sans-serif\";\'>&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"background: white; margin: 0px 0px 0px 75.6px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: \"Verdana\",\"sans-serif\";\'>Assuming the work is now over &amp;\r\nthe flat is ready for possession in Jan 19, there is <span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>a gap of approximately 48 months (Dec 2014 to\r\nJan 19) and current rate of interest offered by SBI is approximately 7.00%.\r\nTotal amount paid till date is 24.22 Lakhs. After taking all the factors into\r\nconsideration the interest amount for 48 months comes down to Rs. 6.78 Lakhs. The\r\nagreement also suggests that possession can only be taken after <span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>clearance of account. Balance amount now payable\r\nis Rs. -5.51 Lakhs (1.27 lakhs - 6.78 lakhs). </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"background: white; margin: 0px 0px 0px 75.6px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: \"Verdana\",\"sans-serif\";\'>&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"background: white; margin: 0px 0px 0px 75.6px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: \"Verdana\",\"sans-serif\";\'>In view of the facts mentioned in\r\npara 4,I, Suman Dhaundiyal, prays for the compensation of Rs.<b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">6.78 Lakhs and reversal of legal notice\r\nnumber 3 (cancellation of said property)</b></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"background: white; margin: 0px 0px 0px 75.6px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: \"Verdana\",\"sans-serif\";\'>&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"background: white; margin: 0px 0px 0px 75.6px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: \"Verdana\",\"sans-serif\";\'>&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><font face=\"Times New Roman\"></font><br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><br></p>','0','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','000