ion and Development Rules, 2017</p><p><br></p><p>2.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs. 20,00,000&nbsp; for causing mental agony caused to the complainant.</p><p><br></p><p>3.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs. 14,00,000 to the complainant as the deficiency in services for keeping the complainant in dark in regard to the progress of the property.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>4.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span> To direct the OP to pay Rs. 14,00,000&nbsp; for causing physical harassment caused to the complainant.</p><p><br></p><p>5.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay 5 per cent of the total estimated cost of the project under section 61 of Real Estate Regulation and Development Act, 2016</p><p><br></p><p>6.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To revoke the license of the OP under section 7 of the Real Estate Regulation and Development act, 2016.</p><p><br></p><p>Any other relief or claim which the Honble Authority deems appropriate.</p>',0.00,2525000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Not Prayed</p>','1','','2009-11-03 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2019-02-26 13:23:36.000','lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2019-02-26 13:23:36.000'),(1111,1264,'1264',1010,'a182232b-88d6-4711-8baa-f8a026fb675f','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-26 13:24:02.000','SUNDAR KRISHNAN','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988100005,1724181010,434498329217,'Tower 6, Flat 62, Godrej Garden Enclave, ','Opp. Godrej Memorial Hospital, Vikroli East, Mumbai',21,400,'400079','0','#102, Sector 10 A','',6,128,'160011','HIMANSHU RAJ','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988200001,1724190909,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0013','ATS GOLF MEADOWS-I','ATS ESTATES PRIVATE LIMITED','pradeep.rathee@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'711/92, DEEPALI','NEHRU PLACE, NEW DELHI',10,429,'110019','1','711/92, DEEPALI','NEHRU PLACE, NEW DELHI',10,429,'110019','1','<p>The complainant had booked a plot measuring 350 SQ. YARD at OPs project ATS GOLF MEADOWS I in the year 2005. That it is pertinent to mention here that OP did not possess any of the requisite clearances license from the competent authority to develop the said project at that time The complainant has paid the COMPLETE AMOUNT against the said unit to the Opposite Party in the year 2005.&nbsp;</p><p>That on 03.11.2009 the OP furnished an ALLOTMENT LETTER and allotted a plot to the complainant measuring 388.11 Sq. Yard, indentified by unique No. 120 in the said project. That it is pertinent to mention here that the OP had arbitrarily reduced the area of the plot which was booked. That the OP promised through verbal assurance and Verbal Agreement that the possession will be handed over to the complainant by 03.11.2011, i.e. 2 years from the date of allotment, but Op failed to do so. That the OP had raised a Demand for EDC from the complainant at exorbitant rate after the expiry of deemed date of possession 8 years after the date of booking. That OP had threatened to cancel the allotment and deduct the Earnest money if the demanded EDC is not paid. The complainant complied with the demands of OP and deposited the amount against EDC but till date the possession of the unit has not been handed over.&nbsp;</p><p>Therefore, the complainant craves the indulgence of the Honble RERA authority to hand to direct the OP to refund the entire amount as per the RERA CENTRAL ACT AND RERA STATE RULES.</p>','<p>1.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to compensate the complainant in the shape of refund the complete amount which has been deposited against the residential property so booked by the complainant along with an Interest on the amount from the date of deposit at the rate of 20 per cent&nbsp; till the actual realization of the complete amount within 90 days according to section 18 1 Real Estate Regulation And Development Act, 2016, 18 2 Real Estate Regulation And Development Act, 2016, Section 19 4 of The Real Estate Regulation And Development Act, 2016, r w Rule 16 and Rule 17 of Punjab State Real Estate Regulation and Development Rules, 2017</p><p><br></p><p>2.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs. 20,00,000&nbsp; for causing mental agony caused to the complainant.</p><p><br></p><p>3.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs. 14,00,000 to the complainant as the deficiency in services for keeping the complainant in dark in regard to the progress of the property.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>4.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span> To direct the OP to pay Rs. 14,00,000&nbsp; for causing physical harassment caused to the complainant.</p><p><br></p><p>5.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay 5 per cent of the total estimated cost of the project under section 61 of Real Estate Regulation and Development Act, 2016</p><p><br></p><p>6.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To revoke the license of the OP under section 7 of the Real Estate Regulation and Development act, 2016.</p><p><br></p><p>Any other relief or claim which the Honble Authority deems appropriate.</p>',0.00,2525000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Not Prayed</p>','1','','2009-11-03 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2019-02-26 13:23:58.000','lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2019-02-26 13:23:58.000'),(1112,1295,'1295',1374,'82227358-6d09-4a12-8b11-de1e75c71cac','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-25 20:26:50.000','Dev Raj Sharma','deva_2406@yahoo.co.in',9463087206,0,0,'H.No. 306','Sector - 35A, Chandigarh',6,128,'160017','1','H.No. 306','Sector - 35A, Chandigarh',6,128,'160017','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0089','GBP Aeropolis City (formerly known as Yellowstone Landmark Infocity)','Mr.  TS Bhatia(MD)  Mr. Aprajit Sachdev(GM) Mr. Anupam Gupta, Director – GBP Group.','tejindersbhatia@gmail.com',9592969696,9814412946,'M/s. Aeropolis Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd.,','Aeropolis City, Sector 66-A, S.A.S. Nagar,',28,507,'160062','1','M/s. Aeropolis Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd.,','Aeropolis City, Sector 66-A, S.A.S. Nagar,',28,507,'160062','1','<p>1.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span> Mega IT Project of M/s Aeropolis Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd. (formerly known as M/s Sukhm Infrastructure pvt. Ltd.) Project: AEROPOLIS CITY (Formerly known as YELLOWSTONE LAND MARK INFOCITY), SECTOR 66A, Mohali, approved by the state Government was launched in the market in the year 2009.&nbsp; Promoters issued Misleading and False adds in the Media or otherwise using names of Big Corporate Houses such as MukeshAmbani led Reliance group, The Dalmias, Bergruen( US ) and Yellow stone Chandigarh based firm.</p><p>2.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>On 17th Feb. 2010, Sukhm issued the Allotment letter in which it is on record and mentioned that “THAT ALLOTMENT LETTER IS SUBJECT TO SIGNING OF THE BUYER/SELLER AGREEMENT WITHIN 60 DAYS FROM THE ISSUANCE OF THIS LETTER.</p><p>3.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>But M/s Sukhm has issued the BUYER/SELLER AGREEMENT in August 2013, In Buyer/Seller Agreement Clause 7 (a) read as ( Development of the said IT/Industrial Plots is likely to be completed within a tentative period of 18 months from the date of this Agreement.)</p><p>4.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>We have paid under pressure up to 65% of the BSP.</p><p>5.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>On 26.09.2018, M/s Sukham Infrastructures Pvt. Ltd. has signed Joint Development Agreement with GBP Group.</p><p>6.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>As on date the status at the site of the project is as follows.</p><p>a)<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Development work is insignificant, which can be verified.</p><p>b)<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>No demarcation of plots.</p><p>c)<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>No services are available.</p><p>d)<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Patches of land which are shown on their approved maps, still not owned/ bought by them.</p><p>7.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>As on date we strongly believe that promoters :-</p><p>a)<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Does not have the approved layout plan from the competent Authority BEING DEFAULTER IN PAYMENT OF EDC.</p><p>b)<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>May not have valid agreement with State Govt. as on date.</p><p>c)<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>May have not acquired/purchased land which is part of promoters approved maps.</p>','<p>In view of the facts stated above , when promoters have failed on all fronts to give possession of plots even after 9 years of our investment,&nbsp; We request your honor as under to save us as we have invested all our life’s savings in this project.</p><p><br></p><p>a.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Direct the promoters and Govt. Authorities concerned to develop the Project immediately and give possession of plots to us.</p><p><br></p><p>b.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Payment of interest on the amount paid @ 18% p.a. (compounded) for the delay in giving the possession of plots.</p><p><br></p><p>c.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Pay compensation&nbsp; as per Seller/Buyers Agreement.</p><p>Any other relief which RERA may feel appropriate.</p>',15840000.00,10451397.00,'2015-08-08 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>a.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Payment of interest on the&nbsp; amount paid @ 18% (compound) for the delay in giving possession of plots.</p><p>b.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Pay compensation&nbsp;as per seller-Buyer agreement&nbsp;and mental harassment and agony suffered by us so long.</p><p>c.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Any other relief which RERA may feel appropriate.</p><p>d.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Direct the promoters and Govt. Authorities concerned to develop the Project immediately and give possession of plots to us.</p>','1','','2010-02-17 00:00:00','2013-08-08 00:00:00','Plot Number IT/P/MS/05 , IT/P/MS/06 M/s. Aeropolis Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd., Aeropolis City, Sector 66-A, S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali-160062','','',2,0,0,0,'devraj306','2019-02-26 14:17:19.000','devraj306','2019-02-26 14:17:19.000'),(1113,1295,'1295',1374,'82227358-6d09-4a12-8b11-de1e75c71cac','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-26 14:17:45.000','Dev Raj Sharma','deva_2406@yahoo.co.in',9463087206,0,0,'H.No. 306','Sector - 35A, Chandigarh',6,128,'160017','1','H.No. 306','Sector - 35A, Chandigarh',6,128,'160017','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0089','GBP Aeropolis City (formerly known as Yellowstone Landmark Infocity)','Mr.  TS Bhatia(MD)  Mr. Aprajit Sachdev(GM) Mr. Anupam Gupta, Director – GBP Group.','tejindersbhatia@gmail.com',9592969696,9814412946,'M/s. Aeropolis Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd.,','Aeropolis City, Sector 66-A, S.A.S. Nagar,',28,507,'160062','1','M/s. Aeropolis Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd.,','Aeropolis City, Sector 66-A, S.A.S. Nagar,',28,507,'160062','1','<p>1.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span> Mega IT Project of M/s Aeropolis Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd. (formerly known as M/s Sukhm Infrastructure pvt. Ltd.) Project: AEROPOLIS CITY (Formerly known as YELLOWSTONE LAND MARK INFOCITY), SECTOR 66A, Mohali, approved by the state Government was launched in the market in the year 2009.&nbsp; Promoters issued Misleading and False adds in the Media or otherwise using names of Big Corporate Houses such as MukeshAmbani led Reliance group, The Dalmias, Bergruen( US ) and Yellow stone Chandigarh based firm.</p><p>2.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>On 17th Feb. 2010, Sukhm issued the Allotment letter in which it is on record and mentioned that “THAT ALLOTMENT LETTER IS SUBJECT TO SIGNING OF THE BUYER/SELLER AGREEMENT WITHIN 60 DAYS FROM THE ISSUANCE OF THIS LETTER.</p><p>3.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>But M/s Sukhm has issued the BUYER/SELLER AGREEMENT i