nt Authority BEING DEFAULTER IN PAYMENT OF EDC.</p><p>b)<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>May not have valid agreement with State Govt. as on date.</p><p>c)<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>May have not acquired/purchased land which is part of promoters approved maps.</p>','<p>In view of the facts stated above , when promoters have failed on all fronts to give possession of plots even after 9 years of our investment,&nbsp; We request your honor as under to save us as we have invested all our life’s savings in this project.</p><p><br></p><p>a.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Direct the promoters and Govt. Authorities concerned to develop the Project immediately and give possession of plots to us.</p><p><br></p><p>b.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Payment of interest on the amount paid @ 18% p.a. (compounded) for the delay in giving the possession of plots.</p><p><br></p><p>c.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Pay compensation&nbsp; as per Seller/Buyers Agreement.</p><p>Any other relief which RERA may feel appropriate.</p>',15840000.00,10451397.00,'2015-08-08 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>a.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Payment of interest on the&nbsp; amount paid @ 18% (compound) for the delay in giving possession of plots.</p><p>b.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Pay compensation&nbsp;as per seller-Buyer agreement&nbsp;and mental harassment and agony suffered by us so long.</p><p>c.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Any other relief which RERA may feel appropriate.</p><p>d.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>Direct the promoters and Govt. Authorities concerned to develop the Project immediately and give possession of plots to us.</p>','1','','2010-02-17 00:00:00','2013-08-08 00:00:00','Plot Number IT/P/MS/05 , IT/P/MS/06 M/s. Aeropolis Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd., Aeropolis City, Sector 66-A, S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali-160062','','',1,1,0,0,'devraj306','2019-02-26 14:41:19.000','devraj306','2019-02-26 14:41:19.000'),(1115,1337,'1337',1414,'4669a5bc-9896-49e7-9bb4-0dd1e065b724','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-26 22:46:54.000','Nitesh Sharma','nitesh2244@gmail.com',9888847570,0,871466880240,'House no 1334 ','Sector 15',13,15,'134113','1','House no 1334 ','Sector 15',13,15,'134113','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PC0010','Chandigarh Citi Center','vijay jindal','info@chandigarhciticenter.in',9876084621,0,'M/s citi centre developers','VIP Road,Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','M/s citi centre developers','VIP Road,Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; text-align: justify; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">1.That I Advocate Nitesh&nbsp; Sharma S/O Sh. Madan lal Sharma R/O 1334 Sector 15 ,Panchkula. That I am practicing in the Punjab &amp; Haryana High Court at Chandigarh.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; text-align: justify; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">That I was needed a space for my law office in the area of Zirakpur Punjab thus in the month of January 2018 I have purchased a fully furnished office space in Chandigarh Citi Centre Zirakpur,Punjab.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; text-align: justify; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">2.That it is pertinent to mention here that I and my mother Smt. Vinod Bala entered in to an agreement on dated 23<sup>rd</sup> January 2018 with the above said company and said company issued me a Soho Bearing No 330 Block B ,Third floor Chandigarh Citi Centre Zirakpur,Punjab.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; text-align: justify; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">3.That I have already paid the whole amount to the said company and nothing is due against me as per agreement.That as per the agreement company has to handed over the possession to me in the month of December 2018 but very unfortunately the said company didn’t gave me the possession of my office even till today and now they are demanding around Rs 1 lac(one) as advance maintenance charges for two years but in agreement it is specifically mentioned in point no 11 that “ The Promoter shall be responsible to provide and maintain essential services in the project till the taking over of the maintenance of the project by the association of the allottees. The cost of such maintenance has been included in the Total Price Of the unit.”so now they are demanding for the maintenance charges&nbsp; for two&nbsp; year which is not the part of the agreement.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; text-align: justify; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">4.That the above said company cheated me by demanding more money illegally for which the company is not entitled rather company breached the terms and condition of the agreement.</p>','<ol>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">That kindly direct the company not to go beyond the agreement and immediately handover the possession of my office to me without charging the maintenance fee. &nbsp;</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">That due to the fake commitments of the company I failed to open my office on time i.e. first week of January 2019 due to that I am bearing irreparable loss of my profession.</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">That the compensation of Rs 2,00000/- for my loss which I bared due to the fault of company.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">That I am seeking 24% interest on the amount of Rs 1175625/- which I have fully paid till the handing over of the possession.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">That I am seeking the litigation charges of Rs 50,000/-</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Any other order or direction which this Hon’ble court may deem fit and proper under the peculiar facts and circumstances of the present case.</li>\r\n</ol>',1175625.00,1175625.00,'2019-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ol>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">That kindly direct the company not to go beyond the agreement and immediately handover the possession of my office to me without charging the maintenance fee.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">That I am seeking 24% interest on the amount of Rs 1175625/- which I have fully paid till the handing over of the possession.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Any other order or direction which this Hon’ble court may deem fit and proper under the peculiar facts and circumstances of the present case.</li>\r\n</ol>','1','','2018-01-23 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Chandigarh Citi Centere,Soho 330 Block B, Third floor,Vip Road,Zirakpur,Punjab,140603','','',1,1,0,0,'Nitesh1334','2019-02-26 18:23:40.000','Nitesh1334','2019-02-26 18:23:40.000'),(1116,1338,'1338',1416,'da091fa1-bfc1-4e6e-b814-69ed2e771dc6','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','JAGDEEP SINGH','bhupinderb06@gmail.com',7589186556,0,0,'PUNJAB  POLICE HQ, #1111, SECTOR 70, NEAR GURU THE NAHADUR COMPLEX, MOHALI-160062','',28,507,'160062','1','3060, SECTOR 20D','',6,128,'160020','Bhupinder Banga','bhupinderb06@gmail.com',9814297086,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0047','EMERGING HEIGHTS-111\r\nM/S EMERGING INDIA HOUSING CORPORATION PVT LTD','M/S EMERGING INDIA HOUSING CORPORATION PVT LTD THROUGH DIRECTOR','info@emerinindia.in',9872700016,0,'SCO-46-47, FIRST FLOOR','SECTOR 9-D, MADHYA MARG, CHANDIGARH',6,128,'160009','1','SCO-46-47, FIRST FLOOR','SECTOR 9-D, MADHYA MARG, CHANDIGARH',6,128,'160009','1','<p>That the applicant has entered into an agreement with the present respondent.  The respondent has given the assurance that he is developing the project namely Emerging Heights 3 situated at Sector 115, Kharar, Landran Road Mohali, and an allotment letter has been issued by the said respondent, copy of the allotment letter is annexed as Annexure A-1.  \r\n</p><p>That as per the allotment letter the basic sale price of the flat is Rs.34 lacs and the net sale price is Rs.31 lac and including the club membership and preferential location charges the applicant has to pay a total sum of Rs.34 lacs.  That the applicant has booked the flat on dated 4 of May, 2010 and the respondent has issued a letter dated 10th of May, 2016 of flat no. H403 Cat B, Block 4, Tower H, 2BHK in the emerging heights 3.   Copy of the same is annexed as Annexure A-2.  \r\n</p><p>That on 10th of May the applicant has paid initially amount of Rs.6,20,000/-.  That on the asking of the present respondent loan of Rs.24,90,000/- has been sanctioned by the indiabulls, copy of the sanction letter is annexed as Annexure A-3. \r\n</p><p>That the applicant is regularly paying the EMIs of loan amount of the above said flat.  Copy of certificate issued by bank dated 26.07.2018 for the period of 01.04.2017 to 31.03.2018 of the loan account is annexed as Annexure A-4. \r\n</p><p>That as per the assurance of the respondent the possession of the flat has to be delivered within one year that is till mid of 2017, but the construction is not completed within time and the applicant approached the respondent to deliver the possession or to refund the amount with the interest on the various requests of the applicant the respondent entered into an agreement dated 10.11.2017. Copy of the same is annexed as Annexure A-5. \r\n</p><p><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">As per the agreement the amount\r\nof Rs.18,38,000/- which is deposited by the applicant is agreed to return\r\nwithin three instalments by dated 31/03/2018, 30/06/2018, 30/09/2018 and the\r\nrespondent has also issued a check of Punjab National Bank having no. 157037 of\r\nRs.2,00,000/-.&nbsp; But the same has been\r\nreturned due to wrong name of applicant has been written the same can be\r\nproduced in the court also, if require&nbsp; </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">That the respondent is now\r\ndelaying to return despite settlement intentionally.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Prayer:-</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">It is therefore respectfully\r\nprayed that respondent are directed to returned the settled amount of\r\nRs.18,38,000/- along with 12 per cent interest, in the interest of justice.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">And </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Any other order which this&nbsp; Court deems fit may also be granted to the applicant as per provisions of RERA ACT.</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br></p>',3100000.00,3100000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Prayer:-</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">1. It is therefore respectfully prayed that respondent may be directed to returned the settled amount of Rs.18,38,000/- along with interest as per provisions of Rera to the applicant and the remaining loan amount to the bank, in the interest of justice.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">2. compensation on account of mental agony, harassment, deficiency of services, litigation cost, unwanted site visits amounting to Rs. 500000/-</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">And</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">If any other order which this Court deems fit may also be granted to the applicant as per provisions of RERA ACT.</p>','0','','2016-06-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','H-403, CAT-B, TOWER -H (4TH FLOOR) Emerging Heights 3 situated at Sector 115, Kharar, Landran Road, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'vikasgchd','2019-02-26 19:21:16.000','vikasgchd','2019-02-26 19:21:16.000'),(1117,1338,'1338',1416,'da091fa1-bfc1-4e6e-b814-69ed2e771dc6','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','JAGDEEP SINGH','bhupinderb06@gmail.com',7589186556,0,0,'PUNJAB  POLICE HQ, #1111, SECTOR 70, NEAR GURU THE NAHADUR COMPLEX, MOHALI-160062','',28,507,'160062','1','3060, SECTOR 20D','',6,128,'160020','Bhupinder Banga','bhupinderb06@gmail.com',9814297086,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0047','EMERGING HEIGHTS-111\r\nM/S EMERGING INDIA HOUSING CORPORATION PVT LTD','M/S EMERGING INDIA HOUSING CORPORATION PVT LTD THROUGH DIRECTOR','info@emerinindia.in',9872700016,0,'SCO-46-47, FIRST FLOOR','SECTOR 9-D, MADHYA MARG, CHANDIGARH',6,128,'160009','1','SCO-46-47, FIRST FLOOR','SECTOR 9-D, MADHYA MARG, CHANDIGARH',6,128,'160009','1','<p>That the applic