h Sub-Registrar, Derabassi. Thereafter the said\r\npromotor and husband of the complainant executed a sale deed iin favour of the\r\ncomplainant which is duly registered with &nbsp;Sub Registrar, Dera bassi vide\r\nwasika no. 667 dated 16.05.2017. Thereafter, complainant gave an application to\r\nthe Tehsildar, Derabassi to execute intkal of said plot in the name of the\r\ncomplainant. The Tehsildar marked the said application to Area Patwari who in\r\nits report dated 22.03.2018 reported that the said land has already been sold\r\nand its intkal cannot be executed in favour of the complainant. In this way\r\nsaid promoter has done fraud with the complainant and her husband.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4.7pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:6.5pt;font-family:&quot;roboto&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The said plot was purchased by the complainant and her husband\r\nfor their residential purpose as they are not having any residential property\r\nin their name anywhere in India. So the intkal of said plot should be done in\r\nthe name of the complainant and its possession should be provided to the\r\ncomplainant. &nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></o:p></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:6.5pt;font-family:&quot;roboto&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The authorities should be directed to not to transfer the said\r\nplot in name of anyone.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'nisha.6242','2019-02-27 08:55:47.000','nisha.6242','2019-02-27 08:55:47.000'),(1119,1088,'1088',1150,'8cb19109-707e-431d-b61f-37ad95d22359','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-29 15:27:07.000','Nisha Nisha','cscderabassi@gmail.com',9888306242,0,0,'341','Phase-2 Ramdarbar',28,507,'160014','1','341','Phase-2 Ramdarbar',28,507,'160014','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PM0055','SAINI DEVELOPERS & PROMOTERS (P) LTD','PHOOL SING SAINI','sainidevelopers2004@gmail.com',0,0,'BALTANA','MC ZRAKKPUR',28,507,'140603','1','BALTANA','MC ZRAKKPUR',28,507,'140603','1','<p>I HAD PURCHASED TWO PLOT NUMBERED 41 - 115 SQ YDS AND 37 - 110 SQ. YARDS IN BALAJI ENCLAVE&nbsp; KOLI MAJRA, LALRU, TEHSIL DERA BASSI, DISTT S A S NAGAR, PUNJAB AGAINST THE DEED NO. 667 AND 668 OF 16/05/2017, THE AREA WAS UNDER DEVELOPING</p><p><br></p><p>TILL DATE NO POSSESSION HAS BEEN GIVEN BY THEM.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>','<p>CASE HAS BEEN REGSITERED AGASNT TIHME AND MY MONEY WITH INTEREST WILL BE RETURN BACK TO ME.</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>CASE HAS BEEN REGSITERED AGASNT TIHME AND MY MONEY WITH INTEREST WILL BE RETURN BACK TO ME.<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'nisha.6242','2019-02-27 09:13:57.000','nisha.6242','2019-02-27 09:13:57.000'),(1120,1088,'1088',1150,'8cb19109-707e-431d-b61f-37ad95d22359','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-29 15:27:07.000','Nisha','cscderabassi@gmail.com',9888306242,0,0,'341','Phase-2 Ramdarbar',28,507,'160014','1','341','Phase-2 Ramdarbar',28,507,'160014','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PM0055','Balaji Enclave','Saini Group of Companies','infosgoc@gmail.com',0,0,'SCO 1, Opposite Power House Address Line 2 NH-22, Lalru, Punjab','',28,507,'140105','1','SCO 1, Opposite Power House Address Line 2 NH-22, Lalru, Punjab','',28,507,'140105','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:6.5pt;font-family:&quot;roboto&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The husband of the complaint contacted said promoter for\r\npurchasing a plot in said project. On this said promoter agreed to sell plot\r\nno. 37 in said project to the husband of complainant. On receiving the total\r\nsale price of said plot said promoter executed a power of attorney in the name\r\nof the husband of the complainant authorizing him to sell, mortgage, gift etc.\r\nthe said plot to anyone. Said power of attorney is duly registered with\r\nSub-Registrar, Derabassi. Thereafter the said promotor and husband of the\r\ncomplainant executed a sale deed iin favour of the complainant which is duly\r\nregistered with &nbsp;Sub Registrar, Dera bassi vide wasika no. 667 dated\r\n16.05.2017. Thereafter, complainant gave an application to the Tehsildar,\r\nDerabassi to execute intkal of said plot in the name of the complainant. The\r\nTehsildar marked the said application to Area Patwari who in its report dated\r\n22.03.2018 reported that the said land has already been sold and its intkal\r\ncannot be executed in favour of the complainant. In this way said promoter has\r\ndone fraud with the complainant and her husband.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:6.5pt;font-family:&quot;roboto&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The said plot was purchased by the complainant and her husband\r\nfor their residential purpose as they are not having any residential property\r\nin their name anywhere in India. So the intkal of said plot should be done in\r\nthe name of the complainant and its possession should be provided to the\r\ncomplainant.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:6.5pt;font-family:&quot;roboto&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The authorities should be directed to not to transfer the said\r\nplot in name of anyone.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'nisha.6242','2019-02-27 09:21:28.000','nisha.6242','2019-02-27 09:21:28.000'),(1121,1088,'1088',1150,'8cb19109-707e-431d-b61f-37ad95d22359','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-27 09:23:22.000','Nisha','cscderabassi@gmail.com',9888306242,0,0,'341','Pha