singhadvocate@gmail.com',9915772513,0,0,'H. no. 2515 ','Sector-19C ',6,128,'160019','1','H. no. 2515 ','Sector-19C ',6,128,'160019','Kulwinder Singh','ksvarun513@gmail.com',9872903100,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0152','Wave Estate','M/S Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd.','rera@waveestate.in',7290015352,0,'Opposite Rayan and Silk Mills adjoining Coca- Cola Depot, G.T Road, Chheharta','Amritsar',28,39,'143105','1','Opposite Rayan and Silk Mills adjoining Coca- Cola Depot, G.T Road, Chheharta','Amritsar',28,39,'143105','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\">That\r\nthe complainants booked one flat in Wave garden, Apartment No. 1101, F Fressia,\r\n11th Floor Type -3, Sector 85 &amp;99, Mohali from respondent no-1 for the\r\ntotal consideration is 93,74,837/- &nbsp;for\r\ntheir personal residence on 27.01.2015 .</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\">2. That for the purchase of\r\nabovementioned flat complainants borrowed the amount of Rs. 60,71,163/ loan\r\nfrom the respondent-2 with signing the tripartite agreement on 27.01.2015 among\r\nrespondent-1, 2 and complainants and as per clause 3 of agreement the loan\r\namount borrowed from respondent-2 is under subvention scheme and respondent-1\r\nis liable to pay pre-possession EMI to respondent-2 for 36 month.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:Garamond;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">3. That the possession of flat was to delivered to the\r\ncomplainants within 30 month along with extended period of 6 month from the date\r\nof execution of agreement the maximum period on or before i.e. 26-Jan-2018 but\r\nthe respondent-1 failed to deliver the possession till date even after taking\r\nthe hefty amount from complainant of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nfont-family:Garamond;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nArial;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:\r\nAR-SA\">85,62,767/- and also failed to pay &nbsp;the pre-possession Emi to the respondent-2.</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\">4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That the complainants approached several a times to the\r\nrespondent-1 to hand over the possession of the flat but respondent-1 failed to\r\nhand it over till date, and it is further submitted that project is not in\r\ncondition to hand over to the allottee in the absence of completion/occupation\r\ncertificate.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\">5.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That having no other option the complainants are compelled to\r\napproach respected authority for getting refund their hard earned money along\r\nwith interest as per norms of RERA.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:.25pt;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\nGaramond;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">A&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To\r\nrefund the amount of Rs.<i>85,62,767</i>/-\r\nalong with 18% interest from the date of deposit till the date of actual &nbsp;realization of amount &nbsp;as per RERA Act.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:.25pt;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\nGaramond;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">B.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Litigation expenses of Rs.75,000/</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:.25pt;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\nGaramond;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:.25pt;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\nGaramond;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:.25pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:Garamond;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">Or any other order which this respected authority deems fit in the interest of justice.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',9374837.00,8562767.00,'2018-01-26 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Garamond;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That is request to the respected\r\nauthority to direct the respondent -1 to pay Pre-Emi interest to the respondent-2\r\nwhich has failed to pay by respondent 1 as per clause 3 of tripartite agreement\r\nfrom date of failure to pay &nbsp;Emi till 26\r\nJan 2018.</span><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2015-01-27 00:00:00','Wave Gardens, Apartment No. 1101, F Freesia, 11th Floor, Type 3 BHK, Sector 85 & 89 District S.A.S Nagar, Punjab, Pin -140308','','',1,0,0,0,'advkulwindersingh','2019-02-28 17:23:16.000','advkulwindersingh','2019-02-28 17:23:16.000'),(1125,1342,'1342',1420,'7befc797-fb73-47bf-b82f-055349e65c86','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Kulwinder Singh  Pabla','kulwindersinghadvocate@gmail.com',9915772513,0,0,'H. no. 2515 ','Sector-19C ',6,128,'160019','1','H. no. 2515 ','Sector-19C ',6,128,'160019','Kulwinder Singh','ksvarun513@gmail.com',9872903100,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0152','wave estate','M/S Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd.','rera@waveestate.in',7290015352,0,'Opposite Rayan and Silk Mills adjoining Coca- Cola Depot, G.T Road, Chheharta','Amritsar',28,39,'143105','1','Opposite Rayan and Silk Mills adjoining Coca- Cola Depot, G.T Road, Chheharta','Amritsar',28,39,'143105','1','<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">That\r\nthe complainants booked one flat in Wave garden, Apartment No. 1101, F Fressia,\r\n11th Floor Type -3, Sector 85 &amp;99, Mohali from respondent no-1 for the\r\ntotal consideration is 93,74,837/- &nbsp;for\r\ntheir personal residence on 27.01.2015 .</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\">2. That for the purchase of\r\nabovementioned flat complainants borrowed the amount of Rs. 60,71,163/ loan\r\nfrom the respondent-2 with signing the tripartite agreement on 27.01.2015 among\r\nrespondent-1, 2 and complainants and as per clause 3 of agreement the loan\r\namount borrowed from respondent-2 is under subvention scheme and respondent-1\r\nis liable to pay pre-possession EMI to respondent-2 for 36 month.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:Garamond;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">3. That the possession of flat was to delivered to the\r\ncomplainants within 30 month along with extended period of 6 month from the date\r\nof execution of agreement the maximum period on or before i.e. 26-Jan-2018 but\r\nthe respondent-1 failed to deliver the possession till date even after taking\r\nthe hefty amount from complainant of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nfont-family:Garamond;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nArial;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:\r\nAR-SA\">85,62,767/- and also failed to pay &nbsp;the pre-possession Emi to the respondent-2.</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\">4.&nbsp; &nbsp; That the complainants approached several a times to the\r\nrespondent-1 to hand over the possession of the flat but respondent-1 failed to\r\nhand it over till date, and it is further submitted that project is not in\r\ncondition to hand over to the allottee in the absence of completion/occupation\r\ncertificate.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\">5. That having no other option the\r\ncomplainants are compelled to approach respected authority for getting refund\r\ntheir hard earned money along with interest as per norms of RERA.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:Garamond\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:.25pt;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\nGaramond;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">A&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To\r\nrefund the amount of Rs.<i>85,62,767</i>/-\r\nalong with 18% interest from the date of deposit till the date of actual &nbsp;realization of amount &nbsp;as per RERA Act.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:.25pt;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\nGaramond;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">B.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Litigation expenses of Rs.75,000/</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:.25pt;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\nGaramond;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:.25pt;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\nGaramond;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:.25pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:Garamond;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">Or any other order which this respected authority deems fit in the interest of justice.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',9374837.00,8562767.00,'2018-01-26 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:.25pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:Garamond;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That\r\nis request to the respected authority to direct the respondent -1 to pay\r\nPre-Emi interest to the respondent-2 which has failed to pay by respondent 1 as\r\nper clause 3 of tripartite agreement from date of failure to pay &nbsp;Emi till 26 Jan 2018.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2015-01-27 00:00:00','Wave Gardens, Apartment No. 1101, F Freesia, 11th Floor, Type 3 BHK, Sector 85 & 89 District S.A.S Nagar, Punjab, Pin -140308','','',1,0,0,0,'advkulwindersingh','2019-02-28 18:02:06.000','advkulwindersingh','2019-02-28 18:02:06.