9:52:01.000'),(1130,1343,'1343',1420,'7befc797-fb73-47bf-b82f-055349e65c86','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-02 12:21:04.000','Kulwinder Singh  Pabla','kulwindersinghadvocate@gmail.com',9915772513,0,0,'H. no. 2515 ','Sector-19C ',6,128,'160019','1','H. no. 2515 ','Sector-19C ',6,128,'160019','Kulwinder Singh','ksvarun513@gmail.com',9872903100,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0152','Wave Estate, Block-F','M/S Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd.','rera@waveestate.in',7290015352,0,'Opposite Rayan and Silk Mills adjoining Coca- Cola Depot, G.T Road, Chheharta','Amritsar',28,39,'143105','1','Opposite Rayan and Silk Mills adjoining Coca- Cola Depot, G.T Road, Chheharta','Amritsar',28,39,'143105','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\">That\r\nthe complainants booked one flat in Wave garden, Apartment No. 1101, F Fressia,\r\n11th Floor Type -3, Sector 85 &amp;99, Mohali from respondent no-1 for the\r\ntotal consideration is 93,74,837/- &nbsp;for\r\ntheir personal residence on 27.01.2015 .</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\">2. That for the purchase of\r\nabovementioned flat complainants borrowed the amount of Rs. 60,71,163/ loan\r\nfrom the respondent-2 with signing the tripartite agreement on 27.01.2015 among\r\nrespondent-1, 2 and complainants and as per clause 3 of agreement the loan\r\namount borrowed from respondent-2 is under subvention scheme and respondent-1\r\nis liable to pay pre-possession EMI to respondent-2 for 36 month.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\">3. That the possession of flat\r\nwas to delivered to the complainants within 30 month along with extended period\r\nof 6 month from the date of execution of agreement the maximum period on or\r\nbefore i.e. 26-Jan-2018 but the respondent-1 failed to deliver the possession\r\ntill date even after taking the hefty amount from complainant of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Garamond;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">85,62,767/-\r\nand also failed to pay &nbsp;the\r\npre-possession Emi to the respondent-2.</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\"> &nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\">4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That the complainants approached several a times to the\r\nrespondent-1 to hand over the possession of the flat but respondent-1 failed to\r\nhand it over till date, and it is further submitted that project is not in\r\ncondition to hand over to the allottee in the absence of completion/occupation\r\ncertificate.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\">5. That having no other option the\r\ncomplainants are compelled to approach respected authority for getting refund\r\ntheir hard earned money along with interest as per norms of RERA.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Garamond; font-size: 13.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:.25pt;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\nGaramond;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">A&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To\r\nrefund the amount of Rs.<i>85,62,767</i>/-\r\nalong with 18% interest from the date of deposit till the date of actual &nbsp;realization of amount &nbsp;as per RERA Act.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:.25pt;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\nGaramond;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">B.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Litigation expenses of Rs.75,000/</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:.25pt;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\nGaramond;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:.25pt;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;\r\nline-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\nGaramond;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:.25pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:Garamond;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">Or any other order which this respected authority deems\r\nfit in the interest of justice.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',9374837.00,8562767.00,'2018-01-26 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:.25pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n200%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:Garamond;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That\r\nis request to the respected authority to direct the respondent -1 to pay\r\nPre-Emi interest to the respondent-2 which has failed to pay by respondent 1 as\r\nper clause 3 of tripartite agreement from date of failure to pay &nbsp;Emi till 26 Jan 2018.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','2015-01-27 00:00:00','Wave Gardens, Apartment No. 1101, F Freesia, 11th Floor, Type 3 BHK, Sector 85 & 89 District S.A.S Nagar, Punjab, Pin -140308','','',2,0,0,0,'advkulwindersingh','2019-03-01 12:29:34.000','advkulwindersingh','2019-03-01 12:29:34.000'),(1131,1344,'1344',1420,'7befc797-fb73-47bf-b82f-055349e65c86','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Kulwinder Singh  Pabla','kulwindersinghadvocate@gmail.com',9915772513,0,0,'H. no. 2515 ','Sector-19C ',6,128,'160019','1','H. no. 2515 ','Sector-19C ',6,128,'160019','Kulwinder Singh','ksvarun513@gmail.com',9872903100,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0152','Wave Estate, Block-F','M/S Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd','rera@waveestate.in',7290015352,0,'Opposite Rayan and Silk Mills adjoining Coca- Cola Depot, G.T Road, Chheharta','Amritsar',28,39,'143105','1','Opposite Rayan and Silk Mills adjoining Coca- Cola Depot, G.T Road, Chheharta','Amritsar',28,39,'143105','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\">That\r\nthe complainants booked one flat in Wave garden, Apartment No. 1101, F Fressia,\r\n11th Floor Type -3, Sector 85 &amp;99, Mohali from respondent no-1 for the\r\ntotal consideration is 93,74,837/- &nbsp;for\r\ntheir personal residence on 27.01.2015 .<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Garamond\">2. That for the purchase of\r\nabovementioned flat complainants borrowed the amount of Rs. 60,71,163/ loan\r\nfrom the respondent-2 with signing the tripartite agreement on 27.01.2015 among\r\nrespondent-1, 2 and complainants and as per clause 3 of agreemen