ormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">That since the respondent has failed to hand\r\nover the possession of the plot in the stipulated time period i.e 31.03.2015\r\nand further even till date, possession has not been delivered to the\r\nComplainant, as such the complainant is entitled to return of amount and\r\ncompensation.</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.9pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">In view of the above,&nbsp;It is therefore, most\r\nrespectfully&nbsp;</span><a href=\"prayed:-\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">prayed</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">:-</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.9pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">To&nbsp;refund the whole\r\namount paid by complainant&nbsp;i.e. Rs. 26,25,000/- alongwith interest @ 18 %\r\nw.e.f. the date of deposit with the opposite party till the same is paid to the\r\ncomplainant.</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.9pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">To pay an amount of Rs.\r\n2,50,000/- on account of monetary losses, mental as well as physical harassment\r\nto the complainant.</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.9pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">To pay Rs. 1,00,000/-\r\ntowards the litigation charges and counsel fees.</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Any other relief which this\r\nHon’ble Commission deems fit and appropriate in facts and circumstances of the\r\npresent case.<br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span></p>',4625000.00,2312500.00,'2015-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 14.5667px; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 14.5667px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Any interim relief which this Hon’ble Commission deems fit and appropriate in facts and circumstances of the present case.</span><br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','NOT GIVEN.','','',1,1,0,0,'princegoyal2840','2019-03-04 00:16:39.000','princegoyal2840','2019-03-04 00:16:39.000'),(1150,1217,'1217',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-26 15:27:59.000','Kirandeep Kaur','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9815143759,0,0,'HOUSE NO. 38','PHASE IX',28,507,'160062','1','HOUSE NO.253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM GARDEN','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p>Plot measuring 500 sq yards@18500 per sq yard was booked by complainant in&nbsp; Palm Garden being developed by the respondent vide application C-1 dated 18.12.11 &amp; booking amount of Rs. 2775000 i.e. 30% of sale consideration was paid. Before purchasing the said plot, respondent had assured the complainant that it is having all the approvals for the development of project except layout plan approval which will be approved within 30 days &amp; possession be delivered within 2 years &amp; buyer’s agreement will executed within 3 months.It was assured that next installment would be demanded at the time of starting of development.But inspite of repeated requests by the complainant,the respondent has failed to issue any allotment letter &amp; execute buyer’s agreement within the said period and even till date.Many times complainant visited the office of respondent for getting the allotment letter &amp; buyer agreement but to no avail.There was no development on the site &amp; the respondent kept the complainant in dark about the approvals.A legal notice (C-2)dated 30.8.18 was sent to respondent for refund,in which sequence of events have been duly incorporated,which may kindly be treated as part of pleadings.After that complainant received a call from respondent who invited him to its office for redressal of his grievances.Accordingly, complainant along with their family friend Mrs Suparna Randhawa who also received the similar call,went there in 3rd week of October, 2018,where the respondent assured that allotment letter would be duly issued &amp; buyer’s agreement would also be executed if the complainant further deposit a sum of Rs. 1850000 i.e20% sale consideration.But the complainant asked the respondent to first issue the allotment letter &amp; execute the agreement.Respondent refused to issue the same without getting any further amount.Complainant has been harassed for so many years due to unfair trade practices on the part of respondent.A list of dates of approvals &amp; copy of approvals as C-3 &amp; C</p>','<ol><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ndirect the respondent to issue allotment letter in respect of 500 sq yard plot\r\nand execute the buyer’s agreement in compliance with Section 13 of RERA.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\nhand over the actual physical possession of the plot after issuing the\r\nallotment letter and execution of buyer’s agreement. The complainant is ready\r\nto pay the balance sale consideration. The respondent was not having any\r\nauthority to collect the money from general public before 25.1.2017. <o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ndirect the respondent not to charge any other charges from the complainant\r\nexcept EDC and PLC (if any) since the plot was sold to the complainant @Rs18500/-\r\nper sq yards excluding EDC and PLC (if any).<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ndirect the respondent to pay interest at the rate as contemplated under Rule 16\r\nof Punjab RERA Rules, for the period of delay in delivering the possession to\r\nbe calculated from the committed date of possession i.e. 18.12.2013 till the\r\ndate of handing over the actual physical possession after obtaining the\r\ncompletion certificate. <o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ntake action against the respondent under Section 61 of RERA for not complying\r\nthe provision of Section 13 which makes it mandatory for a promoter to execute\r\nthe buyer agreement on receiving 10% of sale consideration. Inspite of repeated\r\nrequest the respondent has not offered the buyer’s agreement even after getting itself registered under RERA rather it is\r\ndemanding more money for executing the same which is a clear violation of\r\nSection 13. The respondent was not even having any approval, rather it had not\r\neven applied the necessary permissions when the plot was sold to the\r\ncomplainant. The respondent got the exemption under Section 44 of PAPRA on\r\n25.1.2017. Before the said date it could not collect any money from general\r\npublic. In the present case the respondent collected the money form the\r\ncomplainant in 2011-12.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">To\r\ntake action against the respondent for collecting the money from the\r\ncomplainant before getting all the approvals and for indulging into unfair\r\ntrade practices<o:p></o:p></span></li></ol>',9250000.00,2775000.00,'2013-12-18 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ol><li style=\"margin-left: 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to issue the allotment letter to the\r\ncomplainant and execute the buyer’s agreement in respect of 500 sq yards plot\r\nbooked by the complainant.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to provide the list of allottees to whom\r\nit has allotted/sold the 862 residential plots as per the layout plan approved\r\nby GMADA on 6.10.2015 and for which it is duly registered under RERA.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;The respondent be directed\r\nto provide the details in respect of funds collected from the general public\r\nsince 2010 in lieu of 862 residential plots which are part of approved layout\r\nand registered under Section 3 of RERA and also, the detail where such amount\r\nhas been utilized by the respondent. Also, the respondent be directed to\r\nprovide all the bank details where such amount has been deposited along with\r\nthe statement of accounts, since the year 2010 and where such amount has been\r\nutilized.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 7pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be\r\ndirected to provide the details in respect of number of bookings done by it\r\nsince the year 2010 for the said 862 residential plots along with the list of\r\napplicants who had applied for booking of plots.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to provide the details as regards the\r\ncriteria adopted by it for allotting the plot numbers to different applicants\r\nthrough pick and choose policy.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to provide the list of total applicants\r\nand further, the list to whom it has already allotted the plot along with the list\r\nof applicants to whom it has not allotted the plots till date. </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be directed to provide the list of hypothecated\r\nplots which are hypothecated to GMADA, out of the approved 862 residential\r\nplots and 73 commercial plots. Also, the respondent be directed to provide the\r\nlist of hypothected plots sold to general public.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n0in;margin-left:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n0in;margin-left:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:200%;\r\nmso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2019-03-04 14:07:54.000','rerafilingformm','2019-03-04 14:07:54.000'),(1151,1217,'1217',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-26 15:27:59.000','Kirandeep Kaur','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9815143759,0,0,'HOUSE NO. 38','PHASE IX',28,507,'160062','1','HOUSE NO.253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM GARDEN','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p>Plot measuring 500 sq yards@18500 per sq yard was booked by complainant in&nbsp; Palm Garden being developed by the respondent vide application C-1 dated 18.12.11 &amp; booking amount of Rs. 2775000 i.e. 30% of sale consideration was paid. Before purchasing the said plot, respondent had assured the complainant that it is having all the approvals for the development of project except layout plan approval which will be approved within 30 days &amp; possession be delivered within 2 years &amp; buyer’s agreement will executed within 3 months.It was assured that next installment would be demanded at the time of starting of development.But inspite of repeated requests by the complainant,the respondent has failed to issue any allotment letter &amp; execute buyer’s agreement within the said period &amp; even till date.Many times complainant visited the office of respondent for getting the allotment letter &amp; buyer agreement but to no avail.There was no development on the site &amp; the respondent kept the complainant in dark about the approvals.A legal notice (C-2)dated 30.8.18 was sent to respondent for refund,in which sequence of events have been duly incorporated,which may kindly be treated as part of