-42','Sector 82 JLPL',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39-42','Sector 82 JLPL',28,507,'140306','1','<p>The complainants agreed to purchase the Apartment No. E-1402, Facing Green in Wing “E” at 14th Floor in (Super Mega) Falcon View, Phase-1, Sector 66-A, Mohali for an amount of Rs. 96,92,942/-. Annexure C-1 Allotment letter \r\n</p><p>After the authorized representatives of the respondent builder committed that they will complete and handover the apartment within 18 months and there is also possibility that they will hand over prior to the committed date.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>And thereafter the complainants paid the booking amount of Rs. 11,00,000/- to the respondent on 23.06.2015 vide receipt no. 3055. The copy of the receipt dated 23.06.2015 is appended herewith as Annexure C-2. \r\n</p><p>The complainants chose the Down Payment Plan . The payment plan is reproduced here as under for the kind perusal of this Hon’ble Court:\r\n</p><p>S. No.	Due Dates	Payment\r\n</p><p>1	17.08.2015	Rs. 81,17,540/- (BSP) + Rs. 2,00,000/- (Car Parking Charges) + applicable service tax on date\r\n</p><p>2.	On the delivery of possession	Rs. 5,19,140/- (Balance 5% BSP) + Rs. 1,50,650/- (IFMS) + Rs. 1,80,780/- (Club Charges) + 45,195/- (Power backup) + applicable service tax on date\r\n</p><p>&nbsp;G. Total	Rs. 86,36,680/- (Basic) + Rs. 5,76,625/- (Other Charges) + along with applicable service tax on date\r\n</p><p>\r\nThat it is the admitted fact that the complainants had made the payment of Rs. 86,86,477/- BSP along with all the applicable taxes on 27.08.2015. The copy of the receipts dated 27.08.2015 is appended herewith as Annexure C-3.&nbsp;</p><p>That it is submitted that as per the clause 2.24 of the allotment letter, the respondent was to deliver the possession of the apartment within 18 months from the date of issue of allotment letter i.e. on or before 22.12.2016. \r\n</p><p>The contentions of the complainant is that despite having paid 95% of the BSP and additional Rs 2000,00 as car parking charges along with the applicable service charges i.e Total of Rs 97,86,477 well within time, He has still not been offered possession of the flat which was to be completed by 23.12.2016</p>','<ul><li>To direct the respondent to handover the actual physical possession of the said apartment complete in all aspects, after obtaining the occupancy certificate.</li><li>To direct the respondent to pay interest for the delayed period to be calculated w.e.f 22.12.2016 upto the date handing over the actual physical possession after obtaining the occupancy certificate</li><li>To direct the respondent to pay litigation charges to the tune of Rs. 50000/-</li><li>The complainants reserve the right to file separate application for claiming compensation for the harassment both physical &amp; mental, due to non delivery of possession within time and for causing unreasonable delay</li></ul>',10268967.00,9786477.00,'2016-12-22 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ul><li>To direct the respondent to complete the development&nbsp; &nbsp;of project and construction of the apartment and deliver the possession of it along with all the facilities.</li></ul>','1','','2018-06-23 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','1402 E Wing Falcon View\r\nSector 66-A Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2019-03-08 20:37:08.000','rerafilingformm','2019-03-08 20:37:08.000'),(1179,1353,'1353',1426,'c52fa8fb-ca9e-4d5d-9572-49b22b4f0748','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-11 07:33:54.000','Puneet Bedi','adv.amansingla@yahoo.com',9915344358,0,0,'House No. 224','Sector 2',13,15,'134109','1','House No. 224','Sector 2',13,15,'134109','Aman Singla','adv.amansingla@yahoo.com',9915344358,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-PTL65-PM0108','Parsavnath king Citi','Parsavnath Developer Limited','mail@parsavnath.com',9560110741,0,'Parsvnath Tower, ','Near Shahdara Metro Station, Shahdara, Delhi ',10,436,'110032','1','Parsvnath Tower, ','Near Shahdara Metro Station, Shahdara, Delhi ',10,436,'110032','1','<p>1. One plot for a sale price of Rs. 21,27,102.50/- purchased from respondent no.1. As per the Plot Buyer Agreement dated 2.4.2007 the maintenance and upkeep of common areas and facilities will only be done by respondent no.1 or by nominee of respondent no.1 till the same is handed over to authority/local body. Respondent no.1 nominated and assigned the maintenance work of common areas and facilities to respondent no.2 and got executed an agreement regarding this on 8.4.2008.</p><p>2. Conveyance Deed executed 1.8.2008 in it is wrongly mentioned that physical, peaceful and vacant possession of the plot has been handed over to complainants. Physical and vacant possession of plot is not handed over to the complainants as no demarcation of plot in project done and complainants have no knowledge about whereabouts of their plot.</p><p>3. Respondent no.1 was liable to maintain the project itself and pay for all the outgoings till transferring possession of plots to allottee/allottees after proper demarcation. Respondent no.1 has transferred his liability of maintaining the project upon respondent no.2 so now respondent no. 2 shall also be treated as promoter of the project as per law.</p><p>4. The maintenance agreement was executed for 5 years which has expired in the year 2013 and thereafter the maintenance agreement has not been renewed till date.</p><p>5. The project has been stalled since long and no construction and maintenance work has been done on the project since long. Essential services and basic necessities which are essential for human habitat is not provided in the project. Respondents haven\'t spent a single penny on development, maintenance and upkeep of the project till date and the project bears a deserted look. No periphery wall of the project has been erected till date.</p><p>6. Respondent No.2 raising illegal demand for maintenance of project as complainants have not received physical possession and the agreement has expired.<br></p>','<p>In view of the facts mentioned in paragraph 4 above, the complainant prays for the following relief(s):</p><p><br></p><p>(a)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Stay of illegal demand notices for maintenance and upkeep charges by respondent no. 2;</p><p>(b)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Respondent No. 1 and Respondent No. 2 be restrained from charging maintenance and upkeep charges from the complainants till the completion of project, completion and occupancy certificate is provided to complainants, demarcation of plots are done in the project and physical and vacant possession of plot no. 549 is handed over to complainants;</p><p>(c)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Respondents be directed to provide Sold and Unsold inventories to the complainants;</p><p>(d)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Respondents be directed to provide Internal Development work which is Annexure II of Plot Buyer Agreement dated 02.04.2007 to the complainants;</p><p>(e)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Respondents be directed to provide Initial Layout Plans of the Project which is Annexure IV of Plot Buyer Agreement dated 02.04.2007 to the complainants;</p><p>(f)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Respondents be directed to place on record Initial Prospectus/Brochure/ Launching Advertisement;</p><p>(g)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Litigation costs of Rs. 51,000/-.</p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Pending final decision on the complaint the complainant seeks issue of the following interim order:</p><p>(a)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Interim Stay of illegal demand notices for maintenance and upkeep charges by respondent no. 2.</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'Amansingla','2019-03-08 22:56:27.000','Amansingla','2019-03-08 22:56:27.000'),(1180,1351,'1351',1301,'99fdf70d-599f-4e41-a773-1804cee1ff27','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-09 12:37:07.000','Ravjot Singh  Gill','gillravjot@yahoo.com',8373900100,1122518435,0,'407 GAGAN VIHAR','',10,189,'110051','1','407 GAGAN VIHAR','',10,189,'110051','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0060','Ireo Waterfront Pvt. Ltd.','MADHUKAR TULSI','iwpl@ireo.in',9810237279,0,'SCO 6-8, Sector 9-D','1st & 2nd Floor, Madhya Marg',6,128,'160009','0','C-14, 1ST FLOOR','Malviya Nagar',10,557,'110017','1','<p>It is submitted that we had booked an independent floor with the above stated company in their project</p><p>Ireo Waterfront situated at Ludhiana. The application for allotment was submitted on 18/02/2013 for Unit</p><p>no. X006A for Ground Floor having super area 1532 square foot in a plot size of 236.80 sq yard having</p><p>proportional rights in the said plot. The agreement was executed on 07/10/2013 for this unit. The basic</p><p>price of unit as per agreement is Rs.58,23,722/-. In these years we have visited the site office of the</p><p>company regarding completion of the unit but every time we find a new representative from the company</p><p>side with some false promises of early delivery. Clause no 12.3 of agreement states that normal period of</p><p>delivery is 24 months from the date of execution of agreement. The company had also asked for a grace</p><p>period of 180 days for delay in delivery. But it has been more than five years from date of execution of</p><p>agreement, but no possession has been offered despite major percentage of payment as demanded by</p><p>the company has been paid. Also, please refer to clause 12.5 of agreement which states that in event of</p><p>delay by company in submitting notice of completion beyond 12 months from the end of grace period then</p><p>the allottee shall become entitled to opt for termination. We have made all the payments diligently as and</p><p>when advised by the company. Till date an amount of Rs 50,68,232/- has been paid (basic + tax) by us to</p><p>the company as per their demand letters received by us but there is no sign of completion and delivery of</p><p>the above said unit. We had purchased this unit for our son who was to start his career. All our hopes</p><p>have been dashed and we had to invest in making additional construction at our parental house to create</p><p>an accommodation for him. You are humbly requested to get our unit cancelled and our money along with</p><p>market rate of interest and a suitable amount of compensation be returned to us.</p>','<p>You are humbly requested to get our unit cancelled and our money along with market rate of interest and a suitable amount of compensation be returned to us.</p>',5823722.00,5068232.00,'2015-10-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>You are humbly requested to get our unit cancelled and our money along with market rate of interest and a suitable amount of compensation be returned to us.<br></p>','1','','2013-10-07 00:00:00','2013-10-07 00:00:00','X006 A','','',1,1,0,0,'gillravjot','2019-03-09 11:04:33.000','gillravjot','2019-03-09 11:04:33.000'),(1181,1354,'1354',1430,'361911d5-4ee4-45f1-9ab2-5933e432eae4','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Anupam Garg','sandeepkhunger@gmail.com',9814011446,0,0,'C-42, Uppal Marble Arch, Manimajra, Chandigarh','',6,128,'160101','1','Sandeep Khunger','H.No. 2201, Sector 38-C, Chandigarh',6,128,'160036','Sandeep Khunger, Advocate','sandeepkhunger@gmail.com',9814011446,1722691011,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0007','ATS GOLF MEADOWS, DERA BASSI, DISTRICT SAS NAGAR','M/s ATS Private Limited','email@atsgreens.com',8591358504,0,'ATS Golf Meadow, Derabassi, NH-22, ','',28,507,'140507','1','ATS Golf Meadow, Derabassi, NH-22, ','',28,507,'140507','1','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:9.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->That the complainant applied for allotment of\r\nflat vide Reg. no: ATS Golf Meadows Lifestyle/234/A/2012 by paying the booking\r\namount of Rs. 1358037.</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:9.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->That the complainants received allotment letter\r\ndated 20.01.2014 from the respondents informing that the complainants have been\r\nallotted Type “A” flat on 11<sup>th</sup> floor in Tower No. 4 bearing No. 4113\r\nin “ATS Golf Meadows Lifestyle” situated at Village Madhopur, Tehsil-Derabassi,\r\nDistt. Mohali, Punjab. <b>(Annexure C-1)</b>\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:9.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->That the buyers agreement was executed on 20.01.2014\r\nand allotted an apartment bearing number 4113 on 11<sup>th</sup> floor in tower\r\nno 4 having a super area of approx. 2950 sq.ft. (274.06 sq.mt.) along with 1\r\n(Nos.) of car parking earmarked in the basement area to be identified and\r\nallotted by the company at the time of possession of the apartment. That the\r\ntotal cost including the booking amount of said flat was Rs.85,21,500 as per\r\nthe Annexure-II enclosed with the buyers agreement <b>(Annexure C-2)<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:9.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->That the complainants as per the accounts ledger\r\nand the receipts had already paid Rs. 84,80,664/- by availing the Home loan of\r\nRs. 42,00,000/- from DHFC Ltd <b>(Annexure&nbsp; C-3)<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:9.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:13.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%\">That as per Clause No.14 of the buyers agreement (20.01.2014)\r\nthe possession of the flat was to be handed over within 36 months with grace\r\nperiod of 6 months from the date of execution of buyers agreement i.e. 20.07.2017.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:9.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:13.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%\">That the undertaken date of possession of the flat has passed\r\nwithout any letter/ correspondence informing the complainants of any force\r\nmajeure conditions or any reasonable explanation qua delay as contemplated\r\nunder Clause 14 of the agreement therefore the respondents are now barred under\r\nlaw from claiming the same as they have waived their such right remaining\r\nsilent qua the same. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:9.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">That the respondents have not offered the\r\npossession of the flat till date and there is no development at the site.&nbsp;</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:45.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-indent:-.5in;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:13.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;\">i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:13.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%\">To direct the respondents to refund an amount of Rs.</span>84,80,664/-\r\n<span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:13.0pt;line-height:150%\">deposited by the\r\ncomplainants alongwith interest as per the provisions of the RERA Act.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',8521500.00,8480664.00,'2017-07-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>No Interim Relief has been prayed for.</p>','1','','2014-01-20 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','4113, 11th Floor, Tower No.4','','',1,0,0,0,'skhunger','2019-03-09 13:09:03.000','skhunger','2019-03-09 13:09:03.000'),(1182,1355,'1355',1430,'361911d5-4ee4-45f1-9ab2-5933e432eae4','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Anupam Garg','sandeepkhunger@gmail.com',9814011446,0,0,'C-42, Uppal Marble Arch, Manimajra, Chandigarh','',6,128,'160101','1','Sandeep Khunger','H.No. 2201, Sector 38-C, Chandigarh',6,128,'160036','Sandeep Khunger, Advocate','sandeepkhunger@gmail.com',9814011446,1722691011,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0007','ATS GOLF MEADOWS','M/s ATS Estate Private Limited','email@atsgreens.com',8591358504,0,'ATS Golf Meadows, ','NH-22, Derabassi',28,507,'140507','1','ATS Golf Meadows, ','NH-22, Derabassi',28,507,'140507','1','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:9.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->That the complainant applied for allotment of\r\nflat vide Reg