tyle=\"mso-bidi-font-size:13.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%\">To direct the respondents to refund an amount of Rs.</span>84,80,664/-\r\n<span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:13.0pt;line-height:150%\">deposited by the\r\ncomplainants alongwith interest as per the provisions of the RERA Act.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',8521500.00,8480664.00,'2017-07-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>No Interim Relief prayed for.</p>','1','','2014-01-20 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','4113, 11th Floor, Tower No.4','','',1,0,0,0,'skhunger','2019-03-09 13:17:57.000','skhunger','2019-03-09 13:17:57.000'),(1183,1356,'1356',1255,'9bb53a1d-6d25-411b-98ab-32c07efb3d65','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-10 16:15:28.000','MAJ. HARAMRIT SINGH DHINGRA','hamdhingra@rediffmail.com',9815541075,0,0,'3745','Sector 46-C',6,128,'160047','1','3745','Sector 46-C',6,128,'160047','Gurditt Singh Saini','advocategssaini@gmail.com',9815973578,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','MANOHAR INFRASTRUCTURE AND CONSTRUCTIONS PRIVATE LTD','TARNINDER SINGH','manohargroupchd@gmail.com',7340941649,0,'SCO 139','SECTOR 17 C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139','SECTOR 17 C',6,128,'160017','1','<p>1.	The Complainant booked a plot measuring 250 Sq.Yds @rate Rs.19000/ per Sq.Yds with the Respondent in Palm Eco city. The Basic sale price of plot was agreed as Rs.4750000/- and 50% of that Basic sale price   Rs.2375000/- was paid by the complainant to the respondent vide 2 Cheques Rs.1500000/- on 23.10.2012 &amp; Rs.875000/- on 6.11.2012.\r\n</p><p>2.	The Complainant was allured by assuring that all necessary permission, approval had been obtained by them from the competent authorities and as such progress of development at the site is in its full swing &amp; that Possession of Plot will be delivered within 2 years &amp; that development charges @5% of basic sale price will be charged extra. Later on it came to the notice of Complainant that respondent was not having CLU permission from the competent authorities, which were obtained around Dec 2014 i.e. after 2 years.\r\n</p><p>3.	The respondent was simultaneously shuffling the customers from one project to another to ensure that his one project at least went ahead with bookings/ appears to be popular/ oversubscribed &amp; in those cases they were clevery taking the signatures of Complainant as well as other customers on performas in that respect, which were prepared by them.On 14.9.2015 another amount of Rs.2062500/- towards Basic Sale Price plus Rs.50000/- as development charges were taken by the respondent. Subsequently Plot No.1189 measuring 228.86 Sq.Yds instead of 250 Sq.Yds was allotted &amp; respondent altered the rate from Rs.19000/- Sq.Yds to Rs.22673/- Sq. Yds. The respondent should have been charged Rs.19000/- Sq. Yds plus 5% as development charges, which comes to Rs.19950/- Sq. Yds &amp; thus Plot measuring 228.86 Sq.Yds would cost around Rs.4565757/-, where as respondent has received a sum of Rs.5012500/-&amp; thus overcharged complainant to the tune of Rs.446743/-\r\n</p><p>4.	The Respondent is forcing Complainant to pay additional amount of Rs.175000/- as 15 years club membership fee, which was never discussed or agreed nor acceptable to the Complainant.</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The\r\ncomplainant has been allured and deceived upon by the Respondent while\r\nshattering their dream of a sweet home within the vicinity of Chandigarh. The\r\ncomplainant seek refund of their amount along with other relief inter alia\r\nbased on following grounds:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:0in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial\">i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The promoter has failed to complete the\r\nproject by the specified date and is unable to give possession of plot in\r\naccordance with the terms.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:0in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial\">ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">That due to acts &amp; misdeeds of\r\nrespondent, Complainant requested to withdraw from the project, but the\r\nrespondent failed to return the amount received by him in respect of that plot i.e.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">\r\nRs.5012500/-</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">, with interest and compensation in the manner as\r\nprovided under this Act.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:0in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial\">iii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The Plot No.1189 measuring 228.86 Sq.Yds\r\ninstead of 250 Sq.Yds was allotted &amp; respondent unilaterally altered the\r\nrate from Rs.19000/- Sq.Yds to Rs.22673/- Sq. Yds. The respondent should have\r\nbeen charged Rs.19000/- Sq. Yds plus 5% as development charges, which comes to\r\nRs.19950/- Sq. Yds &amp; thus Plot measuring 228.86 Sq.Yds would cost around\r\nRs.4565757/-, where as respondent has received a sum of Rs.5012500/-&amp; thus\r\novercharged complainant to the tune of Rs.446743/-. Hence Complainant seeks\r\nrefund of amount of Rs.5012500/- along with interest @ 12% per annum from the\r\ndate of its deposit till realization.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">iii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The complainant is also entitled for </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">50,000/- on account of\r\ndeficiency in service &amp; unfair trade practice on the part of respondent resulting\r\nmonetary loss and for causing physical harassment as well as mental agony to\r\nthe complainant.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">iv)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The complainant is also entitled for sum\r\nof </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Rupee Foradian&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">` </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">25,000/-\r\ntowards the cost of uncalled and unnecessarily litigation and court fee.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">v)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any\r\nother relief which this Hon’ble Forum may deem fit and proper be also granted\r\nto the complainant against the Respondent.</span><br></p>',4565757.00,5012500.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16.6667px; text-align: justify;\">Complainant seeks refund of amount of Rs.5012500/- along with interest @ 12% per annum from the date of its deposit till realization, along with compensation.</span><br></p>','1','','2017-01-13 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','1189, New Chandigarh, District SAS Nagar (Mohali)','','',1,1,0,0,'VakilSaini','2019-03-09 21:40:50.000','VakilSaini','2019-03-09 21:40:50.000'),(1184,1340,'1340',1245,'3f889bdc-3ee0-4229-87d4-71be8592f729','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Prashant Gajanan Pathak','advamitgoyal@hotmail.com',9527700001,0,0,'Flat no. 603, Lotus Tower, Bollywood Heights,','Near sector-20 Panchkula Peer Machalla, Dhakoli, ',28,507,'140603','1','Flat no. 603, Lotus Tower, Bollywood Heights,','Near sector-20 Panchkula Peer Machalla, Dhakoli, ',28,507,'140603','Amit Goyal','advamitgoyal@hotmail.com',9527700001,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','ATS CASA ESPANA','ATS INFRABUILD PVT. LTD','email@atsgreens.com',0,1203811500,'ATS CASA ESPANA ','Village Bad Majra, Sector 121 SAS Nagar',28,507,'140307','1','ATS CASA ESPANA ','Village Bad Majra, Sector 121 SAS Nagar',28,507,'140307','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%\">Complainants relied on\r\nfalse promises &amp; signed </span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Application\r\nfor Allotment </span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">on 10.12.17<b>(C1)</b>. Paid Rs 100,000\r\nas <b>booking amount(C2)</b>. Asked to pay 928,280 as installment. Complainant asked\r\nfor <b>Agreement To Sell</b> &amp; T&amp;C.\r\nThey said formalities could be done later. Installment paid on 02.01.18 <b>(C3).</b>They\r\nasked further payments. Complainant asked for agreement. But no response.\r\nComplainants requested them to execute agreement- they kept prolonging –didn’t\r\neven show agreement- therefore we were unable to raise loan.On 12.02.18\r\ncomplainant called to sign agreement. Advance copy not given. went to their\r\noffice on 17.02.18. shocked on reading agreement as not as per RERA. No exit\r\nclause for allotee. Promoter could leave project mid-way on discretion. Could change\r\nsite plan/dimensions without intimation. No remedy for delay in possession.\r\nLate payments charged at 18%. These terms were unacceptable &amp; asked for\r\nchange. All terms were in their favour. Sanctioned/ layout plan/ stage wise\r\nschedule not given.On 18.02.18 Complainant decided to cancel allotment citing\r\nthese reasons.they requested this will send bad name to project &amp; requested\r\nto cite other reason &amp; they will refund in full. They typed a letter in\r\noffice citing reason as professional- complainant constrained to sign<b>(C4)</b>.They\r\nsaid they will issue cheque in name of Prashant &amp; sought email from Shilpa.\r\nSent<b>(C5).</b> But no refund.Complainant visited them many times for refund.\r\nThey assured full return but did not.No loss to them. When we requested them to\r\ngive booked flat back, they said sold &amp; is no longer available<b>(C6)</b>.Cannot\r\nforfeit whole amount of 1028000. At best respondents can forfeit only part of booking/earnest\r\namount of 100,000.Unilateral agreement- not signed by respondents-hence cannot\r\nbe termed agreement.Written in their application that Receipt of application &amp;\r\nbooking Does not confirm allotment. Meaning, allotment not made till then.Hard earned\r\nmoney of complainants. Respondents cannot be allowed to usurp.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:1.0cm;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-1.0cm;mso-text-indent-alt:-35.45pt;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">The\r\ncomplainant has suffered losses by reason of false and incorrect commitment\r\nmade by the respondents. Thus, the respondents are liable to cancel the booking\r\nof the flat and return the amount of ₹ 10,28,280 along with interest.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Interest as provided under </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">Section\r\n18 and 19(4) of the RERA Act r/w </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Rule 16 of the Regulation and Development Rules\r\n2017 on the above Principal amount from the respective dates it was paid to the\r\nrespondent till the date of payment ie State Bank of India’s (“SBI”) highest\r\nMarginal Cost of Lending Rate (“MCLR”) plus 2%. The current SBI MCLR is 8.50%\r\npa so applicable interest rate for the refund is taken as 10.50% pa.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Compensation\r\nfor Mental harassment to the tune of Rs. 1,00,000/-</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">To\r\nissue direction to pay the cost of litigation ie ₹ 44,000/-.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">To\r\nimpose penalty upon the respondents as per the provisions of Section 60 of RERA\r\nAct for willful default committed by them.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">To\r\nimpose penalty upon the respondents as per the provisions of Section 61 of RERA\r\nAct for contravention of Sec.12, Sec.14, and Sec. 16 of RERA Act.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">To\r\nissue directions to make liable every officer concerned i.e. Director, Manager,\r\nSecretary, or any other officer of the respondent’s company at whose instance,\r\nconnivance, acquiescence, neglect any of the offences has been committed as\r\nmentioned in Sec.69 of RERA Act, 2016 to be read with Punjab RERA Rules, 2017.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">To\r\nrecommend criminal action against the respondents for the criminal offence of\r\ncheating, fraud and criminal breach of trust under section 420, 406 and 409 of\r\nthe Indian Penal Code.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Any\r\nother relief which this Hon’ble Authority deem fit and appropriate in view of\r\nthe facts and circumstances of this complaint.</span></p>',11125760.00,1028000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">No\r\ninterim relief is being sought. The complainants only pray that the promoters\r\nbe directed to return the amount paid with interest.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Apartment 9012 Building no. 9','','',2,0,0,0,'Prashantshilpa','2019-03-11 15:21:56.000','Prashantshilpa','2019-03-11 15:21:56.000'),(1185,1340,'1340',1245,'3f889bdc-3ee0-4229-87d4-71be8592f729','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Prashant Gajanan Pathak','advamitgoyal@hotmail.com',9527700001,0,0,'Flat no. 603, Lotus Tower, Bollywood Heights,','Near sector-20 Panchkula Peer Machalla, Dhakoli, ',28,507,'140603','1','Flat no. 603, Lotus Tower, Bollywood Heights,','Near sector-20 Panchkula Peer Machalla, Dhakoli, ',28,507,'140603','Amit Goyal','advamitgoyal@hotmail.com',9527700001,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','ATS CASA ESPANA','ATS INFRABUILD PVT. LTD','email@atsgreens.com',0,1203811500,'ATS CASA ESPANA ','Village Bad Majra, Sector 121 SAS Nagar',28,507,'140307','1','ATS CASA ESPANA ','Village Bad Majra, Sector 121 SAS Nagar',28,507,'140307','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%\">Complainants relied on\r\nfalse promises &amp; signed </span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Application\r\nfor Allotment </span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">on 10.12.17<b>(C1)</b>. Paid Rs 100,000\r\nas <b>booking amount(C2)</b>. Asked to pay 928,280 as installment. Complainant asked\r\nfor <b>Agreement To Sell</b> &amp; T&amp;C.\r\nThey said formalities could be done later. Installment paid on 02.01.18 <b>(C3).</b>They\r\nasked further payments. Complainant asked for agreement. But no response.\r\nComplainants requested them to execute agreement- they kept prolonging –didn’t\r\neven show agreement- therefore we were unable to raise loan.On 12.02.18\r\ncomplainant called to sign agreement. Advance copy not given. went to their\r\noffice on 17.02.18. shocked on reading agreement as not as per RERA. No exit\r\nclause for allotee. Promoter could leave project mid-way on discretion. Could change\r\nsite plan/dimensions without intimation. No remedy for delay in possession.\r\nLate payments charged at 18%. These terms were unacceptable &amp; asked for\r\nchange. All terms were in their favour. Sanctioned/ layout plan/ stage wise\r\nschedule not given.On 18.02.18 Complainant decided to cancel allotment citing\r\nthese reasons.they requested this will send bad name to project &amp; requested\r\nto cite other reason &amp; they will refund in full. They typed a letter in\r\noffice citing reason as professional- complainant constrained to sign<b>(C4)</b>.They\r\nsaid they will issue cheque in name of Prashant &amp; sought email from Shilpa.\r\nSent<b>(C5).</b> But no refund.Complainant visited them many times for refund.\r\nThey assured full return but did not.No loss to them. When we requested them to\r\ngive booked flat back, they said sold &amp; is no longer available<b>(C6)</b>.Cannot\r\nforfeit whole amount of 1028000. At best respondents can forfeit only part of booking/earnest\r\namount of 100,000.Unilateral agreement- not signed by respondents-hence cannot\r\nbe termed agreement.Written in their application that Receipt of application &amp;\r\nbooking Does not confirm allotment. Meaning, allotment not made till then.Hard earned\r\nmoney of complainants. Respondents cannot be allowed to usurp.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:1.0cm;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-1.0cm;mso-text-indent-alt:-35.45pt;line-height:\r\n200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">The\r\ncomplainant has suffered losses by reason of false and incorrect commitment\r\nmade by the respondents. Thus, the respondents are liable to cancel the booking\r\nof the flat and return the amount of ₹ 10,28,280 along with interest.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Interest as provided under </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">Section\r\n18 and 19(4) of the RERA Act r/w </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Rule 16 of the Regulation and Development Rules\r\n2017 on the above Principal amount from the respective dates it was paid to the\r\nrespondent till the date of payment ie State Bank of India’s (“SBI”) highest\r\nMarginal Cost of Lending Rate (“MCLR”) plus 2%. The current SBI MCLR is 8.50%\r\npa so applicable interest rate for the refund is taken as 10.50% pa.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Compensation\r\nfor Mental harassment to the tune of Rs. 1,00,000/-</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">To\r\nissue direction to pay the cost of litigation ie ₹ 44,000/-.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">To\r\nimpose penalty upon the respondents as per the provisions of Section 60 of RERA\r\nAct for willful default committed by them.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">To\r\nimpose penalty upon the respondents as per the provisions of Section 61 of RERA\r\nAct for contravention of Sec.12, Sec.14, and Sec. 16 of RERA Act.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">To\r\nissue directions to make liable every officer concerned i.e. Director, Manager,\r\nSecretary, or any other officer of the respondent’s company at whose instance,\r\nconnivance, acquiescence, neglect any of the offences has been committed as\r\nmentioned in Sec.69 of RERA Act, 2016 to be read with Punjab RERA Rules, 2017.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">To\r\nrecommend criminal action against the respondents for the criminal offence of\r\ncheating, fraud and criminal breach of trust under section 420, 406 and 409 of\r\nthe Indian Penal Code.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -1cm; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Any\r\nother relief which this Hon’ble Authority deem fit and appropriate in view of\r\nthe facts and circumstances of this complaint.</span></p>',11125760.00,1028000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">No\r\ninterim relief is being sought. The complainants only pray that the promoters\r\nbe directed to return the amount paid with interest.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Apartment 9012 Building no. 9','','',2,0,0,0,'Prashantshilpa','2019-03-11 15:22:44.000','Prashantshilpa','2019-03-11 15:22:44.000'),(1186,1340,'1340',1245,'3f889bdc-3ee0-4229-87d4-71be8592f729','FormTypeM',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Prashant Gajanan Pathak','advamitgoyal@hotmail.com',9527700001,0,0,'Flat no. 603, Lotus Tower, Bollywood Heights,','Near sector-20 Panchkula Peer Machalla, Dhakoli, ',28,507,'140603','1','Flat no. 603, Lotus Tower, Bollywood Heights,','Near sector-20 Panchkula Peer Machalla, Dhakoli, ',28,507,'140603','Amit Goyal','advamitgoyal@hotmail.com',9527700001,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','ATS CASA ESPANA','ATS INFRABUILD PVT. LTD','email@atsgreens.com',0,1203811500,'ATS CASA ESPANA ','Village Bad Majra, Sector 121 SAS Nagar',28,507,'140307','1','ATS CASA ESPANA ','Village Bad Majra, Sector 121 SAS Nagar',28,507,'140307','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%\">Complainants relied on\r\nfalse promises &amp; signed </span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Application\r\nfor Allotment </span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">on 10.12.17<b>(C1)</b>. Paid Rs 100,000\r\nas <b>booking amount(C2)</b>. Asked to pay 928,280 as installment. Complainant asked\r\nfor <b>Agreement To Sell</b> &amp; T&amp;C.\r\nThey said formalities could be done later. Installment paid on 02.01.18 <b>(C3).</b>They\r\nasked further payments. Complainant asked for agreement. But no response.\r\nComplainants requested them to execute agreement- they kept prolonging –didn’t\r\neven show agreement- therefore we were unable to raise loan.On 12.02.18\r\ncomplainant called to sign agreement. Advance copy not given. went to their\r\noffice on 17.02.18. shocked on reading agreement. Not as per RERA. No exit\r\nclause for allotee. Promoter could leave project mid-way on discretion. Could change\r\nsite plan/dimensions without intimation. No remedy for delay in possession.\r\nLate payments charged at 18%. These terms were unacceptable &amp; asked for\r\nchange. All terms were in their favour. Sanctioned/ layout plan/ stage wise\r\nschedule not given.On 18.02.18 Complainant decided to cancel allotment citing\r\nthese reasons.they requested this will send bad name to project &amp; requested\r\nto cite other reason &amp; they will refund in full. They typed a letter in\r\noffice citing reason as professional- complainant constrained to sign<b>(C4)</b>.They\r\nsaid they will issue cheque in name of Prashant &amp; sought email from Shilpa.\r\nSent<b>(C5).</b> But no refund.Complainant visited them many times for refund.\r\nThey assured full return but did not.No loss to them. When we requested them to\r\ngive booked flat back, they said sold &amp; is no longer available<b>(C6)</b>.Cannot\r\nforfeit whole amount of 1028000. At best respondents can forfeit only part of booking/earnest\r\namount of 100,000.Unilateral agreement- not signed by respondents-hence cannot\r\nbe termed agreement.Written in their application that Receipt of application &amp;\r\nbooking Does not confirm allotment. Meaning, allotment not made till then.Hard earned\r\nmoney of complainants. Respondents cannot be allowed to usurp.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:1.0cm;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-1.0cm;mso-text-indent-alt:-35.45pt;line-hei