alance amount of Rs.6 Crore to applicant, respondent has cheated\r\napplicant with Rs. 2 Crore 99 lakh. Till date plots possession has not been\r\ndelivered and whole land of applicant has been utilized by respondent. Copy of\r\nrepresentation/notice dated 22.12.2018 may kindly be read as facts of the\r\ncase.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Registration granted under section 5 of the Real\r\nEstate (Regulation and Development) Act, to the respondent may kindly be\r\nrevoked&nbsp;under Section 7(1) (d) of this act&nbsp;as the respondent promoter\r\nis indulges in unfair and fraudulent practices&nbsp;by cheating the applicant,\r\nafter preparing many documents and by not providing any clear information to\r\nthe applicant regarding the policy/procedure adopted by the company&nbsp;and\r\nhad created loss to the state exchequer by not paying the legal state\r\ntaxes.&nbsp;Respondent be directed to pay the actual amount of&nbsp;Plot No.\r\nR1-C 212&nbsp; &nbsp;(i.e. Rs. 1.5 Crore) purchased from the applicant along\r\nwith interest, as applicant does not want to take any plot from them. Further\r\ncompensation on account of delaying the payment of the applicant by preparing\r\nfalse documents just to commit fraud with the applicant and the state as per\r\nthe Rules of Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Rules which\r\nprovides State Bank of India highest marginal cost of lending rate plus 2% from\r\nthe respective date of deposit made by the complainants. Further directions may\r\nkindly be issued to the respondents to pay Rs. 10 Lacs to the applicant for\r\nmental and physical harassment and on the account of the deficiency in the\r\nservices and unfair trade practice committed by the respondents.&nbsp;Further\r\ndirections may kindly be issued to the respondents to pay Rs. 1,00,000/- on\r\naccount of litigation charges to the applicant.&nbsp;It is further prayed that\r\nthis Hon\'ble Tribunal may grant any other relief, which it deems fit and\r\nproper, in the facts and circumstances of the present case, in the interest of\r\njustice, equity and fair play.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',15000000.00,15000000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Complainant\r\nis filing this complaint in respect of Plot no. R1-C212 and Complainant is\r\nfiling separate complaints for rest of three plots.&nbsp;As these complaints\r\nare outcome of single transaction between same parties. therefore all the\r\ncomplaints be heard together. </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Bank Accounts of the Respondent may kindly be\r\nfreezed during the pendency of present petition.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Sale\r\nand purchase of Plots/Flats constructed therein the project of the respondent\r\nmay kindly be stopped.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Respondent\r\nmay kindly be directed not to alter in the land or may be stopped from creating\r\nany third party right over the land in dispute.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','1','','2012-05-29 00:00:00','2011-11-21 00:00:00','R1-C/212 DLF HYDE PARK, ESTATE PROJECT, NEW CHANDIGARH','','',1,1,0,0,'AGAM','2019-03-18 18:41:33.000','AGAM','2019-03-18 18:41:33.000'),(1217,1125,'1125',1191,'16dedd0c-2e6f-4eb1-85bb-f16106f43c42','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-19 15:43:08.000','Nitin Jindal','nitin.email2me@gmail.com',8800669083,0,0,'D2 065 DLF NEW TOWN','Westend heights begur',17,67,'560068','1','D2 065 DLF NEW TOWN','Westend heights begur',17,67,'560068','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0084','Sushma Crescent ','BHARAT MITTAL','bharat@sushmabuildtech.com',0,0,'B-107, First Floor',', Business Complex at Elante Mall, Industrial Area - 1 ',6,128,'160002','1','B-107, First Floor',', Business Complex at Elante Mall, Industrial Area - 1 ',6,128,'160002','1','<p>1. Delay in Possession (Section 18): My possession date as per agreement is 31-Mar, 2015 and had paid about 85% of amount till Jul, 2014 (Rs 42,32,843). This year builder had further demand – one in September (for flooring work) and final demand on offer the possession on 11 Dec, 2018 (that too without sharing occupancy certificate).<br></p><p>2. Multiple changes in Specification without information (Under section 19): Rights and Duties of Allottees, Builder had changes the layout and specification without any notification and also not ready to share the details (moreover provided incorrect information that they have not made any changes). One example is the change in location of the swimming pool, now constructed in front of my tower (instead originally not proposed at that location). This is unacceptable.</p><p>3. Not sharing information (Under section 19): Builder is not ready to share the specification details and also partial occupancy certificate. But forcing me to pay the final demand for offer of possession (applies 24% interest penalty). </p><p>4. Not delivered as promised at the time of sale (Section 12 &amp; 14): As the time of sale builder promised to provide covered car parking, but now providing open parking</p>','<p>As per section 18 ,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">in\r\ncase of delay the promoter has to pay the interest (State bank of India highest\r\nmarginal cost of lending rate plus two percent).</span></p>',5053900.00,5006075.00,'2015-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>I have asked for compensation as per form N as well. AsC No 10522018</p>','1','','2011-11-05 00:00:00','2012-03-21 00:00:00','704, Tower F, Sushma Crescent, Sushma square','','',2,0,0,0,'Nitinjindal0505','2019-03-19 11:27:46.000','Nitinjindal0505','2019-03-19 11:27:46.000'),(1218,1125,'1125',1191,'16dedd0c-2e6f-4eb1-85bb-f16106f43c42','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-19 15:43:08.000','Nitin Jindal','nitin.email2me@gmail.com',8800669083,0,0,'D2 065 DLF NEW TOWN','Westend heights begur',17,67,'560068','1','D2 065 DLF NEW TOWN','Westend heights begur',17,67,'560068','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0084','Sushma Crescent ','BHARAT MITTAL','bharat@sushmabuildtech.com',0,0,'B-107, First Floor',', Business Complex at Elante Mall, Industrial Area - 1 ',6,128,'160002','1','B-107, First Floor',', Business Complex at Elante Mall, Industrial Area - 1 ',6,128,'160002','1','<p>1. Delay in Possession (Section 18): My possession date as per agreement is 31-Mar, 2015 and had paid about 85% of amount till Jul, 2014 (Rs 42,32,843). This year builder had further demand – one in September (for flooring work) and final demand on offer the possession on 11 Dec, 2018 (that too without sharing occupancy certificate).<br></p><p>2. Multiple changes in Specification without information (Under section 19): Rights and Duties of Allottees, Builder had changes the layout and specification without any notification and also not ready to share the details (moreover provided incorrect information that they have not made any changes). One example is the change in location of the swimming pool, now constructed in front of my tower (instead originally not proposed at that location). This is unacceptable.</p><p>3. Not sharing information (Under section 19): Builder is not ready to share the specification details and also partial occupancy certificate. But forcing me to pay the final demand for offer of possession (applies 24% interest penalty). </p><p>4. Not delivered as promised at the time of sale (Section 12 &amp; 14): As the time of sale builder promised to provide covered car parking, but now providing open parking</p>','<p>As per section 18 ,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">in\r\ncase of delay the promoter has to pay the interest (State bank of India highest\r\nmarginal cost of lending rate plus two percent).</span></p>',5053900.00,5006075.00,'2015-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>I have asked for compensation as per form N as well. AsC No 10522018</p>','1','','2011-11-05 00:00:00','2012-03-21 00:00:00','704, Tower F, Sushma Crescent, Sushma square','','',2,0,0,0,'Nitinjindal0505','2019-03-19 11:28:55.000','Nitinjindal0505','2019-03-19 11:28:55.000'),(1219,1125,'1125',1191,'16dedd0c-2e6f-4eb1-85bb-f16106f43c42','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-19 11:37:49.000','Nitin Jindal','nitin.email2me@gmail.com',8800669083,0,0,'D2 065 DLF NEW TOWN','Westend heights begur',17,67,'560068','1','D2 065 DLF NEW TOWN','Westend heights begur',17,67,'560068','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0084','Sushma Crescent ','BHARAT MITTAL','bharat@sushmabuildtech.com',0,0,'B-107, First Floor',', Business Complex at Elante Mall, Industrial Area - 1 ',6,128,'160002','1','B-107, First Floor',', Business Complex at Elante Mall, Industrial Area - 1 ',6,128,'160002','1','<p>1. Delay in Possession (Section 18): My possession date as per agreement is 31-Mar, 2015 and had paid about 85% of amount till Jul, 2014 (Rs 42,32,843). This year builder had further demand – one in September (for flooring work) and final demand on offer the possession on 11 Dec, 2018 (that too without sharing occupancy certificate).<br></p><p>2. Multiple changes in Specification without information (Under section 19): Rights and Duties of Allottees, Builder had changes the layout and specification without any notification and also not ready to share the details (moreover provided incorrect information that they have not made any changes). One example is the change in location of the swimming pool, now constructed in front of my tower (instead originally not proposed at that location). This is unacceptable.</p><p>3. Not sharing information (Under section 19): Builder is not ready to share the specification details and also partial occupancy certificate. But forcing me to pay the final demand for offer of possession (applies 24% interest penalty). </p><p>4. Not delivered as promised at the time of sale (Section 12 &amp; 14): As the time of sale builder promised to provide covered car parking, but now providing open parking</p>','<p>As per section 18 ,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">in\r\ncase of delay the promoter has to pay the interest (State bank of India highest\r\nmarginal cost of lending rate plus two percent).</span></p>',5053900.00,5006075.00,'2015-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>I have asked for compensation as per form N as well. AsC No 10522018</p>','1','','2011-11-05 00:00:00','2012-03-21 00:00:00','704, Tower F, Sushma Crescent, Sushma square','','',1,0,0,0,'Nitinjindal0505','2019-03-19 11:37:45.000','Nitinjindal0505','2019-03-19 11:37:45.000'),(1220,1363,'1363',1246,'96086989-2e6b-40cc-800e-d883e1db44eb','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Ravikant Choudhary','ravi.choudhary@yahoo.co.in',9878988441,0,0,'Flat No.505, 5th Floor, Tower-1','SBP North Valley, Kharar-Landran road, Santemajra, Kharar Mohali ',28,507,'140307','1','Flat No.505, 5th Floor, Tower-1','SBP North Valley, Kharar-Landran road, Santemajra, Kharar Mohali ',28,507,'140307','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0242','CASA Homes','Bhola Ram Goyal','casahomes2016@gmail.com',9815623019,0,'Future City developers pvt. ltd, Sector 115, Kharar-Landran highway, SAS Nagar 140307','',28,507,'140307','1','Future City developers pvt. ltd, Sector 115, Kharar-Landran highway, SAS Nagar 140307','',28,507,'140307','1','<p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif;\">This\r\ncomplained in raised on behalf of the residents of CASA homes .</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif;\">Sanctioned building plan\r\nreferred in the below complaint is downloaded from the RERA website where\r\nbuilder has uploaded their documents.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif;\">1. The sanctioned building\r\nplan of CASA homes uploaded on RERA website ( file name :\r\n20181013Sanctioned_Building_Plan) says that all the internal roads of the\r\nprojects are 35 Feet wide ( excluding open parking area in front of the flats)\r\nbut in actual the roads are narrow which is a gross violation of the laid down\r\nplan.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif;\">2. The builder has started\r\ngiving possession to the buyers whereas builder does not have the occupancy\r\ncertificate which is a violation as per REAR agreement executed with the buyers.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif;\">3. Builder has not\r\nprovisioned enough Gensets so as to cater to the backup electricity demand. As\r\nof now they have installed only 125 KVA Genset which is insufficient as they\r\nhave charged all the buyers for 3 KVA power backup and there are more than 200\r\nflats.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif;\">4. Builder has not even\r\nstarted the construction of the club house whereas more than 25 families has\r\nalready been shifted in the society and every flat owner has already paid club\r\nhouse charges ( 75K).</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif;\">5. Builder is executing the\r\nregistry of the flats with less covered area whereas actual covered area of the\r\nflat is more for flats on second floors</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif;\">6. Actual building\r\nconstructed on the second floors are in violation with the approved plan&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif;\">7. As per the approved plan\r\n, there are 6 green areas whereas builder has developed only one and another is\r\nin progress . There is no clarity about when the rest of the green areas will\r\nbe developed.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1.&nbsp;\r\nBuilder to measure all the internal roads and broaden it where ever there is a\r\npossibility. Where there is no possibility now builder has to compensate the\r\naffected parties.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">2.\r\nBuilder to provide occupancy certificate before starting any new construction.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3.\r\nBuilder to immediately install another 125 KVA Genset and provide timelines\r\nwhen rest of the Gensets would be installed.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">4.\r\nBuilder to start the construction of the club house in a time bound manner and\r\nhandover to residents with all promised facilities and equipments.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">5.\r\nBuilder to explain why registry of less covered areas are being executed and\r\nall such registries to be corrected with builder bearing all the costs\r\ninvolved.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">6.\r\nBuilder to provide approved plan as per the actual construction .<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">7.\r\nBuilder to demarcate and start work on green area development in a time bound\r\nmanner.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>That builder should stop further construction of the flats till the time all the above issues related to internal roads, Parks, club house, Power backup, Registries are not resolved.</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'Ravikant','2019-03-19 15:17:10.000','Ravikant','2019-03-19 15:17:10.000'),(1221,1363,'1363',1246,'96086989-2e6b-40cc-800e-d883e1db44eb','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Ravikant Choudhary','ravi.choudhary@yahoo.co.in',9878988441,0,0,'Flat No.505, 5th Floor, Tower-1','SBP North Valley, Kharar-Landran road, Santemajra, Kharar Mohali ',28,507,'140307','1','Flat No.505, 5th Floor, Tower-1','SBP North Valley, Kharar-Landran road, Santemajra, Kharar Mohali ',28,507,'140307','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0242','CASA Homes','Bhola Ram Goyal','casahomes2016@gmail.com',9815623019,0,'Future City developers pvt. ltd, Sector 115, Kharar-Landran highway, SAS Nagar 140307','',28,507,'140307','1','Future City developers pvt. ltd, Sector 115, Kharar-Landran highway, SAS Nagar 140307','',28,507,'140307','1','<p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><font face=\"Calibri Light, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">abc</span></font></p>','<p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1.&nbsp;\r\nBuilder to measure all the internal roads and broaden it where ever there is a\r\npossibility. Where there is no possibility now builder has to compensate the\r\naffected parties.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">2.\r\nBuilder to provide occupancy certificate before starting any new constru