:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">6.\r\nBuilder to provide approved plan as per the actual construction .<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">7.\r\nBuilder to demarcate and start work on green area development in a time bound\r\nmanner.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>That builder should stop further construction of the flats till the time all the above issues related to internal roads, Parks, club house, Power backup, Registries are not resolved.</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'Ravikant','2019-03-19 16:41:14.000','Ravikant','2019-03-19 16:41:14.000'),(1223,1363,'1363',1246,'96086989-2e6b-40cc-800e-d883e1db44eb','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Ravikant Choudhary','ravi.choudhary@yahoo.co.in',9878988441,0,0,'Flat No.505, 5th Floor, Tower-1','SBP North Valley, Kharar-Landran road, Santemajra, Kharar Mohali ',28,507,'140307','1','Flat No.505, 5th Floor, Tower-1','SBP North Valley, Kharar-Landran road, Santemajra, Kharar Mohali ',28,507,'140307','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0242','CASA Homes','Bhola Ram Goyal','casahomes2016@gmail.com',9815623019,0,'Future City developers pvt. ltd, Sector 115, Kharar-Landran highway, SAS Nagar 140307','',28,507,'140307','1','Future City developers pvt. ltd, Sector 115, Kharar-Landran highway, SAS Nagar 140307','',28,507,'140307','1','<p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><font face=\"Calibri Light, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">Complainant booked a unit bearing No. DDD-3,2nd Floor,Casa homes vide application dated 16.12.2016.A brochure (C-1)was given to the complainant,in which all facilities which were to be provided by the respondent were/are duly mentioned.Total sale consideration was fixed as Rs. 26 lacs.A buyer agreement(C-2)in respect of said apartment measuring 1350 sq ft was executed on 23.12.17/7.3.18.As per clause 7,the possession was to be handed over by 31.3.18. Complainant was also given 60% roof rights(C-3).Respondent vide its letter dated 5.8.18 (C-4) demanded balance amount of Rs. 436800/-.Thereafter vide letter dated 8.10.18 respondent issued the possession letter(C-5) &amp; demanded the balance amount of Rs. 291201/-which was due at the time of possession.It was mentioned in the said letter that the possession,complete in all aspects is being delivered.But the reality is that still lot of pending work is there. Respondent has not competed the work as specified in the brochure &amp; also most of the work in the unit is incomplete. Also,work in the residential complex is not complete.Respondent has not even obtained the occupancy certificate.Construction of club house not been started. Roads are very narrow though respondent agreed to provide wider roads as per approved layout.Green area,parking space,street lights,gated security,power back up &amp; other basic amenities are not there,GST has been charged on the higher side. Complainant has also written letters(C-6)to respondent but no response came from it.Though there was no formal agreement, it was orally agreed between the parties that respondent will give the interest on the amount of loan taken by the complainant. Respondent also gave the interest for 2 months but failed to give the interest for the remaining period i.e. from the date of loan to the date of possession.Rate was arrived on the basis of carpet area of Rs. 1350 sq ft but the actual area in the flat is much less than that.Complainant has paid Rs. _till date. Old agre</span></font></p>','<p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1.&nbsp;\r\nBuilder to measure all the internal roads and broaden it where ever there is a\r\npossibility. Where there is no possibility now builder has to compensate the\r\naffected parties.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">2.\r\nBuilder to provide occupancy certificate before starting any new construction.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3.\r\nBuilder to immediately install another 125 KVA Genset and provide timelines\r\nwhen rest of the Gensets would be installed.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">4.\r\nBuilder to start the construction of the club house in a time bound manner and\r\nhandover to residents with all promised facilities and equipments.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">5.\r\nBuilder to explain why registry of less covered areas are being executed and\r\nall such registries to be corrected with builder bearing all the costs\r\ninvolved.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">6.\r\nBuilder to provide approved plan as per the actual construction .<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">7.\r\nBuilder to demarcate and start work on green area development in a time bound\r\nmanner.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>That builder should stop further construction of the flats till the time all the above issues related to internal roads, Parks, club house, Power backup, Registries are not resolved.</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'Ravikant','2019-03-1