rect the respondent to complete all the pending work in\r\nrespect of parking space, green area, street lights, power back up along with\r\nother basic amenities.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">To direct the respondent to provide the detail of GST deposited\r\nby the respondent in respect of unit belonging to the complainant along with\r\ndetail of GST being charged by the respondent from other allottees.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\">To direct the respondent to refund the excess amount which\r\nhas been charged by it towards carpet area since the area which was to be provided\r\nby the respondent comes to 1350 sq ft and the respondent has duly charged the price from the complainant on the basis of carpet area.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\"><o:p>To direct the respondent to provide all the facilities as promised by the respondent, which are duly mentioned in the brochure.</o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\"><o:p>To direct the respondent to complete all the works as per the approved layout plan &amp; approved building plan.(C-8)</o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">To provide any other relief which this Hon’ble Authority may\r\ndeem fit in the facts &amp; circumstances of the present case.</span><br></p>',2600000.00,0.00,'2018-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>To direct the respondent to complete all the remaining work and apply for the occupancy certificate as early as possible.</p>','1','','2018-03-07 00:00:00','2017-12-23 00:00:00','Unit No. DDD-3, 2nd Floor, 1350 sq ft,casa homes','','',2,0,0,0,'Ravikant','2019-03-19 17:47:07.000','Ravikant','2019-03-19 17:47:07.000'),(1231,1363,'1363',1246,'96086989-2e6b-40cc-800e-d883e1db44eb','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Sushil Kumari','ravi.choudhary@yahoo.co.in',9878988441,0,0,'Flat No.505, 5th Floor, Tower-1','SBP North Valley, Kharar-Landran road, Santemajra, Kharar Mohali ',28,507,'140307','0','House No 253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','SANJEEV GUPTA','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0242','CASA Homes','Bhola Ram Goyal','casahomes2016@gmail.com',9815623019,0,'Future City developers pvt. ltd, Sector 115, Kharar-Landran highway, SAS Nagar 140307','',28,507,'140307','1','Future City developers pvt. ltd, Sector 115, Kharar-Landran highway, SAS Nagar 140307','',28,507,'140307','1','<p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in\"><font face=\"Calibri Light, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">Complainant booked a unit bearing No. DDD-3,2nd Floor,Casa homes vide application dated 16.12.2016.Brochure C-1)was given to the complainant,in which all facilities which were to be provided by the respondent were duly mentioned.Total sale consideration was fixed as Rs.26 lacs.Agreement(C-2)in respect of said apartment measuring 1350 sq ft was executed on 23.12.17.As per clause 7,the possession was to be handed over by 31.3.18.Complainant was also given 60% roof rights(C-3).Respondent vide its letter dated 5.8.18(C-4)demanded balance amount of Rs. 436800/-.Thereafter vide lletter dated 8.10.18 respondent issued possession letter(C-5)&amp; demanded the balance amount of Rs. 291201/-which was due at the time of possessi