 are duly mentioned in the brochure.</o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%;\"><o:p>To direct the respondent to complete all the works as per the approved layout plan &amp; approved building plan.</o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:0in;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">To provide any other relief which this Hon’ble Authority may\r\ndeem fit in the facts &amp; circumstances of the present case.&nbsp;</span><br></p>',2600000.00,2602139.00,'2018-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>To direct the respondent to complete all the remaining work and apply for the occupancy certificate as early as possible.</p>','1','','2018-03-07 00:00:00','2017-12-23 00:00:00','Unit No. DDD-3, 2nd Floor, 1350 sq ft,casa homes','','',1,1,0,0,'Ravikant','2019-03-21 15:41:27.000','Ravikant','2019-03-21 15:41:27.000'),(1251,1223,'1223',1299,'f05423d6-8aeb-41cc-9669-749a50a90d4d','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-20 16:50:30.000','VICKY  FRANCIS','vf18jan@gmail.com',9996767263,0,0,'217 Rajesh Colony','Near old court',13,21,'135003','1','253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,1,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','Falcon View Apartments','Janta Land Promoters Pvt. Ltd.','janta@jantahousing.com',8427100082,0,'SCO 39-42','Sector 82 JLPL',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39-42','Sector 82 JLPL',28,507,'140306','1','<p>The complainants agreed to purchase the Apartment No. E-1402, Facing Green in Wing “E” at 14th Floor in (Super Mega) Falcon View, Phase-1, Sector 66-A, Mohali for an amount of Rs. 96,92,942/-. Annexure C-1 Allotment letter \r\n</p><p>After the authorized representatives of the respondent builder committed that they will complete and handover the apartment within 18 months and there is also possibility that they will hand over prior to the committed date.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>And thereafter the complainants paid the booking amount of Rs. 11,00,000/- to the respondent on 23.06.2015 vide receipt no. 3055. The copy of the receipt dated 23.06.2015 is appended herewith as Annexure C-2. \r\n</p><p>The complainants chose the Down Payment Plan . The payment plan is reproduced here as under for the kind perusal of this Hon’ble Court:\r\n</p><p>S. No.	Due Dates	Payment\r\n</p><p>1	17.08.2015	Rs. 81,17,540/- (BSP) + Rs. 2,00,000/- (Car Parking Charges) + applicable service tax on date\r\n</p><p>2.	On the delivery of possession	Rs. 5,19,140/- (Balance 5% BSP) + Rs. 1,50,650/- (IFMS) + Rs. 1,80,780/- (Club Charges) + 45,195/- (Power backup) + applicable service tax on date\r\n</p><p>&nbsp;G. Total	Rs. 86,36,680/- (Basic) + Rs. 5,76,625/- (Other Charges) + along with applicable service tax on date\r\n</p><p>\r\nThat it is the admitted fact that the complainants had made the payment of Rs. 86,86,477/- BSP along with all the applicable taxes on 27.08.2015. The copy of the receipts dated 27.08.2015 is appended herewith as Annexure C-3.&nbsp;</p><p>That it is submitted that as per the clause 2.24 of the allotment letter, the respondent was to deliver the possession of the apartment within 18 months from the date of issue of allotment letter i.e. on or before 22.12.2016. \r\n</p><p>The contentions of the complainant is that despite having paid 95% of the BSP and additional Rs 2000,00 as car parking charges along with the applicable service charges i.e Total of Rs 97,86,477 well within time, He has still not been offered possession of the flat which was to be completed by 23.12.2016</p>','<ul><li>To direct the respondent to handover the actual physical possession of the said apartment complete in all aspects, after obtaining the occupancy certificate.</li><li>To direct the respondent to pay interest for the delayed period to be calculated w.e.f 22.12.2016 upto the date handing over the actual physical possession after obtaining the occupancy certificate</li><li>To direct the respondent to pay litigation charges to the tune of Rs. 50000/-</li><li>The complainants reserve the right to file separate application for claiming compensation for the harassment both physical &amp; mental, due to non delivery of possession within time and for causing unreasonable delay</li></ul>',10268967.00,9786477.00,'2016-12-22 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ul><li>To direct the respondent to complete the development&nbsp; &nbsp;of project and construction of the apartment and deliver the possession of it along with all the facilities.</li></ul>','1','','2018-06-23 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','1402 E Wing Falcon View\r\nSector 66-A Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'vf18jan','2019-03-22 21:58:33.000','vf18jan','2019-03-22 21:58:33.000'),(1252,1223,'1223',1299,'f05423d6-8aeb-41cc-9669-749a50a90d4d','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-20 16:50:30.000','VICKY  FRANCIS','vf18jan@gmail.com',9996767263,0,0,'217 Rajesh Colony','Near old court',13,21,'135003','1','253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,1,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','Falcon View Apartments','Janta Land Promoters Pvt. Ltd.','janta@jantahousing.com',8427100082,0,'SCO 39-42','Sector 82 JLPL',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39-42','Sector 82 JLPL',28,507,'140306','1','<p>The complainants agreed to purchase the Apartment No. E-1402, Facing Green in Wing “E” at 14th Floor in (Super Mega) Falcon View, Phase-1, Sector 66-A, Mohali for an amount of Rs. 96,92,942/-. Annexure C-1 Allotment letter \r\n</p><p>After the authorized representatives of the respondent builder committed that they will complete and handover the apartment within 18 months and there is also possibility that they will hand over prior to the committed date.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>And thereafter the complainants paid the booking amount of Rs. 11,00,000/- to the respondent on 