 the possession.Till date, the complainant has already paid the amount of Rs. 9786477/- (Receipts as C-2) and balance amount is payable at the time of delivery of possession. The respondent has only handed over the amount of Rs.&nbsp; &nbsp; as a delayed compensation. out of the said , the complainants have only encashed Rs.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>','<ul><li>To direct the respondent to handover the actual physical possession of the said apartment complete in all aspects, after obtaining the occupancy certificate.</li><li>To direct the respondent to pay interest for the delayed period to be calculated w.e.f 22.12.2016 upto the date handing over the actual physical possession after obtaining the occupancy certificate</li><li>To direct the respondent to pay litigation charges to the tune of Rs. 50000/-</li><li>The complainants reserve the right to file separate application for claiming compensation for the harassment both physical &amp; mental, due to non delivery of possession within time and for causing unreasonable delay</li><li>To direct the respondent to issue separate receipt for the service tax charged from the complainants</li></ul>',10268967.00,9786477.00,'2016-12-22 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ul><li>To direct the respondent to complete the development&nbsp; &nbsp;of project and construction of the apartment and deliver the possession of it along with all the facilities.</li></ul>','1','','2018-06-23 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','1402 E Wing Falcon View\r\nSector 66-A Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'vf18jan','2019-03-22 22:30:05.000','vf18jan','2019-03-22 22:30:05.000'),(1254,1223,'1223',1299,'f05423d6-8aeb-41cc-9669-749a50a90d4d','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-22 22:38:40.000','VICKY  FRANCIS','vf18jan@gmail.com',9996767263,0,0,'217 Rajesh Colony','Near old court',13,21,'135003','1','253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,1,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9