e harassment both physical &amp; mental, due to non delivery of possession within time and for causing unreasonable delay</li><li>To direct the respondent to issue separate receipt for the service tax charged from the complainants</li></ul>',10268967.00,9786477.00,'2016-12-22 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<ul><li>To direct the respondent to complete the development&nbsp; &nbsp;of project and construction of the apartment and deliver the possession of it along with all the facilities.</li></ul>','1','','2018-06-23 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','1402 E Wing Falcon View\r\nSector 66-A Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'vf18jan','2019-03-22 22:35:40.000','vf18jan','2019-03-22 22:35:40.000'),(1255,1364,'1364',1397,'299ba852-83b4-40af-b09b-8e559c3e726d','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','shivendra anupam','wizard1828@gmail.com',8284898737,0,431159076868,'Flat no 68A','amari greens ',28,507,'140301','1','Flat no 68A','amari greens ',28,507,'140301','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0006','AMARI GREENS','SUMIT GOYAL','nirwanagreens@gmail.com',9592555506,0,'Showroom No. 1-2','Nirwana Greens-2 Khanpur, Kharar  Sahibzada Ajit Singh Nagar (Mohali)',28,507,'140301','1','Showroom No. 1-2','Nirwana Greens-2 Khanpur, Kharar  Sahibzada Ajit Singh Nagar (Mohali)',28,507,'140301','1','<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">This complaint is made to seek resolution to the poor quality construction of the house and Non responsive behavior by the Society Incharge. Noteworthy points to my complaints are mentioned below .&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;Repaired wall needs to be painted at the back yard .&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li><li style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Wall dampness has been a serious issue and this has destroyed wall paper and wall highlight each year in every room , hall and at the mail entrance - As per supervisor Mr. Manpreet&nbsp;&nbsp;it has to be borne by me , if it is so i want a written communication as i will not entertain any verbal communication and will mark this complaint as \'open\' .&nbsp;</span><br></li><li style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">No electricity connection for the bulb at the front balcony.</span></li><li style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">Non responsive behavior&nbsp;of the incharge to my previous mails .</li></ul><p><br></p>','<p>1. Wall paint at the back yard at the repaired portion .&nbsp;</p><p>2. Concrete resolution to wall dampness problem as this has resulted in various health hazards and sickness to my family members .&nbsp;</p><p>3. electricity connection in t he front of balcony .&nbsp;</p><p>4. written apology for neither responding to my mails for over 25 days nor proving the builder contact details despite reminders .&nbsp;</p>',2800000.00,2930000.00,'2016-10-26 00:00:00.000','2016-10-26 00:00:00.000','<p>1. Wall paint at the back yard at the repaired portion .&nbsp;</p><p>2. Concrete resolution to wall dampness problem as this has resulted in various health hazards and sickness to my family members .&nbsp;</p><p>3. electricity connection in t he front of balcony .&nbsp;</p><p>4. written apology for neither responding to my mails for over 25 days nor proving the builder contact details despite reminders .&nbsp;</p>','1','','2016-10-26 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat no 68A\r\namari greens village khanpur kharar , sas nagar punjab','','',1,0,0,0,'wizard1828','2019-03-23 13:15:18.000','wizard1828','2019-03-23 13:15:18.000'),(1256,1365,'1365',1397,'299ba852-83b4-40af-b09b-8e559c3e726d','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','shivendra anupam','wizard1828@gmail.com',8284898737,0,431159076868,'Flat no 68A','amari greens ',28,507,'140301','1','Flat no 68A','amari greens ',28,507,'140301','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0006','AMARI GREENS','SUMIT GOYAL','nirwanagreens@gmail.com',9592555506,0,'Showroom No. 1-2','Nirwa