r of the office.</p><p>For which i have submitted the cancellation on the performa that has been formulated by them on 22nd December 2018.&nbsp;</p><p>Neither the&nbsp; agreement nor the documents has been provided to me from Maya Garden Magnesia till date. Even after getting the correspondence no response was given by them regarding the same.</p><p>Requesting you too revive&nbsp; my deposit for the above mention issue.</p><p>Thanking you</p>','<p>I want to claim my money that i have submitted.&nbsp;</p>',4300000.00,992452.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>No action taken by the Maya Garden Magnesia&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); color: rgb(213, 87, 0); font-family: Calibri, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: center;\">Maya Garden Magnesia</span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); color: rgb(213, 87, 0); font-family: Calibri, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span></p><span style=\"color: rgb(213, 87, 0); font-family: Calibri, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\">Opp McDonalds, NH 22&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(213, 87, 0); font-family: Calibri, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(213, 87, 0); font-family: Calibri, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\">Chd-Ambala Highway, Zirakpur, Punjab 140603</span>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Maya Garden Magnesia \r\nOpp McDonalds, NH 22 \r\nChd-Ambala Highway, Zirakpur, Punjab 140603','','',1,1,0,0,'DurgaDevi','2019-03-23 19:22:39.000','DurgaDevi','2019-03-23 19:22:39.000'),(1262,1368,'1368',1450,'99509e83-b468-4aae-973b-0c821afca0cc','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','AKHILESH KHANNA','khanna.chd@gmail.com',9815509469,0,0,'#3299 , SECTOR 19-D ','',6,128,'160019','1','#3299 , SECTOR 19-D ','',6,128,'160019','D.KHANNA','khanna.chd@gmail.com',9815509469,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0116','750 PLOT SCHEME (IT CITY , MOHALI)','ESTATE OFFICER GMADA','helpdesk@gmada.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA BHAVAN, SECTOR-62','MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAVAN, SECTOR-62','MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That one Mr.Vikram Rai , s/o Sh.Himmat Rai, was allocated an LOI for the allotment of Residential Plot measuring 256.66 Sq.yds. in category \'\'Schedule cast /Schedule tribe (750 Plots category scheme) against Application Form no.8596&nbsp; for the draw of Lots held by the GMADA on dated 21.09.2016 (Serial No.155) in I.T. CITY S.A.S. Nagar (Mohali), issued vide GMADA \'s Letter of Intent /Memo No.GMADA-EO/2047/6460 , dtd: 22.02.2017. On an application having been made by&nbsp; aforesaid allottee Mr.Vikram Rai for transfer of Letter of Intent in favour of the complainant i.e.Mr.Akhilesh Khanna, the respondent pursuant to the request transferred the LOI&nbsp; in the name of complainant vide memo no.9554 dated 10.03.2017 subject to the condition to abide by the terms and condition mentioned in the LOI as well as the provisions of Punjab Regional Town Planning &amp; Development Act, 1995.As per CL.15 of LOI the possession of plot was to be given to the allottee within one year i.e.by 21.02.2018. The&nbsp; possession of the&nbsp; plot has not been given by the respondent till today as promised.The complainant has made full payment along with taxes , transfer fees and interest&nbsp; of about Rs.60 lacs.(subject to calculation of admissible amount for entitlement of interest to be supplied by the respondent).It is learnt that the respondent has miserably failed to carry development of the area so as to &nbsp; hand over possession to the allottee\'s/holder of LOIs and&nbsp; which is likely to considerable time . Thus the complainant is entitled for interest&nbsp; @12%(as charged/calculated/applied by the respondent as per LOI for non payment of instalments)&nbsp; on the payment made to respondent till actual possession of the plot is handed over by the respondent.&nbsp;</p><p>\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 14px;\"><br></p>','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">In view of the facts mentioned in Para no.4 above, the complainant prays that the respondent be directed to pay interest @12%(as charged/calculated/applied by the respondent as per LOI for non payment of instalments) from the date of issuance of LOI 22.02.2017 till the actual possession is handed over to the complainant. As the relief claimed involves future interest as well as for uncertain period , the respondent may be directed to deposit in this Hon\'ble tribunal Rs15 lacs as security .&nbsp;</p><p>\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 14px;\"><br></p>',5200000.00,0.00,'2018-02-21 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Deposit an amount of Rs 15 lacs as prayed above in para no.5.</p>','1','','2017-02-22 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,0,0,0,'khanna3299','2019-03-23 21:16:12.000','khanna3299','2019-03-23 21:16:12.000'),(1263,1369,'1369',1448,'a7813333-38f0-43a0-989d-54439ebd8c18','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-24 19:40:02.000','Manish Malhotra','manishm0602@gmail.com',9815796644,0,214785597487,'149, Sector 70 SAS Nagar','',28,507,'160055','1','# 381/2, Sector 44-A','',6,128,'600044','ramnik gupta','ramnikgupta115@yahoo.co.in',9855506205,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0271','GOLF Link-II','Ansal Properties & Infrastructure Ltd and Ors.','info@ansalapi.com',0,0,'115, Ansal Bhawan, 16 K.G. Marg, New Delhi.','SCO No. 183-184, Sector 9-C, Chandigarh.',10,429,'110001','1','115, Ansal Bhawan, 16 K.G. Marg, New Delhi.','SCO No. 183-184, Sector 9-C, Chandigarh.',10,429,'110001','1','<p>1.	That the Respondents promoted their housing and commercial project which is being developed under the name &amp; Style Golf Links-II, in Sector 116, SAS Nagar Distt. Mohali, Punjab by them. Respondent No. 2 is the local office of Respondent No. 1., Respondent No. 3 is the Managing Director whereas, Respondents 4 &amp; 5 are the Directors of the Respondent No. 1 and jointly they constitute the Board of Directors of Respondent No. 1 to carry its business, taking decisions, making policies in its ordinary, usual and day to day course of business and hence Respondents no. 3 to 5 are liable jointly and severally for all the acts and conduct of Respondent No. 1. \r\n</p><p>2	That the Respondents claimed that they have been granted a License by Chief Town Planner, Punjab and that they have also been granted approval by the Punjab Government, Department of Housing Project for developing a Mega Housing Project in the name of “Golf Links-II” in Sector 116, SAS Nagar, Mohali. \r\n</p><p>3   That it was also canvassed that the project is one of its kinds and the Developer/Promoter had all the approvals of the Government Departments such as approval of Layout Plan, Environment Clearance, PPCB NOC for the launch and marketing of said Housing Project. It was further claimed by the Respondents that the project was being designed by renowned Architects and would cater to all the amenities of modern living. It was also claimed by the Respondents that the present project (Golf Links-II) is a Mega Project and shall also have mix of Flats, Villas, Commercial Complexes etc. characterized by outstanding levels of comfort, basic amenities, parks, adequate commercial parking, convenience, security etc. and further assured that the residential project of the opposite party would be a huge success. \r\n</p><p>4	That pursuant to the said advertisements regarding the project in question, one M/S Monga Realtors Pvt. Ltd., Mohali got booked one SCO Plot in the aforesaid project and paid Rs. 10,00,000/- as booking amount to the</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:1.0in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-theme-font:\r\nminor-latin\">i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">To grant interest\r\non the paid up amount of Rs. 60,73,725/-&nbsp;\r\nw.e.f. 16/07/2014 and on Rs. 7,24,500/- w.e.f. 18.09.2015 at the\r\nprevailing SBI lending rate plus 2 percent till the actual, physical possession\r\nis offered under section 18 (1) of the RERA Act 2016 read with Rule 16 of The\r\nPunjab State Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Rules 2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" s