0.2012. That a buyer’s agreement\r\nwas signed between the complainant no. 1 and the respondents on 30.10.2012. The respondents were\r\nthereafter offered possession of the said apartment and the possession was taken over by the\r\nrespondents on 11.09.2015. Further it is pertinent to mention here that in the possession handing over\r\nletter, the respondents had undertaken to pay the maintenance charges after taking over possession of\r\nthe said apartment and had also undertaken to enter into a maintenance agreement. The respondents\r\nthereafter, entered into a maintenance agreement dated 11.09.2015 with the complainant no. 2. That the\r\nrespondents despite been in possession of the said apartment, has not been paying the maintenance\r\ncharges fixed as per the maintenance agreement and is enjoying all the services free of cost. It is further\r\npertinent to mention here that a number of public notices has been got attached in the society whereby\r\nthe respondents were called upon various times for payment of the maintenance charges but no heed\r\nwas paid to the said notices by the respondents.&nbsp;<br></p>','<p>Directing the respondents to pay the amount of Rs. 34,727/- due towards the maintenance charges.\r\nDirecting the respondents to pay interest on the amount due toward maintenace charges in terms of Section 19 (7) of RERA&nbsp; to the complainants.<br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Directing the respondents to pay interest on the due amount as mentioned in the maintenance agreement\r\ntill the pendency of the present complaint till actual payment.<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'BeeG','2019-04-02 17:07:35.000','BeeG','2019-04-02 17:07:35.000'),(1292,1381,'1381',1458,'3b6a06c6-602d-4db1-a6b6-0f26a94a0a62','FormTypeM',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Rohit Rahal','vinodverma.adv46@gmail.com',9888377960,0,0,'Flat no. 502, GHS 4','Alaknanda, GHS, sector 20 ',13,15,'134116','1','Flat no. 502, GHS 4','Alaknanda, GHS, sector 20 ',13,15,'134116','Vinod Verma','vinodverma.adv46@gmail.com',9888377960,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0022','LOBP Scheme ','Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority','se@puda.gov.in',0,0,'The Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority, PUDA Bhawan',',Sector62, SAS Nagar',28,507,'160062','1','The Punjab Urban Planning and Development Authority, PUDA Bhawan',',Sector62, SAS Nagar',28,507,'160062','1','<p>1.	That the complainant applied for allotment of plot of 400 sq yard vide application form No. 1449 with the Respondent. The draw was conducted on 19.03.2015 and the complainant was declared as successful vide S.L. No. 32 regarding the allotment of plot in the above said scheme. The allotment of plot was communicated vide Letter of Intent Memo No. PUDA-E.O. Gateway city/2015 (24468), dated 24.06.2015.  \r\n</p><p>2.	That the tentative price of the plot was Rs 84,00,000 fixed at the rate of Rs 21000/- per sq yard. Besides this 2 % cancer cess shall also be charged on the total price of the plot. \r\n</p><p>3.	That the complainant had deposited a sum of Rs 8400000 (Rs Eighty four lacs only) from time to time as per the requirement of deposit of the amount stated in the allotment letter.  In addition to this amount a complainant also deposited a sum of Rs 1,68,000  in lieu of the cancer cess amount etc. This amount is admitted by Respondent by issuance of No objection certificate.  \r\n</p><p>4.	That as per clause 4 of the allotment letter, the possession of the said plot shall be handed over to the allottee after the completion of the development works at site or 18 months from the date of issuance of the allotment letter whichever is earlier.  The ownership of the land shall continue to vest in the name of PUDA until the entire consideration money together with interest and any other dues, is paid in full to the Authority.  \r\n</p><p>5.	That the Respondent has given “ No objection Certificate” dated 25.11.2016 Memo No. 658 addressed to the complainant and admitted the receipt of payment of Rs 8400000/- and stated that the complainant will pay the enhanced amount if any within the 30 days from the date of demand by the Respondent.  \r\n</p><p>6.	That the complainant had waited till Dec, 2016 for completion of the project and the Respondent had failed to give possession. After waiting for long period the complainant made a representation dated 20.12.2016, stating therein that as per the personal visit of the co</p>','<p>It is therefore humbly prayed that the complaint of the complainant</p><p>may kindly be accepted and opposite party be directed to :</p><p>A) Give physical possession of the plot after leveling the same along with all the amenities, sewerage facilities &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;etc</p><p>B) Pay Rs 1,26,000/- P.M. as the interest for period from 26.11.2016 till the final possession of the plot and &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;interest of Rs 94500/- from 22-08-2016 to 26-11-2016 on a Sum of Rs 2100000</p><p><br></p><p>C) Pay Rs 5,00,000/- to the complainant for causing inconvenience, mental pain, agony, facing financial &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;hardship etc.</p><p>D) Rs 2,00,000/- as costs of litigation charges etc.</p><p>E) Any relief which this Hon\'ble Commission may pass or deem fit and proper in the interests of justice.</p>',8400000.00,8400000.00,'2018-08-22 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>It is prayed that meantime pending the complaint the respondent be directed to get the plot properly leveled along with all amenities etc.&nbsp;</p>','1','','2016-08-22 00:00:00','2015-06-24 00:00:00','Plot no. 11','','',1,0,0,0,'Vinod@adv46','2019-04-02 23:57:23.000','Vinod@adv46','2019-04-02 23:57:23.000'),(1293,1318,'1318',1112,'29af80b1-85ed-4b88-8344-b429d2f24eca','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-04-02 17:01:31.000','Bee Gee Builtech','savindersinghgill@gmail.com',9988861126,0,0,'SCF 44-45, Ist Floor','Sector-9',13,15,'134108',