easuring 2180 sq. ft. (Approximate Super Area)\r\non 02.05.2014 in the abovementioned project and in pursuance of the said booking, they were allotted flat\r\nno. B-1201 on 12th Floor in Tower-B vide allotment letter dated 02.05.2014. That a buyer’s agreement\r\nwas signed between the complainant no. 1 and the respondent on 02.05.2014. The respondent was thereafter offered possession of the said apartment and the possession was taken over by the\r\nrespondent on 22.04.2015. Further it is pertinent to mention here that in the possession handing over\r\nletter, the respondent had undertaken to pay the maintenance charges after taking over possession of\r\nthe said apartment and had also undertaken to enter into a maintenance agreement. The respondent thereafter, entered into a maintenance agreement dated 22.04.2015 with the complainant no. 2. That the\r\nrespondent despite been in possession of the said apartment, has not been paying the maintenance\r\ncharges fixed as per the maintenance agreement and is enjoying all the services free of cost. It is further\r\npertinent to mention here that a number of public notices has been got attached in the society whereby\r\nthe respondent were called upon various times for payment of the maintenance charges but no heed\r\nwas paid to the said notices by the respondent.&nbsp;<br></p>','<p>Directing the respondent to pay the amount of Rs. 89,985/- due towards the maintenance charges.\r\nDirecting the respondent to pay interest on the amount due toward maintenace charges in terms of\r\nSection 19 (7) of RERA to the complainants.<br></p>',0.00,0.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Directing the respondent to pay interest on the due amount as mentioned in the maintenance agreement\r\ntill the pendency of the present complaint till actual payment.<br></p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'BeeG','2019-04-03 11:47:59.000','BeeG','2019-04-03 11:47:59.000'),(1295,1372,'1372',1446,'9cd007eb-499d-49cd-ad24-954c4ee507d5','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-25 14:51:20.000','Ms Surinder  Chopra','choprasurinder39@yahoo.com',9988370789,1722582510,0,'510 sector 16 Panchkula','same',13,15,'134109','1','510 sector 16 Panchkula','same',13,15,'134109','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PC0010','CHANDIGARH CITI CENTER','M/s Citi Centre Developers VIP Road Zirakpur,Rajeev Bhatt 9888989888,GM,Pankaj Gupta MD','ccc.ritesh@gmail.com',9023490234,0,'VIP ROAD,ZIRAKPUR','SAME',28,507,'140603','1','VIP ROAD,ZIRAKPUR','SAME',28,507,'140603','1','<p>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><p>That Mr. Rajeev Bhatt, Property Dealer ph 9888989888 approached me in the month of October 2018 with a\r\nAssured Lease Guarantee (For 9 years)Scheme.The place offered to me was Fully Furnished Office Suites (Block D &amp; E) (All A Block Facing Unit) at 11<sup><font size=\"2\">th</font></sup> Floor (Hereinafter referred as “Office Space”). Then I was thereafter taken to visit the property on 27.10.2018.</p><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt;\"><p>Mr. Sachin Verma who is the General Manager met <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>and offered Office Space No. 1108 at 11<sup><font size=\"2\">th</font></sup> Floor with Carpet area of 525 sq ft at the price of Rs. 7350 per sq. ft.</p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><p>The possession as promised by them&nbsp;was to be given on or\r\nbefore 31/12/2018 if the entire payment is made up&nbsp;front.<span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt;\">&nbsp;<strong>Considering\r\nthat I was making Full Payment of the above said Office Space, after much negotiations, agreed and finalized the final price for the\r\ncarpet area of 525 sq.ft to be Rs. 5665.76 per sq. ft. Hence forth after making\r\nthe calculations I was informed that the final amount which needs to be paid is\r\nRs. 31,53,000/- inclusive of GST.</strong><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><strong>On\r\nbelieving their representations as regards completion certificate and getting\r\npossession of the Office Space by 31/12/2018, I depoisted the amount of Rs.\r\n31,53,000/- via RTGS from my PNB Account with UTR PUNBR52018102914135067 to the\r\naccount of CITI CENTRE DEVELOPERS on dated 29.10.2018.</strong><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"> T<strong>hat\r\nthey have prepared the Allotment Letter and on being shown the said Allotment\r\nLetter which was dated 05.12.2018, I was perplexed to see that the full and\r\nfinal amount paid by me was mentioned as “earnest money” and that the carpet\r\narea was also reduced to 373.50 sq ft.I also learnt of the fraud being\r\ncommitted against me as there were no Office Spaces\r\napproved for 11<sup><font size=\"2\">th</font></sup> Floor but only SOHO suites.</strong><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">That I has been approaching them for refund of\r\nmy entire amount being paid by me time and again since February 2019, they\r\nneither completed the formalities nor have refunded the amount in total to me.That till date they have not given me the claimed amount even when I approached them time and again inspite of giving&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 10pt 0.5in;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font></p></span><p></p></span><p></p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font></p></span><p></p></span><p></p>','<p>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><p>false assuarances that the amount will be repaid with in a few days time there is no refund which has been affected till date.Thus I believe and claim that they have acted malafidely to grab money from me .This is my Humble request kindly to take action on the above mentioned concerned persons.</p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font></p></span><p></p>',0.00,3153000.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>&nbsp;please issue the notices to the respondents as soon as possible .And humbly request to take action on them.</p><p>Thanks&nbsp;</p>','1','','0001-01-01 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'SURINDERCHOPRA','2019-04-03 18:29:56.000','SURINDERCHOPRA','2019-04-03 18:29:56.000'),(1296,1372,'1372',1446,'9cd007eb-499d-49cd-ad24-954c4ee507d5','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-25 14:51:20.000','Ms Surinder  Chopra','choprasurinder39@yahoo.com',9988370789,1722582510,0,'510 sector 16 Panchkula','same',13,15,'134109','1','510 sector 16 Panchkula','same',13,15,'134109','','',0,0,'Agent','PBRERA-SAS79-PC0010','CHANDIGARH CITI CENTER','M/s Citi Centre Developers VIP Road Zirakpur,Rajeev Bhatt 9888989888,GM,Pankaj Gupta MD','ccc.ritesh@gmail.com',9023490234,0,'VIP ROAD,ZIRAKPUR','SAME',28,507,'140603','1','VIP ROAD,ZIRAKPUR','SAME',28,507,'140603','1','<p>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso