S Nagar','se@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA Bhawan Sector-62, SAS Nagar','',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA Bhawan Sector-62, SAS Nagar','',28,507,'160062','1','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">1.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nthe present complaint is against Project namely gateway city SAS Nagar Mohali\r\nwhich is registered with the present authority with registration number PBRERA-SAS81-PR0022\r\nand is an ongoing project. Therefore, the complainant has cause of action to\r\nfile this complaint before this Hon’ble Authority.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">2.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nthe complainant applied for a residential plot of 150 Sq. Yard<span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp; </span>vide application No. 5909 and was successful\r\nin the draw of lots held on 19.03.2015 vide S.L No. 405 w.r.t. allotment of\r\nplots in the scheme known as gateway city, SAS Nagar, PUDA. The complainant was\r\ngiven letter of intent dated 27.05.2015 which is annexed herewith as annexure\r\nC/1. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">3.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nas per the conditions of the letter of intent dated 27.05.2015, the complainant\r\nmade two payments of Rupees 10,71,000/- vide DD No. 60778 and 60779 of Rs.\r\n5,35,500/- each dated 22.06.2015 on account of instalment for allotment of plot\r\nin gateway city. Copy of receipt dated 22.06.2015<span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp; </span>issued by the PUDA is annexed herewith as\r\nAnnexure C/2.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">4.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nan allotment letter dated 27.09.2016 was issued by the PUDA to the complainant\r\nwhich is annexed herewith as annexure C/3. As per the allotment letter clause\r\n4(I), it was agreed that the possession of the said plot shall be handed over\r\nto the allottee after the completion of the development works at site or 18\r\nmonths from the date of issuance of allotment letter whichever is earlier. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">5.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>It\r\nis humbly submitted that the project has not yet been completed. It is still\r\nregistered with RERA as an ongoing project. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">6.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nthe status of the development works have not been updated by the PUDA and no\r\ninformation was given to the complainant regarding the work going on in the\r\nproject. Neither any demand letter has been issued by the respondent to the\r\ncomplainant. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><font face=\"Times New Roman\"></font><br></p>','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><font face=\'\"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"\'>7</font><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nin the absence of any update on the progress of development works in the\r\nproject and non issue of demand letters as per payment plan mentioned in\r\nclause<span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp; </span>3 (III) of<span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp; </span>the allotment letter, the complainant could\r\nnot make balance payments.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\">8<span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nthe possession of the plot was to be handed over within 18 months as per the\r\nallotment letter i.e. March 27, 2018 which has not been communicated to the\r\ncomplainant till date. Therefore, delay of more than one year has already\r\noccurred in handing over the possession of the plot. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><font face=\'\"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"\'>9</font><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>In\r\nview of the above facts and circumstances, the complainant wishes to withdraw\r\nfrom the project.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>Prayer</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>The\r\nrespondent has violated the provision u/s 18 of the Act. Therefore, it is most\r\nrespectfully prayed that the present complaint may be decided and respondent be\r\ndirected to refund of the amount paid to respondent along with interest as per\r\nRERA Act/Punjab RERA Rules, 2017.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><font face=\"Times New Roman\"></font><br></p>',0.00,1606500.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NA&nbsp;</p>','1','','2016-09-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Residential Plot-693, Park Facing','','',1,0,0,0,'anilkumarc','2019-04-04 13:27:17.000','anilkumarc','2019-04-04 13:27:17.000'),(1299,1375,'1375',1450,'99509e83-b468-4aae-973b-0c821afca0cc','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-29 11:53:58.000','AKHILESH KHANNA','khanna.chd@gmail.com',9815509469,0,0,'#3299 , SECTOR 19-D ','',6,128,'160019','1','#3299 First Floor, SECTOR 19-D ','',6,128,'160019','D.KHANNA Adv.','khanna.chd@gmail.com',9815509469,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0116','750 PLOT SCHEME (IT CITY, MOHALI)','The chief Administrator, GMADA','helpdesk@gmada.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA BHAVAN , SECTOR-62, MOHALI(S.A.S .NAGAR)','',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAVAN , SECTOR-62, MOHALI(S.A.S .NAGAR)','',28,507,'160062','1','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That one Mr.Vikram Rai , s/o Sh.Himmat Rai, was allocated an LOI for the allotment of Residential Plot measuring 256.66 Sq.yds. in category \'\'Schedule cast /Schedule tribe (750 Plots category scheme) against Application Form no.8596&nbsp; for the draw of Lots held by the GMADA on dated 21.09.2016 (Serial No.155) in I.T. CITY S.A.S. Nagar (Mohali), issued vide GMADA \'s Letter of Intent /Memo No.GMADA-EO/2047/6460 , dtd: 22.02.2017. On an application having been made by&nbsp; aforesaid allottee Mr.Vikram Rai for transfer of Letter of Intent in favour of the complainant i.e.Mr.Akhilesh Khanna, the respondent pursuant to the request transferred the LOI&nbsp; in the name of complainant vide memo no.9554 dated 10.03.2017 subject to the condition to abide by the terms and condition mentioned in the LOI as well as the provisions of Punjab Regional Town Planning &amp; Development Act, 1995.As per CL.15 of LOI the possession of plot was to be given to the allottee within one year i.e.by 21.02.2018. The&nbsp; possession of the&nbsp; plot has not been given by the respondent till today as promised.The complainant has paid &nbsp;complete price &amp; made full &nbsp;payment along with taxes , transfer fees and interest&nbsp;amounting to&nbsp;Rs.5209620 /-. It is submitted that the respondent has miserably failed to carry development works of the area so as to hand over possession to the allottee\'s/holder of LOIs as promised and&nbsp; which is likely total further considerable time . Thus, the complainant is entitled for interest&nbsp; @12% PA (as charged/calculated/applied by the respondent as per LOI for non payment of instalments)&nbsp;&nbsp;on the payment made to respondent till actual possession of the plot is handed over by the respondent.&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">In view of the facts mentioned in Para no.4 above, the complainant prays that the respondent be directed to pay interest @12% PA(as charged/calculated/applied by the respondent as per LOI for non payment of instalments) from the date of issuance of LOI &nbsp;22.02.2017 till the actual possession is handed over to the complainant. As the relief claimed involves future interest as well &nbsp;for uncertain period , the respondent may be directed to deposit in this Hon\'ble tribunal Rs15 lacs as security .&nbsp;</p>',5209620.00,5209620.00,'2018-02-21 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Deposit an amount of Rs 15 lacs as prayed above in para no.5.</p>','1','','2017-02-22 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'khanna3299','2019-04-04 14:48:14.000','khanna3299','2019-04-04 14:48:14.000'),(1300,1375,'1375',1450,'99509e83-b468-4aae-973b-0c821afca0cc','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-29 11:53:58.000','AKHILESH KHANNA','khanna.chd@gmail.com',9815509469,0,0,'#3299 , SECTOR 19-D ','',6,128,'160019','1','#3299 First Floor, SECTOR 19-D ','',6,128,'160019','D.KHANNA Adv.','khanna.chd@gmail.com',9815509469,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0116','750 PLOT SCHEME (IT CITY, MOHALI)','The chief Administrator, GMADA','helpdesk@gmada.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA BHAVAN , SECTOR-62, MOHALI(S.A.S .NAGAR)','',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAVAN , SECTOR-62, MOHALI(S.A.S .NAGAR)','',28,507,'160062','1','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That one Mr.Vikram Rai , s/o Sh.Himmat Rai, was allocated an LOI for the allotment of Residential P