lacs as security .&nbsp;</p>',5209620.00,5209620.00,'2018-02-21 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Deposit an amount of Rs 15 lacs as prayed above in para no.5.</p>','1','','2017-02-22 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'khanna3299','2019-04-04 15:06:03.000','khanna3299','2019-04-04 15:06:03.000'),(1302,1375,'1375',1450,'99509e83-b468-4aae-973b-0c821afca0cc','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-04-04 15:11:00.000','AKHILESH KHANNA','khanna.chd@gmail.com',9815509469,0,0,'#3299 , SECTOR 19-D ','',6,128,'160019','1','#3299 First Floor, SECTOR 19-D ','',6,128,'160019','D.KHANNA Adv.','khanna.chd@gmail.com',9815509469,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0116','750 PLOT SCHEME (IT CITY, MOHALI)','The chief Administrator, GMADA','helpdesk@gmada.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA BHAVAN , SECTOR-62, MOHALI(S.A.S .NAGAR)','',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAVAN , SECTOR-62, MOHALI(S.A.S .NAGAR)','',28,507,'160062','1','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That one Mr.Vikram Rai , s/o Sh.Himmat Rai, was allocated an LOI for the allotment of Residential Plot measuring 256.66 Sq.yds. in category \'\'Schedule cast /Schedule tribe (750 Plots category scheme) against Application Form no.8596&nbsp; for the draw of Lots held by the GMADA on dated 21.09.2016 (Serial No.155) in I.T. CITY S.A.S. Nagar (Mohali), issued vide GMADA \'s Letter of Intent /Memo No.GMADA-EO/2047/6460 , dtd: 22.02.2017. On an application having been made by&nbsp; aforesaid allottee Mr.Vikram Rai for transfer of Letter of Intent in favour of the complainant i.e.Mr.Akhilesh Khanna, the respondent pursuant to the request transferred the LOI&nbsp; in the name of complainant vide memo no.9554 dated 10.03.2017 subject to the condition to abide by the terms and condition mentioned in the LOI as well as the provisions of Punjab Regional Town Planning &amp; Development Act, 1995.As per CL.15 of LOI the possession of plot was to be given to the allottee within one year i.e.by 21.02.2018. The&nbsp; possession of the&nbsp; plot has not been given by the respondent till today as promised.The complainant has paid &nbsp;complete price &amp; made full &nbsp;payment along with taxes , transfer fees and interest&nbsp;amounting to&nbsp;Rs.5209620 /-. It is submitted that the respondent has miserably failed to carry development works of the area so as to hand over possession to the allottee\'s/holder of LOIs as promised and&nbsp; which is likely total further considerable time . Thus, the complainant is entitled for interest&nbsp; @12% PA (as charged/calculated/applied by the respondent as per LOI for non payment of instalments)&nbsp;&nbsp;on the payment made to respondent till actual possession of the plot is handed over by the respondent.&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">In view of the facts mentioned in Para no.4 above, the complainant prays that the respondent be directed to pay interest @12% PA(as charged/calculated/applied by the respondent as per LOI for non payment of instalments) from the date of issuance of LOI &nbsp;22.02.2017 till the actual possession is handed over to the complainant. As the relief claimed involves future interest as well &nbsp;for uncertain period , the respondent may be directed to deposit in this Hon\'ble tribunal Rs15 lacs as security .&nbsp;</p>',5209620.00,5209620.00,'2018-02-21 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Deposit an amount of Rs 15 lacs as prayed above in para no.5.</p>','1','','2017-02-22 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'khanna3299','2019-04-04 15:10:49.000','khanna3299','2019-04-04 15:10:49.000'),(1303,1379,'1379',1450,'99509e83-b468-4aae-973b-0c821afca0cc','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-04-04 14:42:27.000','AKHILESH KHANNA','khanna.chd@gmail.com',9815509469,0,0,'#3299 , SECTOR 19-D ','',6,128,'160019','1','#3299 , SECTOR 19-D ','',6,128,'160019','D.KHANNA Advocate','khanna.chd@gmail.com',9815509469,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0116','IT  CITY MOHALI(S.A.S.NAGAR), 20.00 SQ.YARD COMMERICIAL BOOTH ,SECTOR82/83A LAND POOLING.','THE CHIEF ADMINISTRATOR, GMADA.','helpdesk@gmada.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA BHAVAN,SECTOR-62,MOHALI(S.A.S.NAGAR)','',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAVAN,SECTOR-62,MOHALI(S.A.S.NAGAR)','',28,507,'160062','1','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That&nbsp; Mr.Vivek Goel, s/o Sh.Shiv Charn and Ms.Ekta Goel w/o Vivek Goel residents of # 301, III Floor Maya Gardens, Phase 2 , VIP road ,Zirakpur,Punjab were holders of LOI number 25201 , dated 06-Jun-2016 issued under Sector 82A/83A- Land Pooling(Ref.No.82-0540/-) in respect of commercial booth measuring 20.00 Sq.Yards. This LOI was transferred vide No.12029 dated 27.03.2017 in favour of the complainants after having made payment of about Rs.30 lacs to them along with Rs.34700/- as transfer fee.It may be mentioned here that as per brochure of respondent/GMADA , this commercial area of 20.00 Sq.Yards commercial booths adjoins another residential plotted area offered by respondent GMADA known as 750 Plots&nbsp; Scheme (IT City , Mohali), S.A.S .Nagar (each measuring 256.66 Sq.Yards) it is further stated here that the respondent/GMADA in residential , 750 Plots&nbsp; Scheme (IT City , Mohali), S.A.S .Nagar had promised to deliver the possession within one year issuance of first LOI i.e. by 05-Jun-2017(As per original LOI). The respondent /GMADA has miserably failed to develop the area so as to further hand over the possession to the allottees/ holders of LOIs, which is causing great financial loss to the complainants. It may be added here that the present cost of 20.00 Sq Yard commercial booth in the vicinity is about Rs 36 lacs .It is also relevant to assert that various builders are offering 10-15% rental on the deposited money. Therefore, the complainants are entitled for interest @12% on equal amount or as decided by this Honble Authority.The complainants are aggrieved by the inaction of the respondent GMADA and are thus entitled for interest as prayed for.</p><p>\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 14px;\"><br></p>','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">In view of the facts mentioned in Para no.4 above, the complainants pray that the respondent be directed to pay interest @12% (as charged/calculated/applied by the respondent as per LOI for non payment of instalments) from the date of issuance of LOI dated&nbsp; 27.03.2017 till the actual possession is handed over to the complainants . As the relief claimed involves future interest as well as for uncertain period , the respondent may be directed to deposit in this Hon\'ble Authority Rs15 lacs as security .&nbsp;</p>',3600000.00,0.00,'2017-06-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Deposit an amount of Rs 15 lacs as prayed above in para no.5.</p><div><br></div>','1','','2017-03-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'khanna3299','2019-04-04 16:49:47.000','khanna3299','2019-04-04 16:49:47.000'),(1304,1379,'1379',1450,'99509e83-b468-4aae-973b-