at the present cost of 20.00 Sq Yard commercial booth in the vicinity is about Rs 36 lacs .It is also relevant to assert that various builders are offering 10-15% rental on the deposited money. Therefore, the complainants are entitled for interest @12% on equal amount or as decided by this Honble Authority.The complainants are aggrieved by the inaction of the respondent GMADA and are thus entitled for interest as prayed for.</p><p>\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 14px;\"><br></p>','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">In view of the facts mentioned in Para no.4 above, the complainants pray that the respondent be directed to pay interest @12% (as charged/calculated/applied by the respondent as per LOI for non payment of instalments) from the date of issuance of LOI dated&nbsp; 27.03.2017 till the actual possession is handed over to the complainants . As the relief claimed involves future interest as well as for uncertain period , the respondent may be directed to deposit in this Hon\'ble Authority Rs15 lacs as security .&nbsp;</p>',3600000.00,0.00,'2017-06-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Deposit an amount of Rs 15 lacs as prayed above in para no.5.</p><div><br></div>','1','','2017-03-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',2,0,0,0,'khanna3299','2019-04-04 16:54:43.000','khanna3299','2019-04-04 16:54:43.000'),(1305,1379,'1379',1450,'99509e83-b468-4aae-973b-0c821afca0cc','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-04-04 16:57:40.000','AKHILESH KHANNA','khanna.chd@gmail.com',9815509469,0,0,'#3299 , SECTOR 19-D ','',6,128,'160019','1','#3299 , SECTOR 19-D ','