d money. Therefore, the complainants are entitled for interest @12% on equal amount or as decided by this Honble Authority.The complainants are aggrieved by the inaction of the respondent GMADA and are thus entitled for interest as prayed for.</p><p>\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 14px;\"><br></p>','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">In view of the facts mentioned in Para no.4 above, the complainants pray that the respondent be directed to pay interest @12% (as charged/calculated/applied by the respondent as per LOI for non payment of instalments) from the date of issuance of LOI dated&nbsp; 27.03.2017 till the actual possession is handed over to the complainants . As the relief claimed involves future interest as well as for uncertain period , the respondent may be directed to deposit in this Hon\'ble Authority Rs15 lacs as security .&nbsp;</p>',3600000.00,0.00,'2017-06-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Deposit an amount of Rs 15 lacs as prayed above in para no.5.</p><div><br></div>','1','','2017-03-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','','','',1,1,0,0,'khanna3299','2019-04-04 16:57:34.000','khanna3299','2019-04-04 16:57:34.000'),(1306,1383,'1383',1393,'d33e1b7d-de22-43e0-97c8-115b8ed3d62e','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-04-05 17:28:56.000','Surinder Singh Sehra','harish635@rediffmail.com',9876052682,0,561752516027,'H No.2229, ','Sector 71',28,507,'160062','1','H No.2229, ','Sector 71',28,507,'160062','Harish Goyal','harish635@rediffmail.com',9815628635,1722217635,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0121','Sector 88 and 89 including purab premium apartments','Estate Officer GMADA','eo@gmada.gov.in',0,1722213535,'PUDA Bhawan','Sector 62',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA Bhawan','Sector 62',28,507,'160062','0','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Respondents acquired land vide\r\naward dated 15/11/11. In lieu of compensation GMADA has given land pooling\r\nscheme, according to which owner will get developed land in lieu of his\r\nacquired land. Neither land owner required to pay anything nor GMADA has to pay\r\nanything for the same(Anne C/2). As per LOIs issued in the year 2013, to the landowners,\r\nhe can transfer the LOI on paying the 2.5% of price of plot, which was fixed by\r\nGMADA @25,000/- per sq. Yds. (C/3 of similar person). Complainant purchased the\r\nPlot from Deepika Bhatia etc, vide transfer letter dated 26/12/16, after paying\r\nRs.219836 as transfer fee (Ann C/4). Orally GMADA have promised that they will\r\ndevelop land in 1.5 to 2 years. However now on 28/1/2019 they have issued\r\nallotment letter and offer of possession, without completing the development on\r\nthe spot(Ann C/5). They have also demanded extra amount for Corner, which was\r\nnot mention either in award or policy of land pooling or in LOI. Possession\r\nalso offered without completing the development work. Even in High Court in CWP\r\nNo.398/2016, EO has stated that they will complete development work by\r\n30/11/2018. But to develop the parks they have issued the tenders only on\r\n8/2/2019 to be completed in 8 Months. (Ann C/6) Although some development work\r\nis going on but same is not completed. No street light are working. Sewerage\r\nSystem was lying open. Even development of Parks has not been started yet.\r\nRoads are only half done. So there is no question of the handing over the possession.\r\nThere is a huge delay in handing over the possession, whereas they have\r\ndeveloped the area for private builder in 2016 itself. Further even demand for\r\nextra amount for corner is also not justified, as Nothing such condition in\r\nAward, or in Policy or in Original LOI. Further in ECO City matter also in case\r\nof Land pooling scheme, GMADA has itself withdrawn such charges, when people\r\napproached HIGH COURT by way of CWP No.25715/15 (Ann C/7).&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1. Prayer for issuance of\r\ndirection to the Respondent to handover the possession of the Plot after\r\ncompletion of the Development work, as defined under Section 2(t), 2(w), 2(zb)\r\nof the The Real Estate (Reg. and Development), Act 2006, as allotment letter\r\nissued on 28/1/2019, whereas till date development work is not complete. Roads\r\nare not complete, street lights are not working, even for parks, they have\r\nissued tenders just on 8/2/2019, after issuance of allotment letter. 2. To Pay\r\ninterest @18% p.a. (or as per the provisions of the Act) for delayed period of\r\nPossession, from the date of issuance of LOI till handing over the actual\r\npossession, after completing the development work, since entire consideration\r\nhas already paid to them, in form of land @ Rs.25000/- per sq. yds. Further\r\nthey have developed the land for the private builder Hero Homes, within 6\r\nmonths in the year 2016, development for the common people only started after\r\nintervention of the Hon\'ble High Court in CWP No.398 of 2016. Further even\r\nallotment letters are issued only to show in the Hon\'ble High Court, otherwise development\r\nis still incomplete. There is a huge delay of 6 years in handing over the\r\npossession. They have violated the various provisions of the RERA Act. 3. Refund\r\nan amount of Rs.765625/- along with interest @ Rs.18% from the date of payment till\r\nrefund and not to charge any extra amount on account of Preferential Location\r\nCharges, being beyond the Scope of LOI, Award and Land acquisition Policy and\r\nin view of withdrawal of such charges by themselves in ECO City. In the LOI no\r\nsuch condition was mentioned. Now they cannot of their own, could not start\r\ncharging extra amount as per their own whim and caprice. 4. This Hon\'ble Court\r\nmay grant any other relief, which this Hon\'ble Court may deem fit and proper in\r\nthe peculiar facts and circumstances of the present case.<o:p></o:p></p>',7656250.00,8421875.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>NA</p>','1','','2019-01-28 00:00:00','2016-01-06 00:00:00','Plot No.32, Sector 89, Block A, SAS Nagar, Mohali','','',1,1,0,0,'harish635','2019-04-05 08:30:55.000','harish635','2019-04-05 08:30:55.000'),(1307,1350,'1350',1010,'a182232b-88d6-4711-8baa-f8a026fb675f','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-08 10:36:51.000','MONIKA TAKKAR','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',8622000001,1724181010,457308216625,'RZ 63, GALI NO.-2','MAIN ROAD, PALAM PURAN NAGAR, PALAM COLONY, PALAM VILLAGE',10,562,'110045','0','#102, Sector 10 A','',6,128,'160011','HIMANSHU RAJ','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988200001,1724190909,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PC0029','GOLF LINKS-I (ANSAL GOLF LINKS)','ANSAL PROPERTIES AND INFRASTRUCTURE LIMITED ','customercare@ansalapi.com',1725035035,0,'115, ANSAL BHAWAN ','K G MARG, NEW DELHI',10,429,'110001','1','115, ANSAL BHAWAN ','K G MARG, NEW DELHI',10,429,'110001','1','<p>That the original allottee had booked a plot on 11.12.2010 for shop cum office SCO in OPs project ANSAL GOLF LINKS situated around village kailon on kharar-landran road, Mohali, Punjab. That on 12.10.2010, the Op allotted Plot No. 47 E measuring 33.33 Sq. Yard in the said Project and it was assured that the possession of the plot will be delivered by 31.12.2011. Allotment letter is annexed as ANNEXURE C-1</p><p>That on 10.02.2011, the complainant, aadhar card annexed as ANNEXURE C-2, had purchased the said plot from the original allottee vide transfer application annexed as ANENXURE C-3 COLLY. That the OP continuously demanded amount from the complainant without even having necessary approvals from the competent authority. Demand notices is annexed as ANNEXURE C-4. That the complainant had paid the complete amount along with delayed interest 18 per cent to the OP but OP failed to hand over the possession of the unit by 31.12.2011. Total amount paid by complainant is annexed as ANNEXURE C-5 COLLY.</p><p>That the complainant tried to contact the OP numerous times regarding the status of the unit but no response was given. Being aggrieved the complainant issued Legal notice but no response was given. Legal Notice is annexed as ANNEXURE C-6. The complainant had also lodged a complaint against OP in Police station Hari Nagar. New delhi under Section 420 of IPC 1806 on 20.02.2016. Police complaint is annexed as ANNEXURE C-7.</p><p>That on 10.09.2018, OP unilaterally and arbitrarily relocated the plot of the complainant from 47 E to 54 E, the letter is annexed as ANENXURE C-8, but has failed to hand over the possession of the unit. That the OP has even failed to upload the requite documents in RERA’s website, till date. That the complainant had even filed a complaint with NCDRC but the same is to be withdrawn by the complainants. If need be, relevant documents will be adduced at the time of the arguments.</p>','<p>1.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to hand over the complete amount along with 18 per cent interest according to Section 2 za i of Real Estate Regulation and Development Act, 2016, as the same was demanded and accepted by OP from the complainant for delayed payments.</p><p>2.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs.10,000 per month from the committed date of possession till the filing of the present petition,&nbsp; for causing mental agony caused to the complainants.</p><p>3.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs.10,000 per month from the committed date of possession till the filing of the present petition, to the complainants as the deficiency in services for keeping the complainants in dark in regard to the progress of the property.</p><p>4.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to pay Rs.10,000 per month from the committed date of possession till the filing of the present petition, for causing physical harassment caused to the complainants.</p><p>5.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To direct the OP to hand upload all the requiste documents in RERA Punjab website i.e. CLU, License to develop, Environmental clearance etc&nbsp; and furnish the complainant with the same.</p><p>6.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Any other relief or claim which the Honble Authority deems appropriate.</p>',1499850.00,1589708.00,'2011-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>Not Prayed</p>','1','','2010-11-12 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Earlier Allotted Unit No. 47 E, Revised Allotted Unit No. 54 E, Sector-114, Golf Links-I, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2019-04-05 12:51:46.000','lawofficeofhimanshuraj','2019-04-05 12:51:46.000'),(1308,1350,'1350',1010,'a182232b-88d6-4711-8baa-f8a026fb675f','FormTypeM',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-08 10:36:51.000','MONIKA TAKKAR','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',8622000001,1724181010,457308216625,'RZ 63, GALI NO.-2','MAIN ROAD, PALAM PURAN NAGAR, PALAM COLONY, PALAM VILLAGE',10,562,'110045','0','#102, Sector 10 A','',6,128,'160011','HIMANSHU RAJ','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988200001,1724190909,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PC0029','GOLF LINKS-I (ANSAL GOLF LINKS)','ANSAL PROPERTIES AND INFRASTRUCTURE LIMITED ','customercare@ansalapi.com',1725035035,0,'115, ANSAL BHAWAN ','K G MARG, NEW DELHI',10,429,'110001','1','115, ANSAL BHAWAN ','K G MARG, NEW DELHI',10,429,'110001','1','<p>That the original allottee had booked a plot on 11.12.2010 for shop cum office SCO in OPs project ANSAL GOLF LINKS situated around village kailon on kharar-landran road, Mohali, Punjab. That on 12.10.2010, the Op allotted Plot No. 47 E measuring 33.33