ishma5.rv@gmail.com',8872476090,0,0,'House No. 1256','Urban Estate, Phase-I',28,261,'144001','1','House No. 1256','Urban Estate, Phase-I',28,261,'144001','Rishma Verma Advocate','rishma5.rv@gmail.com',8872476090,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PC0076','Ansal Lotus Melange Projects Pvt. Ltd. (at City Centre) situated at Kharar Landran Road, Mohali (Punjab)','Ansal Lotus Melange Projects Pvt. Ltd.  through its Director/Authorized signatory','customercare@ansalapi.com',9878584368,0,'S.C.O. 183-184, Sector 9-C, Chandigarh','',6,128,'160009','0','1/18-B, Asaf Ali Road','',10,429,'110002','1','<font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">sadfasdfga</span></font>','<p>safsafasg</p>',1975043.00,846351.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p>gfdafgag</p>','1','','2009-11-03 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','commercial unit no. Sh-17,UGF mesuring 51.70sq m on the upper ground in the retail and the commercial cum office complex\" city centre\" building sector 115','','',2,0,0,0,'Rishmaverma','2019-04-05 16:06:42.000','Rishmaverma','2019-04-05 16:06:42.000'),(1311,1384,'1384',1418,'167113a8-f037-477a-bc7f-a1c65c8ac911','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Kumkum Bhatia','rishma5.rv@gmail.com',8872476090,0,0,'House No. 1256','Urban Estate, Phase-I',28,261,'144001','1','House No. 1256','Urban Estate, Phase-I',28,261,'144001','Rishma Verma Advocate','rishma5.rv@gmail.com',8872476090,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PC0076','Ansal Lotus Melange Projects Pvt. Ltd. (at City Centre) situated at Kharar Landran Road, Mohali (Punjab)','Ansal Lotus Melange Projects Pvt. Ltd.  through its Director/Authorized signatory','customercare@ansalapi.com',9878584368,0,'S.C.O. 183-184, Sector 9-C, Chandigarh','',6,128,'160009','0','1/18-B, Asaf Ali Road','',10,429,'110002','1','<p style=\"margin-left: 54pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">That complainant entered into agreement with respondent on 3.11.2009 to buy a Commercial Unit no.SH-17,UGF, measuring 51.70 sq.mts. on upper ground in the retail &amp; commercial&nbsp; cum office complex \"City Centre\" building situated at Kharar-Landran road, Mohalli(Pb) for total sale consideration of Rs.19,75,000/-(Ann.C1).As per terms &amp; conditions of agreement, 25% of total sale consideration&nbsp; was to be paid to respondent company initially and respondent assured to deliver possession of said unit within 3 years from date of allotment letter. As per said terms &amp; conditions, complainant paid sum of Rs.1 lac through D.D. no.33695 dtd 1.9.2009, Rs.2 lacs through D.D.no.006683 dtd 15.3.2010, Rs.93,761/-through Chequeno.006681 dtd 30.3.2010,Rs.2,02,590/- through Cheque no.371843 dtd 10.9.2011 and Rs.1 lac through D.D.no.60986 dtd 20.7.2013 (Ann. C2-C6). During aforesaid period, respondent allured &amp; induced complainant in year 2011 by alluring that they are going to construct a site for residential flats opp. to commercial site &amp; in pre-lunch project offer,allured complainant to deposit sum of Rs.1.5 lac towards allotment of 1BHK flat in Tower no.6, Sector 127 Mohali, to be constructed opposite to commercial site. Total sale price was fixed as Rs.10.5 lac &amp; complainant paid Rs.1.5 lac through two cheques (Annexure C7 to C8) i.e. Cheque no.006684 for Rs.1 lac &amp; Cheque no.006682 for Rs.50,000/- bothdrawn on Union Bank,to respondent towards allotment of said flat. The said project however, regarding construction of residential flats did not materialize and was later on dropped by respondent and subsequently despite repeated requests &amp; visits, said payment of Rs. 1.5 lac was not returned by respondent. It was assured by respondent that said amount of Rs.1.5 lac would be adjusted towards the commercial unit which was already&nbsp; allotted to complainant.</span></font><br></p>','<div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">consequently complainant came to know that on said amount of Rs.1.5 lac, respondent agreed to award only S.I. of Rs.25000/- &amp; offered to adjust Rs.1,75,000/- towards&nbsp; commercial unit.As per complainant’s knowledge, project was left half way &amp; even till today &amp; no further action is being taken in completing the construction. When respondent failed to complete project &amp; deliver possession, complainant feeling harassed, approached&nbsp; respondent at its Chandigarh Office, thereby asking for refund of amount alongwith interest but despite repeated visits &amp; reminders, nothing was done by respondent. Rather they threatened to cancel allotment in case remaining balance sale consideration of Rs.8 lac was not paid to them.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp;Subsequently when no steps were taken by respondent, then Legal Notice dated 29.9.2015 (Ann. C9) was served on the respondent but respondent did not respond to the same. Earlier complainant filed complaint before the District Consumer Disputes Redressal Forum, Jalandhar but same was dismissed while observing that complaint was not maintainable and liberty to approach the civil court or any other appropriate&nbsp; forum for seeking&nbsp; redressal of his grievance was given. (Ann. C10).</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">Earlier complainant filed similar complaint bearing no. AO/34/2018 before Adjudicating Officer, R.E.R.A., Punjab, which was returned to complainant vide order dated 01.11.2018, with liberty to file fresh complaint before Authority as per decision of learned Authority. (Ann. C11).</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;It is therefore prayed that respondent be directed to deliver the possession of the aforesaid Commercial unit or to refund the amount of Rs. 8,46,351/- alongwith interest @ 24% per annum on account of failure to complete&nbsp; the project as specified&nbsp; in allotment letter, u/s 18 of the Real Estate (regulation and development) Act, 2016.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp;</span></font></div>',1975043.00,846351.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p style=\"margin-left: 72pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 28px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Reboot, serif; font-size: 18.6667px; text-align: start;\">It is therefore prayed that respondent be directed to deliver the possession of the aforesaid Commercial unit or to refund the amount of Rs. 8,46,351/- alongwith interest @ 24% per annum on account of failure to complete&nbsp; the project as specified&nbsp; in allotment letter, u/s 18 of the Real Estate (regulation and development) Act, 2016.</span><br></p><div><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 37.3333px; font-family: Reboot, serif;\"><br></span></div>','1','','2009-11-03 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','commercial unit no. Sh-17,UGF mesuring 51.70sq m on the upper ground in the retail and the commercial cum office complex\" city centre\" building sector 115','','',2,0,0,0,'Rishmaverma','2019-04-05 16:49:46.000','Rishmaverma','2019-04-05 16:49:46.000'),(1312,1384,'1384',1418,'167113a8-f037-477a-bc7f-a1c65c8ac911','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Kumkum Bhatia','rishma5.rv@gmail.com',8872476090,0,0,'House No. 1256','Urban Estate, Phase-I',28,261,'144001','1','House No. 1256','Urban Estate, Phase-I',28,261,'144001','Rishma Verma Advocate','rishma5.rv@gmail.com',8872476090,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PC0076','Ansal Lotus Melange Projects Pvt. Ltd. (at City Centre) situated at Kharar Landran Road, Mohali (Punjab)','Ansal Lotus Melange Projects Pvt. Ltd.  through its Director/Authorized signatory','customercare@ansalapi.com',9878584368,0,'S.C.O. 183-184, Sector 9-C, Chandigarh','',6,128,'160009','0','1/18-B, Asaf Ali Road','',10,429,'110002','1','<p style=\"margin-left: 54pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">That complainant entered into agreement with respondent on 3.11.2009 to buy a Commercial Unit no.SH-17,UGF, measuring 51.70 sq.mts. on upper ground in the retail &amp; commercial&nbsp; cum office complex \"City Centre\" building situated at Kharar-Landran road, Mohalli(Pb) for total sale consideration of Rs.19,75,000/-(Ann.C1).As per terms &amp; conditions of agreement, 25% of total sale consideration&nbsp; was to be paid to respondent company initially and respondent assured to deliver possession of said unit within 3 years from date of allotment letter. As per said terms &amp; conditions, complainant paid sum of Rs.1 lac through D.D. no.33695 dtd 1.9.2009, Rs.2 lacs through D.D.no.006683 dtd 15.3.2010, Rs.93,761/-through Chequeno.006681 dtd 30.3.2010,Rs.2,02,590/- through Cheque no.371843 dtd 10.9.2011 and Rs.1 lac through D.D.no.60986 dtd 20.7.2013 (Ann. C2-C6). During aforesaid period, respondent allured &amp; induced complainant in year 2011 by alluring that they are going to construct a site for residential flats opp. to commercial site &amp; in pre-lunch project offer,allured complainant to deposit sum of Rs.1.5 lac towards allotment of 1BHK flat in Tower no.6, Sector 127 Mohali, to be constructed opposite to commercial site. Total sale price was fixed as Rs.10.5 lac &amp; complainant paid Rs.1.5 lac through two cheques (Annexure C7 to C8) i.e. Cheque no.006684 for Rs.1 lac &amp; Cheque no.006682 for Rs.50,000/- bothdrawn on Union Bank,to respondent towards allotment of said flat. The said project however, regarding construction of residential flats did not materialize and was later on dropped by respondent and subsequently despite repeated requests &amp; visits, said payment of Rs. 1.5 lac was not returned by respondent. It was assured by respondent that said amount of Rs.1.5 lac would be adjusted towards the commercial unit which was already&nbsp; allotted to complainant.</span></font><br></p>','<div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">consequently complainant came to know that on said amount of Rs.1.5 lac, respondent agreed to award only S.I. of Rs.25000/- &amp; offered to adjust Rs.1,75,000/- towards&nbsp; commercial unit.As per complainant’s knowledge, project was left half way &amp; even till today &amp; no further action is being taken in completing the construction. When respondent failed to complete project &amp; deliver possession, complainant feeling harassed, approached&nbsp; respondent at its Chandigarh Office, thereby asking for refund of amount alongwith interest but despite repeated visits &amp; reminders, nothing was done by respondent. Rather they threatened to cancel allotment in case remaining balance sale consideration of Rs.8 lac was not paid to them.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp;Subsequently when no steps were taken by respondent, then Legal Notice dated 29.9.2015 (Ann. C9) was served on the respondent but respondent did not respond to the same. Earlier complainant filed complaint before the District Consumer Disputes Redressal Forum, Jalandhar but same was dismissed while observing that complaint was not maintainable and liberty to approach the civil court or any other appropriate&nbsp; forum for seeking&nbsp; redressal of his grievance was given. (Ann. C10).</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">Earlier complainant filed similar complaint bearing no. AO/34/2018 before Adjudicating Officer, R.E.R.A., Punjab, which was returned to complainant vide order dated 01.11.2018, with liberty to file fresh complaint before Authority as per decision of learned Authority. (Ann. C11).</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;It is therefore prayed that respondent be directed to deliver the possession of the aforesaid Commercial unit or to refund the amount of Rs. 8,46,351/- alongwith interest @ 24% per annum on account of failure to complete&nbsp; the project as specified&nbsp; in allotment letter, u/s 18 of the Real Estate (regulation and development) Act, 2016.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Reboot, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp;</span></font></div>',1975043.00,846351.00,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p style=\"margin-left: 72pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 28px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Reboot, serif; font-size: 18.6667px; text-align: start;\">It is therefore prayed that respondent be directed to deliver the possession of the aforesaid Commercial unit or to refund the amount of Rs. 8,46,351/- alongwith interest @ 24% per annum on account of failure to complete&nbsp; the project as specified&nbsp; in allotment letter, u/s 18 of the Real Estate (regulation and development) Act, 2016.</span><br></p><div><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 37.3333px; font-family: Reboot, serif;\"><br></span></div>','1','','2009-11-03 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','commercial unit no. Sh-17,UGF mesuring 51.70sq m on the upper ground in the retail and the commercial cum office complex\" city centre\" building sector 115','','',1,0,0,0,'Rishmaverma','2019-04-05 16:49:58.000','Rishmaverma','2019-04-05 16:49:58.000'),(1313,1385,'1385',1465,'972df7fa-1c37-4c57-9edb-5b3410a739ba','FormTypeM',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','AMAN DEEP','amandeep4500@gmail.com',7837771792,0,222988755066,'# 108','GTB Nagar Kharar',28,507,'140301','1','Plot no. B-24','Phase 3, Industrial Area, Mohali',28,507,'160055','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0069','Singla Builders and Promoters Limited','AMITENDRA MISHRA','amitendra@sbpgroup.in',9569933083,0,'SCO 146-148 1st Floor','Sector 43 B',6,128,'160042','1','SCO 146-148 1st Floor','Sector 43 B',6,128,'160042','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">On dated\r\n16 Feb 2017, I went at SBP Project (Name - Sbp exotic floors, village-khanpur,\r\ntehsil-kharar,Mohali) and I met&nbsp; Mr Amitendra mishra, project head of sbp\r\nexotic floors project. After long discussion regarding the flat, I gave him\r\n11,000 INR BY CARD for flat booking ( Flat Address : 126, tower no -1,First\r\nfloor, sbp exotic floors, village - khanpur ). At that time, the project was\r\nunder construction &amp; I was promised the possession on or before March 2018.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">I visited\r\nthe site continuously till March 2018 and even after my countless visits, I\r\nwasn\'t satisfied with the work going on, as it was very slow.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">In March\r\n2018, when the project was still under construction, I was told that they will\r\nsurely deliver us the flat in Sept 2018 i.e after 6 months grace period\r\nmentioned in Allotment letter.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">After\r\nSept 2018, I even visited the Registered office in Sector 43,Chandigarh so many\r\ntimes but no one entertained me properly and no best resolution to my query or\r\nthe exact date or time of possession was told to me.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">But now\r\nas it is even more than 1 year after the possession date, I am feeling very\r\nmuch harassed.As I am paying the home loan Interest EMI and also the rent where\r\nI am residing currently. Due to non possession of flat on time, I am being\r\ndouble burdened. And being a Single Hand Earner, its very difficult for me.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">On my\r\nlast visit to Registered Office Sector 43 Chandigarh , I was told to release\r\nthe required payment from bank and then I will be given the possession within\r\n15 days maximum. On 23rd March 2019, I released the payment and was expecting\r\npossession till 7th April 2019. So when I visited the site on 31st March 2019,\r\nI felt so dissatisfied as no progress was seen in my Flat. I even met Mr Amit\r\nPathania who was available there, I inquired from him and even I saw the list\r\nof flats which were to be given possession in 15 days, &amp; my flat no was not\r\nmentioned in that list.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">I reserve\r\nmy right to seek the compensation as well as the early possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">In view\r\nof the facts mentioned in paragraph 4 above, I pray for the following\r\nrelief(s).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1. EARLY\r\nPOSSESSION<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; I seek the earliest possession possible as it\'s already very late.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">2. HOME\r\nLOAN INTEREST REFUND&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; I took a home loan and paying the interest amount since 14 November 2017\r\ntill now and I seek all the interest amount paid till now to be refunded. i.e\r\nRs 1,18,728/-<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3. RENT\r\nPAID FOR CURRENT RESIDENCE<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; I am double burdened by paying the Home Loan EMI and also paying rent\r\nfor the current residence. So I seek compensation of the Rent paid by me till\r\nnow i.e. Rs 6500/- per month.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">4.\r\nCOMPENSATION FOR LATE POSSESSION AS PER RERA<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; As SBP Exotic Floors is under RERA, so I seek the compensation to be\r\ngiven to me for the late possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">5.\r\nCOMPENSATION FOR HARASSMENT&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; I seek some more compensation for the harassment I have faced till now\r\nin the form of countless site visits and Office Visits. And also the\r\nmisbehavior which I have faced while visiting the Office.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">I reserve\r\nmy right to seek the compensation as well as the early possession.</span><br>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">I trust and believe that choosing the RERA to seek\r\ncompensation will be the best decision.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',1500000.00,1436722.00,'2018-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1. HOME\r\nLOAN INTEREST REFUND&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; I took a home loan and paying the interest amount since 14 November 2017\r\ntill now and I seek all the interest amount paid till now to be refunded. i.e\r\nRs 1,18,728/-<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">2. RENT\r\nPAID FOR CURRENT RESIDENCE<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; I am double burdened by paying the Home Loan EMI and also paying rent\r\nfor the current residence. So I seek compensation of the Rent paid by me till\r\nnow i.e. Rs 6500/- per month.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3.\r\nCOMPENSATION FOR LATE POSSESSION AS PER RERA<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; As SBP Exotic Floors is under RERA, so I seek the compensation to be\r\ngiven to me for the late possession.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">4.\r\nCOMPENSATION FOR HARASSMENT&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; I seek some more compensation for the harassment I have faced till now\r\nin the form of countless site visits and Office Visits. And also the\r\nmisbehavior which I have faced while visiting the Office.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">I reserve\r\nmy right to seek the compensation as well as the early possession.</span><br>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">I trust and believe that choosing the RERA to seek\r\ncompensation will be the best decision.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>